// Static machine translations. Runtime pages make no translation requests.
export const finalCandidateTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"es":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Escenario del subsidio de desempleo suizo","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Calculadora suiza de prestaciones por desempleo: escenario bruto","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Estime la asignación diaria bruta suiza utilizando el salario asegurado y la tarifa confirmada por su fondo.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Ingrese el salario asegurado y la tasa del 70% u 80% confirmada por su fondo de desempleo.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Las normas suizas establecen la tasa de asignación y el tope salarial. El fondo decide la elegibilidad, las deducciones, los días de espera y los derechos. El rango mensual refleja entre 20 y 23 días laborables pagaderos.","Example":"Ejemplo","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5.000 CHF al 70 % equivalen aproximadamente a 161,29 CHF por día laborable pagadero.","How it works":"Cómo funciona","Questions":"Preguntas","Scope and limits":"Alcance y límites","Related tools":"Herramientas relacionadas","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Salario mensual asegurado (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Tasa confirmada por fondo","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Estimación","Clear":"Transparente","Gross scenario":"Escenario bruto","Insured salary used":"Salario asegurado utilizado","Per payable weekday":"Por día laborable pagadero","20-day month":"Mes de 20 días","23-day month":"Mes de 23 días","Official benefit rules":"Reglas oficiales de beneficios","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Ingrese sus cifras confirmadas.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Escenario calculado. Confirma montos con tu fondo.","Check the values.":"Compruebe los valores.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Planificador suizo de avisos de arrendamiento","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Planificador de avisos de alquiler suizo y borrador de cartas","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Planifique un aviso de arrendamiento a partir de las fechas y términos de su propio contrato; redactar una carta sin asumir las reglas del cantón.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Ingrese el período de notificación, el siguiente día de terminación válido en su contrato y la fecha de recepción. Consulta cada fecha con la asociación de propietarios o inquilinos.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"El planificador aplica solo las fechas y el período que usted proporciona. No decide si la notificación es válida, cuándo se recibe legalmente o si se aplica una protección especial.","Contract notice period (months)":"Período de notificación de contrato (meses)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Siguiente día de terminación válido del mes (a partir del contrato)","Expected receipt date":"Fecha prevista de recepción","Your name":"Tu nombre","Your address":"Su dirección","Landlord / agency":"Propietario / agencia","Recipient address":"Dirección del destinatario","Rental property":"Propiedad de alquiler","Place":"Lugar","Letter date":"Fecha de la carta","Termination of tenancy":"Terminación del arrendamiento","Calculate date and draft letter":"Calcular fecha y borrador de carta","Planning date":"Fecha de planificación","Target date":"Fecha objetivo","Editable draft":"Borrador editable","Copy draft":"Copiar borrador","Enter your contract terms.":"Ingrese los términos de su contrato.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Borrador de planificación listo. Verifique con su contrato.","Check the dates and period.":"Consulta las fechas y el período.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"El resultado sigue el día del aviso de contrato proporcionado; no es una resolución de notificación legal.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Escenario de ganancia de propiedad en Suiza","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Impuesto suizo sobre ganancias de propiedad: escenario de tasas ingresadas por el usuario","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Estime una ganancia de propiedad utilizando sus propios costos de transacción y una tasa impositiva del cantón responsable.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Ingrese los ingresos, el costo de adquisición, los gastos elegibles que haya confirmado y una tasa efectiva de la calculadora cantonal oficial.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"El impuesto suizo sobre las ganancias de propiedad varía según el cantón, el período de tenencia, las deducciones y el caso. Esta herramienta no proporciona tarifas ni determina costos admisibles.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Ingresos de la venta (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Costo de adquisición (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Otros costes confirmados admisibles (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Tipo impositivo efectivo de fuente oficial (%)","Estimate scenario":"Escenario estimado","Illustrative scenario":"Escenario ilustrativo","Gain entered":"Ganancia ingresada","Tax at entered rate":"Impuesto a la tasa ingresada","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Ingrese cifras de sus registros y fuente del cantón.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Escenario calculado; verificarlo con el cantón.","Check amounts and rate.":"Consultar importes y tarifa.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"No hay ninguna tabla de impuestos de cantón incrustada; su tasa efectiva ingresada impulsa la estimación.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Escenario del impuesto suizo sobre sucesiones y donaciones","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Impuesto suizo sobre sucesiones y donaciones: su escenario de tarifas","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Estimar un monto imponible a partir de una exención y tasa ingresadas por el usuario; Las reglas varían según el cantón y la relación.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Ingrese un monto, exención y tasa efectiva confirmada para el destinatario y el cantón.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Las reglas del cantón y la relación familiar pueden cambiar las exenciones y las tarifas. Esta herramienta no selecciona una regla cantonal ni determina la obligación tributaria.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Monto de herencia o donación (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Exención confirmada con el cantón (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Tasa efectiva confirmada con cantón (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Importe después de la exención ingresada","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Ingrese cifras confirmadas para su caso.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"La estimación utiliza solo la exención y la tasa que usted ingresa.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Escenario del presupuesto de manutención infantil suizo","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Presupuesto suizo de manutención infantil: escenario familiar transparente","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Asignar un presupuesto secundario ingresado por ingreso de los padres después de un crédito de costo directo ingresado.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Utilice las necesidades mensuales documentadas del niño, los ingresos mensuales disponibles de ambos padres y cualquier costo directo que desee acreditar.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Esta es solo una hoja de trabajo de planificación. No se trata de una concesión de manutención ni de un método jurídico suizo; No se evalúan vivienda, cuidados, impuestos, prestaciones ni jurisprudencia.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Presupuesto hijo mensual que usted documentó (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Ingreso mensual disponible del padre A (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Ingreso mensual disponible del padre B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Costos directos del niño pagados por el padre A al crédito (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Asignar escenario","Illustrative allocation":"Asignación ilustrativa","Parent A remaining contribution":"Contribución restante del padre A","Parent B contribution":"Contribución del padre B","Entered monthly child budget":"Presupuesto secundario mensual ingresado","Enter your household budget figures.":"Ingrese las cifras de su presupuesto familiar.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Escenario presupuestario calculado; discutir las obligaciones legales con un asesor calificado.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Verificar importes; El crédito no puede exceder el presupuesto.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Las acciones son proporcionales a los dos ingresos ingresados; el crédito de costo directo se resta primero.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Vista previa de separación de palabras en el navegador","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Vista previa de separación de palabras: patrones de idioma del navegador","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Vista previa de la separación de palabras del navegador para el texto que proporcione; El soporte depende del navegador y de los recursos de idioma instalados.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Elija el idioma que coincida con su texto, ingrese una muestra y ajuste el ancho de línea disponible.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Utiliza la división de palabras CSS nativa del navegador. No incluye diccionarios; Es posible que los navegadores no compatibles no muestren guiones. Al copiar el texto se mantiene la ortografía original.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Idioma del texto (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Ancho de vista previa (caracteres)","Text to preview":"Texto para vista previa","Preview":"Vista previa","Enter text and choose its language.":"Ingrese texto y elija su idioma.","Preview updated.":"Vista previa actualizada.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Ingrese una etiqueta de idioma y un texto admitidos.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Pruebe el mismo párrafo en diferentes anchos para ver dónde el navegador puede dividir las palabras.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Espacio de trabajo privado de revisión ortográfica","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Corrector ortográfico local: utilice el diccionario de su navegador","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Edite texto con el corrector ortográfico nativo del navegador, elija un idioma y copie el texto corregido.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"El texto permanece en esta página. Establezca un idioma para el que su navegador tenga un diccionario ortográfico, luego use su menú de ortografía o subraye sugerencias.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Este espacio de trabajo no carga texto ni envía diccionarios. La disponibilidad y las sugerencias del corrector ortográfico del navegador dependen del dispositivo, el navegador y el diccionario instalado.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Idioma del corrector ortográfico (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Texto a comprobar","Copy text":"Copiar texto","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Escriba o pegue texto. Haga clic derecho o use el menú de ortografía de su dispositivo para obtener sugerencias.","Text copied.":"Texto copiado.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"No se pudo copiar automáticamente; seleccione y copie el texto.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Es posible que un navegador sin un diccionario coincidente no marque errores ortográficos.","Resume Structure Checker":"Reanudar el verificador de estructura","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"Comprobador de currículum ATS: revisión gratuita de PDF local y DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Compruebe el texto del currículum, los títulos, las secciones, los enlaces y la estructura de viñetas en su navegador. Comparar los términos de la descripción del trabajo por recuento; sin puntuación de contratación ni carga.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Revise lo que realmente expone un currículum basado en texto: texto extraído, estructura de encabezado, presencia en el campo de contacto, enlaces y secciones comúnmente reconocidas. Opcionalmente, compare términos repetidos de descripción del trabajo.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"Un DOCX con estilos de Título 1 para Experiencia y Educación muestra esos títulos. Un PDF se verifica a partir de su texto seleccionable; Las columnas se pueden leer en un orden diferente.\nLos archivos","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX se inspeccionan localmente como Office ZIP/XML. Los archivos PDF se leen con un motor PDF.js local diferido. La comparación opcional de descripciones de puestos cuenta los términos seleccionados en cada texto; no crea una puntuación ni recomienda contratar a alguien.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Esta es una verificación de formato y estructura de texto, no un simulador ATS, revisión legal o predicción del éxito de la entrevista. Los archivos PDF escaneados sin texto seleccionable necesitan primero OCR. No se admiten documentos protegidos con contraseña, habilitados para macros, firmados o inusualmente grandes.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Elija un currículum (PDF o DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Sus archivos permanecen en este navegador y no se cargan. Máximo 20 MB; PDF de hasta 50 páginas. El contenido ampliado DOCX tiene un límite de 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Descripción del trabajo opcional","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Pegue texto sin formato si desea una comparación de frecuencia de términos. No incluya información sensible que no necesite analizar.","Paste job-description text here…":"Pegue aquí el texto de descripción del trabajo…","Analyze locally":"Analizar localmente","Clear files and report":"Borrar archivos e informar","Resume review":"Reanudar revisión","File type":"Tipo de archivo","Extracted characters":"Caracteres extraídos","Words counted":"Palabras contadas","Detected headings":"Rumbos detectados","Recognized sections":"Secciones reconocidas","Hyperlinks found":"Hipervínculos encontrados","Bullet paragraphs":"Párrafos con viñetas","An email address appears in the text":"Aparece una dirección de correo electrónico en el texto","No email address pattern was detected":"No se detectó ningún patrón de dirección de correo electrónico","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Aparece un patrón similar a un número de teléfono en el texto","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"No se detectó ningún patrón similar a un número de teléfono","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Términos de descripción del trabajo (solo cuenta)","Term":"Término","In job text":"En el texto del trabajo","In resume":"En currículum","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Pegue una descripción de trabajo para comparar el recuento de términos.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"No se detectaron estilos de título claros. Los títulos de PDF se calculan a partir del tamaño del texto y pueden ser inexactos.","Detected":"Detectado","Not detected":"No detectado","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Esta heurística reconoce un conjunto limitado de nombres de secciones comunes; no decide qué secciones se requieren.","Profile / summary":"Perfil / resumen","Experience":"Experiencia","Education":"Educación","Skills":"Habilidades","Contact":"Contacto","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"No se encontró texto seleccionable. Los PDF solo escaneados necesitan OCR antes de poder verificarlos.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Elija un currículum PDF o DOCX para comenzar.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Leyendo el archivo seleccionado localmente…","Local structure review complete.":"Revisión de la estructura local completa.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Este navegador no admite una función de documento local requerida.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Elija un archivo PDF válido o DOCX moderno hasta los límites locales indicados.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"No se pudo leer el PDF. Puede estar dañado, encriptado o no contener texto seleccionable.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"El paquete DOCX no se pudo abrir ni leer de forma segura.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"¿Esta herramienta carga o guarda mi currículum?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"No. El análisis y análisis se ejecutan en su navegador. El texto del archivo no se envía a un servidor ni se retiene después de borrar el informe o abandonar la página.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"¿Predice si un ATS o un empleador aceptarán mi currículum?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"No. Comprueba únicamente texto legible y estructura simple. Los sistemas de contratación difieren y esto no es una garantía de compatibilidad con ATS ni una predicción de contratación.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"¿Puede leer un PDF escaneado?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Solo si el PDF tiene una capa de texto seleccionable. Este verificador no descarga modelos OCR; Utilice primero una herramienta OCR para un documento que solo contenga imágenes escaneadas.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"¿Qué significa la comparación de descripción de puestos?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Muestra recuentos de términos recurrentes después de una normalización simple. No es un porcentaje de coincidencia, clasificación, recomendación o evaluación de sus calificaciones.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"¿Por qué un PDF muestra menos títulos que un DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"Los archivos PDF normalmente no conservan estilos de encabezado semánticos. El verificador estima las líneas prominentes a partir del tamaño del texto y el orden de lectura, por lo que las columnas y el diseño visual pueden afectar el resultado.","How local resume review works":"Cómo funciona la revisión de currículum local","Resume checker questions":"Preguntas del verificador de currículums","Scope and limitations":"Alcance y limitaciones","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Separador de acompañamiento y voz local","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Removedor de voces: voces separadas y acompañamiento localmente","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Separe una breve muestra de audio estéreo en voces estimadas y acompañamiento en su navegador. El audio permanece en su dispositivo; el modelo se descarga desde su servidor público.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Elija un clip de música estéreo de hasta 30 segundos. Cuando se utiliza por primera vez, el navegador descarga un modelo de 35,6 MB. El archivo de audio se procesa en este dispositivo y nunca se carga.","What you get":"Lo que obtienes","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Vista previa y descarga de dos temas WAV: voces estimadas y el acompañamiento residual. Los resultados dependen de la mezcla y pueden contener artefactos.","Local processing":"Procesamiento local","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"La herramienta utiliza la red de voces Open-Unmix UMX-HQ exportada a ONNX y ONNX Runtime Web. El modelo se recupera solo cuando presiona Separar; no se utiliza ninguna API de inferencia paga ni suscripción. El audio se decodifica, procesa y exporta localmente.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Esta es una estimación para procesamiento estéreo de 44,1 kHz y clips de hasta 30 segundos. Las fuentes mono se duplican a estéreo. Las voces mezcladas profundamente con instrumentos, efectos pesados, grabaciones en vivo y géneros inusuales pueden producir fugas o artefactos. No utilice el resultado como un maestro limpio. La descarga del modelo requiere una conexión a Internet; El audio no sale de este dispositivo.","Is my audio uploaded?":"¿Está subido mi audio?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"No. El audio seleccionado se decodifica y procesa en su navegador. La única solicitud de red es la descarga del modelo cuando comienza la separación.","Why is the first run slow?":"¿Por qué la primera ejecución es lenta?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"El navegador descarga un modelo de 35,6 MB una vez; el navegador puede almacenarlo en caché. Luego, la inferencia se ejecuta localmente en la CPU del dispositivo.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"¿Se separarán limpiamente todas las canciones?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"No. El modelo estima una raíz vocal y puede dejar fugas vocales, eliminar armónicos del instrumento o crear artefactos. Escuche antes de confiar en una raíz.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Archivo de audio estéreo (hasta 30 segundos)","Choose audio":"Elegir audio","Separate vocals":"Voces separadas","Cancel / clear":"Cancelar / borrar","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Elija un archivo de audio corto para comenzar.","Downloading the separation model…":"Descargando el modelo de separación…","Separating locally…":"Separando localmente…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Separación completa. Obtenga una vista previa o descargue cualquiera de los tallos.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"No se pudo procesar este archivo ni cargar el modelo. Verifique el formato y la conexión, luego inténtelo nuevamente.","Model and weight license information":"Información de licencia de modelo y peso","Estimated vocals":"Voces estimadas","Estimated accompaniment":"Acompañamiento estimado","Download WAV":"Descargar WAV","Progress":"Progreso","Preparing local separation…":"Preparando separación local…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Separación completa. El audio permaneció en este dispositivo.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Este audio no se pudo procesar. Pruebe con un archivo de música estéreo de menos de 30 segundos.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Comparador de deducibles de seguros médicos suizos","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Calculadora de franquicias de seguros médicos suizos: comparación de costos anuales","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Compare los deducibles del seguro médico básico suizo utilizando las primas y los costos médicos anuales elegibles que ingrese. No se adivina ninguna cotización de aseguradora.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Ingrese las primas mensuales mostradas por la misma aseguradora para cada deducible que ofrece, luego compare escenarios de costo de tratamiento anual bajo, esperado y alto.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Para el seguro médico básico suizo obligatorio, el deducible estándar para adultos es de 300 CHF y el deducible para niños es de 0 CHF. Los niveles opcionales varían según el grupo de edad. Después del deducible, la tasa de retención estándar es del 10 % de los costes restantes elegibles, con un límite de 700 CHF al año para adultos y 350 CHF para niños. La herramienta agrega su prima ingresada a este costo compartido modelado; no busca las tarifas de las aseguradoras ni decide qué opción es la adecuada para usted.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Si un adulto ingresa una prima mensual de CHF 400 con un deducible de CHF 300 y CHF 350 con un deducible de CHF 2500, la diferencia de prima anual es CHF 600. Compare ese ahorro con la diferencia modelada en el costo compartido en cada uno de sus montos de costo elegibles bajo, esperado y alto.","How the estimate works":"Cómo funciona el presupuesto","Common questions":"Preguntas comunes","Scope and exclusions":"Alcance y exclusiones","Where do I get the premiums?":"¿Dónde obtengo las primas?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Utilice ofertas mensuales actuales para la misma aseguradora, región de prima, grupo de edad, cobertura de accidentes y modelo de seguro. Priminfo es el sitio oficial de comparación federal. Esta página no busca ni reproduce cotizaciones de aseguradoras.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"¿Se ofrecen siempre todos los niveles de deducibles enumerados?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"No. Las aseguradoras no tienen que ofrecer todos los niveles opcionales y las ofertas pueden diferir para los adultos jóvenes. Ingrese sólo las primas que se muestran para su propia póliza; deje en blanco las opciones no disponibles.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"¿Muestra esto mi factura médica completa?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"No. El modelo cubre el deducible ordinario y la tarifa de retención estándar del 10% sobre los costos elegibles. Excluye cotizaciones por días hospitalarios, retención especial de medicamentos del 40%, servicios exentos, cuidados no cubiertos y seguros complementarios.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Esta es una comparación de escenarios, no un consejo médico, financiero o de seguros. No predice su tratamiento ni sus primas. Excluye las cotizaciones por días de hospitalización (normalmente 15 CHF por día de hospitalización, con exenciones legales), la retención especial del 40 % sobre determinados medicamentos, las exenciones de maternidad/preventivas, los servicios fuera de la cobertura obligatoria, las subvenciones a las primas y el seguro complementario. Por lo tanto, el copago real puede diferir. Un deducible más alto significa que usted debe poder pagar más por adelantado si recibe atención.","Who is insured under this policy?":"¿Quién está asegurado bajo esta póliza?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Adulto (19 años o más)","Child (under 18)":"Niño (menor de 18 años)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Escenario de costo de tratamiento elegible anual bajo (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Costos de tratamiento elegibles anuales esperados (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Escenario de costo de tratamiento elegible anual alto (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Primas mensuales de una aseguradora","Monthly premium":"Prima mensual","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Ingrese solo las opciones ofrecidas para esta misma póliza. Deje los demás en blanco.","Adult deductible choices":"Opciones de deducible para adultos","Child deductible choices":"Opciones de deducible por niño","Compare annual costs":"Comparar costos anuales","Clear entries":"Borrar entradas","Download CSV":"Descargar CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Prima anual estimada más costos compartidos","Deductible":"Deducible","Annual premiums":"Primas anuales","Total at low costs":"Total a bajos costos","Total at expected costs":"Total a costos esperados","Total at high costs":"Total a costes elevados","Cost sharing at low costs":"Costos compartidos a bajo coste","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Costos compartidos a los costos esperados","Cost sharing at high costs":"Costos compartidos a altos costos","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Diferencia del deducible más bajo disponible","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Costos médicos donde se agota el ahorro en primas","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"El ahorro de prima ingresado no se cancela dentro del rango de costo compartido modelado.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Sin ahorro en primas contra el deducible más bajo.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Total más bajo esperado entre las opciones ingresadas","Scenario details":"Detalles del escenario","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Ingrese tres escenarios de costos médicos ordenados y primas mensuales para al menos dos deducibles disponibles.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Normas oficiales y primas vigentes:","Federal deductible rules":"Reglas federales de deducible","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Comparación premium oficial de Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Comparación calculada en este navegador.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Consulte el grupo de edad, los escenarios de costos ordenados y al menos dos primas mensuales.","Entries cleared.":"Entradas borradas.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV descargado localmente.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Calculadora de reducción de primas de Swiss Health","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Calculadora de subsidio de primas suizas: su prima neta","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Calcule la prima neta del seguro médico suizo a partir de la prima actual y de una reducción mensual ya concedida por su cantón.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Ingrese la prima y la reducción mensual confirmada por su aseguradora o decisión cantonal. Esta herramienta no decide si usted califica.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Los cantones suizos determinan quién tiene derecho a ello, cuánta ayuda se concede y si es necesaria una solicitud. Esta calculadora solo resta una reducción mensual confirmada de la prima de una póliza y muestra el monto anual.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Si la prima mensual es de 420 CHF y la reducción confirmada es de 120 CHF, la prima neta estimada es de 300 CHF por mes.","How the calculation works":"Cómo funciona el cálculo","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"¿Esto me dice si califico?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"No. La elegibilidad y los importes de las concesiones los decide el cantón de residencia. Utilice la información oficial vinculada o comuníquese con la oficina cantonal.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"¿Dónde encuentro el importe de la reducción?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Utilice la decisión actual o la prima reducida mostrada por su aseguradora. Algunos cantones conceden reducciones automáticamente; otros requieren una solicitud.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Esto es aritmética para una póliza, no una decisión de elegibilidad o beneficios. No calcula los ingresos del hogar, los bienes, la situación familiar, los plazos, los umbrales cantonales ni los derechos de solicitud. Las primas y premios pueden cambiar; confírmalos con tu aseguradora y cantón.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Prima mensual actual (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Reducción mensual ya concedida (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Ingrese un monto confirmado por el cantón o asegurador; no utilice una estimación como premio.","Calculate net premium":"Calcular prima neta","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Ingrese la prima actual y la reducción confirmada.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Prima estimada después de la reducción","Current monthly premium":"Prima mensual actual","Monthly reduction":"Reducción mensual","Estimated net monthly premium":"Prima mensual neta estimada","Reduction over 12 months":"Reducción en 12 meses","Reduction as a share of premium":"Reducción como parte de la prima","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Cálculo completo. Confirme la adjudicación y las fechas de vigencia con su cantón y aseguradora.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Compruebe que la reducción no sea mayor que la prima mensual.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora de escenarios de tasa de referencia de alquiler en Suiza","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Calculadora de ajuste de alquiler en Suiza: escenario de tarifa de referencia","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Estime únicamente cómo un cambio en la tasa de referencia hipotecaria de Suiza afecta el alquiler neto residencial. Utilice la tarifa más reciente de la oficina federal de vivienda.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Compare la tarifa de referencia indicada en su contrato de arrendamiento o en el último aviso de alquiler con la tarifa oficial suiza actual. El cálculo permanece en su dispositivo.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"La Oficina Federal de la Vivienda publica cada trimestre un tipo de referencia hipotecario para la adaptación del alquiler en Suiza. En principio, un aumento de 0,25 puntos porcentuales puede permitir un aumento del alquiler del 3%; una disminución de 0,25 puntos puede permitir en principio una reducción del 2,91%. Este escenario aplica esos cambios paso a paso al alquiler neto que ingresa.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Para un alquiler neto mensual de CHF 3.000, una disminución del tipo de referencia del 1,75% al ​​1,50% da un cambio estimado del tipo de referencia únicamente de aproximadamente −CHF 87,38 por mes (−2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Cómo funciona esta estimación","Where do I find the current rate?":"¿Dónde encuentro la tarifa actual?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Abra la página vinculada de la Oficina Federal de Vivienda e ingrese la tarifa publicada actual. La herramienta no incluye una tarifa que pueda quedar obsoleta.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"¿Esto decide si puedo solicitar un cambio de alquiler?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"No. Aísla un factor para orientarse. Su contrato, inflación, cambios de costos, reservas y otras condiciones legales pueden alterar el resultado.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"¿El resultado incluye costos accesorios?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"No. Ingrese el alquiler neto mensual, excluyendo costos auxiliares y otros cargos variables.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"El resultado es un escenario de tasa de referencia ilustrativo, no una opinión legal ni una revisión completa del alquiler. Excluye inflación, cambios generales de costos, mejoras, reservas contractuales, alquileres indexados o escalonados, fechas de aviso y procedimiento cantonal. Consulte su contrato de arrendamiento y la orientación oficial antes de actuar.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Arrendamientos residenciales en Suiza: una estimación del efecto del tipo de referencia hipotecario únicamente. No es una decisión legal ni una revisión del alquiler completo.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Alquiler neto mensual actual (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Tasa de referencia indicada en su contrato de arrendamiento o último aviso de alquiler (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Tipo de referencia oficial suizo actual (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Calcular escenario de tasa de referencia","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Escenario de tasa de referencia únicamente","Current monthly net rent":"Renta neta mensual actual","Reference-rate change":"Cambio de tasa de referencia","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Efecto mensual estimado a partir de la tasa de referencia","Scenario monthly net rent":"Escenario alquiler neto mensual","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Efecto anualizado durante 12 meses a la misma tasa","potential increase":"aumento potencial","potential decrease":"disminución potencial","no reference-rate change":"sin cambio de tasa de referencia","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"La estimación aplica un 3% por cada aumento de 0,25 puntos porcentuales y la reducción inversa equivalente por cada disminución. Otros factores pueden cambiar el resultado.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Esto no incluye inflación, cambios de costos generales, mejoras, reservas de contratos, alquileres indexados o escalonados, fechas de aviso ni requisitos de procedimiento locales. Consulte su contrato de arrendamiento y la orientación de la Oficina Federal de Vivienda.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Consulte la guía y la tarifa oficial más reciente","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Oficina Federal Suiza de Vivienda (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Ingrese el alquiler y ambas tarifas para ver un escenario.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Escenario calculado. Verifique las fechas y términos del contrato antes de confiar en él.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Consulta los importes y tarifas. Los tipos deben estar entre el 0% y el 5% y diferir en incrementos de 0,25 puntos.","Inputs cleared.":"Entradas borradas.","Result":"Resultado","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Estimador de acumulación de vacaciones en Suiza","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Calculadora de acumulación de vacaciones en Suiza: saldo de vacaciones prorrateado","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Estime el saldo de días de vacaciones en Suiza a partir de las vacaciones anuales de su contrato, la semana laboral, las fechas de empleo y los días ya tomados.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Estime la licencia remunerada prorrateada para un año calendario utilizando el derecho y el horario de trabajo que ingrese. No se adivinan los términos del contrato.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"El estimador prorratea los días de vacaciones anuales en su contrato por los días calendario empleados en el año seleccionado. Para trabajo a tiempo parcial, ingrese sus días laborables habituales por semana y las vacaciones anuales en semanas.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Con cuatro semanas de vacaciones, una semana laboral de cinco días y empleo durante todo el año, el derecho anual es de 20 días hábiles antes de restar las vacaciones ya disfrutadas.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"¿Cuál es el mínimo legal en Suiza?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"La guía federal establece al menos cuatro semanas por año de servicio y cinco semanas para los trabajadores que no han cumplido 20 años. Un contrato o convenio colectivo puede otorgar más.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"¿Esto decide mi saldo legal?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"No. Se trata de un simple prorrateo de días naturales. Los términos del contrato, las reglas colectivas aplicables, las ausencias calificadas, el redondeo y los registros del empleador pueden cambiar el saldo.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Esta estimación no decide un derecho legal ni calcula el pago de vacaciones. Se excluyen las reducciones por determinadas ausencias prolongadas, las normas de devengo y redondeo específicas de cada contrato, los días festivos, las horas extraordinarias, los plazos de prórroga y los litigios. Consulta tu contrato y obtén asesoramiento por un saldo impugnado.","Leave year":"Año de licencia","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Vacaciones anuales en tu contrato (semanas)","Usual working days per week":"Días laborables habituales por semana","Employment start date":"Fecha de inicio de empleo","Employment end date":"Fecha de finalización del empleo","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Días de licencia ya tomados en este año de licencia","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Solo como orientación. Ingrese el derecho anual contractual; el mínimo legal es generalmente de cuatro semanas, o cinco semanas para los trabajadores menores de 20 años.","Estimate balance":"Saldo estimado","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Ingrese su contrato y fechas para estimar un saldo.","Estimated leave balance":"Saldo estimado de vacaciones","Annual leave at this schedule":"Vacaciones anuales en este horario","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Días naturales empleados en este año de vacaciones","Prorated days accrued":"Días prorrateados acumulados","Days already taken":"Días ya tomados","Estimated days remaining":"Días restantes estimados","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Esto prorratea las vacaciones anuales por días calendario en el período de empleo. Las reglas del empleador y del contrato pueden diferir.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Estimación calculada. Compruébelo con su contrato y los registros del empleador.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Consulta el año, fechas, horario de trabajo y valores."},"fr":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Scénario de l'allocation de chômage suisse","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Calculateur d'allocations de chômage suisse — Scénario brut","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Estimez une indemnité journalière brute suisse à partir du salaire assuré et du taux confirmés par votre caisse.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Saisissez le salaire assuré et le taux de 70 % ou 80 % confirmé par votre caisse de chômage.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Les règles suisses fixent le taux d'allocation et le plafond salarial. Le fonds décide de l'éligibilité, des déductions, des jours d'attente et des droits. La fourchette mensuelle reflète 20 à 23 jours de semaine payables.","Example":"Exemple","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5'000 à 70% équivaut à environ CHF 161,29 par jour de semaine payable.","How it works":"Comment ça marche","Questions":"Questions","Scope and limits":"Portée et limites","Related tools":"Outils associés","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Salaire mensuel assuré (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Taux confirmé par fonds","70%":"70 %","80%":"80 %","Estimate":"Estimation","Clear":"Effacer","Gross scenario":"Scénario brut","Insured salary used":"Salaire assuré utilisé","Per payable weekday":"Par jour de semaine payable","20-day month":"Mois de 20 jours","23-day month":"Mois de 23 jours","Official benefit rules":"Règles officielles en matière d'avantages sociaux","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Entrez vos chiffres confirmés.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Scénario calculé. Confirmez les montants avec votre fonds.","Check the values.":"Vérifiez les valeurs.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Planificateur d'avis de location en Suisse","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Planificateur d'avis de location et brouillon de lettre en Suisse","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Prévoyez un avis de location à partir des dates et modalités de votre propre contrat ; rédiger une lettre sans assumer les règles cantonales.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Saisissez le délai de préavis, le prochain jour de résiliation valide dans votre contrat et la date de réception. Vérifiez chaque date auprès de votre propriétaire ou association de locataires.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Le planificateur applique uniquement les dates et la période que vous fournissez. Il ne décide pas si la notification est valable, quand elle est légalement reçue, ni si une protection spéciale s'applique.","Contract notice period (months)":"Délai de préavis (mois)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Prochain jour de résiliation valide du mois (du contrat)","Expected receipt date":"Date de réception prévue","Your name":"Votre nom","Your address":"Votre adresse","Landlord / agency":"Propriétaire / agence","Recipient address":"Adresse du destinataire","Rental property":"Bien locatif","Place":"Placer","Letter date":"Date de la lettre","Termination of tenancy":"Résiliation de location","Calculate date and draft letter":"Calculer la date et le brouillon de la lettre","Planning date":"Date de planification","Target date":"Date cible","Editable draft":"Brouillon modifiable","Copy draft":"Copier le brouillon","Enter your contract terms.":"Saisissez les conditions de votre contrat.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Brouillon de planification prêt. Vérifiez par rapport à votre contrat.","Check the dates and period.":"Vérifiez les dates et la période.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Le résultat suit le jour de préavis fourni ; il ne s’agit pas d’une décision de préavis légale.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Scénario de gain de propriété en Suisse","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Impôt suisse sur les gains immobiliers — Scénario de taux saisi par l'utilisateur","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Estimez une plus-value immobilière en utilisant vos propres frais de transaction et un taux d'imposition du canton compétent.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Saisissez le produit, le coût d'acquisition, les dépenses admissibles que vous avez confirmées et un taux effectif du calculateur cantonal officiel.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"L'impôt suisse sur les gains immobiliers varie selon le canton, la durée de détention, les déductions et les cas. Cet outil ne fournit pas de tarifs ni ne détermine les coûts admissibles.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Produit de la vente (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Coût d'acquisition (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Autres frais confirmés recevables (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Taux d'imposition effectif de source officielle (%)","Estimate scenario":"Scénario d'estimation","Illustrative scenario":"Scénario illustratif","Gain entered":"Gain saisi","Tax at entered rate":"Taxe au taux saisi","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Saisissez les chiffres de vos dossiers et de la source du canton.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Scénario calculé ; vérifiez-le auprès du canton.","Check amounts and rate.":"Vérifiez les montants et le taux.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Aucune table d'impôt cantonale n'est intégrée ; votre taux effectif saisi détermine l’estimation.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Scénario fiscal suisse sur les successions et les donations","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Impôt suisse sur les successions et les donations — Votre scénario de taux","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Estimer un montant imposable à partir d'une exonération et d'un taux saisis par l'utilisateur ; les règles varient selon le canton et la relation.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Saisissez un montant, une exonération et un taux effectif confirmés pour le bénéficiaire et le canton.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Les règles cantonales et les liens familiaux peuvent modifier les exonérations et les taux. Cet outil ne sélectionne pas de règle de canton ni ne détermine l’assujettissement à l’impôt.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Montant de l'héritage ou de la donation (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Exonération confirmée auprès du canton (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Taux effectif confirmé auprès du canton (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Montant après exonération saisie","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Saisissez les chiffres confirmés pour votre cas.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"L'estimation utilise uniquement l'exonération et le taux que vous saisissez.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Scénario budgétaire des pensions alimentaires pour enfants en Suisse","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Budget suisse des pensions alimentaires pour enfants — Scénario de ménage transparent","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Allouez un budget enfant saisi en fonction du revenu des parents après un crédit de coût direct saisi.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Utilisez les besoins mensuels documentés de l'enfant, les revenus mensuels disponibles des deux parents et tous les coûts directs que vous souhaitez créditer.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Il s'agit uniquement d'une feuille de calcul de planification. Il ne s’agit pas d’une pension alimentaire suisse ni d’une méthode légale; le logement, les soins, les impôts, les allocations et la jurisprudence ne sont pas évalués.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Budget mensuel pour enfants que vous avez documenté (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Revenu mensuel disponible du parent A (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Revenu mensuel disponible du parent B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Frais directs des enfants payés par le parent A au crédit (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Scénario d'allocation","Illustrative allocation":"Attribution illustrative","Parent A remaining contribution":"Contribution restante du parent A","Parent B contribution":"Contribution du parent B","Entered monthly child budget":"Budget mensuel pour enfants saisi","Enter your household budget figures.":"Saisissez les chiffres du budget de votre ménage.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Scénario budgétaire calculé ; discutez des obligations légales avec un conseiller qualifié.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Vérifier les montants ; le crédit ne peut pas dépasser le budget.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Les actions sont proportionnelles aux deux revenus saisis ; le crédit pour coûts directs est soustrait en premier.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Aperçu de la césure du navigateur","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Aperçu de la césure des mots — Modèles de langage du navigateur","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Aperçu de la césure du navigateur pour le texte que vous fournissez ; la prise en charge dépend du navigateur et des ressources linguistiques installées.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Choisissez la langue qui correspond à votre texte, saisissez un échantillon et ajustez la largeur de ligne disponible.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Utilise la césure CSS native du navigateur. Il ne regroupe pas les dictionnaires ; les navigateurs non pris en charge peuvent ne pas afficher de traits d'union. La copie du texte conserve l'orthographe originale.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Langage du texte (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Largeur d'aperçu (caractères)","Text to preview":"Texte à prévisualiser","Preview":"Aperçu","Enter text and choose its language.":"Saisissez le texte et choisissez sa langue.","Preview updated.":"Aperçu mis à jour.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Entrez une balise de langue et un texte pris en charge.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Essayez le même paragraphe avec des largeurs différentes pour voir où le navigateur peut couper les mots.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Espace de travail de vérification orthographique privé","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Vérificateur orthographique local – Utilisez le dictionnaire de votre navigateur","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Modifiez le texte avec le correcteur orthographique natif du navigateur, choisissez une langue et copiez le texte corrigé.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Le texte reste dans cette page. Définissez une langue pour laquelle votre navigateur dispose d'un dictionnaire orthographique, puis utilisez son menu orthographique ou soulignez les suggestions.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Cet espace de travail ne télécharge pas de dictionnaires de texte ou de livraison. La disponibilité et les suggestions de la vérification orthographique du navigateur dépendent de l'appareil, du navigateur et du dictionnaire installé.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Langage de vérification orthographique (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Texte à vérifier","Copy text":"Copier le texte","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Tapez ou collez du texte. Cliquez avec le bouton droit ou utilisez le menu orthographique de votre appareil pour obtenir des suggestions.","Text copied.":"Texte copié.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Impossible de copier automatiquement ; sélectionnez et copiez le texte.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Un navigateur sans dictionnaire correspondant ne peut pas signaler les fautes d'orthographe.","Resume Structure Checker":"Vérificateur de structure de CV","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"Vérificateur de CV ATS — Révision locale gratuite des PDF et DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Vérifiez le texte du CV, les titres, les sections, les liens et la structure des puces dans votre navigateur. Comparez les termes des descriptions de poste par nombre ; pas de score d'embauche ni de téléchargement.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Examinez ce qu'un CV textuel expose réellement : texte extrait, structure des titres, présence du champ de contact, liens et sections communément reconnues. Comparez éventuellement les termes répétés de la description de poste.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"Un DOCX avec les styles Titre 1 pour Expérience et Formation affiche ces titres. Un PDF est vérifié à partir de son texte sélectionnable ; les colonnes peuvent être lues dans un ordre différent.\nLes fichiers","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX sont inspectés localement au format Office ZIP/XML. Les PDF sont lus avec un moteur PDF.js local différé. La comparaison facultative des descriptions de poste compte les termes sélectionnés dans chaque texte ; il ne crée pas de score et ne recommande pas d'embaucher quelqu'un.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Il s'agit d'une vérification du format et de la structure du texte, et non d'un simulateur ATS, d'un examen juridique ou d'une prédiction du succès de l'entretien. Les PDF numérisés sans texte sélectionnable nécessitent d'abord l'OCR. Les documents protégés par mot de passe, compatibles avec les macros, signés ou inhabituellement volumineux ne sont pas pris en charge.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Choisissez un CV (PDF ou DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Vos fichiers restent dans ce navigateur et ne sont pas téléchargés. Maximum 20 Mo ; PDF jusqu'à 50 pages. Le contenu étendu DOCX est limité à 80 Mo.","Optional job description":"Description de poste facultative","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Collez du texte brut si vous souhaitez une comparaison terme-fréquence. N'incluez pas d'informations sensibles que vous n'avez pas besoin d'analyser.","Paste job-description text here…":"Collez le texte de la description de poste ici…","Analyze locally":"Analyser localement","Clear files and report":"Effacer les fichiers et le rapport","Resume review":"Reprendre la révision","File type":"Type de fichier","Extracted characters":"Caractères extraits","Words counted":"Mots comptés","Detected headings":"En-têtes détectés","Recognized sections":"Sections reconnues","Hyperlinks found":"Hyperliens trouvés","Bullet paragraphs":"Paragraphes à puces","An email address appears in the text":"Une adresse e-mail apparaît dans le texte","No email address pattern was detected":"Aucun modèle d'adresse e-mail n'a été détecté","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Un motif semblable à un numéro de téléphone apparaît dans le texte","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Aucun modèle de type numéro de téléphone n'a été détecté","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Termes de la description de poste (comptes uniquement)","Term":"Terme","In job text":"Dans le texte du travail","In resume":"Dans le CV","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Collez une description de poste pour comparer le nombre de termes.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Aucun style de titre clair n'a été détecté. Les titres PDF sont estimés à partir de la taille du texte et peuvent être inexacts.","Detected":"Détecté","Not detected":"Non détecté","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Cette heuristique reconnaît un ensemble limité de noms de sections courants ; il ne décide pas quelles sections sont nécessaires.","Profile / summary":"Profil / résumé","Experience":"Expérience","Education":"Éducation","Skills":"Compétences","Contact":"Contactez-nous","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Aucun texte sélectionnable n'a été trouvé. Les PDF numérisés uniquement nécessitent une OCR avant de pouvoir être vérifiés.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Choisissez un CV PDF ou DOCX pour commencer.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Lecture locale du fichier sélectionné…","Local structure review complete.":"Révision de la structure locale terminée.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Ce navigateur ne prend pas en charge une fonctionnalité de document local requise.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Choisissez un fichier PDF valide ou DOCX moderne dans les limites locales indiquées.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"Le PDF n'a pas pu être lu. Il peut être endommagé, crypté ou ne contenir aucun texte sélectionnable.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Le package DOCX n'a ​​pas pu être ouvert ou lu en toute sécurité.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Cet outil télécharge-t-il ou enregistre-t-il mon CV ?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Non. L'analyse et l'analyse s'exécutent dans votre navigateur. Le texte du fichier n'est pas envoyé à un serveur ni conservé après que vous ayez effacé le rapport ou quitté la page.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Est-ce que cela prédit si un ATS ou un employeur acceptera mon CV ?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Non. Il vérifie uniquement le texte lisible et la structure simple. Les systèmes d'embauche diffèrent, et il ne s'agit pas d'une garantie de compatibilité ATS ni d'une prévision d'embauche.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Peut-il lire un PDF numérisé ?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Uniquement si le PDF comporte un calque de texte sélectionnable. Ce vérificateur ne télécharge pas les modèles OCR ; utilisez d’abord un outil OCR pour un document numérisé contenant uniquement une image.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Que signifie la comparaison des descriptions de poste ?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Il affiche le nombre de termes récurrents après une simple normalisation. Il ne s’agit pas d’un pourcentage de correspondance, d’un classement, d’une recommandation ou d’une évaluation de vos qualifications.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Pourquoi un PDF affiche-t-il moins de titres qu'un DOCX ?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"Les PDF ne conservent généralement pas les styles de titres sémantiques. Le vérificateur estime les lignes proéminentes en fonction de la taille du texte et de l'ordre de lecture, de sorte que les colonnes et la conception visuelle peuvent affecter le résultat.","How local resume review works":"Fonctionnement de la révision locale des CV","Resume checker questions":"Questions du vérificateur de CV","Scope and limitations":"Portée et limites","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Séparateur local de voix et d'accompagnement","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Vocal Remover — Séparez les voix et l'accompagnement localement","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Séparez un court échantillon audio stéréo en voix et accompagnement estimés dans votre navigateur. L'audio reste sur votre appareil ; le modèle est téléchargé depuis son hôte public.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Choisissez un clip musical stéréo d'une durée maximale de 30 secondes. Lors de la première utilisation, le navigateur télécharge un modèle de 35,6 Mo. Le fichier audio est traité sur cet appareil et n'est jamais téléchargé.","What you get":"Ce que vous obtenez","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Prévisualisez et téléchargez deux stems WAV : le chant estimé et l'accompagnement résiduel. Les résultats dépendent du mixage et peuvent contenir des artefacts.","Local processing":"Traitement local","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"L'outil utilise le réseau vocal Open-Unmix UMX-HQ exporté vers ONNX et ONNX Runtime Web. Le modèle est récupéré uniquement lorsque vous appuyez sur Séparer ; aucune API ou abonnement d'inférence payant n'est utilisé. L'audio est décodé, traité et exporté localement.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Il s'agit d'une estimation pour le traitement stéréo de 44,1 kHz et les clips d'une durée maximale de 30 secondes. Les sources mono sont dupliquées en stéréo. Les voix profondément mélangées aux instruments, les effets lourds, les enregistrements live et les genres inhabituels peuvent produire des fuites ou des artefacts. N'utilisez pas le résultat comme un maître propre. Le téléchargement du modèle nécessite une connexion Internet ; l'audio ne quitte pas cet appareil.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Mon audio est-il téléchargé ?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Non. L'audio sélectionné est décodé et traité dans votre navigateur. La seule requête réseau est le téléchargement du modèle lorsque vous démarrez la séparation.","Why is the first run slow?":"Pourquoi la première exécution est-elle lente ?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Le navigateur télécharge une fois un modèle de 35,6 Mo ; le navigateur peut le mettre en cache. L'inférence s'exécute ensuite localement sur le processeur de l'appareil.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Est-ce que chaque chanson se séparera proprement ?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Non. Le modèle estime une tige vocale et peut laisser des fuites vocales, supprimer les harmoniques des instruments ou créer des artefacts. Écoutez avant de vous fier à une tige.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Fichier audio stéréo (jusqu'à 30 secondes)","Choose audio":"Choisir l'audio","Separate vocals":"Voix séparées","Cancel / clear":"Annuler / effacer","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Choisissez un court fichier audio pour commencer.","Downloading the separation model…":"Téléchargement du modèle de séparation…","Separating locally…":"Séparation locale…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Séparation terminée. Prévisualisez ou téléchargez l’une ou l’autre tige.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Impossible de traiter ce fichier ou de charger le modèle. Vérifiez le format et la connexion, puis réessayez.","Model and weight license information":"Informations sur la licence de modèle et de poids","Estimated vocals":"Voix estimée","Estimated accompaniment":"Accompagnement estimé","Download WAV":"Télécharger WAV","Progress":"Progrès","Preparing local separation…":"Préparation de la séparation locale…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Séparation terminée. L'audio est resté sur cet appareil.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Cet audio n'a pas pu être traité. Essayez un fichier de musique stéréo de moins de 30 secondes.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Comparateur de franchises de l'assurance maladie suisse","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Calculateur de franchise d'assurance maladie suisse — Comparez les coûts annuels","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Comparez les franchises de l'assurance maladie de base suisse à l'aide des primes et des frais médicaux annuels éligibles que vous saisissez. Aucun devis d'assureur n'est deviné.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Saisissez les primes mensuelles indiquées par le même assureur pour chaque franchise qu'il propose, puis comparez les scénarios de coûts de traitement annuels faibles, attendus et élevés.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Pour l'assurance maladie de base obligatoire en Suisse, la franchise standard adulte s'élève à 300 CHF et la franchise enfant à 0 CHF. Les niveaux optionnels diffèrent selon la tranche d'âge. Après la franchise, le droit de rétention standard s'élève à 10% des frais restants éligibles, plafonné à CHF 700 par an pour les adultes et CHF 350 pour les enfants. L'outil ajoute votre prime saisie à ce partage des coûts modélisé ; il ne récupère pas les tarifs des assureurs et ne décide pas quelle option vous convient le mieux.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Si un adulte inscrit une prime mensuelle de 400 CHF avec une franchise de 300 CHF et de 350 CHF avec une franchise de 2 500 CHF, la différence de prime annuelle est de 600 CHF. Comparez cette économie avec la différence modélisée de partage des coûts pour chacun de vos montants de coûts éligibles faibles, attendus et élevés.","How the estimate works":"Comment fonctionne l'estimation","Common questions":"Questions courantes","Scope and exclusions":"Portée et exclusions","Where do I get the premiums?":"Où puis-je obtenir les primes ?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Utilisez les offres mensuelles actuelles pour le même assureur, la même région de prime, la même tranche d'âge, la même couverture accident et le même modèle d'assurance. Priminfo est le site de comparaison fédéral officiel. Cette page ne récupère ni ne reproduit les devis des assureurs.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Tous les niveaux de franchise répertoriés sont-ils toujours proposés ?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Non. Les assureurs ne sont pas obligés de proposer tous les niveaux optionnels et les offres peuvent différer pour les jeunes adultes. Saisissez uniquement les primes indiquées pour votre propre police ; laissez les options non disponibles vides.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Est-ce que ceci montre ma facture médicale complète ?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Non. Le modèle couvre la franchise ordinaire et les frais de rétention standard de 10 % sur les coûts éligibles. Sont exclues les cotisations journalières d'hospitalisation, la rétention spéciale de 40 % des médicaments, les prestations exonérées, les soins non couverts et les assurances complémentaires.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Il s'agit d'une comparaison de scénarios et non d'un conseil d'assurance, médical ou financier. Il ne prédit pas votre traitement ni vos primes. Sont exclues les cotisations journalières d'hospitalisation (normalement 15 CHF par jour d'hospitalisation, avec exonérations légales), la retenue spéciale de 40% sur certains médicaments, les exonérations de maternité/préventive, les prestations hors couverture obligatoire, les subventions de primes et les assurances complémentaires. Le ticket modérateur réel peut donc différer. Une franchise plus élevée signifie que vous devez pouvoir payer davantage d’avance si vous recevez des soins.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Qui est assuré en vertu de cette police ?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Adulte (19 ans ou plus)","Child (under 18)":"Enfant (moins de 18 ans)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Scénario de coûts de traitement éligibles annuels faibles (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Coûts de traitement éligibles annuels attendus (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Scénario de coûts de traitement éligibles annuels élevés (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Primes mensuelles d'un assureur","Monthly premium":"Prime mensuelle","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Entrez uniquement les options proposées pour cette même stratégie. Laissez les autres vides.","Adult deductible choices":"Choix de franchise pour adultes","Child deductible choices":"Choix de franchise pour enfants","Compare annual costs":"Comparez les coûts annuels","Clear entries":"Effacer les entrées","Download CSV":"Télécharger le fichier CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Prime annuelle estimée plus partage des coûts","Deductible":"Franchise","Annual premiums":"Primes annuelles","Total at low costs":"Total à petits prix","Total at expected costs":"Total aux coûts prévus","Total at high costs":"Total à coûts élevés","Cost sharing at low costs":"Partage des coûts à faible coût","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Partage des coûts aux coûts prévus","Cost sharing at high costs":"Partage des coûts à des coûts élevés","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Différence par rapport à la franchise la plus basse disponible","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Frais médicaux pour lesquels les économies sur les primes sont épuisées","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"L'économie de prime saisie n'est pas annulée dans la plage de partage des coûts modélisée.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Aucune économie de prime par rapport à la franchise la plus basse.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Total attendu le plus bas parmi les options saisies","Scenario details":"Détails du scénario","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Saisissez trois scénarios de frais médicaux ordonnés et des primes mensuelles pour au moins deux franchises disponibles.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Règlement officiel et primes en vigueur :","Federal deductible rules":"Règles fédérales de franchise","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Comparaison premium officielle de Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Comparaison calculée dans ce navigateur.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Vérifiez la tranche d'âge, les scénarios de coûts commandés et au moins deux primes mensuelles.","Entries cleared.":"Entrées effacées.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV téléchargé localement.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Calculateur de réduction des primes de santé suisses","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Calculateur de subvention des primes suisses — Votre prime nette","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Calculez la prime nette d'assurance maladie suisse à partir de la prime actuelle et d'une réduction mensuelle déjà accordée par votre canton.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Saisissez la prime et la réduction mensuelle confirmée par votre assureur ou décision cantonale. Cet outil ne décide pas si vous êtes admissible.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Les cantons suisses déterminent qui est éligible, quel montant d'aide est accordé et si une demande est nécessaire. Ce calculateur soustrait uniquement une réduction mensuelle confirmée d'une prime de police et indique le montant annuel.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Si la prime mensuelle est de 420 CHF et la réduction confirmée est de 120 CHF, la prime nette estimée est de 300 CHF par mois.","How the calculation works":"Comment fonctionne le calcul","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Est-ce que cela me dit si je suis admissible ?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Non. L'éligibilité et le montant des allocations sont déterminés par le canton de résidence. Utilisez les informations officielles liées ou contactez l'office cantonal.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Où puis-je trouver le montant de la réduction ?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Utilisez la décision en vigueur ou la prime réduite indiquée par votre assureur. Certains cantons accordent automatiquement des réductions ; d'autres nécessitent une demande.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Il s'agit d'une opération arithmétique pour une politique, et non d'une décision en matière d'éligibilité ou de prestations. Il ne calcule pas les revenus du ménage, le patrimoine, la situation familiale, les délais, les seuils cantonaux ou les droits de candidature. Les primes et les récompenses peuvent changer ; confirmez-les auprès de votre assureur et de votre canton.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Prime mensuelle actuelle (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Réduction mensuelle déjà accordée (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Saisissez un montant confirmé par le canton ou l'assureur; n’utilisez pas une estimation comme récompense.","Calculate net premium":"Calculer la prime nette","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Saisissez la prime actuelle et la réduction confirmée.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Prime estimée après réduction","Current monthly premium":"Prime mensuelle actuelle","Monthly reduction":"Réduction mensuelle","Estimated net monthly premium":"Prime mensuelle nette estimée","Reduction over 12 months":"Réduction sur 12 mois","Reduction as a share of premium":"Réduction en quote-part de prime","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Calcul terminé. Confirmez l'attribution et les dates d'effet auprès de votre canton et de votre assureur.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Vérifiez que la réduction n'est pas supérieure à la prime mensuelle.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Calculateur de scénario de taux de référence pour le loyer suisse","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Calculateur d'ajustement de loyer suisse — Scénario de taux de référence","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Estimez uniquement l'impact d'une modification du taux hypothécaire de référence en Suisse sur un loyer net résidentiel. Utilisez le dernier tarif du bureau fédéral du logement.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Comparez le tarif de référence indiqué dans votre bail ou votre dernier avis de location avec le tarif officiel suisse en vigueur. Le calcul reste sur votre appareil.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"L'Office fédéral du logement publie chaque trimestre un taux hypothécaire de référence pour les adaptations de loyer en Suisse. Une augmentation de 0,25 point de pourcentage peut en principe permettre une augmentation du loyer de 3 % ; une diminution de 0,25 point peut en principe permettre une réduction de 2,91 %. Ce scénario applique ces modifications étape par étape au loyer net que vous saisissez.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Pour un loyer mensuel net de 3000 CHF, une diminution du taux de référence de 1,75% à 1,50% donne une variation estimée du taux de référence uniquement d'environ −87,38 CHF par mois (−2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Fonctionnement de cette estimation","Where do I find the current rate?":"Où puis-je trouver le taux actuel ?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Ouvrez la page liée de l'Office fédéral du logement et saisissez le tarif actuellement publié. L’outil n’embarque pas de tarif qui pourrait devenir obsolète.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Cela détermine-t-il si je peux demander une modification de loyer ?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Non. Il isole un facteur d’orientation. Votre contrat, l'inflation, les modifications de coûts, les réservations et autres conditions juridiques peuvent modifier le résultat.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Le résultat inclut-il les frais accessoires ?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Non. Saisissez le loyer mensuel net, hors frais annexes et autres charges variables.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Le résultat est un scénario de taux de référence illustratif, et non un avis juridique ou une révision complète du loyer. Sont exclus l'inflation, les modifications générales des coûts, les améliorations, les réserves contractuelles, les loyers indexés ou échelonnés, les délais de préavis et la procédure cantonale. Vérifiez votre bail et les directives officielles avant d'agir.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Baux d'habitation en Suisse : estimation de l'effet taux de référence hypothécaire uniquement. Il ne s’agit pas d’une décision judiciaire ou d’une révision complète du loyer.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Loyer mensuel net actuel (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Taux de référence indiqué dans votre bail ou dernier avis de loyer (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Taux de référence officiel suisse actuel (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Calculer le scénario du taux de référence","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Scénario de taux de référence uniquement","Current monthly net rent":"Loyer mensuel net actuel","Reference-rate change":"Changement du taux de référence","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Effet mensuel estimé à partir du taux de référence","Scenario monthly net rent":"Scénario de loyer net mensuel","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Effet annualisé pendant 12 mois au même rythme","potential increase":"augmentation potentielle","potential decrease":"diminution potentielle","no reference-rate change":"aucun changement de taux de référence","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"L'estimation applique 3 % pour chaque augmentation de 0,25 point de pourcentage et la réduction inverse équivalente pour chaque diminution. D'autres facteurs peuvent modifier le résultat.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Cela n'inclut pas l'inflation, les modifications générales des coûts, les améliorations, les réservations de contrat, les loyers indexés ou échelonnés, les dates de préavis ou les exigences procédurales locales. Vérifiez votre bail et les directives de l'Office fédéral du logement.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Consultez les derniers taux et conseils officiels","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Office fédéral du logement (OFM)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Saisissez le loyer et les deux tarifs pour voir un scénario.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Scénario calculé. Vérifiez les dates et les termes du contrat avant de vous y fier.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Vérifiez les montants et les tarifs. Les taux doivent être compris entre 0 % et 5 % et différer par paliers de 0,25 point.","Inputs cleared.":"Entrées effacées.","Result":"Résultat","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Estimateur de cumul de vacances en Suisse","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Calculateur de cumul de vacances en Suisse — Solde de congés au prorata","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Estimez un solde de jours de vacances suisses à partir des congés annuels de votre contrat, de la semaine de travail, des dates d'emploi et des jours déjà pris.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Estimez les congés payés au prorata pour une année civile à l'aide des droits et de l'horaire de travail que vous saisissez. Aucune clause contractuelle n'est devinée.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"L'estimateur calcule au prorata les jours de congé annuel de votre contrat en fonction des jours calendaires employés au cours de l'année sélectionnée. Pour le travail à temps partiel, indiquez vos jours de travail habituels par semaine et vos congés annuels en semaines.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Avec quatre semaines de congés, une semaine de travail de cinq jours et un emploi toute l'année, le droit annuel est de 20 jours ouvrables avant déduction des congés déjà pris.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Quel est le minimum légal suisse ?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Les directives fédérales prévoient au moins quatre semaines par année de service et cinq semaines pour les travailleurs de moins de 20 ans. Un contrat ou une convention collective peut accorder davantage.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Est-ce que cela détermine mon équilibre juridique ?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Non. Il s’agit d’un simple calcul au prorata par jour calendaire. Les clauses contractuelles, les règles collectives applicables, les absences qualifiantes, les arrondis et les dossiers employeurs peuvent modifier la balance.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Cette estimation ne détermine pas un droit légal ni ne calcule l'indemnité de congés. Elle exclut les réductions pour certaines absences prolongées, les règles de régularisation et d'arrondi spécifiques au contrat, les jours fériés, les heures supplémentaires, les délais de report et les litiges. Vérifiez votre contrat et obtenez des conseils en cas de solde contesté.","Leave year":"Année de congé","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Congés annuels dans votre contrat (semaines)","Usual working days per week":"Jours ouvrables habituels par semaine","Employment start date":"Date de début d'emploi","Employment end date":"Date de fin d'emploi","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Jours de congé déjà pris au cours de cette année de congé","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Pour orientation uniquement. Saisir le droit annuel contractuel ; le minimum légal est généralement de quatre semaines, ou de cinq semaines pour les travailleurs de moins de 20 ans.","Estimate balance":"Estimation du solde","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Entrez votre contrat et vos dates pour estimer un solde.","Estimated leave balance":"Solde de congés estimé","Annual leave at this schedule":"Congé annuel à cet horaire","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Jours calendaires employés au cours de cette année de congé","Prorated days accrued":"Jours accumulés au prorata","Days already taken":"Jours déjà pris","Estimated days remaining":"Jours restants estimés","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Cela répartit les congés annuels au prorata des jours calendaires de la période d'emploi. Les règles de l’employeur et du contrat peuvent différer.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Estimation calculée. Vérifiez-le par rapport à votre contrat et aux dossiers de votre employeur.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Vérifiez l'année, les dates, le calendrier de travail et les valeurs."},"pt":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Cenário de subsídio de desemprego suíço","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Calculadora de benefício de desemprego suíço - cenário bruto","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Estime uma diária bruta suíça usando o salário segurado e a taxa confirmada pelo seu fundo.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Insira o salário segurado e a taxa de 70% ou 80% confirmada pelo seu fundo de desemprego.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"As regras suíças definem a taxa de subsídio e o teto salarial. O fundo decide a elegibilidade, deduções, dias de espera e direitos. A faixa mensal reflete de 20 a 23 dias úteis a pagar.","Example":"Exemplo","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5.000 a 70% é cerca de CHF 161,29 por dia da semana pagável.","How it works":"Como funciona","Questions":"Perguntas","Scope and limits":"Escopo e limites","Related tools":"Ferramentas relacionadas","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Salário mensal segurado (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Taxa confirmada pelo fundo","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Estimativa","Clear":"Limpar","Gross scenario":"Cenário bruto","Insured salary used":"Salário segurado usado","Per payable weekday":"Por dia útil a pagar","20-day month":"mês de 20 dias","23-day month":"mês de 23 dias","Official benefit rules":"Regras oficiais de benefícios","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Insira seus números confirmados.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Cenário calculado. Confirme os valores com seu fundo.","Check the values.":"Verifique os valores.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Planejador de avisos de locação suíço","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Planejador de aviso de aluguel suíço e rascunho de carta","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Planeje um aviso de locação a partir das datas e termos do seu próprio contrato; redigir uma carta sem assumir as regras do cantão.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Insira o período de aviso prévio, o próximo dia de rescisão válido em seu contrato e a data de recebimento. Verifique todas as datas com o seu senhorio ou associação de inquilinos.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"O planejador aplica apenas as datas e o período que você fornecer. Não decide se a notificação é válida, quando é recebida legalmente ou se se aplica uma proteção especial.","Contract notice period (months)":"Período de notificação do contrato (meses)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Próximo dia válido do mês de rescisão (do contrato)","Expected receipt date":"Data de recebimento prevista","Your name":"Seu nome","Your address":"Seu endereço","Landlord / agency":"Proprietário / agência","Recipient address":"Endereço do destinatário","Rental property":"Propriedade para alugar","Place":"Local","Letter date":"Data da carta","Termination of tenancy":"Rescisão da locação","Calculate date and draft letter":"Calcular data e rascunho da carta","Planning date":"Data de planejamento","Target date":"Data prevista","Editable draft":"Rascunho editável","Copy draft":"Copiar rascunho","Enter your contract terms.":"Insira os termos do seu contrato.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Projeto de planejamento pronto. Verifique em relação ao seu contrato.","Check the dates and period.":"Verifique as datas e o período.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"O resultado segue o dia do aviso de contrato fornecido; não é uma decisão de aviso legal.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Cenário de ganho de propriedade na Suíça","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Imposto sobre ganhos de propriedade na Suíça — Cenário de taxa inserida pelo usuário","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Estime um ganho de propriedade usando seus próprios custos de transação e uma taxa de imposto do cantão responsável.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Insira receitas, custo de aquisição, despesas elegíveis que você confirmou e uma taxa efetiva da calculadora cantonal oficial.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"O imposto suíço sobre ganhos de propriedade varia de acordo com o cantão, o período de detenção, as deduções e o caso. Esta ferramenta não fornece taxas nem determina custos admissíveis.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Receita da venda (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Custo de aquisição (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Outros custos confirmados como admissíveis (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Taxa de imposto efetiva de fonte oficial (%)","Estimate scenario":"Cenário estimado","Illustrative scenario":"Cenário ilustrativo","Gain entered":"Ganho inserido","Tax at entered rate":"Imposto à taxa inserida","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Insira números de seus registros e da fonte do cantão.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Cenário calculado; verifique com o cantão.","Check amounts and rate.":"Verifique valores e taxas.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Nenhuma tabela de impostos cantões está incorporada; sua taxa efetiva inserida impulsiona a estimativa.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Cenário de imposto sobre heranças e doações na Suíça","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Imposto suíço sobre heranças e doações - seu cenário de taxa","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Estimar um valor tributável de uma isenção e taxa inserida pelo usuário; as regras variam de acordo com o cantão e o relacionamento.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Insira um valor, isenção e taxa efetiva confirmada para o destinatário e cantão.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"As regras do cantão e o relacionamento familiar podem alterar isenções e taxas. Esta ferramenta não seleciona uma regra de cantão nem determina a obrigação fiscal.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Valor de herança ou doação (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Isenção confirmada com cantão (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Taxa efetiva confirmada com cantão (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Valor após isenção inserida","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Insira os números confirmados para o seu caso.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"A estimativa usa apenas a isenção e a taxa inseridas.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Cenário de orçamento de pensão alimentícia suíça","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Orçamento Suíço de Apoio à Criança — Cenário Familiar Transparente","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Alocar um orçamento infantil inserido pela renda dos pais após um crédito de custo direto inserido.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Use as necessidades mensais documentadas da criança, a renda mensal disponível de ambos os pais e quaisquer custos diretos que você deseja creditar.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Esta é apenas uma planilha de planejamento. Não se trata de um prêmio suíço de pensão alimentícia ou de um método legal; habitação, cuidados, impostos, benefícios e jurisprudência não são avaliados.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Orçamento infantil mensal que você documentou (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Renda mensal disponível do pai A (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Renda mensal disponível do pai B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Custos diretos dos filhos pagos pelo Pai A ao crédito (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Alocar cenário","Illustrative allocation":"Alocação ilustrativa","Parent A remaining contribution":"Contribuição restante do pai A","Parent B contribution":"Contribuição do pai B","Entered monthly child budget":"Orçamento infantil mensal inserido","Enter your household budget figures.":"Insira os valores do seu orçamento familiar.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Cenário de orçamento calculado; discutir obrigações legais com um consultor qualificado.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Verificar valores; o crédito não pode exceder o orçamento.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"As ações são proporcionais aos dois rendimentos inseridos; o crédito de custo direto é subtraído primeiro.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Visualização da hifenização do navegador","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Visualização da hifenização de palavras — Padrões de linguagem do navegador","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Visualizar a hifenização do navegador para o texto fornecido; o suporte depende do navegador e dos recursos de idioma instalados.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Escolha o idioma que corresponde ao seu texto, insira uma amostra e ajuste a largura da linha disponível.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Usa a hifenização CSS nativa do navegador. Não agrupa dicionários; navegadores não suportados podem não mostrar hífens. Copiar o texto mantém a ortografia original.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Linguagem de texto (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Largura de visualização (caracteres)","Text to preview":"Texto para visualização","Preview":"Visualização","Enter text and choose its language.":"Insira o texto e escolha seu idioma.","Preview updated.":"Visualização atualizada.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Insira uma tag e texto de idioma suportado.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Experimente o mesmo parágrafo em larguras diferentes para ver onde o navegador pode quebrar palavras.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Espaço de trabalho de verificação ortográfica privada","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Verificador ortográfico local — Use o dicionário do seu navegador","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Edite o texto com o corretor ortográfico nativo do navegador, escolha um idioma e copie o texto corrigido.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"O texto permanece nesta página. Defina um idioma para o qual seu navegador possui um dicionário ortográfico e, em seguida, use o menu de ortografia ou sublinhe as sugestões.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Esta área de trabalho não carrega texto nem envia dicionários. A disponibilidade e as sugestões da verificação ortográfica do navegador dependem do dispositivo, do navegador e do dicionário instalado.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Linguagem de verificação ortográfica (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Texto para verificar","Copy text":"Copiar texto","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Digite ou cole texto. Clique com o botão direito ou use o menu de ortografia do seu dispositivo para obter sugestões.","Text copied.":"Texto copiado.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Não foi possível copiar automaticamente; selecione e copie o texto.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Um navegador sem um dicionário correspondente não pode marcar erros ortográficos.","Resume Structure Checker":"Retomar verificador de estrutura","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Resume Checker – Revisão local gratuita de PDF e DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Verifique o texto do currículo, títulos, seções, links e estrutura de marcadores em seu navegador. Compare os termos da descrição do trabalho por contagem; nenhuma pontuação de contratação ou upload.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Revise o que um currículo baseado em texto realmente expõe: texto extraído, estrutura de cabeçalho, presença de campo de contato, links e seções comumente reconhecidas. Opcionalmente, compare termos repetidos de descrição de cargo.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"Um DOCX com estilos de Título 1 para Experiência e Educação mostra esses títulos. Um PDF é verificado a partir do texto selecionável; colunas podem ser lidas em uma ordem diferente.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"Arquivos DOCX são inspecionados localmente como Office ZIP/XML. Os PDFs são lidos com um mecanismo PDF.js local diferido. A comparação opcional da descrição do trabalho conta os termos selecionados em cada texto; não cria uma pontuação nem recomenda a contratação de alguém.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Esta é uma verificação de formato e estrutura de texto, não um simulador ATS, revisão legal ou previsão de sucesso de entrevista. PDFs digitalizados sem texto selecionável precisam primeiro de OCR. Documentos protegidos por senha, habilitados para macro, assinados ou excepcionalmente grandes não são suportados.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Escolha um currículo (PDF ou DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Seus arquivos permanecem neste navegador e não são carregados. Máximo 20MB; PDF até 50 páginas. O conteúdo expandido DOCX é limitado a 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Descrição do trabalho opcional","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Cole texto simples se desejar uma comparação termo-frequência. Não inclua informações confidenciais que você não precisa analisar.","Paste job-description text here…":"Cole o texto da descrição do trabalho aqui…","Analyze locally":"Analisar localmente","Clear files and report":"Limpar arquivos e relatório","Resume review":"Retomar revisão","File type":"Tipo de arquivo","Extracted characters":"Caracteres extraídos","Words counted":"Palavras contadas","Detected headings":"Títulos detectados","Recognized sections":"Seções reconhecidas","Hyperlinks found":"Hiperlinks encontrados","Bullet paragraphs":"Parágrafos com marcadores","An email address appears in the text":"Um endereço de e-mail aparece no texto","No email address pattern was detected":"Nenhum padrão de endereço de e-mail foi detectado","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Um padrão semelhante a um número de telefone aparece no texto","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Nenhum padrão semelhante a um número de telefone foi detectado","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Termos de descrição do trabalho (apenas conta)","Term":"Prazo","In job text":"No texto do trabalho","In resume":"No currículo","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Cole uma descrição de trabalho para comparar contagens de mandatos.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Nenhum estilo de título claro foi detectado. Os títulos do PDF são estimados a partir do tamanho do texto e podem ser imprecisos.","Detected":"Detectado","Not detected":"Não detectado","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Esta heurística reconhece um conjunto limitado de nomes de seções comuns; ele não decide quais seções são necessárias.","Profile / summary":"Perfil/resumo","Experience":"Experiência","Education":"Educação","Skills":"Habilidades","Contact":"Contato","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Nenhum texto selecionável foi encontrado. PDFs somente digitalizados precisam de OCR antes de serem verificados.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Escolha um currículo em PDF ou DOCX para começar.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Lendo o arquivo selecionado localmente…","Local structure review complete.":"Revisão da estrutura local concluída.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Este navegador não suporta um recurso de documento local obrigatório.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Escolha um arquivo PDF válido ou um arquivo DOCX moderno até os limites locais indicados.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"O PDF não pôde ser lido. Pode estar danificado, criptografado ou não conter texto selecionável.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"O pacote DOCX não pôde ser aberto ou lido com segurança.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Esta ferramenta carrega ou salva meu currículo?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Não. Análise e análise são executadas em seu navegador. O texto do arquivo não é enviado a um servidor nem retido após você limpar o relatório ou sair da página.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Ele prevê se um ATS ou empregador aceitará meu currículo?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Não. Ele verifica apenas texto legível e estrutura simples. Os sistemas de contratação são diferentes e isso não é uma garantia de compatibilidade ATS ou previsão de contratação.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Ele consegue ler um PDF digitalizado?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Somente se o PDF tiver uma camada de texto selecionável. Este verificador não baixa modelos OCR; use primeiro uma ferramenta de OCR para um documento digitalizado apenas com imagem.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"O que significa a comparação da descrição do trabalho?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Mostra contagens de termos recorrentes após normalização simples. Não se trata de uma percentagem de correspondência, classificação, recomendação ou avaliação das suas qualificações.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Por que um PDF mostra menos títulos do que um DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDFs geralmente não preservam estilos de cabeçalho semânticos. O verificador estima as linhas proeminentes a partir do tamanho do texto e da ordem de leitura, portanto, as colunas e o design visual podem afetar o resultado.","How local resume review works":"Como funciona a revisão de currículo local","Resume checker questions":"Retomar perguntas do verificador","Scope and limitations":"Escopo e limitações","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Separador local de voz e acompanhamento","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Removedor vocal — Vocais separados e acompanhamento localmente","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Separe uma pequena amostra de áudio estéreo em vocais estimados e acompanhamento em seu navegador. O áudio permanece no seu dispositivo; o modelo é baixado de seu host público.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Escolha um clipe de música estéreo de até 30 segundos. Na primeira utilização, o navegador baixa um modelo de 35,6 MB. O arquivo de áudio é processado neste dispositivo e nunca é carregado.","What you get":"O que você obtém","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Visualize e baixe duas hastes WAV: vocais estimados e o acompanhamento residual. Os resultados dependem da combinação e podem conter artefatos.","Local processing":"Processamento local","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"A ferramenta usa a rede vocal Open-Unmix UMX-HQ exportada para ONNX e ONNX Runtime Web. O modelo é obtido somente quando você pressiona Separar; nenhuma API de inferência paga ou assinatura é usada. O áudio é decodificado, processado e exportado localmente.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Esta é uma estimativa para processamento estéreo de 44,1 kHz e clipes de até 30 segundos. Fontes mono são duplicadas para estéreo. Vocais profundamente misturados em instrumentos, efeitos pesados, gravações ao vivo e gêneros incomuns podem produzir vazamentos ou artefatos. Não use o resultado como um master limpo. O download do modelo requer conexão com a internet; o áudio não sai deste dispositivo.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Meu áudio foi carregado?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Não. O áudio selecionado é decodificado e processado em seu navegador. A única solicitação de rede é o download do modelo quando você inicia a separação.","Why is the first run slow?":"Por que a primeira execução é lenta?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"O navegador baixa um modelo de 35,6 MB uma vez; o navegador pode armazená-lo em cache. A inferência é então executada localmente na CPU do dispositivo.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Todas as músicas serão separadas de forma limpa?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Não. O modelo estima uma haste vocal e pode deixar vazamento vocal, remover harmônicos do instrumento ou criar artefatos. Ouça antes de confiar em uma haste.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Arquivo de áudio estéreo (até 30 segundos)","Choose audio":"Escolha o áudio","Separate vocals":"Vocais separados","Cancel / clear":"Cancelar/limpar","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Escolha um arquivo de áudio curto para começar.","Downloading the separation model…":"Baixando o modelo de separação…","Separating locally…":"Separando localmente…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Separação concluída. Visualize ou baixe qualquer stem.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Não foi possível processar este arquivo ou carregar o modelo. Verifique o formato e a conexão e tente novamente.","Model and weight license information":"Informações sobre modelo e licença de peso","Estimated vocals":"Vocais estimados","Estimated accompaniment":"Acompanhamento estimado","Download WAV":"Baixar WAV","Progress":"Progresso","Preparing local separation…":"Preparando separação local…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Separação concluída. O áudio permaneceu neste dispositivo.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Este áudio não pôde ser processado. Experimente um arquivo de música estéreo com menos de 30 segundos.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Comparador de franquia de seguro saúde suíço","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Calculadora de franquia de seguro saúde suíço - compare custos anuais","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Compare as franquias do seguro de saúde básico suíço usando prêmios e custos médicos anuais elegíveis inseridos. Nenhuma cotação da seguradora é adivinhada.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Insira os prêmios mensais mostrados pela mesma seguradora para cada franquia que ela oferece e, em seguida, compare os cenários de custo de tratamento anual baixo, esperado e alto.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Para o seguro de saúde básico suíço obrigatório, a franquia padrão para adultos é de CHF 300 e a franquia para crianças é de CHF 0. Os níveis opcionais variam de acordo com a faixa etária. Após a franquia, a taxa de retenção padrão é de 10% dos custos restantes elegíveis, limitada a CHF 700 por ano para adultos e CHF 350 para crianças. A ferramenta adiciona o prêmio inserido a esse compartilhamento de custos modelado; ele não busca taxas de seguradora nem decide qual opção é certa para você.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Se um adulto inscreve um prêmio mensal de CHF 400 com uma franquia de CHF 300 e CHF 350 com uma franquia de CHF 2.500, a diferença do prêmio anual é de CHF 600. Compare essa economia com a diferença modelada na divisão de custos em cada um dos valores de custo elegível baixo, esperado e alto.","How the estimate works":"Como funciona a estimativa","Common questions":"Perguntas comuns","Scope and exclusions":"Escopo e exclusões","Where do I get the premiums?":"Onde posso obter os prêmios?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Use as ofertas mensais atuais para a mesma seguradora, região premium, faixa etária, cobertura de acidentes e modelo de seguro. Priminfo é o site oficial de comparação federal. Esta página não busca nem reproduz cotações de seguradoras.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Todos os níveis de franquia listados são sempre oferecidos?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Não. As seguradoras não precisam oferecer todos os níveis opcionais e as ofertas podem ser diferentes para jovens adultos. Insira apenas os prêmios mostrados para sua própria apólice; deixe as opções indisponíveis em branco.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Isso mostra minha conta médica completa?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Não. O modelo cobre a franquia normal e a taxa de retenção padrão de 10% sobre os custos elegíveis. Exclui contribuições para dias hospitalares, retenção especial de medicamentos de 40%, serviços isentos, cuidados não cobertos e seguros complementares.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Esta é uma comparação de cenários, não um seguro, aconselhamento médico ou financeiro. Não prevê seu tratamento ou prêmios. Exclui contribuições para dias de hospitalização (normalmente CHF 15 por dia de internamento, com isenções legais), retenção especial de 40% sobre determinados medicamentos, isenções de maternidade/preventivas, serviços fora da cobertura obrigatória, subsídios de prémios e seguros complementares. O co-pagamento real pode, portanto, ser diferente. Uma franquia mais alta significa que você precisa pagar mais adiantado se receber cuidados.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Quem está segurado por esta apólice?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Adulto (19 anos ou mais)","Child (under 18)":"Criança (menores de 18 anos)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Cenário anual baixo de custo de tratamento elegível (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Custos de tratamento elegíveis anuais esperados (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Cenário anual de alto custo de tratamento elegível (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Prêmios mensais de uma seguradora","Monthly premium":"Prêmio mensal","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Insira apenas as opções oferecidas para esta mesma política. Deixe os outros em branco.","Adult deductible choices":"Opções de franquia para adultos","Child deductible choices":"Opções de franquia infantil","Compare annual costs":"Comparar custos anuais","Clear entries":"Limpar entradas","Download CSV":"Baixar CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Prêmio anual estimado mais divisão de custos","Deductible":"Franquia","Annual premiums":"Prêmios anuais","Total at low costs":"Total a baixo custo","Total at expected costs":"Total a custos esperados","Total at high costs":"Total com custos elevados","Cost sharing at low costs":"Compartilhamento de custos a custos baixos","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Compartilhamento de custos com custos esperados","Cost sharing at high costs":"Compartilhamento de custos com custos elevados","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Diferença da franquia mais baixa disponível","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Custos médicos onde a economia de prêmio é esgotada","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"A economia de prêmio inserida não é cancelada dentro do intervalo modelado de divisão de custos.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Sem economia de prêmio em relação à franquia mais baixa.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Total mais baixo esperado entre as opções inseridas","Scenario details":"Detalhes do cenário","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Insira três cenários de custos médicos solicitados e prêmios mensais para pelo menos duas franquias disponíveis.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Regras oficiais e prêmios atuais:","Federal deductible rules":"Regras de franquia federais","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Comparação premium oficial do Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Comparação calculada neste navegador.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Verifique a faixa etária, os cenários de custos solicitados e pelo menos dois prêmios mensais.","Entries cleared.":"Entradas apagadas.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV baixado localmente.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Calculadora de redução premium da Swiss Health","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Calculadora de subsídio premium suíço – Seu prêmio líquido","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Calcule o prêmio líquido do seguro de saúde suíço a partir do prêmio atual e de uma redução mensal já concedida pelo seu cantão.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Insira o prêmio e a redução mensal confirmada da sua seguradora ou decisão cantonal. Esta ferramenta não decide se você se qualifica.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Os cantões suíços determinam quem se qualifica, quanto apoio é concedido e se uma inscrição é necessária. Esta calculadora subtrai apenas uma redução mensal confirmada de um prêmio de apólice e mostra o valor anual.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Se o prêmio mensal for CHF 420 e a redução confirmada for CHF 120, o prêmio líquido estimado será CHF 300 por mês.","How the calculation works":"Como funciona o cálculo","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Isso me diz se estou qualificado?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Não. A elegibilidade e os valores dos prêmios são decididos pelo cantão de residência. Use as informações oficiais vinculadas ou entre em contato com o escritório cantonal.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Onde encontro o valor da redução?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Use a decisão atual ou o prêmio reduzido mostrado pela sua seguradora. Alguns cantões concedem reduções automaticamente; outros exigem um aplicativo.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Isso é aritmética para uma apólice, não uma decisão de elegibilidade ou benefício. Não calcula o rendimento familiar, bens, situação familiar, prazos, limites cantonais ou direitos de aplicação. Os prêmios e prêmios podem mudar; confirme-os com sua seguradora e cantão.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Prêmio mensal atual (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Redução mensal já concedida (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Insira um valor confirmado pelo cantão ou seguradora; não use uma estimativa como prêmio.","Calculate net premium":"Calcular prêmio líquido","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Insira o prêmio atual e a redução confirmada.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Prêmio estimado após redução","Current monthly premium":"Prêmio mensal atual","Monthly reduction":"Redução mensal","Estimated net monthly premium":"Prêmio líquido mensal estimado","Reduction over 12 months":"Redução em 12 meses","Reduction as a share of premium":"Redução como parcela do prêmio","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Cálculo concluído. Confirme a concessão e as datas de vigência com seu cantão e seguradora.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Verifique se a redução não é superior ao prêmio mensal.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora de cenário de taxa de referência de aluguel suíço","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Calculadora de ajuste de aluguel na Suíça — Cenário de taxa de referência","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Estime apenas como uma mudança na taxa de referência hipotecária da Suíça afeta o aluguel líquido residencial. Use a taxa mais recente do órgão federal de habitação.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Compare a taxa de referência indicada no seu contrato de locação ou no último aviso de aluguel com a taxa oficial suíça atual. O cálculo permanece no seu dispositivo.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"O Departamento Federal de Habitação publica uma taxa de referência de hipoteca para ajustes de aluguel na Suíça a cada trimestre. Um aumento de 0,25 pontos percentuais pode, em princípio, permitir um aumento de 3% nas rendas; uma redução de 0,25 pontos pode, em princípio, permitir uma redução de 2,91%. Este cenário aplica essas alterações passo a passo ao aluguel líquido inserido.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Para um aluguel líquido mensal de CHF 3.000, uma redução da taxa de referência de 1,75% para 1,50% resulta em uma alteração estimada apenas na taxa de referência de cerca de -CHF 87,38 por mês (-2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Como funciona essa estimativa","Where do I find the current rate?":"Onde encontro a taxa atual?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Abra a página vinculada do Federal Office for Housing e insira a taxa publicada atual. A ferramenta não incorpora uma taxa que possa ficar desatualizada.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Isso decide se posso solicitar uma alteração no aluguel?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Não. Ele isola um fator para orientação. Seu contrato, inflação, alterações de custos, reservas e outras condições legais podem alterar o resultado.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"O resultado inclui custos acessórios?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Não. Insira a renda líquida mensal, excluindo custos acessórios e outros encargos variáveis.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"O resultado é um cenário ilustrativo da taxa de referência, não um parecer jurídico ou revisão completa do aluguel. Exclui inflação, alterações gerais de custos, melhorias, reservas contratuais, aluguéis indexados ou escalonados, datas de aviso prévio e procedimento cantonal. Verifique seu contrato de locação e as orientações oficiais antes de agir.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Aluguéis residenciais na Suíça: apenas uma estimativa do efeito da taxa de referência da hipoteca. Não é uma decisão legal ou uma revisão completa do aluguel.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Aluguel líquido mensal atual (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Taxa de referência indicada no seu contrato de locação ou no último aviso de aluguel (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Taxa de referência suíça oficial atual (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Calcular cenário de taxa de referência","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Cenário somente de taxa de referência","Current monthly net rent":"Aluguel líquido mensal atual","Reference-rate change":"Alteração da taxa de referência","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Efeito mensal estimado da taxa de referência","Scenario monthly net rent":"Cenário aluguel líquido mensal","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Efeito anualizado por 12 meses na mesma taxa","potential increase":"aumento potencial","potential decrease":"diminuição potencial","no reference-rate change":"sem alteração na taxa de referência","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"A estimativa aplica 3% para cada aumento de 0,25 pontos percentuais e a redução inversa equivalente para cada diminuição. Outros fatores podem alterar o resultado.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Isso não inclui inflação, alterações gerais de custos, melhorias, reservas de contratos, aluguéis indexados ou escalonados, datas de aviso ou requisitos processuais locais. Verifique seu contrato de locação e as orientações da Secretaria Federal de Habitação.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Verifique as últimas taxas e orientações oficiais","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Escritório Federal Suíço de Habitação (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Insira o aluguel e ambas as taxas para ver um cenário.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Cenário calculado. Verifique as datas e os termos do contrato antes de confiar neles.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Consulte valores e taxas. As taxas devem estar entre 0% e 5% e diferir em etapas de 0,25 pontos.","Inputs cleared.":"Entradas apagadas.","Result":"Resultado","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Estimador de acúmulo de férias na Suíça","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Calculadora de acumulação de férias na Suíça - Saldo de licenças rateado","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Estime o saldo de dias de férias na Suíça a partir das férias anuais do seu contrato, semana de trabalho, datas de emprego e dias já gozados.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Estimar férias remuneradas rateadas para um ano civil usando o direito e o horário de trabalho inseridos. Nenhum termo do contrato é adivinhado.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"O estimador distribui os dias de férias anuais em seu contrato pelos dias corridos empregados no ano selecionado. Para trabalho a tempo parcial, insira os dias de trabalho habituais por semana e as férias anuais em semanas.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Com quatro semanas de férias, uma semana de trabalho de cinco dias e emprego durante todo o ano, o direito anual é de 20 dias úteis antes de subtrair as férias já gozadas.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Qual é o mínimo legal suíço?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"As orientações federais estabelecem pelo menos quatro semanas por ano de serviço e cinco semanas para trabalhadores que não atingiram a idade de 20 anos. Um contrato ou acordo coletivo pode conceder mais.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Isso decide meu equilíbrio jurídico?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Não. É um rateio simples por dia corrido. As condições contratuais, as regras coletivas aplicáveis, as ausências qualificadas, os arredondamentos e os registos do empregador podem alterar o equilíbrio.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Esta estimativa não decide um direito legal nem calcula o pagamento de férias. Exclui reduções para certas ausências prolongadas, regras de arredondamento e acumulação específicas do contrato, feriados, horas extras, prazos de transferência e disputas. Verifique o seu contrato e obtenha aconselhamento sobre um saldo contestado.","Leave year":"Ano de licença","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Férias anuais no seu contrato (semanas)","Usual working days per week":"Dias úteis normais por semana","Employment start date":"Data de início do emprego","Employment end date":"Data de término do emprego","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Dias de férias já gozados neste ano de férias","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Apenas para orientação. Insira o direito contratual anual; o mínimo legal é geralmente quatro semanas, ou cinco semanas para trabalhadores com menos de 20 anos.","Estimate balance":"Estimar saldo","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Insira seu contrato e datas para estimar o saldo.","Estimated leave balance":"Saldo estimado de licenças","Annual leave at this schedule":"Licença anual neste horário","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Dias corridos empregados neste ano de férias","Prorated days accrued":"Dias rateados acumulados","Days already taken":"Dias já aproveitados","Estimated days remaining":"Dias restantes estimados","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Isso distribui as férias anuais por dias corridos no período de emprego. As regras do empregador e do contrato podem ser diferentes.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Estimativa calculada. Verifique-o em relação ao seu contrato e aos registros do empregador.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Confira ano, datas, horário de trabalho e valores."},"de":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Schweizer Arbeitslosengeld-Szenario","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Schweizer Arbeitslosengeldrechner – Bruttoszenario","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Schätzen Sie Ihr Schweizer Bruttotaggeld anhand des von Ihrer Kasse bestätigten versicherten Lohns und Tarifs.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Geben Sie den versicherten Lohn und den von Ihrer Arbeitslosenkasse bestätigten Satz von 70 % oder 80 % ein.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Schweizer Regeln legen den Zulagensatz und die Gehaltsobergrenze fest. Der Fonds entscheidet über Anspruchsberechtigung, Abzüge, Wartezeiten und Ansprüche. Der monatliche Bereich umfasst 20–23 zahlbare Wochentage.","Example":"Beispiel","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5.000 bei 70 % sind etwa CHF 161,29 pro zahlbarem Wochentag.","How it works":"So funktioniert es","Questions":"Fragen","Scope and limits":"Umfang und Grenzen","Related tools":"Verwandte Tools","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Monatlicher versicherter Lohn (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Preis vom Fonds bestätigt","70%":"70 %","80%":"80 %","Estimate":"Schätzung","Clear":"Klar","Gross scenario":"Bruttoszenario","Insured salary used":"Versicherter Lohn verwendet","Per payable weekday":"Pro zahlbarem Wochentag","20-day month":"20-Tage-Monat","23-day month":"23-Tage-Monat","Official benefit rules":"Offizielle Leistungsregeln","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Geben Sie Ihre bestätigten Zahlen ein.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Szenario berechnet. Bestätigen Sie die Beträge mit Ihrem Fonds.","Check the values.":"Überprüfen Sie die Werte.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Schweizer Mietanzeigenplaner","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Schweizer Mietanzeigenplaner und Briefentwurf","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Planen Sie eine Mietkündigung anhand der Daten und Bedingungen in Ihrem eigenen Vertrag; Einen Brief verfassen, ohne die kantonalen Regeln zu übernehmen.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Geben Sie die Kündigungsfrist, den nächsten gültigen Kündigungstag in Ihrem Vertrag und das Eingangsdatum ein. Erkundigen Sie sich bei jedem Termin bei Ihrem Vermieter oder Ihrer Mietervereinigung.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Der Planer wendet nur die von Ihnen angegebenen Daten und Zeiträume an. Es entscheidet nicht darüber, ob eine Mitteilung gültig ist, wann sie rechtmäßig eingeht oder ob ein besonderer Schutz gilt.","Contract notice period (months)":"Vertragskündigungsfrist (Monate)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Nächster gültiger Kündigungstag des Monats (ab Vertrag)","Expected receipt date":"Erwartetes Empfangsdatum","Your name":"Ihr Name","Your address":"Ihre Adresse","Landlord / agency":"Vermieter/Agentur","Recipient address":"Empfängeradresse","Rental property":"Mietobjekt","Place":"Ort","Letter date":"Briefdatum","Termination of tenancy":"Beendigung des Mietverhältnisses","Calculate date and draft letter":"Datum berechnen und Briefentwurf erstellen","Planning date":"Planungsdatum","Target date":"Zieldatum","Editable draft":"Bearbeitbarer Entwurf","Copy draft":"Entwurf kopieren","Enter your contract terms.":"Geben Sie Ihre Vertragsbedingungen ein.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Planungsentwurf bereit. Vergleichen Sie Ihren Vertrag.","Check the dates and period.":"Überprüfen Sie die Daten und den Zeitraum.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Das Ergebnis folgt dem angegebenen Vertragskündigungstag; es handelt sich nicht um eine gesetzliche Bekanntmachungsentscheidung.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Schweizer Immobiliengewinnszenario","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Schweizer Grundgewinnsteuer – Vom Benutzer eingegebenes Tarifszenario","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Schätzen Sie einen Immobiliengewinn anhand Ihrer eigenen Transaktionskosten und einem Steuersatz des zuständigen Kantons.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Geben Sie den Erlös, die Anschaffungskosten, die von Ihnen bestätigten anrechenbaren Ausgaben und einen effektiven Satz aus dem offiziellen kantonalen Rechner ein.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Die Schweizer Grundstückgewinnsteuer variiert je nach Kanton, Haltedauer, Abzügen und Fall. Dieses Tool liefert keine Tarife und ermittelt auch nicht die zulässigen Kosten.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Verkaufserlös (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Anschaffungskosten (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Weitere Kosten als zulässig bestätigt (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Effektiver Steuersatz aus offizieller Quelle (%)","Estimate scenario":"Schätzungsszenario","Illustrative scenario":"Anschauliches Szenario","Gain entered":"Gewinn eingegeben","Tax at entered rate":"Steuer zum eingegebenen Satz","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Geben Sie Zahlen aus Ihren Unterlagen und der Kantonsquelle ein.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Szenario berechnet; Überprüfen Sie dies beim Kanton.","Check amounts and rate.":"Beträge und Tarif prüfen.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Keine Kantonssteuertabelle eingebettet; Ihr eingegebener effektiver Zinssatz bestimmt die Schätzung.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Schweizer Erbschafts- und Schenkungssteuerszenario","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Schweizer Erbschafts- und Schenkungssteuer – Ihr Tarifszenario","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Schätzen Sie einen steuerpflichtigen Betrag anhand einer vom Benutzer eingegebenen Befreiung und eines Steuersatzes. Die Regeln variieren je nach Kanton und Verhältnis.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Geben Sie einen für den Empfänger und den Kanton bestätigten Betrag, Freibetrag und effektiven Steuersatz ein.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Kantonische Vorschriften und familiäre Beziehungen können Ausnahmen und Sätze ändern. Dieses Tool wählt keine Kantonsregel aus und bestimmt auch nicht die Steuerschuld.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Erbschafts- oder Schenkungsbetrag (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Befreiung mit Kanton bestätigt (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Mit Kanton bestätigter Effektivsatz (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Betrag nach eingegebener Befreiung","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Geben Sie für Ihren Fall bestätigte Zahlen ein.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Der Kostenvoranschlag verwendet nur die von Ihnen eingegebene Befreiung und Rate.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Schweizer Kindergeldbudget-Szenario","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Schweizer Unterhaltsbudget – Transparentes Haushaltsszenario","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Ein eingegebenes Kinderbudget nach dem Einkommen der Eltern nach einer eingegebenen Direktkostengutschrift zuordnen.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Verwenden Sie den dokumentierten monatlichen Bedarf des Kindes, das verfügbare monatliche Einkommen beider Elternteile und alle direkten Kosten, die Sie anrechnen möchten.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Dies ist nur ein Planungsarbeitsblatt. Es handelt sich nicht um einen schweizerischen Kindesunterhaltsanspruch oder um eine gesetzliche Methode; Wohnen, Pflege, Steuern, Sozialleistungen und Rechtsprechung werden nicht bewertet.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Von Ihnen dokumentiertes monatliches Kinderbudget (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Elternteil A verfügbares monatliches Einkommen (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Verfügbares monatliches Einkommen von Elternteil B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Von Elternteil A gezahlte direkte Kinderkosten an Gutschrift (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Szenario zuordnen","Illustrative allocation":"Veranschaulichende Zuordnung","Parent A remaining contribution":"Parent A verbleibender Beitrag","Parent B contribution":"Übergeordneter B-Beitrag","Entered monthly child budget":"Eingegebenes monatliches Kinderbudget","Enter your household budget figures.":"Geben Sie Ihre Haushaltsbudgetzahlen ein.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Budgetszenario berechnet; Besprechen Sie rechtliche Verpflichtungen mit einem qualifizierten Berater.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Beträge prüfen; Der Kredit darf das Budget nicht überschreiten.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Anteile sind proportional zu den beiden eingegebenen Einkommen; die direkte Kostengutschrift wird zunächst abgezogen.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Browser-Silbentrennungsvorschau","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Vorschau der Worttrennung – Browser-Sprachmuster","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Vorschau der Browser-Silbentrennung für den von Ihnen bereitgestellten Text; Die Unterstützung hängt vom Browser und den installierten Sprachressourcen ab.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Wählen Sie die Sprache, die zu Ihrem Text passt, geben Sie ein Beispiel ein und passen Sie die verfügbare Linienbreite an.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Verwendet die native CSS-Silbentrennung des Browsers. Es werden keine Wörterbücher gebündelt; Nicht unterstützte Browser zeigen möglicherweise keine Bindestriche an. Beim Kopieren des Textes bleibt die ursprüngliche Schreibweise erhalten.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Textsprache (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Vorschaubreite (Zeichen)","Text to preview":"Text zur Vorschau","Preview":"Vorschau","Enter text and choose its language.":"Geben Sie Text ein und wählen Sie die Sprache aus.","Preview updated.":"Vorschau aktualisiert.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Geben Sie ein unterstütztes Sprach-Tag und einen unterstützten Text ein.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Probieren Sie denselben Absatz mit unterschiedlichen Breiten aus, um zu sehen, wo der Browser Wörter umbrechen kann.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Privater Arbeitsbereich für die Rechtschreibprüfung","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Lokale Rechtschreibprüfung – Verwenden Sie Ihr Browser-Wörterbuch","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Bearbeiten Sie Text mit der nativen Rechtschreibprüfung des Browsers, wählen Sie eine Sprache und kopieren Sie den korrigierten Text.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Text bleibt auf dieser Seite. Legen Sie eine Sprache fest, für die Ihr Browser über ein Rechtschreibwörterbuch verfügt, und verwenden Sie dann das Rechtschreibmenü oder Unterstreichungsvorschläge.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Dieser Arbeitsbereich lädt keinen Text hoch und versendet keine Wörterbücher. Die Verfügbarkeit und Vorschläge der Browser-Rechtschreibprüfung hängen vom Gerät, Browser und installierten Wörterbuch ab.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Rechtschreibprüfungssprache (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Zu prüfender Text","Copy text":"Text kopieren","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Text eingeben oder einfügen. Klicken Sie mit der rechten Maustaste oder verwenden Sie das Rechtschreibmenü Ihres Geräts, um Vorschläge zu erhalten.","Text copied.":"Text kopiert.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Konnte nicht automatisch kopiert werden; Wählen Sie den Text aus und kopieren Sie ihn.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Ein Browser ohne passendes Wörterbuch markiert möglicherweise keine Rechtschreibfehler.","Resume Structure Checker":"Überprüfung der Lebenslaufstruktur","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Resume Checker – Kostenlose lokale PDF- und DOCX-Überprüfung","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Überprüfen Sie Lebenslauftext, Überschriften, Abschnitte, Links und Aufzählungszeichenstruktur in Ihrem Browser. Vergleichen Sie die Begriffe der Stellenbeschreibung nach Anzahl; Keine Einstellungsbewertung oder Upload.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Überprüfen Sie, was ein textbasierter Lebenslauf tatsächlich zeigt: extrahierter Text, Überschriftenstruktur, Präsenz im Kontaktfeld, Links und allgemein bekannte Abschnitte. Vergleichen Sie optional wiederholte Begriffe in der Stellenbeschreibung.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"Ein DOCX mit Überschriften-1-Stilen für Erfahrung und Bildung zeigt diese Überschriften an. Ein PDF wird anhand seines auswählbaren Textes überprüft; Spalten können in einer anderen Reihenfolge gelesen werden.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX-Dateien werden lokal als Office ZIP/XML geprüft. PDFs werden mit einer verzögerten lokalen PDF.js-Engine gelesen. Der optionale Stellenbeschreibungsvergleich zählt ausgewählte Begriffe in jedem Text; Es wird weder eine Bewertung erstellt noch empfohlen, ob jemand eingestellt werden soll.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Dies ist eine Format- und Textstrukturprüfung, kein ATS-Simulator, keine rechtliche Überprüfung oder Vorhersage des Interviewerfolgs. Gescannte PDFs ohne auswählbaren Text benötigen zunächst OCR. Passwortgeschützte, makrofähige, signierte oder ungewöhnlich große Dokumente werden nicht unterstützt.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Wählen Sie einen Lebenslauf (PDF oder DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Ihre Dateien bleiben in diesem Browser und werden nicht hochgeladen. Maximal 20 MB; PDF bis zu 50 Seiten. Erweiterter DOCX-Inhalt ist auf 80 MB begrenzt.","Optional job description":"Optionale Stellenbeschreibung","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Fügen Sie einfachen Text ein, wenn Sie einen Begriff-Häufigkeits-Vergleich wünschen. Geben Sie keine sensiblen Informationen an, die nicht analysiert werden müssen.","Paste job-description text here…":"Stellenbeschreibungstext hier einfügen…","Analyze locally":"Lokal analysieren","Clear files and report":"Dateien löschen und Bericht erstatten","Resume review":"Überprüfung des Lebenslaufs","File type":"Dateityp","Extracted characters":"Extrahierte Zeichen","Words counted":"Wörter gezählt","Detected headings":"Erkannte Überschriften","Recognized sections":"Erkannte Abschnitte","Hyperlinks found":"Hyperlinks gefunden","Bullet paragraphs":"Absätze mit Aufzählungszeichen","An email address appears in the text":"Eine E-Mail-Adresse erscheint im Text","No email address pattern was detected":"Es wurde kein E-Mail-Adressmuster erkannt","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Im Text erscheint ein Muster, das einer Telefonnummer ähnelt","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Es wurde kein telefonnummernähnliches Muster erkannt","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Stellenbeschreibungsbedingungen (nur Zählungen)","Term":"Begriff","In job text":"Im Jobtext","In resume":"Im Lebenslauf","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Fügen Sie eine Stellenbeschreibung ein, um die Anzahl der Begriffe zu vergleichen.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Es wurden keine klaren Überschriftenstile erkannt. PDF-Überschriften werden anhand der Textgröße geschätzt und können ungenau sein.","Detected":"Erkannt","Not detected":"Nicht erkannt","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Diese Heuristik erkennt eine begrenzte Anzahl allgemeiner Abschnittsnamen; Es wird nicht entschieden, welche Abschnitte erforderlich sind.","Profile / summary":"Profil/Zusammenfassung","Experience":"Erfahrung","Education":"Bildung","Skills":"Fähigkeiten","Contact":"Kontakt","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Es wurde kein auswählbarer Text gefunden. Nur gescannte PDFs benötigen OCR, bevor sie überprüft werden können.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Wählen Sie zunächst einen Lebenslauf im PDF- oder DOCX-Format.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Die ausgewählte Datei wird lokal gelesen…","Local structure review complete.":"Überprüfung der lokalen Struktur abgeschlossen.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Dieser Browser unterstützt eine erforderliche lokale Dokumentfunktion nicht.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Wählen Sie eine gültige PDF- oder moderne DOCX-Datei bis zu den angegebenen lokalen Grenzwerten.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"Das PDF konnte nicht gelesen werden. Es kann beschädigt oder verschlüsselt sein oder keinen auswählbaren Text enthalten.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Das DOCX-Paket konnte nicht sicher geöffnet oder gelesen werden.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Ladet oder speichert dieses Tool meinen Lebenslauf?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Nr. Parsing und Analyse laufen in Ihrem Browser. Der Dateitext wird nicht an einen Server gesendet oder beibehalten, nachdem Sie den Bericht gelöscht oder die Seite verlassen haben.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Wird vorhergesagt, ob ein ATS oder Arbeitgeber meinen Lebenslauf akzeptieren wird?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Nr. Es prüft nur lesbaren Text und einfache Struktur. Die Einstellungssysteme unterscheiden sich, und dies ist keine ATS-Kompatibilitätsgarantie oder Einstellungsvorhersage.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Kann es ein gescanntes PDF lesen?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Nur wenn das PDF eine auswählbare Textebene hat. Dieser Prüfer lädt keine OCR-Modelle herunter; Verwenden Sie zunächst ein OCR-Tool für ein gescanntes Nur-Bild-Dokument.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Was bedeutet der Stellenbeschreibungsvergleich?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Es zeigt die Anzahl wiederkehrender Begriffe nach einfacher Normalisierung an. Es handelt sich hierbei nicht um eine Übereinstimmungsquote, ein Ranking, eine Empfehlung oder eine Bewertung Ihrer Qualifikationen.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Warum zeigt ein PDF weniger Überschriften als ein DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDFs behalten normalerweise keine semantischen Überschriftenstile bei. Der Prüfer schätzt markante Zeilen anhand der Textgröße und der Lesereihenfolge, sodass Spalten und visuelle Gestaltung das Ergebnis beeinflussen können.","How local resume review works":"So funktioniert die lokale Lebenslaufüberprüfung","Resume checker questions":"Fragen zur Lebenslaufprüfung","Scope and limitations":"Umfang und Einschränkungen","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Lokaler Gesangs- und Begleitungstrenner","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Vocal Remover – Gesang und Begleitung lokal trennen","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Teilen Sie in Ihrem Browser ein kurzes Stereo-Audiobeispiel in geschätzten Gesang und Begleitung auf. Audio bleibt auf Ihrem Gerät; Das Modell wird von seinem öffentlichen Host heruntergeladen.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Wählen Sie einen Stereo-Musikclip mit einer Länge von bis zu 30 Sekunden. Bei der ersten Verwendung lädt der Browser ein 35,6 MB großes Modell herunter. Die Audiodatei wird auf diesem Gerät verarbeitet und nie hochgeladen.","What you get":"Was Sie erhalten","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Zwei WAV-Stems in der Vorschau ansehen und herunterladen: geschätzter Gesang und die restliche Begleitung. Die Ergebnisse hängen von der Mischung ab und können Artefakte enthalten.","Local processing":"Lokale Verarbeitung","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Das Tool verwendet das Open-Unmix UMX-HQ-Gesangsnetzwerk, das nach ONNX und ONNX Runtime Web exportiert wird. Das Modell wird nur abgerufen, wenn Sie auf „Trennen“ klicken. Es wird keine kostenpflichtige Inferenz-API oder ein Abonnement verwendet. Audio wird lokal dekodiert, verarbeitet und exportiert.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Dies ist eine Schätzung für Stereoverarbeitung mit 44,1 kHz und Clips mit einer Länge von bis zu 30 Sekunden. Monoquellen werden in Stereo dupliziert. Tief in Instrumente eingemischter Gesang, starke Effekte, Live-Aufnahmen und ungewöhnliche Genres können zu Lecks oder Artefakten führen. Verwenden Sie das Ergebnis nicht als sauberen Master. Für den Modell-Download ist eine Internetverbindung erforderlich. Audio verlässt dieses Gerät nicht.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Ist mein Audio hochgeladen?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Nr. Das ausgewählte Audio wird in Ihrem Browser dekodiert und verarbeitet. Die einzige Netzwerkanforderung ist der Modell-Download, wenn Sie mit der Trennung beginnen.","Why is the first run slow?":"Warum ist der erste Lauf langsam?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Der Browser lädt einmal ein 35,6-MB-Modell herunter; Der Browser kann es zwischenspeichern. Inference wird dann lokal auf der Geräte-CPU ausgeführt.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Wird jedes Lied sauber getrennt?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Nr. Das Modell schätzt einen Stimmstamm und kann Stimmverluste hinterlassen, Instrumentenobertöne entfernen oder Artefakte erzeugen. Hören Sie zu, bevor Sie sich auf einen Stamm verlassen.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Stereo-Audiodatei (bis zu 30 Sekunden)","Choose audio":"Audio auswählen","Separate vocals":"Separater Gesang","Cancel / clear":"Abbrechen/Löschen","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Wählen Sie zunächst eine kurze Audiodatei.","Downloading the separation model…":"Das Trennungsmodell wird heruntergeladen…","Separating locally…":"Lokale Trennung…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Trennung abgeschlossen. Sehen Sie sich einen der Stems in der Vorschau an oder laden Sie ihn herunter.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Diese Datei konnte nicht verarbeitet oder das Modell geladen werden. Überprüfen Sie das Format und die Verbindung und versuchen Sie es dann erneut.","Model and weight license information":"Modell- und Gewichtslizenzinformationen","Estimated vocals":"Geschätzter Gesang","Estimated accompaniment":"Geschätzte Begleitung","Download WAV":"WAV herunterladen","Progress":"Fortschritt","Preparing local separation…":"Lokale Trennung wird vorbereitet…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Trennung abgeschlossen. Der Ton blieb auf diesem Gerät.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Dieses Audio konnte nicht verarbeitet werden. Probieren Sie eine Stereomusikdatei mit einer Länge von weniger als 30 Sekunden aus.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Selbstbehaltvergleich der Schweizer Krankenversicherung","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Franchise-Rechner der Schweizer Krankenversicherung – Vergleichen Sie die jährlichen Kosten","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Vergleichen Sie die Selbstbehalte der Schweizer Grundversicherung anhand der von Ihnen eingegebenen Prämien und anrechenbaren jährlichen medizinischen Kosten. Es wird kein Angebot des Versicherers erraten.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Geben Sie die monatlichen Prämien desselben Versicherers für jeden von ihm angebotenen Selbstbehalt ein und vergleichen Sie dann die Szenarien mit niedrigen, erwarteten und hohen jährlichen Behandlungskosten.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"In der obligatorischen Schweizer Grundkrankenversicherung beträgt die Standardfranchise für Erwachsene 300 CHF und die Kinderfranchise 0 CHF. Die optionalen Stufen unterscheiden sich je nach Altersgruppe. Nach Abzug der Selbstbeteiligung beträgt der Selbstbehalt pauschal 10 % der anrechenbaren Restkosten, maximal jedoch 700 CHF pro Jahr für Erwachsene und 350 CHF für Kinder. Das Tool addiert Ihre eingegebene Prämie zu dieser modellierten Kostenbeteiligung; Es ruft weder die Versicherungstarife ab noch entscheidet es, welche Option für Sie die richtige ist.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Wenn ein Erwachsener eine monatliche Prämie von 400 CHF bei einem Selbstbehalt von 300 CHF und 350 CHF bei einem Selbstbehalt von 2.500 CHF eintritt, beträgt die jährliche Prämiendifferenz 600 CHF. Vergleichen Sie diese Ersparnis mit der modellierten Differenz in der Kostenbeteiligung bei jedem Ihrer niedrigen, erwarteten und hohen erstattungsfähigen Kostenbeträge.","How the estimate works":"So funktioniert die Schätzung","Common questions":"Häufige Fragen","Scope and exclusions":"Geltungsbereich und Ausschlüsse","Where do I get the premiums?":"Wo erhalte ich die Prämien?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Nutzen Sie aktuelle Monatsangebote für denselben Versicherer, dieselbe Prämienregion, dieselbe Altersgruppe, denselben Unfallschutz und dasselbe Versicherungsmodell. Priminfo ist die offizielle Vergleichsseite des Bundes. Auf dieser Seite werden keine Kostenvoranschläge von Versicherern abgerufen oder reproduziert.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Werden immer alle aufgeführten Selbstbehaltsstufen angeboten?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Nr. Versicherer müssen nicht alle optionalen Stufen anbieten und die Angebote können für junge Erwachsene unterschiedlich sein. Geben Sie nur die für Ihre eigene Police angezeigten Prämien ein; Lassen Sie nicht verfügbare Optionen leer.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Wird hier meine vollständige Arztrechnung angezeigt?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Nr. Das Modell deckt den normalen Selbstbehalt und den standardmäßigen Selbstbehalt von 10 % auf förderfähige Kosten ab. Davon ausgenommen sind Krankenhaustagebeiträge, ein besonderer Selbstbehalt von 40 % für Medikamente, befreite Leistungen, nicht abgedeckte Pflege und Zusatzversicherungen.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Dies ist ein Szenariovergleich, keine Versicherungs-, medizinische oder finanzielle Beratung. Es gibt keine Vorhersage über Ihre Behandlung oder Prämien. Ausgenommen sind Spitaltagsbeiträge (in der Regel CHF 15.– pro Stationstag, mit gesetzlichen Ausnahmen), der spezielle Selbstbehalt von 40 % auf bestimmte Medikamente, Mutterschafts-/Vorsorgebefreiungen, Leistungen ausserhalb der Pflichtversicherung, Prämienzuschüsse und Zusatzversicherungen. Die tatsächliche Zuzahlung kann daher abweichen. Ein höherer Selbstbehalt bedeutet, dass Sie in der Lage sein müssen, mehr im Voraus zu bezahlen, wenn Sie Pflegeleistungen in Anspruch nehmen.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Wer ist im Rahmen dieser Police versichert?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Erwachsener (ab 19 Jahren)","Child (under 18)":"Kind (unter 18)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Szenario mit niedrigen jährlichen erstattungsfähigen Behandlungskosten (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Erwartete jährliche erstattungsfähige Behandlungskosten (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Szenario mit hohen jährlichen erstattungsfähigen Behandlungskosten (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Monatliche Prämien von einem Versicherer","Monthly premium":"Monatliche Prämie","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Geben Sie nur die Optionen ein, die für dieselbe Richtlinie angeboten werden. Lassen Sie andere leer.","Adult deductible choices":"Optionen zur Selbstbeteiligung für Erwachsene","Child deductible choices":"Optionen zur Selbstbeteiligung bei Kindern","Compare annual costs":"Jahreskosten vergleichen","Clear entries":"Einträge löschen","Download CSV":"CSV herunterladen","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Geschätzte jährliche Prämie plus Kostenbeteiligung","Deductible":"Selbstbehalt","Annual premiums":"Jährliche Prämien","Total at low costs":"Insgesamt zu geringen Kosten","Total at expected costs":"Gesamt zu erwarteten Kosten","Total at high costs":"Insgesamt zu hohen Kosten","Cost sharing at low costs":"Kostenbeteiligung zu geringen Kosten","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Kostenbeteiligung zu erwarteten Kosten","Cost sharing at high costs":"Kostenbeteiligung bei hohen Kosten","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Differenz zum niedrigsten verfügbaren Selbstbehalt","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Medizinische Kosten, bei denen die Prämieneinsparung aufgebraucht ist","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Die eingegebene Prämienersparnis wird innerhalb des modellierten Kostenbeteiligungsbereichs nicht storniert.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Keine Prämienersparnis gegenüber der niedrigsten Selbstbeteiligung.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Niedrigste erwartete Summe unter den eingegebenen Optionen","Scenario details":"Szenariodetails","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Geben Sie drei bestellte Krankheitskostenszenarien und monatliche Prämien für mindestens zwei verfügbare Selbstbehalte ein.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Offizielle Regeln und aktuelle Prämien:","Federal deductible rules":"Bundesrechtliche Selbstbehaltsregeln","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo offizieller Premium-Vergleich","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"In diesem Browser berechneter Vergleich.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Überprüfen Sie die Altersgruppe, bestellte Kostenszenarien und mindestens zwei Monatsbeiträge.","Entries cleared.":"Einträge gelöscht.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV lokal heruntergeladen.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Swiss Health Prämienreduktionsrechner","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Swiss Premium Subventionsrechner – Ihre Nettoprämie","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Berechnen Sie die Nettoprämie der Schweizer Krankenversicherung aus der aktuellen Prämie und einer bereits von Ihrem Kanton gewährten monatlichen Reduktion.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Geben Sie die Prämie und die bestätigte monatliche Reduktion Ihres Versicherers oder Ihres kantonalen Entscheids ein. Dieses Tool entscheidet nicht darüber, ob Sie qualifiziert sind.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Die Schweizer Kantone bestimmen, wer Anspruch hat, wie viel Unterstützung gewährt wird und ob ein Antrag erforderlich ist. Dieser Rechner zieht lediglich eine bestätigte monatliche Reduzierung von einer Versicherungsprämie ab und zeigt den Jahresbetrag an.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Wenn die monatliche Prämie CHF 420 beträgt und die bestätigte Reduktion CHF 120 beträgt, beträgt die geschätzte Nettoprämie CHF 300 pro Monat.","How the calculation works":"So funktioniert die Berechnung","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Sag mir das, ob ich qualifiziert bin?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Nr. Über Förderfähigkeit und Förderhöhe entscheidet der Wohnkanton. Nutzen Sie die verlinkten offiziellen Informationen oder wenden Sie sich an die kantonale Stelle.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Wo finde ich den Ermäßigungsbetrag?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Nutzen Sie den aktuellen Bescheid oder die von Ihrem Versicherer ausgewiesene reduzierte Prämie. Einige Kantone gewähren automatisch Ermäßigungen; andere erfordern eine Bewerbung.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Dies ist eine Berechnung für eine Police, keine Anspruchs- oder Leistungsentscheidung. Es werden weder Haushaltseinkommen, Vermögen, Familienstand, Fristen, kantonale Schwellenwerte noch Antragsrechte berechnet. Prämien und Auszeichnungen können sich ändern; Lassen Sie sich diese von Ihrem Versicherer und Ihrem Kanton bestätigen.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Aktuelle monatliche Prämie (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Monatsrabatt bereits gewährt (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Geben Sie einen vom Kanton oder Versicherer bestätigten Betrag ein; Verwenden Sie einen Kostenvoranschlag nicht als Auszeichnung.","Calculate net premium":"Nettoprämie berechnen","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Geben Sie die aktuelle Prämie und die bestätigte Ermäßigung ein.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Geschätzte Prämie nach Reduzierung","Current monthly premium":"Aktuelle monatliche Prämie","Monthly reduction":"Monatliche Reduzierung","Estimated net monthly premium":"Geschätzte monatliche Nettoprämie","Reduction over 12 months":"Reduzierung über 12 Monate","Reduction as a share of premium":"Reduzierung als Prämienanteil","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Berechnung abgeschlossen. Bestätigen Sie den Zuschlag und die Gültigkeitsdaten mit Ihrem Kanton und Ihrem Versicherer.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Stellen Sie sicher, dass die Ermäßigung nicht höher ist als die monatliche Prämie.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Szenario-Rechner für Referenzzinssätze in der Schweiz","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Schweizer Mietanpassungsrechner – Referenzsatz-Szenario","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Schätzen Sie nur, wie sich eine Änderung des Schweizer Hypothekenreferenzzinssatzes auf die Nettomiete für Wohnimmobilien auswirkt. Nutzen Sie den aktuellen Tarif des Bundeswohnungsamtes.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Vergleichen Sie den in Ihrem Mietvertrag oder der letzten Mietanzeige angegebenen Referenzzinssatz mit dem aktuellen offiziellen Schweizer Tarif. Die Berechnung bleibt auf Ihrem Gerät.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Das Bundesamt für Wohnungswesen veröffentlicht vierteljährlich einen Hypotheken-Referenzzinssatz für Schweizer Mietanpassungen. Eine Erhöhung um 0,25 Prozentpunkte kann grundsätzlich eine Mieterhöhung von 3 % ermöglichen; Eine Reduzierung um 0,25 Punkte kann grundsätzlich eine Reduzierung um 2,91 % ermöglichen. Dieses Szenario wendet diese Änderungen Schritt für Schritt auf die von Ihnen eingegebene Nettomiete an.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Bei einer monatlichen Nettomiete von CHF 3.000 ergibt eine Senkung des Referenzzinssatzes von 1,75 % auf 1,50 % eine geschätzte rein referenzzinssatzbedingte Änderung von etwa −CHF 87,38 pro Monat (−2,91 %).","How this estimate works":"So funktioniert diese Schätzung","Where do I find the current rate?":"Wo finde ich den aktuellen Tarif?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Öffnen Sie die verlinkte Seite des Bundesamtes für Wohnungswesen und geben Sie den aktuell veröffentlichten Tarif ein. Das Tool bettet keinen Tarif ein, der veraltet sein könnte.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Entscheidet dies darüber, ob ich eine Mietänderung beantragen kann?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Nein. Es isoliert einen Faktor zur Orientierung. Ihr Vertrag, Inflation, Kostenänderungen, Reservierungen und andere rechtliche Bedingungen können das Ergebnis verändern.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Beinhaltet das Ergebnis Nebenkosten?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Nr. Geben Sie die monatliche Nettomiete ohne Nebenkosten und sonstige variable Kosten ein.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Das Ergebnis ist ein illustratives Referenzzinsszenario, kein Rechtsgutachten oder eine vollständige Mietbewertung. Ausgenommen sind Inflation, allgemeine Kostenänderungen, Verbesserungen, Vertragsvorbehalte, indexierte oder gestaffelte Mieten, Kündigungstermine und kantonale Verfahren. Überprüfen Sie Ihren Mietvertrag und die offiziellen Richtlinien, bevor Sie handeln.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Schweizer Wohnraummietverträge: Nur eine Schätzung des Hypothekenreferenzzinseffekts. Es handelt sich nicht um eine gerichtliche Entscheidung oder eine vollständige Mietpreisüberprüfung.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Aktuelle monatliche Nettomiete (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"In Ihrem Mietvertrag oder Ihrer letzten Mietanzeige angegebener Referenzzinssatz (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Aktueller offizieller Schweizer Referenzzinssatz (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Referenzkursszenario berechnen","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Nur-Referenzzins-Szenario","Current monthly net rent":"Aktuelle monatliche Nettomiete","Reference-rate change":"Änderung des Referenzzinssatzes","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Geschätzter monatlicher Effekt aus dem Referenzsatz","Scenario monthly net rent":"Szenario monatliche Nettomiete","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Annualisierter Effekt für 12 Monate zum gleichen Satz","potential increase":"potenzielle Erhöhung","potential decrease":"potenzielle Verringerung","no reference-rate change":"keine Änderung des Referenzzinssatzes","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Die Schätzung wendet 3 % für jede Erhöhung um 0,25 Prozentpunkte und die entsprechende umgekehrte Reduzierung für jede Verringerung an. Andere Faktoren können das Ergebnis verändern.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Dies gilt nicht für Inflation, allgemeine Kostenänderungen, Verbesserungen, Vertragsreservierungen, indexierte oder gestaffelte Mieten, Kündigungstermine oder lokale Verfahrensanforderungen. Überprüfen Sie Ihren Mietvertrag und lassen Sie sich vom Bundesamt für Wohnungswesen beraten.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Überprüfen Sie den neuesten offiziellen Tarif und die neuesten Richtlinien","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Bundesamt für Wohnungswesen (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Geben Sie die Miete und beide Sätze ein, um ein Szenario anzuzeigen.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Szenario berechnet. Überprüfen Sie die Termine und Vertragsbedingungen, bevor Sie sich darauf verlassen.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Überprüfen Sie die Beträge und Tarife. Die Sätze müssen zwischen 0 % und 5 % liegen und sich in 0,25-Punkte-Schritten unterscheiden.","Inputs cleared.":"Eingaben gelöscht.","Result":"Ergebnis","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Schätzer für Urlaubsrückstellungen in der Schweiz","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Schweizer Urlaubsrückstellungsrechner – Anteiliger Urlaubssaldo","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Schätzen Sie den Urlaubssaldo in der Schweiz anhand des Jahresurlaubs in Ihrem Vertrag, der Arbeitswoche, den Anstellungsterminen und den bereits genommenen Tagen.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Schätzen Sie den anteiligen bezahlten Urlaub für ein Kalenderjahr anhand des von Ihnen eingegebenen Anspruchs und Arbeitszeitplans. Es werden keine Vertragsbedingungen vermutet.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Der Schätzer rechnet die Jahresurlaubstage in Ihrem Vertrag anteilig anhand der im ausgewählten Jahr beschäftigten Kalendertage um. Geben Sie bei einer Teilzeitbeschäftigung Ihre üblichen Arbeitstage pro Woche und den Jahresurlaub in Wochen ein.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Bei vier Wochen Urlaub, einer fünftägigen Arbeitswoche und ganzjähriger Beschäftigung beträgt der jährliche Anspruch 20 Arbeitstage abzüglich bereits genommenem Urlaub.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Was ist das gesetzliche Minimum in der Schweiz?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Bundesrichtlinien sehen mindestens vier Wochen pro Dienstjahr und fünf Wochen für Arbeitnehmer vor, die das 20. Lebensjahr noch nicht erreicht haben. Ein Vertrag oder eine Tarifvereinbarung kann mehr vorsehen.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Entscheidet dies über mein rechtliches Gleichgewicht?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Nr. Es handelt sich um eine einfache kalendertägige Aufteilung. Vertragsbedingungen, geltende Tarifbestimmungen, qualifizierende Abwesenheiten, Rundungen und Arbeitgeberunterlagen können den Saldo verändern.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Dieser Kostenvoranschlag entscheidet nicht über den Rechtsanspruch oder berechnet das Urlaubsgeld. Ausgenommen sind Kürzungen bei bestimmten längeren Abwesenheiten, vertragsspezifischen Abgrenzungs- und Rundungsregeln, gesetzlichen Feiertagen, Überstunden, Übertragungsfristen und Streitigkeiten. Überprüfen Sie Ihren Vertrag und lassen Sie sich bei einem strittigen Saldo beraten.","Leave year":"Abgangsjahr","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Jahresurlaub in Ihrem Vertrag (Wochen)","Usual working days per week":"Übliche Arbeitstage pro Woche","Employment start date":"Beschäftigungsdatum","Employment end date":"Enddatum des Beschäftigungsverhältnisses","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"In diesem Urlaubsjahr bereits in Anspruch genommene Urlaubstage","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Nur zur Orientierung. Geben Sie den vertraglichen Jahresanspruch ein; das gesetzliche Minimum beträgt in der Regel vier Wochen bzw. fünf Wochen für Arbeitnehmer unter 20 Jahren.","Estimate balance":"Guthaben schätzen","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Geben Sie Ihren Vertrag und die Daten ein, um den Saldo zu schätzen.","Estimated leave balance":"Geschätzter Urlaubssaldo","Annual leave at this schedule":"Jahresurlaub nach diesem Zeitplan","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"In diesem Urlaubsjahr beschäftigte Kalendertage","Prorated days accrued":"Anteilige Tage aufgelaufen","Days already taken":"Bereits in Anspruch genommene Tage","Estimated days remaining":"Geschätzte verbleibende Tage","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Dadurch wird der Jahresurlaub anteilig nach Kalendertagen im Beschäftigungszeitraum aufgeteilt. Arbeitgeber- und Vertragsregeln können unterschiedlich sein.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Schätzung berechnet. Vergleichen Sie es mit Ihrem Vertrag und Ihren Arbeitgeberunterlagen.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Überprüfen Sie das Jahr, die Daten, den Arbeitsplan und die Werte."},"ja":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"スイスの失業手当のシナリオ","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"スイスの失業給付計算ツール — 全体的なシナリオ","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"基金によって確認された保険付き給与とレートを使用して、スイスの総日当を見積もってください。","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"失業基金によって確認された被保険者の給与と 70% または 80% の率を入力します。","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"スイスの規則により、手当率と給与の上限が設定されています。基金が資格、控除、待機日数、権利を決定します。月次範囲は、支払われる平日の 20 ～ 23 日を反映しています。","Example":"例","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"70% で 5,000 スイスフランは、支払可能な平日あたり約 161.29 スイスフランです。","How it works":"仕組み","Questions":"質問","Scope and limits":"範囲と制限","Related tools":"関連ツール","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"毎月の被保険者給与 (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"ファンドによりレートが確認されました","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"見積もり","Clear":"クリア","Gross scenario":"全体的なシナリオ","Insured salary used":"使用された保険付き給与","Per payable weekday":"支払い可能な平日ごと","20-day month":"20 日の月","23-day month":"23 日制の月","Official benefit rules":"公式特典ルール","Enter your confirmed figures.":"確認された数値を入力してください。","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"シナリオが計算されました。ファンドに金額を確認してください。","Check the values.":"値を確認してください。","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"スイスの賃貸契約通知プランナー","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"スイスのレンタル通知プランナーとレタードラフト","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"独自の契約の日付と条件に基づいてテナント通知を計画します。州の規則を前提とせずに手紙の草案を作成する。","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"通知期間、契約の次の有効な終了日、および受領日を入力します。すべての日付を家主またはテナント協会に確認してください。","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"プランナーは、指定された日付と期間のみを適用します。通知が有効かどうか、いつ合法的に受け取られるか、または特別な保護が適用されるかどうかは決定されません。","Contract notice period (months)":"契約通知期間 (月)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"次の有効な終了日 (契約から)","Expected receipt date":"受取予定日","Your name":"あなたの名前","Your address":"あなたの住所","Landlord / agency":"家主 / 代理店","Recipient address":"受信者のアドレス","Rental property":"賃貸物件","Place":"場所","Letter date":"手紙の日付","Termination of tenancy":"テナント契約の終了","Calculate date and draft letter":"日付とレターの下書きを計算します","Planning date":"計画日","Target date":"目標日","Editable draft":"編集可能なドラフト","Copy draft":"下書きをコピー","Enter your contract terms.":"契約条件を入力してください。","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"計画草案の準備ができました。契約書と照らし合わせて確認してください。","Check the dates and period.":"日付と期間を確認してください。","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"結果は、指定された契約通知日に続きます。それは法定通知による決定ではありません。","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"スイスの不動産獲得シナリオ","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"スイスの不動産利得税 - ユーザー入力の税率シナリオ","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"独自の取引コストと担当州の税率を使用して不動産利益を見積もります。","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"収益、取得コスト、確認した対象経費、および州の公式計算機からの実効税率を入力します。","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"スイスの不動産利得税は、州、保有期間、控除、ケースによって異なります。このツールは料金を提供したり、許容コストを決定したりするものではありません。","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"売上金 (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"取得コスト (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"許容できることが確認されたその他の費用 (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"公式情報源からの実効税率 (%)","Estimate scenario":"シナリオの見積もり","Illustrative scenario":"例示的なシナリオ","Gain entered":"ゲインを入力しました","Tax at entered rate":"入力された税率による税金","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"記録と州の情報源から数字を入力してください。","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"シナリオが計算されました。州に確認してください。","Check amounts and rate.":"金額とレートを確認してください。","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"カントン税表は埋め込まれていません。入力した実効レートによって推定値が決まります。","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"スイスの相続税と贈与税のシナリオ","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"スイスの相続税と贈与税 — 税率シナリオ","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"ユーザーが入力した控除と税率から課税対象額を推定します。ルールは州や関係によって異なります。","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"受取人および州について確認された金額、免除および実効税率を入力します。","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"カントンの規則や家族関係によって、免除や税率が変更される場合があります。このツールは、カントンのルールを選択したり、納税額を決定したりするものではありません。","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"相続または贈与の金額 (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"州 (CHF) により免除が確認されました","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"州で確認された有効率 (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"入力された免除後の金額","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"あなたのケースで確認された数字を入力してください。","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"見積もりでは、入力した免除と税率のみが使用されます。","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"スイスの養育費予算シナリオ","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"スイスの養育費予算 — 透明性のある世帯シナリオ","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"入力された直接費クレジット後の親の収入によって、入力された子予算を割り当てます。","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"文書化された子供の月々のニーズ、両親の利用可能な月収、クレジットしたい直接費用を使用します。","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"これは計画ワークシートのみです。これはスイスの養育費の補償や法的な方法ではありません。住宅、介護、税金、福利厚生、判例法は評価されません。","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"文書化した子供の月次予算 (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"親 A の利用可能な月収 (スイスフラン)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"親 B の利用可能な月収 (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"子供の費用は親 A がクレジット (CHF) で直接支払った","Allocate scenario":"シナリオの割り当て","Illustrative allocation":"割り当ての例","Parent A remaining contribution":"親 A の残りの貢献","Parent B contribution":"親 B の貢献","Entered monthly child budget":"子供の月次予算を入力しました","Enter your household budget figures.":"家計の数字を入力してください。","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"予算シナリオを計算しました。法的義務については資格のあるアドバイザーと話し合ってください。","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"金額を確認してください。クレジットは予算を超えることはできません。","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"株式は入力された 2 つの収入に比例します。直接コストのクレジットが最初に差し引かれます。","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"ブラウザのハイフネーション プレビュー","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"単語のハイフネーション プレビュー — ブラウザ言語パターン","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"指定したテキストのブラウザーのハイフネーションをプレビューします。サポートはブラウザとインストールされている言語リソースによって異なります。","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"テキストに一致する言語を選択し、サンプルを入力して、使用可能な線幅を調整します。","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"ブラウザのネイティブ CSS ハイフネーションを使用します。辞書はバンドルされません。サポートされていないブラウザではハイフンが表示されない場合があります。テキストをコピーすると、元のスペルが保持されます。","Text language (BCP 47)":"テキスト言語 (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"プレビュー幅 (文字数)","Text to preview":"プレビューするテキスト","Preview":"プレビュー","Enter text and choose its language.":"テキストを入力し、言語を選択します。","Preview updated.":"プレビューが更新されました。","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"サポートされている言語タグとテキストを入力してください。","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"同じ段落を異なる幅で試して、ブラウザが単語を区切る場所を確認します。","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"プライベート スペルチェック ワークスペース","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"ローカル スペル チェッカー — ブラウザ辞書を使用する","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"ブラウザのネイティブ スペルチェックでテキストを編集し、言語を選択して、修正したテキストをコピーします。","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"テキストはこのページに残ります。ブラウザにあるスペル辞書の言語を設定し、スペル メニューを使用するか、候補に下線を付けます。","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"このワークスペースはテキストをアップロードしたり、辞書を配布したりしません。ブラウザーのスペルチェックの可用性と提案は、デバイス、ブラウザー、およびインストールされている辞書によって異なります。","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"スペルチェック言語 (BCP 47)","Text to check":"チェックするテキスト","Copy text":"テキストをコピー","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"テキストを入力または貼り付けます。右クリックするか、デバイスのスペル メニューを使用して候補を表示します。","Text copied.":"テキストがコピーされました。","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"自動的にコピーできませんでした。テキストを選択してコピーします。","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"一致する辞書がないブラウザでは、スペルミスがマークされない可能性があります。","Resume Structure Checker":"構造チェッカーを再開","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS 履歴書チェッカー — 無料のローカル PDF および DOCX レビュー","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"ブラウザで履歴書のテキスト、見出し、セクション、リンク、箇条書きの構造を確認してください。職務内容の用語を数で比較します。採用スコアやアップロードはありません。","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"抽出されたテキスト、見出しの構造、連絡先フィールドの存在、リンク、一般的に認識されているセクションなど、テキストベースの履歴書が実際に明らかにするものを確認してください。必要に応じて、繰り返された職務記述用語を比較します。","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"経験と教育用の見出し 1 スタイルを持つ DOCX には、これらの見出しが表示されます。 PDF は選択可能なテキストからチェックされます。列は異なる順序で読み取られる場合があります。","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX ファイルは Office ZIP/XML としてローカルで検査されます。 PDF は、据え置きのローカル PDF.js エンジンを使用して読み取られます。オプションの職務内容の比較では、各テキストで選択された用語をカウントします。スコアを作成したり、誰かを雇用するかどうかを推奨したりするものではありません。","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"これは形式とテキスト構造のチェックであり、ATS シミュレーター、法的レビュー、または面接の成功の予測ではありません。選択可能なテキストのないスキャンされた PDF には、最初に OCR が必要です。パスワードで保護されているドキュメント、マクロが有効になっているドキュメント、署名されたドキュメント、または異常に大きいドキュメントはサポートされていません。","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"履歴書を選択してください (PDF または DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"あなたのファイルはこのブラウザに残り、アップロードされません。最大20MB。 PDFは50ページまで。 DOCX 拡張コンテンツの上限は 80 MB です。","Optional job description":"オプションの職務記述","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"用語頻度の比較が必要な場合は、プレーン テキストを貼り付けてください。分析する必要のない機密情報は含めないでください。","Paste job-description text here…":"ジョブ説明テキストをここに貼り付けてください…","Analyze locally":"ローカルで分析する","Clear files and report":"ファイルとレポートをクリア","Resume review":"レビューを再開","File type":"ファイル タイプ","Extracted characters":"抽出された文字","Words counted":"単語数をカウントしました","Detected headings":"検出された機首方位","Recognized sections":"認識されたセクション","Hyperlinks found":"ハイパーリンクが見つかりました","Bullet paragraphs":"箇条書きの段落","An email address appears in the text":"電子メール アドレスがテキストに表示されます","No email address pattern was detected":"電子メール アドレス パターンが検出されませんでした","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"電話番号のようなパターンがテキストに表示されます","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"電話番号のようなパターンは検出されませんでした","Job-description terms (counts only)":"職務内容の用語 (カウントのみ)","Term":"期間","In job text":"ジョブ テキスト内","In resume":"履歴書中","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"仕事の説明を貼り付けて、用語数を比較します。","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"明確な見出しスタイルが検出されませんでした。 PDF の見出しはテキスト サイズから推定されているため、不正確である可能性があります。","Detected":"検出されました","Not detected":"検出されませんでした","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"このヒューリスティックは、限られたセットの一般的なセクション名を認識します。どのセクションが必要かは決定されません。","Profile / summary":"プロフィール/概要","Experience":"経験","Education":"教育","Skills":"スキル","Contact":"連絡先","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"選択可能なテキストが見つかりませんでした。スキャンのみの PDF は、チェックする前に OCR が必要です。","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"開始するには、PDF または DOCX 履歴書を選択してください。","Reading the selected file locally…":"選択したファイルをローカルで読み取り中…","Local structure review complete.":"局所構造のレビューが完了しました。","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"このブラウザは、必要なローカル ドキュメント機能をサポートしていません。","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"指定されたローカル制限を上限として有効な PDF または最新の DOCX ファイルを選択してください。","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF を読み取れませんでした。破損しているか、暗号化されているか、選択可能なテキストが含まれていない可能性があります。","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX パッケージを安全に開くことも読み取ることもできませんでした。","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"このツールは私の履歴書をアップロードまたは保存しますか?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"いいえ。解析と分析はブラウザーで実行されます。レポートをクリアするかページを離れた後は、ファイル テキストはサーバーに送信されず、保持されません。","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"ATS または雇用主が私の履歴書を受け入れるかどうかを予測しますか?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"いいえ。読みやすいテキストと単純な構造のみをチェックします。採用システムはそれぞれ異なります。これは ATS の互換性を保証したり、採用を予測したりするものではありません。","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"スキャンした PDF を読み取ることができますか?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"PDF に選択可能なテキスト レイヤーがある場合のみ。このチェッカーは OCR モデルをダウンロードしません。スキャンされた画像のみのドキュメントに対して最初に OCR ツールを使用します。","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"職務内容の比較は何を意味しますか?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"単純な正規化後の繰り返し用語の数が表示されます。これは、あなたの資格の一致率、ランキング、推奨または評価ではありません。","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"PDF には DOCX よりも見出しが少ないのはなぜですか?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF は通常、セマンティックな見出しスタイルを保持しません。チェッカーはテキストのサイズと読み上げ順序から目立つ行を推定するため、列と視覚的なデザインが結果に影響を与える可能性があります。","How local resume review works":"現地での履歴書審査の仕組み","Resume checker questions":"履歴書チェッカーの質問","Scope and limitations":"範囲と制限事項","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"ローカルのボーカルと伴奏のセパレータ","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"ボーカルリムーバー — ボーカルと伴奏をローカルで分離","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"ブラウザで短いステレオ オーディオ サンプルを推定ボーカルと伴奏に分離します。音声はデバイスに残ります。モデルはパブリック ホストからダウンロードされます。","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"最大 30 秒までのステレオ ミュージック クリップを選択します。初めて使用するとき、ブラウザは 35.6 MB のモデルをダウンロードします。音声ファイルはこのデバイスで処理され、アップロードされることはありません。","What you get":"得られるもの","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"2 つの WAV ステム (推定ボーカルと残りの伴奏) をプレビューしてダウンロードします。結果はミックスによって異なり、アーティファクトが含まれる場合があります。","Local processing":"ローカル処理","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"このツールは、ONNX および ONNX ランタイム Web にエクスポートされた Open-Unmix UMX-HQ ボーカル ネットワークを使用します。モデルは、Separate を押した場合にのみフェッチされます。有料の推論 API やサブスクリプションは使用されません。オーディオはローカルでデコード、処理され、エクスポートされます。","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"これは、ステレオ 44.1 kHz 処理および最大 30 秒のクリップの推定値です。モノラルソースがステレオに複製されます。ボーカルが楽器、強力なエフェクト、ライブ録音、および特殊なジャンルに深くミックスされている場合、漏れやアーチファクトが発生する可能性があります。結果をクリーンマスターとして使用しないでください。モデルのダウンロードにはインターネット接続が必要です。音声はこのデバイスから出力されません。","Is my audio uploaded?":"私の音声はアップロードされていますか?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"いいえ。選択した音声はブラウザでデコードされて処理されます。唯一のネットワーク リクエストは、分離を開始するときのモデルのダウンロードです。","Why is the first run slow?":"最初の実行が遅いのはなぜですか?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"ブラウザは 35.6 MB モデルを 1 回ダウンロードします。ブラウザがそれをキャッシュする可能性があります。その後、推論はデバイスの CPU 上でローカルに実行されます。","Will every song separate cleanly?":"すべての曲がきれいに分離されますか?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"いいえ。モデルはボーカルステムを推定し、ボーカルの漏れを残したり、楽器の倍音を除去したり、アーティファクトを作成したりする可能性があります。ステマに頼る前に聞いてください。","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"ステレオ オーディオ ファイル (最大 30 秒)","Choose audio":"オーディオの選択","Separate vocals":"個別のボーカル","Cancel / clear":"キャンセル/クリア","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"開始するには短いオーディオ ファイルを選択してください。","Downloading the separation model…":"分離モデルをダウンロードしています…","Separating locally…":"ローカルで分離しています…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"分離が完了しました。いずれかのステムをプレビューまたはダウンロードします。","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"このファイルを処理できませんでした、またはモデルをロードできませんでした。フォーマットや接続を確認して、再度実行してください。","Model and weight license information":"モデルおよび重量ライセンス情報","Estimated vocals":"推定ボーカル","Estimated accompaniment":"推定付属品","Download WAV":"WAV をダウンロード","Progress":"進捗状況","Preparing local separation…":"ローカル分離を準備中…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"分離が完了しました。音声はこのデバイスに残りました。","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"この音声は処理できませんでした。 30 秒以内のステレオ音楽ファイルを試してください。","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"スイスの健康保険控除の比較","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"スイスの健康保険フランチャイズ計算ツール — 年間費用の比較","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"入力した保険料と対象となる年間医療費を使用して、スイスの基本健康保険の控除額を比較します。保険会社の見積もりは推測されません。","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"同じ保険会社が提供する各免責金額について、同じ保険会社が提示する月々の保険料を入力し、年間治療費の低額、予想される、高のシナリオを比較します。","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"強制加入のスイスの基本健康保険の場合、成人の標準免責金額は 300 スイス フラン、子供の免責金額は 0 スイス フランです。オプションのレベルは年齢グループによって異なります。控除後の標準維持費は対象となる残りの費用の 10% で、上限は大人で年間 700 スイス フラン、子供で 350 スイス フランです。このツールは、入力したプレミアムをこのモデル化されたコスト分担に追加します。保険会社の料金を取得したり、どのオプションがあなたに適しているかを判断したりするものではありません。","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"大人が免責金額 300 スイスフランで月額 400 スイスフランの保険料を入力し、免責金額 2,500 スイスフランで 350 スイスフランの保険料を入力した場合、年間保険料の差額は 600 スイスフランとなります。その節約額を、対象となる低額、予想される費用、および高額のそれぞれにおける費用負担のモデル化された差と比較してください。","How the estimate works":"見積もりの仕組み","Common questions":"よくある質問","Scope and exclusions":"範囲と除外事項","Where do I get the premiums?":"保険料はどこで入手できますか?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"同じ保険会社、保険料地域、年齢層、事故補償、保険モデルの現在の月次オファーを使用します。 Priminfo は連邦政府の公式比較サイトです。このページでは、保険会社の見積もりを取得または複製することはありません。","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"リストされているすべての免責レベルは常に提供されますか?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"いいえ。保険会社はすべてのオプションレベルを提供する必要はなく、若年成人に対しては提供内容が異なる場合があります。ご自身の保険に表示されている保険料のみを入力してください。使用できないオプションは空白のままにします。","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"これは私の医療費全額を示していますか?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"いいえ。このモデルでは、対象となるコストに対する通常の控除額と標準の 10% の保持手数料がカバーされます。これには、入院日の拠出金、特別な 40% の医薬品保持、免除サービス、対象外のケア、補足保険は含まれません。","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"これはシナリオの比較であり、保険、医療、財務上のアドバイスではありません。治療や保険料を予測するものではありません。これには、入院日の拠出金（通常、入院日あたり 15 スイスフラン、法定の免除あり）、特定の医薬品の 40% の特別保留、出産/予防の免除、強制適用外のサービス、保険料の補助金、補足保険は含まれません。したがって、実際の自己負担額は異なる場合があります。免責金額が高いということは、医療を受ける場合に、より多くの前払いが必要になることを意味します。","Who is insured under this policy?":"この保険に加入しているのは誰ですか?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"大人 (19 歳以上)","Child (under 18)":"子供 (18 歳未満)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"低年間適格治療費シナリオ (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"予想される年間対象治療費 (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"高額な年間適格治療費シナリオ (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"1 つの保険会社からの月々の保険料","Monthly premium":"月額保険料","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"この同じ保険に提供されるオプションのみを入力してください。他は空白のままにしておきます。","Adult deductible choices":"大人の免責金額の選択","Child deductible choices":"子供控除の選択肢","Compare annual costs":"年間コストの比較","Clear entries":"エントリをクリア","Download CSV":"CSV をダウンロード","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"推定年間保険料と費用負担の合計","Deductible":"免責金額","Annual premiums":"年間保険料","Total at low costs":"低コストでトータル","Total at expected costs":"予想コストの合計","Total at high costs":"高コストの合計","Cost sharing at low costs":"低コストでのコスト共有","Cost sharing at expected costs":"予想されるコストでのコスト共有","Cost sharing at high costs":"高コストでのコスト共有","Difference from lowest available deductible":"利用可能な最低免責金額との差額","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"保険料貯蓄が使い果たされた場合の医療費","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"入力された保険料節約は、モデル化された費用負担範囲内ではキャンセルされません。","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"最低免責金額に対する保険料節約はありません。","Lowest expected total among entered options":"入力されたオプションの中で予想される合計の最小値","Scenario details":"シナリオの詳細","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"3 つの注文済み医療費シナリオと、少なくとも 2 つの利用可能な免責金額の月々の保険料を入力します。","Official rules and current premiums:":"公式ルールと現在の保険料:","Federal deductible rules":"連邦控除規則","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo 公式プレミアム比較","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"このブラウザで計算された比較。","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"年齢層、オーダーされたコスト シナリオ、および少なくとも 2 つの月々の保険料を確認してください。","Entries cleared.":"エントリがクリアされました。","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV がローカルにダウンロードされました。","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"スイスの健康保険料軽減計算ツール","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"スイスの保険料補助金計算ツール - あなたの純保険料","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"現在の保険料と、州によってすでに認められている月々の軽減額から、スイスの正味健康保険料を計算します。","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"保険会社または州の決定から得られる保険料と確認された月々の軽減額を入力します。このツールは資格があるかどうかを決定するものではありません。","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"誰が対象となるか、どの程度の支援が与えられるか、申請が必要かどうかはスイスの各州が決定します。この計算機は、1つの保険料から確定した月々の軽減額のみを差し引き、年間金額を表示します。","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"月額保険料が 420 スイス フランで、確認された減額が 120 スイス フランの場合、推定正味保険料は月額 300 スイス フランです。","How the calculation works":"計算の仕組み","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"これにより、私に資格があるかどうかわかりますか?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"いいえ。資格と賞金額は居住する州によって決定されます。リンクされた公式情報を使用するか、州事務所にお問い合わせください。","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"削減額はどこで確認できますか?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"現在の決定、または保険会社が提示した減額保険料を使用してください。一部の州では自動的に減額が認められます。その他は申請が必要です。","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"これは 1 つの保険に関する計算であり、資格や給付の決定ではありません。世帯収入、資産、家族状況、期限、州の基準値、申請権などは計算されません。プレミアムと特典は変更される場合があります。保険会社と州に確認してください。","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"現在の月額保険料 (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"毎月の割引はすでに付与されています (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"州または保険会社によって確認された金額を入力してください。見積もりを報酬として使用しないでください。","Calculate net premium":"純保険料の計算","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"現在の保険料と確認された減額を入力します。","Estimated premium after reduction":"減額後の推定保険料","Current monthly premium":"現在の月額保険料","Monthly reduction":"毎月の割引","Estimated net monthly premium":"推定正味月額保険料","Reduction over 12 months":"12 か月にわたる削減","Reduction as a share of premium":"保険料の割合としての削減","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"計算が完了しました。特典と発効日については、州および保険会社に確認してください。","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"軽減額が月々の保険料を超えていないことを確認してください。","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"スイスの家賃参考率シナリオ計算ツール","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"スイスの家賃調整計算ツール - 参照レートのシナリオ","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"スイスの住宅ローン参照金利の変更が住宅の純家賃にどのような影響を与えるかを推定するだけです。連邦住宅局からの最新の料金を使用してください。","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"リースまたは最新の家賃通知に記載されている参考レートを、現在のスイスの公式レートと比較してください。計算はデバイス上に残ります。","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"連邦住宅局は、スイスの家賃調整のための住宅ローン基準金利を四半期ごとに 1 つ公表しています。 0.25 パーセントポイントの引き上げは、原則として 3% の家賃の引き上げを許可します。 0.25 ポイントの減少により、原則として 2.91% の削減が可能になります。このシナリオでは、入力した純家賃にこれらの変更を段階的に適用します。","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"月額正味家賃 3,000 スイスフランの場合、基準金利が 1.75% から 1.50% に引き下げられると、推定基準金利のみの変化は月あたり約 -CHF 87.38 (-2.91%) となります。","How this estimate works":"この見積もりの仕組み","Where do I find the current rate?":"現在のレートはどこで確認できますか?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"リンクされた連邦住宅局のページを開き、現在の公示レートを入力します。このツールには、時代遅れになる可能性のあるレートが埋め込まれていません。","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"これによって、家賃の変更をリクエストできるかどうかが決まりますか?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"いいえ。これにより、方向性に関する 1 つの要素が分離されます。契約、インフレ、費用の変更、予約、その他の法的条件により、結果が変わる可能性があります。","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"結果には付随費用が含まれますか?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"いいえ。付随費用やその他の変動料金を除いた月々の純家賃を入力します。","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"結果は参考金利シナリオの説明であり、法的意見や完全な家賃の見直しではありません。これには、インフレ、一般的なコストの変更、改善、契約上の予約、インデックスまたはステップ家賃、通知日、および州の手続きは含まれません。行動する前に、賃貸契約書と公式のガイダンスを確認してください。","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"スイスの住宅リース: 住宅ローン参照金利効果のみの推定。これは法的な決定や家賃の全面的な見直しではありません。","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"現在の月額純家賃 (スイスフラン)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"リースまたは最新の家賃通知に記載されている参考金利 (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"現在のスイスの公式参照レート (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"基準金利シナリオの計算","Reference-rate-only scenario":"参照レートのみのシナリオ","Current monthly net rent":"現在の月額純家賃","Reference-rate change":"基準レートの変更","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"参照レートから推定される月間効果","Scenario monthly net rent":"シナリオの月額純家賃","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"同じレートでの 12 か月間の年換算効果","potential increase":"潜在的な増加","potential decrease":"潜在的な減少","no reference-rate change":"基準レートの変更なし","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"推定では、0.25 パーセント ポイントの増加ごとに 3% が適用され、減少ごとに同等の逆減少が適用されます。他の要因によって結果が変わる可能性があります。","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"これには、インフレ、一般的なコストの変更、改善、契約の予約、インデックスまたはステップ家賃、通知日、または現地の手続き要件は含まれません。リースと連邦住宅局のガイダンスを確認してください。","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"最新の公式レートとガイダンスを確認する","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"スイス連邦住宅局 (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"家賃と両方の料金を入力してシナリオを表示します。","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"シナリオが計算されました。信頼する前に、日付と契約条件を確認してください。","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"金額とレートを確認してください。レートは 0% ～ 5% の範囲にする必要があり、0.25 ポイント刻みで異なります。","Inputs cleared.":"入力がクリアされました。","Result":"結果","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"スイスの休暇取得見積りツール","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"スイスの有給休暇計算ツール — 日割り休暇残高","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"契約上の年次休暇、週労働時間、雇用日、およびすでに取得した日数から、スイスの休暇残日数を推定します。","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"入力した資格と勤務スケジュールを使用して、1 暦年の日割り有給休暇を見積もります。契約条件は推測されません。","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"見積りツールは、契約内の年次休暇日数を、選択された年に雇用された暦日で按分します。パートタイムの仕事の場合は、通常の週の勤務日数と年次休暇を週単位で入力します。","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"4 週間の休暇、週 5 日勤務、年間を通じての雇用により、年間の権利は、すでに取得した休暇を差し引く前の 20 営業日となります。","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"スイスの法定最低額はいくらですか?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"連邦政府のガイダンスでは、勤務年あたり少なくとも 4 週間、20 歳に達していない労働者には 5 週間と規定されています。契約または労働協約により、それ以上の期間が与えられる場合があります。","Does this decide my legal balance?":"これによって私の法的残高が決まりますか?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"いいえ。単純な暦日按分です。契約条件、適用される団体規則、対象となる欠勤、四捨五入、雇用主の記録によってバランスが変わる可能性があります。","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"この見積もりは、法的な権利を決定したり、休日手当を計算したりするものではありません。これには、特定の長期欠勤、契約固有の見越および四捨五入ルール、祝日、時間外勤務、繰り越し期限および紛争による減額は含まれません。契約を確認し、不一致の残高についてアドバイスを得てください。","Leave year":"退職年","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"契約上の年次休暇 (週)","Usual working days per week":"週の通常営業日","Employment start date":"雇用開始日","Employment end date":"雇用終了日","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"この休暇年に既に取得された休暇日数","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"向きのみ。契約上の年間権利を入力します。法定最低期間は通常 4 週間、20 歳未満の労働者の場合は 5 週間です。","Estimate balance":"残高の見積り","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"契約と日付を入力して残高を見積もってください。","Estimated leave balance":"推定休暇残高","Annual leave at this schedule":"このスケジュールでの年次休暇","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"この休暇年に雇用された暦日","Prorated days accrued":"日割り計算された日数","Days already taken":"すでに経過した日数","Estimated days remaining":"残りの推定日数","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"これは、年次休暇を雇用期間の暦日ごとに按分します。雇用主と契約の規定は異なる場合があります。","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"見積もりが計算されました。契約書や雇用主の記録と照らし合わせて確認してください。","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"年、日付、作業スケジュール、値を確認してください。"},"ko":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"스위스 실업수당 시나리오","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"스위스 실업 급여 계산기 - 총 시나리오","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"귀하의 펀드에서 확인한 보험 급여 및 요율을 사용하여 스위스 총 일일 수당을 추정하세요.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"보험 급여와 실업 기금에서 확인한 70% 또는 80% 요율을 입력하세요.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"스위스 규칙은 수당률과 급여 상한선을 설정합니다. 기금은 자격, 공제, 대기일 및 자격을 결정합니다. 월별 범위에는 지불 가능한 평일 20~23일이 반영됩니다.","Example":"예","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"70%에서 CHF 5,000는 지불 가능한 주중당 약 CHF 161.29입니다.","How it works":"작동 방식","Questions":"질문","Scope and limits":"범위 및 제한","Related tools":"관련 도구","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"월 보장 급여(CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"펀드에서 확인된 비율","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"추정","Clear":"지우기","Gross scenario":"총체적 시나리오","Insured salary used":"보험 급여 사용됨","Per payable weekday":"지불 가능한 평일당","20-day month":"20일 월","23-day month":"23일 월","Official benefit rules":"공식 혜택 규칙","Enter your confirmed figures.":"확인된 수치를 입력하세요.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"시나리오가 계산되었습니다. 귀하의 기금으로 금액을 확인하십시오.","Check the values.":"값을 확인하십시오.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"스위스 임차 통지 플래너","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"스위스 임대 공지 플래너 및 편지 초안","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"귀하의 계약 날짜와 조건을 바탕으로 임대 통지를 계획하십시오. 캔톤 규칙을 가정하지 않고 편지 초안을 작성합니다.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"통지 기간, 계약의 다음 유효 종료일 및 수령 날짜를 입력하십시오. 집주인이나 세입자 협회에 매일 날짜를 확인하세요.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"플래너는 사용자가 제공한 날짜와 기간만 적용합니다. 통지가 유효한지, 적법하게 접수된 시기 또는 특별 보호가 적용되는지 여부는 결정되지 않습니다.","Contract notice period (months)":"계약 통지 기간(개월)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"다음 달의 유효한 종료일(계약부터)","Expected receipt date":"예상 수령 날짜","Your name":"당신의 이름","Your address":"귀하의 주소","Landlord / agency":"집주인/대리점","Recipient address":"수신자 주소","Rental property":"임대 부동산","Place":"장소","Letter date":"편지 날짜","Termination of tenancy":"임차 종료","Calculate date and draft letter":"날짜 및 초안 편지 계산","Planning date":"계획일자","Target date":"목표 날짜","Editable draft":"편집 가능한 초안","Copy draft":"초안 복사","Enter your contract terms.":"계약 조건을 입력하세요.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"계획 초안이 준비되었습니다. 계약을 확인하세요.","Check the dates and period.":"날짜와 기간을 확인하세요.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"결과는 제공된 계약 공지일을 따릅니다. 이는 법정 고시 판결이 아니다.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"스위스 부동산 이득 시나리오","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"스위스 재산 이득세 - 사용자 입력 세율 시나리오","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"귀하의 거래 비용과 담당 주의 세율을 사용하여 재산 이득을 추정하십시오.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"수익금, 취득 비용, 확인한 적격 비용 및 공식 주 계산기의 유효 요율을 입력하세요.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"스위스 재산 이득세는 주, 보유 기간, 공제 및 사례에 따라 다릅니다. 이 도구는 요율을 제공하거나 허용 가능한 비용을 결정하지 않습니다.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"판매 수익금(CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"획득 비용(CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"기타 비용 허용 확인(CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"공식 소스의 유효 세율(%)","Estimate scenario":"추정 시나리오","Illustrative scenario":"예시 시나리오","Gain entered":"이득 입력됨","Tax at entered rate":"입력된 세율의 세금","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"당신의 기록과 주(州) 소스의 수치를 입력하세요.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"시나리오가 계산되었습니다. 캔턴에 확인해 보세요.","Check amounts and rate.":"금액과 요율을 확인하세요.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"광둥세 테이블이 포함되어 있지 않습니다. 입력한 유효 요율이 추정치를 결정합니다.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"스위스 상속 및 증여세 시나리오","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"스위스 상속 및 증여세 - 세율 시나리오","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"사용자가 입력한 면제 및 세율에서 과세 금액을 추정합니다. 규칙은 주와 관계에 따라 다릅니다.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"수취인 및 주에 대해 확인된 금액, 면제 및 유효 비율을 입력하십시오.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"광저우 규칙 및 가족 관계에 따라 면제 및 세율이 변경될 수 있습니다. 이 도구는 칸톤 규칙을 선택하거나 납세 의무를 결정하지 않습니다.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"상속 또는 증여 금액(CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"캔톤(CHF)으로 면제 확인됨","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"광주로 확인된 유효율(%)","Amount after entered exemption":"면세 입력 후 금액","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"귀하의 사건에 대해 확인된 수치를 입력하세요.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"추정에는 입력한 면제 및 세율만 사용됩니다.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"스위스 자녀 양육비 예산 시나리오","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"스위스 자녀 양육비 예산 — 투명한 가구 시나리오","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"직접 비용 대변을 입력한 후 상위 소득별로 입력된 하위 예산을 할당합니다.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"자녀의 문서화된 월별 필요 사항, 부모의 월별 소득 및 공제하려는 직접 비용을 사용하십시오.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"이것은 계획 워크시트일 뿐입니다. 이는 스위스의 아동 양육 보상이나 법적 방법이 아닙니다. 주택, 돌봄, 세금, 혜택 및 판례법은 평가되지 않습니다.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"귀하가 문서화한 월별 하위 예산(CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"부모 A 가용 월 소득(CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"부모 B 가용 월 소득(CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"상위 A가 크레딧(CHF)으로 지불한 직접 하위 비용","Allocate scenario":"할당 시나리오","Illustrative allocation":"예시적 할당","Parent A remaining contribution":"상위 A 남은 기여","Parent B contribution":"상위 B 기여","Entered monthly child budget":"월별 자녀 예산 입력됨","Enter your household budget figures.":"가계 예산 수치를 입력하세요.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"예산 시나리오가 계산되었습니다. 자격을 갖춘 조언자와 법적 의무에 대해 논의하십시오.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"금액을 확인하세요. 크레딧은 예산을 초과할 수 없습니다.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"주식은 입력된 두 소득에 비례합니다. 직접 비용 크레딧이 먼저 차감됩니다.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"브라우저 하이픈 미리보기","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"단어 하이픈 미리보기 — 브라우저 언어 패턴","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"제공한 텍스트에 대한 브라우저 하이픈 연결을 미리 봅니다. 지원 여부는 브라우저 및 설치된 언어 리소스에 따라 다릅니다.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"텍스트와 일치하는 언어를 선택하고 샘플을 입력한 후 사용 가능한 선 너비를 조정하세요.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"브라우저의 기본 CSS 하이픈 연결을 사용합니다. 사전을 번들로 묶지 않습니다. 지원되지 않는 브라우저에는 하이픈이 표시되지 않을 수 있습니다. 텍스트를 복사하면 원래 철자가 유지됩니다.","Text language (BCP 47)":"텍스트 언어(BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"미리보기 너비(문자)","Text to preview":"미리 볼 텍스트","Preview":"미리보기","Enter text and choose its language.":"텍스트를 입력하고 언어를 선택하세요.","Preview updated.":"미리보기가 업데이트되었습니다.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"지원되는 언어 태그와 텍스트를 입력하세요.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"동일한 단락을 다른 너비로 시도하여 브라우저가 단어를 구분할 수 있는 위치를 확인하십시오.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"비공개 맞춤법 검사 작업 공간","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"로컬 맞춤법 검사기 - 브라우저 사전 사용","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"브라우저의 기본 맞춤법 검사로 텍스트를 편집하고 언어를 선택한 다음 수정된 텍스트를 복사하세요.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"텍스트가 이 페이지에 남아 있습니다. 브라우저에 철자 사전이 있는 언어를 설정한 다음 철자 메뉴를 사용하거나 추천 단어에 밑줄을 긋습니다.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"이 작업공간은 텍스트를 업로드하거나 사전을 제공하지 않습니다. 브라우저 맞춤법 검사 가용성 및 제안은 장치, 브라우저 및 설치된 사전에 따라 다릅니다.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"맞춤법 검사 언어(BCP 47)","Text to check":"확인할 텍스트","Copy text":"텍스트 복사","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"텍스트를 입력하거나 붙여넣으세요. 제안 사항을 보려면 마우스 오른쪽 버튼을 클릭하거나 장치 맞춤법 메뉴를 사용하세요.","Text copied.":"텍스트가 복사되었습니다.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"자동으로 복사할 수 없습니다. 텍스트를 선택하고 복사하세요.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"일치하는 사전이 없는 브라우저는 맞춤법 오류를 표시하지 못할 수 있습니다.","Resume Structure Checker":"이력서 구조 검사기","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS 이력서 검사기 — 무료 로컬 PDF 및 DOCX 검토","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"브라우저에서 이력서 텍스트, 제목, 섹션, 링크 및 글머리 기호 구조를 확인하세요. 직업 설명 용어를 개수별로 비교합니다. 채용 점수나 업로드가 없습니다.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"텍스트 기반 이력서가 실제로 노출하는 내용(추출된 텍스트, 제목 구조, 연락처 필드 존재, 링크 및 일반적으로 인식되는 섹션)을 검토하십시오. 선택적으로 반복되는 직무 설명 용어를 비교하십시오.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"경험 및 교육에 대한 제목 1 스타일이 있는 DOCX는 해당 제목을 표시합니다. PDF는 선택 가능한 텍스트에서 확인됩니다. 열은 다른 순서로 읽을 수 있습니다.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX 파일은 Office ZIP/XML로 로컬에서 검사됩니다. PDF는 지연된 로컬 PDF.js 엔진으로 읽혀집니다. 선택적 직무 설명 비교는 각 텍스트에서 선택한 용어를 계산합니다. 점수를 생성하거나 누군가를 고용할지 여부를 권장하지 않습니다.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"이것은 ATS 시뮬레이터, 법적 검토 또는 인터뷰 성공 예측이 아닌 형식 및 텍스트 구조 확인입니다. 선택 가능한 텍스트가 없는 스캔한 PDF에는 먼저 OCR이 필요합니다. 비밀번호로 보호되거나, 매크로가 활성화되거나, 서명되었거나 비정상적으로 큰 문서는 지원되지 않습니다.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"이력서를 선택하세요(PDF 또는 DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"파일은 이 브라우저에 남아 있으며 업로드되지 않습니다. 최대 20MB; PDF는 최대 50페이지입니다. DOCX 확장 콘텐츠는 80MB로 제한됩니다.","Optional job description":"선택적 작업 설명","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"용어-빈도 비교를 원하면 일반 텍스트를 붙여넣으십시오. 분석할 필요가 없는 민감한 정보는 포함하지 마세요.","Paste job-description text here…":"여기에 작업 설명 텍스트를 붙여넣으세요…","Analyze locally":"로컬 분석","Clear files and report":"파일 지우기 및 보고서","Resume review":"이력서 검토","File type":"파일 유형","Extracted characters":"추출된 문자","Words counted":"단어 수 계산","Detected headings":"제목 감지됨","Recognized sections":"인식된 섹션","Hyperlinks found":"하이퍼링크 발견","Bullet paragraphs":"글머리 기호 단락","An email address appears in the text":"텍스트에 이메일 주소가 나타납니다","No email address pattern was detected":"이메일 주소 패턴이 감지되지 않았습니다.","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"텍스트에 전화번호와 유사한 패턴이 나타납니다.","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"전화번호와 유사한 패턴이 감지되지 않았습니다.","Job-description terms (counts only)":"작업 설명 용어(개수만)","Term":"용어","In job text":"작업 텍스트에서","In resume":"이력서에","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"용어 수를 비교하려면 작업 설명을 붙여넣으세요.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"명확한 제목 스타일이 감지되지 않았습니다. PDF 제목은 텍스트 크기로 추정되며 정확하지 않을 수 있습니다.","Detected":"감지됨","Not detected":"감지되지 않음","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"이 경험적 방법은 제한된 공통 섹션 이름 세트를 인식합니다. 어떤 섹션이 필요한지는 결정하지 않습니다.","Profile / summary":"프로필/요약","Experience":"경험","Education":"교육","Skills":"스킬","Contact":"연락처","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"선택 가능한 텍스트를 찾을 수 없습니다. 스캔 전용 PDF는 확인하기 전에 OCR이 필요합니다.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"시작하려면 PDF 또는 DOCX 이력서를 선택하십시오.","Reading the selected file locally…":"선택한 파일을 로컬에서 읽는 중...","Local structure review complete.":"로컬 구조 검토가 완료되었습니다.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"이 브라우저는 필수 로컬 문서 기능을 지원하지 않습니다.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"명시된 로컬 제한까지 유효한 PDF 또는 최신 DOCX 파일을 선택하십시오.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF를 읽을 수 없습니다. 손상되었거나 암호화되었거나 선택 가능한 텍스트가 포함되어 있지 않을 수 있습니다.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX 패키지를 안전하게 열거나 읽을 수 없습니다.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"이 도구는 내 이력서를 업로드하거나 저장합니까?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"아니요. 구문 분석 및 분석은 브라우저에서 실행됩니다. 보고서를 지우거나 페이지를 떠난 후에는 파일 텍스트가 서버로 전송되거나 유지되지 않습니다.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"ATS 또는 고용주가 내 이력서를 수락할지 여부를 예측합니까?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"아니요. 읽을 수 있는 텍스트와 간단한 구조만 검사합니다. 채용 시스템은 다양하며 이는 ATS 호환성 보장이나 채용 예측이 아닙니다.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"스캔한 PDF를 읽을 수 있습니까?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"PDF에 선택 가능한 텍스트 레이어가 있는 경우에만 해당됩니다. 이 검사기는 OCR 모델을 다운로드하지 않습니다. 스캔한 이미지 전용 문서에는 먼저 OCR 도구를 사용하십시오.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"직업 설명 비교는 무엇을 의미합니까?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"간단한 정규화 후 반복 용어의 개수를 표시합니다. 이는 귀하의 자격에 대한 일치율, 순위, 추천 또는 평가가 아닙니다.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"PDF가 DOCX보다 제목을 적게 표시하는 이유는 무엇입니까?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF는 일반적으로 의미 체계 제목 스타일을 유지하지 않습니다. 검사기는 텍스트 크기와 읽기 순서를 통해 눈에 띄는 선을 추정하므로 열과 시각적 디자인이 결과에 영향을 미칠 수 있습니다.","How local resume review works":"로컬 이력서 검토 작동 방식","Resume checker questions":"이력서 검사기 질문","Scope and limitations":"범위 및 제한 사항","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"로컬 보컬 및 반주 분리기","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"보컬 리무버 — 로컬에서 보컬과 반주 분리","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"브라우저에서 짧은 스테레오 오디오 샘플을 예상 보컬과 반주로 분리하세요. 오디오는 장치에 남아 있습니다. 모델은 공개 호스트에서 다운로드됩니다.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"최대 30초 길이의 스테레오 음악 클립을 선택하세요. 처음 사용할 때 브라우저는 35.6MB 모델을 다운로드합니다. 오디오 파일은 이 장치에서 처리되며 업로드되지 않습니다.","What you get":"당신이 얻는 것","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"2개의 WAV 스템(예상 보컬 및 잔여 반주)을 미리 보고 다운로드하세요. 결과는 혼합에 따라 다르며 인공물이 포함될 수 있습니다.","Local processing":"로컬 처리","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"이 도구는 ONNX 및 ONNX 런타임 웹으로 내보낸 Open-Unmix UMX-HQ 보컬 네트워크를 사용합니다. 모델은 분리를 누를 때만 가져옵니다. 유료 추론 API 또는 구독은 사용되지 않습니다. 오디오는 로컬로 디코딩, 처리 및 내보내집니다.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"이는 스테레오 44.1kHz 처리 및 최대 30초 클립에 대한 추정치입니다. 모노 소스는 스테레오로 복제됩니다. 악기, 헤비 이펙트, 라이브 녹음 및 특이한 장르에 깊이 섞인 보컬은 누출이나 인공물을 생성할 수 있습니다. 결과를 클린 마스터로 사용하지 마십시오. 모델을 다운로드하려면 인터넷 연결이 필요합니다. 오디오는 이 장치를 벗어나지 않습니다.","Is my audio uploaded?":"내 오디오가 업로드되었습니까?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"아니요. 선택한 오디오는 브라우저에서 디코딩되어 처리됩니다. 유일한 네트워크 요청은 분리를 시작할 때 모델을 다운로드하는 것입니다.","Why is the first run slow?":"첫 번째 실행이 느린 이유는 무엇입니까?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"브라우저는 35.6MB 모델을 한 번 다운로드합니다. 브라우저가 이를 캐시할 수 있습니다. 그런 다음 추론은 장치 CPU에서 로컬로 실행됩니다.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"모든 노래가 깔끔하게 분리되나요?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"아니요. 모델은 보컬 줄기를 추정하고 보컬 누출을 남기거나 악기 고조파를 제거하거나 인공물을 생성할 수 있습니다. 줄기에 의존하기 전에 들어보세요.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"스테레오 오디오 파일(최대 30초)","Choose audio":"오디오 선택","Separate vocals":"별도의 보컬","Cancel / clear":"취소/지우기","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"시작하려면 짧은 오디오 파일을 선택하세요.","Downloading the separation model…":"분리 모델 다운로드 중…","Separating locally…":"로컬로 분리 중…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"분리가 완료되었습니다. 스템을 미리 보거나 다운로드하세요.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"이 파일을 처리하거나 모델을 로드할 수 없습니다. 형식과 연결을 확인한 후 다시 시도하세요.","Model and weight license information":"모델 및 중량 라이센스 정보","Estimated vocals":"예상 보컬","Estimated accompaniment":"예상 반주","Download WAV":"WAV 다운로드","Progress":"진행","Preparing local separation…":"로컬 분리 준비 중…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"분리가 완료되었습니다. 이 기기에는 오디오가 남아 있습니다.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"이 오디오를 처리할 수 없습니다. 30초 미만의 스테레오 음악 파일을 사용해 보세요.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"스위스 건강 보험 공제액 비교기","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"스위스 건강 보험 프랜차이즈 계산기 — 연간 비용 비교","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"입력한 보험료와 적격 연간 의료비를 사용하여 스위스 기본 건강 보험 공제액을 비교하세요. 보험사 견적은 추측되지 않습니다.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"동일 보험사가 제공하는 각 공제액에 대해 표시한 월 보험료를 입력한 다음 연간 치료 비용이 낮은 시나리오, 예상되는 비용, 높은 연간 치료 비용 시나리오를 비교하세요.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"스위스 의무 기본 건강 보험의 경우 성인 표준 공제액은 CHF 300이고 어린이 공제액은 CHF 0입니다. 선택 수준은 연령 그룹에 따라 다릅니다. 공제액을 제외한 표준 유지 비용은 적격 잔존 비용의 10%이며, 최대 금액은 성인의 경우 연간 CHF 700, 어린이의 경우 CHF 350입니다. 이 도구는 귀하가 입력한 프리미엄을 이 모델링된 비용 공유에 추가합니다. 보험사 요율을 가져오거나 귀하에게 적합한 옵션을 결정하지 않습니다.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"성인이 CHF 300 공제액에 CHF 400 월 보험료를 입력하고 CHF 2,500 공제액에 CHF 350을 입력하는 경우 연간 보험료 차이는 CHF 600입니다. 해당 절감액을 낮은, 예상 및 높은 적격 비용 금액 각각에 대한 비용 분담의 모델링된 차이와 비교하십시오.","How the estimate works":"추정 작동 방식","Common questions":"일반적인 질문","Scope and exclusions":"범위 및 제외","Where do I get the premiums?":"보험료는 어디서 구할 수 있나요?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"동일한 보험사, 프리미엄 지역, 연령 그룹, 사고 보장 및 보험 모델에 대한 현재 월간 혜택을 사용하세요. Priminfo는 공식 연방 비교 사이트입니다. 이 페이지는 보험사 견적을 가져오거나 재생산하지 않습니다.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"나열된 모든 공제액 수준이 항상 제공됩니까?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"아니요. 보험사는 모든 선택 수준을 제공할 필요는 없으며 젊은 성인에 대해서는 제안이 다를 수 있습니다. 자신의 보험에 표시된 보험료만 입력하세요. 사용할 수 없는 옵션은 비워 두세요.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"이것은 내 전체 의료비 청구서를 보여줍니까?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"아니요. 이 모델은 적격 비용에 대한 일반 공제액과 표준 10% 유지 수수료를 보장합니다. 병원 당일 기여금, 특별 40% 의약품 보유, 면제 서비스, 비보장 진료 및 보충 보험은 제외됩니다.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"이것은 보험, 의료 또는 재정 조언이 아닌 시나리오 비교입니다. 이는 귀하의 치료나 보험료를 예측하지 않습니다. 병원 일 기여금(일반적으로 입원일당 CHF 15, 법정 면제 있음), 특정 의약품에 대한 특별 40% 유보, 출산/예방 면제, 의무 보장 외 서비스, 보험료 보조금 및 보충 보험은 제외됩니다. 따라서 실제 본인부담금은 다를 수 있습니다. 공제액이 높다는 것은 진료를 받을 경우 더 많은 금액을 선불로 지불할 수 있어야 함을 의미합니다.","Who is insured under this policy?":"이 정책에 따라 누가 보험에 가입됩니까?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"성인(19세 이상)","Child (under 18)":"어린이(18세 미만)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"낮은 연간 적격 치료 비용 시나리오(CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"예상 연간 적격 치료 비용(CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"높은 연간 적격 치료 비용 시나리오(CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"한 보험사의 월 보험료","Monthly premium":"월간 프리미엄","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"이 동일한 정책에 대해 제공된 옵션만 입력하십시오. 나머지는 비워 두세요.","Adult deductible choices":"성인 공제액 선택","Child deductible choices":"아동 공제액 선택","Compare annual costs":"연간 비용 비교","Clear entries":"항목 지우기","Download CSV":"CSV 다운로드","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"예상 연간 보험료 + 비용 분담","Deductible":"공제액","Annual premiums":"연간 보험료","Total at low costs":"저렴한 비용으로 총계","Total at expected costs":"예상 비용의 총액","Total at high costs":"총 비용이 높음","Cost sharing at low costs":"저렴한 비용으로 비용 공유","Cost sharing at expected costs":"예상 비용으로 비용 공유","Cost sharing at high costs":"높은 비용으로 비용 공유","Difference from lowest available deductible":"사용 가능한 최저 공제액과의 차이","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"보험료 절감액이 소진된 의료비","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"입력된 보험료 할인은 모델링된 비용 공유 범위 내에서 취소되지 않습니다.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"최저 공제액에 대한 보험료 절약은 없습니다.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"입력된 옵션 중 가장 낮은 예상 합계","Scenario details":"시나리오 세부정보","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"3개의 주문된 의료비 시나리오와 최소 2개의 공제액에 대한 월 보험료를 입력하세요.","Official rules and current premiums:":"공식 규정 및 현재 보험료:","Federal deductible rules":"연방 공제액 규칙","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo 공식 프리미엄 비교","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"이 브라우저에서 비교가 계산되었습니다.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"연령대, 주문 비용 시나리오 및 최소 2개의 월 보험료를 확인하세요.","Entries cleared.":"항목이 지워졌습니다.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV가 로컬로 다운로드되었습니다.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"스위스 건강 보험료 절감 계산기","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"스위스 프리미엄 보조금 계산기 - 순 프리미엄","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"현재 보험료와 해당 주에서 이미 부여한 월간 감액에서 순 스위스 건강 보험 보험료를 계산합니다.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"보험사 또는 주 결정에 따라 보험료 및 확인된 월별 할인액을 입력하세요. 이 도구는 귀하의 자격 여부를 결정하지 않습니다.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"스위스 주에서는 자격을 갖춘 사람, 지원 금액 및 신청이 필요한지 여부를 결정합니다. 이 계산기는 하나의 보험료에서 확인된 월별 할인액만 차감하고 연간 금액을 표시합니다.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"월 보험료가 CHF 420이고 확인된 감소액이 CHF 120인 경우 예상 순 보험료는 월 CHF 300입니다.","How the calculation works":"계산 작동 방식","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"이것이 내가 자격이 있는지 알려주나요?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"아니요. 자격과 보상 금액은 거주하는 캔톤에 따라 결정됩니다. 링크된 공식정보를 이용하시거나 주정부 사무소에 문의하세요.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"감소 금액은 어디서 확인할 수 있나요?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"현재 결정 또는 보험사가 제시한 감소된 보험료를 사용하십시오. 일부 주는 자동으로 감소를 부여합니다. 다른 사람들은 신청서가 필요합니다.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"이것은 자격 또는 혜택 결정이 아닌 하나의 정책에 대한 산술입니다. 가계 소득, 자산, 가족 상태, 마감일, 주 기준 한도 또는 신청 권리는 계산되지 않습니다. 보험료와 보상은 변경될 수 있습니다. 보험사와 주에 확인하십시오.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"현재 월 보험료(CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"월별 할인이 이미 부여됨(CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"주 또는 보험사에서 확인한 금액을 입력하세요. 견적을 보상으로 사용하지 마십시오.","Calculate net premium":"순 프리미엄 계산","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"현재 보험료와 확인된 감소를 입력하세요.","Estimated premium after reduction":"감소 후 예상 프리미엄","Current monthly premium":"현재 월 보험료","Monthly reduction":"월간 절감","Estimated net monthly premium":"추정 순월 보험료","Reduction over 12 months":"12개월에 걸쳐 감소","Reduction as a share of premium":"프리미엄 비율로 감소","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"계산이 완료되었습니다. 귀하의 주와 보험사에 보상 및 발효일을 확인하십시오.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"감소액이 월 보험료보다 크지 않은지 확인하십시오.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"스위스 임대료 기준율 시나리오 계산기","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"스위스 임대료 조정 계산기 - 기준율 시나리오","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"스위스 모기지 기준금리의 변화가 주거용 순임대료에 어떤 영향을 미치는지 추정해 보세요. 연방 주택 사무소의 최신 요금을 사용하세요.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"리스 또는 최근 임대 통지에 명시된 참조 요율을 현재 스위스 공식 요율과 비교하십시오. 계산은 장치에 유지됩니다.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"연방 주택청은 매 분기마다 스위스 임대료 조정에 대한 하나의 모기지 기준 금리를 발표합니다. 원칙적으로 0.25%포인트 인상 시 임대료는 3% 인상될 수 있습니다. 0.25포인트 감소는 원칙적으로 2.91% 감소를 허용합니다. 이 시나리오에서는 입력한 순 임대료에 이러한 변경 사항을 단계별로 적용합니다.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"월 순 임대료가 CHF 3,000인 경우 기준 요율이 1.75%에서 1.50%로 감소하면 참조 요율만 변경된 추정치는 월 약 -CHF 87.38(-2.91%)입니다.","How this estimate works":"이 추정 작동 방식","Where do I find the current rate?":"현재 환율은 어디서 확인할 수 있나요?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"링크된 연방 주택청 페이지를 열고 현재 공시 요금을 입력하세요. 이 도구에는 오래될 수 있는 요율이 포함되어 있지 않습니다.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"임대료 변경을 요청할 수 있는지 여부가 결정됩니까?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"아니요. 방향에 대한 한 가지 요소를 분리합니다. 귀하의 계약, 인플레이션, 비용 변경, 예약 및 기타 법적 조건에 따라 결과가 변경될 수 있습니다.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"결과에 보조 비용이 포함됩니까?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"아니요. 부대 비용 및 기타 변동 비용을 제외한 월별 순 임대료를 입력합니다.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"결과는 법적 의견이나 완전한 임대료 검토가 아닌 예시적인 기준 금리 시나리오입니다. 인플레이션, 일반 비용 변경, 개선, 계약 유보, 색인 또는 단계별 임대료, 통지 날짜 및 주정부 절차는 제외됩니다. 조치를 취하기 전에 임대차 계약과 공식 지침을 확인하세요.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"스위스 주거용 임대: 모기지 기준 금리 효과만 추정한 것입니다. 이는 법적 결정이나 전체 임대료 검토가 아닙니다.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"현재 월별 순임대료(CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"리스 또는 최근 임대료 통지서에 명시된 참조율(%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"현재 스위스 공식 기준율(%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"참조율 시나리오 계산","Reference-rate-only scenario":"참조율 전용 시나리오","Current monthly net rent":"현재 월별 순임대료","Reference-rate change":"참조율 변경","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"기준율의 예상 월별 효과","Scenario monthly net rent":"시나리오 월별 순임대료","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"같은 비율로 12개월 동안 연간 효과","potential increase":"잠재적 증가","potential decrease":"잠재적 감소","no reference-rate change":"참조 속도 변경 없음","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"추정치는 0.25% 포인트 증가할 때마다 3%를 적용하고 감소할 때마다 이에 상응하는 역 감소를 적용합니다. 다른 요인으로 인해 결과가 바뀔 수 있습니다.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"여기에는 인플레이션, 일반 비용 변경, 개선, 계약 예약, 색인화 또는 단계별 임대료, 통지 날짜 또는 현지 절차 요구 사항이 포함되지 않습니다. 임대차 계약과 연방 주택청 지침을 확인하세요.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"최신 공식 요금 및 안내를 확인하세요","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"스위스 연방 주택국(BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"시나리오를 보려면 임대료와 요율을 모두 입력하세요.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"시나리오가 계산되었습니다. 신뢰하기 전에 날짜와 계약 조건을 확인하세요.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"금액과 요율을 확인하세요. 요율은 0%에서 5% 사이여야 하며 0.25포인트 단위로 달라집니다.","Inputs cleared.":"입력이 지워졌습니다.","Result":"결과","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"스위스 휴가 발생 추정기","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"스위스 휴가 발생 계산기 - 비례 배분된 휴가 잔액","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"계약, 근무 주, 고용 날짜 및 이미 사용된 날짜의 연차 휴가에서 스위스 휴가 일 잔액을 추정합니다.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"입력한 자격 및 작업 일정을 사용하여 1년 동안 비례 배분된 유급 휴가를 추정합니다. 계약 조건은 추측되지 않습니다.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"추정기는 계약상의 연차 휴가 일수를 선택한 연도에 고용된 달력 일수로 비례 배분합니다. 파트타임 근무의 경우 주당 평소 근무일수와 연차휴가를 주 단위로 입력합니다.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"4주간의 휴가, 주 5일 근무 및 연중 고용이 포함된 연간 권리는 이미 사용된 휴가를 빼기 전 근무일 20일입니다.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"스위스 법정 최소 금액은 얼마입니까?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"연방 지침에는 근무 연도당 최소 4주, 20세 미만 근로자의 경우 5주가 명시되어 있습니다. 계약 또는 단체 협약에 따라 더 많은 혜택이 부여될 수 있습니다.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"이것이 내 법적 잔고를 결정합니까?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"아니요. 이는 간단한 역일 비례배분입니다. 계약 조건, 적용 가능한 단체 규칙, 적격 결근, 반올림 및 고용주 기록으로 인해 잔액이 변경될 수 있습니다.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"이 추정치는 법적 자격을 결정하거나 휴일 수당을 계산하지 않습니다. 특정 장기 결근, 계약별 누적 및 반올림 규칙, 공휴일, 초과 근무, 이월 기한 및 분쟁에 대한 감소는 제외됩니다. 계약을 확인하고 분쟁이 있는 잔액에 대한 조언을 얻으세요.","Leave year":"퇴사 연도","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"계약상의 연차 휴가(주)","Usual working days per week":"주당 일반적인 근무일","Employment start date":"고용 시작일","Employment end date":"고용 종료일","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"이번 연도에 이미 휴가가 사용되었습니다.","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"방향 전용입니다. 계약상의 연간 권리를 입력합니다. 법적 최소 기간은 일반적으로 4주이며, 20세 미만 근로자의 경우 5주입니다.","Estimate balance":"잔액 추정","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"잔고를 추정하려면 계약서와 날짜를 입력하세요.","Estimated leave balance":"추정 휴가 잔액","Annual leave at this schedule":"연차 휴가는 이 일정으로","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"이 휴가 연도에 고용된 달력 일수","Prorated days accrued":"일할 계산된 누적 일수","Days already taken":"이미 촬영된 일 수","Estimated days remaining":"남은 예상 일수","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"연차 휴가는 고용 기간 중 달력 일수만큼 비례 배분됩니다. 고용주 및 계약 규칙은 다를 수 있습니다.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"추정치가 계산되었습니다. 계약서 및 고용주 기록과 비교하여 확인하십시오.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"연도, 날짜, 작업 일정 및 값을 확인하세요."},"id":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Skenario Tunjangan Pengangguran Swiss","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Kalkulator Tunjangan Pengangguran Swiss — Skenario Bruto","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Perkirakan tunjangan harian kotor Swiss menggunakan gaji dan tarif yang diasuransikan yang dikonfirmasi oleh dana Anda.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Masukkan gaji yang diasuransikan dan tarif 70% atau 80% yang dikonfirmasi oleh dana pengangguran Anda.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Peraturan Swiss menetapkan tingkat tunjangan dan batas gaji. Dana tersebut menentukan kelayakan, pengurangan, hari tunggu, dan hak. Kisaran bulanan mencerminkan 20–23 hari kerja yang harus dibayar.","Example":"Contoh","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5.000 pada 70% adalah sekitar CHF 161,29 per hari kerja yang harus dibayar.","How it works":"Cara kerjanya","Questions":"Pertanyaan","Scope and limits":"Cakupan dan batasan","Related tools":"Alat terkait","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Gaji bulanan yang diasuransikan (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Nilai dikonfirmasi oleh dana","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Perkiraan","Clear":"Jelas","Gross scenario":"Skenario kotor","Insured salary used":"Gaji yang diasuransikan digunakan","Per payable weekday":"Per hari kerja yang harus dibayar","20-day month":"bulan 20 hari","23-day month":"bulan 23 hari","Official benefit rules":"Aturan manfaat resmi","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Masukkan angka terkonfirmasi Anda.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Skenario dihitung. Konfirmasikan jumlah dengan dana Anda.","Check the values.":"Periksa nilainya.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Perencana Pemberitahuan Penyewaan Swiss","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Perencana Pemberitahuan Sewa Swiss dan Draf Surat","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Rencanakan pemberitahuan sewa dari tanggal dan ketentuan dalam kontrak Anda sendiri; menyusun surat tanpa mengasumsikan aturan wilayah.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Masukkan periode pemberitahuan, hari penghentian valid berikutnya dalam kontrak Anda, dan tanggal penerimaan. Periksa setiap tanggal dengan pemilik atau asosiasi penyewa Anda.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Perencana hanya menerapkan tanggal dan periode yang Anda berikan. Ia tidak memutuskan apakah pemberitahuan itu sah, kapan diterima secara sah, atau apakah ada perlindungan khusus yang berlaku.","Contract notice period (months)":"Periode pemberitahuan kontrak (bulan)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Hari penghentian valid berikutnya pada bulan tersebut (dari kontrak)","Expected receipt date":"Tanggal penerimaan yang diharapkan","Your name":"Nama Anda","Your address":"Alamat Anda","Landlord / agency":"Pemilik / agen","Recipient address":"Alamat penerima","Rental property":"Properti sewaan","Place":"Tempat","Letter date":"Tanggal surat","Termination of tenancy":"Pengakhiran sewa","Calculate date and draft letter":"Hitung tanggal dan draf surat","Planning date":"Tanggal perencanaan","Target date":"Tanggal target","Editable draft":"Draf yang dapat diedit","Copy draft":"Salin draf","Enter your contract terms.":"Masukkan persyaratan kontrak Anda.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Draf perencanaan sudah siap. Verifikasi terhadap kontrak Anda.","Check the dates and period.":"Periksa tanggal dan periodenya.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Hasilnya mengikuti hari pemberitahuan kontrak yang diberikan; ini bukan keputusan pemberitahuan undang-undang.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Skenario Keuntungan Properti Swiss","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Pajak Keuntungan Properti Swiss — Skenario Tarif yang Dimasukkan Pengguna","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Perkirakan keuntungan properti menggunakan biaya transaksi Anda sendiri dan tarif pajak dari wilayah yang bertanggung jawab.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Masukkan hasil, biaya akuisisi, pengeluaran yang memenuhi syarat yang telah Anda konfirmasi, dan tarif efektif dari kalkulator wilayah resmi.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Pajak keuntungan properti Swiss bervariasi menurut wilayah, periode penyimpanan, pengurangan, dan kasus. Alat ini tidak memberikan tarif atau menentukan biaya yang diperbolehkan.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Hasil penjualan (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Biaya akuisisi (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Biaya lain yang dikonfirmasi dapat diterima (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Tarif pajak efektif dari sumber resmi (%)","Estimate scenario":"Skenario perkiraan","Illustrative scenario":"Skenario ilustrasi","Gain entered":"Keuntungan dimasukkan","Tax at entered rate":"Pajak sesuai tarif yang dimasukkan","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Masukkan angka dari catatan dan sumber wilayah Anda.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Skenario dihitung; verifikasi dengan kanton.","Check amounts and rate.":"Periksa jumlah dan tarif.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Tidak ada tabel pajak wilayah yang disematkan; tarif efektif yang Anda masukkan akan menentukan perkiraan.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Skenario Pajak Warisan dan Hadiah Swiss","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Pajak Warisan dan Hadiah Swiss — Skenario Tarif Anda","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Perkirakan jumlah kena pajak dari pembebasan dan tarif yang dimasukkan pengguna; aturan berbeda-beda menurut wilayah dan hubungan.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Masukkan jumlah, pengecualian dan tarif efektif yang dikonfirmasi untuk penerima dan wilayah.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Peraturan wilayah dan hubungan keluarga dapat mengubah pengecualian dan tarif. Alat ini tidak memilih aturan wilayah atau menentukan kewajiban pajak.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Jumlah warisan atau hadiah (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Pengecualian dikonfirmasi dengan kanton (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Tingkat efektif dikonfirmasi dengan kanton (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Jumlah setelah memasukkan pengecualian","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Masukkan angka yang dikonfirmasi untuk kasus Anda.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Perkiraan hanya menggunakan pengecualian dan tarif yang Anda masukkan.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Skenario Anggaran Tunjangan Anak Swiss","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Anggaran Tunjangan Anak Swiss — Skenario Rumah Tangga Transparan","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Alokasikan anggaran anak yang dimasukkan berdasarkan pendapatan orang tua setelah kredit biaya langsung yang dimasukkan.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Gunakan kebutuhan bulanan anak yang terdokumentasi, pendapatan bulanan kedua orang tua yang tersedia, dan biaya langsung apa pun yang ingin Anda kreditkan.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Ini hanya lembar kerja perencanaan. Ini bukan merupakan penghargaan atau metode hukum pemeliharaan anak di Swiss; perumahan, perawatan, pajak, tunjangan dan kasus hukum tidak dinilai.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Anggaran anak bulanan yang Anda dokumentasikan (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Pendapatan bulanan tersedia Orang Tua A (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Pendapatan bulanan tersedia Induk B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Biaya anak langsung dibayarkan oleh Induk A ke kredit (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Alokasikan skenario","Illustrative allocation":"Alokasi ilustratif","Parent A remaining contribution":"Induk Kontribusi yang tersisa","Parent B contribution":"Kontribusi Orang Tua B","Entered monthly child budget":"Memasukkan anggaran anak bulanan","Enter your household budget figures.":"Masukkan angka anggaran rumah tangga Anda.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Skenario anggaran dihitung; mendiskusikan kewajiban hukum dengan penasihat yang berkualifikasi.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Periksa jumlah; kredit tidak boleh melebihi anggaran.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Bagian sebanding dengan dua pendapatan yang dimasukkan; kredit biaya langsung dikurangi terlebih dahulu.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Pratinjau Tanda Hubung Browser","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Pratinjau Tanda Hubung Kata — Pola Bahasa Browser","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Pratinjau tanda hubung browser untuk teks yang Anda berikan; dukungan tergantung pada browser dan sumber daya bahasa yang diinstal.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Pilih bahasa yang cocok dengan teks Anda, masukkan sampel dan sesuaikan lebar garis yang tersedia.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Menggunakan tanda hubung CSS asli browser. Itu tidak menggabungkan kamus; browser yang tidak didukung mungkin tidak menampilkan tanda hubung. Menyalin teks mempertahankan ejaan aslinya.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Bahasa teks (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Lebar pratinjau (karakter)","Text to preview":"Teks untuk dipratinjau","Preview":"Pratinjau","Enter text and choose its language.":"Masukkan teks dan pilih bahasanya.","Preview updated.":"Pratinjau diperbarui.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Masukkan tag bahasa dan teks yang didukung.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Coba paragraf yang sama dengan lebar berbeda untuk melihat di mana browser dapat memecah kata.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Ruang Kerja Periksa Ejaan Pribadi","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Pemeriksa Ejaan Lokal — Gunakan Kamus Browser Anda","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Edit teks dengan pemeriksa ejaan asli browser, pilih bahasa dan salin teks yang dikoreksi.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Teks tetap ada di halaman ini. Tetapkan bahasa pada kamus ejaan browser Anda, lalu gunakan menu ejaannya atau saran yang digarisbawahi.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Ruang kerja ini tidak mengunggah teks atau mengirimkan kamus. Ketersediaan dan saran pemeriksaan ejaan browser bergantung pada perangkat, browser, dan kamus yang diinstal.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Periksa ejaan bahasa (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Teks untuk diperiksa","Copy text":"Salin teks","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Ketik atau tempel teks. Klik kanan atau gunakan menu ejaan perangkat Anda untuk mendapatkan saran.","Text copied.":"Teks disalin.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Tidak dapat menyalin secara otomatis; pilih dan salin teksnya.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Browser tanpa kamus yang cocok mungkin tidak menandai kesalahan ejaan.","Resume Structure Checker":"Pemeriksa Struktur Lanjutkan","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Pemeriksa Resume — Ulasan PDF & DOCX Lokal Gratis","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Periksa teks resume, judul, bagian, tautan, dan struktur poin di browser Anda. Bandingkan persyaratan deskripsi pekerjaan berdasarkan hitungan; tidak ada skor perekrutan atau unggahan.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Tinjau apa yang sebenarnya diekspos oleh resume berbasis teks: teks yang diekstraksi, struktur judul, keberadaan bidang kontak, tautan, dan bagian yang umum dikenali. Secara opsional, bandingkan persyaratan deskripsi pekerjaan yang berulang.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"DOCX dengan gaya Heading 1 untuk Pengalaman dan Pendidikan menunjukkan judul tersebut. PDF diperiksa dari teks yang dapat dipilih; kolom dapat dibaca dalam urutan yang berbeda.\nFile","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX diperiksa secara lokal sebagai Office ZIP/XML. PDF dibaca dengan mesin PDF.js lokal yang ditangguhkan. Perbandingan deskripsi pekerjaan opsional menghitung istilah yang dipilih di setiap teks; itu tidak menciptakan skor atau merekomendasikan apakah akan mempekerjakan seseorang.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Ini adalah pemeriksaan format dan struktur teks, bukan simulator ATS, tinjauan hukum, atau prediksi keberhasilan wawancara. PDF yang dipindai tanpa teks yang dapat dipilih memerlukan OCR terlebih dahulu. Dokumen yang dilindungi kata sandi, berkemampuan makro, ditandatangani, atau berukuran luar biasa besar tidak didukung.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Pilih resume (PDF atau DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"File Anda tetap berada di browser ini dan tidak diunggah. Maksimal 20MB; PDF hingga 50 halaman. Konten DOCX yang diperluas dibatasi hingga 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Deskripsi pekerjaan opsional","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Tempelkan teks biasa jika Anda ingin perbandingan frekuensi istilah. Jangan sertakan informasi sensitif yang tidak perlu Anda analisis.","Paste job-description text here…":"Tempel teks deskripsi pekerjaan di sini…","Analyze locally":"Analisis secara lokal","Clear files and report":"Hapus file dan laporkan","Resume review":"Lanjutkan ulasan","File type":"Jenis berkas","Extracted characters":"Karakter yang diekstraksi","Words counted":"Kata-kata dihitung","Detected headings":"Judul terdeteksi","Recognized sections":"Bagian yang dikenali","Hyperlinks found":"Hyperlink ditemukan","Bullet paragraphs":"Paragraf poin","An email address appears in the text":"Alamat email muncul di teks","No email address pattern was detected":"Tidak ada pola alamat email yang terdeteksi","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Pola seperti nomor telepon muncul di teks","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Tidak ada pola seperti nomor telepon yang terdeteksi","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Istilah deskripsi pekerjaan (hanya dihitung)","Term":"Istilah","In job text":"Dalam teks pekerjaan","In resume":"Dalam ringkasan","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Tempelkan deskripsi pekerjaan untuk membandingkan jumlah masa jabatan.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Tidak ada gaya judul yang jelas terdeteksi. Judul PDF diperkirakan berdasarkan ukuran teks dan mungkin tidak akurat.","Detected":"Terdeteksi","Not detected":"Tidak terdeteksi","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Heuristik ini mengenali sekumpulan nama bagian umum yang terbatas; itu tidak memutuskan bagian mana yang diperlukan.","Profile / summary":"Profil / ringkasan","Experience":"Pengalaman","Education":"Pendidikan","Skills":"Keterampilan","Contact":"Kontak","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Tidak ditemukan teks yang dapat dipilih. PDF yang hanya dipindai memerlukan OCR sebelum dapat diperiksa.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Pilih resume PDF atau DOCX untuk memulai.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Membaca file yang dipilih secara lokal…","Local structure review complete.":"Tinjauan struktur lokal selesai.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Browser ini tidak mendukung fitur dokumen lokal yang diperlukan.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Pilih file PDF atau DOCX modern yang valid hingga batas lokal yang ditentukan.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF tidak dapat dibaca. Mungkin rusak, terenkripsi, atau tidak berisi teks yang dapat dipilih.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Paket DOCX tidak dapat dibuka atau dibaca dengan aman.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Apakah alat ini mengunggah atau menyimpan resume saya?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Tidak. Parsing dan analisis dijalankan di browser Anda. Teks file tidak dikirim ke server atau disimpan setelah Anda menghapus laporan atau meninggalkan halaman.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Apakah ini memprediksi apakah ATS atau perusahaan akan menerima resume saya?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Tidak. Ia memeriksa teks yang dapat dibaca dan struktur sederhana saja. Sistem perekrutan berbeda-beda, dan ini bukan jaminan kompatibilitas ATS atau prediksi perekrutan.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Bisakah membaca PDF yang dipindai?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Hanya jika PDF memiliki lapisan teks yang dapat dipilih. Pemeriksa ini tidak mengunduh model OCR; gunakan alat OCR terlebih dahulu untuk dokumen yang hanya berisi gambar pindaian.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Apa yang dimaksud dengan perbandingan deskripsi pekerjaan?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Ini menunjukkan jumlah istilah berulang setelah normalisasi sederhana. Ini bukan persentase pertandingan, peringkat, rekomendasi atau penilaian kualifikasi Anda.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Mengapa PDF menampilkan lebih sedikit judul dibandingkan DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF biasanya tidak mempertahankan gaya judul semantik. Pemeriksa memperkirakan garis yang menonjol dari ukuran teks dan urutan pembacaan, sehingga kolom dan desain visual dapat memengaruhi hasilnya.","How local resume review works":"Cara kerja tinjauan resume lokal","Resume checker questions":"Pertanyaan pemeriksa resume","Scope and limitations":"Cakupan dan batasan","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Pemisah Vokal dan Pengiring Lokal","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Penghilang Vokal — Pisahkan Vokal dan Pengiring Secara Lokal","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Pisahkan sampel audio stereo pendek menjadi perkiraan vokal dan pengiring di browser Anda. Audio tetap ada di perangkat Anda; model diunduh dari host publiknya.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Pilih klip musik stereo hingga 30 detik. Pada penggunaan pertama, browser mengunduh model 35,6 MB. File audio diproses di perangkat ini dan tidak pernah diunggah.","What you get":"Apa yang Anda dapatkan","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Pratinjau dan unduh dua batang WAV: perkiraan vokal dan sisa pengiring. Hasil bergantung pada campuran dan mungkin mengandung artefak.","Local processing":"Pemrosesan lokal","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Alat ini menggunakan jaringan vokal Open-Unmix UMX-HQ yang diekspor ke ONNX dan ONNX Runtime Web. Model diambil hanya ketika Anda menekan Pisahkan; tidak ada API inferensi atau langganan berbayar yang digunakan. Audio diterjemahkan, diproses, dan diekspor secara lokal.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Ini adalah perkiraan untuk pemrosesan stereo 44,1 kHz dan klip hingga 30 detik. Sumber mono diduplikasi menjadi stereo. Vokal yang tercampur secara mendalam ke dalam instrumen, efek berat, rekaman live, dan genre yang tidak biasa dapat menghasilkan kebocoran atau artefak. Jangan gunakan hasilnya sebagai master bersih. Pengunduhan model memerlukan koneksi internet; audio tidak keluar dari perangkat ini.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Apakah audio saya sudah diunggah?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Tidak. Audio yang dipilih diterjemahkan dan diproses di browser Anda. Satu-satunya permintaan jaringan adalah pengunduhan model saat Anda memulai pemisahan.","Why is the first run slow?":"Mengapa proses pertama berjalan lambat?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Browser mengunduh model 35,6 MB satu kali; browser mungkin menyimpannya dalam cache. Inferensi kemudian dijalankan secara lokal pada CPU perangkat.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Apakah setiap lagu akan terpisah dengan rapi?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Tidak. Model ini memperkirakan batang vokal dan mungkin meninggalkan kebocoran vokal, menghilangkan harmonik instrumen, atau membuat artefak. Dengarkan sebelum mengandalkan batang.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"File audio stereo (hingga 30 detik)","Choose audio":"Pilih audio","Separate vocals":"Vokal terpisah","Cancel / clear":"Batal / hapus","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Pilih file audio pendek untuk memulai.","Downloading the separation model…":"Mengunduh model pemisahan…","Separating locally…":"Memisahkan secara lokal…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Pemisahan selesai. Pratinjau atau unduh salah satu batangnya.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Tidak dapat memproses file ini atau memuat model. Periksa format dan koneksi, lalu coba lagi.","Model and weight license information":"Informasi lisensi model dan berat","Estimated vocals":"Perkiraan vokal","Estimated accompaniment":"Perkiraan iringan","Download WAV":"Unduh WAV","Progress":"Kemajuan","Preparing local separation…":"Mempersiapkan pemisahan lokal…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Pemisahan selesai. Audio tetap ada di perangkat ini.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Audio ini tidak dapat diproses. Coba file musik stereo kurang dari 30 detik.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Pembanding Pengurangan Asuransi Kesehatan Swiss","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Kalkulator Waralaba Asuransi Kesehatan Swiss — Bandingkan Biaya Tahunan","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Bandingkan pengurangan asuransi kesehatan dasar Swiss menggunakan premi dan biaya pengobatan tahunan yang memenuhi syarat yang Anda masukkan. Tidak ada penawaran perusahaan asuransi yang dapat ditebak.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Masukkan premi bulanan yang ditunjukkan oleh perusahaan asuransi yang sama untuk setiap pengurangan yang ditawarkannya, lalu bandingkan skenario biaya perawatan tahunan yang rendah, diharapkan, dan tinggi.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Untuk asuransi kesehatan dasar wajib Swiss, pengurangan standar dewasa adalah CHF 300 dan pengurangan anak adalah CHF 0. Tingkat opsional berbeda menurut kelompok umur. Setelah dikurangi, biaya retensi standar adalah 10% dari sisa biaya yang memenuhi syarat, dibatasi sebesar CHF 700 per tahun untuk dewasa dan CHF 350 untuk anak-anak. Alat ini menambahkan premi yang Anda masukkan ke model pembagian biaya ini; itu tidak mengambil tarif perusahaan asuransi atau memutuskan opsi mana yang tepat untuk Anda.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Jika orang dewasa memasukkan premi bulanan CHF 400 dengan potongan CHF 300 dan CHF 350 dengan potongan CHF 2.500, selisih premi tahunannya adalah CHF 600. Bandingkan penghematan tersebut dengan perbedaan model dalam pembagian biaya pada masing-masing jumlah biaya yang memenuhi syarat rendah, diharapkan, dan tinggi.","How the estimate works":"Cara kerja perkiraan","Common questions":"Pertanyaan umum","Scope and exclusions":"Cakupan dan pengecualian","Where do I get the premiums?":"Di mana saya bisa mendapatkan preminya?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Gunakan penawaran bulanan saat ini untuk perusahaan asuransi, wilayah premi, kelompok usia, perlindungan kecelakaan, dan model asuransi yang sama. Priminfo adalah situs perbandingan resmi federal. Halaman ini tidak mengambil atau mereproduksi penawaran perusahaan asuransi.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Apakah semua tingkat pengurangan yang tercantum selalu ditawarkan?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Tidak. Perusahaan asuransi tidak harus menawarkan setiap tingkat opsional, dan penawaran dapat berbeda untuk dewasa muda. Masukkan hanya premi yang tertera pada polis Anda; biarkan opsi yang tidak tersedia kosong.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Apakah ini menunjukkan tagihan medis lengkap saya?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Tidak. Model ini mencakup biaya retensi biasa yang dapat dikurangkan dan standar sebesar 10% untuk biaya yang memenuhi syarat. Ini tidak termasuk iuran harian rumah sakit, retensi obat khusus sebesar 40%, layanan yang dikecualikan, perawatan yang tidak ditanggung, dan asuransi tambahan.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Ini adalah perbandingan skenario, bukan nasihat asuransi, medis, atau keuangan. Itu tidak memprediksi perawatan atau premi Anda. Ini tidak termasuk kontribusi hari rumah sakit (biasanya CHF 15 per hari rawat inap, dengan pengecualian menurut undang-undang), retensi khusus sebesar 40% untuk obat-obatan tertentu, pengecualian kehamilan/pencegahan, layanan di luar perlindungan wajib, subsidi premi dan asuransi tambahan. Oleh karena itu, pembayaran bersama yang sebenarnya dapat berbeda. Pengurangan yang lebih tinggi berarti Anda harus mampu membayar lebih banyak di muka jika Anda menerima perawatan.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Siapa yang diasuransikan berdasarkan polis ini?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Dewasa (usia 19 tahun ke atas)","Child (under 18)":"Anak (di bawah 18 tahun)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Skenario biaya pengobatan tahunan yang rendah (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Perkiraan biaya pengobatan tahunan yang memenuhi syarat (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Skenario biaya pengobatan tahunan yang tinggi (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Premi bulanan dari satu perusahaan asuransi","Monthly premium":"Premi bulanan","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Masukkan hanya opsi yang ditawarkan untuk kebijakan yang sama ini. Biarkan yang lain kosong.","Adult deductible choices":"Pilihan yang dapat dikurangkan untuk orang dewasa","Child deductible choices":"Pilihan yang dapat dikurangkan dari anak","Compare annual costs":"Bandingkan biaya tahunan","Clear entries":"Hapus entri","Download CSV":"Unduh CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Perkiraan premi tahunan ditambah pembagian biaya","Deductible":"Dapat dikurangkan","Annual premiums":"Premi tahunan","Total at low costs":"Total dengan biaya rendah","Total at expected costs":"Total sesuai biaya yang diharapkan","Total at high costs":"Total dengan biaya tinggi","Cost sharing at low costs":"Pembagian biaya dengan biaya rendah","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Pembagian biaya dengan biaya yang diharapkan","Cost sharing at high costs":"Pembagian biaya dengan biaya tinggi","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Selisih dari pengurangan terendah yang tersedia","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Biaya pengobatan dimana tabungan premi habis","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Penghematan premi yang dimasukkan tidak dibatalkan dalam rentang pembagian biaya yang dimodelkan.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Tidak ada penghematan premi terhadap pengurangan terendah.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Total ekspektasi terendah di antara opsi yang dimasukkan","Scenario details":"Rincian skenario","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Masukkan tiga skenario biaya medis yang dipesan dan premi bulanan untuk setidaknya dua pengurangan yang tersedia.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Aturan resmi dan premi saat ini:","Federal deductible rules":"Aturan pengurangan federal","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Perbandingan premium resmi Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Perbandingan dihitung di browser ini.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Periksa kelompok usia, skenario biaya yang dipesan, dan setidaknya dua premi bulanan.","Entries cleared.":"Entri dihapus.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV diunduh secara lokal.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Kalkulator Pengurangan Premium Kesehatan Swiss","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Kalkulator Subsidi Premium Swiss — Premium Bersih Anda","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Hitung premi bersih asuransi kesehatan Swiss dari premi saat ini dan pengurangan bulanan yang telah diberikan oleh wilayah Anda.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Masukkan premi dan pengurangan bulanan yang dikonfirmasi dari perusahaan asuransi atau keputusan wilayah Anda. Alat ini tidak menentukan apakah Anda memenuhi syarat.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Kanton Swiss menentukan siapa yang memenuhi syarat, berapa banyak dukungan yang diberikan dan apakah permohonan diperlukan. Kalkulator ini hanya mengurangi pengurangan bulanan yang dikonfirmasi dari satu premi polis dan menunjukkan jumlah tahunannya.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Jika premi bulanan adalah CHF 420 dan pengurangan yang dikonfirmasi adalah CHF 120, perkiraan premi bersih adalah CHF 300 per bulan.","How the calculation works":"Cara kerja perhitungan","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Apakah ini memberi tahu saya apakah saya memenuhi syarat?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Tidak. Kelayakan dan jumlah penghargaan ditentukan oleh wilayah tempat tinggal. Gunakan informasi resmi yang tertaut atau hubungi kantor kewilayahan.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Di mana saya dapat menemukan jumlah pengurangannya?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Gunakan keputusan saat ini atau pengurangan premi yang ditunjukkan oleh perusahaan asuransi Anda. Beberapa kanton memberikan pengurangan secara otomatis; yang lain memerlukan aplikasi.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Ini adalah aritmatika untuk satu polis, bukan keputusan kelayakan atau manfaat. Ini tidak menghitung pendapatan rumah tangga, aset, status keluarga, tenggat waktu, ambang batas wilayah atau hak permohonan. Premi dan penghargaan dapat berubah; konfirmasikan dengan perusahaan asuransi dan wilayah Anda.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Premi bulanan saat ini (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Pengurangan bulanan sudah diberikan (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Masukkan jumlah yang dikonfirmasi oleh wilayah atau perusahaan asuransi; jangan gunakan perkiraan sebagai penghargaan.","Calculate net premium":"Hitung premi bersih","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Masukkan premi saat ini dan pengurangan yang dikonfirmasi.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Perkiraan premi setelah pengurangan","Current monthly premium":"Premi bulanan saat ini","Monthly reduction":"Pengurangan bulanan","Estimated net monthly premium":"Perkiraan premi bulanan bersih","Reduction over 12 months":"Pengurangan selama 12 bulan","Reduction as a share of premium":"Pengurangan sebagai bagian premi","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Perhitungan selesai. Konfirmasikan penghargaan dan tanggal efektif dengan wilayah dan perusahaan asuransi Anda.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Pastikan pengurangannya tidak lebih besar dari premi bulanan.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Kalkulator Skenario Tarif Referensi Sewa Swiss","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Kalkulator Penyesuaian Sewa Swiss — Skenario Tarif Referensi","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Perkirakan hanya bagaimana perubahan suku bunga referensi hipotek Swiss mempengaruhi sewa bersih perumahan. Gunakan tarif terbaru dari kantor perumahan federal.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Bandingkan tarif referensi yang tercantum dalam sewa atau pemberitahuan sewa terbaru Anda dengan tarif resmi Swiss saat ini. Perhitungannya tetap ada di perangkat Anda.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Kantor Federal untuk Perumahan menerbitkan satu tingkat referensi hipotek untuk penyesuaian sewa Swiss setiap kuartal. Peningkatan sebesar 0,25 poin persentase pada prinsipnya memungkinkan kenaikan sewa sebesar 3%; penurunan sebesar 0,25 poin pada prinsipnya dapat menyebabkan penurunan sebesar 2,91%. Skenario ini menerapkan perubahan tersebut selangkah demi selangkah pada sewa bersih yang Anda masukkan.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Untuk sewa bersih bulanan CHF 3.000, penurunan tarif referensi dari 1,75% menjadi 1,50% memberikan perkiraan perubahan hanya tarif referensi sekitar −CHF 87,38 per bulan (−2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Cara kerja perkiraan ini","Where do I find the current rate?":"Di mana saya bisa menemukan tarif saat ini?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Buka halaman Kantor Federal untuk Perumahan dan masukkan tarif yang dipublikasikan saat ini. Alat ini tidak menyematkan tarif yang mungkin sudah ketinggalan zaman.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Apakah ini menentukan apakah saya dapat meminta perubahan sewa?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Tidak. Ini mengisolasi satu faktor untuk orientasi. Kontrak Anda, inflasi, perubahan biaya, reservasi, dan ketentuan hukum lainnya dapat mengubah hasilnya.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Apakah hasilnya sudah termasuk biaya tambahan?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Tidak. Masukkan sewa bersih bulanan, tidak termasuk biaya tambahan dan biaya variabel lainnya.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Hasilnya adalah skenario tarif referensi ilustratif, bukan opini hukum atau tinjauan sewa lengkap. Ini tidak termasuk inflasi, perubahan biaya umum, perbaikan, reservasi kontrak, harga sewa yang diindeks atau bertahap, tanggal pemberitahuan dan prosedur kewilayahan. Periksa sewa Anda dan panduan resmi sebelum bertindak.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Sewa perumahan Swiss: perkiraan efek tingkat referensi hipotek saja. Ini bukan keputusan hukum atau tinjauan sewa penuh.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Sewa bersih bulanan saat ini (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Tarif referensi tercantum dalam sewa Anda atau pemberitahuan sewa terakhir (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Tingkat referensi resmi Swiss saat ini (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Hitung skenario tarif referensi","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Skenario hanya tingkat referensi","Current monthly net rent":"Sewa bersih bulanan saat ini","Reference-rate change":"Perubahan tingkat referensi","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Perkiraan efek bulanan dari suku bunga referensi","Scenario monthly net rent":"Skenario sewa bersih bulanan","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Efek tahunan selama 12 bulan dengan laju yang sama","potential increase":"potensi peningkatan","potential decrease":"potensi penurunan","no reference-rate change":"tidak ada perubahan tarif referensi","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Perkiraan berlaku 3% untuk setiap kenaikan 0,25 poin persentase dan pengurangan kebalikan yang setara untuk setiap penurunan. Faktor lain dapat mengubah hasilnya.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Ini tidak termasuk inflasi, perubahan biaya umum, perbaikan, reservasi kontrak, harga sewa yang diindeks atau bertahap, tanggal pemberitahuan, atau persyaratan prosedur lokal. Periksa sewa Anda dan panduan Kantor Federal untuk Perumahan.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Periksa tarif dan panduan resmi terbaru","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Kantor Federal Swiss untuk Perumahan (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Masukkan harga sewa dan kedua tarif untuk melihat skenario.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Skenario dihitung. Verifikasi tanggal dan ketentuan kontrak sebelum mengandalkannya.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Periksa jumlah dan tarif. Tarif harus antara 0% dan 5% dan berbeda dalam langkah 0,25 poin.","Inputs cleared.":"Input dihapus.","Result":"Hasil","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Penaksir Akrual Liburan Swiss","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Kalkulator Akrual Liburan Swiss — Saldo Cuti Prorata","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Perkirakan saldo hari libur Swiss dari cuti tahunan dalam kontrak Anda, minggu kerja, tanggal kerja, dan hari yang sudah diambil.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Perkirakan cuti berbayar yang diprorata selama satu tahun kalender menggunakan hak dan jadwal kerja yang Anda masukkan. Tidak ada ketentuan kontrak yang dapat ditebak.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Estimator memprorata hari cuti tahunan dalam kontrak Anda dengan hari kalender yang digunakan pada tahun yang dipilih. Untuk pekerjaan paruh waktu, masukkan hari kerja biasa Anda per minggu dan cuti tahunan dalam minggu.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Dengan cuti empat minggu, lima hari kerja dalam seminggu, dan bekerja sepanjang tahun, hak tahunan adalah 20 hari kerja sebelum dikurangi cuti yang telah diambil.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Berapa batas minimum menurut undang-undang Swiss?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Panduan federal menyatakan setidaknya empat minggu per tahun layanan, dan lima minggu untuk pekerja yang belum mencapai usia 20 tahun. Kontrak atau kesepakatan bersama dapat memberikan lebih banyak minggu kerja.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Apakah ini menentukan keseimbangan hukum saya?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Tidak. Ini adalah prorata hari kalender yang sederhana. Persyaratan kontrak, aturan kolektif yang berlaku, ketidakhadiran yang memenuhi syarat, pembulatan, dan catatan pemberi kerja dapat mengubah keseimbangan.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Perkiraan ini tidak menentukan hak hukum atau menghitung pembayaran liburan. Hal ini tidak termasuk pengurangan untuk ketidakhadiran tertentu yang berkepanjangan, aturan akrual dan pembulatan yang spesifik pada kontrak, hari libur nasional, lembur, tenggat waktu pengalihan, dan perselisihan. Periksa kontrak Anda dan dapatkan saran untuk saldo yang diperebutkan.","Leave year":"Tinggalkan tahun","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Cuti tahunan dalam kontrak Anda (minggu)","Usual working days per week":"Hari kerja biasa per minggu","Employment start date":"Tanggal mulai bekerja","Employment end date":"Tanggal akhir pekerjaan","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Hari cuti yang telah diambil pada tahun cuti ini","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Untuk orientasi saja. Masukkan hak tahunan kontraktual; batas minimum yang sah umumnya adalah empat minggu, atau lima minggu untuk pekerja di bawah 20 tahun.","Estimate balance":"Perkiraan saldo","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Masukkan kontrak dan tanggal Anda untuk memperkirakan saldo.","Estimated leave balance":"Perkiraan saldo cuti","Annual leave at this schedule":"Cuti tahunan pada jadwal ini","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Kalender hari kerja pada tahun cuti ini","Prorated days accrued":"Hari yang diprorata bertambah","Days already taken":"Hari sudah berlalu","Estimated days remaining":"Perkiraan hari tersisa","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Ini memprorata cuti tahunan berdasarkan hari kalender dalam masa kerja. Aturan pemberi kerja dan kontrak mungkin berbeda.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Perkiraan dihitung. Periksa berdasarkan kontrak dan catatan perusahaan Anda.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Periksa tahun, tanggal, jadwal kerja dan nilai."},"hi":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"स्विस बेरोजगारी भत्ता परिदृश्य","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"स्विस बेरोजगारी लाभ कैलकुलेटर — सकल परिदृश्य","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"बीमाकृत वेतन और आपके फंड द्वारा पुष्टि की गई दर का उपयोग करके सकल स्विस दैनिक भत्ते का अनुमान लगाएं।","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"बीमाकृत वेतन और आपके बेरोजगारी कोष द्वारा पुष्टि की गई 70% या 80% दर दर्ज करें।","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"स्विस नियम भत्ता दर और वेतन सीमा निर्धारित करते हैं। फंड पात्रता, कटौतियाँ, प्रतीक्षा दिवस और पात्रता तय करता है। मासिक सीमा 20-23 देय कार्यदिवसों को दर्शाती है।","Example":"उदाहरण","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5,000 70% पर लगभग CHF 161.29 प्रति देय कार्यदिवस है।","How it works":"यह कैसे काम करता है","Questions":"प्रश्न","Scope and limits":"दायरा और सीमाएँ","Related tools":"संबंधित उपकरण","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"मासिक बीमाकृत वेतन (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"फंड द्वारा दर की पुष्टि की गई","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"अनुमान","Clear":"साफ़ करें","Gross scenario":"सकल परिदृश्य","Insured salary used":"बीमाकृत वेतन का उपयोग किया गया","Per payable weekday":"प्रति देय कार्यदिवस","20-day month":"20 दिन का महीना","23-day month":"23 दिन का महीना","Official benefit rules":"आधिकारिक लाभ नियम","Enter your confirmed figures.":"अपने पुष्टि किए गए आंकड़े दर्ज करें।","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"परिदृश्य की गणना। अपने फंड के साथ राशि की पुष्टि करें।","Check the values.":"मानों की जाँच करें।","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"स्विस किरायेदारी नोटिस प्लानर","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"स्विस रेंटल नोटिस प्लानर और लेटर ड्राफ्ट","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"अपने अनुबंध की तारीखों और शर्तों से किरायेदारी नोटिस की योजना बनाएं; कैंटन नियमों को माने बिना एक पत्र का मसौदा तैयार करें।","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"नोटिस अवधि, अपने अनुबंध में अगला वैध समाप्ति दिवस और प्राप्ति तिथि दर्ज करें। अपने मकान मालिक या किरायेदारों के संघ से प्रत्येक तारीख की जाँच करें।","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"प्लानर केवल आपके द्वारा प्रदान की गई तारीखें और अवधि लागू करता है। यह तय नहीं करता कि नोटिस वैध है या नहीं, यह कानूनी रूप से कब प्राप्त हुआ, या कोई विशेष सुरक्षा लागू होती है या नहीं।","Contract notice period (months)":"अनुबंध सूचना अवधि (महीने)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"महीने का अगला वैध समाप्ति दिन (अनुबंध से)","Expected receipt date":"अपेक्षित प्राप्ति तिथि","Your name":"आपका नाम","Your address":"आपका पता","Landlord / agency":"मकान मालिक/एजेंसी","Recipient address":"प्राप्तकर्ता का पता","Rental property":"किराये की संपत्ति","Place":"स्थान","Letter date":"पत्र दिनांक","Termination of tenancy":"किरायेदारी की समाप्ति","Calculate date and draft letter":"तिथि और ड्राफ्ट पत्र की गणना करें","Planning date":"योजना तिथि","Target date":"लक्ष्य तिथि","Editable draft":"संपादन योग्य ड्राफ्ट","Copy draft":"ड्राफ्ट कॉपी करें","Enter your contract terms.":"अपने अनुबंध की शर्तें दर्ज करें।","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"योजना ड्राफ्ट तैयार। अपने अनुबंध के विरुद्ध सत्यापित करें.","Check the dates and period.":"दिनांक और अवधि की जाँच करें।","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"परिणाम आपूर्ति किए गए अनुबंध नोटिस दिवस के बाद आता है; यह कोई वैधानिक नोटिस निर्णय नहीं है।","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"स्विस संपत्ति लाभ परिदृश्य","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"स्विस संपत्ति लाभ कर - उपयोगकर्ता द्वारा दर्ज दर परिदृश्य","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"अपनी स्वयं की लेनदेन लागत और जिम्मेदार कैंटन से कर की दर का उपयोग करके संपत्ति लाभ का अनुमान लगाएं।","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"आय, अधिग्रहण लागत, आपके द्वारा पुष्टि किए गए योग्य खर्च और आधिकारिक कैंटोनल कैलकुलेटर से प्रभावी दर दर्ज करें।","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"स्विस संपत्ति लाभ कर कैंटन, होल्डिंग अवधि, कटौती और मामले के अनुसार भिन्न होता है। यह उपकरण दरें प्रदान नहीं करता है या स्वीकार्य लागत निर्धारित नहीं करता है।","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"बिक्री आय (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"अधिग्रहण लागत (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"अन्य लागत स्वीकार्य पुष्टि (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"आधिकारिक स्रोत से प्रभावी कर दर (%)","Estimate scenario":"अनुमान परिदृश्य","Illustrative scenario":"चित्रणात्मक परिदृश्य","Gain entered":"लाभ दर्ज हुआ","Tax at entered rate":"दर्ज दर पर कर","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"अपने रिकॉर्ड और कैंटन स्रोत से आंकड़े दर्ज करें।","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"परिदृश्य की गणना; इसे कैंटन से सत्यापित करें।","Check amounts and rate.":"राशि और दर की जाँच करें।","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"कोई कैंटन टैक्स तालिका एम्बेडेड नहीं है; आपकी दर्ज की गई प्रभावी दर अनुमान को संचालित करती है।","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"स्विस विरासत और उपहार कर परिदृश्य","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"स्विस विरासत और उपहार कर - आपका दर परिदृश्य","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"उपयोगकर्ता द्वारा दर्ज छूट और दर से कर योग्य राशि का अनुमान लगाएं; कैंटन और संबंध के अनुसार नियम अलग-अलग होते हैं।","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"प्राप्तकर्ता और कैंटन के लिए पुष्टि की गई राशि, छूट और प्रभावी दर दर्ज करें।","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"कैंटन नियम और पारिवारिक संबंध छूट और दरों को बदल सकते हैं। यह उपकरण कैंटन नियम का चयन नहीं करता है या कर दायित्व निर्धारित नहीं करता है।","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"विरासत या उपहार राशि (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"कैंटन (CHF) के साथ छूट की पुष्टि की गई","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"कैंटन के साथ प्रभावी दर की पुष्टि (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"छूट दर्ज करने के बाद राशि","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"अपने मामले के लिए पुष्टि किए गए आंकड़े दर्ज करें।","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"अनुमान केवल आपके द्वारा दर्ज छूट और दर का उपयोग करता है।","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"स्विस बाल सहायता बजट परिदृश्य","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"स्विस बाल सहायता बजट — पारदर्शी घरेलू परिदृश्य","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"प्रवेशित प्रत्यक्ष-लागत क्रेडिट के बाद माता-पिता की आय द्वारा दर्ज किए गए बच्चे के बजट को आवंटित करें।","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"बच्चे की प्रलेखित मासिक आवश्यकताओं, माता-पिता दोनों की उपलब्ध मासिक आय और किसी भी प्रत्यक्ष लागत का उपयोग करें जिसे आप क्रेडिट करना चाहते हैं।","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"यह केवल एक योजना वर्कशीट है। यह कोई स्विस बाल-रखरखाव पुरस्कार या कानूनी पद्धति नहीं है; आवास, देखभाल, कर, लाभ और केस कानून का मूल्यांकन नहीं किया जाता है।","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"आपके द्वारा प्रलेखित मासिक बाल बजट (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"अभिभावक A उपलब्ध मासिक आय (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"पैरेंट बी उपलब्ध मासिक आय (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"माता-पिता ए द्वारा क्रेडिट के लिए भुगतान की गई प्रत्यक्ष बच्चे की लागत (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"परिदृश्य आवंटित करें","Illustrative allocation":"चित्रात्मक आवंटन","Parent A remaining contribution":"अभिभावक एक शेष योगदान","Parent B contribution":"पैरेंट बी योगदान","Entered monthly child budget":"मासिक शिशु बजट दर्ज किया गया","Enter your household budget figures.":"अपने घरेलू बजट के आंकड़े दर्ज करें।","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"बजट परिदृश्य की गणना; किसी योग्य सलाहकार से कानूनी दायित्वों पर चर्चा करें।","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"राशि की जाँच करें; क्रेडिट बजट से अधिक नहीं हो सकता.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"शेयर दो दर्ज आय के आनुपातिक हैं; प्रत्यक्ष-लागत क्रेडिट पहले घटाया जाता है।","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"ब्राउज़र हाइफ़नेशन पूर्वावलोकन","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"वर्ड हाइफ़नेशन पूर्वावलोकन — ब्राउज़र भाषा पैटर्न","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"आपके द्वारा प्रदान किए गए पाठ के लिए ब्राउज़र हाइफ़नेशन का पूर्वावलोकन करें; समर्थन ब्राउज़र और स्थापित भाषा संसाधनों पर निर्भर करता है।","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"वह भाषा चुनें जो आपके टेक्स्ट से मेल खाती हो, एक नमूना दर्ज करें और उपलब्ध लाइन चौड़ाई समायोजित करें।","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"ब्राउज़र के मूल CSS हाइफ़नेशन का उपयोग करता है। यह शब्दकोशों का बंडल नहीं बनाता; असमर्थित ब्राउज़र कोई हाइफ़न नहीं दिखा सकते हैं। पाठ की प्रतिलिपि बनाने से मूल वर्तनी बनी रहती है।","Text language (BCP 47)":"पाठ भाषा (बीसीपी 47)","Preview width (characters)":"पूर्वावलोकन चौड़ाई (अक्षर)","Text to preview":"पूर्वावलोकन के लिए पाठ","Preview":"पूर्वावलोकन","Enter text and choose its language.":"टेक्स्ट दर्ज करें और उसकी भाषा चुनें।","Preview updated.":"पूर्वावलोकन अद्यतन किया गया।","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"समर्थित भाषा टैग और टेक्स्ट दर्ज करें।","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"ब्राउज़र शब्दों को कहाँ तोड़ सकता है यह देखने के लिए अलग-अलग चौड़ाई पर एक ही पैराग्राफ आज़माएँ।","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"निजी वर्तनी जांच कार्यस्थान","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"स्थानीय वर्तनी जांचकर्ता - अपने ब्राउज़र शब्दकोश का उपयोग करें","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"ब्राउज़र की मूल वर्तनी जांच के साथ टेक्स्ट संपादित करें, एक भाषा चुनें और सही टेक्स्ट की प्रतिलिपि बनाएँ।","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"पाठ इस पृष्ठ में रहता है। वह भाषा सेट करें जिसके लिए आपके ब्राउज़र में वर्तनी शब्दकोश है, फिर उसके वर्तनी मेनू का उपयोग करें या सुझावों को रेखांकित करें।","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"यह कार्यक्षेत्र टेक्स्ट अपलोड नहीं करता है या शब्दकोश नहीं भेजता है। ब्राउज़र वर्तनी जांच की उपलब्धता और सुझाव डिवाइस, ब्राउज़र और स्थापित शब्दकोश पर निर्भर करते हैं।","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"वर्तनी जांच भाषा (बीसीपी 47)","Text to check":"जाँचने के लिए पाठ","Copy text":"टेक्स्ट कॉपी करें","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"टेक्स्ट टाइप या पेस्ट करें। सुझावों के लिए राइट-क्लिक करें या अपने डिवाइस वर्तनी मेनू का उपयोग करें।","Text copied.":"पाठ कॉपी किया गया।","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"स्वचालित रूप से प्रतिलिपि नहीं बनाई जा सकी; टेक्स्ट चुनें और कॉपी करें.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"मिलान शब्दकोश के बिना ब्राउज़र गलत वर्तनी को चिह्नित नहीं कर सकता है।","Resume Structure Checker":"रेज़्यूमे स्ट्रक्चर चेकर","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS रेज़्यूमे चेकर - मुफ़्त स्थानीय पीडीएफ और DOCX समीक्षा","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"अपने ब्राउज़र में बायोडाटा टेक्स्ट, शीर्षक, अनुभाग, लिंक और बुलेट संरचना की जांच करें। गिनती के आधार पर नौकरी-विवरण शर्तों की तुलना करें; कोई नियुक्ति स्कोर या अपलोड नहीं।","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"समीक्षा करें कि टेक्स्ट-आधारित बायोडाटा वास्तव में क्या उजागर करता है: निकाला गया टेक्स्ट, शीर्षक संरचना, संपर्क-क्षेत्र उपस्थिति, लिंक और आम तौर पर मान्यता प्राप्त अनुभाग। वैकल्पिक रूप से दोहराई गई नौकरी-विवरण शर्तों की तुलना करें।","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"अनुभव और शिक्षा के लिए शीर्षक 1 शैलियों वाला एक DOCX उन शीर्षकों को दिखाता है। एक पीडीएफ की जाँच उसके चयन योग्य पाठ से की जाती है; कॉलम को भिन्न क्रम में पढ़ा जा सकता है।","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX फ़ाइलों का स्थानीय स्तर पर Office ZIP/XML के रूप में निरीक्षण किया जाता है। पीडीएफ को एक स्थगित स्थानीय पीडीएफ.जेएस इंजन के साथ पढ़ा जाता है। वैकल्पिक कार्य-विवरण तुलना प्रत्येक पाठ में चयनित शब्दों की गणना करती है; यह कोई स्कोर नहीं बनाता या यह अनुशंसा नहीं करता कि किसी को नौकरी पर रखा जाए या नहीं।","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"यह एक प्रारूप और पाठ-संरचना जांच है, न कि एटीएस सिम्युलेटर, कानूनी समीक्षा या साक्षात्कार की सफलता की भविष्यवाणी। चयन योग्य पाठ के बिना स्कैन की गई पीडीएफ को पहले ओसीआर की आवश्यकता होती है। पासवर्ड-संरक्षित, मैक्रो-सक्षम, हस्ताक्षरित या असामान्य रूप से बड़े दस्तावेज़ समर्थित नहीं हैं।","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"एक बायोडाटा चुनें (पीडीएफ या DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"आपकी फ़ाइलें इस ब्राउज़र में रहती हैं और अपलोड नहीं की जाती हैं। अधिकतम 20 एमबी; 50 पेज तक की पीडीएफ. DOCX विस्तारित सामग्री की अधिकतम सीमा 80 एमबी है।","Optional job description":"वैकल्पिक नौकरी विवरण","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"यदि आप शब्द-आवृत्ति तुलना चाहते हैं तो सादा पाठ चिपकाएँ। ऐसी संवेदनशील जानकारी शामिल न करें जिसका आपको विश्लेषण करने की आवश्यकता नहीं है।","Paste job-description text here…":"नौकरी-विवरण पाठ यहाँ चिपकाएँ…","Analyze locally":"स्थानीय स्तर पर विश्लेषण करें","Clear files and report":"फ़ाइलें साफ़ करें और रिपोर्ट करें","Resume review":"समीक्षा फिर से शुरू करें","File type":"फ़ाइल प्रकार","Extracted characters":"निकाले गए अक्षर","Words counted":"शब्द गिने गए","Detected headings":"पता लगाया गया शीर्षक","Recognized sections":"मान्यता प्राप्त अनुभाग","Hyperlinks found":"हाइपरलिंक मिले","Bullet paragraphs":"बुलेट पैराग्राफ","An email address appears in the text":"पाठ में एक ईमेल पता दिखाई देता है","No email address pattern was detected":"कोई ईमेल पता पैटर्न नहीं पाया गया","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"पाठ में एक फ़ोन-नंबर जैसा पैटर्न दिखाई देता है","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"कोई फ़ोन-नंबर जैसा पैटर्न नहीं पाया गया","Job-description terms (counts only)":"नौकरी-वर्णन शर्तें (केवल मायने रखती हैं)","Term":"अवधि","In job text":"कार्य पाठ में","In resume":"रेज़्यूमे में","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"अवधि संख्या की तुलना करने के लिए कार्य विवरण चिपकाएँ।","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"कोई स्पष्ट शीर्षक शैली नहीं पाई गई। पीडीएफ शीर्षकों का अनुमान पाठ के आकार से लगाया जाता है और वे गलत हो सकते हैं।","Detected":"पता चला","Not detected":"पता नहीं चला","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"यह अनुमान सामान्य अनुभाग नामों के सीमित सेट को पहचानता है; यह तय नहीं करता कि कौन से अनुभाग आवश्यक हैं।","Profile / summary":"प्रोफ़ाइल/सारांश","Experience":"अनुभव","Education":"शिक्षा","Skills":"कौशल","Contact":"संपर्क करें","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"कोई चयन योग्य पाठ नहीं मिला। केवल स्कैन की गई पीडीएफ को जांचने से पहले ओसीआर की आवश्यकता होती है।","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"शुरू करने के लिए एक PDF या DOCX बायोडाटा चुनें।","Reading the selected file locally…":"चयनित फ़ाइल को स्थानीय रूप से पढ़ा जा रहा है...","Local structure review complete.":"स्थानीय संरचना समीक्षा पूर्ण।","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"यह ब्राउज़र आवश्यक स्थानीय दस्तावेज़ सुविधा का समर्थन नहीं करता है।","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"बताई गई स्थानीय सीमा तक एक वैध PDF या आधुनिक DOCX फ़ाइल चुनें।","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"पीडीएफ पढ़ा नहीं जा सका। यह क्षतिग्रस्त हो सकता है, एन्क्रिप्टेड हो सकता है या इसमें कोई चयन योग्य टेक्स्ट नहीं हो सकता है।","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX पैकेज को सुरक्षित रूप से खोला या पढ़ा नहीं जा सका।","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"क्या यह टूल मेरा बायोडाटा अपलोड या सेव करता है?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"नहीं। पार्सिंग और विश्लेषण आपके ब्राउज़र में चलता है। आपके द्वारा रिपोर्ट साफ़ करने या पेज छोड़ने के बाद फ़ाइल टेक्स्ट सर्वर पर नहीं भेजा जाता है या रखा नहीं जाता है।","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"क्या यह भविष्यवाणी करता है कि कोई एटीएस या नियोक्ता मेरा बायोडाटा स्वीकार करेगा या नहीं?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"नहीं। यह केवल पढ़ने योग्य पाठ और सरल संरचना की जाँच करता है। नियुक्ति प्रणालियाँ अलग-अलग होती हैं, और यह एटीएस अनुकूलता गारंटी या नियुक्ति संबंधी भविष्यवाणी नहीं है।","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"क्या यह स्कैन की गई पीडीएफ पढ़ सकता है?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"केवल तभी जब पीडीएफ में चयन योग्य टेक्स्ट परत हो। यह चेकर OCR मॉडल डाउनलोड नहीं करता है; केवल-स्कैन किए गए दस्तावेज़ के लिए पहले OCR टूल का उपयोग करें।","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"कार्य-विवरण तुलना का क्या अर्थ है?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"यह साधारण सामान्यीकरण के बाद आवर्ती शब्दों की गिनती दिखाता है। यह आपकी योग्यता का मिलान प्रतिशत, रैंकिंग, अनुशंसा या मूल्यांकन नहीं है।","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"पीडीएफ DOCX की तुलना में कम शीर्षक क्यों दिखाता है?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"पीडीएफ आमतौर पर अर्थ संबंधी शीर्षक शैलियों को संरक्षित नहीं करते हैं। चेकर पाठ के आकार और पढ़ने के क्रम से प्रमुख पंक्तियों का अनुमान लगाता है, इसलिए कॉलम और दृश्य डिज़ाइन परिणाम को प्रभावित कर सकते हैं।","How local resume review works":"स्थानीय बायोडाटा समीक्षा कैसे काम करती है","Resume checker questions":"रेज़्यूमे चेकर प्रश्न","Scope and limitations":"दायरा और सीमाएँ","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"स्थानीय स्वर और संगत विभाजक","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"वोकल रिमूवर - स्थानीय स्तर पर स्वर और संगत को अलग करें","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"अपने ब्राउज़र में अनुमानित स्वर और संगत में एक छोटा स्टीरियो ऑडियो नमूना अलग करें। ऑडियो आपके डिवाइस पर रहता है; मॉडल को इसके सार्वजनिक होस्ट से डाउनलोड किया गया है।","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"30 सेकंड तक का स्टीरियो संगीत क्लिप चुनें। पहले उपयोग पर, ब्राउज़र 35.6 एमबी मॉडल डाउनलोड करता है। ऑडियो फ़ाइल इस डिवाइस पर संसाधित की जाती है और कभी अपलोड नहीं की जाती है।","What you get":"आपको क्या मिलेगा","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"दो WAV स्टेम का पूर्वावलोकन करें और डाउनलोड करें: अनुमानित स्वर और अवशिष्ट संगत। परिणाम मिश्रण पर निर्भर करते हैं और उनमें कलाकृतियाँ हो सकती हैं।","Local processing":"स्थानीय प्रसंस्करण","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"यह टूल ONNX और ONNX रनटाइम वेब पर निर्यात किए गए ओपन-अनमिक्स UMX-HQ वोकल्स नेटवर्क का उपयोग करता है। मॉडल तभी प्राप्त होता है जब आप अलग दबाते हैं; किसी सशुल्क अनुमान एपीआई या सदस्यता का उपयोग नहीं किया जाता है। ऑडियो को स्थानीय स्तर पर डिकोड, संसाधित और निर्यात किया जाता है।","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"यह स्टीरियो 44.1 kHz प्रोसेसिंग और 30 सेकंड तक क्लिप के लिए एक अनुमान है। मोनो स्रोतों को स्टीरियो में डुप्लिकेट किया गया है। वाद्ययंत्रों, भारी प्रभावों, लाइव रिकॉर्डिंग और असामान्य शैलियों में गहराई से मिश्रित स्वर लीक या कलाकृतियों का उत्पादन कर सकते हैं। परिणाम का उपयोग क्लीन मास्टर के रूप में न करें। मॉडल डाउनलोड के लिए इंटरनेट कनेक्शन की आवश्यकता होती है; ऑडियो इस डिवाइस को नहीं छोड़ता.","Is my audio uploaded?":"क्या मेरा ऑडियो अपलोड किया गया है?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"नहीं। चयनित ऑडियो आपके ब्राउज़र में डिकोड और संसाधित किया जाता है। जब आप अलग होना शुरू करते हैं तो एकमात्र नेटवर्क अनुरोध मॉडल डाउनलोड होता है।","Why is the first run slow?":"पहला रन धीमा क्यों है?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"ब्राउज़र एक बार 35.6 एमबी मॉडल डाउनलोड करता है; ब्राउज़र इसे कैश कर सकता है. फिर अनुमान डिवाइस सीपीयू पर स्थानीय रूप से चलता है।","Will every song separate cleanly?":"क्या हर गाना साफ़-साफ़ अलग होगा?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"नहीं। मॉडल एक स्वर स्टेम का अनुमान लगाता है और स्वर रिसाव छोड़ सकता है, उपकरण हार्मोनिक्स को हटा सकता है या कलाकृतियाँ बना सकता है। किसी तने पर भरोसा करने से पहले सुनें.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"स्टीरियो ऑडियो फ़ाइल (30 सेकंड तक)","Choose audio":"ऑडियो चुनें","Separate vocals":"अलग स्वर","Cancel / clear":"रद्द करें/स्पष्ट करें","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"शुरू करने के लिए एक छोटी ऑडियो फ़ाइल चुनें।","Downloading the separation model…":"पृथक्करण मॉडल डाउनलोड हो रहा है…","Separating locally…":"स्थानीय रूप से अलग हो रहा है…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"पृथक्करण पूर्ण। किसी भी स्टेम का पूर्वावलोकन करें या डाउनलोड करें।","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"इस फ़ाइल को संसाधित नहीं किया जा सका या मॉडल लोड नहीं किया जा सका। प्रारूप और कनेक्शन की जाँच करें, फिर पुनः प्रयास करें।","Model and weight license information":"मॉडल और वजन लाइसेंस जानकारी","Estimated vocals":"अनुमानित स्वर","Estimated accompaniment":"अनुमानित संगत","Download WAV":"WAV डाउनलोड करें","Progress":"प्रगति","Preparing local separation…":"स्थानीय पृथक्करण की तैयारी…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"पृथक्करण पूर्ण। ऑडियो इस डिवाइस पर बना रहा.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"यह ऑडियो संसाधित नहीं किया जा सका। 30 सेकंड से कम समय की स्टीरियो संगीत फ़ाइल आज़माएँ।","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"स्विस स्वास्थ्य बीमा डिडक्टिबल तुलनित्र","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"स्विस स्वास्थ्य बीमा फ़्रैंचाइज़ कैलकुलेटर - वार्षिक लागतों की तुलना करें","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"प्रीमियम और आपके द्वारा दर्ज की गई योग्य वार्षिक चिकित्सा लागतों का उपयोग करके स्विस बुनियादी स्वास्थ्य बीमा कटौती की तुलना करें। किसी बीमाकर्ता उद्धरण का अनुमान नहीं लगाया गया है।","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"प्रत्येक कटौती योग्य राशि के लिए एक ही बीमाकर्ता द्वारा दिखाए गए मासिक प्रीमियम दर्ज करें, फिर कम, अपेक्षित और उच्च वार्षिक उपचार-लागत परिदृश्यों की तुलना करें।","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"अनिवार्य स्विस बुनियादी स्वास्थ्य बीमा के लिए, एक वयस्क मानक कटौती योग्य CHF 300 है और एक बच्चे की कटौती योग्य राशि CHF 0 है। वैकल्पिक स्तर आयु समूह के अनुसार भिन्न होते हैं। कटौती के बाद, मानक प्रतिधारण शुल्क पात्र शेष लागत का 10% है, जो वयस्कों के लिए CHF 700 प्रति वर्ष और बच्चों के लिए CHF 350 है। टूल आपके दर्ज किए गए प्रीमियम को इस मॉडल लागत साझाकरण में जोड़ता है; यह बीमाकर्ता दरें नहीं लाता है या यह तय नहीं करता है कि कौन सा विकल्प आपके लिए सही है।","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"यदि कोई वयस्क कटौती योग्य CHF 300 पर CHF 400 मासिक प्रीमियम और कटौती योग्य CHF 2,500 पर CHF 350 दर्ज करता है, तो वार्षिक प्रीमियम अंतर CHF 600 है। उस बचत की तुलना अपने प्रत्येक निम्न, अपेक्षित और उच्च पात्र-लागत राशि पर लागत साझाकरण में मॉडल किए गए अंतर से करें।","How the estimate works":"अनुमान कैसे काम करता है","Common questions":"सामान्य प्रश्न","Scope and exclusions":"दायरा और बहिष्करण","Where do I get the premiums?":"मुझे प्रीमियम कहां से मिलेगा?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"समान बीमाकर्ता, प्रीमियम क्षेत्र, आयु समूह, दुर्घटना कवर और बीमा मॉडल के लिए वर्तमान मासिक ऑफ़र का उपयोग करें। प्राइमइन्फो आधिकारिक संघीय तुलना साइट है। यह पृष्ठ बीमाकर्ता उद्धरण प्राप्त या पुनरुत्पादित नहीं करता है।","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"क्या सभी सूचीबद्ध कटौती योग्य स्तर हमेशा पेश किए जाते हैं?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"नहीं। बीमाकर्ताओं को हर वैकल्पिक स्तर की पेशकश करने की ज़रूरत नहीं है, और युवा वयस्कों के लिए ऑफ़र भिन्न हो सकते हैं। केवल अपनी पॉलिसी के लिए दिखाए गए प्रीमियम दर्ज करें; अनुपलब्ध विकल्पों को खाली छोड़ दें।","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"क्या यह मेरा पूरा मेडिकल बिल दिखाता है?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"नहीं। मॉडल पात्र लागतों पर सामान्य कटौती योग्य और मानक 10% प्रतिधारण शुल्क को कवर करता है। इसमें अस्पताल दिवस का योगदान, विशेष 40% दवा प्रतिधारण, छूट वाली सेवाएं, गैर-कवर देखभाल और पूरक बीमा शामिल नहीं है।","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"यह एक परिदृश्य तुलना है, बीमा, चिकित्सा या वित्तीय सलाह नहीं। यह आपके उपचार या प्रीमियम की भविष्यवाणी नहीं करता है। इसमें अस्पताल के दिन का योगदान (सामान्यतः वैधानिक छूट के साथ प्रति रोगी दिवस CHF 15), कुछ दवाओं पर विशेष 40% प्रतिधारण, मातृत्व/निवारक छूट, अनिवार्य कवर के बाहर की सेवाएं, प्रीमियम सब्सिडी और पूरक बीमा शामिल नहीं हैं। इसलिए वास्तविक सह-भुगतान भिन्न हो सकता है। अधिक कटौती योग्य का मतलब है कि यदि आपको देखभाल मिलती है तो आपको अधिक अग्रिम भुगतान करने में सक्षम होने की आवश्यकता है।","Who is insured under this policy?":"इस पॉलिसी के तहत किसका बीमा किया जाता है?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"वयस्क (उम्र 19 वर्ष या अधिक)","Child (under 18)":"बच्चा (18 वर्ष से कम)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"कम वार्षिक पात्र उपचार-लागत परिदृश्य (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"अपेक्षित वार्षिक पात्र उपचार लागत (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"उच्च वार्षिक पात्र उपचार-लागत परिदृश्य (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"एक बीमाकर्ता से मासिक प्रीमियम","Monthly premium":"मासिक प्रीमियम","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"केवल इसी पॉलिसी के लिए प्रस्तावित विकल्प दर्ज करें। दूसरों को खाली छोड़ें.","Adult deductible choices":"वयस्क कटौती योग्य विकल्प","Child deductible choices":"बाल कटौती योग्य विकल्प","Compare annual costs":"वार्षिक लागतों की तुलना करें","Clear entries":"प्रविष्टियाँ साफ़ करें","Download CSV":"CSV डाउनलोड करें","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"अनुमानित वार्षिक प्रीमियम प्लस लागत साझाकरण","Deductible":"कटौती योग्य","Annual premiums":"वार्षिक प्रीमियम","Total at low costs":"कम लागत पर कुल","Total at expected costs":"अपेक्षित लागत पर कुल","Total at high costs":"उच्च लागत पर कुल","Cost sharing at low costs":"कम लागत पर लागत साझाकरण","Cost sharing at expected costs":"अपेक्षित लागत पर लागत साझाकरण","Cost sharing at high costs":"उच्च लागत पर लागत साझाकरण","Difference from lowest available deductible":"न्यूनतम उपलब्ध कटौती योग्य से अंतर","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"चिकित्सा लागत जहां प्रीमियम बचत का उपयोग किया जाता है","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"मॉडल लागत-साझाकरण सीमा के भीतर दर्ज की गई प्रीमियम बचत रद्द नहीं की जाती है।","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"न्यूनतम कटौती योग्य पर कोई प्रीमियम बचत नहीं।","Lowest expected total among entered options":"प्रविष्ट विकल्पों में सबसे कम अपेक्षित कुल","Scenario details":"परिदृश्य विवरण","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"तीन आदेशित चिकित्सा-लागत परिदृश्य और कम से कम दो उपलब्ध कटौतियों के लिए मासिक प्रीमियम दर्ज करें।","Official rules and current premiums:":"आधिकारिक नियम और वर्तमान प्रीमियम:","Federal deductible rules":"संघीय कटौती योग्य नियम","Priminfo official premium comparison":"प्राइमइन्फो आधिकारिक प्रीमियम तुलना","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"इस ब्राउज़र में तुलना की गणना की गई।","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"आयु समूह, आदेशित लागत परिदृश्य और कम से कम दो मासिक प्रीमियम की जाँच करें।","Entries cleared.":"प्रविष्टियाँ साफ़ की गईं।","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV स्थानीय रूप से डाउनलोड किया गया।","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"स्विस स्वास्थ्य प्रीमियम कटौती कैलकुलेटर","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"स्विस प्रीमियम सब्सिडी कैलकुलेटर - आपका नेट प्रीमियम","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"वर्तमान प्रीमियम से शुद्ध स्विस स्वास्थ्य-बीमा प्रीमियम की गणना करें और आपके कैंटन द्वारा पहले ही दी गई मासिक कटौती की गणना करें।","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"प्रीमियम दर्ज करें और अपने बीमाकर्ता या कैंटोनल निर्णय से मासिक कटौती की पुष्टि करें। यह टूल यह तय नहीं करता कि आप योग्य हैं या नहीं।","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"स्विस कैंटन यह निर्धारित करते हैं कि कौन योग्य है, कितना समर्थन दिया जाएगा और क्या किसी आवेदन की आवश्यकता है। यह कैलकुलेटर केवल एक पॉलिसी प्रीमियम से एक निश्चित मासिक कटौती घटाता है और वार्षिक राशि दिखाता है।","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"यदि मासिक प्रीमियम CHF 420 है और पुष्टि की गई कटौती CHF 120 है, तो अनुमानित शुद्ध प्रीमियम CHF 300 प्रति माह है।","How the calculation works":"गणना कैसे काम करती है","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"क्या इससे मुझे पता चलता है कि मैं योग्य हूं या नहीं?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"नहीं। पात्रता और पुरस्कार राशि निवास के कैंटन द्वारा तय की जाती है। लिंक की गई आधिकारिक जानकारी का उपयोग करें या कैंटोनल कार्यालय से संपर्क करें।","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"मुझे कटौती की राशि कहां मिलेगी?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"वर्तमान निर्णय या अपने बीमाकर्ता द्वारा दिखाए गए कम प्रीमियम का उपयोग करें। कुछ कैंटन स्वचालित रूप से कटौती प्रदान करते हैं; दूसरों को एक आवेदन की आवश्यकता होती है.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"यह एक पॉलिसी के लिए अंकगणित है, पात्रता या लाभ का निर्णय नहीं। यह घरेलू आय, संपत्ति, पारिवारिक स्थिति, समय सीमा, कैंटोनल सीमा या आवेदन अधिकारों की गणना नहीं करता है। प्रीमियम और पुरस्कार बदल सकते हैं; अपने बीमाकर्ता और कैंटन से उनकी पुष्टि करें।","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"वर्तमान मासिक प्रीमियम (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"मासिक कटौती पहले ही दी जा चुकी है (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"कैंटन या बीमाकर्ता द्वारा पुष्टि की गई राशि दर्ज करें; किसी अनुमान को पुरस्कार के रूप में उपयोग न करें।","Calculate net premium":"शुद्ध प्रीमियम की गणना करें","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"वर्तमान प्रीमियम और पुष्टिकृत कटौती दर्ज करें।","Estimated premium after reduction":"कमी के बाद अनुमानित प्रीमियम","Current monthly premium":"वर्तमान मासिक प्रीमियम","Monthly reduction":"मासिक कटौती","Estimated net monthly premium":"अनुमानित शुद्ध मासिक प्रीमियम","Reduction over 12 months":"12 महीनों में कमी","Reduction as a share of premium":"प्रीमियम के हिस्से के रूप में कटौती","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"गणना पूर्ण। अपने कैंटन और बीमाकर्ता के साथ पुरस्कार और प्रभावी तिथियों की पुष्टि करें।","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"जाँचें कि कटौती मासिक प्रीमियम से अधिक न हो।","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"स्विस किराया संदर्भ-दर परिदृश्य कैलकुलेटर","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"स्विस किराया समायोजन कैलकुलेटर — संदर्भ दर परिदृश्य","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"केवल अनुमान लगाएं कि स्विट्जरलैंड की बंधक संदर्भ दर में परिवर्तन आवासीय शुद्ध किराए को कैसे प्रभावित करता है। संघीय आवास कार्यालय से नवीनतम दर का उपयोग करें।","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"अपने पट्टे या नवीनतम किराया नोटिस में बताई गई संदर्भ दर की तुलना वर्तमान आधिकारिक स्विस दर से करें। गणना आपके डिवाइस पर रहती है.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"आवास के लिए संघीय कार्यालय प्रत्येक तिमाही में स्विस किराया समायोजन के लिए एक बंधक संदर्भ दर प्रकाशित करता है। 0.25 प्रतिशत-बिंदु की वृद्धि सैद्धांतिक रूप से 3% किराए में वृद्धि की अनुमति दे सकती है; 0.25 अंक की कमी सैद्धांतिक रूप से 2.91% की कमी की अनुमति दे सकती है। यह परिदृश्य उन परिवर्तनों को आपके द्वारा दर्ज किए गए शुद्ध किराए पर चरण दर चरण लागू करता है।","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"CHF 3,000 मासिक शुद्ध किराए के लिए, संदर्भ-दर में 1.75% से 1.50% की कमी लगभग −CHF 87.38 प्रति माह (−2.91%) का अनुमानित संदर्भ-दर-परिवर्तन देती है।","How this estimate works":"यह अनुमान कैसे काम करता है","Where do I find the current rate?":"मुझे वर्तमान दर कहां मिलेगी?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"लिंक किए गए फेडरल ऑफिस फॉर हाउसिंग पेज को खोलें और वर्तमान प्रकाशित दर दर्ज करें। उपकरण ऐसी दर को एम्बेड नहीं करता है जो पुरानी हो सकती है।","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"क्या यह तय करता है कि मैं किराए में बदलाव का अनुरोध कर सकता हूं या नहीं?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"नहीं। यह अभिविन्यास के लिए एक कारक को अलग करता है। आपका अनुबंध, मुद्रास्फीति, लागत परिवर्तन, आरक्षण और अन्य कानूनी स्थितियाँ परिणाम को बदल सकती हैं।","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"क्या परिणाम में सहायक लागतें शामिल हैं?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"नहीं। सहायक लागतों और अन्य परिवर्तनीय शुल्कों को छोड़कर, मासिक शुद्ध किराया दर्ज करें।","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"परिणाम एक उदाहरणात्मक संदर्भ-दर परिदृश्य है, न कि कोई कानूनी राय या संपूर्ण किराया समीक्षा। इसमें मुद्रास्फीति, सामान्य लागत परिवर्तन, सुधार, संविदात्मक आरक्षण, अनुक्रमित या चरणबद्ध किराए, नोटिस तिथियां और कैंटोनल प्रक्रिया शामिल नहीं है। कार्रवाई करने से पहले अपने पट्टे और आधिकारिक मार्गदर्शन की जाँच करें।","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"स्विस आवासीय पट्टे: केवल बंधक-संदर्भ-दर प्रभाव का एक अनुमान। यह कोई कानूनी निर्णय या पूर्ण किराया समीक्षा नहीं है।","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"वर्तमान मासिक शुद्ध किराया (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"आपके पट्टे या नवीनतम किराया नोटिस में बताई गई संदर्भ दर (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"वर्तमान आधिकारिक स्विस संदर्भ दर (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"संदर्भ-दर परिदृश्य की गणना करें","Reference-rate-only scenario":"केवल-संदर्भ-दर परिदृश्य","Current monthly net rent":"वर्तमान मासिक शुद्ध किराया","Reference-rate change":"संदर्भ-दर परिवर्तन","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"संदर्भ दर से अनुमानित मासिक प्रभाव","Scenario monthly net rent":"परिदृश्य मासिक शुद्ध किराया","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"एक ही दर पर 12 महीनों के लिए वार्षिक प्रभाव","potential increase":"संभावित वृद्धि","potential decrease":"संभावित कमी","no reference-rate change":"कोई संदर्भ-दर परिवर्तन नहीं","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"अनुमान प्रत्येक 0.25 प्रतिशत-बिंदु वृद्धि के लिए 3% और प्रत्येक कमी के लिए समतुल्य व्युत्क्रम कमी लागू करता है। अन्य कारक परिणाम बदल सकते हैं.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"इसमें मुद्रास्फीति, सामान्य लागत परिवर्तन, सुधार, अनुबंध आरक्षण, अनुक्रमित या चरणबद्ध किराए, नोटिस तिथियां, या स्थानीय प्रक्रियात्मक आवश्यकताएं शामिल नहीं हैं। अपने पट्टे और आवास मार्गदर्शन के लिए संघीय कार्यालय की जाँच करें।","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"नवीनतम आधिकारिक दर और मार्गदर्शन की जाँच करें","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"आवास के लिए स्विस संघीय कार्यालय (बीडब्ल्यूओ)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"परिदृश्य देखने के लिए किराया और दोनों दरें दर्ज करें।","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"परिदृश्य की गणना। इस पर भरोसा करने से पहले तारीखों और अनुबंध की शर्तों को सत्यापित करें।","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"राशि और दरें जांचें। दरें 0% और 5% के बीच होनी चाहिए और 0.25-पॉइंट चरणों में भिन्न होनी चाहिए।","Inputs cleared.":"इनपुट साफ़ किए गए।","Result":"परिणाम","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"स्विस अवकाश संचय अनुमानक","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"स्विस अवकाश संचय कैलकुलेटर - आनुपातिक अवकाश शेष","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"अपने अनुबंध में वार्षिक छुट्टी, कार्यसप्ताह, रोजगार की तारीखों और पहले से लिए गए दिनों से स्विस अवकाश-दिन के शेष का अनुमान लगाएं।","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"आपके द्वारा दर्ज की गई पात्रता और कार्य अनुसूची का उपयोग करके एक कैलेंडर वर्ष के लिए आनुपातिक भुगतान छुट्टी का अनुमान लगाएं। किसी अनुबंध की शर्तों का अनुमान नहीं लगाया गया है.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"आकलनकर्ता आपके अनुबंध में वार्षिक छुट्टी के दिनों को चयनित वर्ष में नियोजित कैलेंडर दिनों के अनुसार अनुपातित करता है। अंशकालिक कार्य के लिए, प्रति सप्ताह अपने सामान्य कार्य दिवस और सप्ताहों में वार्षिक अवकाश दर्ज करें।","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"चार सप्ताह की छुट्टी, पांच दिन का कार्यसप्ताह और पूरे वर्ष रोजगार के साथ, पहले से ली गई छुट्टी को घटाने से पहले वार्षिक पात्रता 20 कार्य दिवस है।","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"स्विस वैधानिक न्यूनतम क्या है?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"संघीय मार्गदर्शन प्रति सेवा वर्ष में कम से कम चार सप्ताह और उन श्रमिकों के लिए पांच सप्ताह बताता है जो 20 वर्ष की आयु तक नहीं पहुंचे हैं। एक अनुबंध या सामूहिक समझौता अधिक अनुदान दे सकता है।","Does this decide my legal balance?":"क्या यह मेरा कानूनी संतुलन तय करता है?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"नहीं। यह एक साधारण कैलेंडर-दिवस अनुपात है। अनुबंध की शर्तें, लागू सामूहिक नियम, योग्य अनुपस्थिति, पूर्णांकन और नियोक्ता रिकॉर्ड संतुलन को बदल सकते हैं।","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"यह अनुमान कानूनी पात्रता तय नहीं करता है या अवकाश वेतन की गणना नहीं करता है। इसमें कुछ लंबी अनुपस्थिति, अनुबंध-विशिष्ट संचय और पूर्णांकन नियम, सार्वजनिक छुट्टियां, ओवरटाइम, कैरी-ओवर समय सीमा और विवादों के लिए कटौती शामिल नहीं है। अपने अनुबंध की जाँच करें और विवादित शेष के लिए सलाह प्राप्त करें।","Leave year":"छुट्टी वर्ष","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"आपके अनुबंध में वार्षिक अवकाश (सप्ताह)","Usual working days per week":"प्रति सप्ताह सामान्य कार्य दिवस","Employment start date":"रोजगार प्रारंभ तिथि","Employment end date":"रोजगार समाप्ति तिथि","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"इस छुट्टी वर्ष में पहले ही छुट्टी के दिन ले लिए गए हैं","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"केवल ओरिएंटेशन के लिए। संविदात्मक वार्षिक पात्रता दर्ज करें; कानूनी न्यूनतम आम तौर पर चार सप्ताह या 20 वर्ष से कम आयु के श्रमिकों के लिए पांच सप्ताह है।","Estimate balance":"अनुमान संतुलन","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"शेष राशि का अनुमान लगाने के लिए अपना अनुबंध और तारीखें दर्ज करें।","Estimated leave balance":"अनुमानित अवकाश शेष","Annual leave at this schedule":"इस समय पर वार्षिक अवकाश","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"इस अवकाश वर्ष में नियोजित कैलेंडर दिन","Prorated days accrued":"आनुपातिक दिन अर्जित","Days already taken":"दिन पहले ही ले लिए गए हैं","Estimated days remaining":"अनुमानित दिन शेष","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"यह रोजगार अवधि में वार्षिक अवकाश को कैलेंडर दिनों के अनुसार अनुपातित करता है। नियोक्ता और अनुबंध नियम भिन्न हो सकते हैं।","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"अनुमान की गणना की गई। इसे अपने अनुबंध और नियोक्ता रिकॉर्ड से जांचें।","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"वर्ष, दिनांक, कार्यसूची और मूल्यों की जाँच करें।"},"ar":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"سيناريو بدل البطالة السويسري","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"حاسبة إعانة البطالة في سويسرا — السيناريو الإجمالي","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"قم بتقدير إجمالي البدل اليومي السويسري باستخدام الراتب المؤمن عليه والمعدل الذي يؤكده صندوقك.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"أدخل راتب المؤمن عليه ومعدل 70% أو 80% المعتمد من قبل صندوق البطالة الخاص بك.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"تحدد القواعد السويسرية معدل البدل والحد الأقصى للراتب. ويقرر الصندوق الاستحقاق والاستقطاعات وأيام الانتظار والاستحقاق. يعكس النطاق الشهري 20-23 يومًا من أيام الأسبوع المستحقة الدفع.","Example":"مثال","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5000 فرنك سويسري بفائدة 70% هو حوالي 161.29 فرنك سويسري لكل يوم عمل مستحق الدفع.","How it works":"كيف يعمل","Questions":"الأسئلة","Scope and limits":"النطاق والحدود","Related tools":"أدوات ذات صلة","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"الراتب الشهري المؤمن عليه (بالفرنك السويسري)","Rate confirmed by fund":"السعر مؤكد من قبل الصندوق","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"تقدير","Clear":"مسح","Gross scenario":"السيناريو الإجمالي","Insured salary used":"الراتب المؤمن عليه المستخدم","Per payable weekday":"لكل يوم من أيام الأسبوع مستحق الدفع","20-day month":"شهر مكون من 20 يومًا","23-day month":"شهر مكون من 23 يومًا","Official benefit rules":"قواعد المزايا الرسمية","Enter your confirmed figures.":"أدخل الأرقام المؤكدة.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"تم حساب السيناريو. قم بتأكيد المبالغ مع صندوقك.","Check the values.":"التحقق من القيم.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"مخطط إشعار الإيجار السويسري","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"مخطط إشعار الإيجار السويسري ومسودة الرسالة","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"خطِّط لإشعار الإيجار من التواريخ والشروط الواردة في العقد الخاص بك؛ صياغة خطاب دون افتراض قواعد الكانتون.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"أدخل فترة الإشعار، ويوم الإنهاء الصالح التالي في عقدك، وتاريخ الاستلام. تحقق من كل تاريخ مع جمعية المالك أو المستأجرين.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"يطبق المخطط فقط التواريخ والفترة التي تقدمها. ولا تقرر ما إذا كان الإشعار صالحًا، أو متى يتم استلامه بشكل قانوني، أو ما إذا كانت هناك حماية خاصة تنطبق.","Contract notice period (months)":"فترة إشعار العقد (بالشهور)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"يوم الإنهاء الصالح التالي من الشهر (من العقد)","Expected receipt date":"تاريخ الاستلام المتوقع","Your name":"اسمك","Your address":"عنوانك","Landlord / agency":"المالك / الوكالة","Recipient address":"عنوان المستلم","Rental property":"تأجير العقارات","Place":"المكان","Letter date":"تاريخ الرسالة","Termination of tenancy":"إنهاء عقد الإيجار","Calculate date and draft letter":"حساب التاريخ ومسودة الرسالة","Planning date":"تاريخ التخطيط","Target date":"التاريخ المستهدف","Editable draft":"مسودة قابلة للتحرير","Copy draft":"نسخ المسودة","Enter your contract terms.":"أدخل شروط العقد الخاص بك.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"مسودة التخطيط جاهزة. تحقق ضد العقد الخاص بك.","Check the dates and period.":"التحقق من التواريخ والفترة.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"النتيجة تتبع يوم إشعار العقد المورد؛ إنه ليس حكم إشعار قانوني.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"سيناريو مكاسب الملكية السويسرية","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"ضريبة أرباح العقارات السويسرية — سيناريو المعدل الذي أدخله المستخدم","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"قم بتقدير مكاسب الملكية باستخدام تكاليف المعاملات الخاصة بك ومعدل الضريبة من الكانتون المسؤول.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"أدخل العائدات، وتكلفة الشراء، والنفقات المؤهلة التي قمت بتأكيدها، والسعر الفعلي من الآلة الحاسبة الرسمية للكانتونات.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"تختلف ضريبة أرباح الممتلكات السويسرية حسب الكانتون وفترة الحجز والخصومات والحالة. لا توفر هذه الأداة الأسعار أو تحدد التكاليف المقبولة.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"عائدات البيع (بالفرنك السويسري)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"تكلفة الاقتناء (بالفرنك السويسري)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"التكاليف الأخرى المؤكدة مقبولة (بالفرنك السويسري)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"معدل الضريبة الفعلي من المصدر الرسمي (%)","Estimate scenario":"السيناريو التقديري","Illustrative scenario":"سيناريو توضيحي","Gain entered":"تم إدخال الربح","Tax at entered rate":"الضريبة بالسعر المُدخل","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"أدخل الأرقام من سجلاتك ومصدر الكانتون.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"تم حساب السيناريو؛ التحقق من ذلك مع الكانتون.","Check amounts and rate.":"التحقق من المبالغ والمعدل.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"لم يتم تضمين جدول ضرائب الكانتون؛ المعدل الفعلي الذي أدخلته هو الذي يحرك التقدير.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"سيناريو ضريبة الميراث والهدايا السويسرية","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"ضريبة الميراث والهدايا السويسرية - سيناريو السعر الخاص بك","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"تقدير المبلغ الخاضع للضريبة من الإعفاء والمعدل الذي أدخله المستخدم؛ تختلف القواعد حسب الكانتون والعلاقة.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"أدخل المبلغ والإعفاء والسعر الفعلي المؤكد للمستلم والكانتون.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"يمكن لقواعد الكانتون والعلاقات الأسرية تغيير الإعفاءات والمعدلات. لا تحدد هذه الأداة قاعدة الكانتون أو تحدد الالتزام الضريبي.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"مبلغ الميراث أو الهبة (بالفرنك السويسري)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"تم تأكيد الإعفاء من خلال الكانتون (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"تم تأكيد المعدل الفعلي من خلال الكانتون (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"المبلغ بعد إدخال الإعفاء","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"أدخل الأرقام المؤكدة لحالتك.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"يستخدم التقدير الإعفاء والمعدل الذي تدخله فقط.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"سيناريو ميزانية دعم الطفل السويسرية","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"ميزانية دعم الطفل السويسرية — سيناريو منزلي شفاف","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"تخصيص ميزانية فرعية تم إدخالها حسب دخل الأصل بعد إدخال ائتمان التكلفة المباشرة.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"استخدم احتياجات الطفل الشهرية الموثقة، والدخل الشهري المتاح لكلا الوالدين وأي تكاليف مباشرة تريد إضافتها إلى حسابها.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"هذه ورقة عمل تخطيطية فقط. إنها ليست جائزة سويسرية لنفقة الطفل أو طريقة قانونية؛ لا يتم تقييم الإسكان والرعاية والضرائب والفوائد والسوابق القضائية.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"ميزانية الطفل الشهرية التي قمت بتوثيقها (بالفرنك السويسري)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"الدخل الشهري المتوفر (CHF) الأصلي","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"الدخل الشهري المتوفر للأصل ب (الفرنك السويسري)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"التكاليف التابعة المباشرة التي يدفعها الوالد \"أ\" إلى الائتمان (الفرنك السويسري)","Allocate scenario":"سيناريو التخصيص","Illustrative allocation":"تخصيص توضيحي","Parent A remaining contribution":"الأصل مساهمة متبقية","Parent B contribution":"مساهمة الأصل ب","Entered monthly child budget":"تم إدخال ميزانية الطفل الشهرية","Enter your household budget figures.":"أدخل أرقام ميزانية أسرتك.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"تم حساب سيناريو الميزانية؛ مناقشة الالتزامات القانونية مع مستشار مؤهل.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"التحقق من المبالغ؛ لا يمكن أن يتجاوز الائتمان الميزانية.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"تتناسب الأسهم مع الدخلين المُدخلين؛ يتم طرح رصيد التكلفة المباشرة أولاً.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"معاينة وصلة المتصفح","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"معاينة وصلة الكلمات — أنماط لغة المتصفح","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"معاينة وصلة المتصفح للنص الذي تقدمه؛ يعتمد الدعم على المتصفح وموارد اللغة المثبتة.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"اختر اللغة التي تطابق النص، وأدخل نموذجًا، ثم اضبط عرض الخط المتوفر.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"يستخدم وصلة CSS الأصلية للمتصفح. لا يجمع القواميس. قد لا تظهر المتصفحات غير المدعومة أي واصلات. يؤدي نسخ النص إلى الاحتفاظ بالتهجئة الأصلية.","Text language (BCP 47)":"لغة النص (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"عرض المعاينة (الأحرف)","Text to preview":"نص للمعاينة","Preview":"معاينة","Enter text and choose its language.":"أدخل النص واختر لغته.","Preview updated.":"تم تحديث المعاينة.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"أدخل علامة اللغة والنص المعتمدين.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"جرب نفس الفقرة بعروض مختلفة لترى أين يمكن للمتصفح فصل الكلمات.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"مساحة عمل التدقيق الإملائي الخاصة","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"المدقق الإملائي المحلي — استخدم قاموس المتصفح الخاص بك","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"قم بتحرير النص باستخدام التدقيق الإملائي الأصلي للمتصفح، واختر لغة وانسخ النص المصحح.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"يظل النص في هذه الصفحة. قم بتعيين لغة يحتوي متصفحك على قاموس إملائي لها، ثم استخدم قائمة التدقيق الإملائي أو اقتراحات التسطير.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"لا تقوم مساحة العمل هذه بتحميل النص أو تحميل القواميس. يعتمد توفر التدقيق الإملائي للمتصفح واقتراحاته على الجهاز والمتصفح والقاموس المثبت.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"لغة التدقيق الإملائي (BCP 47)","Text to check":"النص المطلوب التحقق منه","Copy text":"نسخ النص","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"اكتب نصًا أو الصقه. انقر بزر الماوس الأيمن أو استخدم قائمة التدقيق الإملائي بجهازك للحصول على اقتراحات.","Text copied.":"تم نسخ النص.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"تعذر النسخ تلقائيًا؛ حدد ونسخ النص.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"المتصفح الذي لا يحتوي على قاموس مطابق قد لا يضع علامة على الأخطاء الإملائية.","Resume Structure Checker":"مدقق هيكل السيرة الذاتية","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Resume Checker - مراجعة محلية مجانية لملفات PDF وDOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"تحقق من نص السيرة الذاتية والعناوين والأقسام والروابط وبنية التعداد النقطي في متصفحك. مقارنة مصطلحات الوصف الوظيفي حسب العدد؛ لا توجد نقاط توظيف أو تحميل.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"راجع ما تكشفه السيرة الذاتية المبنية على النص فعليًا: النص المستخرج، وبنية العنوان، ووجود حقل الاتصال، والروابط، والأقسام المعروفة بشكل شائع. يمكنك بشكل اختياري مقارنة مصطلحات الوصف الوظيفي المتكررة.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"يُظهر مستند DOCX مع أنماط العنوان 1 للخبرة والتعليم تلك العناوين. يتم فحص ملف PDF من النص الذي يمكن تحديده؛ يمكن قراءة الأعمدة بترتيب مختلف.\nيتم فحص ملفات","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX محليًا بتنسيق Office ZIP/XML. تتم قراءة ملفات PDF باستخدام محرك PDF.js المحلي المؤجل. تحسب مقارنة الوصف الوظيفي الاختيارية المصطلحات المحددة في كل نص؛ فهو لا يُنشئ نتيجة أو يوصي بتوظيف شخص ما.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"هذا عبارة عن فحص للتنسيق وبنية النص، وليس محاكاة ATS أو مراجعة قانونية أو توقع نجاح المقابلة. تحتاج ملفات PDF الممسوحة ضوئيًا والتي لا تحتوي على نص قابل للتحديد إلى التعرف الضوئي على الحروف (OCR) أولاً. لا يتم دعم المستندات المحمية بكلمة مرور أو الممكّنة بماكرو أو الموقعة أو الكبيرة بشكل غير عادي.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"اختر السيرة الذاتية (PDF أو DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"تبقى ملفاتك في هذا المتصفح ولا يتم تحميلها. الحد الأقصى 20 ميجابايت؛ PDF يصل إلى 50 صفحة. يبلغ الحد الأقصى لمحتوى DOCX الموسع 80 ميجابايت.","Optional job description":"وصف وظيفي اختياري","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"الصق نصًا عاديًا إذا كنت تريد مقارنة تكرار المصطلح. لا تقم بتضمين معلومات حساسة لا تحتاج إلى تحليلها.","Paste job-description text here…":"الصق نص الوصف الوظيفي هنا...","Analyze locally":"التحليل محليًا","Clear files and report":"مسح الملفات والتقرير","Resume review":"استئناف المراجعة","File type":"نوع الملف","Extracted characters":"الأحرف المستخرجة","Words counted":"عدد الكلمات","Detected headings":"العناوين المكتشفة","Recognized sections":"الأقسام التي تم التعرف عليها","Hyperlinks found":"تم العثور على ارتباطات تشعبية","Bullet paragraphs":"فقرات نقطية","An email address appears in the text":"يظهر عنوان بريد إلكتروني في النص","No email address pattern was detected":"لم يتم اكتشاف نمط عنوان البريد الإلكتروني","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"يظهر نمط يشبه رقم الهاتف في النص","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"لم يتم اكتشاف أي نمط يشبه رقم الهاتف","Job-description terms (counts only)":"مصطلحات الوصف الوظيفي (بالتهم فقط)","Term":"المصطلح","In job text":"في نص المهمة","In resume":"في السيرة الذاتية","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"الصق الوصف الوظيفي لمقارنة عدد المصطلحات.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"لم يتم الكشف عن أنماط عناوين واضحة. يتم تقدير عناوين PDF من حجم النص وقد تكون غير دقيقة.","Detected":"تم الكشف عنه","Not detected":"لم يتم الكشف عنه","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"يتعرف هذا الكشف على مجموعة محدودة من أسماء الأقسام الشائعة؛ ولا يقرر الأقسام المطلوبة.","Profile / summary":"الملف الشخصي / الملخص","Experience":"الخبرة","Education":"التعليم","Skills":"المهارات","Contact":"جهة الاتصال","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"لم يتم العثور على نص قابل للتحديد. تحتاج ملفات PDF الممسوحة ضوئيًا فقط إلى تقنية التعرف الضوئي على الحروف (OCR) قبل أن يتم التحقق منها.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"اختر سيرة ذاتية بتنسيق PDF أو DOCX للبدء.","Reading the selected file locally…":"قراءة الملف المحدد محليًا...","Local structure review complete.":"اكتملت مراجعة البنية المحلية.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"لا يدعم هذا المستعرض ميزة المستندات المحلية المطلوبة.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"اختر ملف PDF صالحًا أو ملف DOCX حديثًا يصل إلى الحدود المحلية المذكورة.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"تعذرت قراءة ملف PDF. قد يكون تالفًا أو مشفرًا أو لا يحتوي على نص يمكن تحديده.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"تعذر فتح حزمة DOCX أو قراءتها بأمان.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"هل تقوم هذه الأداة بتحميل سيرتي الذاتية أو حفظها؟","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"لا. يتم تشغيل التحليل والتحليل في متصفحك. لا يتم إرسال نص الملف إلى الخادم أو الاحتفاظ به بعد مسح التقرير أو مغادرة الصفحة.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"هل يتنبأ بما إذا كان ATS أو صاحب العمل سيقبل سيرتي الذاتية؟","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"لا. فهو يتحقق من النص المقروء والبنية البسيطة فقط. تختلف أنظمة التوظيف، وهذا ليس ضمانًا لتوافق ATS أو توقعًا للتوظيف.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"هل يمكنه قراءة ملف PDF ممسوح ضوئيًا؟","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"فقط إذا كان ملف PDF يحتوي على طبقة نص قابلة للتحديد. لا يقوم هذا المدقق بتنزيل نماذج التعرف الضوئي على الحروف؛ استخدم أداة OCR أولاً لمستند مصور فقط ممسوح ضوئيًا.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"ماذا تعني مقارنة الوصف الوظيفي؟","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"يُظهر أعداد المصطلحات المتكررة بعد التسوية البسيطة. إنها ليست نسبة مطابقة أو تصنيف أو توصية أو تقييم لمؤهلاتك.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"لماذا يُظهر ملف PDF عناوين أقل من DOCX؟","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"ملفات PDF عادةً لا تحتفظ بأنماط العناوين الدلالية. يقوم المدقق بتقدير الخطوط البارزة من حجم النص وترتيب القراءة، بحيث يمكن أن تؤثر الأعمدة والتصميم المرئي على النتيجة.","How local resume review works":"كيفية عمل مراجعة السيرة الذاتية المحلية","Resume checker questions":"أسئلة مدقق السيرة الذاتية","Scope and limitations":"النطاق والقيود","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"فاصل الصوت والمرافقة المحلي","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"مزيل الصوت — فصل الأصوات والمرافقة محليًا","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"قم بفصل عينة صوت استريو قصيرة إلى أصوات مقدرة ومرافقة في متصفحك. يبقى الصوت على جهازك؛ يتم تنزيل النموذج من مضيفه العام.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"اختر مقطع موسيقى استريو لمدة تصل إلى 30 ثانية. عند الاستخدام لأول مرة، يقوم المتصفح بتنزيل نموذج بحجم 35.6 ميجابايت. تتم معالجة الملف الصوتي على هذا الجهاز ولا يتم تحميله مطلقًا.","What you get":"ما تحصل عليه","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"معاينة وتنزيل مقطعي WAV: الأصوات المقدرة والمرافقة المتبقية. تعتمد النتائج على المزيج وقد تحتوي على قطع أثرية.","Local processing":"المعالجة المحلية","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"تستخدم الأداة شبكة غناء Open-Unmix UMX-HQ المصدرة إلى ONNX وONNX Runtime Web. يتم جلب النموذج فقط عند الضغط على منفصل؛ لا يتم استخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات الاستدلال المدفوعة أو الاشتراك. يتم فك تشفير الصوت ومعالجته وتصديره محليًا.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"هذا تقدير لمعالجة استريو 44.1 كيلو هرتز ومقاطع تصل إلى 30 ثانية. يتم تكرار المصادر الأحادية إلى الاستريو. يمكن أن تؤدي الأغاني الممزوجة بعمق في الآلات الموسيقية والمؤثرات الثقيلة والتسجيلات الحية والأنواع غير العادية إلى حدوث تسرب أو قطع أثرية. لا تستخدم النتيجة كسيد نظيف. يتطلب تنزيل النموذج اتصالاً بالإنترنت؛ الصوت لا يترك هذا الجهاز.","Is my audio uploaded?":"هل تم تحميل الصوت الخاص بي؟","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"لا. يتم فك تشفير الصوت المحدد ومعالجته في متصفحك. طلب الشبكة الوحيد هو تنزيل النموذج عند بدء الانفصال.","Why is the first run slow?":"لماذا يكون التشغيل الأول بطيئًا؟","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"يقوم المتصفح بتنزيل نموذج بحجم 35.6 ميجابايت مرة واحدة؛ قد يقوم المتصفح بتخزينه مؤقتًا. ثم يتم تشغيل الاستدلال محليًا على وحدة المعالجة المركزية بالجهاز.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"هل سيتم فصل كل أغنية بشكل واضح؟","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"لا. يقوم النموذج بتقدير الجذع الصوتي وقد يترك تسربًا صوتيًا أو يزيل توافقيات الآلة أو ينشئ قطعًا أثرية. استمع قبل الاعتماد على الجذع.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"ملف صوتي استريو (حتى 30 ثانية)","Choose audio":"اختر الصوت","Separate vocals":"غناء منفصل","Cancel / clear":"إلغاء / مسح","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"اختر ملفًا صوتيًا قصيرًا للبدء.","Downloading the separation model…":"جاري تحميل نموذج الفصل…","Separating locally…":"الفصل محليًا…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"اكتمل الفصل. معاينة أو تنزيل أي منهما.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"تعذرت معالجة هذا الملف أو تحميل النموذج. تحقق من التنسيق والاتصال، ثم حاول مرة أخرى.","Model and weight license information":"معلومات ترخيص الطراز والوزن","Estimated vocals":"الغناء المقدر","Estimated accompaniment":"المرافقة المقدرة","Download WAV":"تنزيل WAV","Progress":"التقدم","Preparing local separation…":"جاري تحضير الفصل المحلي…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"اكتمل الفصل. بقي الصوت على هذا الجهاز.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"تعذرت معالجة هذا الصوت. جرب ملف موسيقى استريو في أقل من 30 ثانية.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"مقارنة التأمين الصحي السويسري للخصم","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"حاسبة امتياز التأمين الصحي السويسري - قارن التكاليف السنوية","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"قارن خصومات التأمين الصحي الأساسي السويسري باستخدام الأقساط والتكاليف الطبية السنوية المؤهلة التي تدخلها. لا يتم تخمين أي عرض أسعار لشركة التأمين.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"أدخل الأقساط الشهرية التي تعرضها شركة التأمين نفسها لكل مبلغ قابل للخصم تقدمه، ثم قارن بين سيناريوهات تكلفة العلاج السنوية المنخفضة والمتوقعة والمرتفعة.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"بالنسبة للتأمين الصحي الأساسي السويسري الإلزامي، يبلغ المبلغ القابل للخصم القياسي للبالغين 300 فرنك سويسري والمبلغ القابل للخصم من الأطفال هو 0 فرنك سويسري. وتختلف المستويات الاختيارية حسب الفئة العمرية. بعد الخصم، تبلغ رسوم الاحتفاظ القياسية 10% من التكاليف المتبقية المؤهلة، بحد أقصى 700 فرنك سويسري سنويًا للبالغين و350 فرنك سويسري للأطفال. تضيف الأداة القسط الذي أدخلته إلى نموذج مشاركة التكلفة هذا؛ لا يجلب أسعار التأمين أو يقرر الخيار المناسب لك.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"إذا قام شخص بالغ بإدخال قسط شهري قدره 400 فرنك سويسري مع خصم 300 فرنك سويسري و350 فرنك سويسري مع خصم 2500 فرنك سويسري، فإن فرق القسط السنوي هو 600 فرنك سويسري. قارن هذا التوفير بالفرق النموذجي في تقاسم التكاليف عند كل مبلغ من مبالغ التكلفة المؤهلة المنخفضة والمتوقعة والعالية.","How the estimate works":"كيفية عمل التقدير","Common questions":"الأسئلة الشائعة","Scope and exclusions":"النطاق والاستثناءات","Where do I get the premiums?":"من أين أحصل على الأقساط؟","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"استخدم العروض الشهرية الحالية لنفس شركة التأمين والمنطقة المميزة والفئة العمرية وتغطية الحوادث ونموذج التأمين. Priminfo هو موقع المقارنة الفيدرالي الرسمي. لا تقوم هذه الصفحة بجلب أو إعادة إنتاج عروض أسعار شركات التأمين.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"هل يتم تقديم جميع المستويات القابلة للخصم المدرجة دائمًا؟","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"لا. لا يتعين على شركات التأمين تقديم كل مستوى اختياري، ويمكن أن تختلف العروض بالنسبة للشباب. أدخل فقط الأقساط المبينة في وثيقتك الخاصة؛ اترك الخيارات غير المتاحة فارغة.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"هل يعرض هذا فاتورتي الطبية الكاملة؟","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"لا. يغطي النموذج الرسوم العادية القابلة للخصم ورسوم الاحتفاظ القياسية بنسبة 10% على التكاليف المؤهلة. وهو لا يشمل مساهمات يوم المستشفى، والاحتفاظ بالأدوية الخاصة بنسبة 40٪، والخدمات المعفاة، والرعاية غير المغطاة والتأمين التكميلي.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"هذه مقارنة سيناريوهات، وليست نصيحة تأمينية أو طبية أو مالية. لا يتنبأ بمعاملتك أو أقساط التأمين الخاصة بك. وهو لا يشمل مساهمات يوم المستشفى (عادة 15 فرنك سويسري لكل يوم مريض داخلي، مع استثناءات قانونية)، والاحتفاظ الخاص بنسبة 40% على بعض الأدوية، وإعفاءات الأمومة/الوقائية، والخدمات خارج التغطية الإلزامية، وإعانات الأقساط والتأمين التكميلي. وبالتالي يمكن أن يختلف الدفع المشترك الفعلي. يعني الخصم الأعلى أنك بحاجة إلى أن تكون قادرًا على دفع المزيد مقدمًا إذا كنت تتلقى الرعاية.","Who is insured under this policy?":"من هو المؤمن عليه بموجب هذه الوثيقة؟","Adult (age 19 or over)":"البالغ (19 عامًا أو أكثر)","Child (under 18)":"الطفل (أقل من 18 عامًا)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"سيناريو انخفاض تكلفة العلاج السنوية المؤهلة (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"تكاليف العلاج المؤهلة السنوية المتوقعة (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"سيناريو ارتفاع تكلفة العلاج السنوية المؤهلة (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"أقساط شهرية من شركة تأمين واحدة","Monthly premium":"القسط الشهري","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"أدخل فقط الخيارات المقدمة لنفس السياسة. اترك الآخرين فارغين.","Adult deductible choices":"خيارات قابلة للخصم للبالغين","Child deductible choices":"الاختيارات القابلة للخصم للأطفال","Compare annual costs":"مقارنة التكاليف السنوية","Clear entries":"مسح الإدخالات","Download CSV":"تنزيل ملف CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"القسط السنوي المقدر بالإضافة إلى مشاركة التكلفة","Deductible":"قابل للخصم","Annual premiums":"الأقساط السنوية","Total at low costs":"الإجمالي بتكاليف منخفضة","Total at expected costs":"الإجمالي بالتكاليف المتوقعة","Total at high costs":"الإجمالي بتكاليف مرتفعة","Cost sharing at low costs":"تقاسم التكاليف بتكاليف منخفضة","Cost sharing at expected costs":"تقاسم التكاليف بالتكاليف المتوقعة","Cost sharing at high costs":"تقاسم التكاليف بتكاليف عالية","Difference from lowest available deductible":"الفرق عن أقل مبلغ قابل للخصم متاح","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"التكاليف الطبية التي يتم فيها استخدام التوفير المتميز","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"لا يتم إلغاء التوفير المتميز الذي تم إدخاله ضمن نطاق مشاركة التكلفة النموذجي.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"لا يوجد توفير في الأقساط مقابل أقل مبلغ قابل للخصم.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"أقل إجمالي متوقع بين الخيارات المدخلة","Scenario details":"تفاصيل السيناريو","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"أدخل ثلاثة سيناريوهات مرتبة للتكلفة الطبية والأقساط الشهرية لخصمين متاحين على الأقل.","Official rules and current premiums:":"القواعد الرسمية والأقساط الحالية:","Federal deductible rules":"قواعد الخصم الفيدرالية","Priminfo official premium comparison":"مقارنة Priminfo الرسمية المميزة","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"تم حساب المقارنة في هذا المتصفح.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"تحقق من الفئة العمرية وسيناريوهات التكلفة المطلوبة وقسطين شهريين على الأقل.","Entries cleared.":"تم مسح الإدخالات.\nتم تنزيل","CSV downloaded locally.":"ملف CSV محليًا.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"حاسبة تخفيض قسط الصحة السويسرية","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"حاسبة دعم الأقساط السويسرية — صافي الأقساط الخاصة بك","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"احسب صافي أقساط التأمين الصحي السويسري من القسط الحالي والتخفيض الشهري الذي منحه كانتونك بالفعل.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"أدخل القسط والتخفيض الشهري المؤكد من شركة التأمين الخاصة بك أو قرار الكانتون. لا تقرر هذه الأداة ما إذا كنت مؤهلاً أم لا.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"تحدد الكانتونات السويسرية من هو المؤهل، ومقدار الدعم الممنوح، وما إذا كانت هناك حاجة إلى تقديم طلب. تقوم هذه الآلة الحاسبة بطرح التخفيض الشهري المؤكد فقط من قسط بوليصة واحد وتظهر المبلغ السنوي.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"إذا كان القسط الشهري هو 420 فرنك سويسري والتخفيض المؤكد هو 120 فرنك سويسري، فإن صافي القسط المقدر هو 300 فرنك سويسري شهريًا.","How the calculation works":"كيفية عمل الحساب","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"هل يخبرني هذا ما إذا كنت مؤهلاً أم لا؟","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"رقم. يتم تحديد الأهلية ومبالغ الجائزة من قبل كانتون الإقامة. استخدم المعلومات الرسمية المرتبطة أو اتصل بمكتب الكانتون.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"أين أجد مبلغ التخفيض؟","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"استخدم القرار الحالي أو القسط المخفض الذي توضحه شركة التأمين الخاصة بك. تمنح بعض الكانتونات تخفيضات بشكل تلقائي؛ البعض الآخر يتطلب التطبيق.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"هذه عملية حسابية لسياسة واحدة، وليست قرارًا بشأن الأهلية أو الميزة. ولا يحسب دخل الأسرة أو الأصول أو الحالة العائلية أو المواعيد النهائية أو عتبات الكانتونات أو حقوق التقديم. يمكن أن تتغير الأقساط والجوائز؛ قم بتأكيدها مع شركة التأمين الخاصة بك والكانتون.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"القسط الشهري الحالي (بالفرنك السويسري)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"تم منح التخفيض الشهري بالفعل (بالفرنك السويسري)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"أدخل المبلغ الذي أكده الكانتون أو شركة التأمين؛ لا تستخدم التقدير كجائزة.","Calculate net premium":"حساب صافي القسط","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"أدخل القسط الحالي والتخفيض المؤكد.","Estimated premium after reduction":"القسط المقدر بعد التخفيض","Current monthly premium":"القسط الشهري الحالي","Monthly reduction":"تخفيض شهري","Estimated net monthly premium":"صافي القسط الشهري المقدر","Reduction over 12 months":"التخفيض على مدار 12 شهرًا","Reduction as a share of premium":"التخفيض كحصة من القسط","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"اكتملت العملية الحسابية. قم بتأكيد الجائزة وتواريخ السريان مع الكانتون وشركة التأمين الخاصة بك.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"تأكد من أن التخفيض ليس أكبر من القسط الشهري.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"حاسبة سيناريو السعر المرجعي للإيجارات السويسرية","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"حاسبة تعديل الإيجار السويسرية — سيناريو السعر المرجعي","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"تقدير فقط مدى تأثير التغير في المعدل المرجعي للرهن العقاري في سويسرا على صافي الإيجار السكني. استخدم أحدث سعر من مكتب الإسكان الفيدرالي.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"قارن السعر المرجعي المذكور في عقد الإيجار أو إشعار الإيجار الأخير بالسعر السويسري الرسمي الحالي. يبقى الحساب على جهازك.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"ينشر المكتب الفيدرالي للإسكان معدلًا مرجعيًا واحدًا للرهن العقاري لتعديلات الإيجار السويسري كل ربع سنة. ومن الممكن أن تسمح زيادة قدرها 0.25 نقطة مئوية من حيث المبدأ بزيادة الإيجار بنسبة 3%؛ ومن الممكن أن يسمح الانخفاض بمقدار 0.25 نقطة من حيث المبدأ بتخفيض بنسبة 2.91%. يطبق هذا السيناريو هذه التغييرات خطوة بخطوة على صافي الإيجار الذي تدخله.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"بالنسبة لصافي الإيجار الشهري البالغ 3000 فرنك سويسري، فإن انخفاض المعدل المرجعي من 1.75% إلى 1.50% يعطي تغيرًا تقديريًا في المعدل المرجعي فقط يبلغ حوالي -87.38 فرنك سويسري شهريًا (−2.91%).","How this estimate works":"كيفية عمل هذا التقدير","Where do I find the current rate?":"أين يمكنني العثور على المعدل الحالي؟","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"افتح صفحة المكتب الفيدرالي للإسكان المرتبطة وأدخل السعر المنشور الحالي. لا تتضمن الأداة معدلًا قد يصبح قديمًا.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"هل يحدد هذا ما إذا كان بإمكاني طلب تغيير الإيجار؟","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"لا. يعزل عامل واحد للتوجيه. العقد الخاص بك، والتضخم، وتغيرات التكلفة، والحجوزات والشروط القانونية الأخرى يمكن أن تغير النتيجة.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"هل تتضمن النتيجة التكاليف الإضافية؟","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"لا. أدخل صافي الإيجار الشهري، باستثناء التكاليف الإضافية والرسوم المتغيرة الأخرى.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"النتيجة هي سيناريو توضيحي للسعر المرجعي، وليس رأيًا قانونيًا أو مراجعة كاملة للإيجار. وهو لا يشمل التضخم، والتغيرات العامة في التكاليف، والتحسينات، والحجوزات التعاقدية، والإيجارات المفهرسة أو المتزايدة، وتواريخ الإشعار وإجراءات الكانتونات. تحقق من عقد الإيجار والتوجيهات الرسمية قبل التصرف.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"عقود الإيجار السكنية السويسرية: تقدير لتأثير معدل الرهن العقاري المرجعي فقط. إنه ليس قرارًا قانونيًا أو مراجعة كاملة للإيجار.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"صافي الإيجار الشهري الحالي (بالفرنك السويسري)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"السعر المرجعي المذكور في عقد الإيجار أو إشعار الإيجار الأخير (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"السعر المرجعي السويسري الرسمي الحالي (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"حساب سيناريو المعدل المرجعي","Reference-rate-only scenario":"سيناريو المعدل المرجعي فقط","Current monthly net rent":"صافي الإيجار الشهري الحالي","Reference-rate change":"تغير المعدل المرجعي","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"التأثير الشهري المقدر من المعدل المرجعي","Scenario monthly net rent":"السيناريو صافي الإيجار الشهري","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"تأثير سنوي لمدة 12 شهرًا بنفس المعدل","potential increase":"الزيادة المحتملة","potential decrease":"الانخفاض المحتمل","no reference-rate change":"لا يوجد تغيير في المعدل المرجعي","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"ينطبق التقدير بنسبة 3% لكل زيادة قدرها 0.25 نقطة مئوية والتخفيض العكسي المكافئ لكل انخفاض. عوامل أخرى يمكن أن تغير النتيجة.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"لا يشمل ذلك التضخم، أو تغييرات التكلفة العامة، أو التحسينات، أو حجوزات العقود، أو الإيجارات المفهرسة أو المتدرجة، أو تواريخ الإشعار، أو المتطلبات الإجرائية المحلية. تحقق من عقد الإيجار الخاص بك وتوجيهات المكتب الاتحادي للإسكان.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"تحقق من أحدث الأسعار والتوجيهات الرسمية","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"المكتب الفيدرالي السويسري للإسكان (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"أدخل الإيجار وكلا السعرين لرؤية السيناريو.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"تم حساب السيناريو. التأكد من التواريخ وشروط العقد قبل الاعتماد عليها.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"التحقق من الكميات والأسعار. يجب أن تتراوح المعدلات بين 0% و5% وتختلف بخطوات قدرها 0.25 نقطة.","Inputs cleared.":"تم مسح المدخلات.","Result":"النتيجة","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"مُقدِّر تراكم الإجازة السويسري","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"الحاسبة السويسرية لاستحقاق الإجازات — رصيد الإجازات التناسبي","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"قم بتقدير رصيد يوم الإجازة السويسري من الإجازة السنوية في عقدك وأسبوع العمل وتواريخ التوظيف والأيام المستغرقة بالفعل.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"تقدير الإجازة مدفوعة الأجر التناسبية لمدة سنة تقويمية واحدة باستخدام الاستحقاق وجدول العمل الذي تدخله. لا يتم تخمين أي شروط العقد.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"يقوم المقدر بتقسيم أيام الإجازة السنوية في عقدك حسب أيام التقويم المستخدمة في السنة المحددة. بالنسبة للعمل بدوام جزئي، أدخل أيام العمل المعتادة في الأسبوع والإجازة السنوية بالأسابيع.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"مع أربعة أسابيع إجازة، وأسبوع عمل مدته خمسة أيام، والتوظيف على مدار العام، يكون الاستحقاق السنوي 20 يوم عمل قبل خصم الإجازة التي تم أخذها بالفعل.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"ما هو الحد الأدنى القانوني السويسري؟","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"تنص التوجيهات الفيدرالية على أربعة أسابيع على الأقل لكل سنة خدمة، وخمسة أسابيع للعمال الذين لم يبلغوا سن 20 عامًا. وقد يمنح العقد أو الاتفاقية الجماعية المزيد.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"هل يؤثر هذا على رصيدي القانوني؟","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"لا. إنه توزيع بسيط ليوم التقويم. شروط العقد، والقواعد الجماعية المعمول بها، وحالات الغياب المؤهلة، والتقريب، وسجلات صاحب العمل يمكن أن تغير التوازن.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"لا يحدد هذا التقدير الاستحقاق القانوني أو حساب أجر الإجازة. وهو يستثني التخفيضات لبعض حالات الغياب الطويلة، وقواعد الاستحقاق والتقريب الخاصة بالعقد، والعطلات الرسمية، والعمل الإضافي، والمواعيد النهائية للترحيل والنزاعات. تحقق من العقد الخاص بك واحصل على المشورة بشأن الرصيد المتنازع عليه.","Leave year":"إجازة السنة","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"الإجازة السنوية في عقدك (أسابيع)","Usual working days per week":"أيام العمل المعتادة في الأسبوع","Employment start date":"تاريخ بدء التوظيف","Employment end date":"تاريخ انتهاء التوظيف","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"أيام الإجازة التي تم أخذها بالفعل في سنة الإجازة هذه","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"للتوجيه فقط. أدخل الاستحقاق السنوي التعاقدي؛ الحد الأدنى القانوني عمومًا هو أربعة أسابيع، أو خمسة أسابيع للعمال الذين تقل أعمارهم عن 20 عامًا.","Estimate balance":"تقدير الرصيد","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"أدخل العقد والتواريخ لتقدير الرصيد.","Estimated leave balance":"رصيد الإجازات المقدر","Annual leave at this schedule":"الإجازة السنوية في هذا الجدول","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"الأيام التقويمية المستخدمة في سنة الإجازة هذه","Prorated days accrued":"الأيام المتراكمة التناسبية","Days already taken":"الأيام المستغرقة بالفعل","Estimated days remaining":"الأيام المقدرة المتبقية","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"يقوم هذا بتقسيم الإجازة السنوية حسب الأيام التقويمية في فترة التوظيف. قد تختلف قواعد صاحب العمل والعقد.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"تم حساب التقدير. التحقق من ذلك مقابل العقد الخاص بك وسجلات صاحب العمل.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"التحقق من السنة والتواريخ وجدول العمل والقيم."},"zh":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"瑞士失业津贴情景","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"瑞士失业救济金计算器 — 总体情景","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"使用您的基金确认的受保工资和费率估算瑞士每日津贴总额。","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"输入受保工资以及您的失业基金确认的 70% 或 80% 比率。","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"瑞士规则规定了津贴率和工资上限。该基金决定资格、扣除额、等待天数和权利。每月范围反映 20-23 个应付工作日。","Example":"示例","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5,000 瑞士法郎按 70% 计算，每个工作日的应付金额约为 161.29 瑞士法郎。","How it works":"工作原理","Questions":"问题","Scope and limits":"范围和限制","Related tools":"相关工具","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"每月受保工资（瑞士法郎）","Rate confirmed by fund":"基金确认的利率","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"估计","Clear":"清除","Gross scenario":"总体场景","Insured salary used":"已使用的保险工资","Per payable weekday":"每个应付工作日","20-day month":"每月 20 天","23-day month":"每月 23 天","Official benefit rules":"官方福利规则","Enter your confirmed figures.":"输入您确认的数字。","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"已计算场景。确认您的资金金额。","Check the values.":"检查值。","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"瑞士租赁通知规划师","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"瑞士租赁通知规划师和信函草稿","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"根据您自己合同中的日期和条款制定租赁通知；在不遵循州规则的情况下起草一封信。","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"输入通知期、合同中的下一个有效终止日以及收据日期。请与您的房东或租户协会核实每个日期。","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"计划员仅应用您提供的日期和期间。它不决定通知是否有效、何时合法收到或是否适用特殊保护。","Contract notice period (months)":"合同通知期（月）","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"下一个有效终止日（来自合同）","Expected receipt date":"预计收货日期","Your name":"你的名字","Your address":"您的地址","Landlord / agency":"业主/代理","Recipient address":"收件人地址","Rental property":"出租物业","Place":"地点","Letter date":"信件日期","Termination of tenancy":"租赁终止","Calculate date and draft letter":"计算日期和草稿信函","Planning date":"计划日期","Target date":"目标日期","Editable draft":"可编辑草稿","Copy draft":"复制草稿","Enter your contract terms.":"输入您的合同条款。","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"规划草案已准备就绪。根据您的合同进行验证。","Check the dates and period.":"检查日期和期间。","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"结果以提供的合同通知日为准；这不是法定通知裁决。","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"瑞士财产收益情景","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"瑞士财产增值税 — 用户输入的税率场景","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"使用您自己的交易成本和负责州的税率估算财产收益。","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"输入您已确认的收益、购置​​成本、合格费用以及官方州计算器的有效汇率。","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"瑞士财产增值税因州、持有期限、扣除额和情况而异。该工具不提供费率或确定可接受的成本。","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"销售收益（瑞士法郎）","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"购置成本（瑞士法郎）","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"确认可接受的其他费用（瑞士法郎）","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"官方来源的有效税率 (%)","Estimate scenario":"估计场景","Illustrative scenario":"示例场景","Gain entered":"输入增益","Tax at entered rate":"按输入的税率征税","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"输入来自您的记录和州来源的数字。","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"计算出的场景；与州核实。","Check amounts and rate.":"检查金额和费率。","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"未嵌入州税表；您输入的有效利率将影响估算。","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"瑞士继承和赠与税场景","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"瑞士继承税和赠与税 — 您的税率方案","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"根据用户输入的免税额和税率估算应税金额；规则因州和关系而异。","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"输入为接收者和州确认的金额、豁免和有效税率。","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"广州规则和家庭关系可以更改豁免和税率。该工具不会选择州规则或确定纳税义务。","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"继承或赠与金额（瑞士法郎）","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"州确认豁免（瑞士法郎）","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"与州确认的有效率(%)","Amount after entered exemption":"输入豁免后的金额","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"输入为您的案例确认的数字。","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"估算仅使用您输入的豁免和费率。","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"瑞士儿童抚养预算情景","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"瑞士儿童抚养预算 — 透明的家庭情景","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"在输入直接成本贷项后按父母收入分配输入的儿童预算。","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"使用孩子记录的每月需求、父母双方可用的每月收入以及您想要贷记的任何直接费用。","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"这只是一个规划工作表。这不是瑞士的子女抚养费裁决或法律方法；住房、护理、税收、福利和判例法不予评估。","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"您记录的每月儿童预算（瑞士法郎）","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"家长 A 可用月收入（瑞士法郎）","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"家长 B 可用月收入（瑞士法郎）","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"家长 A 向贷方支付的直接子女费用（瑞士法郎）","Allocate scenario":"分配场景","Illustrative allocation":"示例性分配","Parent A remaining contribution":"父 A 剩余贡献","Parent B contribution":"父 B 贡献","Entered monthly child budget":"已输入每月儿童预算","Enter your household budget figures.":"输入您的家庭预算数字。","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"计算出的预算方案；与合格的顾问讨论法律义务。","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"检查金额；信贷不能超过预算。","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"份额与两项输入的收入成正比；首先减去直接成本信贷。","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"浏览器断字预览","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"单词连字符预览 — 浏览器语言模式","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"预览您提供的文本的浏览器连字符；支持取决于浏览器和安装的语言资源。","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"选择与您的文本匹配的语言，输入示例并调整可用的线宽。","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"使用浏览器的本机 CSS 连字符。它不捆绑字典；不受支持的浏览器可能不显示连字符。复制文本会保留原始拼写。","Text language (BCP 47)":"文本语言 (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"预览宽度（字符）","Text to preview":"要预览的文本","Preview":"预览","Enter text and choose its language.":"输入文本并选择其语言。","Preview updated.":"预览已更新。","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"输入支持的语言标签和文本。","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"尝试使用不同宽度的同一段落，看看浏览器可以在哪里断词。","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"私人拼写检查工作区","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"本地拼写检查器 — 使用您的浏览器词典","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"使用浏览器的本机拼写检查编辑文本，选择语言并复制更正的文本。","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"文本保留在此页面中。设置您的浏览器具有拼写词典的语言，然后使用其拼写菜单或下划线建议。","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"此工作区不上传文本或发送字典。浏览器拼写检查的可用性和建议取决于设备、浏览器和安装的词典。","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"拼写检查语言 (BCP 47)","Text to check":"要检查的文本","Copy text":"复制文本","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"键入或粘贴文本。右键单击或使用设备拼写菜单获取建议。","Text copied.":"已复制文本。","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"无法自动复制；选择并复制文本。","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"没有匹配词典的浏览器可能不会标记拼写错误。","Resume Structure Checker":"简历结构检查器","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS 简历检查器 — 免费本地 PDF 和 DOCX 审查","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"在浏览器中检查简历文本、标题、部分、链接和项目符号结构。按数量比较职位描述术语；没有招聘分数或上传。","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"查看基于文本的简历实际公开的内容：提取的文本、标题结构、联系字段存在、链接和常见的部分。可以选择比较重复的职位描述术语。","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"具有用于体验和教育的标题 1 样式的 DOCX 显示这些标题。从 PDF 的可选文本中检查 PDF；列可以按不同的顺序阅读。","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX 文件在本地检查为 Office ZIP/XML。 PDF 使用延迟的本地 PDF.js 引擎读取。可选的工作描述比较对每个文本中选定的术语进行计数；它不会创建分数或建议是否雇用某人。","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"这是格式和文本结构检查，而不是 ATS 模拟器、法律审查或面试成功预测。没有可选文本的扫描 PDF 首先需要 OCR。不支持受密码保护、启用宏、签名或异常大的文档。","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"选择简历（PDF 或 DOCX）","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"您的文件保留在此浏览器中并且不会上传。最大 20 MB； PDF 最多 50 页。 DOCX 扩展内容的上限为 80 MB。","Optional job description":"可选工作描述","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"如果您想要进行术语频率比较，请粘贴纯文本。不要包含不需要分析的敏感信息。","Paste job-description text here…":"将职位描述文本粘贴到此处...","Analyze locally":"本地分析","Clear files and report":"清除文件和报告","Resume review":"简历审核","File type":"文件类型","Extracted characters":"提取的字符","Words counted":"字数统计","Detected headings":"检测到的标题","Recognized sections":"已识别的部分","Hyperlinks found":"找到超链接","Bullet paragraphs":"项目符号段落","An email address appears in the text":"电子邮件地址出现在文本中","No email address pattern was detected":"未检测到电子邮件地址模式","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"文本中出现类似电话号码的模式","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"未检测到类似电话号码的模式","Job-description terms (counts only)":"职位描述术语（仅计数）","Term":"术语","In job text":"在作业文本中","In resume":"简历中","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"粘贴职位描述以比较术语计数。","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"未检测到明确的标题样式。 PDF 标题是根据文本大小估算的，可能不准确。","Detected":"检测到","Not detected":"未检测到","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"此启发式识别一组有限的公共部分名称；它不决定需要哪些部分。","Profile / summary":"简介/摘要","Experience":"经验","Education":"教育","Skills":"技能","Contact":"联系方式","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"未找到可选择的文本。仅扫描的 PDF 需要 OCR 才能进行检查。","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"选择 PDF 或 DOCX 简历开始。","Reading the selected file locally…":"正在本地读取所选文件...","Local structure review complete.":"局部结构审查完成。","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"此浏览器不支持所需的本地文档功能。","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"选择有效的 PDF 或现代 DOCX 文件，最高可达规定的本地限制。","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"无法读取 PDF。它可能已损坏、加密或不包含可选择的文本。","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"无法安全打开或读取 DOCX 包。","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"此工具是否上传或保存我的简历？","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"编号解析和分析在您的浏览器中运行。清除报告或离开页面后，文件文本不会发送到服务器或保留。","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"它是否可以预测 ATS 或雇主是否会接受我的简历？","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"编号它仅检查可读文本和简单结构。招聘系统有所不同，这不是 ATS 兼容性保证或招聘预测。","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"它可以读取扫描的 PDF 吗？","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"仅当 PDF 具有可选择的文本层时。该检查器不下载 OCR 模型；首先对扫描的纯图像文档使用 OCR 工具。","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"职位描述比较是什么意思？","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"它显示简单标准化后重复出现的术语的计数。它不是对您资格的匹配百分比、排名、推荐或评估。","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"为什么 PDF 显示的标题比 DOCX 少？","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF 通常不保留语义标题样式。检查器根据文本大小和阅读顺序估计突出的线条，因此列和视觉设计会影响结果。","How local resume review works":"本地简历审核的工作原理","Resume checker questions":"简历检查器问题","Scope and limitations":"范围和限制","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"本地人声与伴奏分离器","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"人声去除器 — 本地分离人声和伴奏","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"在浏览器中将短立体声音频样本分成估计的人声和伴奏。音频保留在您的设备上；该模型是从其公共主机下载的。","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"选择长达 30 秒的立体声音乐剪辑。首次使用时，浏览器会下载 35.6 MB 的模型。音频文件在此设备上进行处理，并且永远不会上传。","What you get":"您将得到什么","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"预览并下载两个 WAV 词干：估计人声和残留伴奏。结果取决于混合，并且可能包含伪影。","Local processing":"本地处理","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"该工具使用导出到 ONNX 和 ONNX Runtime Web 的 Open-Unmix UMX-HQ 人声网络。仅当您按“分离”时才会获取模型；不使用付费推理 API 或订阅。音频在本地进行解码、处理和导出。","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"这是对立体声 44.1 kHz 处理和剪辑长达 30 秒的估计。单声道源被复制为立体声。人声与乐器、重型效果、现场录音和不寻常流派的深度混合可能会产生泄漏或伪影。不要将结果用作干净的母版。模型下载需要互联网连接；音频不会离开此设备。","Is my audio uploaded?":"我的音频上传了吗？","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"编号所选音频将在您的浏览器中进行解码和处理。唯一的网络请求是开始分离时的模型下载。","Why is the first run slow?":"为什么第一次运行很慢？","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"浏览器下载一次35.6 MB的模型；浏览器可能会缓存它。然后推理在设备 CPU 上本地运行。","Will every song separate cleanly?":"每首歌都能干净地分开吗？","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"编号该模型估计声干，可能会留下声音泄漏、消除乐器谐波或产生伪影。在依靠茎之前先听一下。","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"立体声音频文件（最长 30 秒）","Choose audio":"选择音频","Separate vocals":"独立人声","Cancel / clear":"取消/清除","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"选择一个简短的音频文件开始。","Downloading the separation model…":"正在下载分离模型...","Separating locally…":"本地分离...","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"分离完成。预览或下载任一干。","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"无法处理此文件或加载模型。检查格式和连接，然后重试。","Model and weight license information":"型号和重量许可证信息","Estimated vocals":"估计人声","Estimated accompaniment":"预计伴奏","Download WAV":"下载 WAV","Progress":"进度","Preparing local separation…":"正在准备局部分离...","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"分离完成。音频保留在此设备上。","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"无法处理该音频。尝试 30 秒以内的立体声音乐文件。","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"瑞士健康保险免赔额比较器","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"瑞士健康保险特许经营计算器 — 比较年度费用","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"使用您输入的保费和符合条件的年度医疗费用来比较瑞士基本健康保险免赔额。没有猜测保险公司的报价。","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"输入同一保险公司为其提供的每项免赔额显示的每月保费，然后比较低、预期和高年度治疗成本方案。","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"对于强制性瑞士基本健康保险，成人标准免赔额为 300 瑞士法郎，儿童免赔额为 0 瑞士法郎。可选级别因年龄组而异。扣除免赔额后，标准保留费为符合条件的剩余费用的 10%，成人每年上限为 700 瑞士法郎，儿童每年上限为 350 瑞士法郎。该工具将您输入的保费添加到该模型成本分摊中；它不会获取保险公司的费率或决定哪个选项适合您。","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"如果成人每月保费为 400 瑞士法郎，免赔额为 300 瑞士法郎，而每月保费为 350 瑞士法郎，免赔额为 2,500 瑞士法郎，则每年的保费差额为 600 瑞士法郎。将节省的金额与每个低、预期和高合格成本金额的成本分摊模型差异进行比较。","How the estimate works":"估算如何进行","Common questions":"常见问题","Scope and exclusions":"范围和排除","Where do I get the premiums?":"我在哪里可以获得保费？","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"使用同一保险公司、保费地区、年龄组、事故保险和保险模式的当前每月优惠。 Priminfo 是官方联邦比较网站。此页面不会获取或复制保险公司报价。","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"是否始终提供所有列出的免赔额级别？","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"编号保险公司不必提供所有可选级别，而且针对年轻人的优惠可能有所不同。仅输入您自己的保单显示的保费；将不可用选项留空。","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"这是否显示我完整的医疗账单？","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"编号该模型涵盖了合格费用的普通免赔额和标准 10% 保留费。它不包括住院日缴费、特殊 40% 药品保留、豁免服务、非承保护理和补充保险。","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"这是场景比较，而不是保险、医疗或财务建议。它不能预测您的治疗或保费。它不包括住院日缴款（通常每个住院日 15 瑞士法郎，有法定豁免）、某些药物的 40% 特别保留、生育/预防性豁免、强制保险之外的服务、保费补贴和补充保险。因此，实际的共付额可能有所不同。较高的免赔额意味着如果您接受护理，您需要能够预先支付更多费用。","Who is insured under this policy?":"本保单的受保人是谁？","Adult (age 19 or over)":"成人（19 岁或以上）","Child (under 18)":"儿童（18 岁以下）","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"低年度合格治疗成本情景（瑞士法郎）","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"预计年度合格治疗费用（瑞士法郎）","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"每年合格治疗成本较高的情况（瑞士法郎）","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"一家保险公司的每月保费","Monthly premium":"每月保费","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"仅输入为此同一策略提供的选项。其他的留空。","Adult deductible choices":"成人免赔额选择","Child deductible choices":"儿童免赔额选择","Compare annual costs":"比较年度成本","Clear entries":"清除条目","Download CSV":"下载 CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"预计年度保费加上费用分摊","Deductible":"免赔额","Annual premiums":"年度保费","Total at low costs":"低成本总计","Total at expected costs":"预计成本总计","Total at high costs":"总成本高","Cost sharing at low costs":"低成本分摊成本","Cost sharing at expected costs":"按预期成本分摊成本","Cost sharing at high costs":"高成本分摊成本","Difference from lowest available deductible":"与最低可用免赔额的差异","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"保费储蓄用完的医疗费用","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"输入的保费节省在建模的成本分摊范围内不会取消。","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"相对于最低免赔额，没有保费节省。","Lowest expected total among entered options":"输入选项中预期总数最低的","Scenario details":"场景详细信息","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"输入三个订购的医疗费用方案以及至少两个可用免赔额的每月保费。","Official rules and current premiums:":"官方规则和当前保费：","Federal deductible rules":"联邦免赔额规则","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo官方溢价对比","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"在此浏览器中计算的比较。","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"检查年龄组、订购的成本方案以及至少两次每月保费。","Entries cleared.":"条目已清除。","CSV downloaded locally.":"本地下载的 CSV。","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"瑞士健康保费减免计算器","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"瑞士保费补贴计算器 — 您的净保费","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"根据当前保费和您所在州已授予的每月减免额计算瑞士健康保险净保费。","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"输入您的保险公司或州决定的保费和确认的每月减少额。该工具不会决定您是否符合资格。","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"瑞士各州决定谁有资格、提供多少支持以及是否需要申请。该计算器仅从一份保单保费中减去已确认的每月减少额并显示年度金额。","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"如果每月保费为 420 瑞士法郎，确认减少为 120 瑞士法郎，则预计每月净保费为 300 瑞士法郎。","How the calculation works":"计算原理","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"这能告诉我我是否符合资格吗？","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"编号资格和奖励金额由居住州决定。使用链接的官方信息或联系州办公室。","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"在哪里可以找到减少的金额？","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"使用保险公司当前的决定或降低的保费。有些州自动给予减免；其他需要申请。","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"这是一项保单的算术，而不是资格或福利决定。它不计算家庭收入、资产、家庭状况、截止日期、州门槛或申请权。保费和奖励可能会发生变化；与您的保险公司和州确认。","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"当前每月保费（瑞士法郎）","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"已批准每月减少（瑞士法郎）","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"输入经州或保险公司确认的金额；不要使用估算作为奖励。","Calculate net premium":"计算净溢价","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"输入当前保费和确认的减少。","Estimated premium after reduction":"减少后的预估溢价","Current monthly premium":"当前每月保费","Monthly reduction":"每月减少","Estimated net monthly premium":"估计每月净保费","Reduction over 12 months":"12个月内减少","Reduction as a share of premium":"保费份额减少","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"计算完成。与您所在州和保险公司确认奖励和生效日期。","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"检查减少的金额是否不大于每月保费。","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"瑞士租金参考率情景计算器","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"瑞士租金调整计算器 — 参考利率场景","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"仅估计瑞士抵押贷款参考利率的变化如何影响住宅净租金。使用联邦住房办公室的最新利率。","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"将您的租约或最新租金通知中规定的参考费率与当前瑞士官方费率进行比较。计算结果保留在您的设备上。","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"联邦住房办公室每季度发布一份瑞士租金调整的抵押贷款参考利率。上涨0.25个百分点，原则上可以允许租金上涨3%；减少0.25个百分点，原则上可以减少2.91%。此方案将逐步将这些更改应用于您输入的净租金。","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"对于每月 3,000 瑞士法郎的净租金，参考利率从 1.75% 下降至 1.50%，估计仅参考利率变化约为每月 -87.38 瑞士法郎 (-2.91%)。","How this estimate works":"此估算的工作原理","Where do I find the current rate?":"在哪里可以找到当前汇率？","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"打开链接的联邦住房办公室页面并输入当前公布的费率。该工具没有嵌入可能会过时的费率。","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"这是否决定我是否可以请求更改租金？","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"编号它隔离了一个方向因素。您的合同、通货膨胀、成本变化、预订和其他法律条件可能会改变结果。","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"结果是否包括辅助成本？","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"编号输入每月净租金，不包括辅助成本和其他可变费用。","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"结果是一个说明性的参考利率方案，而不是法律意见或完整的租金审查。它不包括通货膨胀、一般成本变化、改进、合同保留、指数或阶梯租金、通知日期和州程序。行动前请检查您的租约和官方指南。","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"瑞士住宅租赁：仅对抵押贷款参考利率效应的估计。这不是一项法律决定或全面的租金审查。","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"当前每月净租金（瑞士法郎）","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"您的租约或最新租金通知中规定的参考利率 (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"当前瑞士官方参考利率(%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"计算参考利率场景","Reference-rate-only scenario":"仅参考利率场景","Current monthly net rent":"当前每月净租金","Reference-rate change":"参考率更改","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"参考费率估计的每月效果","Scenario monthly net rent":"场景月净租金","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"12个月同率年化效果","potential increase":"潜在的增长","potential decrease":"潜在减少","no reference-rate change":"没有参考利率变化","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"每增加 0.25 个百分点，该估算适用 3%，而每减少 0.25 个百分点，则适用相应的反向减少。其他因素可能会改变结果。","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"这不包括通货膨胀、一般成本变化、改进、合同预订、指数或阶梯租金、通知日期或当地程序要求。检查您的租约和联邦住房办公室的指导。","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"查看最新官方汇率和指导","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"瑞士联邦住房办公室 (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"输入租金和两个费率以查看场景。","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"计算出的场景。在依赖之前验证日期和合同条款。","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"检查金额和费率。费率必须介于 0% 和 5% 之间，并且以 0.25 点为单位变化。","Inputs cleared.":"输入已清除。","Result":"结果","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"瑞士假期累积估算器","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"瑞士假期累积计算器 — 按比例分配的休假余额","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"根据合同中的年假、工作周、就业日期和已休天数估算瑞士假期余额。","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"使用您输入的权利和工作时间表估算一个日历年按比例分配的带薪休假。没有猜测合同条款。","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"估算器根据所选年份中雇用的日历天数按比例分配合同中的年假天数。对于兼职工作，请输入您每周的正常工作日和年假（以周为单位）。","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"如果有四个星期的假期，每周工作五天，并且全年都有工作，那么在扣除已休的假期之前，每年的权利是 20 个工作日。","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"瑞士法定最低限度是多少？","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"联邦指南规定每个服务年至少为四个星期，对于未满 20 岁的工人为五周。合同或集体协议可能会给予更多。","Does this decide my legal balance?":"这会决定我的法定余额吗？","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"编号这是一个简单的日历日按比例分配。合同条款、适用的集体规则、合格缺勤、四舍五入和雇主记录可能会改变平衡。","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"此估算并不决定法定权利或计算假期工资。它不包括某些长期缺勤、合同特定的应计和舍入规则、公共假期、加班、结转期限和争议的减少。检查您的合同并获取有关有争议余额的建议。","Leave year":"休假年份","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"合同中的年假（周）","Usual working days per week":"每周通常工作日","Employment start date":"就业开始日期","Employment end date":"雇佣结束日期","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"本休假年已使用的休假天数","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"仅用于定向。输入合同年度权利；法定最短期限通常为 4 周，对于 20 岁以下的工人则为 5 周。","Estimate balance":"估计余额","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"输入您的合同和日期以估计余额。","Estimated leave balance":"预计休假余额","Annual leave at this schedule":"按此安排的年假","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"本休假年使用的日历天数","Prorated days accrued":"按比例累积的天数","Days already taken":"已占用天数","Estimated days remaining":"预计剩余天数","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"这按工作期间的日历天数按比例分配年假。雇主和合同规则可能有所不同。","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"已计算估计值。根据您的合同和雇主记录进行检查。","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"检查年份、日期、工作计划和值。"},"bn":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"সুইস বেকারত্ব ভাতা দৃশ্যকল্প","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"সুইস বেকারত্ব বেনিফিট ক্যালকুলেটর — গ্রস সিনারিও","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"আপনার তহবিল দ্বারা নিশ্চিতকৃত বীমাকৃত বেতন এবং হার ব্যবহার করে একটি গ্রস সুইস দৈনিক ভাতা অনুমান করুন।","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"আপনার বেকারত্ব তহবিল দ্বারা নিশ্চিতকৃত বীমাকৃত বেতন এবং 70% বা 80% হার লিখুন।","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"সুইস নিয়ম ভাতার হার এবং বেতন ক্যাপ সেট করে। তহবিল যোগ্যতা, ছাড়, অপেক্ষার দিন এবং এনটাইটেলমেন্ট নির্ধারণ করে। মাসিক পরিসীমা 20-23টি প্রদেয় সপ্তাহের দিনগুলিকে প্রতিফলিত করে৷","Example":"উদাহরণ","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"70% এ CHF 5,000 প্রদেয় সপ্তাহের দিনে প্রায় 161.29 CHF।","How it works":"এটি কিভাবে কাজ করে","Questions":"প্রশ্ন","Scope and limits":"সুযোগ এবং সীমা","Related tools":"সম্পর্কিত টুল","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"মাসিক বীমাকৃত বেতন (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"দর তহবিল দ্বারা নিশ্চিত করা হয়েছে","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"আনুমানিক","Clear":"পরিষ্কার করুন","Gross scenario":"গ্রস দৃশ্যকল্প","Insured salary used":"বীমাকৃত বেতন ব্যবহার করা হয়েছে","Per payable weekday":"প্রতি প্রদেয় সপ্তাহের দিন","20-day month":"20-দিনের মাস","23-day month":"23-দিনের মাস","Official benefit rules":"অফিসিয়াল সুবিধার নিয়ম","Enter your confirmed figures.":"আপনার নিশ্চিত পরিসংখ্যান লিখুন।","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"পরিকল্পনা গণনা করা হয়েছে। আপনার তহবিলের সাথে পরিমাণ নিশ্চিত করুন।","Check the values.":"মানগুলি পরীক্ষা করুন৷","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"সুইস টেন্যান্সি নোটিশ প্ল্যানার","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"সুইস ভাড়া নোটিশ পরিকল্পনাকারী এবং চিঠির খসড়া","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"আপনার নিজের চুক্তির তারিখ এবং শর্তাবলী থেকে একটি ভাড়াটে নোটিশের পরিকল্পনা করুন; ক্যান্টন নিয়ম অনুমান না করে একটি চিঠি খসড়া.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"নোটিশের সময়কাল, আপনার চুক্তির পরবর্তী বৈধ সমাপ্তির দিন এবং প্রাপ্তির তারিখ লিখুন। আপনার বাড়িওয়ালা বা ভাড়াটেদের সমিতির সাথে প্রতিটি তারিখ চেক করুন।","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"পরিকল্পক শুধুমাত্র আপনার সরবরাহ করা তারিখ এবং সময়কাল প্রযোজ্য। নোটিশটি বৈধ কিনা, কখন এটি আইনত প্রাপ্ত হয়, বা একটি বিশেষ সুরক্ষা প্রযোজ্য কিনা তা স্থির করে না।","Contract notice period (months)":"চুক্তি বিজ্ঞপ্তির সময়কাল (মাস)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"মাসের পরবর্তী বৈধ সমাপ্তির দিন (চুক্তি থেকে)","Expected receipt date":"প্রত্যাশিত প্রাপ্তির তারিখ","Your name":"আপনার নাম","Your address":"আপনার ঠিকানা","Landlord / agency":"ভূমি মালিক/এজেন্সি","Recipient address":"প্রাপকের ঠিকানা","Rental property":"ভাড়া সম্পত্তি","Place":"স্থান","Letter date":"চিঠির তারিখ","Termination of tenancy":"ভাড়াটিয়া অবসান","Calculate date and draft letter":"তারিখ এবং খসড়া চিঠি গণনা করুন","Planning date":"পরিকল্পনার তারিখ","Target date":"টার্গেট তারিখ","Editable draft":"সম্পাদনাযোগ্য খসড়া","Copy draft":"খসড়া কপি করুন","Enter your contract terms.":"আপনার চুক্তির শর্তাবলী লিখুন।","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"প্ল্যানিং ড্রাফ্ট প্রস্তুত। আপনার চুক্তির বিরুদ্ধে যাচাই করুন।","Check the dates and period.":"তারিখ এবং সময়কাল চেক করুন।","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"ফলাফল সরবরাহকৃত চুক্তি নোটিশের দিন অনুসরণ করে; এটা কোনো বিধিবদ্ধ নোটিশের রায় নয়।","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"সুইস সম্পত্তি লাভের দৃশ্যকল্প","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"সুইস সম্পত্তি লাভ কর — ব্যবহারকারী-প্রবেশকৃত হার দৃশ্যকল্প","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"আপনার নিজস্ব লেনদেনের খরচ এবং দায়ী ক্যান্টন থেকে একটি করের হার ব্যবহার করে একটি সম্পত্তি লাভ অনুমান করুন।","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"আয়, অধিগ্রহণের খরচ, আপনি নিশ্চিত করেছেন যোগ্য খরচ এবং অফিসিয়াল ক্যান্টোনাল ক্যালকুলেটর থেকে একটি কার্যকর হার লিখুন।","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"সুইস সম্পত্তি লাভ কর ক্যান্টন, হোল্ডিং পিরিয়ড, ডিডাকশন এবং কেস অনুসারে পরিবর্তিত হয়। এই টুল হার সরবরাহ করে না বা গ্রহণযোগ্য খরচ নির্ধারণ করে না।","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"বিক্রয়ের আয় (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"অধিগ্রহণ খরচ (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"অন্যান্য খরচ স্বীকারযোগ্য নিশ্চিত (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"অফিসিয়াল উৎস থেকে কার্যকর করের হার (%)","Estimate scenario":"আনুমানিক দৃশ্যকল্প","Illustrative scenario":"দৃষ্টান্তমূলক দৃশ্যকল্প","Gain entered":"লাভ প্রবেশ করানো হয়েছে৷","Tax at entered rate":"প্রবেশকৃত হারে কর","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"আপনার রেকর্ড এবং ক্যান্টন উৎস থেকে পরিসংখ্যান লিখুন।","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"পরিকল্পনা গণনা করা হয়েছে; ক্যান্টন দিয়ে যাচাই করুন।","Check amounts and rate.":"পরিমাণ এবং হার চেক করুন।","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"কোন ক্যান্টন ট্যাক্স টেবিল এম্বেড করা নেই; আপনার প্রবেশ করা কার্যকর হার অনুমান চালায়।","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"সুইস উত্তরাধিকার এবং উপহার ট্যাক্স দৃশ্যকল্প","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"সুইস উত্তরাধিকার এবং উপহার ট্যাক্স - আপনার হারের দৃশ্য","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"ব্যবহারকারী-প্রবেশকৃত ছাড় এবং হার থেকে একটি করযোগ্য পরিমাণ অনুমান করুন; ক্যান্টন এবং সম্পর্কের ভিত্তিতে নিয়ম পরিবর্তিত হয়।","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"প্রাপক এবং ক্যান্টনের জন্য নিশ্চিতকৃত পরিমাণ, ছাড় এবং কার্যকর হার লিখুন।","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"ক্যান্টন নিয়ম এবং পারিবারিক সম্পর্ক ছাড় এবং হার পরিবর্তন করতে পারে। এই টুলটি ক্যান্টন নিয়ম নির্বাচন করে না বা ট্যাক্স দায় নির্ধারণ করে না।","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"উত্তরাধিকার বা উপহারের পরিমাণ (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"ক্যান্টন (CHF) এর সাথে ছাড় নিশ্চিত করা হয়েছে","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"কার্যকর হার ক্যান্টনের সাথে নিশ্চিত করা হয়েছে (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"অনুমোদিত ছাড়ের পরে পরিমাণ","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"আপনার ক্ষেত্রে নিশ্চিত হওয়া পরিসংখ্যান লিখুন।","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"অনুমানটি শুধুমাত্র আপনি যে ছাড় এবং রেট প্রবেশ করান তা ব্যবহার করে।","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"সুইস চাইল্ড সাপোর্ট বাজেট দৃশ্যকল্প","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"সুইস চাইল্ড সাপোর্ট বাজেট — স্বচ্ছ পারিবারিক দৃশ্যকল্প","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"একটি প্রবেশ করা প্রত্যক্ষ খরচের ক্রেডিট পরে পিতামাতার আয় দ্বারা একটি প্রবেশ করা শিশু বাজেট বরাদ্দ করুন৷","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"সন্তানের নথিভুক্ত মাসিক চাহিদা, পিতামাতার উভয়েরই উপলব্ধ মাসিক আয় এবং আপনি ক্রেডিট করতে চান এমন কোনো সরাসরি খরচ ব্যবহার করুন।","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"এটি শুধুমাত্র একটি পরিকল্পনা ওয়ার্কশীট। এটি একটি সুইস শিশু-রক্ষণাবেক্ষণ পুরস্কার বা আইনি পদ্ধতি নয়; আবাসন, যত্ন, কর, সুবিধা এবং মামলা আইন মূল্যায়ন করা হয় না।","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"আপনার নথিভুক্ত মাসিক শিশু বাজেট (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"পিতামাতা একটি উপলব্ধ মাসিক আয় (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"প্যারেন্ট B উপলব্ধ মাসিক আয় (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"অভিভাবক A দ্বারা ক্রেডিট করার জন্য (CHF) সরাসরি সন্তানের খরচ","Allocate scenario":"পরিকল্পনা বরাদ্দ করুন","Illustrative allocation":"দৃষ্টান্তমূলক বরাদ্দ","Parent A remaining contribution":"অভিভাবক একটি অবশিষ্ট অবদান","Parent B contribution":"অভিভাবক B অবদান","Entered monthly child budget":"প্রবেশ করা হয়েছে মাসিক শিশু বাজেট","Enter your household budget figures.":"আপনার পরিবারের বাজেটের পরিসংখ্যান লিখুন।","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"বাজেট দৃশ্যকল্প গণনা করা হয়েছে; একজন যোগ্য উপদেষ্টার সাথে আইনি বাধ্যবাধকতা নিয়ে আলোচনা করুন।","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"পরিমাণ চেক করুন; ক্রেডিট বাজেট অতিক্রম করতে পারে না.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"শেয়ার দুটি প্রবেশকৃত আয়ের সমানুপাতিক; সরাসরি-খরচের ক্রেডিট প্রথমে বিয়োগ করা হয়।","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"ব্রাউজার হাইফেনেশন প্রিভিউ","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"শব্দ হাইফেনেশন পূর্বরূপ — ব্রাউজার ভাষার প্যাটার্নস","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"আপনার দেওয়া পাঠ্যের জন্য ব্রাউজার হাইফেনেশনের পূর্বরূপ দেখুন; সমর্থন ব্রাউজার এবং ইনস্টল করা ভাষা সম্পদের উপর নির্ভর করে।","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"আপনার পাঠ্যের সাথে মেলে এমন ভাষা চয়ন করুন, একটি নমুনা লিখুন এবং উপলব্ধ লাইন প্রস্থ সামঞ্জস্য করুন।","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"ব্রাউজারের নেটিভ CSS হাইফেনেশন ব্যবহার করে। এটা অভিধান বান্ডিল না; অসমর্থিত ব্রাউজার কোনো হাইফেন দেখাতে পারে না। টেক্সট কপি করলে মূল বানান ঠিক থাকে।","Text language (BCP 47)":"পাঠ্য ভাষা (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"প্রিভিউ প্রস্থ (অক্ষর)","Text to preview":"প্রিভিউ করার জন্য পাঠ্য","Preview":"প্রিভিউ","Enter text and choose its language.":"পাঠ্য লিখুন এবং এর ভাষা চয়ন করুন।","Preview updated.":"প্রিভিউ আপডেট করা হয়েছে।","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"একটি সমর্থিত ভাষা ট্যাগ এবং পাঠ্য লিখুন।","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"কোথায় ব্রাউজার শব্দ ভাঙতে পারে তা দেখতে বিভিন্ন প্রস্থে একই অনুচ্ছেদ চেষ্টা করুন৷","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"ব্যক্তিগত বানান চেক ওয়ার্কস্পেস","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"স্থানীয় বানান পরীক্ষক — আপনার ব্রাউজার অভিধান ব্যবহার করুন","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"ব্রাউজারের নেটিভ বানান পরীক্ষা করে পাঠ্য সম্পাদনা করুন, একটি ভাষা চয়ন করুন এবং সংশোধন করা পাঠ্যটি অনুলিপি করুন।","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"পাঠ্য এই পৃষ্ঠায় থাকে। আপনার ব্রাউজারে একটি বানান অভিধান আছে এমন একটি ভাষা সেট করুন, তারপরে এর বানান মেনু বা আন্ডারলাইন প্রস্তাবনাগুলি ব্যবহার করুন৷","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"এই ওয়ার্কস্পেস টেক্সট বা শিপ ডিকশনারী আপলোড করে না। ব্রাউজার বানান পরীক্ষা প্রাপ্যতা এবং পরামর্শ ডিভাইস, ব্রাউজার এবং ইনস্টল করা অভিধানের উপর নির্ভর করে।","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"বানান পরীক্ষা ভাষা (BCP 47)","Text to check":"পরীক্ষা করার জন্য পাঠ্য","Copy text":"পাঠ্য অনুলিপি করুন","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"টেক্সট টাইপ বা পেস্ট করুন। পরামর্শের জন্য ডান-ক্লিক করুন বা আপনার ডিভাইসের বানান মেনু ব্যবহার করুন।","Text copied.":"পাঠ্য অনুলিপি করা হয়েছে৷","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে অনুলিপি করা যায়নি; পাঠ্য নির্বাচন করুন এবং অনুলিপি করুন।","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"একটি মিলিত অভিধান ছাড়া একটি ব্রাউজার ভুল বানান চিহ্নিত করতে পারে না৷","Resume Structure Checker":"স্ট্রাকচার পরীক্ষক পুনরায় শুরু করুন","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS রিজিউম চেকার - বিনামূল্যে স্থানীয় PDF এবং DOCX পর্যালোচনা","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"আপনার ব্রাউজারে রেজিউম টেক্সট, শিরোনাম, বিভাগ, লিঙ্ক এবং বুলেট স্ট্রাকচার চেক করুন। গণনা অনুসারে কাজের বিবরণের শর্তাবলী তুলনা করুন; কোন নিয়োগ স্কোর বা আপলোড.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"একটি পাঠ্য-ভিত্তিক জীবনবৃত্তান্ত আসলে কী প্রকাশ করে তা পর্যালোচনা করুন: নিষ্কাশিত পাঠ্য, শিরোনাম কাঠামো, যোগাযোগ-ক্ষেত্রের উপস্থিতি, লিঙ্ক এবং সাধারণভাবে স্বীকৃত বিভাগগুলি। ঐচ্ছিকভাবে পুনরাবৃত্ত কাজের বর্ণনার শর্তাবলী তুলনা করুন।","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"অভিজ্ঞতা এবং শিক্ষার জন্য শিরোনাম 1 শৈলী সহ একটি DOCX সেই শিরোনামগুলি দেখায়৷ একটি PDF এর নির্বাচনযোগ্য পাঠ্য থেকে চেক করা হয়; কলাম একটি ভিন্ন ক্রমে পড়া হতে পারে.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX ফাইলগুলি স্থানীয়ভাবে Office ZIP/XML হিসাবে পরিদর্শন করা হয়৷ পিডিএফগুলি একটি বিলম্বিত স্থানীয় PDF.js ইঞ্জিনের সাথে পড়া হয়৷ ঐচ্ছিক কাজের বিবরণ তুলনা প্রতিটি পাঠ্যের নির্বাচিত পদ গণনা করে; এটি একটি স্কোর তৈরি করে না বা কাউকে নিয়োগের সুপারিশ করে না।","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"এটি একটি ফরম্যাট এবং টেক্সট-স্ট্রাকচার চেক, এটি একটি ATS সিমুলেটর নয়, আইনি পর্যালোচনা বা সাক্ষাৎকারের সাফল্যের পূর্বাভাস। নির্বাচনযোগ্য পাঠ্য ছাড়াই স্ক্যান করা পিডিএফগুলি প্রথমে ওসিআর প্রয়োজন৷ পাসওয়ার্ড-সুরক্ষিত, ম্যাক্রো-সক্ষম, স্বাক্ষরিত বা অস্বাভাবিকভাবে বড় নথি সমর্থিত নয়।","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"একটি জীবনবৃত্তান্ত চয়ন করুন (PDF বা DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"আপনার ফাইলগুলি এই ব্রাউজারে থাকে এবং আপলোড হয় না৷ সর্বাধিক 20 এমবি; পিডিএফ 50 পৃষ্ঠা পর্যন্ত। DOCX সম্প্রসারিত বিষয়বস্তু 80 MB এ সীমাবদ্ধ।","Optional job description":"ঐচ্ছিক কাজের বিবরণ","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"আপনি যদি টার্ম-ফ্রিকোয়েন্সি তুলনা করতে চান তাহলে প্লেইন টেক্সট পেস্ট করুন। আপনার বিশ্লেষণ করার প্রয়োজন নেই এমন সংবেদনশীল তথ্য অন্তর্ভুক্ত করবেন না।","Paste job-description text here…":"চাকরীর বিবরণের পাঠ্য এখানে আটকান...","Analyze locally":"স্থানীয়ভাবে বিশ্লেষণ করুন","Clear files and report":"ফাইল এবং রিপোর্ট সাফ করুন","Resume review":"পর্যালোচনা পুনরায় শুরু করুন","File type":"ফাইলের ধরন","Extracted characters":"এক্সট্র্যাক্ট করা অক্ষর","Words counted":"শব্দ গণনা করা হয়েছে","Detected headings":"শনাক্ত করা শিরোনাম","Recognized sections":"স্বীকৃত বিভাগ","Hyperlinks found":"হাইপারলিঙ্ক পাওয়া গেছে","Bullet paragraphs":"বুলেট অনুচ্ছেদ","An email address appears in the text":"পাঠ্যটিতে একটি ইমেল ঠিকানা প্রদর্শিত হবে৷","No email address pattern was detected":"কোন ইমেল ঠিকানা প্যাটার্ন সনাক্ত করা যায়নি","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"টেক্সটে ফোন নম্বরের মতো প্যাটার্ন দেখা যাচ্ছে","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"কোন ফোন নম্বরের মতো প্যাটার্ন শনাক্ত করা যায়নি৷","Job-description terms (counts only)":"চাকরীর বিবরণের শর্তাবলী (শুধুমাত্র গণনা)","Term":"মেয়াদ","In job text":"চাকরীর টেক্সটে","In resume":"জীবনবৃত্তান্তে","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"মেয়াদী সংখ্যার তুলনা করতে একটি কাজের বিবরণ পেস্ট করুন।","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"কোন স্পষ্ট শিরোনাম শৈলী সনাক্ত করা যায়নি. PDF শিরোনামগুলি পাঠ্যের আকার থেকে অনুমান করা হয়েছে এবং ভুল হতে পারে৷","Detected":"শনাক্ত করা হয়েছে৷","Not detected":"শনাক্ত করা হয়নি","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"এই হিউরিস্টিক সাধারণ বিভাগের নামের একটি সীমিত সেটকে স্বীকৃতি দেয়; কোন বিভাগে প্রয়োজন তা নির্ধারণ করে না।","Profile / summary":"প্রোফাইল/সারাংশ","Experience":"অভিজ্ঞতা","Education":"শিক্ষা","Skills":"দক্ষতা","Contact":"যোগাযোগ","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"কোন নির্বাচনযোগ্য পাঠ্য পাওয়া যায়নি। শুধুমাত্র স্ক্যান করা PDF গুলি চেক করার আগে OCR প্রয়োজন৷","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"শুরু করতে একটি PDF বা DOCX জীবনবৃত্তান্ত বেছে নিন।","Reading the selected file locally…":"নির্বাচিত ফাইল স্থানীয়ভাবে পড়া হচ্ছে...","Local structure review complete.":"স্থানীয় কাঠামো পর্যালোচনা সম্পূর্ণ।","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"এই ব্রাউজারটি একটি প্রয়োজনীয় স্থানীয় নথি বৈশিষ্ট্য সমর্থন করে না।","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"উক্ত স্থানীয় সীমা পর্যন্ত একটি বৈধ PDF বা আধুনিক DOCX ফাইল বেছে নিন।","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"পিডিএফ পড়া যায়নি। এটি ক্ষতিগ্রস্থ, এনক্রিপ্ট করা বা কোন নির্বাচনযোগ্য পাঠ্য থাকতে পারে।","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX প্যাকেজটি নিরাপদে খোলা বা পড়া যাবে না।","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"এই টুলটি কি আমার জীবনবৃত্তান্ত আপলোড বা সংরক্ষণ করে?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"না। পার্সিং এবং বিশ্লেষণ আপনার ব্রাউজারে রান. আপনি রিপোর্ট সাফ করার পরে বা পৃষ্ঠা ছেড়ে যাওয়ার পরে ফাইলের পাঠ্যটি সার্ভারে পাঠানো হয় না বা ধরে রাখা হয় না।","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"এটি কি ভবিষ্যদ্বাণী করে যে একজন ATS বা নিয়োগকর্তা আমার জীবনবৃত্তান্ত গ্রহণ করবে কিনা?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"না। এটি শুধুমাত্র পঠনযোগ্য পাঠ্য এবং সাধারণ কাঠামো পরীক্ষা করে। নিয়োগের সিস্টেমগুলি আলাদা, এবং এটি একটি ATS সামঞ্জস্যতার গ্যারান্টি বা নিয়োগের পূর্বাভাস নয়।","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"এটি কি স্ক্যান করা PDF পড়তে পারে?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"পিডিএফ-এ একটি নির্বাচনযোগ্য পাঠ্য স্তর থাকলেই৷ এই চেকার OCR মডেল ডাউনলোড করে না; শুধুমাত্র স্ক্যান করা ইমেজ ডকুমেন্টের জন্য প্রথমে একটি OCR টুল ব্যবহার করুন।","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"চাকরীর বিবরণ তুলনা মানে কি?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"এটি সাধারণ স্বাভাবিককরণের পরে পুনরাবৃত্তিমূলক পদগুলির জন্য গণনা দেখায়। এটি আপনার যোগ্যতার ম্যাচ শতাংশ, র‌্যাঙ্কিং, সুপারিশ বা মূল্যায়ন নয়।","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"কেন একটি PDF একটি DOCX এর চেয়ে কম শিরোনাম দেখায়?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF সাধারণত শব্দার্থিক শিরোনাম শৈলী সংরক্ষণ করে না। চেকার পাঠ্যের আকার এবং পড়ার ক্রম থেকে বিশিষ্ট লাইনগুলি অনুমান করে, তাই কলাম এবং ভিজ্যুয়াল ডিজাইন ফলাফলকে প্রভাবিত করতে পারে।","How local resume review works":"স্থানীয় জীবনবৃত্তান্ত পর্যালোচনা কিভাবে কাজ করে","Resume checker questions":"পরীক্ষক প্রশ্ন পুনরায় শুরু করুন","Scope and limitations":"সুযোগ এবং সীমাবদ্ধতা","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"স্থানীয় ভোকাল এবং সঙ্গতি বিভাজক","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"ভোকাল রিমুভার — স্থানীয়ভাবে আলাদা কণ্ঠ এবং সঙ্গত","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"আপনার ব্রাউজারে আনুমানিক ভোকাল এবং সঙ্গতিতে একটি ছোট স্টেরিও অডিও নমুনা আলাদা করুন। অডিও আপনার ডিভাইসে থাকে; মডেলটি তার পাবলিক হোস্ট থেকে ডাউনলোড করা হয়।","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"30 সেকেন্ড পর্যন্ত একটি স্টেরিও মিউজিক ক্লিপ বেছে নিন। প্রথম ব্যবহারে, ব্রাউজারটি একটি 35.6 MB মডেল ডাউনলোড করে। অডিও ফাইল এই ডিভাইসে প্রক্রিয়া করা হয় এবং আপলোড করা হয় না.","What you get":"আপনি যা পাবেন","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"দুটি ডাব্লুএভি স্টেমের পূর্বরূপ দেখুন এবং ডাউনলোড করুন: আনুমানিক কণ্ঠ এবং অবশিষ্ট সঙ্গতি। ফলাফলগুলি মিশ্রণের উপর নির্ভর করে এবং এতে নিদর্শন থাকতে পারে।","Local processing":"স্থানীয় প্রক্রিয়াকরণ","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"টুলটি ONNX এবং ONNX রানটাইম ওয়েবে রপ্তানি করা Open-Unmix UMX-HQ ভোকাল নেটওয়ার্ক ব্যবহার করে। আপনি আলাদা প্রেস করলেই মডেলটি আনা হয়; কোন প্রদত্ত অনুমান API বা সদস্যতা ব্যবহার করা হয় না. অডিও স্থানীয়ভাবে ডিকোড, প্রক্রিয়াজাত এবং রপ্তানি করা হয়।","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"এটি স্টেরিও 44.1 kHz প্রসেসিং এবং 30 সেকেন্ড পর্যন্ত ক্লিপের জন্য একটি অনুমান। মনো উত্সগুলি স্টেরিওতে নকল করা হয়েছে৷ যন্ত্র, ভারী প্রভাব, লাইভ রেকর্ডিং এবং অস্বাভাবিক ঘরানার মধ্যে গভীরভাবে মিশ্রিত কণ্ঠগুলি ফুটো বা শিল্পকর্ম তৈরি করতে পারে। পরিচ্ছন্ন মাস্টার হিসাবে ফলাফল ব্যবহার করবেন না। মডেল ডাউনলোডের জন্য একটি ইন্টারনেট সংযোগ প্রয়োজন; অডিও এই ডিভাইস ছেড়ে না.","Is my audio uploaded?":"আমার অডিও কি আপলোড করা হয়েছে?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"না। নির্বাচিত অডিও আপনার ব্রাউজারে ডিকোড এবং প্রক্রিয়া করা হয়। আপনি বিচ্ছেদ শুরু করার সময় একমাত্র নেটওয়ার্ক অনুরোধ হল মডেল ডাউনলোড।","Why is the first run slow?":"প্রথম রান ধীর কেন?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"ব্রাউজারটি একবার 35.6 MB মডেল ডাউনলোড করে; ব্রাউজার এটি ক্যাশে করতে পারে। ইনফারেন্স তখন ডিভাইস CPU-তে স্থানীয়ভাবে চলে।","Will every song separate cleanly?":"প্রতিটি গান কি পরিষ্কারভাবে আলাদা হবে?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"না। মডেলটি একটি ভোকাল স্টেম অনুমান করে এবং কণ্ঠ্য ফুটো ছেড়ে যেতে পারে, যন্ত্র সুরেলা অপসারণ করতে পারে বা শিল্পকর্ম তৈরি করতে পারে। কান্ডের উপর নির্ভর করার আগে শুনুন।","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"স্টিরিও অডিও ফাইল (30 সেকেন্ড পর্যন্ত)","Choose audio":"অডিও বেছে নিন","Separate vocals":"পৃথক কণ্ঠ","Cancel / clear":"বাতিল / সাফ","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"শুরু করতে একটি ছোট অডিও ফাইল বেছে নিন।","Downloading the separation model…":"বিচ্ছেদ মডেল ডাউনলোড করা হচ্ছে...","Separating locally…":"স্থানীয়ভাবে আলাদা করা হচ্ছে...","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"বিচ্ছেদ সম্পূর্ণ। প্রিভিউ বা ডাউনলোড হয় স্টেম.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"এই ফাইলটি প্রক্রিয়া করা বা মডেলটি লোড করা যায়নি। বিন্যাস এবং সংযোগ পরীক্ষা করুন, তারপর আবার চেষ্টা করুন.","Model and weight license information":"মডেল এবং ওজন লাইসেন্স তথ্য","Estimated vocals":"আনুমানিক কণ্ঠস্বর","Estimated accompaniment":"আনুমানিক অনুষঙ্গী","Download WAV":"WAV ডাউনলোড করুন","Progress":"প্রগতি","Preparing local separation…":"স্থানীয় বিচ্ছেদ প্রস্তুত করা হচ্ছে...","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"বিচ্ছেদ সম্পূর্ণ। এই ডিভাইসে অডিও রয়ে গেছে।","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"এই অডিও প্রক্রিয়া করা যায়নি। 30 সেকেন্ডের নিচে একটি স্টেরিও মিউজিক ফাইল ব্যবহার করে দেখুন।","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"সুইস হেলথ ইন্স্যুরেন্স ডিডাক্টিবল কম্প্যারেটর","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"সুইস হেলথ ইন্স্যুরেন্স ফ্র্যাঞ্চাইজ ক্যালকুলেটর — বার্ষিক খরচ তুলনা করুন","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"প্রিমিয়াম এবং যোগ্য বার্ষিক চিকিৎসা খরচ ব্যবহার করে সুইস মৌলিক স্বাস্থ্য বীমা ছাড়ের তুলনা করুন যা আপনি লিখছেন। কোন বীমাকারী উদ্ধৃতি অনুমান করা হয় না.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"একই বীমাকারীর দ্বারা দেখানো মাসিক প্রিমিয়ামগুলি লিখুন যেগুলি প্রতিটি কাটছাঁটের জন্য অফার করে, তারপর কম, প্রত্যাশিত এবং উচ্চ বার্ষিক চিকিত্সা-খরচের পরিস্থিতির তুলনা করুন৷","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"আবশ্যিক সুইস মৌলিক স্বাস্থ্য বীমার জন্য, একটি প্রাপ্তবয়স্ক স্ট্যান্ডার্ড ছাড়যোগ্য CHF 300 এবং একটি শিশু ছাড়যোগ্য CHF 0৷ ঐচ্ছিক স্তরগুলি বয়সের দ্বারা পৃথক হয়৷ বাদ দেওয়ার পরে, স্ট্যান্ডার্ড রিটেনশন ফি হল যোগ্য অবশিষ্ট খরচের 10%, প্রাপ্তবয়স্কদের জন্য প্রতি বছর CHF 700 এবং শিশুদের জন্য 350 CHF। টুলটি আপনার প্রবেশ করা প্রিমিয়াম এই মডেল করা খরচ ভাগাভাগি করতে যোগ করে; এটি বীমাকারীর হার আনে না বা কোন বিকল্পটি আপনার জন্য সঠিক তা নির্ধারণ করে না।","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"যদি একজন প্রাপ্তবয়স্ক CHF 400 মাসিক প্রিমিয়ামে প্রবেশ করে CHF 300 ছাড়যোগ্য এবং CHF 350 একটি CHF 2,500 কেটে নেওয়া যায়, বার্ষিক প্রিমিয়ামের পার্থক্য হল CHF 600৷ সেই সঞ্চয়ের সাথে তুলনা করুন খরচ ভাগাভাগির মডেলের পার্থক্যের সাথে, প্রত্যাশিত প্রতিটিতে প্রত্যাশিত- কম পরিমাণে৷","How the estimate works":"কিভাবে অনুমান কাজ করে","Common questions":"সাধারণ প্রশ্ন","Scope and exclusions":"স্কোপ এবং এক্সক্লুশন","Where do I get the premiums?":"আমি প্রিমিয়াম কোথায় পাব?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"একই বীমাকারী, প্রিমিয়াম অঞ্চল, বয়স গোষ্ঠী, দুর্ঘটনা কভার এবং বীমা মডেলের জন্য বর্তমান মাসিক অফারগুলি ব্যবহার করুন৷ Priminfo হল অফিসিয়াল ফেডারেল তুলনা সাইট। এই পৃষ্ঠাটি বীমাকারীর উদ্ধৃতি আনয়ন বা পুনরুত্পাদন করে না।","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"সব তালিকাভুক্ত ডিডাকটিবল লেভেল কি সবসময় দেওয়া হয়?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"না। বীমাকারীদের প্রতিটি ঐচ্ছিক স্তর অফার করতে হবে না, এবং অফারগুলি অল্প বয়স্কদের জন্য আলাদা হতে পারে। শুধুমাত্র আপনার নিজস্ব পলিসির জন্য দেখানো প্রিমিয়াম লিখুন; অনুপলব্ধ বিকল্পগুলি ফাঁকা ছেড়ে দিন।","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"এটা কি আমার সম্পূর্ণ মেডিকেল বিল দেখায়?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"না। মডেলটি যোগ্য খরচে সাধারণ ছাড়যোগ্য এবং স্ট্যান্ডার্ড 10% ধরে রাখার ফি কভার করে। এতে হাসপাতালের দিনের অবদান, বিশেষ 40% ওষুধ ধারণ, অব্যাহতি পরিষেবা, নন-কভারড কেয়ার এবং সম্পূরক বীমা বাদ দেওয়া হয়।","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"এটি একটি দৃশ্যকল্পের তুলনা, বীমা, চিকিৎসা বা আর্থিক পরামর্শ নয়। এটি আপনার চিকিত্সা বা প্রিমিয়ামের পূর্বাভাস দেয় না। এটি হাসপাতালের দিনের অবদান (সাধারণত 15 CHF প্রতি ইনপেশেন্ট দিনে, বিধিবদ্ধ ছাড় সহ), কিছু ওষুধের উপর বিশেষ 40% ধরে রাখা, মাতৃত্ব/প্রতিরোধমূলক ছাড়, বাধ্যতামূলক কভারের বাইরে পরিষেবা, প্রিমিয়াম ভর্তুকি এবং সম্পূরক বীমা বাদ দেয়। প্রকৃত সহ-প্রদান তাই ভিন্ন হতে পারে। একটি উচ্চ কর্তনযোগ্য মানে আপনি যদি যত্ন গ্রহণ করেন তবে আপনাকে আরও অগ্রিম অর্থ প্রদান করতে সক্ষম হতে হবে।","Who is insured under this policy?":"এই পলিসির অধীনে কারা বীমাকৃত?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"প্রাপ্তবয়স্ক (বয়স 19 বা তার বেশি)","Child (under 18)":"শিশু (18 বছরের কম)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"নিম্ন বার্ষিক যোগ্য চিকিৎসা-খরচের দৃশ্য (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"প্রত্যাশিত বার্ষিক যোগ্য চিকিৎসা খরচ (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"উচ্চ বার্ষিক যোগ্য চিকিৎসা-খরচ দৃশ্যকল্প (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"একজন বীমাকারীর কাছ থেকে মাসিক প্রিমিয়াম","Monthly premium":"মাসিক প্রিমিয়াম","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"এই একই নীতির জন্য শুধুমাত্র প্রস্তাবিত বিকল্পগুলি লিখুন৷ অন্যদের ফাঁকা ছেড়ে দিন।","Adult deductible choices":"প্রাপ্তবয়স্কদের ছাড়যোগ্য পছন্দ","Child deductible choices":"শিশু কাটানোর যোগ্য পছন্দ","Compare annual costs":"বার্ষিক খরচ তুলনা করুন","Clear entries":"এন্ট্রি সাফ করুন","Download CSV":"CSV ডাউনলোড করুন","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"আনুমানিক বার্ষিক প্রিমিয়াম প্লাস খরচ ভাগাভাগি","Deductible":"ছাড়যোগ্য","Annual premiums":"বার্ষিক প্রিমিয়াম","Total at low costs":"স্বল্প খরচে মোট","Total at expected costs":"প্রত্যাশিত খরচে মোট","Total at high costs":"উচ্চ খরচে মোট","Cost sharing at low costs":"কম খরচে খরচ ভাগাভাগি","Cost sharing at expected costs":"প্রত্যাশিত খরচে খরচ ভাগাভাগি","Cost sharing at high costs":"উচ্চ খরচে খরচ ভাগাভাগি","Difference from lowest available deductible":"সর্বনিম্ন উপলব্ধ কর্তনযোগ্য থেকে পার্থক্য","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"চিকিৎসা খরচ যেখানে প্রিমিয়াম সেভ করা হয়","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"প্রদত্ত প্রিমিয়াম সঞ্চয় মডেল করা খরচ ভাগাভাগি সীমার মধ্যে বাতিল করা হয় না।","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"সর্বনিম্ন ছাড়ের বিপরীতে কোনো প্রিমিয়াম সঞ্চয় নেই।","Lowest expected total among entered options":"প্রদত্ত বিকল্পগুলির মধ্যে সর্বনিম্ন প্রত্যাশিত মোট","Scenario details":"দৃশ্যের বিবরণ","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"অন্তত দুটি উপলব্ধ ডিডাক্টিবলের জন্য তিনটি অর্ডার করা চিকিৎসা-খরচের পরিস্থিতি এবং মাসিক প্রিমিয়াম লিখুন।","Official rules and current premiums:":"অফিসিয়াল নিয়ম এবং বর্তমান প্রিমিয়াম:","Federal deductible rules":"ফেডারেল ছাড়যোগ্য নিয়ম","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo অফিসিয়াল প্রিমিয়াম তুলনা","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"এই ব্রাউজারে তুলনা করা হয়েছে।","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"বয়স গ্রুপ, অর্ডারকৃত খরচের পরিস্থিতি এবং কমপক্ষে দুটি মাসিক প্রিমিয়াম দেখুন।","Entries cleared.":"এন্ট্রিগুলি সাফ করা হয়েছে৷","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV স্থানীয়ভাবে ডাউনলোড করা হয়েছে।","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"সুইস হেলথ প্রিমিয়াম রিডাকশন ক্যালকুলেটর","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"সুইস প্রিমিয়াম ভর্তুকি ক্যালকুলেটর - আপনার নেট প্রিমিয়াম","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"বর্তমান প্রিমিয়াম থেকে নেট সুইস স্বাস্থ্য-বীমা প্রিমিয়াম এবং আপনার ক্যান্টন দ্বারা ইতিমধ্যেই দেওয়া মাসিক হ্রাসের হিসাব করুন।","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"আপনার বীমাকারী বা ক্যান্টোনাল সিদ্ধান্তের কাছ থেকে প্রিমিয়াম এবং নিশ্চিত মাসিক হ্রাস লিখুন। আপনি যোগ্য কিনা এই টুলটি সিদ্ধান্ত নেয় না।","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"সুইস ক্যান্টন নির্ধারণ করে কে যোগ্য, কতটা সমর্থন দেওয়া হবে এবং একটি আবেদনের প্রয়োজন আছে কিনা। এই ক্যালকুলেটর শুধুমাত্র একটি পলিসি প্রিমিয়াম থেকে একটি নিশ্চিত মাসিক হ্রাস বিয়োগ করে এবং বার্ষিক পরিমাণ দেখায়।","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"মাসিক প্রিমিয়াম যদি CHF 420 হয় এবং নিশ্চিত হ্রাস CHF 120 হয়, তাহলে আনুমানিক নেট প্রিমিয়াম হল প্রতি মাসে 300 CHF।","How the calculation works":"কিভাবে গণনা কাজ করে","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"এটা কি আমাকে বলে যে আমি যোগ্য কিনা?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"না। যোগ্যতা এবং পুরস্কারের পরিমাণ বাসস্থানের ক্যান্টন দ্বারা নির্ধারিত হয়। লিঙ্ক করা অফিসিয়াল তথ্য ব্যবহার করুন বা ক্যান্টনাল অফিসে যোগাযোগ করুন।","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"আমি হ্রাসের পরিমাণ কোথায় পাব?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"বর্তমান সিদ্ধান্ত বা আপনার বীমাকারীর দ্বারা দেখানো হ্রাসকৃত প্রিমিয়াম ব্যবহার করুন। কিছু ক্যান্টন স্বয়ংক্রিয়ভাবে হ্রাস মঞ্জুর করে; অন্যদের একটি আবেদন প্রয়োজন.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"এটি একটি নীতির জন্য পাটিগণিত, কোনো যোগ্যতা বা সুবিধার সিদ্ধান্ত নয়। এটি পরিবারের আয়, সম্পদ, পারিবারিক অবস্থা, সময়সীমা, ক্যান্টোনাল থ্রেশহোল্ড বা আবেদনের অধিকার গণনা করে না। প্রিমিয়াম এবং পুরস্কার পরিবর্তন হতে পারে; আপনার বীমাকারী এবং ক্যান্টনের সাথে তাদের নিশ্চিত করুন।","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"বর্তমান মাসিক প্রিমিয়াম (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"মাসিক হ্রাস ইতিমধ্যেই দেওয়া হয়েছে (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"ক্যান্টন বা বীমাকারীর দ্বারা নিশ্চিতকৃত পরিমাণ লিখুন; একটি পুরস্কার হিসাবে একটি অনুমান ব্যবহার করবেন না.","Calculate net premium":"নেট প্রিমিয়াম গণনা করুন","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"বর্তমান প্রিমিয়াম এবং নিশ্চিত হ্রাস লিখুন।","Estimated premium after reduction":"কমানোর পর আনুমানিক প্রিমিয়াম","Current monthly premium":"বর্তমান মাসিক প্রিমিয়াম","Monthly reduction":"মাসিক হ্রাস","Estimated net monthly premium":"আনুমানিক নেট মাসিক প্রিমিয়াম","Reduction over 12 months":"12 মাসের বেশি হ্রাস","Reduction as a share of premium":"প্রিমিয়ামের একটি শেয়ার হিসাবে হ্রাস","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"গণনা সম্পূর্ণ। আপনার ক্যান্টন এবং বীমাকারীর সাথে পুরস্কার এবং কার্যকর তারিখ নিশ্চিত করুন।","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"কমানোর মাসিক প্রিমিয়ামের চেয়ে বেশি নয় তা পরীক্ষা করুন।","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"সুইস ভাড়া রেফারেন্স-রেট দৃশ্যকল্প ক্যালকুলেটর","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"সুইস ভাড়া সমন্বয় ক্যালকুলেটর — রেফারেন্স রেট দৃশ্যকল্প","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"সুইজারল্যান্ডের মর্টগেজ রেফারেন্স রেট কীভাবে আবাসিক নেট ভাড়াকে প্রভাবিত করে তা শুধুমাত্র অনুমান করুন। ফেডারেল হাউজিং অফিস থেকে সর্বশেষ হার ব্যবহার করুন.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"আপনার ইজারা বা সর্বশেষ ভাড়া বিজ্ঞপ্তিতে উল্লেখিত রেফারেন্স রেট বর্তমান অফিসিয়াল সুইস রেট এর সাথে তুলনা করুন। গণনা আপনার ডিভাইসে থাকে।","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"আবাসনের জন্য ফেডারেল অফিস প্রতি ত্রৈমাসিকে সুইস ভাড়া সমন্বয়ের জন্য একটি বন্ধকী রেফারেন্স রেট প্রকাশ করে। একটি 0.25 শতাংশ-পয়েন্ট বৃদ্ধি নীতিগতভাবে 3% ভাড়া বৃদ্ধির অনুমতি দিতে পারে; একটি 0.25-পয়েন্ট হ্রাস নীতিগতভাবে 2.91% হ্রাসের অনুমতি দিতে পারে। এই দৃশ্যটি সেই পরিবর্তনগুলি ধাপে ধাপে প্রয়োগ করে আপনার প্রবেশ করা নেট ভাড়ায়।","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"CHF 3,000 মাসিক নেট ভাড়ার জন্য, একটি রেফারেন্স-রেট 1.75% থেকে 1.50% পর্যন্ত হ্রাস করলে প্রতি মাসে প্রায় −CHF 87.38 (−2.91%) এর আনুমানিক রেফারেন্স-রেট-শুধু পরিবর্তন পাওয়া যায়।","How this estimate works":"এই অনুমান কিভাবে কাজ করে","Where do I find the current rate?":"বর্তমান হার কোথায় পাব?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"লিঙ্ক করা ফেডারেল অফিস ফর হাউজিং পৃষ্ঠা খুলুন এবং বর্তমান প্রকাশিত হার লিখুন। টুলটি এমন একটি হার এম্বেড করে না যা পুরানো হয়ে যেতে পারে।","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"এটি কি সিদ্ধান্ত নেয় যে আমি ভাড়া পরিবর্তনের অনুরোধ করতে পারি কিনা?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"না। এটি অভিযোজন জন্য একটি ফ্যাক্টর বিচ্ছিন্ন. আপনার চুক্তি, মুদ্রাস্ফীতি, খরচ পরিবর্তন, সংরক্ষণ এবং অন্যান্য আইনি শর্ত ফলাফল পরিবর্তন করতে পারে।","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"ফলাফল কি আনুষঙ্গিক খরচ অন্তর্ভুক্ত করে?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"না। মাসিক নেট ভাড়া লিখুন, আনুষঙ্গিক খরচ এবং অন্যান্য পরিবর্তনশীল চার্জ ব্যতীত।","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"ফলাফল হল একটি উদাহরণমূলক রেফারেন্স-রেটের দৃশ্য, আইনি মতামত বা সম্পূর্ণ ভাড়া পর্যালোচনা নয়। এটি মুদ্রাস্ফীতি, সাধারণ খরচ পরিবর্তন, উন্নতি, চুক্তিভিত্তিক সংরক্ষণ, সূচীকৃত বা ধাপে দেওয়া ভাড়া, নোটিশের তারিখ এবং ক্যান্টোনাল পদ্ধতি বাদ দেয়। অভিনয় করার আগে আপনার ইজারা এবং অফিসিয়াল নির্দেশিকা পরীক্ষা করুন।","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"সুইস আবাসিক ইজারা: শুধুমাত্র বন্ধকী-রেফারেন্স-রেট প্রভাবের একটি অনুমান। এটি একটি আইনি সিদ্ধান্ত বা সম্পূর্ণ ভাড়া পর্যালোচনা নয়।","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"বর্তমান মাসিক নেট ভাড়া (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"আপনার ইজারা বা সর্বশেষ ভাড়া বিজ্ঞপ্তিতে উল্লেখিত রেফারেন্স রেট (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"বর্তমান অফিসিয়াল সুইস রেফারেন্স রেট (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"রেফারেন্স-রেট দৃশ্যকল্প গণনা করুন","Reference-rate-only scenario":"রেফারেন্স-রেট শুধুমাত্র দৃশ্যকল্প","Current monthly net rent":"বর্তমান মাসিক নেট ভাড়া","Reference-rate change":"রেফারেন্স-রেট পরিবর্তন","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"রেফারেন্স রেট থেকে আনুমানিক মাসিক প্রভাব","Scenario monthly net rent":"সিনেরিও মাসিক নেট ভাড়া","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"একই হারে 12 মাসের জন্য বার্ষিক প্রভাব","potential increase":"সম্ভাব্য বৃদ্ধি","potential decrease":"সম্ভাব্য হ্রাস","no reference-rate change":"কোনো রেফারেন্স-রেট পরিবর্তন নেই","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"প্রতিটি 0.25 শতাংশ-পয়েন্ট বৃদ্ধির জন্য অনুমানটি 3% এবং প্রতিটি হ্রাসের জন্য সমতুল্য বিপরীত হ্রাস প্রযোজ্য। অন্যান্য কারণ ফলাফল পরিবর্তন করতে পারে.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"এতে মুদ্রাস্ফীতি, সাধারণ খরচ পরিবর্তন, উন্নতি, চুক্তি সংরক্ষণ, সূচীকৃত বা ধাপে দেওয়া ভাড়া, নোটিশের তারিখ বা স্থানীয় পদ্ধতিগত প্রয়োজনীয়তা অন্তর্ভুক্ত নয়। আপনার ইজারা এবং হাউজিং নির্দেশিকা জন্য ফেডারেল অফিস চেক করুন।","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"সর্বশেষ অফিসিয়াল রেট এবং নির্দেশিকা দেখুন","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"সুইস ফেডারেল অফিস ফর হাউজিং (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"একটি দৃশ্য দেখতে ভাড়া এবং উভয় হার লিখুন।","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"পরিকল্পনা গণনা করা হয়েছে। এটির উপর নির্ভর করার আগে তারিখ এবং চুক্তির শর্তাবলী যাচাই করুন।","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"পরিমাণ এবং হার চেক করুন। হার অবশ্যই 0% এবং 5% এর মধ্যে হতে হবে এবং 0.25-পয়েন্ট ধাপে আলাদা হতে হবে।","Inputs cleared.":"ইনপুট সাফ করা হয়েছে৷","Result":"ফলাফল","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"সুইস অবকাশ প্রাপ্তি অনুমানকারী","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"সুইস ভ্যাকেশন অ্যাক্রুয়াল ক্যালকুলেটর — আনুপাতিক ছুটি ব্যালেন্স","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"আপনার চুক্তি, কর্ম সপ্তাহ, কর্মসংস্থানের তারিখ এবং ইতিমধ্যে নেওয়া দিনগুলিতে বার্ষিক ছুটি থেকে একটি সুইস অবকাশ-দিনের ব্যালেন্স অনুমান করুন।","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"আপনার প্রবেশ করা এনটাইটেলমেন্ট এবং কাজের সময়সূচী ব্যবহার করে এক ক্যালেন্ডার বছরের জন্য আনুপাতিক বেতনের ছুটি অনুমান করুন। কোন চুক্তির শর্তাবলী অনুমান করা হয়.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"নির্বাচিত বছরে নিযুক্ত ক্যালেন্ডার দিনগুলির দ্বারা অনুমানকারী আপনার চুক্তিতে বার্ষিক ছুটির দিনগুলিকে অনুমান করে। খণ্ডকালীন কাজের জন্য, প্রতি সপ্তাহে আপনার স্বাভাবিক কাজের দিন এবং সপ্তাহে বার্ষিক ছুটি লিখুন।","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"চার সপ্তাহের ছুটি, পাঁচ দিনের কর্মসপ্তাহ এবং সারা বছর চাকরির সাথে, বার্ষিক এনটাইটেলমেন্ট হল ইতিমধ্যে নেওয়া ছুটি বিয়োগ করার 20 কার্যদিবস।","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"সুইস সংবিধিবদ্ধ নূন্যতম কি?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"ফেডারেল নির্দেশিকা প্রতি পরিষেবা বছরে কমপক্ষে চার সপ্তাহ, এবং 20 বছর বয়সে পৌঁছেনি এমন কর্মীদের জন্য পাঁচ সপ্তাহ। একটি চুক্তি বা যৌথ চুক্তি আরও বেশি মঞ্জুর করতে পারে।","Does this decide my legal balance?":"এটি কি আমার আইনি ব্যালেন্স নির্ধারণ করে?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"না। এটি একটি সাধারণ ক্যালেন্ডার-দিনের অনুপাত। চুক্তির শর্তাবলী, প্রযোজ্য যৌথ নিয়ম, যোগ্যতা অনুপস্থিতি, রাউন্ডিং এবং নিয়োগকর্তার রেকর্ড ভারসাম্য পরিবর্তন করতে পারে।","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"এই অনুমানটি কোনও আইনি এনটাইটেলমেন্ট বা ছুটির বেতন গণনা করে না। এটি নির্দিষ্ট দীর্ঘায়িত অনুপস্থিতি, চুক্তি-নির্দিষ্ট সঞ্চয় এবং রাউন্ডিং নিয়ম, সরকারী ছুটি, ওভারটাইম, বহন করার সময়সীমা এবং বিরোধের জন্য হ্রাস বাদ দেয়। আপনার চুক্তি পরীক্ষা করুন এবং প্রতিদ্বন্দ্বিত ব্যালেন্সের জন্য পরামর্শ পান।","Leave year":"ছাড়ের বছর","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"আপনার চুক্তিতে বার্ষিক ছুটি (সপ্তাহ)","Usual working days per week":"প্রতি সপ্তাহে স্বাভাবিক কাজের দিন","Employment start date":"কর্মসংস্থান শুরুর তারিখ","Employment end date":"কর্মসংস্থানের শেষ তারিখ","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"এই ছুটির বছরে ইতিমধ্যেই নেওয়া ছুটির দিনগুলি","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"শুধুমাত্র ওরিয়েন্টেশনের জন্য। চুক্তিভিত্তিক বার্ষিক এনটাইটেলমেন্ট লিখুন; 20 বছরের কম বয়সী কর্মীদের জন্য আইনগত সর্বনিম্ন সাধারণত চার সপ্তাহ বা পাঁচ সপ্তাহ।","Estimate balance":"আনুমানিক ব্যালেন্স","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"ব্যালেন্স অনুমান করতে আপনার চুক্তি এবং তারিখগুলি লিখুন৷","Estimated leave balance":"আনুমানিক ছুটির ভারসাম্য","Annual leave at this schedule":"এই সময়সূচীতে বার্ষিক ছুটি","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"এই ছুটির বছরে নিযুক্ত ক্যালেন্ডার দিন","Prorated days accrued":"অনুপাতিত দিন জমা হয়েছে","Days already taken":"দিন আগেই নেওয়া হয়েছে","Estimated days remaining":"আনুমানিক দিন বাকি","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"এটি কর্মসংস্থানের সময়কালের ক্যালেন্ডার দিন অনুসারে বার্ষিক ছুটির অনুপাত করে। নিয়োগকর্তা এবং চুক্তির নিয়ম ভিন্ন হতে পারে।","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"আনুমানিক হিসাব করা হয়েছে। আপনার চুক্তি এবং নিয়োগকর্তার রেকর্ডের বিরুদ্ধে এটি পরীক্ষা করুন।","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"বছর, তারিখ, কাজের সময়সূচী এবং মান পরীক্ষা করুন।"},"ru":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Швейцарский сценарий пособия по безработице","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Швейцарский калькулятор пособия по безработице — валовой сценарий","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Оцените брутто-дневное пособие в Швейцарии, используя застрахованную зарплату и ставку, подтвержденную вашим фондом.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Введите застрахованную зарплату и ставку 70% или 80%, подтвержденную вашей кассой по безработице.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Швейцарские правила устанавливают размер надбавки и потолок заработной платы. Фонд определяет право на получение пособия, вычеты, дни ожидания и право на получение пособия. Месячный диапазон отражает 20–23 оплачиваемых рабочих дня.","Example":"Пример","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5 000 швейцарских франков при ставке 70% составляют около 161,29 швейцарских франков за оплачиваемый будний день.","How it works":"Как это работает","Questions":"Вопросы","Scope and limits":"Объем и ограничения","Related tools":"Связанные инструменты","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Ежемесячная страховая зарплата (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Рейтинг подтвержден фондом","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Оценка","Clear":"Очистить","Gross scenario":"Брутальный сценарий","Insured salary used":"Использована страховая зарплата","Per payable weekday":"За оплачиваемый будний день","20-day month":"20-дневный месяц","23-day month":"23-дневный месяц","Official benefit rules":"Официальные правила получения льгот","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Введите подтвержденные цифры.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Сценарий рассчитан. Подтвердите суммы в своем фонде.","Check the values.":"Проверьте значения.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Швейцарский планировщик уведомлений об аренде","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Планировщик уведомлений об аренде в Швейцарии и проект письма","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Спланируйте уведомление об аренде, исходя из дат и условий вашего собственного контракта; составить письмо, не принимая во внимание кантональные правила.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Введите период уведомления, ближайший действительный день расторжения вашего контракта и дату получения. Проверяйте каждую дату у своего арендодателя или ассоциации арендаторов.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Планировщик применяет только указанные вами даты и период. Он не решает, является ли уведомление действительным, когда оно получено на законных основаниях или применяется ли специальная защита.","Contract notice period (months)":"Период уведомления о контракте (месяцы)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Следующий действительный день прекращения действия контракта (из контракта)","Expected receipt date":"Ожидаемая дата получения","Your name":"Ваше имя","Your address":"Ваш адрес","Landlord / agency":"Арендодатель/агентство","Recipient address":"Адрес получателя","Rental property":"Арендуемая недвижимость","Place":"Место","Letter date":"Письменная дата","Termination of tenancy":"Прекращение аренды","Calculate date and draft letter":"Рассчитать дату и черновик письма","Planning date":"Дата планирования","Target date":"Целевая дата","Editable draft":"Редактируемый черновик","Copy draft":"Копировать черновик","Enter your contract terms.":"Введите условия вашего контракта.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Планировочный проект готов. Проверьте соответствие своему контракту.","Check the dates and period.":"Проверьте даты и период.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Результат соответствует указанному дню уведомления о контракте; это не установленное законом постановление.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Сценарий приобретения недвижимости в Швейцарии","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Налог на прирост недвижимости в Швейцарии — сценарий ставки, вводимой пользователем","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Оцените прибыль от собственности, используя собственные транзакционные издержки и ставку налога ответственного кантона.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Введите выручку, стоимость приобретения, подтвержденные вами приемлемые расходы и эффективную ставку из официального кантонального калькулятора.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Налог на прирост недвижимости в Швейцарии зависит от кантона, периода владения, вычетов и случая. Этот инструмент не определяет ставки и не определяет допустимые затраты.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Выручка от продажи (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Стоимость приобретения (швейцарский франк)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Прочие расходы подтверждены допустимыми (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Эффективная ставка налога из официального источника (%)","Estimate scenario":"Оценочный сценарий","Illustrative scenario":"Иллюстративный сценарий","Gain entered":"Усиление введено","Tax at entered rate":"Налог по введенной ставке","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Введите цифры из своих записей и источника в кантоне.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Сценарий рассчитан; уточните это в кантоне.","Check amounts and rate.":"Проверьте сумму и курс.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Таблица кантональных налогов не встроена; введенная вами эффективная ставка определяет оценку.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Швейцарский сценарий налога на наследство и дарение","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Швейцарский налог на наследство и дарение — сценарий вашей ставки","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Оценить налогооблагаемую сумму на основе введенного пользователем освобождения и ставки; правила различаются в зависимости от кантона и отношений.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Введите сумму, освобождение и эффективную ставку, подтвержденную для получателя и кантона.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Кантонские правила и семейные отношения могут изменить льготы и ставки. Этот инструмент не выбирает правила кантона и не определяет налоговые обязательства.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Сумма наследства или подарка (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Исключение подтверждено кантоном (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Эффективная ставка подтверждена в кантоне (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Сумма после введенного освобождения","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Введите цифры, подтвержденные для вашего случая.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"В оценке используются только введенные вами освобождение и ставка.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Сценарий бюджета алиментов на детей в Швейцарии","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Швейцарский бюджет на содержание детей — прозрачный сценарий для домохозяйств","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Распределить введенный дочерний бюджет по доходам родителей после введенного кредита прямых затрат.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Используйте документально подтвержденные ежемесячные потребности ребенка, доступные ежемесячные доходы обоих родителей и любые прямые расходы, которые вы хотите учесть.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Это только таблица планирования. Это не швейцарская выплата по содержанию детей или законный метод; жилье, уход, налоги, льготы и прецедентное право не облагаются налогом.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Ежемесячный детский бюджет, который вы задокументировали (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Доступный ежемесячный доход родителя А (в швейцарских франках)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Доступный ежемесячный доход родителя Б (в швейцарских франках)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Прямые расходы на ребенка, оплаченные родителем А для зачета (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Выделить сценарий","Illustrative allocation":"Иллюстративное размещение","Parent A remaining contribution":"Оставшийся вклад родителя A","Parent B contribution":"Вклад родителя Б","Entered monthly child budget":"Введен ежемесячный дочерний бюджет","Enter your household budget figures.":"Введите данные о семейном бюджете.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Рассчитан бюджетный сценарий; обсудить юридические обязательства с квалифицированным консультантом.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Проверить суммы; кредит не может превышать бюджет.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Доли пропорциональны двум введенным доходам; кредит прямых затрат вычитается первым.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Предварительный просмотр расстановки переносов в браузере","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Предварительный просмотр переносов в словах — языковые шаблоны браузера","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Предварительный просмотр расстановки переносов в браузере для предоставленного вами текста; поддержка зависит от браузера и установленных языковых ресурсов.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Выберите язык, соответствующий вашему тексту, введите образец и отрегулируйте доступную толщину линии.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Использует встроенную в браузере расстановку переносов CSS. Он не объединяет словари; неподдерживаемые браузеры могут не отображать дефисы. При копировании текста сохраняется исходное написание.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Язык текста (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Ширина предварительного просмотра (символов)","Text to preview":"Текст для предварительного просмотра","Preview":"Предварительный просмотр","Enter text and choose its language.":"Введите текст и выберите его язык.","Preview updated.":"Предварительная версия обновлена.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Введите тег и текст поддерживаемого языка.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Попробуйте один и тот же абзац разной ширины, чтобы увидеть, где браузер может разбить слова.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Личное рабочее пространство для проверки орфографии","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Локальная проверка орфографии — используйте словарь браузера","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Отредактируйте текст с помощью встроенной проверки орфографии браузера, выберите язык и скопируйте исправленный текст.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Текст останется на этой странице. Установите язык, для которого в вашем браузере есть орфографический словарь, затем воспользуйтесь его меню правописания или подчеркните предложения.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Эта рабочая область не загружает текст и не отправляет словари. Доступность и предложения проверки орфографии в браузере зависят от устройства, браузера и установленного словаря.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Язык проверки правописания (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Текст для проверки","Copy text":"Копировать текст","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Введите или вставьте текст. Щелкните правой кнопкой мыши или воспользуйтесь меню правописания вашего устройства, чтобы просмотреть предложения.","Text copied.":"Текст скопирован.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Не удалось скопировать автоматически; выделите и скопируйте текст.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Браузер без соответствующего словаря не может отмечать орфографические ошибки.","Resume Structure Checker":"Проверка структуры резюме","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"Проверка резюме ATS — бесплатный локальный обзор PDF и DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Проверьте текст резюме, заголовки, разделы, ссылки и структуру маркеров в браузере. Сравните условия описания должности по количеству; нет найма или загрузки.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Ознакомьтесь с тем, что на самом деле представляет собой текстовое резюме: извлеченный текст, структура заголовков, наличие полей для контактов, ссылки и общепризнанные разделы. При желании сравните повторяющиеся термины описания работы.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"DOCX со стилями заголовка 1 для опыта и образования отображает эти заголовки. PDF-файл проверяется по выбираемому тексту; столбцы могут читаться в другом порядке.\nФайлы","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX проверяются локально как Office ZIP/XML. PDF-файлы читаются с помощью отложенного локального механизма PDF.js. Опциональное сравнение описаний должностей учитывает выбранные термины в каждом тексте; он не выставляет оценку и не рекомендует, нанимать ли кого-то.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Это проверка формата и структуры текста, а не симулятор ATS, юридическая экспертиза или прогноз успеха собеседования. Отсканированные PDF-файлы без выделяемого текста сначала требуют распознавания. Защищенные паролем, подписанные или необычно большие документы с поддержкой макросов не поддерживаются.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Выбрать резюме (PDF или DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Ваши файлы остаются в этом браузере и не загружаются. Максимум 20 МБ; PDF до 50 страниц. Расширенный контент DOCX ограничен 80 МБ.","Optional job description":"Необязательное описание вакансии","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Вставьте обычный текст, если хотите сравнить частоту терминов. Не включайте конфиденциальную информацию, которую вам не нужно анализировать.","Paste job-description text here…":"Вставьте сюда текст описания вакансии…","Analyze locally":"Анализ локально","Clear files and report":"Очистить файлы и отчет","Resume review":"Просмотр резюме","File type":"Тип файла","Extracted characters":"Извлеченные символы","Words counted":"Слов подсчитано","Detected headings":"Обнаружены заголовки","Recognized sections":"Признанные разделы","Hyperlinks found":"Найдены гиперссылки","Bullet paragraphs":"Маркированные абзацы","An email address appears in the text":"В тексте появляется адрес электронной почты","No email address pattern was detected":"Шаблон адреса электронной почты не обнаружен","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"В тексте появляется шаблон, похожий на номер телефона.","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Не обнаружено шаблонов, подобных номеру телефона.","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Условия должностной инструкции (только учитывается)","Term":"Термин","In job text":"В тексте задания","In resume":"В резюме","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Вставьте описание вакансии, чтобы сравнить количество терминов.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Четкие стили заголовков не обнаружены. Заголовки PDF оцениваются по размеру текста и могут быть неточными.","Detected":"Обнаружено","Not detected":"Не обнаружено","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Эта эвристика распознает ограниченный набор общих имен разделов; он не решает, какие разделы необходимы.","Profile / summary":"Профиль/сводка","Experience":"Опыт","Education":"Образование","Skills":"Навыки","Contact":"Контакт","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Текст для выбора не найден. PDF-файлы, содержащие только отсканированные изображения, нуждаются в распознавании текста, прежде чем их можно будет проверить.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Чтобы начать, выберите резюме в формате PDF или DOCX.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Локальное чтение выбранного файла…","Local structure review complete.":"Проверка локальной структуры завершена.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Этот браузер не поддерживает необходимую функцию локального документа.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Выберите действительный файл PDF или современный файл DOCX в соответствии с указанными локальными ограничениями.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"Не удалось прочитать PDF-файл. Он может быть поврежден, зашифрован или не содержать выбираемого текста.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Не удалось безопасно открыть или прочитать пакет DOCX.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Этот инструмент загружает или сохраняет мое резюме?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Нет. Парсинг и анализ запускаются в вашем браузере. Текст файла не отправляется на сервер и не сохраняется после очистки отчета или выхода со страницы.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Предсказывает ли это, примет ли ATS или работодатель мое резюме?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Нет. Он проверяет только читаемый текст и простую структуру. Системы найма различаются, и это не является гарантией совместимости ATS или прогнозом найма.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Может ли он прочитать отсканированный PDF-файл?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Только если в PDF-файле есть выбираемый текстовый слой. Эта программа проверки не загружает модели OCR; сначала используйте инструмент OCR для отсканированного документа, содержащего только изображение.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Что означает сравнение должностных инструкций?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Показывает количество повторяющихся терминов после простой нормализации. Это не процент совпадений, рейтинг, рекомендации или оценка вашей квалификации.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Почему в PDF-файле меньше заголовков, чем в DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF-файлы обычно не сохраняют стили семантических заголовков. Средство проверки оценивает заметные строки по размеру текста и порядку чтения, поэтому столбцы и визуальное оформление могут повлиять на результат.","How local resume review works":"Как работает проверка местных резюме","Resume checker questions":"Вопросы для проверки резюме","Scope and limitations":"Область применения и ограничения","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Локальный разделитель вокала и аккомпанемента","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Vocal Remover — локальное разделение вокала и аккомпанемента","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Разделите короткий стереозвук на предполагаемый вокал и аккомпанемент в браузере. Звук остается на вашем устройстве; модель загружается со своего общедоступного хоста.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Выберите стереомузыкальный клип продолжительностью до 30 секунд. При первом использовании браузер загружает модель размером 35,6 МБ. Аудиофайл обрабатывается на этом устройстве и никогда не загружается.","What you get":"Что вы получите","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Просмотрите и загрузите два фрагмента WAV: предполагаемый вокал и остаточный аккомпанемент. Результаты зависят от смеси и могут содержать артефакты.","Local processing":"Локальная обработка","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Инструмент использует вокальную сеть Open-Unmix UMX-HQ, экспортированную в ONNX и ONNX Runtime Web. Модель извлекается только при нажатии кнопки «Разделить»; платный API вывода или подписка не используются. Аудио декодируется, обрабатывается и экспортируется локально.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Это оценка для стереообработки 44,1 кГц и клипов продолжительностью до 30 секунд. Моно-источники дублируются в стерео. Вокал, глубоко смешанный с инструментами, тяжелыми эффектами, концертными записями и необычными жанрами, может привести к утечкам или артефактам. Не используйте результат как чистый мастер. Для загрузки модели требуется подключение к Интернету; звук не покидает это устройство.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Загружен ли мой аудиофайл?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Нет. Выбранный звук декодируется и обрабатывается в вашем браузере. Единственный сетевой запрос — это загрузка модели при запуске разделения.","Why is the first run slow?":"Почему первый запуск выполняется медленно?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Браузер загружает модель размером 35,6 МБ один раз; браузер может кэшировать его. Затем вывод выполняется локально на процессоре устройства.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Будет ли каждая песня разделяться четко?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Нет. Модель оценивает вокальную основу и может привести к утечке голоса, удалению гармоник инструментов или созданию артефактов. Послушайте, прежде чем полагаться на стебель.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Стерео аудиофайл (до 30 секунд)","Choose audio":"Выбрать аудио","Separate vocals":"Отдельный вокал","Cancel / clear":"Отменить/очистить","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Для начала выберите короткий аудиофайл.","Downloading the separation model…":"Загрузка модели разделения…","Separating locally…":"Локальное разделение…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Разделение завершено. Предварительный просмотр или загрузка любого стебля.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Не удалось обработать этот файл или загрузить модель. Проверьте формат и подключение, затем повторите попытку.","Model and weight license information":"Информация о лицензии на модель и вес","Estimated vocals":"Примерный вокал","Estimated accompaniment":"Предполагаемое сопровождение","Download WAV":"Загрузить WAV","Progress":"Прогресс","Preparing local separation…":"Подготовка локального разделения…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Разделение завершено. Аудио осталось на этом устройстве.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Этот звук не удалось обработать. Попробуйте стереомузыкальный файл продолжительностью менее 30 секунд.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Сравнение франшизы швейцарского медицинского страхования","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Калькулятор франшизы швейцарского медицинского страхования — сравнение годовых затрат","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Сравните франшизы швейцарского базового медицинского страхования, используя введенные вами страховые взносы и приемлемые годовые медицинские расходы. Котировка страховщика не предполагается.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Введите ежемесячные премии, указанные одним и тем же страховщиком по каждой предлагаемой им франшизе, а затем сравните сценарии с низкой, ожидаемой и высокой годовой стоимостью лечения.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Для обязательного базового медицинского страхования в Швейцарии стандартная франшиза для взрослого составляет 300 швейцарских франков, а франшиза для ребенка — 0 швейцарских франков. Дополнительные уровни различаются в зависимости от возрастной группы. После франшизы стандартная плата за удержание составляет 10 % от оставшихся приемлемых расходов и не может превышать 700 швейцарских франков в год для взрослых и 350 швейцарских франков в год для детей. Инструмент добавляет введенную вами премию к этому смоделированному распределению затрат; он не получает тарифы страховщиков и не решает, какой вариант подходит именно вам.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Если взрослый человек вносит ежемесячный страховой взнос в размере 400 швейцарских франков с франшизой 300 швейцарских франков и 350 швейцарских франков с франшизой 2500 швейцарских франков, разница в годовом страховом взносе составит 600 швейцарских франков. Сравните эту экономию с смоделированной разницей в распределении затрат при каждой из ваших низких, ожидаемых и высоких сумм приемлемых расходов.","How the estimate works":"Как работает оценка","Common questions":"Общие вопросы","Scope and exclusions":"Область применения и исключения","Where do I get the premiums?":"Где я могу получить премии?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Используйте текущие ежемесячные предложения для того же страховщика, премиального региона, возрастной группы, покрытия от несчастного случая и модели страхования. Priminfo — официальный федеральный сайт сравнения. Эта страница не получает и не воспроизводит котировки страховщиков.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Всегда ли предлагаются все перечисленные уровни франшизы?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Нет. Страховщики не обязаны предлагать все дополнительные уровни, и предложения для молодых людей могут отличаться. Введите только те премии, которые указаны для вашего собственного полиса; оставьте недоступные параметры пустыми.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Здесь показан мой полный счет за медицинские услуги?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Нет. Модель покрывает обычную франшизу и стандартную комиссию за удержание в размере 10% от приемлемых расходов. В него не включены взносы на больничные дни, специальные 40% удержания лекарств, освобожденные от налога услуги, уход без покрытия и дополнительное страхование.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Это сравнение сценариев, а не советы по страхованию, медицине или финансам. Он не прогнозирует ваше лечение или страховые взносы. Сюда не входят взносы на больничные дни (обычно 15 швейцарских франков за день пребывания в стационаре, с установленными законом исключениями), специальные удержания в размере 40% на определенные лекарства, льготы по беременности и родам/профилактические услуги, услуги, не подлежащие обязательному страхованию, субсидии на премии и дополнительное страхование. Таким образом, фактическая сооплата может отличаться. Более высокая франшиза означает, что вам нужно будет заплатить больше аванса, если вы получите медицинское обслуживание.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Кто застрахован по этому полису?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Взрослый (19 лет и старше)","Child (under 18)":"Детский (до 18 лет)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Сценарий с низкой годовой приемлемой стоимостью лечения (в швейцарских франках)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Ожидаемые годовые приемлемые расходы на лечение (в швейцарских франках)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Сценарий с высокими годовыми затратами на лечение (в швейцарских франках)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Ежемесячные премии от одного страховщика","Monthly premium":"Ежемесячная премия","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Введите только варианты, предлагаемые для этой же политики. Остальные оставьте пустыми.","Adult deductible choices":"Выбор франшизы для взрослых","Child deductible choices":"Выбор франшизы на ребенка","Compare annual costs":"Сравнить годовые затраты","Clear entries":"Очистить записи","Download CSV":"Загрузить CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Ориентировочная годовая премия плюс участие в расходах","Deductible":"Франшиза","Annual premiums":"Годовые премии","Total at low costs":"Всего по низким ценам","Total at expected costs":"Итого по ожидаемым затратам","Total at high costs":"Всего по высокой цене","Cost sharing at low costs":"Распределение затрат при низких затратах","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Распределение затрат по ожидаемым затратам","Cost sharing at high costs":"Распределение затрат при высоких затратах","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Отличие от самой низкой доступной франшизы","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Медицинские расходы, при которых израсходована экономия премий","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Введенная экономия премий не отменяется в пределах смоделированного диапазона распределения затрат.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Никакой премии по минимальной франшизе.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Самая низкая ожидаемая сумма среди введенных вариантов","Scenario details":"Детали сценария","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Введите три заказанных сценария медицинских расходов и ежемесячные страховые взносы как минимум для двух доступных франшиз.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Официальные правила и текущие премии:","Federal deductible rules":"Федеральные правила франшизы","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Официальное сравнение премиум-класса Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Сравнение рассчитывается в этом браузере.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Проверьте возрастную группу, заказанные сценарии стоимости и как минимум две ежемесячные премии.","Entries cleared.":"Записи удалены.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV загружен локально.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Калькулятор снижения страховых взносов Swiss Health","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Калькулятор субсидий швейцарских премий — ваша чистая премия","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Рассчитайте чистую сумму страхового взноса по швейцарскому медицинскому страхованию, исходя из текущего взноса и ежемесячной скидки, уже предоставленной вашим кантоном.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Укажите размер премии и подтвержденное ежемесячное сокращение согласно решению вашего страховщика или кантона. Этот инструмент не решает, соответствуете ли вы критериям.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Швейцарские кантоны определяют, кто имеет право на получение помощи, какой объем поддержки предоставляется и требуется ли подача заявления. Этот калькулятор вычитает только подтвержденное ежемесячное сокращение из одной страховой премии и показывает годовую сумму.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Если ежемесячная премия составляет 420 швейцарских франков, а подтвержденное сокращение составляет 120 швейцарских франков, расчетная чистая премия составит 300 швейцарских франков в месяц.","How the calculation works":"Как работает расчет","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Покажет ли мне это, имею ли я право на участие?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Нет. Право на участие и суммы вознаграждения определяются кантоном проживания. Используйте связанную официальную информацию или свяжитесь с кантональным офисом.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Где я могу найти сумму скидки?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Используйте текущее решение или уменьшенную премию, указанную вашим страховщиком. Некоторые кантоны предоставляют скидки автоматически; другие требуют приложения.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Это арифметика для одного полиса, а не решение о праве на участие или получении льгот. Он не рассчитывает семейный доход, активы, семейное положение, сроки, кантональные пороги или права подачи заявления. Премии и награды могут меняться; подтвердите их у своего страховщика и кантона.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Текущая ежемесячная премия (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Ежемесячная скидка уже предоставлена (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Введите сумму, подтвержденную кантоном или страховой компанией; не используйте оценку в качестве награды.","Calculate net premium":"Рассчитать чистую премию","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Введите текущую премию и подтвержденное снижение.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Оценочная премия после снижения","Current monthly premium":"Текущий ежемесячный взнос","Monthly reduction":"Ежемесячная скидка","Estimated net monthly premium":"Ориентировочная чистая ежемесячная премия","Reduction over 12 months":"Скидка за 12 месяцев","Reduction as a share of premium":"Сокращение доли премии","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Расчет завершен. Подтвердите решение и дату его вступления в силу в своем кантоне и страховой компании.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Убедитесь, что скидка не превышает ежемесячную премию.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Калькулятор сценария базовой ставки арендной платы в Швейцарии","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Швейцарский калькулятор корректировки арендной платы — сценарий базовой ставки","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Оцените только то, как изменение базовой ставки по ипотечным кредитам в Швейцарии влияет на чистую арендную плату за жилье. Используйте последнюю ставку федерального жилищного управления.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Сравните базовую ставку, указанную в вашем договоре аренды или последнем уведомлении об аренде, с текущей официальной швейцарской ставкой. Расчет остается на вашем устройстве.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Федеральное управление жилищного строительства каждый квартал публикует одну базовую ставку по ипотечным кредитам для корректировки арендной платы в Швейцарии. Увеличение на 0,25 процентного пункта в принципе может позволить повысить арендную плату на 3%; снижение на 0,25 пункта в принципе может позволить снижение на 2,91%. В этом сценарии эти изменения шаг за шагом применяются к введенной вами чистой арендной плате.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Для чистой арендной платы в размере 3000 швейцарских франков в месяц снижение базовой ставки с 1,75% до 1,50% дает расчетное изменение только базовой ставки примерно на -87,38 швейцарских франков в месяц (-2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Как работает эта оценка","Where do I find the current rate?":"Где я могу найти текущий курс?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Откройте связанную страницу Федерального жилищного управления и введите текущую опубликованную ставку. Инструмент не встраивает тариф, который может устареть.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"От этого зависит, могу ли я запросить изменение арендной платы?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Нет. Он изолирует один фактор для ориентации. Ваш контракт, инфляция, изменения стоимости, оговорки и другие юридические условия могут изменить результат.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Включает ли результат дополнительные затраты?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Нет. Введите ежемесячную чистую арендную плату, исключая дополнительные расходы и другие переменные расходы.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Результатом является иллюстративный сценарий базовой ставки, а не юридическое заключение или полный пересмотр арендной платы. Сюда не входят инфляция, общие изменения затрат, улучшения, договорные оговорки, индексированная или ступенчатая арендная плата, даты уведомления и кантональные процедуры. Прежде чем действовать, проверьте договор аренды и официальные инструкции.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Аренда жилья в Швейцарии: только оценка эффекта базовой ставки по ипотеке. Это не юридическое решение или полный пересмотр арендной платы.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Текущая ежемесячная чистая арендная плата (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Справочная ставка, указанная в договоре аренды или последнем уведомлении об аренде (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Текущая официальная швейцарская базовая ставка (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Рассчитать сценарий базового курса","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Сценарий только с базовой ставкой","Current monthly net rent":"Текущая ежемесячная чистая арендная плата","Reference-rate change":"Изменение базовой ставки","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Оценочный ежемесячный эффект от базовой ставки","Scenario monthly net rent":"Сценарий ежемесячной чистой арендной платы","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Годовой эффект на 12 месяцев по той же ставке","potential increase":"потенциальное увеличение","potential decrease":"потенциальное снижение","no reference-rate change":"без изменения базовой ставки","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"В расчете применяется 3% за каждое увеличение на 0,25 процентного пункта и эквивалентное обратное снижение за каждое уменьшение. Другие факторы могут изменить результат.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Это не включает инфляцию, общие изменения стоимости, улучшения, оговорки по контракту, индексированную или ступенчатую арендную плату, даты уведомления или местные процедурные требования. Проверьте договор аренды и рекомендации Федерального управления жилищного строительства.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Ознакомьтесь с последними официальными тарифами и рекомендациями","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Швейцарское федеральное жилищное управление (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Введите арендную плату и обе ставки, чтобы увидеть сценарий.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Сценарий рассчитан. Проверьте даты и условия контракта, прежде чем полагаться на него.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Проверьте суммы и тарифы. Ставки должны находиться в пределах от 0% до 5% и отличаться с шагом 0,25 пункта.","Inputs cleared.":"Вводы очищены.","Result":"Результат","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Оценщик отпускных в Швейцарии","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Калькулятор накопления отпуска в Швейцарии — пропорциональный остаток отпуска","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Оцените остаток отпускных дней в Швейцарии, исходя из ежегодного отпуска, указанного в вашем контракте, рабочей недели, дат трудоустройства и уже отработанных дней.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Оцените пропорционально оплачиваемый отпуск на один календарный год, используя введенные вами право и график работы. Условия контракта не предполагаются.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Оценщик пропорционально распределяет дни ежегодного отпуска, указанные в вашем контракте, на календарные дни, отработанные в выбранном году. Для работы неполный рабочий день введите обычные рабочие дни в неделю и ежегодный отпуск в неделях.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"С учетом четырехнедельного отпуска, пятидневной рабочей недели и работы в течение года годовое пособие составляет 20 рабочих дней без вычета уже использованного отпуска.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Каков минимальный размер, установленный в Швейцарии?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Федеральные инструкции предусматривают не менее четырех недель за трудовой год и пять недель для работников, не достигших 20-летнего возраста. Контракт или коллективный договор могут предусматривать большее количество недель.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Влияет ли это на мой юридический баланс?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Нет. Это простая пропорция календарных дней. Условия контракта, применимые коллективные правила, отсутствие на работе, округление и записи работодателя могут изменить баланс.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Эта оценка не определяет юридическое право и не рассчитывает отпускные. Сюда не входят скидки за некоторые длительные отсутствия, правила начисления и округления, специфичные для контракта, праздничные дни, сверхурочную работу, перенос сроков и споры. Проверьте свой контракт и получите консультацию по спорному балансу.","Leave year":"Год отпуска","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Ежегодный отпуск в вашем контракте (недели)","Usual working days per week":"Обычные рабочие дни в неделю","Employment start date":"Дата начала работы","Employment end date":"Дата окончания трудовой деятельности","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Дни отпуска, уже отработанные в этом отпускном году","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Только для ознакомления. Введите договорное годовое пособие; Законный минимум обычно составляет четыре недели или пять недель для работников младше 20 лет.","Estimate balance":"Оценить баланс","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Введите свой контракт и даты, чтобы оценить баланс.","Estimated leave balance":"Расчетный остаток отпуска","Annual leave at this schedule":"Ежегодный отпуск по этому графику","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Календарные дни, использованные в этом отпускном году","Prorated days accrued":"Начислено пропорциональное количество дней","Days already taken":"Дней уже отнято","Estimated days remaining":"Осталось примерно дней","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Ежегодный отпуск распределяется пропорционально календарным дням периода занятости. Правила работодателя и договора могут отличаться.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Оценка рассчитана. Сравните это с вашим контрактом и записями работодателя.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Проверьте год, даты, график работы и значения."},"ur":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"سوئس بے روزگاری الاؤنس کا منظرنامہ","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"سوئس بے روزگاری بینیفٹ کیلکولیٹر - مجموعی منظر نامہ","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"بیمہ شدہ تنخواہ اور اپنے فنڈ سے تصدیق شدہ شرح کا استعمال کرتے ہوئے مجموعی سوئس یومیہ الاؤنس کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"بیمہ شدہ تنخواہ درج کریں اور آپ کے بے روزگاری فنڈ سے تصدیق شدہ %70 یا 80% شرح۔","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"سوئس قوانین الاؤنس کی شرح اور تنخواہ کی حد متعین کرتے ہیں۔ فنڈ اہلیت، کٹوتیوں، انتظار کے دنوں اور استحقاق کا فیصلہ کرتا ہے۔ ماہانہ رینج 20-23 قابل ادائیگی ہفتے کے دنوں کی عکاسی کرتی ہے۔","Example":"مثال","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"70% پر CHF 5,000 تقریباً CHF 161.29 فی قابل ادائیگی ہفتے کے دن ہے۔","How it works":"یہ کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","Questions":"سوالات","Scope and limits":"دائرہ کار اور حدود","Related tools":"متعلقہ ٹولز","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"ماہانہ بیمہ شدہ تنخواہ (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"فنڈ کی طرف سے تصدیق شدہ شرح","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"تخمینہ","Clear":"صاف کریں۔","Gross scenario":"مجموعی منظرنامہ","Insured salary used":"بیمہ شدہ تنخواہ استعمال کی گئی۔","Per payable weekday":"فی قابل ادائیگی ہفتہ کے دن","20-day month":"20 دن کا مہینہ","23-day month":"23 دن کا مہینہ","Official benefit rules":"سرکاری فائدہ کے قواعد","Enter your confirmed figures.":"اپنے تصدیق شدہ اعداد و شمار درج کریں۔","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"منظر نامہ شمار کیا گیا۔ اپنے فنڈ کے ساتھ رقم کی تصدیق کریں۔","Check the values.":"قدروں کو چیک کریں۔","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"سوئس کرایہ داری نوٹس پلانر","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"سوئس رینٹل نوٹس پلانر اور لیٹر ڈرافٹ","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"اپنے ہی معاہدے کی تاریخوں اور شرائط سے کرایہ داری نوٹس کا منصوبہ بنائیں۔ کینٹن کے اصولوں کو مانے بغیر خط کا مسودہ تیار کریں۔","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"نوٹس کی مدت، اپنے معاہدے میں اگلا درست ختم ہونے کا دن، اور رسید کی تاریخ درج کریں۔ اپنے مالک مکان یا کرایہ داروں کی ایسوسی ایشن کے ساتھ ہر تاریخ کو چیک کریں۔","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"منصوبہ ساز صرف ان تاریخوں اور مدت کا اطلاق کرتا ہے جو آپ فراہم کرتے ہیں۔ یہ فیصلہ نہیں کرتا کہ آیا نوٹس درست ہے، اسے قانونی طور پر کب موصول ہوتا ہے، یا کوئی خصوصی تحفظ لاگو ہوتا ہے۔","Contract notice period (months)":"معاہدے کے نوٹس کی مدت (مہینوں)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"مہینہ کا اگلا درست ختم ہونے کا دن (معاہدے سے)","Expected receipt date":"رسید کی متوقع تاریخ","Your name":"آپ کا نام","Your address":"آپ کا پتہ","Landlord / agency":"زمیندار/ ایجنسی","Recipient address":"وصول کنندہ کا پتہ","Rental property":"کرائے کی جائیداد","Place":"جگہ","Letter date":"خط کی تاریخ","Termination of tenancy":"کرایہ داری کا خاتمہ","Calculate date and draft letter":"تاریخ اور مسودہ خط کا حساب لگائیں۔","Planning date":"منصوبہ بندی کی تاریخ","Target date":"ہدف کی تاریخ","Editable draft":"قابل تدوین مسودہ","Copy draft":"مسودہ کاپی کریں۔","Enter your contract terms.":"اپنے معاہدے کی شرائط درج کریں۔","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"منصوبہ بندی کا مسودہ تیار ہے۔ اپنے معاہدے کے خلاف تصدیق کریں۔","Check the dates and period.":"تاریخوں اور مدت کو چیک کریں۔","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"نتیجہ فراہم کردہ معاہدے کے نوٹس کے دن کے بعد آتا ہے۔ یہ کوئی قانونی نوٹس کا حکم نہیں ہے۔","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"سوئس پراپرٹی حاصل کرنے کا منظرنامہ","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"سوئس پراپرٹی گینز ٹیکس - صارف کی درج کردہ شرح کا منظرنامہ","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"اپنے لین دین کی لاگت اور ذمہ دار کینٹن سے ٹیکس کی شرح کا استعمال کرتے ہوئے جائیداد کے منافع کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"آمدنی، حصول کی لاگت، اہل اخراجات جو آپ نے تصدیق کی ہے، اور آفیشل کینٹونل کیلکولیٹر سے ایک موثر شرح درج کریں۔","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"سوئس پراپرٹی گین ٹیکس کینٹن، انعقاد کی مدت، کٹوتیوں اور کیس کے لحاظ سے مختلف ہوتا ہے۔ یہ ٹول نرخوں کی فراہمی یا قابل قبول لاگت کا تعین نہیں کرتا ہے۔","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"فروخت کی آمدنی (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"حصول لاگت (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"دیگر اخراجات کی تصدیق شدہ قابل قبول (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"سرکاری ذریعہ سے ٹیکس کی مؤثر شرح (%)","Estimate scenario":"تخمینہ کا منظر","Illustrative scenario":"مثالی منظرنامہ","Gain entered":"گائن داخل کیا گیا۔","Tax at entered rate":"درج کردہ شرح پر ٹیکس","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"اپنے ریکارڈ اور کینٹن سورس سے اعداد و شمار درج کریں۔","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"منظر نامے کا حساب لگایا گیا؛ کینٹن کے ساتھ اس کی تصدیق کریں۔","Check amounts and rate.":"مقدار اور شرح چیک کریں۔","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"کوئی کینٹن ٹیکس ٹیبل ایمبیڈ نہیں ہے۔ آپ کی درج کردہ موثر شرح تخمینہ کو آگے بڑھاتی ہے۔","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"سوئس وراثت اور تحفہ ٹیکس کا منظرنامہ","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"سوئس وراثت اور تحفہ ٹیکس - آپ کی شرح کا منظرنامہ","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"صارف کے داخل کردہ استثنیٰ اور شرح سے قابل ٹیکس رقم کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔ قوانین کینٹن اور تعلقات کے لحاظ سے مختلف ہوتے ہیں۔","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"وصول کنندہ اور کینٹن کے لیے تصدیق شدہ رقم، چھوٹ اور موثر شرح درج کریں۔","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"یہ ٹول کینٹن اصول کا انتخاب نہیں کرتا یا ٹیکس کی ذمہ داری کا تعین نہیں کرتا ہے۔","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"وراثت یا تحفہ کی رقم (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"کینٹن (CHF) کے ساتھ استثنیٰ کی تصدیق","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"کینٹن کے ساتھ موثر شرح کی تصدیق (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"داخل ہونے والے استثنیٰ کے بعد رقم","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"اپنے کیس کے لیے تصدیق شدہ اعداد و شمار درج کریں۔","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"تخمینہ صرف چھوٹ اور شرح کا استعمال کرتا ہے جو آپ درج کرتے ہیں۔","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"سوئس چائلڈ سپورٹ بجٹ کا منظرنامہ","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"سوئس چائلڈ سپورٹ بجٹ - شفاف گھریلو منظر نامہ","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"داخل کردہ براہ راست لاگت کے کریڈٹ کے بعد والدین کی آمدنی کے ذریعہ داخل کردہ چائلڈ بجٹ مختص کریں۔","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"بچے کی دستاویزی ماہانہ ضروریات کا استعمال کریں، والدین دونوں کی دستیاب ماہانہ آمدنی اور کوئی بھی براہ راست اخراجات جنہیں آپ کریڈٹ کرنا چاہتے ہیں۔","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"یہ صرف پلاننگ ورک شیٹ ہے۔ یہ سوئس بچوں کی دیکھ بھال کا ایوارڈ یا قانونی طریقہ نہیں ہے۔ ہاؤسنگ، دیکھ بھال، ٹیکس، فوائد اور کیس کے قانون کا اندازہ نہیں لگایا جاتا ہے۔","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"ماہانہ بچے کا بجٹ جو آپ نے دستاویز کیا ہے (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"والدین A دستیاب ماہانہ آمدنی (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"والدین B دستیاب ماہانہ آمدنی (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"والدین A کی طرف سے کریڈٹ (CHF) کے ذریعے براہ راست بچوں کے اخراجات","Allocate scenario":"منظرنامہ مختص کریں۔","Illustrative allocation":"مثالی مختص","Parent A remaining contribution":"والدین A بقیہ شراکت","Parent B contribution":"والدین B کا تعاون","Entered monthly child budget":"ماہانہ بچوں کے بجٹ میں داخل","Enter your household budget figures.":"اپنے گھریلو بجٹ کے اعداد و شمار درج کریں۔","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"بجٹ کے منظر نامے کا حساب لگایا گیا ایک قابل مشیر کے ساتھ قانونی ذمہ داریوں پر تبادلہ خیال کریں۔","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"رقوم کی جانچ کریں۔ کریڈٹ بجٹ سے زیادہ نہیں ہو سکتا۔","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"حصص دو داخل آمدنی کے متناسب ہیں؛ براہ راست لاگت کا کریڈٹ پہلے منہا کیا جاتا ہے۔","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"براؤزر ہائفینیشن کا پیش نظارہ","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"ورڈ ہائفنیشن پیش نظارہ - براؤزر زبان کے پیٹرن","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"آپ کے فراہم کردہ متن کے لیے براؤزر ہائفینیشن کا پیش نظارہ؛ سپورٹ براؤزر اور انسٹال کردہ زبان کے وسائل پر منحصر ہے۔","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"وہ زبان منتخب کریں جو آپ کے متن سے ملتی ہو، نمونہ درج کریں اور دستیاب لائن کی چوڑائی کو ایڈجسٹ کریں۔","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"براؤزر کا مقامی CSS ہائفینیشن استعمال کرتا ہے۔ یہ لغات بنڈل نہیں کرتا؛ غیر تعاون یافتہ براؤزر کوئی ہائفن نہیں دکھا سکتے ہیں۔ متن کو نقل کرنے سے اصل ہجے برقرار رہتا ہے۔","Text language (BCP 47)":"متن کی زبان (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"پیش نظارہ چوڑائی (حروف)","Text to preview":"پیش نظارہ کے لیے متن","Preview":"پیش نظارہ","Enter text and choose its language.":"متن درج کریں اور اس کی زبان منتخب کریں۔","Preview updated.":"پیش نظارہ اپ ڈیٹ ہو گیا۔","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"ایک معاون زبان کا ٹیگ اور متن درج کریں۔","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"ایک ہی پیراگراف کو مختلف چوڑائیوں پر آزمائیں کہ براؤزر الفاظ کو کہاں توڑ سکتا ہے۔","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"پرائیویٹ سپیل چیک ورک اسپیس","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"مقامی ہجے چیکر - اپنی براؤزر ڈکشنری استعمال کریں۔","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"براؤزر کے مقامی ہجے کی جانچ کے ساتھ متن میں ترمیم کریں، ایک زبان کا انتخاب کریں اور درست متن کو کاپی کریں۔","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"متن اس صفحہ میں رہتا ہے۔ وہ زبان سیٹ کریں جس کے لیے آپ کے براؤزر میں ہجے کی لغت ہو، پھر اس کے ہجے والے مینو یا انڈر لائن تجاویز کا استعمال کریں۔","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"یہ ورک اسپیس ٹیکسٹ یا شپ لغات اپ لوڈ نہیں کرتا ہے۔ براؤزر اسپیل چیک کی دستیابی اور تجاویز کا انحصار ڈیوائس، براؤزر اور انسٹال کردہ لغت پر ہوتا ہے۔","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"ہجے کی جانچ کی زبان (BCP 47)","Text to check":"چیک کرنے کے لیے متن","Copy text":"متن کاپی کریں۔","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"متن ٹائپ کریں یا پیسٹ کریں۔ دائیں کلک کریں یا تجاویز کے لیے اپنے آلے کے ہجے کا مینو استعمال کریں۔","Text copied.":"متن کاپی ہو گیا۔","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"خود بخود کاپی نہیں ہو سکا؛ متن کو منتخب کریں اور کاپی کریں۔","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"مماثل لغت کے بغیر براؤزر غلط ہجے کو نشان زد نہیں کر سکتا۔","Resume Structure Checker":"سٹرکچر چیکر دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"اے ٹی ایس ریزیوم چیکر - مفت مقامی PDF اور DOCX جائزہ","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"اپنے براؤزر میں ریزیوم ٹیکسٹ، ہیڈنگز، سیکشنز، لنکس اور بلٹ سٹرکچر کو چیک کریں۔ شمار کے لحاظ سے ملازمت کی وضاحت کی شرائط کا موازنہ کریں؛ کوئی بھرتی کا سکور یا اپ لوڈ نہیں۔","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"جائزہ لیں کہ ٹیکسٹ پر مبنی ریزیوم اصل میں کیا ظاہر کرتا ہے: نکالا ہوا متن، سرخی کا ڈھانچہ، رابطہ فیلڈ کی موجودگی، لنکس اور عام طور پر تسلیم شدہ حصے۔ اختیاری طور پر بار بار ملازمت کی وضاحت کی شرائط کا موازنہ کریں۔","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"تجربہ اور تعلیم کے لیے ہیڈنگ 1 اسٹائل والا DOCX ان سرخیوں کو دکھاتا ہے۔ پی ڈی ایف کو اس کے قابل انتخاب متن سے چیک کیا جاتا ہے۔ کالم کو مختلف ترتیب میں پڑھا جا سکتا ہے۔","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX فائلوں کا معائنہ مقامی طور پر Office ZIP/XML کے طور پر کیا جاتا ہے۔ PDFs کو ایک موخر کردہ مقامی PDF.js انجن کے ساتھ پڑھا جاتا ہے۔ اختیاری ملازمت کی تفصیل کا موازنہ ہر متن میں منتخب شرائط کو شمار کرتا ہے۔ یہ اسکور نہیں بناتا یا تجویز نہیں کرتا کہ آیا کسی کو ملازمت پر رکھا جائے۔","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"یہ ایک فارمیٹ اور ٹیکسٹ اسٹرکچر چیک ہے، ATS سمیلیٹر نہیں، قانونی جائزہ یا انٹرویو کی کامیابی کی پیشین گوئی۔ قابل انتخاب متن کے بغیر اسکین شدہ پی ڈی ایف کو پہلے OCR کی ضرورت ہے۔ پاس ورڈ سے محفوظ، میکرو فعال، دستخط شدہ یا غیر معمولی طور پر بڑی دستاویزات معاون نہیں ہیں۔","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"ایک ریزیومے کا انتخاب کریں (PDF یا DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"آپ کی فائلیں اس براؤزر میں رہتی ہیں اور اپ لوڈ نہیں ہوتیں۔ زیادہ سے زیادہ 20 ایم بی؛ پی ڈی ایف 50 صفحات تک۔ DOCX توسیع شدہ مواد کی حد 80 MB ہے۔","Optional job description":"اختیاری ملازمت کی تفصیل","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"اگر آپ اصطلاحی تعدد کا موازنہ چاہتے ہیں تو سادہ متن چسپاں کریں۔ ایسی حساس معلومات شامل نہ کریں جن کا تجزیہ کرنے کی آپ کو ضرورت نہیں ہے۔","Paste job-description text here…":"ملازمت کی تفصیل کا متن یہاں چسپاں کریں…","Analyze locally":"مقامی طور پر تجزیہ کریں۔","Clear files and report":"فائلیں اور رپورٹ صاف کریں۔","Resume review":"جائزہ دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","File type":"فائل کی قسم","Extracted characters":"ایکسٹریکٹ کردہ حروف","Words counted":"گنے ہوئے الفاظ","Detected headings":"سراغ ملا","Recognized sections":"تسلیم شدہ حصے","Hyperlinks found":"ہائپر لنکس مل گئے۔","Bullet paragraphs":"بلٹ پیراگراف","An email address appears in the text":"متن میں ایک ای میل پتہ ظاہر ہوتا ہے۔","No email address pattern was detected":"کوئی ای میل ایڈریس پیٹرن نہیں ملا","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"متن میں فون نمبر جیسا نمونہ ظاہر ہوتا ہے۔","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"فون نمبر جیسا کوئی پیٹرن نہیں ملا","Job-description terms (counts only)":"ملازمت کی تفصیل کی شرائط (صرف شمار)","Term":"ٹرم","In job text":"جاب کے متن میں","In resume":"ریزیومے میں","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"مدت کی گنتی کا موازنہ کرنے کے لیے ملازمت کی تفصیل چسپاں کریں۔","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"سرخی کے کوئی واضح انداز نہیں ملے۔ PDF عنوانات کا تخمینہ متن کے سائز سے لگایا گیا ہے اور یہ غلط ہو سکتا ہے۔","Detected":"پتہ چلا","Not detected":"پتہ نہیں چلا","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"یہ heuristic عام سیکشن کے ناموں کے ایک محدود سیٹ کو تسلیم کرتا ہے۔ یہ فیصلہ نہیں کرتا کہ کن سیکشنز کی ضرورت ہے۔","Profile / summary":"پروفائل / خلاصہ","Experience":"تجربہ","Education":"تعلیم","Skills":"ہنر","Contact":"رابطہ کریں۔","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"کوئی قابل انتخاب متن نہیں ملا۔ صرف اسکین شدہ پی ڈی ایف کو چیک کرنے سے پہلے OCR کی ضرورت ہوتی ہے۔","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"شروع کرنے کے لیے PDF یا DOCX ریزیومے کا انتخاب کریں۔","Reading the selected file locally…":"منتخب فائل کو مقامی طور پر پڑھا جا رہا ہے…","Local structure review complete.":"مقامی ڈھانچے کا جائزہ مکمل۔","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"یہ براؤزر مطلوبہ مقامی دستاویز کی خصوصیت کو سپورٹ نہیں کرتا ہے۔","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"بیان کردہ مقامی حدود تک ایک درست PDF یا جدید DOCX فائل کا انتخاب کریں۔","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"پی ڈی ایف کو پڑھا نہیں جا سکا۔ یہ خراب ہو سکتا ہے، مرموز ہو سکتا ہے یا اس میں کوئی منتخب متن نہیں ہو سکتا۔","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX پیکیج کو محفوظ طریقے سے کھولا یا پڑھا نہیں جا سکا۔","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"کیا یہ ٹول میرا ریزیومے اپ لوڈ یا محفوظ کرتا ہے؟","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"نمبر۔ تجزیہ اور تجزیہ آپ کے براؤزر میں چلتا ہے۔ فائل کا متن کسی سرور کو نہیں بھیجا جاتا ہے یا رپورٹ کو صاف کرنے یا صفحہ چھوڑنے کے بعد اسے برقرار نہیں رکھا جاتا ہے۔","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"کیا یہ پیشین گوئی کرتا ہے کہ آیا کوئی ATS یا آجر میرا ریزیومے قبول کرے گا؟","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"نہیں یہ صرف پڑھنے کے قابل متن اور سادہ ساخت کو چیک کرتا ہے۔ خدمات حاصل کرنے کے نظام مختلف ہیں، اور یہ ATS مطابقت کی ضمانت یا ملازمت کی پیشن گوئی نہیں ہے۔","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"کیا یہ اسکین شدہ پی ڈی ایف پڑھ سکتا ہے؟","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"صرف اس صورت میں جب پی ڈی ایف میں قابل انتخاب ٹیکسٹ پرت ہو۔ یہ چیکر OCR ماڈل ڈاؤن لوڈ نہیں کرتا ہے۔ صرف اسکین شدہ تصویری دستاویز کے لیے پہلے OCR ٹول استعمال کریں۔","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"جاب کی تفصیل کے موازنہ کا کیا مطلب ہے؟","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"یہ میچ کا فیصد، درجہ بندی، سفارش یا آپ کی اہلیت کا اندازہ نہیں ہے۔","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"PDF ایک DOCX سے کم سرخیاں کیوں دکھاتی ہے؟","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDFs عام طور پر سیمنٹک ہیڈنگ اسٹائلز کو محفوظ نہیں کرتے ہیں۔ چیکر متن کے سائز اور پڑھنے کی ترتیب سے نمایاں لائنوں کا تخمینہ لگاتا ہے، اس لیے کالم اور بصری ڈیزائن نتیجہ کو متاثر کر سکتے ہیں۔","How local resume review works":"مقامی ریزیوم ریویو کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","Resume checker questions":"چیکر سوالات دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","Scope and limitations":"دائرہ کار اور حدود","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"مقامی آواز اور ساتھی الگ کرنے والا","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Vocal Remover — مقامی طور پر آواز اور ساتھ کو الگ کریں۔","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"اپنے براؤزر میں ایک مختصر سٹیریو آڈیو نمونے کو اندازے کے مطابق آواز اور ساتھ میں الگ کریں۔ آڈیو آپ کے آلے پر رہتا ہے۔ ماڈل اس کے عوامی میزبان سے ڈاؤن لوڈ کیا گیا ہے۔","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"30 سیکنڈ تک کا سٹیریو میوزک کلپ منتخب کریں۔ پہلے استعمال پر، براؤزر 35.6 MB ماڈل ڈاؤن لوڈ کرتا ہے۔ آڈیو فائل پر اس ڈیوائس پر کارروائی کی جاتی ہے اور اسے کبھی اپ لوڈ نہیں کیا جاتا ہے۔","What you get":"جو آپ کو ملتا ہے۔","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"دو WAV تنوں کا پیش نظارہ اور ڈاؤن لوڈ کریں: تخمینہ شدہ آواز اور بقایا ساتھ۔ نتائج کا انحصار مکس پر ہے اور اس میں نمونے شامل ہو سکتے ہیں۔","Local processing":"مقامی پروسیسنگ","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"یہ ٹول ONNX اور ONNX رن ٹائم ویب پر برآمد کردہ Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals نیٹ ورک کا استعمال کرتا ہے۔ ماڈل صرف اس وقت حاصل کیا جاتا ہے جب آپ الگ دبائیں؛ کوئی ادا شدہ تخمینہ API یا سبسکرپشن استعمال نہیں کیا جاتا ہے۔ آڈیو کو مقامی طور پر ڈی کوڈ، پروسیس اور ایکسپورٹ کیا جاتا ہے۔","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"یہ سٹیریو 44.1 kHz پروسیسنگ اور 30 ​​سیکنڈ تک کے کلپس کا تخمینہ ہے۔ مونو ذرائع کو سٹیریو میں ڈپلیکیٹ کیا جاتا ہے۔ آلات، بھاری اثرات، لائیو ریکارڈنگ اور غیر معمولی انواع میں گہرائی سے گھل مل جانے والی آوازیں رساو یا نمونے پیدا کر سکتی ہیں۔ نتیجہ کو کلین ماسٹر کے طور پر استعمال نہ کریں۔ ماڈل ڈاؤن لوڈ کے لیے انٹرنیٹ کنکشن کی ضرورت ہے۔ آڈیو اس آلہ کو نہیں چھوڑتا ہے۔","Is my audio uploaded?":"کیا میرا آڈیو اپ لوڈ ہے؟","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"No منتخب شدہ آڈیو کو آپ کے براؤزر میں ڈی کوڈ اور پروسیس کیا جاتا ہے۔ جب آپ علیحدگی شروع کرتے ہیں تو صرف نیٹ ورک کی درخواست ماڈل ڈاؤن لوڈ کی ہے۔","Why is the first run slow?":"پہلا رن سست کیوں ہے؟","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"براؤزر 35.6 MB ماڈل ایک بار ڈاؤن لوڈ کرتا ہے۔ براؤزر اسے کیش کر سکتا ہے۔ اندازہ پھر مقامی طور پر ڈیوائس CPU پر چلتا ہے۔","Will every song separate cleanly?":"کیا ہر گانا صاف طور پر الگ ہوگا؟","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"No ماڈل ایک مخر تنے کا تخمینہ لگاتا ہے اور آواز کا رساو چھوڑ سکتا ہے، ساز ہارمونکس کو ہٹا سکتا ہے یا نمونے بنا سکتا ہے۔ تنے پر بھروسہ کرنے سے پہلے سن لیں۔","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"سٹیریو آڈیو فائل (30 سیکنڈ تک)","Choose audio":"آڈیو کا انتخاب کریں۔","Separate vocals":"الگ آواز","Cancel / clear":"منسوخ / صاف کریں۔","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"شروع کرنے کے لیے ایک مختصر آڈیو فائل کا انتخاب کریں۔","Downloading the separation model…":"علیحدگی کا ماڈل ڈاؤن لوڈ ہو رہا ہے…","Separating locally…":"مقامی طور پر الگ ہو رہا ہے…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"علیحدگی مکمل۔ یا تو اسٹیم کا پیش نظارہ کریں یا ڈاؤن لوڈ کریں۔","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"اس فائل پر کارروائی یا ماڈل لوڈ نہیں ہو سکا۔ فارمیٹ اور کنکشن چیک کریں، پھر دوبارہ کوشش کریں۔","Model and weight license information":"ماڈل اور ویٹ لائسنس کی معلومات","Estimated vocals":"تخمینی آواز","Estimated accompaniment":"تخمینہ ساتھ","Download WAV":"WAV ڈاؤن لوڈ کریں۔","Progress":"ترقی","Preparing local separation…":"مقامی علیحدگی کی تیاری…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"علیحدگی مکمل۔ اس آلہ پر آڈیو باقی ہے۔","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"اس آڈیو پر کارروائی نہیں ہو سکی۔ 30 سیکنڈ سے کم کی سٹیریو میوزک فائل آزمائیں۔","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"سوئس ہیلتھ انشورنس کٹوتی کا موازنہ کرنے والا","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"سوئس ہیلتھ انشورنس فرنچائز کیلکولیٹر - سالانہ اخراجات کا موازنہ کریں۔","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"پریمیم کا استعمال کرتے ہوئے سوئس بنیادی ہیلتھ انشورنس کٹوتیوں اور اہل سالانہ طبی اخراجات کا موازنہ کریں جو آپ داخل کرتے ہیں۔ کسی بیمہ کنندہ کی قیمت کا اندازہ نہیں لگایا گیا ہے۔","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"ایک ہی بیمہ کنندہ کے ذریعہ دکھائے گئے ماہانہ پریمیم ہر ایک کٹوتی کے لیے درج کریں جو وہ پیش کرتا ہے، پھر کم، متوقع اور زیادہ سالانہ علاج کی لاگت کے منظرناموں کا موازنہ کریں۔","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"لازمی سوئس بنیادی ہیلتھ انشورنس کے لیے، ایک بالغ معیاری کٹوتی CHF 300 ہے اور ایک بچے کی کٹوتی CHF 0 ہے۔ اختیاری سطحیں عمر کے لحاظ سے مختلف ہوتی ہیں۔ کٹوتی کے بعد، معیاری برقراری فیس اہل بقایا اخراجات کا 10% ہے، جو بالغوں کے لیے CHF 700 سالانہ اور بچوں کے لیے CHF 350 ہے۔ ٹول آپ کے داخل کردہ پریمیم کو اس ماڈل شدہ لاگت کے اشتراک میں شامل کرتا ہے۔ اس سے بیمہ کنندہ کی شرحیں حاصل نہیں ہوتی ہیں یا یہ فیصلہ نہیں ہوتا ہے کہ آپ کے لیے کون سا آپشن صحیح ہے۔","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"اگر کوئی بالغ CHF 300 کی کٹوتی پر CHF 400 ماہانہ پریمیم داخل کرتا ہے اور CHF 2,500 کی کٹوتی پر CHF 350، سالانہ پریمیم فرق CHF 600 ہے۔ اس بچت کا موازنہ اپنی کم، متوقع اور زیادہ اہل لاگت والی رقم میں لاگت کے اشتراک میں ماڈل کردہ فرق سے کریں۔","How the estimate works":"تخمینہ کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","Common questions":"عام سوالات","Scope and exclusions":"دائرہ کار اور اخراج","Where do I get the premiums?":"میں پریمیم کہاں سے حاصل کروں؟","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"اسی بیمہ کنندہ، پریمیم ریجن، عمر گروپ، ایکسیڈنٹ کور اور انشورنس ماڈل کے لیے موجودہ ماہانہ پیشکشوں کا استعمال کریں۔ Priminfo سرکاری وفاقی موازنہ سائٹ ہے۔ یہ صفحہ بیمہ کنندہ کے اقتباسات کو بازیافت یا دوبارہ پیش نہیں کرتا ہے۔","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"کیا تمام درج کٹوتی کی سطحیں ہمیشہ پیش کی جاتی ہیں؟","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"نہیں، بیمہ کنندگان کو ہر اختیاری سطح کی پیشکش کرنے کی ضرورت نہیں ہے، اور پیشکشیں نوجوان بالغوں کے لیے مختلف ہو سکتی ہیں۔ صرف اپنی پالیسی کے لیے دکھائے گئے پریمیم درج کریں۔ غیر دستیاب اختیارات کو خالی چھوڑ دیں۔","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"کیا یہ میرا مکمل میڈیکل بل دکھاتا ہے؟","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"نہیں، ماڈل اہل اخراجات پر عام کٹوتی اور معیاری 10% برقرار رکھنے کی فیس کا احاطہ کرتا ہے۔ اس میں ہسپتال کے دن کے تعاون، خصوصی 40% ادویات کی برقراری، مستثنی خدمات، بغیر احاطہ کی دیکھ بھال اور اضافی انشورنس شامل ہیں۔","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"یہ ایک منظر نامے کا موازنہ ہے، نہ کہ انشورنس، طبی یا مالی مشورہ۔ یہ آپ کے علاج یا پریمیم کی پیش گوئی نہیں کرتا ہے۔ اس میں ہسپتال کے دن کے تعاون (عام طور پر CHF 15 فی داخل مریض دن، قانونی چھوٹ کے ساتھ)، بعض دوائیوں پر خصوصی 40% برقرار رکھنا، زچگی/احتیاطی چھوٹ، لازمی کور سے باہر خدمات، پریمیم سبسڈیز اور اضافی انشورنس شامل ہیں۔ اصل شریک ادائیگی اس لیے مختلف ہو سکتی ہے۔ زیادہ کٹوتی کا مطلب ہے کہ اگر آپ کو دیکھ بھال ملتی ہے تو آپ کو پہلے سے زیادہ ادائیگی کرنے کے قابل ہونے کی ضرورت ہے۔","Who is insured under this policy?":"اس پالیسی کے تحت کون بیمہ شدہ ہے؟","Adult (age 19 or over)":"بالغ (19 سال یا اس سے زیادہ)","Child (under 18)":"بچہ (18 سال سے کم)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"کم سالانہ قابل علاج لاگت کا منظرنامہ (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"متوقع سالانہ اہل علاج کے اخراجات (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"اعلی سالانہ اہل علاج لاگت کا منظرنامہ (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"ایک بیمہ کنندہ سے ماہانہ پریمیم","Monthly premium":"ماہانہ پریمیم","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"صرف اسی پالیسی کے لیے پیش کردہ اختیارات درج کریں۔ دوسروں کو خالی چھوڑ دیں۔","Adult deductible choices":"بالغوں کے قابل کٹوتی کے انتخاب","Child deductible choices":"بچوں کی کٹوتی کے قابل انتخاب","Compare annual costs":"سالانہ اخراجات کا موازنہ کریں۔","Clear entries":"اندراجات صاف کریں۔","Download CSV":"CSV ڈاؤن لوڈ کریں۔","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"تخمینہ شدہ سالانہ پریمیم کے علاوہ لاگت کا اشتراک","Deductible":"قابل کٹوتی","Annual premiums":"سالانہ پریمیم","Total at low costs":"کم قیمت پر کل","Total at expected costs":"متوقع قیمتوں پر کل","Total at high costs":"زیادہ قیمت پر کل","Cost sharing at low costs":"کم قیمت پر لاگت کا اشتراک","Cost sharing at expected costs":"متوقع قیمتوں پر لاگت کا اشتراک","Cost sharing at high costs":"اعلی قیمتوں پر لاگت کا اشتراک","Difference from lowest available deductible":"سب سے کم دستیاب کٹوتی سے فرق","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"طبی اخراجات جہاں پریمیم بچت استعمال ہوتی ہے۔","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"درج کردہ پریمیم بچت ماڈل شدہ لاگت کے اشتراک کی حد کے اندر منسوخ نہیں کی جاتی ہے۔","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"سب سے کم کٹوتی کے خلاف کوئی پریمیم بچت نہیں ہے۔","Lowest expected total among entered options":"درج کردہ اختیارات میں سب سے کم متوقع کل","Scenario details":"منظر نامے کی تفصیلات","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"کم از کم دو دستیاب کٹوتیوں کے لیے تین آرڈر شدہ طبی لاگت کے منظرنامے اور ماہانہ پریمیم درج کریں۔","Official rules and current premiums:":"سرکاری قواعد اور موجودہ پریمیم:","Federal deductible rules":"وفاقی کٹوتی کے قوانین","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo آفیشل پریمیم موازنہ","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"اس براؤزر میں موازنہ کیا گیا ہے۔","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"عمر کا گروپ، آرڈر شدہ لاگت کے حالات اور کم از کم دو ماہانہ پریمیم چیک کریں۔","Entries cleared.":"اندراجات صاف ہو گئے۔","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV مقامی طور پر ڈاؤن لوڈ کیا گیا۔","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"سوئس ہیلتھ پریمیم کمی کیلکولیٹر","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"سوئس پریمیم سبسڈی کیلکولیٹر - آپ کا نیٹ پریمیم","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"موجودہ پریمیم سے خالص سوئس ہیلتھ انشورنس پریمیم اور آپ کی کینٹن کی طرف سے پہلے سے دی گئی ماہانہ کمی کا حساب لگائیں۔","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"یہ ٹول فیصلہ نہیں کرتا کہ آیا آپ اہل ہیں یا نہیں۔","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"سوئس کینٹنز اس بات کا تعین کرتے ہیں کہ کون اہل ہے، کتنی مدد دی جاتی ہے اور آیا درخواست کی ضرورت ہے۔ یہ کیلکولیٹر صرف ایک پالیسی پریمیم سے تصدیق شدہ ماہانہ کمی کو گھٹاتا ہے اور سالانہ رقم دکھاتا ہے۔","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"اگر ماہانہ پریمیم CHF 420 ہے اور تصدیق شدہ کمی CHF 120 ہے، تو تخمینہ خالص پریمیم CHF 300 ماہانہ ہے۔","How the calculation works":"حساب کتاب کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"کیا یہ مجھے بتاتا ہے کہ آیا میں اہل ہوں؟","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"نمبر۔ اہلیت اور ایوارڈ کی رقم کا فیصلہ کینٹن آف رہائش گاہ کے ذریعہ کیا جاتا ہے۔ منسلک سرکاری معلومات استعمال کریں یا کینٹونل آفس سے رابطہ کریں۔","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"میں کمی کی رقم کہاں سے تلاش کروں؟","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"موجودہ فیصلہ یا اپنے بیمہ کنندہ کے ذریعہ دکھایا گیا کم پریمیم استعمال کریں۔ کچھ کینٹنز خود بخود تخفیف فراہم کرتے ہیں۔ دوسروں کو درخواست کی ضرورت ہے۔","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"یہ ایک پالیسی کے لیے ریاضی ہے، اہلیت یا فائدے کا فیصلہ نہیں۔ یہ گھریلو آمدنی، اثاثوں، خاندانی حیثیت، آخری تاریخ، کینٹونل حد یا درخواست کے حقوق کا حساب نہیں لگاتا ہے۔ پریمیم اور ایوارڈز تبدیل ہو سکتے ہیں۔ اپنے بیمہ کنندہ اور کینٹن سے ان کی تصدیق کریں۔","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"موجودہ ماہانہ پریمیم (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"ماہانہ کمی پہلے ہی دی گئی ہے (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"کینٹن یا بیمہ کنندہ کے ذریعہ تصدیق شدہ رقم درج کریں۔ ایک تخمینہ کو بطور ایوارڈ استعمال نہ کریں۔","Calculate net premium":"نیٹ پریمیم کا حساب لگائیں۔","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"موجودہ پریمیم اور تصدیق شدہ کمی درج کریں۔","Estimated premium after reduction":"کمی کے بعد تخمینی پریمیم","Current monthly premium":"موجودہ ماہانہ پریمیم","Monthly reduction":"ماہانہ کمی","Estimated net monthly premium":"تخمینہ خالص ماہانہ پریمیم","Reduction over 12 months":"12 مہینوں میں کمی","Reduction as a share of premium":"پریمیم کے حصہ کے طور پر کمی","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"حساب مکمل۔ اپنے کینٹن اور بیمہ کنندہ کے ساتھ ایوارڈ اور موثر تاریخوں کی تصدیق کریں۔","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"چیک کریں کہ کمی ماہانہ پریمیم سے زیادہ نہیں ہے۔","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"سوئس کرایہ کے حوالہ کی شرح منظر نامہ کیلکولیٹر","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"سوئس کرایہ ایڈجسٹمنٹ کیلکولیٹر - حوالہ کی شرح کا منظرنامہ","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"صرف اس بات کا اندازہ لگائیں کہ کس طرح سوئٹزرلینڈ کے رہن کے حوالہ کی شرح میں تبدیلی رہائشی خالص کرایہ کو متاثر کرتی ہے۔ فیڈرل ہاؤسنگ آفس سے تازہ ترین شرح استعمال کریں۔","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"اپنے لیز یا تازہ ترین کرائے کے نوٹس میں بیان کردہ حوالہ کی شرح کا موجودہ سرکاری سوئس ریٹ سے موازنہ کریں۔ حساب کتاب آپ کے آلے پر رہتا ہے۔","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"0.25 فیصد پوائنٹ کا اضافہ اصولی طور پر کرائے میں 3 فیصد اضافے کی اجازت دے سکتا ہے۔ 0.25 پوائنٹ کی کمی اصولی طور پر 2.91 فیصد کمی کی اجازت دے سکتی ہے۔ یہ منظر ان تبدیلیوں کو مرحلہ وار لاگو کرتا ہے آپ کے داخل کردہ خالص کرایہ پر۔","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"CHF 3,000 ماہانہ خالص کرایہ کے لیے، حوالہ کی شرح میں 1.75% سے 1.50% تک کمی سے تقریباً −CHF 87.38 فی مہینہ (−2.91%) کی تخمینی حوالہ شرح صرف تبدیلی آتی ہے۔","How this estimate works":"یہ تخمینہ کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","Where do I find the current rate?":"میں موجودہ شرح کہاں سے تلاش کروں؟","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"لنک کردہ فیڈرل آفس برائے ہاؤسنگ صفحہ کھولیں اور موجودہ شائع شدہ شرح درج کریں۔ ٹول ایسی شرح کو سرایت نہیں کرتا ہے جو پرانی ہو سکتی ہے۔","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"کیا یہ فیصلہ کرتا ہے کہ آیا میں کرایہ میں تبدیلی کی درخواست کر سکتا ہوں؟","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"No یہ واقفیت کے لیے ایک عنصر کو الگ کرتا ہے۔ آپ کا معاہدہ، افراط زر، لاگت میں تبدیلی، تحفظات اور دیگر قانونی حالات نتیجہ کو تبدیل کر سکتے ہیں۔","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"کیا نتیجہ میں ذیلی اخراجات شامل ہیں؟","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"نمبر۔ ذیلی اخراجات اور دیگر متغیر چارجز کو چھوڑ کر ماہانہ خالص کرایہ درج کریں۔","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"نتیجہ ایک مثالی حوالہ کی شرح کا منظرنامہ ہے، قانونی رائے یا مکمل کرایہ کا جائزہ نہیں۔ اس میں مہنگائی، عام لاگت میں تبدیلی، بہتری، معاہدے کے تحفظات، انڈیکسڈ یا مرحلہ وار کرائے، نوٹس کی تاریخیں اور کینٹونل طریقہ کار شامل نہیں ہے۔ کام کرنے سے پہلے اپنے لیز اور سرکاری رہنمائی کو چیک کریں۔","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"سوئس رہائشی لیز: صرف رہن کے حوالہ کی شرح کے اثر کا تخمینہ۔ یہ قانونی فیصلہ یا مکمل کرایہ کا جائزہ نہیں ہے۔","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"موجودہ ماہانہ خالص کرایہ (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"آپ کے لیز یا تازہ ترین کرایہ کے نوٹس میں بیان کردہ حوالہ کی شرح (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"موجودہ سرکاری سوئس حوالہ کی شرح (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"حوالہ کی شرح کے منظر نامے کا حساب لگائیں۔","Reference-rate-only scenario":"صرف حوالہ کی شرح کا منظرنامہ","Current monthly net rent":"موجودہ ماہانہ خالص کرایہ","Reference-rate change":"حوالہ کی شرح میں تبدیلی","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"حوالہ کی شرح سے تخمینہ شدہ ماہانہ اثر","Scenario monthly net rent":"منظرنامہ ماہانہ خالص کرایہ","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"اسی شرح پر 12 ماہ کے لیے سالانہ اثر","potential increase":"ممکنہ اضافہ","potential decrease":"ممکنہ کمی","no reference-rate change":"کوئی حوالہ کی شرح میں تبدیلی نہیں۔","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"تخمینہ ہر 0.25 فیصد پوائنٹ کے اضافے کے لیے 3% اور ہر کمی کے لیے مساوی الٹا کمی لاگو ہوتا ہے۔ دوسرے عوامل نتیجہ بدل سکتے ہیں۔","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"اپنے لیز اور وفاقی دفتر برائے ہاؤسنگ رہنمائی کو چیک کریں۔","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"تازہ ترین آفیشل ریٹ اور رہنمائی چیک کریں۔","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"سوئس فیڈرل آفس برائے ہاؤسنگ (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"ایک منظر دیکھنے کے لیے کرایہ اور دونوں شرحیں درج کریں۔","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"منظر نامہ شمار کیا گیا۔ اس پر انحصار کرنے سے پہلے تاریخوں اور معاہدے کی شرائط کی تصدیق کریں۔","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"رقوم اور نرخوں کو چیک کریں۔ شرحیں 0% اور 5% کے درمیان ہونی چاہئیں اور 0.25 پوائنٹ کے مراحل میں مختلف ہونی چاہئیں۔","Inputs cleared.":"ان پٹس صاف ہو گئے۔","Result":"نتیجہ","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"سوئس تعطیلات کا تخمینہ لگانے والا","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"سوئس تعطیلات کا جمع ہونے والا کیلکولیٹر - مناسب رخصت بیلنس","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"اپنے معاہدے، ورک ویک، روزگار کی تاریخوں اور پہلے سے لیے گئے دنوں میں سالانہ چھٹی سے سوئس چھٹیوں کے دن کے توازن کا اندازہ لگائیں۔","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"آپ کے درج کردہ استحقاق اور کام کے شیڈول کا استعمال کرتے ہوئے ایک کیلنڈر سال کے لیے متناسب تنخواہ کی چھٹی کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔ کسی معاہدے کی شرائط کا اندازہ نہیں لگایا گیا ہے۔","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"تخمینہ لگانے والا آپ کے معاہدے میں سالانہ چھٹی کے دنوں کا تخمینہ منتخب سال میں لگائے گئے کیلنڈر کے دنوں سے کرتا ہے۔ جز وقتی کام کے لیے، اپنے معمول کے کام کے دن فی ہفتہ اور سالانہ چھٹی ہفتوں میں درج کریں۔","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"چار ہفتے کی چھٹی، پانچ دن کا کام کا ہفتہ اور سال بھر میں ملازمت کے ساتھ، پہلے سے لی گئی چھٹی کو منہا کرنے سے پہلے سالانہ استحقاق 20 کام کے دن ہے۔","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"سوئس قانونی کم از کم کیا ہے؟","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"وفاقی رہنمائی میں کہا گیا ہے کہ کم از کم چار ہفتے فی سروس سال، اور پانچ ہفتے ان کارکنوں کے لیے جن کی عمر 20 سال تک نہیں پہنچی ہے۔ ایک معاہدہ یا اجتماعی معاہدہ مزید امداد دے سکتا ہے۔","Does this decide my legal balance?":"کیا یہ میرے قانونی توازن کا فیصلہ کرتا ہے؟","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"نہیں، یہ ایک سادہ کیلنڈر ڈے پروشن ہے۔ معاہدے کی شرائط، قابل اطلاق اجتماعی قواعد، اہلیت کی غیر حاضریاں، راؤنڈنگ اور آجر کے ریکارڈ توازن کو تبدیل کر سکتے ہیں۔","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"یہ تخمینہ قانونی استحقاق کا فیصلہ نہیں کرتا یا چھٹی کی تنخواہ کا حساب نہیں لگاتا۔ اس میں کچھ طویل غیر حاضریوں، معاہدے سے متعلق مخصوص جمع اور راؤنڈنگ قواعد، عوامی تعطیلات، اوور ٹائم، کیری اوور ڈیڈ لائنز اور تنازعات شامل نہیں ہیں۔ اپنا معاہدہ چیک کریں اور مقابلہ شدہ بیلنس کے لیے مشورہ حاصل کریں۔","Leave year":"سال چھوڑیں۔","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"آپ کے معاہدے میں سالانہ چھٹی (ہفتوں)","Usual working days per week":"عام کام کے دن فی ہفتہ","Employment start date":"ملازمت شروع ہونے کی تاریخ","Employment end date":"ملازمت کی آخری تاریخ","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"چھوٹی کے دن پہلے ہی اس چھٹی والے سال میں لیے گئے ہیں۔","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"صرف واقفیت کے لیے۔ معاہدہ سالانہ استحقاق درج کریں؛ قانونی کم از کم 20 سال سے کم عمر کارکنوں کے لیے عام طور پر چار ہفتے یا پانچ ہفتے ہوتے ہیں۔","Estimate balance":"تخمینہ بیلنس","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"بیلنس کا اندازہ لگانے کے لیے اپنا معاہدہ اور تاریخیں درج کریں۔","Estimated leave balance":"تخمینی رخصت بیلنس","Annual leave at this schedule":"اس شیڈول کے مطابق سالانہ چھٹی","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"کیلنڈر کے دن اس چھٹی کے سال میں ملازم ہیں۔","Prorated days accrued":"منافق دن جمع ہوئے۔","Days already taken":"دن پہلے ہی لگ چکے ہیں۔","Estimated days remaining":"تخمینی دن باقی ہیں۔","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"آجر اور معاہدہ کے قوانین مختلف ہو سکتے ہیں۔","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"تخمینہ لگایا گیا۔ اسے اپنے معاہدے اور آجر کے ریکارڈ کے خلاف چیک کریں۔","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"سال، تاریخیں، کام کا شیڈول اور اقدار چیک کریں۔"},"tr":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"İsviçre İşsizlik Ödeneği Senaryosu","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"İsviçre İşsizlik Yardımı Hesaplayıcısı — Brüt Senaryo","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Sigortalı maaşı ve fonunuz tarafından onaylanan oranı kullanarak brüt İsviçre günlük ödeneğini tahmin edin.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Sigortalı maaşınızı ve işsizlik fonunuz tarafından onaylanan %70 veya %80 oranını girin.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"İsviçre kuralları ödenek oranını ve maaş tavanını belirler. Fon uygunluk, kesintiler, bekleme günleri ve hak sahipliğine karar verir. Aylık aralık, ödenebilir 20-23 hafta içi günleri yansıtır.","Example":"Örnek\n%70'teki","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5.000, hafta içi ödenecek gün başına yaklaşık 161,29 CHF'dir.","How it works":"Nasıl çalışır?","Questions":"Sorular","Scope and limits":"Kapsam ve sınırlar","Related tools":"İlgili araçlar","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Aylık sigortalı maaş (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Fon tarafından onaylanan oran","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Tahmin","Clear":"Temizle","Gross scenario":"Brüt senaryo","Insured salary used":"Sigortalı maaş kullanıldı","Per payable weekday":"Ödenecek hafta içi gün başına","20-day month":"20 günlük ay","23-day month":"23 günlük ay","Official benefit rules":"Resmi avantaj kuralları","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Onaylanmış rakamlarınızı girin.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Senaryo hesaplandı. Tutarları fonunuzla onaylayın.","Check the values.":"Değerleri kontrol edin.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"İsviçre Kiracılık Bildirim Planlayıcısı","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"İsviçre Kira Bildirimi Planlayıcısı ve Mektup Taslağı","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Kendi sözleşmenizdeki tarih ve şartlardan yararlanarak bir kira bildirimi planlayın; kanton kurallarını varsaymadan bir mektup taslağı hazırlayın.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"İhbar süresini, sözleşmenizdeki bir sonraki geçerli fesih gününü ve fatura tarihini girin. Ev sahibiniz veya kiracılar derneğinizle her tarihi kontrol edin.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Planlayıcı yalnızca sağladığınız tarih ve dönemi uygular. Bildirimin geçerli olup olmadığına, yasal olarak ne zaman alındığına veya özel bir korumanın geçerli olup olmadığına karar vermez.","Contract notice period (months)":"Sözleşme bildirim süresi (ay)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Ayın bir sonraki geçerli fesih günü (sözleşmeden itibaren)","Expected receipt date":"Beklenen teslim tarihi","Your name":"Adınız","Your address":"Adresiniz","Landlord / agency":"Ev sahibi / acente","Recipient address":"Alıcı adresi","Rental property":"Kiralık mülk","Place":"Yer","Letter date":"Mektup tarihi","Termination of tenancy":"Kiracılığın sona ermesi","Calculate date and draft letter":"Tarihi ve taslak mektubu hesaplayın","Planning date":"Planlama tarihi","Target date":"Hedef tarih","Editable draft":"Düzenlenebilir taslak","Copy draft":"Taslağı kopyala","Enter your contract terms.":"Sözleşme şartlarınızı girin.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Planlama taslağı hazır. Sözleşmenize göre doğrulayın.","Check the dates and period.":"Tarihleri ​​ve dönemi kontrol edin.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Sonuç, tedarik edilen sözleşme duyuru gününü takip eder; bu bir kanuni ihbar kararı değildir.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"İsviçre Mülkiyet Kazanımı Senaryosu","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"İsviçre Gayrimenkulleri Vergi Kazanıyor — Kullanıcı Tarafından Girilen Oran Senaryosu","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Kendi işlem maliyetlerinizi ve sorumlu kantonun vergi oranını kullanarak mülk kazancınızı tahmin edin.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Gelirleri, satın alma maliyetini, onayladığınız uygun harcamaları ve resmi kanton hesaplayıcısından geçerli bir oranı girin.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"İsviçre emlak kazanç vergisi kantona, elde tutma süresine, kesintilere ve duruma göre değişir. Bu araç oranları belirtmez veya kabul edilebilir maliyetleri belirlemez.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Satış gelirleri (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Satın alma maliyeti (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Kabul edilen onaylanmış diğer maliyetler (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Resmi kaynaktan alınan geçerli vergi oranı (%)","Estimate scenario":"Tahmin senaryosu","Illustrative scenario":"Açıklayıcı senaryo","Gain entered":"Kazanç girildi","Tax at entered rate":"Girilen oranda vergi","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Kayıtlarınızdan ve kanton kaynağınızdan rakamları girin.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Senaryo hesaplandı; bunu kantonla doğrulayın.","Check amounts and rate.":"Miktarları ve oranı kontrol edin.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Kanton vergi tablosu eklenmemiştir; Girdiğiniz efektif oran, tahmini yönlendirir.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"İsviçre Veraset ve İntikal Vergisi Senaryosu","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"İsviçre Veraset ve İntikal Vergisi — Fiyat Senaryonuz","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Kullanıcı tarafından girilen muafiyet ve orandan vergiye tabi tutarı tahmin edin; kurallar kantona ve ilişkiye göre değişir.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Alıcı ve kanton için onaylanmış tutarı, muafiyeti ve efektif oranı girin.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Kanton kuralları ve aile ilişkileri muafiyetleri ve oranları değiştirebilir. Bu araç bir kanton kuralı seçmez veya vergi yükümlülüğünü belirlemez.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Veraset veya hediye tutarı (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Kanton (CHF) ile muafiyet onaylandı","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Etkili oran kantonla onaylandı (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Muafiyet girildikten sonraki tutar","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Davanız için onaylanmış rakamları girin.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Tahmin yalnızca girdiğiniz muafiyet ve oranı kullanır.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"İsviçre Nafaka Bütçesi Senaryosu","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"İsviçre Nafaka Bütçesi — Şeffaf Ev Senaryosu","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Girilen bir çocuk bütçesini, girilen bir doğrudan maliyet kredisinden sonra ebeveyn gelirine göre tahsis edin.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Çocuğun belgelenen aylık ihtiyaçlarını, hem ebeveynlerin mevcut aylık gelirlerini hem de hesaba katmak istediğiniz doğrudan maliyetleri kullanın.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Bu yalnızca bir planlama çalışma sayfasıdır. Bu bir İsviçre çocuk nafakası ödülü veya yasal bir yöntem değildir; barınma, bakım, vergiler, yardımlar ve içtihatlar değerlendirilmez.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Belgelediğiniz aylık çocuk bütçesi (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Ebeveyn A'nın mevcut aylık geliri (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Ebeveyn B'nin mevcut aylık geliri (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Ebeveyn A tarafından krediye ödenen doğrudan çocuk masrafları (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Ayırma senaryosu","Illustrative allocation":"Örnek tahsis","Parent A remaining contribution":"Ebeveyn A kalan katkı","Parent B contribution":"Ebeveyn B katkısı","Entered monthly child budget":"Aylık çocuk bütçesine girildi","Enter your household budget figures.":"Hane bütçesi rakamlarınızı girin.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Bütçe senaryosu hesaplandı; Nitelikli bir danışmanla yasal yükümlülükleri tartışın.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Tutarları kontrol edin; Kredi bütçeyi aşamaz.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Hisseler girilen iki gelirle orantılıdır; Önce doğrudan maliyet kredisi çıkarılır.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Tarayıcı Tireleme Önizlemesi","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Kelime Tireleme Önizlemesi — Tarayıcı Dili Kalıpları","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Sağladığınız metin için tarayıcı tirelemesini önizleyin; destek tarayıcıya ve yüklü dil kaynaklarına bağlıdır.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Metninizle eşleşen dili seçin, bir örnek girin ve mevcut satır genişliğini ayarlayın.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Tarayıcının yerel CSS tirelemesini kullanır. Sözlükleri bir araya getirmez; desteklenmeyen tarayıcılar tire işareti göstermeyebilir. Metnin kopyalanması orijinal yazımı korur.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Metin dili (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Önizleme genişliği (karakterler)","Text to preview":"Önizlenecek metin","Preview":"Önizleme","Enter text and choose its language.":"Metni girin ve dilini seçin.","Preview updated.":"Önizleme güncellendi.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Desteklenen bir dil etiketi ve metni girin.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Tarayıcının sözcükleri nerede bölebileceğini görmek için aynı paragrafı farklı genişliklerde deneyin.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Özel Yazım Denetimi Çalışma Alanı","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Yerel Yazım Denetleyicisi — Tarayıcı Sözlüğünüzü Kullanın","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Tarayıcının yerel yazım denetimiyle metni düzenleyin, bir dil seçin ve düzeltilmiş metni kopyalayın.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Metin bu sayfada kalır. Tarayıcınızın yazım sözlüğüne sahip olduğu dili ayarlayın, ardından yazım menüsünü kullanın veya önerilerin altını çizin.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Bu çalışma alanı metin yüklemez veya sözlük göndermez. Tarayıcı yazım denetiminin kullanılabilirliği ve önerileri cihaza, tarayıcıya ve yüklü sözlüğe bağlıdır.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Yazım denetimi dili (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Kontrol edilecek metin","Copy text":"Metni kopyala","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Metni yazın veya yapıştırın. Öneriler için sağ tıklayın veya cihazınızın yazım menüsünü kullanın.","Text copied.":"Metin kopyalandı.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Otomatik olarak kopyalanamadı; metni seçin ve kopyalayın.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Eşleşen sözlüğü olmayan bir tarayıcı, hatalı yazımları işaretleyemeyebilir.","Resume Structure Checker":"Özgeçmiş Yapısı Denetleyicisi","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Özgeçmiş Denetleyicisi — Ücretsiz Yerel PDF ve DOCX İncelemesi","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Tarayıcınızda özgeçmiş metnini, başlıkları, bölümleri, bağlantıları ve madde işareti yapısını kontrol edin. İş tanımı şartlarını sayıya göre karşılaştırın; işe alım puanı veya yükleme yok.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Metin tabanlı bir özgeçmişin gerçekte neyi ortaya çıkardığını gözden geçirin: çıkarılan metin, başlık yapısı, iletişim alanı varlığı, bağlantılar ve yaygın olarak tanınan bölümler. İsteğe bağlı olarak tekrarlanan iş tanımı terimlerini karşılaştırın.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"Deneyim ve Eğitim için Başlık 1 stillerini içeren bir DOCX bu başlıkları gösterir. Bir PDF, seçilebilir metninden kontrol edilir; sütunlar farklı sırayla okunabilir.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX dosyaları yerel olarak Office ZIP/XML olarak incelenir. PDF'ler ertelenmiş yerel PDF.js motoruyla okunur. İsteğe bağlı iş tanımı karşılaştırması, her metinde seçilen terimleri sayar; bir puan oluşturmaz veya birinin işe alınıp alınmaması konusunda öneride bulunmaz.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Bu bir format ve metin yapısı kontrolüdür; bir ATS simülatörü, yasal inceleme veya röportaj başarısının tahmini değildir. Seçilebilir metni olmayan taranmış PDF'lerin öncelikle OCR'ye ihtiyacı vardır. Parola korumalı, makro etkin, imzalı veya olağandışı büyük belgeler desteklenmez.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Bir özgeçmiş seçin (PDF veya DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Dosyalarınız bu tarayıcıda kalır ve yüklenmez. Maksimum 20 MB; 50 sayfaya kadar PDF. DOCX genişletilmiş içeriği 80 MB ile sınırlıdır.","Optional job description":"İsteğe bağlı iş tanımı","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Terim sıklığı karşılaştırması istiyorsanız düz metin yapıştırın. Analiz etmeniz gerekmeyen hassas bilgileri eklemeyin.","Paste job-description text here…":"İş tanımı metnini buraya yapıştırın…","Analyze locally":"Yerel olarak analiz edin","Clear files and report":"Dosyaları ve raporu temizle","Resume review":"İncelemeye devam et","File type":"Dosya türü","Extracted characters":"Çıkartılan karakterler","Words counted":"Sayılan kelimeler","Detected headings":"Algılanan başlıklar","Recognized sections":"Tanınan bölümler","Hyperlinks found":"Köprüler bulundu","Bullet paragraphs":"Madde işaretleri","An email address appears in the text":"Metinde bir e-posta adresi görünüyor","No email address pattern was detected":"Hiçbir e-posta adresi modeli algılanmadı","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Metinde telefon numarasına benzer bir desen görünüyor","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Telefon numarasına benzer bir desen algılanmadı","Job-description terms (counts only)":"İş tanımı şartları (yalnızca sayılır)","Term":"Dönem","In job text":"İş metninde","In resume":"Özgeçmişte","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Terim sayılarını karşılaştırmak için bir iş tanımı yapıştırın.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Net başlık stili algılanmadı. PDF başlıkları metin boyutuna göre tahmin edilir ve hatalı olabilir.","Detected":"Algılandı","Not detected":"Algılanmadı","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Bu buluşsal yöntem sınırlı sayıda ortak bölüm adını tanır; hangi bölümlerin gerekli olduğuna karar vermez.","Profile / summary":"Profil / özet","Experience":"Deneyim","Education":"Eğitim","Skills":"Beceriler","Contact":"İletişim","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Seçilebilir metin bulunamadı. Yalnızca taranan PDF'lerin kontrol edilebilmesi için OCR'ye ihtiyacı vardır.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Başlamak için bir PDF veya DOCX özgeçmiş seçin.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Seçili dosya yerel olarak okunuyor…","Local structure review complete.":"Yerel yapı incelemesi tamamlandı.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Bu tarayıcı gerekli yerel belge özelliğini desteklemiyor.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Belirtilen yerel sınırlara kadar geçerli bir PDF veya modern DOCX dosyası seçin.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF okunamadı. Hasar görmüş, şifrelenmiş olabilir veya seçilebilir metin içermeyebilir.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX paketi güvenli bir şekilde açılamadı veya okunamadı.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Bu araç özgeçmişimi yüklüyor mu yoksa kaydediyor mu?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Hayır. Ayrıştırma ve analiz tarayıcınızda çalışır. Raporu temizledikten veya sayfadan ayrıldıktan sonra dosya metni bir sunucuya gönderilmez veya saklanmaz.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Bir ATS'nin veya işverenin özgeçmişimi kabul edip etmeyeceğini tahmin ediyor mu?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Hayır. Yalnızca okunabilir metni ve basit yapıyı kontrol eder. İşe alma sistemleri farklılık gösterir ve bu bir ATS uyumluluk garantisi veya işe alım tahmini değildir.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Taranmış bir PDF'yi okuyabilir mi?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Yalnızca PDF'nin seçilebilir bir metin katmanı varsa. Bu denetleyici OCR modellerini indirmez; Taranan yalnızca görüntü içeren bir belge için öncelikle bir OCR aracı kullanın.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"İş tanımı karşılaştırması ne anlama geliyor?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Basit normalleştirmeden sonra yinelenen terimlerin sayımlarını gösterir. Niteliklerinizin eşleşme yüzdesi, sıralaması, tavsiyesi veya değerlendirmesi değildir.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Neden bir PDF, DOCX'ten daha az başlık gösteriyor?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF'ler genellikle anlamsal başlık stillerini korumaz. Denetleyici, metin boyutundan ve okuma sırasından öne çıkan satırları tahmin eder, böylece sütunlar ve görsel tasarım sonucu etkileyebilir.","How local resume review works":"Yerel özgeçmiş incelemesi nasıl çalışır?","Resume checker questions":"Özgeçmiş denetleyici soruları","Scope and limitations":"Kapsam ve sınırlamalar","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Yerel Vokal ve Eşlik Ayırıcı","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Vokal Temizleyici — Yerel Olarak Ayrı Vokal ve Eşlik","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Tarayıcınızda kısa bir stereo ses örneğini tahmini vokallere ve eşliklere ayırın. Ses cihazınızda kalır; model genel ana bilgisayarından indirilir.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"30 saniyeye kadar stereo müzik klibi seçin. İlk kullanımda tarayıcı 35,6 MB'lık bir modeli indirir. Ses dosyası bu cihazda işlenir ve hiçbir zaman yüklenmez.","What you get":"Ne elde edersiniz?","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"İki WAV gövdesini önizleyin ve indirin: tahmini vokaller ve kalan eşlik. Sonuçlar karışıma bağlıdır ve eserler içerebilir.","Local processing":"Yerel işleme","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Araç, ONNX ve ONNX Runtime Web'e aktarılan Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vokal ağını kullanır. Model yalnızca Ayır'a bastığınızda getirilir; ücretli çıkarım API'si veya abonelik kullanılmaz. Sesin kodu çözülür, işlenir ve yerel olarak dışa aktarılır.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Bu, stereo 44,1 kHz işleme ve 30 saniyeye kadar klipler için bir tahmindir. Mono kaynaklar stereoya kopyalanır. Enstrümanlara derinlemesine karıştırılan vokaller, ağır efektler, canlı kayıtlar ve olağandışı türler sızıntı veya artifaktlar üretebilir. Sonucu temiz ana olarak kullanmayın. Modelin indirilmesi internet bağlantısı gerektirir; ses bu cihazdan çıkmıyor.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Sesim yüklendi mi?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Hayır. Seçilen sesin kodu çözülür ve tarayıcınızda işlenir. Ayrışmaya başladığınızda tek ağ isteği modelin indirilmesidir.","Why is the first run slow?":"İlk çalıştırma neden yavaş?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Tarayıcı 35,6 MB'lık modeli bir kez indirir; tarayıcı bunu önbelleğe alabilir. Çıkarım daha sonra cihazın CPU'sunda yerel olarak çalışır.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Her şarkı temiz bir şekilde ayrılacak mı?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Hayır. Model bir ses kökünü tahmin eder ve ses sızıntısı bırakabilir, enstrüman harmoniklerini ortadan kaldırabilir veya artefaktlar yaratabilir. Bir gövdeye güvenmeden önce dinleyin.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Stereo ses dosyası (30 saniyeye kadar)","Choose audio":"Ses seç","Separate vocals":"Ayrı vokaller","Cancel / clear":"İptal / temizle","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Başlamak için kısa bir ses dosyası seçin.","Downloading the separation model…":"Ayırma modeli indiriliyor…","Separating locally…":"Yerel olarak ayrıştırılıyor…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Ayırma tamamlandı. Köklerden herhangi birini önizleyin veya indirin.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Bu dosya işlenemedi veya model yüklenemedi. Formatı ve bağlantıyı kontrol edip tekrar deneyin.","Model and weight license information":"Model ve ağırlık lisans bilgileri","Estimated vocals":"Tahmini vokaller","Estimated accompaniment":"Tahmini eşlik","Download WAV":"WAV'ı İndir","Progress":"İlerleme","Preparing local separation…":"Yerel ayırma hazırlanıyor…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Ayırma tamamlandı. Ses bu cihazda kaldı.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Bu ses işlenemedi. 30 saniyenin altında bir stereo müzik dosyası deneyin.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"İsviçre Sağlık Sigortası Muafiyet Karşılaştırıcısı","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"İsviçre Sağlık Sigortası Franchise Hesaplayıcı — Yıllık Maliyetleri Karşılaştırın","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"İsviçre temel sağlık sigortası muafiyetlerini primleri ve girdiğiniz uygun yıllık tıbbi masrafları kullanarak karşılaştırın. Hiçbir sigortacı teklifi tahmin edilmiyor.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Aynı sigorta şirketinin sunduğu her muafiyet için gösterilen aylık primleri girin, ardından düşük, beklenen ve yüksek yıllık tedavi maliyeti senaryolarını karşılaştırın.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Zorunlu İsviçre temel sağlık sigortası için, yetişkin standart muafiyet tutarı 300 CHF ve çocuk muafiyet tutarı 0 CHF'dir. İsteğe bağlı seviyeler yaş grubuna göre farklılık gösterir. İndirilebilir tutarın ardından standart saklama ücreti, uygun kalan maliyetlerin %10'udur; yetişkinler için yıllık 700 CHF ve çocuklar için 350 CHF ile sınırlıdır. Araç, girilen priminizi bu modellenmiş maliyet paylaşımına ekler; sigortacı oranlarını getirmez veya hangi seçeneğin sizin için uygun olduğuna karar vermez.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Bir yetişkin, 300 CHF muafiyetle aylık 400 CHF prim ve 2.500 CHF muafiyetle 350 CHF prim girerse, yıllık prim farkı 600 CHF olur. Bu tasarrufu, düşük, beklenen ve yüksek uygun maliyet tutarlarınızın her biri için maliyet paylaşımındaki modellenmiş farkla karşılaştırın.","How the estimate works":"Tahmin nasıl çalışır?","Common questions":"Genel sorular","Scope and exclusions":"Kapsam ve istisnalar","Where do I get the premiums?":"Primleri nereden alabilirim?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Aynı sigorta şirketi, premium bölge, yaş grubu, kaza teminatı ve sigorta modeli için mevcut aylık teklifleri kullanın. Priminfo resmi federal karşılaştırma sitesidir. Bu sayfa sigortacı fiyat tekliflerini getirmez veya çoğaltmaz.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Listelenen tüm indirim seviyeleri her zaman sunulur mu?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Hayır. Sigortacıların her isteğe bağlı düzeyi sunmak zorunda değildir ve teklifler genç yetişkinler için farklılık gösterebilir. Yalnızca kendi poliçeniz için gösterilen primleri girin; kullanılamayan seçenekleri boş bırakın.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Bu, sağlık faturamın tamamını gösteriyor mu?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Hayır. Model, uygun maliyetler üzerinden olağan muafiyet ve standart %10 saklama ücretini kapsar. Hastane günü katkı payları, özel %40 ilaç alıkonması, muafiyet hizmetleri, teminat dışı bakım ve ek sigortayı kapsamamaktadır.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Bu bir senaryo karşılaştırmasıdır; sigorta, tıbbi veya mali tavsiye değildir. Tedavinizi veya primlerinizi tahmin etmez. Hastane günü katkıları (normalde yatarak tedavi günü başına 15 CHF, yasal muafiyetler hariç), belirli ilaçlara ilişkin özel %40 oranındaki alıkonma, analık/koruyucu muafiyetler, zorunlu teminat dışındaki hizmetler, prim sübvansiyonları ve ek sigorta hariçtir. Bu nedenle gerçek katkı payı farklı olabilir. Daha yüksek bir muafiyet, bakım almanız durumunda daha fazla ön ödeme yapabilmeniz gerektiği anlamına gelir.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Bu poliçe kapsamında kimler sigortalıdır?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Yetişkin (19 yaş veya üzeri)","Child (under 18)":"Çocuk (18 yaş altı)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Düşük yıllık uygun tedavi maliyeti senaryosu (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Beklenen yıllık uygun tedavi maliyetleri (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Yüksek yıllık uygun tedavi maliyeti senaryosu (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Bir sigorta şirketinden aylık primler","Monthly premium":"Aylık prim","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Yalnızca aynı politika için sunulan seçenekleri girin. Diğerlerini boş bırakın.","Adult deductible choices":"Yetişkinlere yönelik indirim seçenekleri","Child deductible choices":"Çocuklara indirim uygulanabilecek seçenekler","Compare annual costs":"Yıllık maliyetleri karşılaştırın","Clear entries":"Girişleri temizle","Download CSV":"CSV'yi İndir","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Tahmini yıllık prim artı maliyet paylaşımı","Deductible":"İndirimli","Annual premiums":"Yıllık primler","Total at low costs":"Düşük maliyetlerle toplam","Total at expected costs":"Beklenen maliyetlerle toplam","Total at high costs":"Toplam ve yüksek maliyetler","Cost sharing at low costs":"Düşük maliyetlerle maliyet paylaşımı","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Beklenen maliyetlerde maliyet paylaşımı","Cost sharing at high costs":"Yüksek maliyetlerle maliyet paylaşımı","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Mevcut en düşük indirimden fark","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Prim tasarrufunun tüketildiği tıbbi maliyetler","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Girilen prim tasarrufu, modellenen maliyet paylaşımı aralığı dahilinde iptal edilmez.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"En düşük muafiyet karşılığında prim tasarrufu yok.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Girilen seçenekler arasında beklenen en düşük toplam","Scenario details":"Senaryo ayrıntıları","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Mevcut en az iki muafiyet için üç sıralı tıbbi maliyet senaryosunu ve aylık primleri girin.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Resmi kurallar ve güncel primler:","Federal deductible rules":"Federal muafiyet kuralları","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo resmi premium karşılaştırması","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Karşılaştırma bu tarayıcıda hesaplandı.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Yaş grubunu, sipariş edilen maliyet senaryolarını ve en az iki aylık primi kontrol edin.","Entries cleared.":"Girişler temizlendi.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV yerel olarak indirildi.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Swiss Health Prim İndirimi Hesaplayıcı","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Swiss Premium Sübvansiyon Hesaplayıcı — Net Premium'unuz","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Net İsviçre sağlık sigortası primini, mevcut primden ve kantonunuz tarafından halihazırda verilmiş olan aylık indirimden hesaplayın.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Sigortacınız veya kanton kararıyla primi ve onaylanmış aylık indirimi girin. Bu araç, hak kazanıp kazanmadığınıza karar vermez.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"İsviçre kantonları kimin hak kazanacağını, ne kadar destek verileceğini ve başvurunun gerekli olup olmadığını belirler. Bu hesaplayıcı yalnızca bir poliçe priminden onaylanmış aylık indirimi çıkarır ve yıllık tutarı gösterir.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Aylık prim 420 CHF ise ve teyit edilen indirim 120 CHF ise, tahmini net prim aylık 300 CHF'dir.","How the calculation works":"Hesaplama nasıl çalışır?","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Bu bana uygun olup olmadığımı gösteriyor mu?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Hayır. Uygunluk ve ödül miktarları ikamet edilen kanton tarafından belirlenir. Bağlantılı resmi bilgileri kullanın veya kanton ofisi ile iletişime geçin.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"İndirim miktarını nerede bulabilirim?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Mevcut kararı veya sigortacınız tarafından gösterilen indirimli primi kullanın. Bazı kantonlar indirimleri otomatik olarak uygulamaktadır; diğerleri bir başvuru gerektirir.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Bu bir uygunluk veya fayda kararı değil, tek bir poliçeye ilişkin aritmetiktir. Hanehalkı gelirini, varlıklarını, aile durumunu, son başvuru tarihlerini, kanton eşiklerini veya başvuru haklarını hesaplamaz. Primler ve ödüller değişebilir; bunları sigortacınız ve kantonunuzla onaylayın.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Geçerli aylık prim (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Aylık indirim zaten verildi (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Kanton veya sigortacı tarafından onaylanan tutarı girin; Tahmini ödül olarak kullanmayın.","Calculate net premium":"Net primi hesaplayın","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Mevcut primi ve onaylanmış indirimi girin.","Estimated premium after reduction":"İndirim sonrası tahmini prim","Current monthly premium":"Geçerli aylık prim","Monthly reduction":"Aylık indirim","Estimated net monthly premium":"Tahmini net aylık prim","Reduction over 12 months":"12 ayda azalma","Reduction as a share of premium":"Prim payı olarak indirim","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Hesaplama tamamlandı. Kararı ve geçerlilik tarihlerini kantonunuzla ve sigortacınızla teyit edin.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"İndirimin aylık primden fazla olup olmadığını kontrol edin.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"İsviçre Kira Referans Oranı Senaryosu Hesaplayıcı","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"İsviçre Kira Ayarlaması Hesaplayıcı - Referans Oranı Senaryosu","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"İsviçre'nin ipotek referans oranındaki bir değişikliğin konut net kirasını nasıl etkileyeceğini yalnızca tahmin edin. Federal konut ofisinin en son tarifesini kullanın.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Kira sözleşmenizde veya en son kira bildiriminizde belirtilen referans ücretini geçerli resmi İsviçre ücretiyle karşılaştırın. Hesaplama cihazınızda kalır.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Federal Konut Dairesi her üç ayda bir İsviçre kira ayarlamaları için bir ipotek referans oranı yayınlıyor. Yüzde 0,25'lik bir artış prensip olarak kirada %3'lük bir artışa izin verebilir; 0,25 puanlık bir düşüş prensipte %2,91'lik bir azalmaya izin verebilir. Bu senaryo, bu değişiklikleri adım adım girdiğiniz net kiraya uygular.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Aylık 3.000 CHF net kira için referans oranının %1,75'ten %1,50'ye düşmesi, yalnızca referans oranı için ayda yaklaşık −CHF 87,38 (%−2,91) tutarında bir tahmini değişiklik sağlar.","How this estimate works":"Bu tahmin nasıl işliyor?","Where do I find the current rate?":"Mevcut oranı nerede bulabilirim?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Bağlantılı Federal Konut Dairesi sayfasını açın ve yayınlanan güncel ücreti girin. Araç, geçerliliğini yitirebilecek bir oran içermiyor.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Bu, kira değişikliği talep edip edemeyeceğime karar verir mi?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Hayır. Yönelim için bir faktörü izole eder. Sözleşmeniz, enflasyon, maliyet değişiklikleri, rezervasyonlarınız ve diğer yasal koşullar sonucu değiştirebilir.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Sonuç yan maliyetleri içeriyor mu?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Hayır. Yan masraflar ve diğer değişken masraflar hariç aylık net kirayı girin.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Sonuç, hukuki bir görüş veya eksiksiz bir kira incelemesi değil, açıklayıcı bir referans oranı senaryosudur. Enflasyonu, genel maliyet değişikliklerini, iyileştirmeleri, sözleşmeye bağlı rezervasyonları, endeksli veya kademeli kiraları, bildirim tarihlerini ve kanton prosedürlerini kapsamaz. Harekete geçmeden önce kira kontratınızı ve resmi kılavuzu kontrol edin.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"İsviçre konut kiralamaları: yalnızca ipotek referans oranı etkisine ilişkin bir tahmin. Bu yasal bir karar ya da tam bir kira incelemesi değildir.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Geçerli aylık net kira (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Kira sözleşmenizde veya en son kira bildiriminizde belirtilen referans oranı (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Güncel resmi İsviçre referans oranı (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Referans oranı senaryosunu hesaplayın","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Yalnızca referans oranı senaryosu","Current monthly net rent":"Geçerli aylık net kira","Reference-rate change":"Referans oranı değişimi","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Referans oranına göre tahmini aylık etki","Scenario monthly net rent":"Senaryo aylık net kira","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"12 ay boyunca aynı oranda yıllık etki","potential increase":"potansiyel artış","potential decrease":"potansiyel azalma","no reference-rate change":"referans oranında değişiklik yok","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Tahmin, her 0,25 yüzde puanlık artış için %3 ve her düşüş için eşdeğer ters azalma için geçerlidir. Diğer faktörler sonucu değiştirebilir.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Buna enflasyon, genel maliyet değişiklikleri, iyileştirmeler, sözleşme rezervasyonları, endeksli veya kademeli kiralar, bildirim tarihleri ​​veya yerel prosedür gereklilikleri dahil değildir. Kira kontratınızı ve Federal Konut Dairesi'nin kılavuzunu kontrol edin.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"En son resmi tarifeyi ve yönlendirmeyi kontrol edin","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"İsviçre Federal Konut Dairesi (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Bir senaryo görmek için kirayı ve her iki oranı da girin.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Senaryo hesaplandı. Güvenmeden önce tarihleri ​​ve sözleşme koşullarını doğrulayın.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Miktarları ve oranları kontrol edin. Oranlar %0 ile %5 arasında olmalı ve 0,25 puanlık adımlarla farklılık göstermelidir.","Inputs cleared.":"Girişler temizlendi.","Result":"Sonuç","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"İsviçre Tatil Tahakkuk Tahmin Aracı","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"İsviçre Tatil Tahakkuk Hesaplayıcısı — Eşit Oranlı İzin Bakiyesi","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Sözleşmenizdeki yıllık izin, çalışma haftası, istihdam tarihleri ve halihazırda alınmış olan günlerden İsviçre tatil günü bakiyesini tahmin edin.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Girdiğiniz yetki ve çalışma programını kullanarak bir takvim yılı için eşit olarak dağıtılmış ücretli izinleri tahmin edin. Hiçbir sözleşme şartı tahmin edilmemektedir.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Tahmin aracı, sözleşmenizdeki yıllık izin günlerini, seçilen yılda kullanılan takvim günlerine eşit olarak dağıtır. Yarı zamanlı çalışma için haftalık normal çalışma günlerinizi ve hafta cinsinden yıllık izinlerinizi girin.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Dört haftalık izin, beş günlük çalışma haftası ve yıl boyunca istihdam ile yıllık hak, halihazırda alınmış olan izinlerin düşülmesinden önceki 20 iş günüdür.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"İsviçre yasal minimum değeri nedir?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Federal kılavuz, hizmet yılı başına en az dört haftayı ve 20 yaşına ulaşmamış işçiler için beş haftayı belirtir. Bir sözleşme veya toplu sözleşme daha fazlasını sağlayabilir.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Bu, yasal bakiyemi belirler mi?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Hayır. Bu basit bir takvim günü orantısıdır. Sözleşme şartları, geçerli toplu kurallar, nitelikli devamsızlıklar, yuvarlama ve işveren kayıtları dengeyi değiştirebilir.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Bu tahmin, yasal hak sahipliğine karar vermez veya tatil ücretini hesaplamaz. Belirli uzun süreli devamsızlıklar, sözleşmeye özel tahakkuk ve yuvarlama kuralları, resmi tatiller, fazla mesai, devir teslim tarihleri ​​ve anlaşmazlıklar için yapılan indirimler hariçtir. Sözleşmenizi kontrol edin ve ihtilaflı bir bakiye için tavsiye alın.","Leave year":"Yıldan ayrıl","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Sözleşmenizdeki yıllık izin (hafta)","Usual working days per week":"Haftalık olağan çalışma günleri","Employment start date":"İşe başlama tarihi","Employment end date":"İşe giriş tarihi","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Bu izin yılında halihazırda alınmış olan izin günleri","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Yalnızca yönlendirme için. Sözleşmeye bağlı yıllık yetkiyi girin; yasal minimum süre genellikle dört hafta veya 20 yaşın altındaki işçiler için beş haftadır.","Estimate balance":"Tahmini bakiye","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Bakiyeyi tahmin etmek için sözleşmenizi ve tarihlerinizi girin.","Estimated leave balance":"Tahmini izin bakiyesi","Annual leave at this schedule":"Bu programa göre yıllık izin","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Bu izin yılında kullanılan takvim günleri","Prorated days accrued":"Tahakkuk eden eşit gün sayısı","Days already taken":"Önceden alınmış günler","Estimated days remaining":"Tahmini kalan gün sayısı","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Bu, çalışma dönemindeki takvim günlerine göre yıllık izinleri eşit olarak dağıtır. İşveren ve sözleşme kuralları farklı olabilir.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Tahmin hesaplandı. Sözleşmenize ve işveren kayıtlarınıza göre kontrol edin.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Yılı, tarihleri, çalışma programını ve değerleri kontrol edin."},"vi":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Kịch bản trợ cấp thất nghiệp ở Thụy Sĩ","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Máy tính trợ cấp thất nghiệp của Thụy Sĩ — Kịch bản tổng","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Ước tính tổng trợ cấp hàng ngày của Thụy Sĩ bằng cách sử dụng mức lương và mức được bảo hiểm được quỹ của bạn xác nhận.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Nhập mức lương được bảo hiểm và tỷ lệ 70% hoặc 80% được quỹ thất nghiệp của bạn xác nhận.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Quy tắc của Thụy Sĩ quy định mức phụ cấp và giới hạn lương. Quỹ quyết định tính đủ điều kiện, các khoản khấu trừ, số ngày chờ đợi và quyền lợi. Phạm vi hàng tháng phản ánh 20–23 ngày trong tuần phải trả.","Example":"Ví dụ","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5.000 CHF ở mức 70% là khoảng 161,29 CHF cho mỗi ngày trong tuần phải trả.","How it works":"Cách thức hoạt động","Questions":"Câu hỏi","Scope and limits":"Phạm vi và giới hạn","Related tools":"Các công cụ liên quan","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Lương bảo hiểm hàng tháng (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Tỷ giá được xác nhận bởi quỹ","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Ước tính","Clear":"Xóa","Gross scenario":"Kịch bản tổng thể","Insured salary used":"Tiền lương được bảo hiểm đã sử dụng","Per payable weekday":"Mỗi ngày thanh toán trong tuần","20-day month":"tháng 20 ngày","23-day month":"tháng 23 ngày","Official benefit rules":"Quy tắc phúc lợi chính thức","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Nhập số liệu đã được xác nhận của bạn.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Kịch bản được tính toán. Xác nhận số tiền với quỹ của bạn.","Check the values.":"Kiểm tra các giá trị.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Công cụ lập kế hoạch thông báo thuê nhà ở Thụy Sĩ","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Bản kế hoạch thông báo cho thuê nhà ở Thụy Sĩ và bản thảo thư","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Lên kế hoạch thông báo thuê nhà từ ngày và điều khoản trong hợp đồng của chính bạn; soạn thảo một lá thư mà không cần tuân theo các quy định của bang.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Nhập thời hạn thông báo, ngày chấm dứt hợp lệ tiếp theo trong hợp đồng của bạn và ngày nhận. Kiểm tra hàng ngày với hiệp hội chủ nhà hoặc người thuê nhà của bạn.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Công cụ lập kế hoạch chỉ áp dụng ngày và khoảng thời gian bạn cung cấp. Nó không quyết định liệu thông báo có hợp lệ hay không, khi nào nó được nhận một cách hợp pháp hoặc liệu có áp dụng biện pháp bảo vệ đặc biệt hay không.","Contract notice period (months)":"Thời gian thông báo hợp đồng (tháng)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Ngày chấm dứt hợp lệ tiếp theo trong tháng (từ hợp đồng)","Expected receipt date":"Ngày nhận dự kiến","Your name":"Tên của bạn","Your address":"Địa chỉ của bạn","Landlord / agency":"Chủ nhà / đại lý","Recipient address":"Địa chỉ người nhận","Rental property":"Cho thuê bất động sản","Place":"Địa điểm","Letter date":"Ngày thư","Termination of tenancy":"Chấm dứt hợp đồng thuê nhà","Calculate date and draft letter":"Tính ngày và thư nháp","Planning date":"Ngày quy hoạch","Target date":"Ngày mục tiêu","Editable draft":"Bản nháp có thể chỉnh sửa","Copy draft":"Sao chép bản nháp","Enter your contract terms.":"Nhập các điều khoản hợp đồng của bạn.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Dự thảo quy hoạch đã sẵn sàng. Xác minh đối với hợp đồng của bạn.","Check the dates and period.":"Kiểm tra ngày và giờ.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Kết quả diễn ra sau ngày thông báo hợp đồng được cung cấp; nó không phải là một phán quyết thông báo theo luật định.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Kịch bản tăng tài sản ở Thụy Sĩ","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Thuế thu được từ tài sản của Thụy Sĩ — Kịch bản tỷ giá do người dùng nhập","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Ước tính lợi nhuận từ tài sản bằng cách sử dụng chi phí giao dịch của riêng bạn và thuế suất từ bang chịu trách nhiệm.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Nhập số tiền thu được, chi phí mua lại, chi phí đủ điều kiện mà bạn đã xác nhận và tỷ giá hiệu quả từ công cụ tính toán chính thức của bang.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Thuế thu nhập tài sản của Thụy Sĩ thay đổi tùy theo bang, thời gian nắm giữ, các khoản khấu trừ và trường hợp. Công cụ này không cung cấp mức giá hoặc xác định chi phí có thể chấp nhận được.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Tiền bán hàng (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Chi phí mua lại (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Các chi phí khác được xác nhận có thể chấp nhận được (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Thuế suất hiệu lực từ nguồn chính thức (%)","Estimate scenario":"Kịch bản ước tính","Illustrative scenario":"Tình huống minh họa","Gain entered":"Đã nhập mức tăng","Tax at entered rate":"Thuế theo tỷ lệ đã nhập","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Nhập số liệu từ hồ sơ và nguồn bang của bạn.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Kịch bản được tính toán; xác minh nó với bang.","Check amounts and rate.":"Kiểm tra số lượng và tỷ giá.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Không có bảng thuế bang nào được nhúng; tỷ lệ hiệu quả đã nhập của bạn sẽ thúc đẩy ước tính.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Kịch bản thuế quà tặng và thừa kế của Thụy Sĩ","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Thuế thừa kế và quà tặng của Thụy Sĩ — Kịch bản tỷ lệ của bạn","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Ước tính số tiền chịu thuế từ mức miễn thuế và thuế suất do người dùng nhập; các quy tắc khác nhau tùy theo bang và mối quan hệ.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Nhập số tiền, mức miễn trừ và tỷ lệ hiệu lực được xác nhận cho người nhận và bang.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Quy tắc của Bang và mối quan hệ gia đình có thể thay đổi các mức miễn trừ và tỷ lệ. Công cụ này không chọn quy tắc bang hoặc xác định nghĩa vụ thuế.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Số tiền thừa kế hoặc quà tặng (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Xác nhận miễn trừ với bang (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Tỷ lệ hiệu quả được xác nhận bởi bang (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Số tiền sau khi đã nhập miễn trừ","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Nhập số liệu được xác nhận cho trường hợp của bạn.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Ước tính chỉ sử dụng mức miễn trừ và tỷ lệ bạn nhập.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Kịch bản ngân sách hỗ trợ trẻ em Thụy Sĩ","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Ngân sách hỗ trợ trẻ em của Thụy Sĩ — Kịch bản hộ gia đình minh bạch","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Phân bổ ngân sách dành cho trẻ em đã nhập theo thu nhập của phụ huynh sau khoản tín dụng chi phí trực tiếp đã nhập.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Sử dụng các nhu cầu hàng tháng được ghi lại của trẻ, thu nhập hàng tháng khả dụng của cả cha và mẹ và bất kỳ chi phí trực tiếp nào bạn muốn ghi có.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Đây chỉ là bảng tính lập kế hoạch. Đây không phải là giải pháp nuôi dưỡng trẻ em hay phương pháp pháp lý của Thụy Sĩ; nhà ở, chăm sóc, thuế, phúc lợi và án lệ không được đánh giá.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Ngân sách hàng tháng dành cho trẻ em mà bạn đã ghi lại (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Phụ huynh A thu nhập hàng tháng khả dụng (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Thu nhập hàng tháng khả dụng của Phụ huynh B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Chi phí trực tiếp dành cho trẻ em do Phụ huynh A thanh toán vào tín dụng (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Phân bổ kịch bản","Illustrative allocation":"Phân bổ minh họa","Parent A remaining contribution":"Phụ huynh A đóng góp còn lại","Parent B contribution":"Đóng góp của phụ huynh B","Entered monthly child budget":"Đã nhập ngân sách dành cho trẻ em hàng tháng","Enter your household budget figures.":"Nhập số liệu ngân sách hộ gia đình của bạn.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Kịch bản ngân sách được tính toán; thảo luận về các nghĩa vụ pháp lý với một cố vấn có trình độ.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Kiểm tra số tiền; tín dụng không được vượt quá ngân sách.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Phần chia sẻ tỷ lệ thuận với hai khoản thu nhập đã nhập; tín dụng chi phí trực tiếp được trừ đi đầu tiên.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Xem trước gạch nối trình duyệt","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Xem trước gạch nối từ — Mẫu ngôn ngữ trình duyệt","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Xem trước dấu gạch nối của trình duyệt cho văn bản bạn cung cấp; hỗ trợ phụ thuộc vào trình duyệt và tài nguyên ngôn ngữ được cài đặt.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Chọn ngôn ngữ phù hợp với văn bản của bạn, nhập mẫu và điều chỉnh độ rộng dòng có sẵn.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Sử dụng tính năng gạch nối CSS gốc của trình duyệt. Nó không gói từ điển; các trình duyệt không được hỗ trợ có thể không hiển thị dấu gạch nối. Sao chép văn bản giữ nguyên chính tả.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Ngôn ngữ văn bản (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Độ rộng xem trước (ký tự)","Text to preview":"Văn bản để xem trước","Preview":"Xem trước","Enter text and choose its language.":"Nhập văn bản và chọn ngôn ngữ của nó.","Preview updated.":"Đã cập nhật bản xem trước.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Nhập thẻ ngôn ngữ và văn bản được hỗ trợ.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Thử cùng một đoạn văn với độ rộng khác nhau để xem trình duyệt có thể ngắt từ ở đâu.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Không gian làm việc kiểm tra chính tả riêng tư","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Trình kiểm tra chính tả cục bộ — Sử dụng từ điển trình duyệt của bạn","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Chỉnh sửa văn bản bằng tính năng kiểm tra chính tả gốc của trình duyệt, chọn ngôn ngữ và sao chép văn bản đã sửa.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Văn bản vẫn ở trang này. Đặt ngôn ngữ mà trình duyệt của bạn có từ điển chính tả, sau đó sử dụng menu chính tả hoặc gạch chân các đề xuất của ngôn ngữ đó.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Không gian làm việc này không tải lên văn bản hoặc gửi từ điển. Tính khả dụng và đề xuất của tính năng kiểm tra chính tả của trình duyệt tùy thuộc vào thiết bị, trình duyệt và từ điển đã cài đặt.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Ngôn ngữ kiểm tra chính tả (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Văn bản cần kiểm tra","Copy text":"Sao chép văn bản","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Nhập hoặc dán văn bản. Nhấp chuột phải hoặc sử dụng menu chính tả của thiết bị để xem gợi ý.","Text copied.":"Đã sao chép văn bản.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Không thể sao chép tự động; chọn và sao chép văn bản.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Một trình duyệt không có từ điển phù hợp có thể không đánh dấu lỗi chính tả.","Resume Structure Checker":"Trình kiểm tra cấu trúc sơ yếu lý lịch","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"Trình kiểm tra sơ yếu lý lịch ATS - Đánh giá PDF & DOCX cục bộ miễn phí","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Kiểm tra văn bản sơ yếu lý lịch, tiêu đề, phần, liên kết và cấu trúc dấu đầu dòng trong trình duyệt của bạn. So sánh các thuật ngữ mô tả công việc theo số lượng; không có điểm tuyển dụng hoặc tải lên.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Xem lại những gì sơ yếu lý lịch dựa trên văn bản thực sự thể hiện: văn bản được trích xuất, cấu trúc tiêu đề, sự hiện diện của trường liên hệ, các liên kết và các phần thường được nhận biết. Tùy chọn so sánh các thuật ngữ mô tả công việc lặp đi lặp lại.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"A DOCX với các kiểu Tiêu đề 1 dành cho Trải nghiệm và Giáo dục hiển thị các tiêu đề đó. Một tệp PDF được kiểm tra từ văn bản có thể chọn của nó; các cột có thể được đọc theo thứ tự khác.\nCác tệp","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX được kiểm tra cục bộ dưới dạng Office ZIP/XML. Các tệp PDF được đọc bằng công cụ PDF.js cục bộ bị trì hoãn. Việc so sánh mô tả công việc tùy chọn sẽ tính các thuật ngữ đã chọn trong mỗi văn bản; nó không tạo ra điểm số hoặc khuyến nghị có nên thuê ai đó hay không.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Đây là bước kiểm tra định dạng và cấu trúc văn bản, không phải trình mô phỏng ATS, đánh giá pháp lý hoặc dự đoán thành công của cuộc phỏng vấn. Các tệp PDF được quét không có văn bản có thể chọn cần có OCR trước tiên. Các tài liệu được bảo vệ bằng mật khẩu, kích hoạt macro, có chữ ký hoặc lớn bất thường không được hỗ trợ.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Chọn sơ yếu lý lịch (PDF hoặc DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Các tệp của bạn vẫn ở trong trình duyệt này và không được tải lên. Tối đa 20 MB; PDF lên tới 50 trang. Nội dung mở rộng DOCX được giới hạn ở mức 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Mô tả công việc tùy chọn","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Dán văn bản thuần túy nếu bạn muốn so sánh tần suất thuật ngữ. Không bao gồm thông tin nhạy cảm mà bạn không cần phải phân tích.","Paste job-description text here…":"Dán văn bản mô tả công việc vào đây…","Analyze locally":"Phân tích cục bộ","Clear files and report":"Xóa tập tin và báo cáo","Resume review":"Tiếp tục đánh giá","File type":"Loại tệp","Extracted characters":"Ký tự được trích xuất","Words counted":"Số từ được đếm","Detected headings":"Các tiêu đề được phát hiện","Recognized sections":"Phần được công nhận","Hyperlinks found":"Đã tìm thấy siêu liên kết","Bullet paragraphs":"Đoạn có dấu đầu dòng","An email address appears in the text":"Một địa chỉ email xuất hiện trong văn bản","No email address pattern was detected":"Không phát hiện thấy mẫu địa chỉ email nào","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Mẫu giống số điện thoại xuất hiện trong văn bản","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Không phát hiện thấy mẫu giống số điện thoại","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Điều khoản mô tả công việc (chỉ tính)","Term":"Thời hạn","In job text":"Trong văn bản công việc","In resume":"Trong sơ yếu lý lịch","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Dán mô tả công việc để so sánh số lượng thuật ngữ.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Không phát hiện thấy kiểu tiêu đề rõ ràng nào. Tiêu đề PDF được ước tính từ kích thước văn bản và có thể không chính xác.","Detected":"Đã phát hiện","Not detected":"Không phát hiện được","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Phương pháp phỏng đoán này nhận dạng một tập hợp giới hạn các tên phần chung; nó không quyết định phần nào được yêu cầu.","Profile / summary":"Hồ sơ / tóm tắt","Experience":"Kinh nghiệm","Education":"Giáo dục","Skills":"Kỹ năng","Contact":"Liên hệ","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Không tìm thấy văn bản có thể chọn. Các tệp PDF chỉ được quét cần OCR trước khi có thể kiểm tra chúng.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Chọn sơ yếu lý lịch PDF hoặc DOCX để bắt đầu.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Đọc tệp đã chọn cục bộ…","Local structure review complete.":"Hoàn tất đánh giá cấu trúc cục bộ.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Trình duyệt này không hỗ trợ tính năng tài liệu cục bộ bắt buộc.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Chọn tệp PDF hoặc tệp DOCX hiện đại hợp lệ theo giới hạn cục bộ đã nêu.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"Không thể đọc được bản PDF. Nó có thể bị hỏng, bị mã hóa hoặc không chứa văn bản có thể lựa chọn.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Gói DOCX không thể mở hoặc đọc một cách an toàn.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Công cụ này có tải lên hoặc lưu sơ yếu lý lịch của tôi không?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Không. Phân tích cú pháp và phân tích chạy trong trình duyệt của bạn. Văn bản tệp không được gửi đến máy chủ hoặc được giữ lại sau khi bạn xóa báo cáo hoặc rời khỏi trang.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Nó có dự đoán liệu ATS hoặc nhà tuyển dụng có chấp nhận sơ yếu lý lịch của tôi không?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Không. Nó chỉ kiểm tra văn bản có thể đọc được và cấu trúc đơn giản. Các hệ thống tuyển dụng khác nhau và đây không phải là sự đảm bảo về tính tương thích của ATS hoặc dự đoán tuyển dụng.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Nó có thể đọc bản PDF được quét không?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Chỉ khi tệp PDF có lớp văn bản có thể chọn. Trình kiểm tra này không tải xuống các mô hình OCR; trước tiên hãy sử dụng công cụ OCR cho tài liệu chỉ có hình ảnh được quét.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"So sánh mô tả công việc có ý nghĩa gì?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Nó hiển thị số lượng các thuật ngữ định kỳ sau khi chuẩn hóa đơn giản. Nó không phải là tỷ lệ phần trăm phù hợp, xếp hạng, đề xuất hoặc đánh giá trình độ của bạn.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Tại sao tệp PDF hiển thị ít tiêu đề hơn DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF thường không giữ nguyên kiểu tiêu đề ngữ nghĩa. Trình kiểm tra ước tính các dòng nổi bật từ kích thước văn bản và thứ tự đọc, do đó các cột và thiết kế trực quan có thể ảnh hưởng đến kết quả.","How local resume review works":"Cách hoạt động của quá trình đánh giá sơ yếu lý lịch tại địa phương","Resume checker questions":"Câu hỏi kiểm tra sơ yếu lý lịch","Scope and limitations":"Phạm vi và giới hạn","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Bộ tách giọng hát và đệm cục bộ","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Vocal Remover — Tách giọng hát và đệm cục bộ","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Tách một mẫu âm thanh nổi ngắn thành giọng hát và phần đệm ước tính trong trình duyệt của bạn. Âm thanh vẫn còn trên thiết bị của bạn; mô hình được tải xuống từ máy chủ công cộng của nó.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Chọn một clip nhạc nổi có thời lượng tối đa 30 giây. Trong lần sử dụng đầu tiên, trình duyệt sẽ tải xuống mô hình 35,6 MB. Tệp âm thanh được xử lý trên thiết bị này và không bao giờ được tải lên.","What you get":"Những gì bạn nhận được","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Xem trước và tải xuống hai phần WAV: giọng hát ước tính và phần đệm còn lại. Kết quả phụ thuộc vào sự kết hợp và có thể chứa các thành phần lạ.","Local processing":"Xử lý cục bộ","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Công cụ này sử dụng mạng giọng hát Open-Unmix UMX-HQ được xuất sang ONNX và ONNX Runtime Web. Mô hình chỉ được tìm nạp khi bạn nhấn Tách; không có đăng ký hoặc API suy luận trả phí nào được sử dụng. Âm thanh được giải mã, xử lý và xuất cục bộ.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Đây là ước tính cho quá trình xử lý âm thanh nổi 44,1 kHz và quay clip tối đa 30 giây. Nguồn mono được nhân đôi thành âm thanh nổi. Giọng hát hòa quyện sâu vào nhạc cụ, hiệu ứng nặng, bản ghi âm trực tiếp và các thể loại khác thường có thể tạo ra hiện tượng rò rỉ hoặc giả tạo. Không sử dụng kết quả như một bản gốc sạch. Tải xuống mô hình yêu cầu kết nối internet; âm thanh không rời khỏi thiết bị này.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Âm thanh của tôi đã được tải lên chưa?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Không. Âm thanh đã chọn sẽ được giải mã và xử lý trong trình duyệt của bạn. Yêu cầu mạng duy nhất là tải xuống mô hình khi bạn bắt đầu tách.","Why is the first run slow?":"Tại sao lần chạy đầu tiên chậm?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Trình duyệt tải xuống mô hình 35,6 MB một lần; trình duyệt có thể lưu trữ nó. Suy luận sau đó chạy cục bộ trên CPU của thiết bị.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Mọi bài hát có tách biệt rõ ràng không?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Không. Mô hình ước tính gốc giọng hát và có thể để lại hiện tượng rò rỉ giọng hát, loại bỏ sóng hài của nhạc cụ hoặc tạo ra hiện tượng giả. Hãy lắng nghe trước khi dựa vào một thân cây.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Tệp âm thanh nổi (tối đa 30 giây)","Choose audio":"Chọn âm thanh","Separate vocals":"Giọng hát riêng biệt","Cancel / clear":"Hủy/xóa","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Chọn một tệp âm thanh ngắn để bắt đầu.","Downloading the separation model…":"Đang tải xuống mô hình phân tách…","Separating locally…":"Tách cục bộ…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Tách hoàn tất. Xem trước hoặc tải xuống một trong hai gốc.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Không thể xử lý tệp này hoặc tải mô hình. Hãy kiểm tra định dạng và kết nối, sau đó thử lại.","Model and weight license information":"Thông tin giấy phép về mẫu mã và trọng lượng","Estimated vocals":"Giọng hát ước tính","Estimated accompaniment":"Đệm ước tính","Download WAV":"Tải xuống WAV","Progress":"Tiến độ","Preparing local separation…":"Chuẩn bị phân tách cục bộ…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Tách hoàn tất. Âm thanh vẫn còn trên thiết bị này.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Không thể xử lý âm thanh này. Hãy thử một tệp nhạc âm thanh nổi có thời lượng dưới 30 giây.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Bộ so sánh khấu trừ bảo hiểm y tế Thụy Sĩ","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Máy tính nhượng quyền bảo hiểm y tế Thụy Sĩ — So sánh chi phí hàng năm","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"So sánh các khoản khấu trừ bảo hiểm y tế cơ bản của Thụy Sĩ dựa trên phí bảo hiểm và chi phí y tế hàng năm đủ điều kiện mà bạn nhập. Không có báo giá bảo hiểm nào được đoán.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Nhập phí bảo hiểm hàng tháng do cùng một công ty bảo hiểm hiển thị cho mỗi khoản khấu trừ mà họ cung cấp, sau đó so sánh các kịch bản chi phí điều trị hàng năm thấp, dự kiến ​​và cao.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Đối với bảo hiểm y tế cơ bản bắt buộc của Thụy Sĩ, khoản khấu trừ tiêu chuẩn dành cho người lớn là 300 CHF và khoản khấu trừ dành cho trẻ em là 0 CHF. Các mức tùy chọn khác nhau tùy theo nhóm tuổi. Sau khoản khấu trừ, phí duy trì tiêu chuẩn là 10% chi phí còn lại đủ điều kiện, tối đa ở mức 700 CHF mỗi năm cho người lớn và 350 CHF cho trẻ em. Công cụ này sẽ thêm phí bảo hiểm đã nhập của bạn vào phần chia sẻ chi phí được mô hình hóa này; nó không lấy mức phí bảo hiểm hoặc quyết định lựa chọn nào phù hợp với bạn.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Nếu một người trưởng thành đóng 400 CHF phí bảo hiểm hàng tháng với mức khấu trừ 300 CHF và 350 CHF với mức khấu trừ 2.500 CHF, thì chênh lệch phí bảo hiểm hàng năm là 600 CHF. Hãy so sánh khoản tiết kiệm đó với khoản chênh lệch được mô hình hóa trong việc chia sẻ chi phí ở mỗi khoản chi phí đủ điều kiện thấp, dự kiến ​​và cao của bạn.","How the estimate works":"Cách hoạt động của ước tính","Common questions":"Các câu hỏi thường gặp","Scope and exclusions":"Phạm vi và loại trừ","Where do I get the premiums?":"Tôi lấy phí bảo hiểm ở đâu?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Sử dụng các ưu đãi hàng tháng hiện tại cho cùng một công ty bảo hiểm, khu vực trả phí, nhóm tuổi, bảo hiểm tai nạn và mô hình bảo hiểm. Priminfo là trang so sánh chính thức của liên bang. Trang này không tìm nạp hoặc sao chép các báo giá của công ty bảo hiểm.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Có phải tất cả các mức khấu trừ được liệt kê đều luôn được cung cấp không?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Không. Các công ty bảo hiểm không phải cung cấp mọi cấp độ tùy chọn và các ưu đãi có thể khác nhau đối với thanh niên. Chỉ nhập phí bảo hiểm được hiển thị cho chính sách của riêng bạn; để trống các tùy chọn không có sẵn.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Cái này có hiển thị hóa đơn y tế đầy đủ của tôi không?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Không. Mô hình này bao gồm khoản khấu trừ thông thường và phí giữ lại 10% tiêu chuẩn đối với các chi phí đủ điều kiện. Nó không bao gồm các khoản đóng góp trong ngày nằm viện, giữ lại thuốc đặc biệt 40%, các dịch vụ được miễn, chăm sóc không được bảo hiểm và bảo hiểm bổ sung.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Đây là so sánh tình huống, không phải tư vấn về bảo hiểm, y tế hoặc tài chính. Nó không dự đoán việc điều trị hoặc phí bảo hiểm của bạn. Nó không bao gồm các khoản đóng góp trong ngày nằm viện (thường là 15 CHF mỗi ngày nội trú, với các miễn trừ theo luật định), giữ lại 40% đặc biệt đối với một số loại thuốc, miễn trừ thai sản/phòng ngừa, các dịch vụ ngoài phạm vi bảo hiểm bắt buộc, trợ cấp phí bảo hiểm và bảo hiểm bổ sung. Do đó, khoản đồng thanh toán thực tế có thể khác nhau. Khoản khấu trừ cao hơn có nghĩa là bạn cần có khả năng trả trước nhiều hơn nếu bạn được chăm sóc.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Ai được bảo hiểm theo chính sách này?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Người lớn (19 tuổi trở lên)","Child (under 18)":"Trẻ em (dưới 18 tuổi)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Kịch bản chi phí điều trị đủ điều kiện hàng năm thấp (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Chi phí điều trị đủ điều kiện dự kiến hàng năm (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Kịch bản chi phí điều trị đủ điều kiện hàng năm cao (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Phí bảo hiểm hàng tháng từ một công ty bảo hiểm","Monthly premium":"Phí bảo hiểm hàng tháng","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Chỉ nhập các tùy chọn được cung cấp cho chính sách tương tự này. Để trống những người khác.","Adult deductible choices":"Các lựa chọn khấu trừ dành cho người lớn","Child deductible choices":"Các lựa chọn khấu trừ cho trẻ em","Compare annual costs":"So sánh chi phí hàng năm","Clear entries":"Xóa mục nhập","Download CSV":"Tải xuống CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Phí bảo hiểm hàng năm ước tính cộng với chia sẻ chi phí","Deductible":"Khấu trừ","Annual premiums":"Phí bảo hiểm hàng năm","Total at low costs":"Tổng cộng với chi phí thấp","Total at expected costs":"Tổng theo chi phí dự kiến","Total at high costs":"Tổng cộng với chi phí cao","Cost sharing at low costs":"Chia sẻ chi phí với chi phí thấp","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Chia sẻ chi phí ở mức chi phí dự kiến","Cost sharing at high costs":"Chia sẻ chi phí với chi phí cao","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Sự khác biệt so với mức khấu trừ thấp nhất hiện có","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Chi phí y tế khi sử dụng hết khoản tiết kiệm phí bảo hiểm","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Tiết kiệm phí bảo hiểm đã nhập không bị hủy trong phạm vi chia sẻ chi phí được mô hình hóa.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Không tiết kiệm phí bảo hiểm so với mức khấu trừ thấp nhất.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Tổng số dự kiến thấp nhất trong số các tùy chọn đã nhập","Scenario details":"Chi tiết kịch bản","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Nhập ba kịch bản chi phí y tế theo yêu cầu và phí bảo hiểm hàng tháng cho ít nhất hai khoản khấu trừ hiện có.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Quy tắc chính thức và phí bảo hiểm hiện hành:","Federal deductible rules":"Quy tắc khấu trừ liên bang","Priminfo official premium comparison":"So sánh phí bảo hiểm chính thức của Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"So sánh được tính toán trong trình duyệt này.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Kiểm tra nhóm tuổi, các kịch bản chi phí đặt hàng và ít nhất hai khoản phí bảo hiểm hàng tháng.","Entries cleared.":"Đã xóa mục nhập.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV được tải xuống cục bộ.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Máy tính giảm phí bảo hiểm sức khỏe Thụy Sĩ","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Máy tính trợ cấp cao cấp của Thụy Sĩ — Phí bảo hiểm ròng của bạn","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Tính phí bảo hiểm y tế ròng của Thụy Sĩ từ phí bảo hiểm hiện tại và mức giảm hàng tháng đã được bang của bạn cấp.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Nhập phí bảo hiểm và mức giảm hàng tháng được xác nhận từ công ty bảo hiểm hoặc quyết định của bang. Công cụ này không quyết định liệu bạn có đủ điều kiện hay không.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Các bang của Thụy Sĩ xác định ai đủ điều kiện, mức độ hỗ trợ được cấp và liệu có cần nộp đơn hay không. Công cụ tính toán này chỉ trừ đi khoản giảm hàng tháng đã được xác nhận từ một phí bảo hiểm chính sách và hiển thị số tiền hàng năm.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Nếu phí bảo hiểm hàng tháng là 420 CHF và mức giảm được xác nhận là 120 CHF, thì phí bảo hiểm ròng ước tính là 300 CHF mỗi tháng.","How the calculation works":"Cách tính toán","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Điều này có cho tôi biết liệu tôi có đủ điều kiện không?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Không. Khả năng đủ điều kiện và số tiền thưởng được quyết định bởi bang nơi cư trú. Sử dụng thông tin chính thức được liên kết hoặc liên hệ với văn phòng bang.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Tôi tìm số tiền giảm ở đâu?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Sử dụng quyết định hiện tại hoặc mức phí bảo hiểm giảm do công ty bảo hiểm của bạn đưa ra. Một số bang tự động cắt giảm; những người khác yêu cầu một ứng dụng.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Đây là số học cho một chính sách, không phải là quyết định về tính đủ điều kiện hoặc phúc lợi. Nó không tính toán thu nhập hộ gia đình, tài sản, tình trạng gia đình, thời hạn, ngưỡng cấp bang hoặc quyền nộp đơn. Phí bảo hiểm và giải thưởng có thể thay đổi; xác nhận chúng với công ty bảo hiểm và bang của bạn.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Phí bảo hiểm hàng tháng hiện tại (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Đã được giảm hàng tháng (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Nhập số tiền được bang hoặc công ty bảo hiểm xác nhận; không sử dụng ước tính như một giải thưởng.","Calculate net premium":"Tính phí bảo hiểm ròng","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Nhập phí bảo hiểm hiện tại và mức giảm được xác nhận.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Phí bảo hiểm ước tính sau khi giảm","Current monthly premium":"Phí bảo hiểm hàng tháng hiện tại","Monthly reduction":"Giảm hàng tháng","Estimated net monthly premium":"Phí bảo hiểm ròng hàng tháng ước tính","Reduction over 12 months":"Giảm trên 12 tháng","Reduction as a share of premium":"Giảm phần phí bảo hiểm","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Tính toán hoàn tất. Xác nhận phán quyết và ngày có hiệu lực với bang và công ty bảo hiểm của bạn.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Kiểm tra để đảm bảo mức giảm không lớn hơn phí bảo hiểm hàng tháng.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Máy tính kịch bản tỷ lệ tham chiếu tiền thuê nhà ở Thụy Sĩ","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Máy tính điều chỉnh tiền thuê nhà ở Thụy Sĩ — Kịch bản tỷ giá tham chiếu","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Chỉ ước tính mức độ thay đổi trong tỷ lệ tham chiếu thế chấp của Thụy Sĩ ảnh hưởng đến tiền thuê nhà ở ròng. Sử dụng mức giá mới nhất từ ​​văn phòng nhà ở liên bang.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"So sánh tỷ giá tham chiếu được nêu trong thông báo thuê nhà hoặc thông báo thuê nhà mới nhất của bạn với tỷ giá chính thức hiện tại của Thụy Sĩ. Việc tính toán vẫn còn trên thiết bị của bạn.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Văn phòng Nhà ở Liên bang công bố một tỷ lệ tham chiếu thế chấp để điều chỉnh tiền thuê nhà ở Thụy Sĩ mỗi quý. Về nguyên tắc, mức tăng 0,25 điểm phần trăm có thể cho phép tăng tiền thuê 3%; về nguyên tắc, mức giảm 0,25 điểm có thể cho phép giảm 2,91%. Kịch bản này áp dụng từng bước những thay đổi đó cho tiền thuê ròng mà bạn nhập.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Đối với tiền thuê ròng hàng tháng là 3.000 CHF, tỷ lệ tham chiếu giảm từ 1,75% xuống 1,50% sẽ tạo ra mức thay đổi ước tính chỉ theo tỷ giá tham chiếu là khoảng −87,38 CHF mỗi tháng (−2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Cách thức hoạt động của ước tính này","Where do I find the current rate?":"Tôi tìm tỷ giá hiện tại ở đâu?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Mở trang Văn phòng Nhà ở Liên bang được liên kết và nhập tỷ giá được công bố hiện tại. Công cụ này không nhúng một tỷ lệ có thể trở nên lỗi thời.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Điều này có quyết định liệu tôi có thể yêu cầu thay đổi tiền thuê nhà hay không?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Không. Nó cô lập một yếu tố để định hướng. Hợp đồng của bạn, lạm phát, thay đổi chi phí, đặt chỗ và các điều kiện pháp lý khác có thể làm thay đổi kết quả.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Kết quả có bao gồm chi phí phụ trợ không?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Không. Nhập tiền thuê ròng hàng tháng, không bao gồm chi phí phụ trợ và các khoản phí thay đổi khác.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Kết quả là một kịch bản tỷ giá tham chiếu mang tính minh họa, không phải là ý kiến ​​pháp lý hay bản đánh giá tiền thuê hoàn chỉnh. Nó không bao gồm lạm phát, thay đổi chi phí chung, cải tiến, đặt trước theo hợp đồng, tiền thuê được lập chỉ mục hoặc theo bậc, ngày thông báo và thủ tục cấp bang. Kiểm tra hợp đồng thuê của bạn và hướng dẫn chính thức trước khi hành động.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Hợp đồng thuê nhà ở Thụy Sĩ: chỉ ước tính ảnh hưởng của lãi suất tham chiếu thế chấp. Đây không phải là một quyết định pháp lý hoặc một bản xem xét lại toàn bộ tiền thuê nhà.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Tiền thuê ròng hàng tháng hiện tại (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Giá tham chiếu được nêu trong hợp đồng thuê hoặc thông báo thuê mới nhất của bạn (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Tỷ lệ tham chiếu chính thức hiện tại của Thụy Sĩ (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Tính kịch bản tỷ giá tham chiếu","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Kịch bản chỉ có tỷ lệ tham chiếu","Current monthly net rent":"Tiền thuê ròng hàng tháng hiện tại","Reference-rate change":"Thay đổi tỷ giá tham chiếu","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Hiệu quả ước tính hàng tháng từ tỷ lệ tham chiếu","Scenario monthly net rent":"Kịch bản tiền thuê ròng hàng tháng","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Hiệu lực hàng năm trong 12 tháng với cùng mức giá","potential increase":"tiềm năng tăng","potential decrease":"khả năng giảm","no reference-rate change":"không thay đổi tỷ lệ tham chiếu","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Ước tính áp dụng 3% cho mỗi lần tăng 0,25 điểm phần trăm và mức giảm nghịch đảo tương đương cho mỗi lần giảm. Các yếu tố khác có thể thay đổi kết quả.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Điều này không bao gồm lạm phát, thay đổi chi phí chung, cải tiến, đặt trước hợp đồng, tiền thuê được lập chỉ mục hoặc theo bậc, ngày thông báo hoặc các yêu cầu thủ tục địa phương. Kiểm tra hợp đồng thuê của bạn và hướng dẫn của Văn phòng Nhà ở Liên bang.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Kiểm tra tỷ giá và hướng dẫn chính thức mới nhất","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Văn phòng Nhà ở Liên bang Thụy Sĩ (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Nhập giá thuê và cả hai mức giá để xem tình huống.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Kịch bản được tính toán. Xác minh ngày tháng và các điều khoản hợp đồng trước khi dựa vào nó.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Kiểm tra số lượng và tỷ giá. Tỷ lệ phải nằm trong khoảng từ 0% đến 5% và khác nhau ở các bước 0,25 điểm.","Inputs cleared.":"Đã xóa đầu vào.","Result":"Kết quả","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Công cụ ước tính dồn tích kỳ nghỉ ở Thụy Sĩ","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Máy tính tích lũy kỳ nghỉ ở Thụy Sĩ — Số dư nghỉ phép theo tỷ lệ","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Ước tính số dư ngày nghỉ phép của Thụy Sĩ từ thời gian nghỉ phép hàng năm trong hợp đồng, tuần làm việc, ngày làm việc và số ngày đã nghỉ phép của bạn.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Ước tính thời gian nghỉ phép có lương theo tỷ lệ cho một năm dương lịch bằng cách sử dụng quyền lợi và lịch làm việc mà bạn nhập. Không có điều khoản hợp đồng nào được đoán.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Công cụ ước tính chia tỷ lệ số ngày nghỉ phép hàng năm trong hợp đồng của bạn theo số ngày làm việc theo lịch trong năm đã chọn. Đối với công việc bán thời gian, hãy nhập số ngày làm việc bình thường trong tuần và số ngày nghỉ hàng năm theo tuần.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Với bốn tuần nghỉ phép, một tuần làm việc năm ngày và làm việc trong suốt cả năm, quyền lợi hàng năm là 20 ngày làm việc trước khi trừ đi những ngày nghỉ phép đã nghỉ.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Mức tối thiểu theo luật định của Thụy Sĩ là gì?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Hướng dẫn của Liên bang nêu rõ ít nhất bốn tuần mỗi năm làm việc và năm tuần đối với người lao động chưa đến 20 tuổi. Hợp đồng hoặc thỏa thuận tập thể có thể cho phép nhiều hơn.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Điều này có quyết định số dư pháp lý của tôi không?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Không. Đó là một tỷ lệ ngày dương lịch đơn giản. Các điều khoản hợp đồng, quy tắc tập thể hiện hành, sự vắng mặt đủ điều kiện, làm tròn số và hồ sơ của người sử dụng lao động có thể thay đổi số dư.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Ước tính này không quyết định quyền lợi hợp pháp hoặc tính lương ngày nghỉ lễ. Nó không bao gồm các khoản giảm đối với một số trường hợp vắng mặt kéo dài, các quy tắc làm tròn và tích lũy theo hợp đồng cụ thể, các ngày nghỉ lễ, làm thêm giờ, thời hạn chuyển giao và tranh chấp. Kiểm tra hợp đồng của bạn và nhận được lời khuyên về số dư đang tranh chấp.","Leave year":"Năm nghỉ phép","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Nghỉ phép hàng năm trong hợp đồng của bạn (tuần)","Usual working days per week":"Ngày làm việc bình thường mỗi tuần","Employment start date":"Ngày bắt đầu làm việc","Employment end date":"Ngày kết thúc tuyển dụng","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Số ngày nghỉ phép đã được sử dụng trong năm nghỉ phép này","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Chỉ để định hướng. Nhập quyền lợi hàng năm theo hợp đồng; mức tối thiểu hợp pháp thường là bốn tuần hoặc năm tuần đối với người lao động dưới 20 tuổi.","Estimate balance":"Số dư ước tính","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Nhập hợp đồng và ngày tháng của bạn để ước tính số dư.","Estimated leave balance":"Số dư nghỉ phép ước tính","Annual leave at this schedule":"Nghỉ phép hàng năm theo lịch này","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Ngày dương lịch làm việc trong năm nghỉ phép này","Prorated days accrued":"Số ngày tích lũy theo tỷ lệ","Days already taken":"Số ngày đã sử dụng","Estimated days remaining":"Số ngày ước tính còn lại","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Điều này chia tỷ lệ nghỉ phép hàng năm theo ngày dương lịch trong thời gian làm việc. Các quy tắc của người sử dụng lao động và hợp đồng có thể khác nhau.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Tính toán ước tính. Kiểm tra nó với hồ sơ hợp đồng và chủ lao động của bạn.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Kiểm tra năm, ngày, lịch làm việc và giá trị."},"it":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Scenario dell'indennità di disoccupazione svizzera","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Calcolatore dell'indennità di disoccupazione svizzera - Scenario lordo","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Stimate l'indennità giornaliera lorda svizzera in base al salario assicurato e alla tariffa confermata dalla vostra cassa.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Inserisci il salario assicurato e il tasso del 70% o 80% confermato dalla tua cassa di disoccupazione.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Le regole svizzere stabiliscono il tasso di indennità e il tetto salariale. Il fondo decide l'ammissibilità, le detrazioni, i giorni di attesa e il diritto. L'intervallo mensile riflette 20-23 giorni feriali pagabili.","Example":"Esempio","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5000 al 70% corrisponde a circa CHF 161.29 per giorno feriale pagabile.","How it works":"Come funziona","Questions":"Domande","Scope and limits":"Ambito e limiti","Related tools":"Strumenti correlati","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Stipendio mensile assicurato (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Tasso confermato dal fondo","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Stima","Clear":"Cancella","Gross scenario":"Scenario lordo","Insured salary used":"Stipendio assicurato utilizzato","Per payable weekday":"Per giorno feriale pagabile","20-day month":"Mese di 20 giorni","23-day month":"Mese di 23 giorni","Official benefit rules":"Regole ufficiali sui vantaggi","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Inserisci i tuoi dati confermati.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Scenario calcolato. Conferma gli importi con il tuo fondo.","Check the values.":"Controlla i valori.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Pianificatore di avvisi di locazione svizzero","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Pianificatore svizzero di avvisi di noleggio e bozza di lettera","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Pianificare un avviso di locazione partendo dalle date e dai termini del proprio contratto; redigere una lettera senza assumere norme cantonali.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Inserisci il termine di disdetta, il successivo giorno di disdetta valido nel contratto e la data di ricezione. Controlla ogni data con il tuo proprietario o l’associazione degli inquilini.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Il pianificatore applica solo le date e il periodo forniti. Non decide se la notifica è valida, quando viene ricevuta legalmente o se si applica una protezione speciale.","Contract notice period (months)":"Periodo di preavviso del contratto (mesi)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Prossimo giorno di disdetta valido del mese (dal contratto)","Expected receipt date":"Data di ricezione prevista","Your name":"Il tuo nome","Your address":"Il tuo indirizzo","Landlord / agency":"Locatore/agenzia","Recipient address":"Indirizzo del destinatario","Rental property":"Immobile in affitto","Place":"Luogo","Letter date":"Data della lettera","Termination of tenancy":"Cessazione della locazione","Calculate date and draft letter":"Calcola data e bozza lettera","Planning date":"Data di pianificazione","Target date":"Data prevista","Editable draft":"Bozza modificabile","Copy draft":"Copia bozza","Enter your contract terms.":"Inserisci i termini del contratto.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Bozza di pianificazione pronta. Verifica rispetto al tuo contratto.","Check the dates and period.":"Controlla le date e il periodo.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Il risultato segue il giorno di preavviso fornito; non è una sentenza di notifica legale.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Scenario di guadagno immobiliare svizzero","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Imposta svizzera sulle plusvalenze immobiliari: scenario con tariffa inserita dall'utente","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Stima un guadagno immobiliare utilizzando i tuoi costi di transazione e un'aliquota fiscale del cantone competente.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Inserisci il ricavato, il costo di acquisizione, le spese ammissibili confermate e un tasso effettivo dal calcolatore cantonale ufficiale.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"L'imposta svizzera sulle plusvalenze immobiliari varia a seconda del cantone, del periodo di detenzione, delle detrazioni e del caso. Questo strumento non fornisce tariffe né determina costi ammissibili.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Provento della vendita (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Costo di acquisizione (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Altri costi confermati ammissibili (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Aliquota fiscale effettiva da fonte ufficiale (%)","Estimate scenario":"Scenario di stima","Illustrative scenario":"Scenario illustrativo","Gain entered":"Guadagno immesso","Tax at entered rate":"Imposta all'aliquota immessa","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Inserisci i dati dai tuoi archivi e dalla fonte cantonale.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Scenario calcolato; verificatelo con il Cantone.","Check amounts and rate.":"Verifica importi e tariffe.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Non è incorporata alcuna tabella delle imposte cantonali; il tasso effettivo inserito guida la stima.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Scenario svizzero delle imposte sulle successioni e sulle donazioni","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Imposta svizzera sulle successioni e sulle donazioni: il tuo scenario tariffario","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Stima di un importo imponibile da un'esenzione e un'aliquota immesse dall'utente; le regole variano a seconda del cantone e del rapporto.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Inserisci l'importo, l'esenzione e il tasso effettivo confermato per il destinatario e il cantone.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Le norme cantonali e i rapporti familiari possono modificare esenzioni e tariffe. Questo strumento non seleziona una norma cantonale né determina l’imposizione fiscale.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Importo dell'eredità o della donazione (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Esenzione confermata con il Cantone (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Tasso effettivo confermato con il Cantone (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Importo dopo l'esenzione inserita","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Inserisci le cifre confermate per il tuo caso.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"La stima utilizza solo l'esenzione e la tariffa immesse.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Scenario di bilancio svizzero per il mantenimento dei figli","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Bilancio svizzero per il mantenimento dei figli: scenario familiare trasparente","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Assegnare un budget figlio immesso in base al reddito del genitore dopo un credito per costi diretti immesso.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Utilizza i bisogni mensili documentati del bambino, i redditi mensili disponibili di entrambi i genitori e tutti i costi diretti che desideri accreditare.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Questo è solo un foglio di lavoro di pianificazione. Non si tratta di un premio svizzero per il mantenimento dei figli né di un metodo legale; l'alloggio, l'assistenza, le tasse, i benefici e la giurisprudenza non vengono valutati.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Budget mensile per bambini da te documentato (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Reddito mensile disponibile del genitore A (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Reddito mensile disponibile del genitore B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Costi figli diretti pagati dal genitore A all'accredito (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Assegna scenario","Illustrative allocation":"Assegnazione illustrativa","Parent A remaining contribution":"Genitore Un contributo rimanente","Parent B contribution":"Contributo genitore B","Entered monthly child budget":"Budget infantile mensile immesso","Enter your household budget figures.":"Inserisci i dati del tuo budget familiare.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Scenario di budget calcolato; discutere gli obblighi legali con un consulente qualificato.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Verifica importi; il credito non può superare il budget.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Le azioni sono proporzionali ai due redditi inseriti; il credito per i costi diretti viene prima sottratto.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Anteprima sillabazione del browser","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Anteprima sillabazione delle parole: modelli di lingua del browser","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Anteprima la sillabazione del browser per il testo fornito; il supporto dipende dal browser e dalle risorse linguistiche installate.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Scegli la lingua che corrisponde al tuo testo, inserisci un esempio e regola la larghezza della linea disponibile.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Utilizza la sillabazione CSS nativa del browser. Non raggruppa i dizionari; i browser non supportati potrebbero non mostrare trattini. La copia del testo mantiene l'ortografia originale.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Lingua testo (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Larghezza anteprima (caratteri)","Text to preview":"Testo da visualizzare in anteprima","Preview":"Anteprima","Enter text and choose its language.":"Inserisci il testo e scegli la lingua.","Preview updated.":"Anteprima aggiornata.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Immetti un testo e un tag della lingua supportata.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Prova lo stesso paragrafo con larghezze diverse per vedere dove il browser può suddividere le parole.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Area di lavoro privata per il controllo ortografico","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Controllo ortografico locale: utilizza il dizionario del browser","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Modifica il testo con il controllo ortografico nativo del browser, scegli una lingua e copia il testo corretto.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Il testo rimane in questa pagina. Imposta una lingua per la quale il tuo browser dispone di un dizionario ortografico, quindi utilizza il relativo menu ortografico o sottolinea i suggerimenti.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Questa area di lavoro non carica testo né invia dizionari. La disponibilità e i suggerimenti del controllo ortografico del browser dipendono dal dispositivo, dal browser e dal dizionario installato.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Lingua del controllo ortografico (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Testo da controllare","Copy text":"Copia testo","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Digita o incolla il testo. Fai clic con il pulsante destro del mouse o utilizza il menu ortografico del dispositivo per ottenere suggerimenti.","Text copied.":"Testo copiato.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Impossibile copiare automaticamente; seleziona e copia il testo.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Un browser senza un dizionario corrispondente potrebbe non contrassegnare gli errori di ortografia.","Resume Structure Checker":"Riprendi controllo struttura","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Curriculum Vitae: revisione locale gratuita di PDF e DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Controlla il testo del curriculum, le intestazioni, le sezioni, i collegamenti e la struttura dei punti elenco nel tuo browser. Confronta i termini della descrizione del lavoro per conteggio; nessun punteggio di assunzione o caricamento.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Rivedi cosa espone effettivamente un curriculum basato su testo: testo estratto, struttura dell'intestazione, presenza del campo di contatto, collegamenti e sezioni comunemente riconosciute. Facoltativamente, confronta i termini ripetuti della descrizione del lavoro.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"Un DOCX con gli stili Intestazione 1 per Esperienza e Istruzione mostra tali intestazioni. Un PDF viene controllato dal testo selezionabile; le colonne possono essere lette in un ordine diverso.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"I file DOCX vengono controllati localmente come Office ZIP/XML. I PDF vengono letti con un motore PDF.js locale differito. Il confronto facoltativo tra le descrizioni del lavoro conta i termini selezionati in ciascun testo; non crea un punteggio né consiglia se assumere qualcuno.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Si tratta di un controllo del formato e della struttura del testo, non di un simulatore ATS, di una revisione legale o di una previsione del successo del colloquio. I PDF scansionati senza testo selezionabile necessitano prima dell'OCR. Non sono supportati documenti protetti da password, con macro abilitate, firmati o insolitamente grandi.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Scegli un curriculum (PDF o DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"I tuoi file rimangono in questo browser e non vengono caricati. Massimo 20MB; PDF fino a 50 pagine. Il contenuto espanso DOCX è limitato a 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Descrizione del lavoro facoltativa","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Incolla testo semplice se desideri un confronto termine-frequenza. Non includere informazioni sensibili che non è necessario analizzare.","Paste job-description text here…":"Incolla qui il testo della descrizione del lavoro...","Analyze locally":"Analizza localmente","Clear files and report":"Cancella file e report","Resume review":"Riprendi la revisione","File type":"Tipo di file","Extracted characters":"Caratteri estratti","Words counted":"Le parole si contano","Detected headings":"Intestazioni rilevate","Recognized sections":"Sezioni riconosciute","Hyperlinks found":"Collegamenti ipertestuali trovati","Bullet paragraphs":"Paragrafi puntati","An email address appears in the text":"Nel testo viene visualizzato un indirizzo email","No email address pattern was detected":"Non è stato rilevato alcun modello di indirizzo email","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Nel testo viene visualizzato uno schema simile a un numero di telefono","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Non è stato rilevato alcun modello simile a un numero di telefono","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Termini della descrizione del lavoro (conta solo)","Term":"Termine","In job text":"Nel testo del lavoro","In resume":"Nel curriculum","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Incolla una descrizione del lavoro per confrontare il conteggio dei termini.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Non è stato rilevato alcuno stile di titolo chiaro. Le intestazioni dei PDF sono stimate in base alle dimensioni del testo e potrebbero essere imprecise.","Detected":"Rilevato","Not detected":"Non rilevato","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Questa euristica riconosce un insieme limitato di nomi di sezioni comuni; non decide quali sezioni sono richieste.","Profile / summary":"Profilo/riepilogo","Experience":"Esperienza","Education":"Istruzione","Skills":"Competenze","Contact":"Contatto","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Non è stato trovato testo selezionabile. I PDF di sola scansione necessitano dell'OCR prima di poter essere controllati.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Scegli un curriculum PDF o DOCX per iniziare.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Lettura del file selezionato localmente…","Local structure review complete.":"Revisione della struttura locale completata.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Questo browser non supporta una funzionalità di documento locale richiesta.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Scegli un file PDF valido o un file DOCX moderno entro i limiti locali indicati.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"Impossibile leggere il PDF. Potrebbe essere danneggiato, crittografato o non contenere testo selezionabile.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Non è stato possibile aprire o leggere il pacchetto DOCX in modo sicuro.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Questo strumento carica o salva il mio curriculum?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"N. L'analisi e l'analisi vengono eseguite nel tuo browser. Il testo del file non viene inviato a un server né conservato dopo aver cancellato il report o abbandonato la pagina.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Prevede se un ATS o un datore di lavoro accetterà il mio curriculum?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"N. Controlla solo il testo leggibile e la struttura semplice. I sistemi di assunzione differiscono e questa non è una garanzia di compatibilità ATS o una previsione di assunzione.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Può leggere un PDF scansionato?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Solo se il PDF ha un livello di testo selezionabile. Questo strumento di controllo non scarica i modelli OCR; utilizzare prima uno strumento OCR per un documento di sole immagini scansionate.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Cosa significa il confronto tra le descrizioni del lavoro?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Mostra i conteggi dei termini ricorrenti dopo la normalizzazione semplice. Non è una percentuale di corrispondenza, una classifica, una raccomandazione o una valutazione delle tue qualifiche.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Perché un PDF mostra meno intestazioni di un DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"I PDF solitamente non conservano gli stili di intestazione semantica. Il controllo stima le linee prominenti in base alla dimensione del testo e all'ordine di lettura, quindi le colonne e il design visivo possono influenzare il risultato.","How local resume review works":"Come funziona la revisione del curriculum locale","Resume checker questions":"Riprendi le domande del controllo","Scope and limitations":"Ambito e limitazioni","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Separatore per voce locale e accompagnamento","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Vocal Remover: separa voci e accompagnamento a livello locale","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Separa un breve campione audio stereo in voci stimate e accompagnamento nel tuo browser. L'audio rimane sul tuo dispositivo; il modello viene scaricato dal suo host pubblico.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Scegli un clip musicale stereo fino a 30 secondi. Al primo utilizzo, il browser scarica un modello da 35,6 MB. Il file audio viene elaborato su questo dispositivo e non viene mai caricato.","What you get":"Cosa ottieni","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Anteprima e scarica due stem WAV: voce stimata e accompagnamento residuo. I risultati dipendono dal mix e possono contenere artefatti.","Local processing":"Elaborazione locale","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Lo strumento utilizza la rete vocale Open-Unmix UMX-HQ esportata su ONNX e ONNX Runtime Web. Il modello viene recuperato solo quando si preme Separa; non viene utilizzata alcuna API di inferenza o abbonamento a pagamento. L'audio viene decodificato, elaborato ed esportato localmente.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Questa è una stima per l'elaborazione stereo a 44,1 kHz e clip fino a 30 secondi. Le sorgenti mono vengono duplicate in stereo. Voci mescolate profondamente con strumenti, effetti pesanti, registrazioni dal vivo e generi insoliti possono produrre perdite o artefatti. Non utilizzare il risultato come un master pulito. Il download del modello richiede una connessione Internet; l'audio non lascia questo dispositivo.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Il mio audio è stato caricato?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"N. L'audio selezionato viene decodificato ed elaborato nel tuo browser. L'unica richiesta di rete è il download del modello quando si avvia la separazione.","Why is the first run slow?":"Perché la prima esecuzione è lenta?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Il browser scarica un modello da 35,6 MB una volta; il browser potrebbe memorizzarlo nella cache. L'inferenza viene quindi eseguita localmente sulla CPU del dispositivo.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Ogni canzone verrà separata in modo pulito?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"N. Il modello stima una radice vocale e può lasciare perdite vocali, rimuovere armoniche dello strumento o creare artefatti. Ascolta prima di fare affidamento su una radice.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"File audio stereo (fino a 30 secondi)","Choose audio":"Scegli l'audio","Separate vocals":"Voci separate","Cancel / clear":"Annulla/cancella","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Scegli un breve file audio per iniziare.","Downloading the separation model…":"Download del modello di separazione…","Separating locally…":"Separazione locale…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Separazione completata. Visualizza in anteprima o scarica uno dei due stem.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Impossibile elaborare questo file o caricare il modello. Controlla il formato e la connessione, quindi riprova.","Model and weight license information":"Informazioni sulla licenza su modello e peso","Estimated vocals":"Voci stimate","Estimated accompaniment":"Accompagnamento stimato","Download WAV":"Scarica WAV","Progress":"Progresso","Preparing local separation…":"Preparazione della separazione locale…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Separazione completata. L'audio è rimasto su questo dispositivo.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Questo audio non può essere elaborato. Prova un file musicale stereo di durata inferiore a 30 secondi.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Confronto delle franchigie dell'assicurazione sanitaria svizzera","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Calcolatore del franchising dell'assicurazione sanitaria svizzera: confronta i costi annuali","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Confronta le franchigie dell'assicurazione di base svizzera in base ai premi e alle spese mediche annuali ammissibili da te inserite. Nessun preventivo dell'assicuratore è indovinato.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Inserisci i premi mensili indicati dallo stesso assicuratore per ciascuna franchigia offerta, quindi confronta gli scenari di costi di trattamento annuali bassi, attesi e elevati.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Nell'assicurazione sanitaria di base svizzera obbligatoria la franchigia standard per adulti ammonta a 300 franchi e quella per bambini a 0 franchi. I livelli opzionali variano a seconda della fascia d'età. Al netto della franchigia, la quota di trattenuta standard ammonta al 10% dei costi rimanenti ammissibili, con un limite massimo di 700 franchi all'anno per gli adulti e di 350 franchi per i bambini. Lo strumento aggiunge il premio inserito a questa condivisione dei costi modellata; non recupera le tariffe dell'assicuratore né decide quale opzione è giusta per te.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Se un adulto inserisce un premio mensile di CHF 400 con una franchigia di CHF 300 e CHF 350 con una franchigia di CHF 2.500, la differenza di premio annuale è di CHF 600. Confronta questo risparmio con la differenza modellata nella condivisione dei costi per ciascuno dei tuoi importi di costo ammissibile basso, previsto e alto.","How the estimate works":"Come funziona il preventivo","Common questions":"Domande comuni","Scope and exclusions":"Ambito ed esclusioni","Where do I get the premiums?":"Dove ricevo i premi?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Utilizza le offerte mensili attuali per lo stesso assicuratore, regione premium, fascia d'età, copertura infortuni e modello assicurativo. Priminfo è il sito ufficiale di confronto federale. Questa pagina non recupera né riproduce le quotazioni degli assicuratori.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Vengono sempre offerti tutti i livelli di franchigia elencati?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"N. Gli assicuratori non sono tenuti a offrire tutti i livelli opzionali e le offerte possono differire per i giovani adulti. Inserisci solo i premi indicati per la tua polizza; lasciare vuote le opzioni non disponibili.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Qui viene mostrata la mia fattura medica completa?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"N. Il modello copre la franchigia ordinaria e la trattenuta standard del 10% sui costi ammissibili. Sono esclusi i contributi per le giornate di degenza, la trattenuta speciale sui medicinali del 40%, le prestazioni esenti, le cure non coperte e le assicurazioni integrative.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Questo è un confronto di scenari, non una consulenza assicurativa, medica o finanziaria. Non prevede il trattamento o i premi. Sono esclusi i contributi per i giorni di degenza (normalmente CHF 15 per giorno di degenza, con esenzioni legali), la franchigia speciale del 40% su alcuni medicamenti, le esenzioni maternità/preventive, le prestazioni al di fuori dell'obbligo, i sussidi sui premi e le assicurazioni complementari. Il ticket effettivo può pertanto essere diverso. Una franchigia più elevata significa che devi essere in grado di pagare di più in anticipo se ricevi assistenza.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Chi è assicurato in base a questa polizza?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Adulto (19 anni o più)","Child (under 18)":"Bambino (sotto i 18 anni)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Scenario di costi di trattamento ammissibili annuali bassi (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Costi annuali ammissibili previsti per il trattamento (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Scenario con costi di trattamento ammissibili annuali elevati (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Premi mensili da un assicuratore","Monthly premium":"Premio mensile","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Inserisci solo le opzioni offerte per questa stessa polizza. Lascia gli altri vuoti.","Adult deductible choices":"Scelte di franchigia per adulti","Child deductible choices":"Scelte di franchigia per bambini","Compare annual costs":"Confronta i costi annuali","Clear entries":"Cancella voci","Download CSV":"Scarica CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Premio annuale stimato più partecipazione ai costi","Deductible":"Deducibile","Annual premiums":"Premi annuali","Total at low costs":"Totale a costi contenuti","Total at expected costs":"Totale ai costi previsti","Total at high costs":"Totale a costi elevati","Cost sharing at low costs":"Condivisione dei costi a costi bassi","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Condivisione dei costi ai costi previsti","Cost sharing at high costs":"Condivisione dei costi a costi elevati","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Differenza dalla franchigia più bassa disponibile","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Costi medici in cui viene utilizzato il risparmio sui premi","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Il risparmio sui premi immesso non viene annullato all'interno dell'intervallo di condivisione dei costi modellato.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Nessun risparmio sul premio rispetto alla franchigia più bassa.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Totale previsto più basso tra le opzioni immesse","Scenario details":"Dettagli dello scenario","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Inserisci tre scenari di costi medici ordinati e premi mensili per almeno due franchigie disponibili.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Regole ufficiali e premi attuali:","Federal deductible rules":"Regole federali sulla franchigia","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Confronto premium ufficiale Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Confronto calcolato in questo browser.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Controlla la fascia d'età, gli scenari di costo ordinati e almeno due premi mensili.","Entries cleared.":"Voci cancellate.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV scaricato localmente.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Calcolatore della riduzione dei premi sanitari svizzeri","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Calcolatore del sussidio del premio svizzero: il tuo premio netto","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Calcola il premio netto dell'assicurazione malattia svizzera a partire dal premio attuale e da una riduzione mensile già concessa dal tuo Cantone.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Inserisci il premio e la riduzione mensile confermata dal tuo assicuratore o dalla decisione cantonale. Questo strumento non decide se sei idoneo.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"I cantoni svizzeri determinano chi ha i requisiti, quanto sostegno viene concesso e se è necessaria una domanda. Questo calcolatore sottrae solo una riduzione mensile confermata da un premio della polizza e mostra l'importo annuale.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Se il premio mensile ammonta a 420 franchi e la riduzione confermata ammonta a 120 franchi, il premio netto stimato ammonta a 300 franchi al mese.","How the calculation works":"Come funziona il calcolo","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Questo mi dice se sono idoneo?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"N. L'ammissibilità e l'importo dei premi vengono decisi dal cantone di residenza. Utilizza le informazioni ufficiali collegate o contatta l'ufficio cantonale.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Dove trovo l'importo della riduzione?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Utilizzate la decisione attuale o il premio ridotto indicato dal vostro assicuratore. Alcuni Cantoni concedono riduzioni automaticamente; altri richiedono un'applicazione.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Si tratta di calcoli aritmetici per una polizza, non di una decisione sull'idoneità o sui benefici. Non calcola il reddito dell'economia domestica, il patrimonio, lo stato di famiglia, le scadenze, le soglie cantonali o i diritti di richiesta. Premi e riconoscimenti possono cambiare; confermateli al vostro assicuratore e al cantone.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Premio mensile attuale (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Riduzione mensile già concessa (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Inserisci un importo confermato dal Cantone o dall'assicuratore; non utilizzare una stima come premio.","Calculate net premium":"Calcola il premio netto","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Inserisci il premio attuale e la riduzione confermata.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Premio stimato dopo la riduzione","Current monthly premium":"Premio mensile attuale","Monthly reduction":"Riduzione mensile","Estimated net monthly premium":"Premio mensile netto stimato","Reduction over 12 months":"Riduzione su 12 mesi","Reduction as a share of premium":"Riduzione in percentuale del premio","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Calcolo completato. Confermate il premio e le date di validità con il vostro Cantone e il vostro assicuratore.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Verifica che la riduzione non sia superiore al premio mensile.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Calcolatore dello scenario del tasso di riferimento dell'affitto svizzero","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Calcolatore svizzero per l'adeguamento dell'affitto: scenario del tasso di riferimento","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Stimare solo in che modo una variazione del tasso ipotecario di riferimento della Svizzera influisce sull'affitto netto residenziale. Utilizza la tariffa più recente dell'ufficio federale degli alloggi.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Confronta il tasso di riferimento indicato nel tuo contratto di locazione o nell'ultimo avviso di affitto con il tasso ufficiale svizzero attuale. Il calcolo rimane sul tuo dispositivo.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"L'Ufficio federale delle abitazioni pubblica ogni trimestre un tasso ipotecario di riferimento per gli adeguamenti degli affitti svizzeri. Un aumento di 0,25 punti percentuali può in linea di principio consentire un aumento dell'affitto del 3%; una diminuzione di 0,25 punti può in linea di principio consentire una riduzione del 2,91%. Questo scenario applica tali modifiche passo dopo passo all'affitto netto inserito.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Per un affitto netto mensile di CHF 3000, una diminuzione del tasso di riferimento dall'1,75% all'1,50% dà una variazione stimata del solo tasso di riferimento di circa −CHF 87,38 al mese (−2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Come funziona questa stima","Where do I find the current rate?":"Dove trovo la tariffa attuale?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Apri la pagina collegata dell'Ufficio federale dell'edilizia abitativa e inserisci la tariffa attualmente pubblicata. Lo strumento non incorpora una tariffa che potrebbe diventare obsoleta.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Decide se posso richiedere una modifica dell'affitto?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"N. Isola un fattore per l'orientamento. Il contratto, l'inflazione, le modifiche dei costi, le prenotazioni e altre condizioni legali possono alterare il risultato.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Il risultato include i costi accessori?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"N. Inserisci il canone mensile netto, escluse spese accessorie e altri oneri variabili.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Il risultato è uno scenario illustrativo del tasso di riferimento, non un parere legale o una revisione completa dell'affitto. Sono esclusi l'inflazione, le modifiche generali dei costi, i miglioramenti, le riserve contrattuali, gli affitti indicizzati o scaglionati, le date di disdetta e la procedura cantonale. Controlla il tuo contratto di locazione e la guida ufficiale prima di agire.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Locazioni residenziali svizzere: stima del solo effetto del tasso ipotecario di riferimento. Non si tratta di una decisione legale o di una revisione completa dell'affitto.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Affitto netto mensile attuale (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Tasso di riferimento indicato nel contratto di locazione o nell'ultimo avviso di affitto (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Tasso di riferimento ufficiale svizzero attuale (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Calcola lo scenario del tasso di riferimento","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Scenario solo tasso di riferimento","Current monthly net rent":"Affitto netto mensile attuale","Reference-rate change":"Modifica del tasso di riferimento","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Effetto mensile stimato dal tasso di riferimento","Scenario monthly net rent":"Scenario affitto netto mensile","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Effetto annualizzato per 12 mesi allo stesso tasso","potential increase":"aumento potenziale","potential decrease":"diminuzione potenziale","no reference-rate change":"nessuna modifica del tasso di riferimento","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"La stima applica il 3% per ogni aumento di 0,25 punti percentuali e l'equivalente riduzione inversa per ogni diminuzione. Altri fattori possono modificare il risultato.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Ciò non include l'inflazione, le modifiche generali dei costi, i miglioramenti, le prenotazioni contrattuali, gli affitti indicizzati o scaglionati, le date di preavviso o i requisiti procedurali locali. Controlla il tuo contratto di locazione e l'orientamento dell'Ufficio federale dell'edilizia abitativa.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Controlla la tariffa ufficiale e le indicazioni più recenti","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Ufficio federale dell'edilizia abitativa (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Inserisci l'affitto ed entrambe le tariffe per visualizzare uno scenario.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Scenario calcolato. Verifica le date e le condizioni contrattuali prima di fare affidamento su di esso.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Verifica importi e tariffe. Le tariffe devono essere comprese tra 0% e 5% e differire in incrementi di 0,25 punti.","Inputs cleared.":"Ingressi cancellati.","Result":"Risultato","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Stima della maturazione delle vacanze svizzere","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Calcolatore accumulo ferie svizzere - Saldo ferie proporzionale","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Stima il saldo dei giorni di ferie svizzeri in base alle ferie annuali del contratto, alla settimana lavorativa, alle date di lavoro e ai giorni già utilizzati.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Stima le ferie retribuite proporzionali per un anno solare utilizzando il diritto e il programma di lavoro immessi. Non si indovinano i termini contrattuali.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Lo stimatore ripartisce proporzionalmente i giorni di ferie annuali nel contratto in base ai giorni di calendario impiegati nell'anno selezionato. Per il lavoro a tempo parziale, inserisci i giorni lavorativi abituali alla settimana e le ferie annuali in settimane.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Con quattro settimane di ferie, una settimana lavorativa di cinque giorni e un'occupazione durante tutto l'anno, il diritto annuale è di 20 giorni lavorativi prima della sottrazione delle ferie già godute.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Qual è il minimo legale svizzero?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Le linee guida federali stabiliscono almeno quattro settimane per anno di servizio e cinque settimane per i lavoratori che non hanno raggiunto i 20 anni. Un contratto o un accordo collettivo può concedere di più.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Questo decide il mio saldo legale?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"N. Si tratta di una semplice ripartizione proporzionale dei giorni di calendario. I termini contrattuali, le regole collettive applicabili, le assenze qualificanti, gli arrotondamenti e i registri del datore di lavoro possono modificare l’equilibrio.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Questa stima non decide un diritto legale né calcola il pagamento delle ferie. Sono escluse le riduzioni per alcune assenze prolungate, le regole di maturazione e di arrotondamento specifiche del contratto, i giorni festivi, gli straordinari, i termini di riporto e le controversie. Controlla il tuo contratto e ottieni consulenza per un saldo contestato.","Leave year":"Anno di partenza","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Ferie annuali previste dal contratto (settimane)","Usual working days per week":"Giorni lavorativi abituali alla settimana","Employment start date":"Data di inizio occupazione","Employment end date":"Data di fine occupazione","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Giorni di ferie già utilizzati in questo anno di ferie","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Solo per orientamento. Inserire il diritto annuo contrattuale; il minimo legale è generalmente di quattro settimane o cinque settimane per i lavoratori sotto i 20 anni.","Estimate balance":"Saldo stimato","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Inserisci il contratto e le date per stimare il saldo.","Estimated leave balance":"Saldo ferie stimato","Annual leave at this schedule":"Ferie annuali con questo programma","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Giorni di calendario impiegati in questo anno di ferie","Prorated days accrued":"Giorni maturati proporzionalmente","Days already taken":"Giorni già occupati","Estimated days remaining":"Giorni rimanenti stimati","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Ripartisce proporzionalmente le ferie annuali in base ai giorni di calendario nel periodo di lavoro. Le regole del datore di lavoro e del contratto possono differire.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Stima calcolata. Controllalo confrontandolo con i documenti del tuo contratto e del datore di lavoro.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Controlla l'anno, le date, il programma di lavoro e i valori."},"zh_tw":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"瑞士失业津贴情景","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"瑞士失业救济金计算器 — 总体情景","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"使用您的基金确认的受保工资和费率估算瑞士每日津贴总额。","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"输入受保工资以及您的失业基金确认的 70% 或 80% 比率。","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"瑞士规则规定了津贴率和工资上限。该基金决定资格、扣除额、等待天数和权利。每月范围反映 20-23 个应付工作日。","Example":"範例","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5,000 瑞士法郎按 70% 计算，每个工作日的应付金额约为 161.29 瑞士法郎。","How it works":"工作原理","Questions":"問題","Scope and limits":"範圍與限制","Related tools":"相關工具","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"每月受保薪資（瑞士法郎）","Rate confirmed by fund":"基金確認的利率","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"估計","Clear":"清除","Gross scenario":"整體場景","Insured salary used":"已使用的保險工資","Per payable weekday":"每個應付工作日","20-day month":"每月 20 天","23-day month":"每月 23 天","Official benefit rules":"官方福利法則","Enter your confirmed figures.":"輸入您確認的數字。","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"已計算場景。確認您的資金金額。","Check the values.":"檢查值。","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"瑞士租賃通知規劃師","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"瑞士租賃通知規劃師及信函草稿","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"根據您自己合約中的日期和條款制定租賃通知；在不遵循州規則的情況下起草一封信。","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"輸入通知期、合約中的下一個有效終止日以及收據日期。請與您的房東或房客協會確認每個日期。","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"計劃者僅套用您提供的日期和期間。它不決定通知是否有效、何時合法收到或是否適用特殊保護。","Contract notice period (months)":"合約通知期（月）","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"下一個有效終止日（來自合約）","Expected receipt date":"預計收貨日期","Your name":"你的名字","Your address":"您的地址","Landlord / agency":"業主/代理","Recipient address":"收件者地址","Rental property":"出租物業","Place":"地點","Letter date":"信件日期","Termination of tenancy":"租約終止","Calculate date and draft letter":"计算日期和草稿信函","Planning date":"規劃日期","Target date":"目標日期","Editable draft":"可编辑草稿","Copy draft":"複製草稿","Enter your contract terms.":"输入您的合同条款。","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"規劃草案已準備就緒。根據您的合約進行驗證。","Check the dates and period.":"檢查日期和期間。","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"結果以提供的合約通知日為準；這不是法定通知裁決。","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"瑞士財產收益情景","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"瑞士財產增值稅 — 使用者輸入的稅率場景","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"使用您自己的交易成本和負責州的稅率估算財產收益。","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"輸入您已確認的收益、購買成本、合格費用以及官方州計算器的有效匯率。","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"瑞士財產增值稅因州、持有期限、扣除額和情況而異。該工具不提供費率或確定可接受的成本。","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"銷售收益（瑞士法郎）","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"購置成本（瑞士法郎）","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"確認可接受的其他費用（瑞士法郎）","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"官方來源的有效稅率 (%)","Estimate scenario":"估計場景","Illustrative scenario":"範例場景","Gain entered":"輸入增益","Tax at entered rate":"依輸入的稅率課稅","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"输入来自您的记录和州来源的数字。","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"計算出的場景；與州核實。","Check amounts and rate.":"檢查金額和費率。","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"未嵌入州税表；您输入的有效利率将影响估算。","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"瑞士繼承與贈與稅場景","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"瑞士继承税和赠与税 — 您的税率方案","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"根据用户输入的免税额和税率估算应税金额；规则因州和关系而异。","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"输入为接收者和州确认的金额、豁免和有效税率。","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"廣州規則和家庭關係可以更改豁免和稅率。該工具不會選擇州規則或確定納稅義務。","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"繼承或贈與金額（瑞士法郎）","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"州確認豁免（瑞士法郎）","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"與州確認的有效率(%)","Amount after entered exemption":"輸入豁免後的金額","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"輸入為您的案例確認的數字。","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"估算僅使用您輸入的豁免和費率。","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"瑞士兒童扶養預算情景","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"瑞士兒童扶養預算 — 透明的家庭情景","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"在輸入直接成本貸項後按父母收入分配輸入的兒童預算。","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"使用孩子記錄的每月需求、父母雙方可用的每月收入以及您想要貸記的任何直接費用。","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"這只是一個規劃工作表。這不是瑞士的子女扶養費裁決或法律方法；住房、照護、稅收、福利和判例法不予評估。","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"您記錄的每月兒童預算（瑞士法郎）","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"家長 A 可用月收入（瑞士法郎）","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"家長 B 可用月收入（瑞士法郎）","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"家長 A 向貸款人支付的直接子女費用（瑞士法郎）","Allocate scenario":"分配場景","Illustrative allocation":"範例性分配","Parent A remaining contribution":"父 A 剩餘貢獻","Parent B contribution":"父 B 貢獻","Entered monthly child budget":"已輸入每月兒童預算","Enter your household budget figures.":"輸入您的家庭預算數字。","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"計算出的預算方案；與合格的顧問討論法律義務。","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"檢查金額；信貸不能超過預算。","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"份額與兩項輸入的收入成正比；首先減去直接成本信貸。","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"瀏覽器斷字預覽","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"單字連字預覽 — 瀏覽器語言模式","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"預覽您提供的文字的瀏覽器連字符；支援取決於瀏覽器和安裝的語言資源。","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"選擇與您的文字相符的語言，輸入範例並調整可用的線寬。","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"使用瀏覽器的本機 CSS 連字符。它不會捆綁字典；不受支援的瀏覽器可能不顯示連字符。複製文字會保留原始拼字。","Text language (BCP 47)":"文字語言 (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"預覽寬度（字元）","Text to preview":"要預覽的文本","Preview":"預覽","Enter text and choose its language.":"輸入文字並選擇其語言。","Preview updated.":"預覽已更新。","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"輸入支援的語言標籤和文字。","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"嘗試使用不同寬度的同一段落，看看瀏覽器可以在哪裡斷詞。","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"私人拼字檢查工作區","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"本機拼字檢查器 — 使用您的瀏覽器字典","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"使用瀏覽器的本機拼字檢查編輯文本，選擇語言並複製更正的文本。","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"文字保留在此頁面中。設定您的瀏覽器具有拼字字典的語言，然後使用其拼字選單或底線建議。","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"此工作區不上傳文字或傳送字典。瀏覽器拼字檢查的可用性和建議取決於設備、瀏覽器和安裝的字典。","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"拼字檢查語言 (BCP 47)","Text to check":"要檢查的文本","Copy text":"複製文本","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"鍵入或貼上文字。右鍵單擊或使用裝置拼字選單取得建議。","Text copied.":"已複製文字。","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"無法自動複製；選擇並複製文字。","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"沒有符合字典的瀏覽器可能不會標記拼字錯誤。","Resume Structure Checker":"履歷結構檢查器","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS 簡歷檢查器 — 免費本地 PDF 和 DOCX 審查","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"在瀏覽器中檢查簡歷文字、標題、部分、連結和項目符號結構。按數量比較職位描述術語；沒有招募分數或上傳。","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"查看基於文字的履歷實際公開的內容：擷取的文字、標題結構、聯絡欄位存在、連結和常見的部分。可以選擇比較重複的職位描述術語。","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"具有用於體驗和教育的標題 1 樣式的 DOCX 顯示這些標題。從 PDF 的可選文字中檢查 PDF；列可以按不同的順序閱讀。","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX 檔案在本機檢查為 Office ZIP/XML。 PDF 使用延遲的本機 PDF.js 引擎讀取。可選的工作描述比較對每個文本中選定的術語進行計數；它不會創建分數或建議是否僱用某人。","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"這是格式和文字結構檢查，而不是 ATS 模擬器、法律審查或面試成功預測。沒有可選文字的掃描 PDF 首先需要 OCR。不支援受密碼保護、啟用巨集、簽章或異常大的文件。","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"選擇履歷（PDF 或 DOCX）","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"您的檔案保留在此瀏覽器中並且不會上傳。最大 20 MB； PDF 最多 50 頁。 DOCX 擴充內容的上限為 80 MB。","Optional job description":"可選工作說明","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"如果您想要進行術語頻率比較，請貼上純文字。不要包含不需要分析的敏感資訊。","Paste job-description text here…":"將職位描述文字貼到此處...","Analyze locally":"本地分析","Clear files and report":"清除檔案和報告","Resume review":"履歷審核","File type":"檔案類型","Extracted characters":"擷取的字符","Words counted":"字數統計","Detected headings":"偵測到的標題","Recognized sections":"已辨識的部分","Hyperlinks found":"找到超鏈接","Bullet paragraphs":"項目符號段落","An email address appears in the text":"電子郵件地址出現在文字中","No email address pattern was detected":"未偵測到電子郵件地址模式","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"文字中出現類似電話號碼的模式","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"未偵測到類似電話號碼的模式","Job-description terms (counts only)":"職位描述術語（僅計數）","Term":"術語","In job text":"在作業文本中","In resume":"簡歷中","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"貼上職位描述以比較術語計數。","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"未偵測到明確的標題樣式。 PDF 標題是根據文字大小估算的，可能不準確。","Detected":"偵測到","Not detected":"未偵測到","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"此啟發式識別一組有限的公共部分名稱；它不決定需要哪些部分。","Profile / summary":"簡介/摘要","Experience":"經驗","Education":"教育","Skills":"技能","Contact":"聯絡方式","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"找不到可選擇的文字。僅掃描的 PDF 需要 OCR 才能進行檢查。","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"選擇 PDF 或 DOCX 履歷開始。","Reading the selected file locally…":"正在本地讀取所選檔案...","Local structure review complete.":"局部結構審查完成。","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"此瀏覽器不支援所需的本機文件功能。","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"選擇有效的 PDF 或現代 DOCX 文件，最高可達規定的本地限制。","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"無法讀取 PDF。它可能已損壞、加密或不包含可選擇的文字。","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"無法安全開啟或讀取 DOCX 包。","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"此工具是否上傳或儲存我的履歷？","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"編號解析和分析在您的瀏覽器中執行。清除報告或離開頁面後，文件文字不會傳送到伺服器或保留。","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"它是否可以預測 ATS 或雇主是否會接受我的履歷？","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"編號它只檢查可讀文字和簡單結構。招聘系統有所不同，這不是 ATS 相容性保證或招聘預測。","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"它可以讀取掃描的 PDF 嗎？","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"僅當 PDF 具有可選擇的文字圖層。此檢查器不下載 OCR 模型；首先對掃描的純影像文件使用 OCR 工具。","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"職位描述比較是什麼意思？","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"它顯示簡單標準化後重複出現的術語的計數。它不是對您資格的匹配百分比、排名、推薦或評估。","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"為什麼 PDF 顯示的標題比 DOCX 少？","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF 通常不保留語意標題樣式。檢查器根據文字大小和閱讀順序估計突出的線條，因此列和視覺設計會影響結果。","How local resume review works":"本地履歷審核的工作原理","Resume checker questions":"簡歷檢查器問題","Scope and limitations":"範圍與限制","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"本地人聲與伴奏分離器","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"人聲去除器 — 本地分離人聲和伴奏","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"在瀏覽器中將短立體聲音訊樣本分成估計的人聲和伴奏。音訊保留在您的裝置上；該模型是從其公共主機下載的。","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"選擇長達 30 秒的立體聲音樂片段。首次使用時，瀏覽器會下載 35.6 MB 的模型。音訊檔案會在此裝置上處理，並且永遠不會上傳。","What you get":"您將會得到什麼","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"預覽並下載兩個 WAV 詞幹：估計人聲和殘留伴奏。結果取決於混合，並且可能包含偽影。","Local processing":"本地處理","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"工具使用匯出到 ONNX 和 ONNX Runtime Web 的 Open-Unmix UMX-HQ 人聲網路。只有當您按「分離」時才會取得模型；不使用付費推理 API 或訂閱。音訊在本地進行解碼、處理和匯出。","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"這是對立體聲 44.1 kHz 處理和剪輯長達 30 秒的估計。單聲道來源被複製為立體聲。人聲與樂器、重型效果、現場錄音和不尋常流派的深度混合可能會產生洩漏或偽影。不要將結果用作乾淨的母版。模型下載需要網路連線；音訊不會離開此裝置。","Is my audio uploaded?":"我的音訊上傳了嗎？","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"編號所選音訊將在您的瀏覽器中進行解碼和處理。唯一的網路請求是開始分離時的模型下載。","Why is the first run slow?":"為什麼第一次運行很慢？","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"瀏覽器下載一次35.6 MB的模型；瀏覽器可能會快取它。然後推理在設備 CPU 上本地運行。","Will every song separate cleanly?":"每首歌都能乾淨地分開嗎？","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"編號此模型估計聲幹，可能會留下聲音洩漏、消除樂器諧波或產生偽影。在依靠莖之前先聽一下。","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"立體聲音訊檔案（最長 30 秒）","Choose audio":"選擇音訊","Separate vocals":"獨立人聲","Cancel / clear":"取消/清除","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"選擇一個簡短的音訊檔案開始。","Downloading the separation model…":"正在下載分離模型...","Separating locally…":"本地分離...","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"分離完成。預覽或下載任一干。","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"無法處理此檔案或載入模型。檢查格式和連接，然後重試。","Model and weight license information":"型號和重量許可證信息","Estimated vocals":"估計人聲","Estimated accompaniment":"預計伴奏","Download WAV":"下載 WAV","Progress":"進度","Preparing local separation…":"正在準備局部分離...","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"分離完成。音訊保留在此裝置上。","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"無法處理該音訊。嘗試 30 秒以內的立體聲音樂檔案。","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"瑞士健康保險免賠額比較器","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"瑞士健康保險特許經營計算器 — 比較年度費用","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"使用您輸入的保費和符合資格的年度醫療費用來比較瑞士基本健康保險免賠額。沒有猜測保險公司的報價。","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"輸入同一保險公司為其提供的每項免賠額顯示的每月保費，然後比較低、預期和高年度治療成本方案。","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"對於強制性瑞士基本健康保險，成人標準免賠額為 300 瑞士法郎，兒童免賠額為 0 瑞士法郎。可選等級因年齡組而異。扣除免賠額後，標準保留費為符合資格的剩餘費用的 10%，成人每年上限為 700 瑞士法郎，兒童每年上限為 350 瑞士法郎。該工具將您輸入的保費添加到該模型成本分攤中；它不會獲取保險公司的費率或​​決定哪個選項適合您。","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"如果成人每月保費為 400 瑞士法郎，免賠額為 300 瑞士法郎，而每月保費為 350 瑞士法郎，免賠額為 2,500 瑞士法郎，則每年的保費差額為 600 瑞士法郎。將節省的金額與每個低、預期和高合格成本金額的成本分攤模型差異進行比較。","How the estimate works":"估算如何進行","Common questions":"常見問題","Scope and exclusions":"範圍與排除","Where do I get the premiums?":"我可以在哪裡獲得保費？","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"使用同一保險公司、保費地區、年齡組、事故保險和保險模式的當前每月優惠。 Priminfo 是聯邦官方比較網站。此頁面不會取得或複製保險公司報價。","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"是否始終提供所有列出的免賠額等級？","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"編號保險公司不必提供所有可選級別，而且針對年輕人的優惠可能有所不同。僅輸入您自己的保單顯示的保費；將不可用選項留空。","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"這是否顯示我完整的醫療帳單？","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"編號該型號涵蓋了合格費用的普通免賠額和標準 10% 保留費。它不包括住院日繳費、特殊 40% 藥品保留、豁免服務、非承保護理和補充保險。","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"這是場景比較，而不是保險、醫療或財務建議。它不能預測您的治療或保費。它不包括住院日繳款（通常每個住院日 15 瑞士法郎，有法定豁免）、某些藥物的 40% 特別保留、生育/預防性豁免、強制保險之外的服務、保費補貼和補充保險。因此，實際的共付額可能會有所不同。較高的免賠額意味著如果您接受護理，您需要能夠預先支付更多費用。","Who is insured under this policy?":"本保單的受保人是誰？","Adult (age 19 or over)":"成人（19 歲或以上）","Child (under 18)":"兒童（18 歲以下）","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"低年度合格治療成本情境（瑞士法郎）","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"預計年度合格治療費用（瑞士法郎）","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"每年合格治療成本較高的情況（瑞士法郎）","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"一家保險公司的每月保費","Monthly premium":"每月保費","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"僅輸入為此相同策略提供的選項。其他的留空。","Adult deductible choices":"成人免賠額選擇","Child deductible choices":"兒童免賠額選擇","Compare annual costs":"比較年度成本","Clear entries":"清除條目","Download CSV":"下載 CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"預計年度保費加上費用分攤","Deductible":"免賠額","Annual premiums":"年度保費","Total at low costs":"低成本總計","Total at expected costs":"預計成本總計","Total at high costs":"總成本高","Cost sharing at low costs":"低成本分攤成本","Cost sharing at expected costs":"以預期成本分攤成本","Cost sharing at high costs":"高成本分攤成本","Difference from lowest available deductible":"與最低可用免賠額的差異","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"保費儲蓄用完的醫療費用","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"輸入的保費節省在建模的成本分攤範圍內不會取消。","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"相對於最低免賠額，沒有保費節省。","Lowest expected total among entered options":"輸入選項中預期總數最低的","Scenario details":"場景詳細信息","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"輸入三個訂購的醫療費用方案以及至少兩個可用免賠額的每月保費。","Official rules and current premiums:":"官方規則和當前保費：","Federal deductible rules":"聯邦免賠額規則","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo官方溢價對比","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"在此瀏覽器中計算的比較。","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"檢查年齡組、訂購的成本方案以及至少兩次每月保費。","Entries cleared.":"條目已清除。","CSV downloaded locally.":"本地下載的 CSV。","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"瑞士健康保費減免計算器","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"瑞士保費補貼計算器 — 您的淨保費","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"根據當前保費和您所在州已授予的每月減免額計算瑞士健康保險淨保費。","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"輸入您的保險公司或州決定的保費和確認的每月減少額。該工具不會決定您是否符合資格。","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"瑞士各州決定誰有資格、提供多少支持以及是否需要申請。此計算器僅從一份保單保費中減去已確認的每月減少額並顯示年度金額。","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"如果每月保費為 420 瑞士法郎，確認減少為 120 瑞士法郎，則預計每月淨保費為 300 瑞士法郎。","How the calculation works":"計算原理","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"這能告訴我我是否符合資格嗎？","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"編號資格和獎勵金額由居住州決定。使用連結的官方資訊或聯絡州辦公室。","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"在哪裡可以找到減少的金額？","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"使用保險公司目前的決定或降低的保費。有些州會自動給予減免；其他需要申請。","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"這是一項保單的算術，而不是資格或福利決定。它不計算家庭收入、資產、家庭狀況、截止日期、州門檻或申請權。保費和獎勵可能會發生變化；與您的保險公司和州確認。","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"目前每月保費（瑞士法郎）","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"已批准每月減少（瑞士法郎）","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"輸入經州或保險公司確認的金額；不要使用估算作為獎勵。","Calculate net premium":"計算淨溢價","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"輸入目前保費和確認的減少。","Estimated premium after reduction":"減少後的預估溢價","Current monthly premium":"目前每月保費","Monthly reduction":"每月減少","Estimated net monthly premium":"估計每月淨保費","Reduction over 12 months":"12個月內減少","Reduction as a share of premium":"保費份額減少","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"計算完成。與您所在州和保險公司確認獎勵和生效日期。","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"檢查減少的金額是否不大於每月保費。","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"瑞士租金參考率情境計算器","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"瑞士租金調整計算器 — 參考利率場景","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"僅估計瑞士抵押貸款參考利率的變動如何影響住宅淨租金。使用聯邦住房辦公室的最新利率。","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"將您的租約或最新租金通知中規定的參考費率與當前瑞士官方費率進行比較。計算結果保留在您的裝置上。","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"聯邦住房辦公室每季發布一份瑞士租金調整的抵押貸款參考利率。上漲0.25個百分點，原則上可以允許租金上漲3%；減少0.25個百分點，原則上可以減少2.91%。此方案將逐步將這些變更應用於您輸入的淨租金。","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"对于每月 3,000 瑞士法郎的净租金，参考利率从 1.75% 下降至 1.50%，估计仅参考利率变化约为每月 -87.38 瑞士法郎 (-2.91%)。","How this estimate works":"此估算的工作原理","Where do I find the current rate?":"在哪裡可以找到目前匯率？","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"開啟連結的聯邦住房辦公室頁面並輸入目前公佈的費率。該工具沒有嵌入可能過時的費率。","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"這是否決定我是否可以請求更改租金？","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"編號它隔離了一個方向因素。您的合約、通貨膨脹、成本變化、預訂和其他法律條件可能會改變結果。","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"結果是否包含輔助成本？","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"編號輸入每月淨租金，不包括輔助成本和其他變動費用。","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"結果是一個說明性的參考利率方案，而不是法律意見或完整的租金審查。它不包括通貨膨脹、一般成本變化、改進、合約保留、指數或階梯租金、通知日期和州程序。行動前請檢查您的租約和官方指南。","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"瑞士住宅租賃：僅對抵押貸款參考利率效應的估計。這不是一項法律決定或全面的租金審查。","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"目前每月淨租金（瑞士法郎）","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"您的租約或最新租金通知中規定的參考利率 (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"目前瑞士官方參考利率(%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"計算參考利率場景","Reference-rate-only scenario":"僅參考利率場景","Current monthly net rent":"目前每月淨租金","Reference-rate change":"參考率更改","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"參考費率估計的每月效果","Scenario monthly net rent":"場景月淨租金","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"12個月同率年化效果","potential increase":"潛在的成長","potential decrease":"潛在減少","no reference-rate change":"沒有參考利率變化","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"每增加 0.25 個百分點，該估算適用 3%，而每減少 0.25 個百分點，則適用相應的反向減少。其他因素可能會改變結果。","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"這不包括通貨膨脹、一般成本變化、改進、合約預訂、指數或階梯租金、通知日期或當地程序要求。檢查您的租約和聯邦住房辦公室的指導。","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"查看最新官方匯率與指導","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"瑞士聯邦住房辦公室 (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"輸入租金和兩個費率以查看場景。","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"計算出的場景。在依賴之前驗證日期和合約條款。","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"檢查金額和費率。費率必須介於 0% 和 5% 之間，並以 0.25 點為單位變更。","Inputs cleared.":"輸入已清除。","Result":"結果","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"瑞士假期累積估算器","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"瑞士假期累積計算器 — 按比例分配的休假餘額","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"根據合約中的年假、工作週、就業日期和已休天數估算瑞士假期餘額。","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"使用您輸入的權利和工作時間表估算一個日曆年按比例分配的帶薪休假。沒有猜測合約條款。","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"估算器根據所選年份中僱用的日曆天數按比例分配合約中的年假天數。對於兼職工作，請輸入您每週的正常工作日和年假（以週為單位）。","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"如果有四個星期的假期，每週工作五天，並且全年都有工作，那麼在扣除已休的假期之前，每年的權利是 20 個工作日。","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"瑞士法定最低限度是多少？","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"聯邦指南規定每個服務年至少四個星期，對於未滿 20 歲的工人為五週。合約或集體協議可能會給予更多。","Does this decide my legal balance?":"這會決定我的法定餘額嗎？","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"編號這是一個簡單的日曆日按比例分配。合約條款、適用的集體規則、合格缺勤、四捨五入和雇主記錄可能會改變平衡。","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"此估算並非決定法定權利或計算假期工資。它不包括某些長期缺勤、合約特定的應計和舍入規則、公共假期、加班、結轉期限和爭議的減少。檢查您的合約並獲取有關有爭議餘額的建議。","Leave year":"休假年份","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"合約中的年假（週）","Usual working days per week":"每週通常工作日","Employment start date":"就业开始日期","Employment end date":"雇佣结束日期","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"本休假年已使用的休假天数","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"仅用于定向。輸入合約年度權利；法定最短期限通常為 4 週，對於 20 歲以下的工人則為 5 週。","Estimate balance":"估計餘額","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"輸入您的合約和日期以估計餘額。","Estimated leave balance":"预计休假余额","Annual leave at this schedule":"按此安排的年假","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"本休假年所使用的日曆天數","Prorated days accrued":"按比例累積的天數","Days already taken":"已佔用天數","Estimated days remaining":"預計剩餘天數","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"這按工作期間的日曆天數按比例分配年假。雇主和合約規則可能有所不同。","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"已計算估計值。根據您的合約和雇主記錄進行檢查。","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"檢查年份、日期、工作計畫和值。"},"bg":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Сценарий за обезщетение за безработица в Швейцария","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Калкулатор за обезщетение за безработица в Швейцария — брутен сценарий","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Оценете брутната швейцарска дневна надбавка, като използвате осигурителната заплата и ставката, потвърдени от вашия фонд.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Въведете осигурителната заплата и 70% или 80% процент, потвърдени от вашия фонд за безработица.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Швейцарските правила определят размера на надбавката и тавана на заплатата. Фондът решава допустимостта, удръжките, дните на изчакване и правото. Месечният диапазон отразява 20–23 платими работни дни.","Example":"Пример","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5000 CHF при 70% е около 161,29 CHF за платим ден от седмицата.","How it works":"Как работи","Questions":"Въпроси","Scope and limits":"Обхват и ограничения","Related tools":"Свързани инструменти","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Месечна осигурителна заплата (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Лифът е потвърден от фонда","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Прогноза","Clear":"Изчисти","Gross scenario":"Груб сценарий","Insured salary used":"Използвана осигурена заплата","Per payable weekday":"За платими работни дни","20-day month":"20-дневен месец","23-day month":"23-дневен месец","Official benefit rules":"Официални правила за ползи","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Въведете вашите потвърдени цифри.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Сценарият е изчислен. Потвърдете суми с вашия фонд.","Check the values.":"Проверете стойностите.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Програма за планиране на известия за наем в Швейцария","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Програма за планиране на известия за наемане в Швейцария и чернова на писмо","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Планирайте известие за наемане от датите и условията във вашия собствен договор; начертайте писмо, без да приемате правилата на кантона.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Въведете периода на предизвестие, следващия валиден ден на прекратяване във вашия договор и датата на получаване. Проверявайте всяка дата при вашия наемодател или асоциация на наематели.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Планерът прилага само датите и периода, които предоставяте. Той не решава дали известието е валидно, кога е законно получено или дали се прилага специална защита.","Contract notice period (months)":"Срок на предизвестие за договор (месеци)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Следващ валиден ден на прекратяване от месеца (от договора)","Expected receipt date":"Очаквана дата на получаване","Your name":"Вашето име","Your address":"Вашият адрес","Landlord / agency":"Наемодател / агенция","Recipient address":"Адрес на получател","Rental property":"Имот под наем","Place":"Място","Letter date":"Дата на писмото","Termination of tenancy":"Прекратяване на договора за наем","Calculate date and draft letter":"Изчисляване на дата и чернова на писмо","Planning date":"Дата на планиране","Target date":"Целева дата","Editable draft":"Чернова с възможност за редактиране","Copy draft":"Копирайте черновата","Enter your contract terms.":"Въведете вашите договорни условия.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Готов проект за планиране. Проверете с вашия договор.","Check the dates and period.":"Проверете датите и периода.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Резултатът следва предоставения ден за известие за договора; това не е законово решение за предизвестие.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Сценарий за придобиване на собственост в Швейцария","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Швейцарски данък върху печалбите от собственост — Сценарий за въведена от потребителя ставка","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Оценете печалбата от собственост, като използвате собствените си транзакционни разходи и данъчна ставка от отговорния кантон.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Въведете постъпления, цена на придобиване, допустими разходи, които сте потвърдили, и ефективна ставка от официалния кантонален калкулатор.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Швейцарският данък върху печалбата от собственост варира в зависимост от кантона, периода на задържане, удръжките и случая. Този инструмент не предоставя ставки или определя допустимите разходи.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Sale proceeds (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Acquisition cost (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Други разходи, потвърдени като допустими (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Ефективна данъчна ставка от официален източник (%)","Estimate scenario":"Estimate scenario","Illustrative scenario":"Illustrative scenario","Gain entered":"Gain entered","Tax at entered rate":"Tax at entered rate","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Въведете цифри от вашите записи и кантон източник.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Сценарият е изчислен; проверете го в кантона.","Check amounts and rate.":"Проверете суми и курс.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Не е вградена таблица с кантонални данъци; Вашата въведена ефективна ставка води до оценката.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Швейцарски сценарий за данък върху наследства и подаръци","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Швейцарски данък върху наследства и подаръци — Вашият сценарий за ставка","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Определяне на данъчна основа от въведено от потребителя освобождаване и ставка; правилата варират в зависимост от кантона и връзката.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Въведете сума, освобождаване и ефективна ставка, потвърдени за получателя и кантона.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Правилата на кантона и семейните отношения могат да променят освобождаванията и ставките. Този инструмент не избира правило на кантон или определя данъчно задължение.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Сума за наследство или подарък (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Освобождаване, потвърдено с кантон (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Ефективна ставка, потвърдена с кантон (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Сума след въведено освобождаване","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Въведете цифри, потвърдени за вашия случай.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Прогнозата използва само изключението и тарифата, които въвеждате.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Сценарий на швейцарския бюджет за издръжка на деца","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Швейцарски бюджет за издръжка на деца — сценарий за прозрачно домакинство","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Разпределяне на въведен детски бюджет по доход на родител след въведен кредит за преки разходи.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Използвайте документираните месечни нужди на детето, наличните месечни доходи на двамата родители и всички преки разходи, които искате да кредитирате.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Това е само работен лист за планиране. Това не е швейцарска награда за издръжка на дете или правен метод; жилище, грижи, данъци, обезщетения и съдебна практика не се оценяват.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Документиран от вас месечен детски бюджет (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Наличен месечен доход на родител A (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Наличен месечен доход на родител B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Преки разходи за деца, платени от родител А в кредит (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Разпределете сценария","Illustrative allocation":"Илюстративно разпределение","Parent A remaining contribution":"Родител А оставаща вноска","Parent B contribution":"Принос на родител B","Entered monthly child budget":"Въведен месечен детски бюджет","Enter your household budget figures.":"Въведете цифрите на бюджета на вашето домакинство.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Изчислен бюджетен сценарий; обсъдете правните задължения с квалифициран съветник.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Суми за проверка; кредитът не може да надвишава бюджета.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Дяловете са пропорционални на двата въведени дохода; първо се изважда кредитът за преките разходи.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Преглед на сричкопренасянето на браузъра","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Преглед на сричкопренасянето на думи — Езикови шаблони на браузъра","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Преглед на сричкопренасянето на браузъра за текста, който предоставяте; поддръжката зависи от браузъра и инсталираните езикови ресурси.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Изберете езика, който съответства на вашия текст, въведете проба и коригирайте наличната ширина на линията.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Използва собственото CSS сричкопренасяне на браузъра. Не обединява речници; неподдържаните браузъри може да не показват тирета. Копирането на текста запазва оригиналния правопис.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Език на текста (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Ширина на визуализация (знаци)","Text to preview":"Текст за преглед","Preview":"Визуализация","Enter text and choose its language.":"Въведете текст и изберете неговия език.","Preview updated.":"Визуализацията е актуализирана.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Въведете поддържан езиков таг и текст.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Опитайте един и същ абзац на различни ширини, за да видите къде браузърът може да прекъсне думите.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Лично работно пространство за проверка на правописа","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Локална проверка на правописа — Използвайте речника на вашия браузър","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Редактирайте текст с естествената проверка на правописа на браузъра, изберете език и копирайте коригирания текст.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Текстът остава на тази страница. Задайте език, за който вашият браузър има правописен речник, след което използвайте неговото меню за правопис или подчертайте предложения.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Това работно пространство не качва текст или изпраща речници. Наличието и предложенията за проверка на правописа в браузъра зависят от устройството, браузъра и инсталирания речник.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Език за проверка на правописа (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Текст за проверка","Copy text":"Копирай текст","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Въведете или поставете текст. Щракнете с десния бутон или използвайте менюто за правопис на вашето устройство за предложения.","Text copied.":"Текстът е копиран.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Не може да се копира автоматично; изберете и копирайте текста.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Браузър без съответстващ речник може да не маркира правописни грешки.","Resume Structure Checker":"Проверка на структурата на резюмето","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"Програма за проверка на автобиография на ATS — Безплатен местен преглед на PDF и DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Проверете текста на автобиографията, заглавията, секциите, връзките и структурата на водещите символи във вашия браузър. Сравнете условията на длъжностната характеристика по брой; няма резултат за наемане или качване.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Прегледайте какво всъщност излага базираната на текст автобиография: извлечен текст, структура на заглавие, присъствие на поле за контакт, връзки и общопризнати секции. По желание сравнете повтарящи се термини в описанието на работата.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"DOCX със стилове на заглавие 1 за опит и образование показва тези заглавия. PDF се проверява от текста, който може да се избира; колоните могат да се четат в различен ред.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX файловете се проверяват локално като Office ZIP/XML. PDF файловете се четат с отложена локална машина PDF.js. Незадължителното сравнение на длъжностните характеристики отчита избраните термини във всеки текст; не създава резултат или препоръчва дали да наемете някого.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Това е проверка на формата и структурата на текста, а не ATS симулатор, правен преглед или прогноза за успех на интервюто. Сканираните PDF файлове без избираем текст се нуждаят първо от OCR. Не се поддържат защитени с парола, активирани макроси, подписани или необичайно големи документи.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Изберете автобиография (PDF или DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Вашите файлове остават в този браузър и не се качват. Максимум 20 MB; PDF до 50 страници. Разширеното съдържание на DOCX е ограничено до 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Незадължителна длъжностна характеристика","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Поставете обикновен текст, ако искате сравнение на термин-честота. Не включвайте чувствителна информация, която не е необходимо да анализирате.","Paste job-description text here…":"Поставете текста на длъжностното описание тук…","Analyze locally":"Анализирайте локално","Clear files and report":"Изчистване на файлове и докладване","Resume review":"Резюме преглед","File type":"Тип файл","Extracted characters":"Извлечени знаци","Words counted":"Преброени думи","Detected headings":"Открити заглавия","Recognized sections":"Разпознати раздели","Hyperlinks found":"Намерени са хипервръзки","Bullet paragraphs":"Параграфи с водещи символи","An email address appears in the text":"В текста се появява имейл адрес","No email address pattern was detected":"Не беше открит модел на имейл адрес","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"В текста се появява модел, подобен на телефонен номер","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Не беше открит модел, подобен на телефонен номер","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Условия на длъжностната характеристика (брои се само)","Term":"Срок","In job text":"В текста на заданието","In resume":"В резюме","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Поставете описание на работа, за да сравните броя срокове.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Не бяха открити стилове на ясни заглавия. Заглавията на PDF се изчисляват въз основа на размера на текста и може да са неточни.","Detected":"Открит","Not detected":"Не е открит","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Тази евристика разпознава ограничен набор от общи имена на раздели; той не решава кои секции са необходими.","Profile / summary":"Профил / резюме","Experience":"Опит","Education":"Образование","Skills":"Умения","Contact":"Контакт","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Не беше намерен текст за избиране. Само сканираните PDF файлове се нуждаят от OCR, преди да могат да бъдат проверени.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Изберете PDF или DOCX автобиография, за да започнете.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Избраният файл се чете локално...","Local structure review complete.":"Прегледът на локалната структура е завършен.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Този браузър не поддържа задължителна функция за локален документ.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Изберете валиден PDF или модерен DOCX файл до посочените локални ограничения.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF файлът не може да бъде прочетен. Може да е повреден, криптиран или да не съдържа текст за избиране.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Пакетът DOCX не може да бъде безопасно отворен или прочетен.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Този инструмент качва ли или запазва ли автобиографията ми?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Бр. Разборът и анализът се изпълняват във вашия браузър. Текстът на файла не се изпраща до сървър или се запазва, след като изчистите отчета или напуснете страницата.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Предвижда ли дали ATS или работодател ще приеме автобиографията ми?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Бр. Проверява само четим текст и проста структура. Системите за наемане се различават и това не е гаранция за съвместимост с ATS или прогноза за наемане.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Може ли да чете сканиран PDF?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Само ако PDF има текстов слой с възможност за избор. Този инструмент за проверка не изтегля OCR модели; първо използвайте инструмент за OCR за сканиран документ само с изображение.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Какво означава сравнението на длъжностните характеристики?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Показва броя за повтарящи се термини след проста нормализация. Това не е процент на съвпадение, класиране, препоръка или оценка на вашите квалификации.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Защо PDF показва по-малко заглавия от DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF файловете обикновено не запазват стилове на семантични заглавия. Проверката оценява изпъкналите редове от размера на текста и реда на четене, така че колоните и визуалният дизайн могат да повлияят на резултата.","How local resume review works":"Как работи прегледът на местната автобиография","Resume checker questions":"Въпроси за проверка на автобиография","Scope and limitations":"Обхват и ограничения","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Локален разделител на вокали и акомпанимент","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Премахване на вокали — отделни вокали и акомпанимент локално","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Разделете кратък стерео аудио образец на приблизителни вокали и акомпанимент във вашия браузър. Аудиото остава на вашето устройство; моделът се изтегля от неговия публичен хост.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Изберете стерео музикален клип до 30 секунди. При първо използване браузърът изтегля модел от 35,6 MB. Аудио файлът се обработва на това устройство и никога не се качва.","What you get":"Какво получавате","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Визуализирайте и изтеглете два WAV елемента: прогнозни вокали и остатъчния акомпанимент. Резултатите зависят от сместа и може да съдържат артефакти.","Local processing":"Локална обработка","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Инструментът използва мрежата за вокали Open-Unmix UMX-HQ, експортирана към ONNX и ONNX Runtime Web. Моделът се извлича само когато натиснете Раздели; не се използва платен API за изводи или абонамент. Аудиото се декодира, обработва и експортира локално.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Това е прогноза за обработка на стерео 44,1 kHz и клипове до 30 секунди. Моно източниците се дублират в стерео. Вокали, смесени дълбоко в инструменти, тежки ефекти, записи на живо и необичайни жанрове могат да доведат до изтичане или артефакти. Не използвайте резултата като чист майстор. Изтеглянето на модел изисква интернет връзка; аудиото не напуска това устройство.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Аудиото ми качено ли е?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Бр. Избраното аудио се декодира и обработва във вашия браузър. Единствената мрежова заявка е изтеглянето на модела, когато започнете разделянето.","Why is the first run slow?":"Защо първото изпълнение е бавно?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Браузърът изтегля 35,6 MB модел веднъж; браузърът може да го кешира. След това изводът се изпълнява локално на процесора на устройството.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Всяка песен ще се отдели ли чисто?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Бр. Моделът оценява вокална основа и може да остави вокално изтичане, да премахне хармониците на инструмента или да създаде артефакти. Слушайте, преди да разчитате на стебло.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Стерео аудио файл (до 30 секунди)","Choose audio":"Изберете аудио","Separate vocals":"Отделни вокали","Cancel / clear":"Отказ / изчистване","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Изберете кратък аудио файл, за да започнете.","Downloading the separation model…":"Изтегляне на модела за разделяне...","Separating locally…":"Локално отделяне...","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Разделянето е завършено. Визуализирайте или изтеглете едно от двете стебла.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Не може да се обработи този файл или да се зареди моделът. Проверете формата и връзката, след което опитайте отново.","Model and weight license information":"Информация за лиценз за модел и тегло","Estimated vocals":"Приблизителни вокали","Estimated accompaniment":"Очакван съпровод","Download WAV":"Изтегляне на WAV","Progress":"Напредък","Preparing local separation…":"Подготвя се локално разделяне...","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Разделянето е завършено. Аудиото остана на това устройство.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Този звук не можа да бъде обработен. Опитайте стерео музикален файл под 30 секунди.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Сравнение на франшизите за швейцарско здравно осигуряване","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Франчайз калкулатор за швейцарско здравно осигуряване — Сравнете годишните разходи","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Сравнете приспаданията на основното здравно осигуряване в Швейцария, като използвате премиите и допустимите годишни медицински разходи, които въвеждате. Не се предполага оферта на застраховател.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Въведете месечните премии, показани от един и същ застраховател за всяко приспадане, което предлага, след което сравнете ниски, очаквани и високи сценарии за годишни разходи за лечение.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"За задължителна основна здравна застраховка в Швейцария, стандартната самоучастие за възрастен е 300 CHF, а самоучастието за дете е 0 CHF. Незадължителните нива се различават според възрастовата група. След приспадането, стандартната такса за задържане е 10% от допустимите оставащи разходи, ограничени до 700 CHF на година за възрастни и 350 CHF за деца. Инструментът добавя вашата въведена премия към това моделирано споделяне на разходите; той не извлича тарифи на застрахователя или решава коя опция е подходяща за вас.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Ако възрастен въведе месечна премия от 400 CHF при самоучастие от 300 CHF и 350 CHF при самоучастие от 2500 CHF, разликата в годишната премия е 600 CHF. Сравнете това спестяване с моделираната разлика в споделянето на разходите за всяка от вашите ниски, очаквани и високи суми на допустимите разходи.","How the estimate works":"Как работи оценката","Common questions":"Често срещани въпроси","Scope and exclusions":"Обхват и изключения","Where do I get the premiums?":"Къде мога да получа премиите?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Използвайте текущите месечни оферти за същия застраховател, премиум регион, възрастова група, покритие при злополука и застрахователен модел. Priminfo е официалният федерален сайт за сравнение. Тази страница не извлича и не възпроизвежда котировки на застрахователи.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Винаги ли се предлагат всички изброени нива на приспадане?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Бр. Застрахователите не трябва да предлагат всяко незадължително ниво и офертите могат да се различават за млади възрастни. Въведете само премиите, показани за вашата собствена полица; оставете недостъпните опции празни.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Това показва ли пълната ми медицинска сметка?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Бр. Моделът покрива обикновеното приспадане и стандартната такса за задържане от 10% върху допустимите разходи. Изключва вноски за болничен ден, специално задържане на лекарства от 40%, освободени услуги, непокрити грижи и допълнителна застраховка.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Това е сравнение на сценарий, а не застрахователен, медицински или финансов съвет. Не предвижда вашето лечение или премии. Изключва болнични дневни вноски (обикновено 15 CHF на стационарен ден, със законови изключения), специални 40% задържане на определени лекарства, освобождаване за майчинство/профилактика, услуги извън задължителното покритие, премийни субсидии и допълнителна застраховка. Следователно действителното доплащане може да се различава. По-високото приспадане означава, че трябва да можете да платите повече предварително, ако получавате грижи.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Кой е застрахован по тази полица?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Възрастен (19 или повече години)","Child (under 18)":"Дете (под 18 г.)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Сценарий с ниски годишни допустими разходи за лечение (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Очаквани годишни допустими разходи за лечение (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Сценарий с високи годишни допустими разходи за лечение (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Месечни премии от един застраховател","Monthly premium":"Месечна премия","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Въведете само предлаганите опции за същата тази политика. Оставете другите празни.","Adult deductible choices":"Избор на самоучастие за възрастни","Child deductible choices":"Избор на приспадане за дете","Compare annual costs":"Сравнете годишните разходи","Clear entries":"Изчистване на записите","Download CSV":"Изтеглете CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Прогнозна годишна премия плюс споделяне на разходите","Deductible":"С приспадане","Annual premiums":"Годишни премии","Total at low costs":"Общо на ниски цени","Total at expected costs":"Общо при очаквани разходи","Total at high costs":"Общо при високи разходи","Cost sharing at low costs":"Споделяне на разходите при ниски разходи","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Поделяне на разходите при очаквани разходи","Cost sharing at high costs":"Споделяне на разходите при високи разходи","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Разлика от най-ниската налична самоучастие","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Медицински разходи, при които спестяването на премия е изразходвано","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Въведеното премийно ​​спестяване не се отменя в рамките на моделирания диапазон на споделяне на разходите.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Без спестяване на премии срещу най-ниското приспадане.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Най-ниската очаквана сума сред въведените опции","Scenario details":"Подробности за сценария","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Въведете три поръчани сценария за медицински разходи и месечни премии за поне две налични самоучастие.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Официални правила и текущи премии:","Federal deductible rules":"Федерални правила за приспадане","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Официално премиум сравнение на Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Сравнение, изчислено в този браузър.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Проверете възрастовата група, поръчаните сценарии на разходите и поне две месечни премии.","Entries cleared.":"Записите са изчистени.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV изтеглен локално.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Калкулатор за намаляване на премията на Swiss Health","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Калкулатор за субсидия за премиум в Швейцария — Вашата нетна премия","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Изчислете нетната швейцарска премия за здравно осигуряване от текущата премия и месечно намаление, което вече е предоставено от вашия кантон.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Въведете премията и потвърденото месечно намаление от вашия застраховател или решение на кантона. Този инструмент не решава дали отговаряте на изискванията.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Швейцарските кантони определят кой отговаря на условията, колко подкрепа се отпуска и дали е необходимо заявление. Този калкулатор само изважда потвърденото месечно намаление от една премия по полица и показва годишната сума.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Ако месечната премия е 420 CHF и потвърденото намаление е 120 CHF, прогнозната нетна премия е 300 CHF на месец.","How the calculation works":"Как работи изчислението","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Това показва ли ми дали отговарям на изискванията?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Бр. Допустимостта и сумите на наградите се определят от кантона на пребиваване. Използвайте свързаната официална информация или се свържете с кантоналната служба.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Къде мога да намеря сумата за намаление?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Използвайте текущото решение или намалената премия, показана от вашия застраховател. Някои кантони предоставят намаления автоматично; други изискват приложение.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Това е аритметика за една политика, а не решение за допустимост или полза. Той не изчислява доходите на домакинствата, активите, семейното състояние, крайните срокове, кантоналните прагове или правата за кандидатстване. Премиите и наградите могат да се променят; потвърдете ги с вашия застраховател и кантон.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Текуща месечна премия (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Вече предоставено месечно намаление (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Въведете сума, потвърдена от кантона или застрахователя; не използвайте оценка като награда.","Calculate net premium":"Изчислете нетната премия","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Въведете текущата премия и потвърденото намаление.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Прогнозна премия след намаление","Current monthly premium":"Текуща месечна премия","Monthly reduction":"Месечно намаление","Estimated net monthly premium":"Прогнозна нетна месечна премия","Reduction over 12 months":"Намаление за 12 месеца","Reduction as a share of premium":"Намаление като дял от премията","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Изчислението е завършено. Потвърдете наградата и ефективните дати с вашия кантон и застраховател.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Проверете дали намалението не е по-голямо от месечната премия.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Калкулатор за референтен сценарий за наем в Швейцария","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Калкулатор за корекция на наема в Швейцария — Сценарий за референтен процент","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Оценете само как промяната в референтната лихва по ипотечните кредити в Швейцария се отразява върху нетния наем на жилище. Използвайте най-новата тарифа от федералната жилищна служба.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Сравнете референтната лихва, посочена във вашия договор за наем или последното известие за наем, с текущата официална швейцарска лихва. Изчислението остава на вашето устройство.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Федералната служба за жилищно настаняване публикува една референтна ставка за ипотека за корекции на швейцарския наем всяко тримесечие. Увеличението от 0,25 процентни пункта по принцип може да позволи увеличение на наема с 3%; намаление от 0,25 пункта може по принцип да позволи намаление от 2,91%. Този сценарий прилага тези промени стъпка по стъпка към нетния наем, който въвеждате.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"За 3000 швейцарски франка месечен нетен наем, намалението на референтния лихвен процент от 1,75% на 1,50% дава прогнозна промяна само на референтния лихвен процент от около −CHF 87,38 на месец (−2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Как работи тази оценка","Where do I find the current rate?":"Къде мога да намеря текущия курс?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Отворете свързаната страница на Федералната служба за жилищно настаняване и въведете текущата публикувана цена. Инструментът не вгражда курс, който може да остарее.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Това решава ли дали мога да поискам промяна на наема?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Бр. Той изолира един фактор за ориентация. Вашият договор, инфлация, промени в разходите, резервации и други правни условия могат да променят резултата.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Резултатът включва ли спомагателни разходи?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Бр. Въведете месечния нетен наем, без допълнителните разходи и други променливи такси.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Резултатът е илюстративен сценарий за референтна лихва, а не правно становище или пълен преглед на наема. Изключва инфлация, общи промени в разходите, подобрения, договорни резерви, индексирани или стъпаловидни наеми, дати на предизвестие и кантонална процедура. Проверете вашия лизинг и официалните насоки, преди да действате.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Швейцарски жилищни договори за наем: оценка само на ефекта на ипотечния референтен процент. Това не е правно решение или пълен преглед на наема.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Текущ месечен нетен наем (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Референтен процент, посочен във вашия договор за наем или последното известие за наем (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Текущ официален швейцарски референтен процент (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Изчислете сценарий за референтна ставка","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Сценарий само за референтна ставка","Current monthly net rent":"Текущ месечен нетен наем","Reference-rate change":"Промяна на референтната ставка","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Очакван месечен ефект от референтния процент","Scenario monthly net rent":"Сценарий месечен нетен наем","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Годишен ефект за 12 месеца със същата скорост","potential increase":"потенциално увеличение","potential decrease":"потенциално намаление","no reference-rate change":"no reference-rate change","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Прогнозата прилага 3% за всяко увеличение от 0,25 процентни пункта и еквивалентното обратно намаление за всяко намаление. Other factors can change the result.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Това не включва инфлация, промени в общите разходи, подобрения, резервации по договори, индексирани или стъпаловидни наеми, дати на предизвестие или местни процедурни изисквания. Проверете договора си за наем и насоките на Федералната служба за жилищно настаняване.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Проверете най-новия официален курс и насоки","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Швейцарска федерална служба за жилищно настаняване (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Въведете наема и двете ставки, за да видите сценарий.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Scenario calculated. Проверете датите и договорните условия, преди да разчитате на тях.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Check the amounts and rates. Ставките трябва да са между 0% и 5% и да се различават на стъпки от 0,25 пункта.","Inputs cleared.":"Входовете са изчистени.","Result":"Резултат","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Прогноза за натрупване на ваканции в Швейцария","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Калкулатор за натрупване на отпуск в Швейцария — Пропорционално салдо за отпуск","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Оценете швейцарския баланс от ваканционните дни от годишния отпуск във вашия договор, работна седмица, дати на работа и вече заети дни.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Оценете пропорционално платения отпуск за една календарна година, като използвате правото и работния график, които въвеждате. Не се предполагат условия на договора.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Оценителят пропорционално разпределя дните годишен отпуск във вашия договор спрямо календарните дни, наети през избраната година. За работа на непълно работно време въведете обичайните си работни дни в седмицата и годишния отпуск в седмици.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"С четири седмици отпуск, петдневна работна седмица и заетост през цялата година, годишното право е 20 работни дни преди изваждане на вече взетия отпуск.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Какъв е швейцарският законов минимум?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Федералните насоки гласят най-малко четири седмици за прослужена година и пет седмици за работници, които не са навършили 20-годишна възраст. Договор или колективно споразумение може да предостави повече.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Това определя ли правния ми баланс?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Бр. Това е проста пропорция на календарен ден. Условията на договора, приложимите колективни правила, квалифицираните отсъствия, закръгляването и документацията на работодателя могат да променят баланса.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Тази прогноза не определя законово право или изчислява заплащане за почивка. Изключва намаления за определени продължителни отсъствия, специфични за договора правила за начисляване и закръгляване, официални празници, извънреден труд, срокове за пренасяне и спорове. Проверете договора си и получете съвет за оспорван баланс.","Leave year":"Година на отпуск","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Годишен отпуск във вашия договор (седмици)","Usual working days per week":"Обичайни работни дни в седмицата","Employment start date":"Начална дата на работа","Employment end date":"Крайна дата на работа","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Вече взети отпуски през тази година отпуск","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Само за ориентация. Въведете договорното годишно право; законовият минимум обикновено е четири седмици или пет седмици за работници под 20 години.","Estimate balance":"Оценете баланса","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Въведете своя договор и дати, за да изчислите баланса.","Estimated leave balance":"Очаквано салдо за отпуск","Annual leave at this schedule":"Годишен отпуск по този график","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Календарни дни на работа през тази година на отпуск","Prorated days accrued":"Пропорционално натрупани дни","Days already taken":"Дните вече са заети","Estimated days remaining":"Приблизително оставащи дни","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Това пропорционално разпределя годишния отпуск по календарни дни в периода на работа. Правилата на работодателя и договора може да се различават.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Изчислена оценка. Сверете го с вашия договор и записите на работодателя.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Проверете годината, датите, работния график и стойностите."},"ca":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Escenari del subsidi d'atur suís","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Calculadora de prestacions d'atur suïssa — Escenari brut","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Calculeu una dieta suïssa bruta utilitzant el salari assegurat i la tarifa confirmada pel vostre fons.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Introduïu el sou assegurat i la taxa del 70% o 80% confirmada pel vostre fons d'atur.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"La normativa suïssa estableix la taxa de subsidi i el límit salarial. El fons decideix l'elegibilitat, les deduccions, els dies d'espera i el dret. L'interval mensual reflecteix entre 20 i 23 dies laborables a pagar.","Example":"Exemple","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5.000 CHF al 70% són uns 161,29 CHF per dia laborable a pagar.","How it works":"Com funciona","Questions":"Preguntes","Scope and limits":"Àmbit i límits","Related tools":"Eines relacionades","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Salari mensual assegurat (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Taxa confirmada pel fons","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Estimació","Clear":"Clar","Gross scenario":"Escenari brut","Insured salary used":"Sou assegurat utilitzat","Per payable weekday":"Per dia laborable a pagar","20-day month":"mes de 20 dies","23-day month":"mes de 23 dies","Official benefit rules":"Normes oficials de beneficis","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Introduïu les vostres xifres confirmades.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Escenari calculat. Confirmeu els imports amb el vostre fons.","Check the values.":"Comprova els valors.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Planificador d'avís de lloguer suís","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Planificador d'avís de lloguer suís i esborrany de carta","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Planifiqueu un avís d'arrendament a partir de les dates i termes del vostre propi contracte; redactar una carta sense assumir les regles del cantó.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Introduïu el període de preavís, el següent dia de rescissió vàlid al vostre contracte i la data de recepció. Consulteu totes les dates amb la vostra associació de propietaris o llogaters.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"El planificador només aplica les dates i el període que proporcioneu. No decideix si la notificació és vàlida, quan es rep legalment o si s'aplica una protecció especial.","Contract notice period (months)":"Període de preavís del contracte (mesos)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Proper dia de finalització vàlid del mes (a partir del contracte)","Expected receipt date":"Data de recepció prevista","Your name":"El teu nom","Your address":"La vostra adreça","Landlord / agency":"Propietari/agència","Recipient address":"Adreça del destinatari","Rental property":"Propietat de lloguer","Place":"Lloc","Letter date":"Data de la carta","Termination of tenancy":"Extinció del lloguer","Calculate date and draft letter":"Calcular data i esborrany de carta","Planning date":"Data de planificació","Target date":"Data objectiu","Editable draft":"Esborrany editable","Copy draft":"Copia l'esborrany","Enter your contract terms.":"Introduïu les condicions del vostre contracte.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Esborrany de planificació preparat. Comproveu el vostre contracte.","Check the dates and period.":"Consulta les dates i el període.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"El resultat segueix el dia d'avís del contracte subministrat; no és una resolució d'avís legal.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Escenari de guany de propietat suïssa","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Impost suís sobre guanys immobiliaris — Escenari de tipus introduït per l'usuari","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Calculeu un guany de propietat utilitzant els vostres propis costos de transacció i una taxa impositiva del cantó responsable.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Introduïu els ingressos, el cost d'adquisició, les despeses elegibles que heu confirmat i una taxa efectiva de la calculadora cantonal oficial.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"L'impost suís sobre guanys patrimonials varia segons el cantó, el període de retenció, les deduccions i el cas. Aquesta eina no proporciona tarifes ni determina costos admissibles.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Ingressos de la venda (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Cost d'adquisició (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Altres despeses confirmades admissibles (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Tipus fiscal efectiu de font oficial (%)","Estimate scenario":"Escenari estimat","Illustrative scenario":"Escenari il·lustratiu","Gain entered":"Guany introduït","Tax at entered rate":"Impost al tipus introduït","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Introduïu les xifres dels vostres registres i la font del cantó.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Escenari calculat; comprovar-ho amb el cantó.","Check amounts and rate.":"Consulta quantitats i tarifa.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"No hi ha cap taula d'impostos cantons incrustada; la taxa efectiva introduïda impulsa l'estimació.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Escenari de l'impost suís de successions i donacions","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Impost suís de successions i donacions: el vostre escenari tarifari","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Estima una quantitat imposable a partir d'una exempció i una taxa introduïdes per l'usuari; les regles varien segons el cantó i la relació.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Introduïu un import, una exempció i una taxa efectiva confirmada per al destinatari i el cantó.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Les regles del Canton i la relació familiar poden canviar les exempcions i les tarifes. Aquesta eina no selecciona una norma de cantó ni determina la responsabilitat fiscal.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Import de l'herència o donació (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Exempció confirmada amb el cantó (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Taxa efectiva confirmada amb el cantó (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Import després d'introduir l'exempció","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Introduïu les xifres confirmades per al vostre cas.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"L'estimació utilitza només l'exempció i la tarifa que introduïu.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Escenari pressupostari suís per a la manutenció dels fills","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Pressupost suís de manutenció dels fills — Escenari familiar transparent","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Asignar un pressupost infantil introduït per ingressos dels pares després d'un crèdit de cost directe introduït.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Utilitzeu les necessitats mensuals documentades del nen, els ingressos mensuals disponibles dels dos pares i els costos directes que vulgueu acreditar.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Aquest només és un full de planificació. No és una indemnització suïssa de manutenció dels fills ni un mètode legal; l'habitatge, l'atenció, els impostos, les prestacions i la jurisprudencia no es valoren.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Pressupost infantil mensual que heu documentat (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Ingressos mensuals disponibles del pare A (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Ingressos mensuals disponibles del pare B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Costos directes dels fills pagats pel pare A al crèdit (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Assigna l'escenari","Illustrative allocation":"Assignació il·lustrativa","Parent A remaining contribution":"Pare A contribució restant","Parent B contribution":"Aportació del pare B","Entered monthly child budget":"Prespost infantil mensual introduït","Enter your household budget figures.":"Introduïu les xifres del pressupost familiar.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Escenari pressupostari calculat; discutir les obligacions legals amb un assessor qualificat.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Comprovar quantitats; el crèdit no pot superar el pressupost.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Les accions són proporcionals als dos ingressos introduïts; primer es resta el crèdit de cost directe.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Previsualització de la separació de guió del navegador","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Previsualització de la separació de paraules — Patrons d'idioma del navegador","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Previsualitza la guió del navegador per al text que proporciones; El suport depèn del navegador i dels recursos d'idioma instal·lats.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Trieu l'idioma que coincideixi amb el vostre text, introduïu una mostra i ajusteu l'amplada de línia disponible.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Utilitza la separació CSS ​​nativa del navegador. No agrupa diccionaris; És possible que els navegadors no compatibles no mostrin guions. En copiar el text es manté l'ortografia original.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Idioma de text (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Amplada de vista prèvia (caràcters)","Text to preview":"Text per previsualitzar","Preview":"Vista prèvia","Enter text and choose its language.":"Introduïu text i trieu-ne l'idioma.","Preview updated.":"Vista prèvia actualitzada.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Introduïu una etiqueta d'idioma i un text admesos.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Proveu el mateix paràgraf a diferents amplades per veure on el navegador pot trencar les paraules.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Espai de treball de correcció ortogràfica privada","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Corrector ortogràfic local: utilitzeu el vostre diccionari del navegador","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Edita el text amb el corrector ortogràfic natiu del navegador, tria un idioma i copia el text corregit.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"El text es manté en aquesta pàgina. Definiu un idioma per al qual el vostre navegador tingui un diccionari d'ortografia i, a continuació, utilitzeu el seu menú d'ortografia o subratlleu els suggeriments.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Aquest espai de treball no penja text ni envia diccionaris. La disponibilitat i els suggeriments del corrector ortogràfic del navegador depenen del dispositiu, del navegador i del diccionari instal·lat.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Idioma de correcció ortogràfica (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Text per comprovar","Copy text":"Copia el text","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Escriu o enganxeu text. Feu clic amb el botó dret o utilitzeu el menú d'ortografia del dispositiu per obtenir suggeriments.","Text copied.":"S'ha copiat el text.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"No s'ha pogut copiar automàticament; seleccionar i copiar el text.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Un navegador sense un diccionari coincident pot no marcar faltes d'ortografia.","Resume Structure Checker":"Representa el verificador d'estructura","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"Comprovador de currículums ATS — Revisió local gratuïta de PDF i DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Comproveu el text del currículum, els encapçalaments, les seccions, els enllaços i l'estructura de vinyetes al vostre navegador. Compareu els termes de la descripció de la feina per recompte; sense puntuació de contractació ni càrrega.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Reviseu el que realment exposa un currículum basat en text: text extret, estructura d'encapçalaments, presència del camp de contacte, enllaços i seccions habitualment reconegudes. Opcionalment, compareu els termes repetits de la descripció de la feina.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"Un DOCX amb estils d'encapçalament 1 per a l'experiència i l'educació mostra aquests encapçalaments. Un PDF es comprova a partir del seu text seleccionable; les columnes es poden llegir en un ordre diferent.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"Els fitxers DOCX s'inspeccionen localment com a Office ZIP/XML. Els PDF es llegeixen amb un motor PDF.js local diferit. La comparació opcional de descripció de feina compta els termes seleccionats a cada text; no crea una puntuació ni recomana si es contracta algú.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Aquest és una comprovació de format i estructura de text, no un simulador ATS, una revisió legal o una predicció de l'èxit de l'entrevista. Els PDF escanejats sense text seleccionable necessiten primer OCR. No s'admeten documents protegits amb contrasenya, amb macros habilitats, signats o inusualment grans.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Trieu un currículum (PDF o DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Els vostres fitxers romanen en aquest navegador i no es carreguen. Màxim 20 MB; PDF de fins a 50 pàgines. El contingut ampliat de DOCX té un límit de 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Descripció del lloc de treball opcional","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Enganxeu text sense format si voleu una comparació de termes i freqüència. No inclogueu informació sensible que no necessiteu analitzar.","Paste job-description text here…":"Enganxeu aquí el text de la descripció del treball...","Analyze locally":"Analitzar localment","Clear files and report":"Esborra els fitxers i informa","Resume review":"Reprèn la revisió","File type":"Tipus de fitxer","Extracted characters":"Caràcters extrets","Words counted":"Paraules comptades","Detected headings":"Encapçalaments detectats","Recognized sections":"Seccions reconegudes","Hyperlinks found":"Hiperenllaços trobats","Bullet paragraphs":"Paràgrafs de vinyeta","An email address appears in the text":"Apareix una adreça de correu electrònic al text","No email address pattern was detected":"No s'ha detectat cap patró d'adreça de correu electrònic","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Apareix un patró semblant a un número de telèfon al text","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"No s'ha detectat cap patró semblant a un número de telèfon","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Condicions de la descripció del treball (només recomptes)","Term":"Termini","In job text":"Al text del treball","In resume":"En currículum","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Enganxeu una descripció de la feina per comparar el recompte de termes.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"No s'han detectat estils d'encapçalament clars. Els encapçalaments PDF s'estimen a partir de la mida del text i poden ser inexactes.","Detected":"Detectat","Not detected":"No s'ha detectat","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Aquesta heurística reconeix un conjunt limitat de noms de seccions comuns; no decideix quines seccions són necessàries.","Profile / summary":"Perfil / resum","Experience":"Experiència","Education":"Educació","Skills":"Competències","Contact":"Contacte","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"No s'ha trobat cap text seleccionable. Els PDF només escanejats necessiten OCR abans que es puguin comprovar.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Trieu un currículum PDF o DOCX per començar.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Llegint localment el fitxer seleccionat...","Local structure review complete.":"Revisió de l'estructura local completada.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Aquest navegador no admet cap funció de document local necessària.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Trieu un PDF vàlid o un fitxer DOCX modern fins als límits locals establerts.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"No s'ha pogut llegir el PDF. Pot estar danyat, xifrat o no contenir text seleccionable.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"El paquet DOCX no s'ha pogut obrir ni llegir amb seguretat.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Aquesta eina carrega o guarda el meu currículum?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Núm. L'anàlisi i l'anàlisi s'executen al vostre navegador. El text del fitxer no s'envia a un servidor ni es conserva després d'esborrar l'informe o de sortir de la pàgina.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Prediu si un ATS o un empresari acceptarà el meu currículum?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Núm. Comprova només el text llegible i l'estructura senzilla. Els sistemes de contractació són diferents i això no és una garantia de compatibilitat ATS ni una predicció de contractació.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Pot llegir un PDF escanejat?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Només si el PDF té una capa de text seleccionable. Aquest verificador no descarrega models OCR; utilitzeu primer una eina OCR per a un document només d'imatge escanejat.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Què vol dir la comparació de la descripció de la feina?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Mostra el recompte de termes recurrents després d'una normalització simple. No és un percentatge de coincidència, classificació, recomanació o avaluació de les vostres qualificacions.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Per què un PDF mostra menys encapçalaments que un DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"Els PDF normalment no conserven els estils d'encapçalament semàntics. El verificador estima les línies destacades a partir de la mida del text i l'ordre de lectura, de manera que les columnes i el disseny visual poden afectar el resultat.","How local resume review works":"Com funciona la revisió local del currículum","Resume checker questions":"Reprèn les preguntes del verificador","Scope and limitations":"Àmbit i limitacions","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Separador local de veu i acompanyament","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Eliminador de veu — Separeu les veus i l'acompanyament localment","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Separa una breu mostra d'àudio estèreo en veus i acompanyament estimats al teu navegador. L'àudio es manté al dispositiu; el model es baixa del seu amfitrió públic.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Trieu un clip de música estèreo de fins a 30 segons. Al primer ús, el navegador baixa un model de 35,6 MB. El fitxer d'àudio es processa en aquest dispositiu i mai es penja.","What you get":"El que obteniu","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Previsualitza i descarrega dues tiges WAV: veus estimades i l'acompanyament residual. Els resultats depenen de la barreja i poden contenir artefactes.","Local processing":"Processament local","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"L'eina utilitza la xarxa de veus Open-Unmix UMX-HQ exportada a ONNX i ONNX Runtime Web. El model només s'obté quan premeu Separa; no s'utilitza cap API d'inferència de pagament ni subscripció. L'àudio es descodifica, es processa i s'exporta localment.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Aquesta és una estimació per al processament estèreo de 44,1 kHz i clips de fins a 30 segons. Les fonts mono es dupliquen a estèreo. Les veus barrejades profundament amb instruments, efectes pesats, enregistraments en directe i gèneres inusuals poden produir fuites o artefactes. No utilitzeu el resultat com a mestre net. La descàrrega del model requereix una connexió a Internet; l'àudio no surt d'aquest dispositiu.","Is my audio uploaded?":"El meu àudio està penjat?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Núm. L'àudio seleccionat es descodifica i es processa al vostre navegador. L'única sol·licitud de xarxa és la descàrrega del model quan inicieu la separació.","Why is the first run slow?":"Per què la primera execució és lenta?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"El navegador baixa un model de 35,6 MB una vegada; el navegador pot emmagatzemar-lo a la memòria cau. Aleshores, la inferència s'executa localment a la CPU del dispositiu.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Totes les cançons es separaran netament?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Núm. El model estima una tija vocal i pot deixar fuites vocals, eliminar els harmònics de l'instrument o crear artefactes. Escolteu abans de confiar en una tija.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Fitxer d'àudio estèreo (fins a 30 segons)","Choose audio":"Trieu l'àudio","Separate vocals":"Veus separades","Cancel / clear":"Cancel·la/esborra","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Trieu un fitxer d'àudio breu per començar.","Downloading the separation model…":"S'està descarregant el model de separació...","Separating locally…":"S'està separant localment...","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Separació completa. Previsualitza o baixa qualsevol de les bases.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"No s'ha pogut processar aquest fitxer ni carregar el model. Comproveu el format i la connexió i torneu-ho a provar.","Model and weight license information":"Informació de llicència de model i pes","Estimated vocals":"Veus estimades","Estimated accompaniment":"Acompanyament estimat","Download WAV":"Baixa WAV","Progress":"Progrés","Preparing local separation…":"S'està preparant la separació local...","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Separació completa. L'àudio es va mantenir en aquest dispositiu.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Aquest àudio no s'ha pogut processar. Prova amb un fitxer de música estèreo de menys de 30 segons.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Comparador de franquícies de l'assegurança mèdica suïssa","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Calculadora de franquícies d'assegurança mèdica suïssa — Compara els costos anuals","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Compareu els deduïbles de l'assegurança mèdica bàsica suïssa utilitzant les primes i els costos mèdics anuals elegibles que introduïu. No s'endevina cap cotització de l'asseguradora.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Introduïu les primes mensuals que mostra la mateixa asseguradora per a cada franquícia que ofereix i, a continuació, compareu els escenaris de costos de tractament anuals baixos, esperats i alts.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Per a l'assegurança mèdica bàsica obligatòria suïssa, la franquícia estàndard per a adults és de 300 CHF i la franquicia per a nens és de 0 CHF. Els nivells opcionals varien segons el grup d'edat. Després del deduïble, la quota de retenció estàndard és del 10% dels costos restants elegibles, amb un límit de 700 CHF anuals per als adults i 350 CHF per als nens. L'eina afegeix la vostra prima introduïda a aquest model de repartiment de costos; no aconsegueix les tarifes de l'asseguradora ni decideix quina opció és adequada per a vostè.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Si un adult ingressa una prima mensual de 400 CHF amb un deduïble de 300 CHF i 350 CHF amb un deduïble de 2.500 CHF, la diferència de prima anual és de 600 CHF. Compareu aquest estalvi amb la diferència modelada en el repartiment de costos en cadascun dels vostres imports de costos elegibles baixos, esperats i alts.","How the estimate works":"Com funciona el pressupost","Common questions":"Preguntes habituals","Scope and exclusions":"Àmbit i exclusions","Where do I get the premiums?":"On puc obtenir les primes?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Utilitzeu les ofertes mensuals actuals per a la mateixa asseguradora, regió premium, grup d'edat, cobertura d'accidents i model d'assegurança. Priminfo és el lloc oficial de comparació federal. Aquesta pàgina no recull ni reprodueix les cotitzacions de les asseguradores.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"S'ofereixen sempre tots els nivells de deduïbles indicats?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Núm. Les asseguradores no han d'oferir tots els nivells opcionals, i les ofertes poden ser diferents per als adults joves. Introduïu només les primes mostrades per a la vostra pròpia pòlissa; deixa en blanc les opcions no disponibles.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Això mostra la meva factura mèdica completa?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Núm. El model cobreix el deduïble ordinari i la quota de retenció estàndard del 10% sobre els costos elegibles. S'exclouen les cotitzacions de dies hospitalaris, la retenció especial de medicaments del 40%, els serveis exempts, les cures no cobertes i les assegurances complementàries.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Aquesta és una comparació d'escenaris, no un consell d'assegurança, mèdic o financer. No prediu el vostre tractament ni les vostres primes. S'exclouen les cotitzacions de dies hospitalaris (normalment 15 CHF per dia d'hospitalització, amb exempcions legals), la retenció especial del 40% en determinats medicaments, les exempcions de maternitat/preventives, els serveis fora de la cobertura obligatòria, les subvencions a les primes i les assegurances complementàries. Per tant, el copagament real pot variar. Un deduïble més alt significa que heu de poder pagar més per avançat si rep atenció.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Qui està assegurat amb aquesta pòlissa?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Adult (a partir de 19 anys)","Child (under 18)":"Nen (menors de 18 anys)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Escenari de cost de tractament elegible anual baix (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Costos de tractament elegibles anuals previstos (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Escenari de costos de tractament elegibles anuals elevats (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Primes mensuals d'una asseguradora","Monthly premium":"Prima mensual","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Introduïu només les opcions que s'ofereixen per a aquesta mateixa política. Deixa els altres en blanc.","Adult deductible choices":"Opcions de deduïbles per a adults","Child deductible choices":"Opcions de deduïbles per a nens","Compare annual costs":"Compara els costos anuals","Clear entries":"Esborra les entrades","Download CSV":"Baixa CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Prima anual estimada més costos compartits","Deductible":"Deduïble","Annual premiums":"Primes anuals","Total at low costs":"Total a baix cost","Total at expected costs":"Total als costos previstos","Total at high costs":"Total a costos elevats","Cost sharing at low costs":"Costos compartits a baix cost","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Costos compartits als costos esperats","Cost sharing at high costs":"Repartició de costos a costos elevats","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Diferència amb el deduïble més baix disponible","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Costos mèdics on s'esgota l'estalvi de prima","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"L'estalvi premium introduït no es cancel·la dins de l'interval de repartiment de costos modelat.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Sense estalvi de prima amb el deduïble més baix.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"El total esperat més baix entre les opcions introduïdes","Scenario details":"Detalls de l'escenari","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Introduïu tres escenaris de costos mèdics ordenats i primes mensuals d'almenys dos deduïbles disponibles.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Normes oficials i primes actuals:","Federal deductible rules":"Normes federals de deduïbles","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Comparació premium oficial de Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Comparació calculada en aquest navegador.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Comproveu el grup d'edat, els escenaris de costos ordenats i almenys dues primes mensuals.","Entries cleared.":"Entrades esborrades.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV descarregat localment.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Calculadora de reducció de la prima de la salut suïssa","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Calculadora de subvencions de la prima suïssa: la vostra prima neta","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Calculeu la prima neta d'assegurança mèdica suïssa a partir de la prima actual i d'una reducció mensual ja concedida pel vostre cantó.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Introduïu la prima i la reducció mensual confirmada de la vostra asseguradora o decisió cantonal. Aquesta eina no decideix si es qualifica.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Els cantons suïssos determinen qui qualifica, quanta ajuda es concedeix i si cal una sol·licitud. Aquesta calculadora només resta una reducció mensual confirmada d'una prima de pòlissa i mostra l'import anual.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Si la prima mensual és de 420 CHF i la reducció confirmada és de 120 CHF, la prima neta estimada és de 300 CHF mensuals.","How the calculation works":"Com funciona el càlcul","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Això em diu si estic qualificat?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Núm. L'elegibilitat i els imports dels premis els decideix el cantó de residència. Utilitzeu la informació oficial enllaçada o poseu-vos en contacte amb l'oficina cantonal.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"On trobo l'import de la reducció?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Utilitzeu la decisió actual o la prima reduïda mostrada per la vostra asseguradora. Alguns cantons concedeixen reduccions automàticament; altres requereixen una aplicació.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Això és aritmètica per a una pòlissa, no una decisió d'elegibilitat o de benefici. No calcula els ingressos de la llar, el patrimoni, la situació familiar, els terminis, els llindars cantonals ni els drets de sol·licitud. Les primes i els premis poden canviar; confirmeu-los amb la vostra asseguradora i cantó.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Prima mensual actual (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Reducció mensual ja concedida (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Introduïu un import confirmat pel cantó o l'assegurador; no utilitzeu una estimació com a premi.","Calculate net premium":"Calcular la prima neta","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Introduïu la prima actual i la reducció confirmada.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Prima estimada després de la reducció","Current monthly premium":"Prima mensual actual","Monthly reduction":"Reducció mensual","Estimated net monthly premium":"Prima mensual neta estimada","Reduction over 12 months":"Reducció en 12 mesos","Reduction as a share of premium":"Reducció com a quota de la prima","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Càlcul completat. Confirmeu l'adjudicació i les dates d'entrada en vigor amb el vostre cantó i assegurador.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Comprova que la reducció no sigui superior a la prima mensual.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Calculadora d'escenaris de tarifa de referència de lloguer suís","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Calculadora suïssa d'ajust de lloguer — Escenari de tarifa de referència","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Estimeu només com un canvi en el tipus de referència hipotecari de Suïssa afecta un lloguer net residencial. Utilitzeu la tarifa més recent de l'oficina federal d'habitatge.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Compareu la tarifa de referència indicada al vostre contracte de lloguer o a l'últim avís de lloguer amb la tarifa oficial suïssa actual. El càlcul es manté al dispositiu.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"L'Oficina Federal de l'Habitatge publica cada trimestre un tipus de referència hipotecari per als ajustos del lloguer suís. Un augment de 0,25 punts percentuals pot permetre, en principi, un augment del lloguer del 3%; una disminució de 0,25 punts pot permetre, en principi, una reducció del 2,91%. Aquest escenari aplica aquests canvis pas a pas al lloguer net que introduïu.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Per un lloguer net mensual de 3.000 CHF, una disminució de la taxa de referència de l'1,75% a l'1,50% dóna un canvi estimat només de la taxa de referència d'uns −87,38 CHF al mes (−2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Com funciona aquesta estimació","Where do I find the current rate?":"On trobo la tarifa actual?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Obre la pàgina enllaçada de l'Oficina Federal d'Habitatge i introdueix la tarifa publicada actual. L'eina no inclou una taxa que pugui quedar obsoleta.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Això decideix si puc sol·licitar un canvi de lloguer?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Núm. Aïlla un factor per a l'orientació. El vostre contracte, inflació, canvis de costos, reserves i altres condicions legals poden alterar el resultat.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"El resultat inclou costos auxiliars?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Núm. Introduïu el lloguer net mensual, sense comptar els costos accessoris i altres càrrecs variables.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"El resultat és un escenari il·lustratiu de taxa de referència, no una opinió legal o una revisió completa del lloguer. S'exclouen la inflació, els canvis de costos generals, les millores, les reserves contractuals, els lloguers indexats o escalonats, les dates de notificació i el procediment cantonal. Comproveu el vostre contracte d'arrendament i la guia oficial abans d'actuar.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Arrendaments residencials suïssos: només una estimació de l'efecte del tipus de referència hipotecari. No és una decisió legal ni una revisió completa del lloguer.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Lloguer net mensual actual (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Taxa de referència indicada al vostre contracte d'arrendament o a l'últim avís de lloguer (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Taxa de referència oficial suïssa actual (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Calcular l'escenari de taxa de referència","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Escenari només de taxa de referència","Current monthly net rent":"Lloguer net mensual actual","Reference-rate change":"Canvi de la taxa de referència","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Efecte mensual estimat a partir de la taxa de referència","Scenario monthly net rent":"Escenari lloguer net mensual","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Efecte anualitzat durant 12 mesos al mateix ritme","potential increase":"augment potencial","potential decrease":"disminució potencial","no reference-rate change":"cap canvi en la taxa de referència","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"L'estimació s'aplica un 3% per cada augment de 0,25 punts percentuals i la reducció inversa equivalent per a cada disminució. Altres factors poden canviar el resultat.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Això no inclou la inflació, els canvis de costos generals, les millores, les reserves de contractes, els lloguers indexats o escalonats, les dates d'avís ni els requisits de procediment local. Consulteu el vostre contracte d'arrendament i les instruccions de l'Oficina Federal d'Habitatge.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Comproveu la darrera tarifa i orientació oficials","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Oficina Federal Suïssa de l'Habitatge (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Introduïu el lloguer i les dues tarifes per veure un escenari.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Escenari calculat. Verifiqueu les dates i els termes del contracte abans de confiar-hi.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Consulta els imports i tarifes. Les tarifes han d'estar entre el 0% i el 5% i diferir en passos de 0,25 punts.","Inputs cleared.":"S'han esborrat les entrades.","Result":"Resultat","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Estimador suís de meritació de vacances","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Calculadora suïssa de meritació de vacances — Saldo de permís prorratejat","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Calculeu un saldo de dies de vacances suïssos a partir de les vacances anuals del vostre contracte, setmana laboral, dates laborals i dies ja realitzats.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Calculeu el permís retribuït prorratejat durant un any natural utilitzant el dret i el calendari de treball que introduïu. No s'endevinen termes del contracte.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"L'estimador prorrateja els dies de vacances anuals del vostre contracte per dies naturals emprats durant l'any seleccionat. En el cas del treball a temps parcial, introduïu els vostres dies laborals habituals a la setmana i les vacances anuals en setmanes.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Amb quatre setmanes de permís, cinc dies setmanals i ocupació durant tot l'any, el dret anual és de 20 dies hàbils abans de restar les vacances ja fetes.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Quin és el mínim legal suís?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"La guia federal estableix almenys quatre setmanes per any de servei, i cinc setmanes per als treballadors que no hagin complert els 20 anys. Un contracte o conveni col·lectiu pot concedir més.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Això decideix el meu saldo legal?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Núm. És una simple prorrateig de dies naturals. Les condicions del contracte, les normes col·lectives aplicables, les absències qualificades, l'arrodoniment i els registres de l'empresari poden modificar el saldo.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Aquesta estimació no determina un dret legal ni calcula la paga de vacances. S'exclouen les reduccions per determinades absències prolongades, les normes de meritació i arrodoniment específiques del contracte, els dies festius, les hores extraordinàries, els terminis de pròrroga i els conflictes. Comproveu el vostre contracte i obteniu assessorament sobre un saldo impugnat.","Leave year":"Any de baixa","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Llicència anual en el teu contracte (setmanes)","Usual working days per week":"Dies laborables habituals per setmana","Employment start date":"Data d'inici de l'ocupació","Employment end date":"Data de finalització de l'ocupació","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Dies de baixa ja pres en aquest any de permís","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Només per a orientació. Introduïu el dret anual contractual; el mínim legal és generalment de quatre setmanes, o de cinc setmanes per als treballadors menors de 20 anys.","Estimate balance":"Saldo estimat","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Introduïu el vostre contracte i dates per estimar un saldo.","Estimated leave balance":"Saldo de baixa estimat","Annual leave at this schedule":"Llicències anuals en aquest horari","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Dies naturals emprats en aquest any de vacances","Prorated days accrued":"Dies acumulats prorratejats","Days already taken":"Dies ja fets","Estimated days remaining":"Queden dies estimats","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Això prorrateja les vacances anuals per dies naturals en el període laboral. Les regles de l'empresari i del contracte poden diferir.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Estimació calculada. Comproveu-ho amb el vostre contracte i els registres de l'empresari.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Comprova l'any, les dates, el calendari de treball i els valors."},"nl":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Zwitsers scenario voor werkloosheidsuitkeringen","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Zwitserse werkloosheidsuitkeringscalculator - brutoscenario","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Schat een bruto Zwitserse dagvergoeding op basis van het verzekerde salaris en het tarief dat door uw fonds is bevestigd.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Vul het verzekerde salaris in en het 70% of 80% tarief bevestigd door uw werkloosheidsfonds.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Zwitserse regels stellen het vergoedingspercentage en het salarisplafond vast. Het fonds beslist over de subsidiabiliteit, de inhoudingen, de wachtdagen en het recht. Het maandelijkse bereik weerspiegelt 20-23 betaalbare weekdagen.","Example":"Voorbeeld","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5.000 bij 70% is ongeveer CHF 161,29 per betaalbare weekdag.","How it works":"Hoe het werkt","Questions":"Vragen","Scope and limits":"Reikwijdte en limieten","Related tools":"Gerelateerde hulpmiddelen","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Verzekerd maandsalaris (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Tarief bevestigd door fonds","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Schatting","Clear":"Helder","Gross scenario":"Brutoscenario","Insured salary used":"Verzekerd salaris gebruikt","Per payable weekday":"Per betaalbare weekdag","20-day month":"20-daagse maand","23-day month":"23-daagse maand","Official benefit rules":"Officiële uitkeringsregels","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Voer uw bevestigde cijfers in.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Scenario berekend. Bevestig bedragen bij uw fonds.","Check the values.":"Controleer de waarden.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Zwitserse huuraankondigingsplanner","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Zwitserse huuraankondigingsplanner en conceptbrief","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Plan een huuropzegging vanaf de data en voorwaarden in uw eigen contract; een brief opstellen zonder uit te gaan van kantonregels.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Vul de opzegtermijn, de eerstvolgende geldige opzegdag in uw contract en de ontvangstdatum in. Controleer elke datum bij uw verhuurder of huurdersvereniging.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"De planner hanteert alleen de door u opgegeven data en periode. Het beslist niet of de kennisgeving geldig is, wanneer deze rechtsgeldig wordt ontvangen, of dat er een bijzondere bescherming van toepassing is.","Contract notice period (months)":"Opzegtermijn contract (maanden)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Volgende geldige opzegdag van de maand (vanaf contract)","Expected receipt date":"Verwachte ontvangstdatum","Your name":"Uw naam","Your address":"Uw adres","Landlord / agency":"Verhuurder / makelaar","Recipient address":"Adres van de ontvanger","Rental property":"Huurwoning","Place":"Plaats","Letter date":"Briefdatum","Termination of tenancy":"Beëindiging huurovereenkomst","Calculate date and draft letter":"Datum en conceptbrief berekenen","Planning date":"Planningsdatum","Target date":"Streefdatum","Editable draft":"Bewerkbaar concept","Copy draft":"Concept kopiëren","Enter your contract terms.":"Vul uw contractvoorwaarden in.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Planningsontwerp gereed. Controleer dit aan de hand van uw contract.","Check the dates and period.":"Controleer de data en periode.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Het resultaat volgt op de opgegeven opzegdag; het is geen wettelijke kennisgevingsbeslissing.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Scenario voor winst in Zwitsers vastgoed","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Zwitserse vermogenswinstbelasting – door de gebruiker ingevoerd tariefscenario","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Schat een vastgoedwinst met behulp van uw eigen transactiekosten en een belastingtarief van het verantwoordelijke kanton.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Voer de opbrengsten, aanschafkosten, in aanmerking komende uitgaven die u hebt bevestigd en een effectief tarief in via de officiële kantonnale calculator.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"De Zwitserse vermogenswinstbelasting varieert per kanton, bezitsperiode, aftrekposten en gevallen. Deze tool geeft geen tarieven weer en bepaalt niet de toegestane kosten.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Verkoopopbrengst (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Aankoopkosten (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Andere kosten bevestigd ontvankelijk (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Effectief belastingtarief uit officiële bron (%)","Estimate scenario":"Schatscenario","Illustrative scenario":"Illustratief scenario","Gain entered":"Versterking ingevoerd","Tax at entered rate":"Belasting tegen ingevoerd tarief","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Voer cijfers uit uw administratie en kantonbron in.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Scenario berekend; verifieer dit bij het kanton.","Check amounts and rate.":"Bedragen en tarief controleren.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Er is geen kantonbelastingtabel ingesloten; uw ingevoerde effectieve tarief bepaalt de schatting.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Zwitsers scenario voor successie- en schenkingsbelasting","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Zwitserse successie- en schenkingsbelasting: uw tariefscenario","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Een belastbaar bedrag schatten op basis van een door de gebruiker ingevoerde vrijstelling en tarief; regels variëren per kanton en relatie.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Vul een bedrag, vrijstelling en effectief tarief in, bevestigd voor de ontvanger en het kanton.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Kantonregels en familierelaties kunnen vrijstellingen en tarieven wijzigen. Deze tool selecteert geen kantonregel en bepaalt niet de belastingplicht.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Erfenis- of schenkingsbedrag (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Vrijstelling bevestigd met kanton (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Effectief percentage bevestigd met kanton (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Bedrag na ingevoerde vrijstelling","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Voer de voor uw geval bevestigde cijfers in.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Voor de schatting wordt alleen gebruik gemaakt van de vrijstelling en het tarief dat u invoert.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Zwitsers budgetscenario voor kinderbijslag","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Zwitsers kinderbijslagbudget - transparant huishoudscenario","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Een ingevoerd kindbudget toewijzen op ouderinkomen na een ingevoerd directkostenkrediet.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Gebruik de gedocumenteerde maandelijkse behoeften van het kind, de beschikbare maandinkomens van beide ouders en eventuele directe kosten die u wilt crediteren.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Dit is alleen een planningswerkblad. Het is geen Zwitserse kinderalimentatie of juridische methode; huisvesting, zorg, belastingen, uitkeringen en jurisprudentie worden niet beoordeeld.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Maandelijks kindbudget dat u heeft gedocumenteerd (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Beschikbaar maandelijks inkomen van ouder A (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Beschikbaar maandelijks inkomen van ouder B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Directe kindkosten betaald door ouder A aan tegoed (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Scenario toewijzen","Illustrative allocation":"Illustratieve toewijzing","Parent A remaining contribution":"Ouder Een resterende bijdrage","Parent B contribution":"Bijdrage ouder B","Entered monthly child budget":"Ingevoerd maandelijks kindbudget","Enter your household budget figures.":"Voer de cijfers van uw huishoudbudget in.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Budgetscenario berekend; Bespreek de wettelijke verplichtingen met een gekwalificeerde adviseur.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Bedragen controleren; krediet mag het budget niet overschrijden.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Aandelen zijn evenredig aan de twee ingevoerde inkomens; het directekostenkrediet wordt eerst afgetrokken.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Voorbeeld van browserafbreking","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Voorbeeld van woordafbreking — Browsertaalpatronen","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Voorbeeld van browserafbreking voor door u opgegeven tekst; ondersteuning is afhankelijk van de browser en geïnstalleerde taalbronnen.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Kies de taal die bij uw tekst past, voer een voorbeeld in en pas de beschikbare lijndikte aan.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Maakt gebruik van de eigen CSS-afbreking van de browser. Het bundelt geen woordenboeken; niet-ondersteunde browsers tonen mogelijk geen koppeltekens. Als u de tekst kopieert, blijft de oorspronkelijke spelling behouden.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Teksttaal (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Voorbeeldbreedte (tekens)","Text to preview":"Tekst naar voorbeeld","Preview":"Voorbeeld","Enter text and choose its language.":"Voer tekst in en kies de taal.","Preview updated.":"Voorbeeld bijgewerkt.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Voer een ondersteunde taaltag en tekst in.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Probeer dezelfde alinea met verschillende breedtes om te zien waar de browser woorden kan afbreken.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Privé werkruimte voor spellingcontrole","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Lokale spellingcontrole — Gebruik uw browserwoordenboek","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Bewerk tekst met de oorspronkelijke spellingcontrole van de browser, kies een taal en kopieer de gecorrigeerde tekst.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Tekst blijft op deze pagina staan. Stel een taal in waarvoor uw browser een spellingwoordenboek heeft, gebruik vervolgens het spellingmenu of onderstreep suggesties.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Deze werkruimte uploadt geen tekst en verzendt geen woordenboeken. De beschikbaarheid en suggesties van de browserspellingcontrole zijn afhankelijk van het apparaat, de browser en het geïnstalleerde woordenboek.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Taal voor spellingcontrole (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Tekst ter controle","Copy text":"Tekst kopiëren","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Typ of plak tekst. Klik met de rechtermuisknop of gebruik het spellingmenu van uw apparaat voor suggesties.","Text copied.":"Tekst gekopieerd.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Kan niet automatisch kopiëren; selecteer en kopieer de tekst.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Een browser zonder bijbehorend woordenboek mag geen spelfouten markeren.","Resume Structure Checker":"Cv-structuurcontrole","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS CV Checker - Gratis lokale PDF- en DOCX-beoordeling","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Controleer de CV-tekst, kopjes, secties, links en opsommingstekens in uw browser. Vergelijk functiebeschrijvingstermen op aantal; geen aanwervingsscore of upload.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Bekijk wat een op tekst gebaseerd CV feitelijk blootlegt: geëxtraheerde tekst, kopstructuur, aanwezigheid in contactvelden, links en algemeen erkende secties. Vergelijk eventueel herhaalde functiebeschrijvingstermen.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"Een DOCX met Kop 1-stijlen voor Ervaring en Opleiding toont deze kopjes. Een PDF wordt gecontroleerd op basis van de selecteerbare tekst; kolommen kunnen in een andere volgorde worden gelezen.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX-bestanden worden lokaal geïnspecteerd als Office ZIP/XML. PDF's worden gelezen met een uitgestelde lokale PDF.js-engine. De optionele functiebeschrijvingsvergelijking telt geselecteerde termen in elke tekst; het creëert geen score en adviseert niet of iemand moet worden aangenomen.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Dit is een format- en tekststructuurcontrole, geen ATS-simulator, juridische beoordeling of voorspelling van interviewsucces. Gescande PDF's zonder selecteerbare tekst hebben eerst OCR nodig. Wachtwoordbeveiligde, macro-enabled, ondertekende of ongebruikelijk grote documenten worden niet ondersteund.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Kies een CV (PDF of DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Uw bestanden blijven in deze browser en worden niet geüpload. Maximaal 20 MB; PDF tot 50 pagina's. Uitgebreide DOCX-inhoud is beperkt tot 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Optionele functiebeschrijving","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Plaats platte tekst als u een term-frequentievergelijking wilt. Neem geen gevoelige informatie op die u niet hoeft te analyseren.","Paste job-description text here…":"Taakomschrijvingtekst hier plakken…","Analyze locally":"Lokaal analyseren","Clear files and report":"Bestanden wissen en rapporteren","Resume review":"Cv-beoordeling","File type":"Bestandstype","Extracted characters":"Geëxtraheerde tekens","Words counted":"Woorden geteld","Detected headings":"Gedetecteerde kopteksten","Recognized sections":"Herkende secties","Hyperlinks found":"Hyperlinks gevonden","Bullet paragraphs":"Alinea's met opsommingstekens","An email address appears in the text":"Er verschijnt een e-mailadres in de tekst","No email address pattern was detected":"Er is geen e-mailadrespatroon gedetecteerd","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Er verschijnt een patroon dat lijkt op een telefoonnummer in de tekst","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Er is geen telefoonnummerachtig patroon gedetecteerd","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Termijnen voor functiebeschrijving (alleen telt)","Term":"Termijn","In job text":"In vacaturetekst","In resume":"In CV","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Plak een functiebeschrijving om het aantal termijnen te vergelijken.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Er zijn geen duidelijke kopstijlen gedetecteerd. PDF-koppen worden geschat op basis van de tekstgrootte en kunnen onnauwkeurig zijn.","Detected":"Gedetecteerd","Not detected":"Niet gedetecteerd","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Deze heuristiek herkent een beperkt aantal algemene sectienamen; het beslist niet welke secties nodig zijn.","Profile / summary":"Profiel / samenvatting","Experience":"Ervaring","Education":"Onderwijs","Skills":"Vaardigheden","Contact":"Contact","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Er is geen selecteerbare tekst gevonden. Alleen gescande PDF's hebben OCR nodig voordat ze kunnen worden gecontroleerd.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Kies een PDF- of DOCX-cv om te beginnen.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Het geselecteerde bestand lokaal lezen…","Local structure review complete.":"Review van de lokale structuur voltooid.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Deze browser ondersteunt geen vereiste lokale documentfunctie.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Kies een geldig PDF- of modern DOCX-bestand binnen de aangegeven lokale limieten.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"De PDF kon niet worden gelezen. Het is mogelijk beschadigd, versleuteld of bevat geen selecteerbare tekst.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Het DOCX-pakket kon niet veilig worden geopend of gelezen.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Uploadt of bewaart deze tool mijn CV?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Nr. Het parseren en analyseren wordt in uw browser uitgevoerd. De bestandstekst wordt niet naar een server verzonden of bewaard nadat u het rapport heeft gewist of de pagina heeft verlaten.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Voorspelt het of een ATS of werkgever mijn CV zal accepteren?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Nr. Het controleert alleen leesbare tekst en eenvoudige structuur. Aanwervingssystemen verschillen, en dit is geen ATS-compatibiliteitsgarantie of aanwervingsvoorspelling.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Kan het een gescande PDF lezen?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Alleen als de PDF een selecteerbare tekstlaag heeft. Deze checker downloadt geen OCR-modellen; gebruik eerst een OCR-tool voor een gescand document met alleen afbeeldingen.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Wat betekent de functiebeschrijvingsvergelijking?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Het toont tellingen voor terugkerende termen na eenvoudige normalisatie. Het is geen matchpercentage, rangschikking, aanbeveling of beoordeling van uw kwalificaties.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Waarom toont een PDF minder kopjes dan een DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF's behouden doorgaans geen semantische kopstijlen. De checker schat prominente regels op basis van tekstgrootte en leesvolgorde, zodat kolommen en visueel ontwerp het resultaat kunnen beïnvloeden.","How local resume review works":"Hoe lokale CV-beoordeling werkt","Resume checker questions":"Vragen over CV-checker","Scope and limitations":"Reikwijdte en beperkingen","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Lokale zang- en begeleidingsscheider","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Vocal Remover — Aparte zang en begeleiding lokaal","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Verdeel een kort stereo-audiofragment in geschatte zang en begeleiding in uw browser. Audio blijft op uw apparaat; het model wordt gedownload van de openbare host.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Kies een stereomuziekclip van maximaal 30 seconden. Bij het eerste gebruik downloadt de browser een model van 35,6 MB. Het audiobestand wordt op dit apparaat verwerkt en nooit geüpload.","What you get":"Wat je krijgt","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Bekijk en download twee WAV-stems: geschatte zang en de resterende begeleiding. De resultaten zijn afhankelijk van de mix en kunnen artefacten bevatten.","Local processing":"Lokale verwerking","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"De tool maakt gebruik van het Open-Unmix UMX-HQ zangnetwerk dat wordt geëxporteerd naar ONNX en ONNX Runtime Web. Het model wordt alleen opgehaald als u op Apart drukt; er wordt geen betaalde inferentie-API of abonnement gebruikt. Audio wordt lokaal gedecodeerd, verwerkt en geëxporteerd.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Dit is een schatting voor stereo 44,1 kHz-verwerking en clips tot 30 seconden. Monobronnen worden gedupliceerd naar stereo. Zang die diep in instrumenten is gemengd, zware effecten, live-opnames en ongebruikelijke genres kunnen lekkage of artefacten veroorzaken. Gebruik het resultaat niet als een schone master. Voor het downloaden van modellen is een internetverbinding vereist; audio verlaat dit apparaat niet.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Is mijn audio geüpload?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Nr. De geselecteerde audio wordt gedecodeerd en verwerkt in uw browser. Het enige netwerkverzoek is het downloaden van het model wanneer u de scheiding start.","Why is the first run slow?":"Waarom is de eerste run langzaam?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"De browser downloadt eenmalig een model van 35,6 MB; de browser kan het in de cache opslaan. Inference wordt vervolgens lokaal uitgevoerd op de CPU van het apparaat.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Zal elk nummer netjes gescheiden worden?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Nr. Het model schat een stemstam en kan vocale lekkage achterlaten, harmonischen van instrumenten verwijderen of artefacten creëren. Luister voordat u op een steel vertrouwt.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Stereo audiobestand (tot 30 seconden)","Choose audio":"Kies audio","Separate vocals":"Aparte zang","Cancel / clear":"Annuleren / wissen","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Kies een kort audiobestand om te beginnen.","Downloading the separation model…":"Het scheidingsmodel downloaden…","Separating locally…":"Lokaal scheiden…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Scheiding voltooid. Bekijk of download een van beide stengels.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Kan dit bestand niet verwerken of het model laden. Controleer het formaat en de verbinding en probeer het opnieuw.","Model and weight license information":"Model- en gewichtslicentie-informatie","Estimated vocals":"Geschatte zang","Estimated accompaniment":"Geschatte begeleiding","Download WAV":"WAV downloaden","Progress":"Vooruitgang","Preparing local separation…":"Voorbereiden van lokale scheiding…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Scheiding voltooid. Audio bleef op dit apparaat staan.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Deze audio kon niet worden verwerkt. Probeer een stereomuziekbestand van minder dan 30 seconden.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Zwitsers eigen risico voor ziektekostenverzekeringen","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Zwitserse franchisecalculator voor ziektekostenverzekeringen - Vergelijk jaarlijkse kosten","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Vergelijk het eigen risico van de Zwitserse basisziektekostenverzekering met behulp van premies en in aanmerking komende jaarlijkse medische kosten die u invoert. Er wordt geen offerte van een verzekeraar geraden.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Voer de maandelijkse premies in die door dezelfde verzekeraar worden weergegeven voor elk eigen risico dat zij aanbieden, en vergelijk vervolgens scenario's met lage, verwachte en hoge jaarlijkse behandelingskosten.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Voor de verplichte Zwitserse basisverzekering bedraagt ​​het standaard eigen risico voor volwassenen CHF 300 en het eigen risico voor kinderen CHF 0. Optionele niveaus verschillen per leeftijdsgroep. Na het eigen risico bedraagt ​​de standaard retentievergoeding 10% van de in aanmerking komende resterende kosten, met een maximum van CHF 700 per jaar voor volwassenen en CHF 350 voor kinderen. De tool voegt uw ingevoerde premie toe aan deze gemodelleerde kostendeling; het haalt geen verzekeraartarieven op en beslist niet welke optie voor u geschikt is.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Als een volwassene een maandelijkse premie van CHF 400 invoert met een eigen risico van CHF 300 en CHF 350 met een eigen risico van CHF 2.500, bedraagt ​​het jaarlijkse premieverschil CHF 600. Vergelijk die besparing met het gemodelleerde verschil in kostendeling bij elk van uw lage, verwachte en hoge bedragen die in aanmerking komen.","How the estimate works":"Hoe de schatting werkt","Common questions":"Veelgestelde vragen","Scope and exclusions":"Reikwijdte en uitsluitingen","Where do I get the premiums?":"Waar krijg ik de premies?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Gebruik actuele maandaanbiedingen voor dezelfde verzekeraar, premieregio, leeftijdsgroep, ongevallendekking en verzekeringsmodel. Priminfo is de officiële federale vergelijkingssite. Deze pagina haalt geen offertes van verzekeraars op en reproduceert deze ook niet.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Worden alle vermelde eigen risiconiveaus altijd aangeboden?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Nr. Verzekeraars hoeven niet elk keuzeniveau aan te bieden en voor jongvolwassenen kunnen de aanbiedingen verschillen. Vul alleen de getoonde premies in van uw eigen polis; laat niet-beschikbare opties leeg.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Toon ik hier mijn volledige medische rekening?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Nr. Het model omvat het gewone eigen risico en de standaard retentievergoeding van 10% op de in aanmerking komende kosten. Het is exclusief ziekenhuisdagbijdragen, speciale 40% medicijnretentie, vrijgestelde diensten, niet-gedekte zorg en aanvullende verzekeringen.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Dit is een scenariovergelijking, geen verzekerings-, medisch of financieel advies. Het voorspelt niet uw behandeling of premies. Het is exclusief ziekenhuisdagbijdragen (normaal CHF 15 per opnamedag, met wettelijke vrijstellingen), speciale 40% retentie op bepaalde medicijnen, zwangerschaps-/preventieve vrijstellingen, diensten buiten de verplichte dekking, premiesubsidies en aanvullende verzekeringen. De daadwerkelijke eigen bijdrage kan dus verschillen. Een hoger eigen risico betekent dat u meer vooraf moet kunnen betalen als u zorg ontvangt.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Wie is er verzekerd op deze polis?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Volwassene (19 jaar of ouder)","Child (under 18)":"Kind (jonger dan 18 jaar)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Scenario met lage jaarlijkse subsidiabele behandelingskosten (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Verwachte jaarlijkse subsidiabele behandelingskosten (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Scenario met hoge jaarlijkse subsidiabele behandelingskosten (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Maandelijkse premies van één verzekeraar","Monthly premium":"Maandelijkse premie","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Voer alleen de opties in die voor hetzelfde beleid worden aangeboden. Laat anderen leeg.","Adult deductible choices":"Keuzes voor eigen risico voor volwassenen","Child deductible choices":"Keuzes eigen risico voor kinderen","Compare annual costs":"Jaarkosten vergelijken","Clear entries":"Invoer wissen","Download CSV":"CSV downloaden","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Geschatte jaarlijkse premie plus kostendeling","Deductible":"Eigen risico","Annual premiums":"Jaarpremies","Total at low costs":"Totaal tegen lage kosten","Total at expected costs":"Totaal tegen verwachte kosten","Total at high costs":"Totaal tegen hoge kosten","Cost sharing at low costs":"Kosten delen tegen lage kosten","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Kosten delen tegen verwachte kosten","Cost sharing at high costs":"Kosten delen tegen hoge kosten","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Verschil met laagste beschikbare eigen risico","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Medische kosten waarbij de premiebesparing is opgebruikt","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"De ingevoerde premiebesparing wordt binnen het gemodelleerde kostendelingsbereik niet geannuleerd.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Geen premiebesparing tegen het laagste eigen risico.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Laagst verwacht totaal onder de ingevoerde opties","Scenario details":"Scenariodetails","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Voer drie bestelde medische kostenscenario's en maandelijkse premies in voor minimaal twee beschikbare eigen risico's.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Officiële regels en actuele premies:","Federal deductible rules":"Federale eigen risicoregels","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo officiële premiumvergelijking","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Vergelijking berekend in deze browser.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Check de leeftijdsgroep, bestelde kostenscenario's en minimaal twee maandpremies.","Entries cleared.":"Invoer gewist.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV lokaal gedownload.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Zwitserse gezondheidspremiereductiecalculator","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Zwitserse premiesubsidiecalculator — uw netto premie","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Bereken de netto Zwitserse ziektekostenpremie op basis van de huidige premie en een maandelijkse korting die al door uw kanton is toegekend.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Vul de premie en de bevestigde maandelijkse korting van uw verzekeraar of kantonnale beslissing in. Deze tool beslist niet of u in aanmerking komt.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Zwitserse kantons bepalen wie in aanmerking komt, hoeveel steun wordt toegekend en of een aanvraag nodig is. Deze calculator trekt alleen een bevestigde maandelijkse korting af van één polispremie en toont het jaarlijkse bedrag.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Als de maandelijkse premie CHF 420 bedraagt ​​en de bevestigde verlaging CHF 120 bedraagt, bedraagt ​​de geschatte nettopremie CHF 300 per maand.","How the calculation works":"Hoe de berekening werkt","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Betekent dit dat ik in aanmerking kom?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Nr. De geschiktheid en de toekenningsbedragen worden bepaald door het kanton waar u woont. Gebruik de gekoppelde officiële informatie of neem contact op met het kantonkantoor.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Waar vind ik het kortingsbedrag?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Gebruik de huidige beschikking of de verlaagde premie van uw verzekeraar. Sommige kantons kennen automatisch verlagingen toe; anderen vereisen een aanvraag.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Dit is rekenkunde voor één polis, geen beslissing over geschiktheid of uitkering. Er worden geen huishoudinkomen, bezittingen, gezinsstatus, deadlines, kantonale drempels of aanvraagrechten berekend. Premies en beloningen kunnen veranderen; bevestig ze bij uw verzekeraar en kanton.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Huidige maandelijkse premie (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Maandelijkse korting al toegekend (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Vul een bedrag in dat is bevestigd door het kanton of de verzekeraar; gebruik geen schatting als beloning.","Calculate net premium":"Bereken de netto premie","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Vul de huidige premie en bevestigde korting in.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Geschatte premie na korting","Current monthly premium":"Huidige maandpremie","Monthly reduction":"Maandelijkse korting","Estimated net monthly premium":"Geschatte netto maandpremie","Reduction over 12 months":"Korting over 12 maanden","Reduction as a share of premium":"Verlaging als deel van de premie","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Berekening voltooid. Bevestig de toekenning en ingangsdata bij uw kanton en verzekeraar.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Controleer of de korting niet groter is dan de maandpremie.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Zwitserse huurreferentie-scenariocalculator","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Zwitserse huuraanpassingscalculator — Referentietariefscenario","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Schat alleen hoe een verandering in de Zwitserse hypotheekreferentierente de nettohuur van een woning beïnvloedt. Gebruik het meest recente tarief van het federale huisvestingsbureau.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Vergelijk het referentietarief vermeld in uw huurovereenkomst of laatste huuraankondiging met het huidige officiële Zwitserse tarief. De berekening blijft op uw apparaat staan.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Het Federale Bureau voor Huisvesting publiceert elk kwartaal één hypotheekreferentietarief voor Zwitserse huuraanpassingen. Een verhoging van 0,25 procentpunt kan in principe een huurverhoging van 3% opleveren; een verlaging van 0,25 punt kan in principe een reductie van 2,91% opleveren. Dit scenario past deze wijzigingen stapsgewijs toe op de nettohuur die u invoert.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Voor een maandelijkse nettohuur van CHF 3.000 levert een verlaging van het referentietarief van 1,75% naar 1,50% een geschatte verandering van alleen het referentietarief op van ongeveer −CHF 87,38 per maand (−2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Hoe deze schatting werkt","Where do I find the current rate?":"Waar vind ik het actuele tarief?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Open de gekoppelde pagina van het Federale Bureau voor Huisvesting en voer het huidige gepubliceerde tarief in. De tool bevat geen tarief dat verouderd zou kunnen raken.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Bepaalt dit of ik een huurwijziging kan aanvragen?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Nr. Het isoleert één factor voor oriëntatie. Uw contract, inflatie, kostenwijzigingen, reserveringen en andere wettelijke voorwaarden kunnen de uitkomst wijzigen.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Zit het resultaat inclusief bijkomende kosten?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Nr. Vul de maandelijkse netto huur in, exclusief bijkomende kosten en andere variabele lasten.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Het resultaat is een illustratief referentierentescenario, geen juridisch advies of volledige huurherziening. Het is exclusief inflatie, algemene kostenwijzigingen, verbeteringen, contractuele reserveringen, geïndexeerde of getrapte huurprijzen, opzegdata en kantonnale procedures. Controleer uw huurovereenkomst en de officiële richtlijnen voordat u handelt.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Zwitserse woninghuurovereenkomsten: alleen een schatting van het hypotheekreferentierente-effect. Het is geen juridische beslissing of een volledige huurherziening.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Huidige maandelijkse nettohuur (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Referentietarief vermeld in uw huurcontract of laatste huuraankondiging (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Huidige officiële Zwitserse referentierente (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Bereken het referentierentescenario","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Scenario met alleen referentierente","Current monthly net rent":"Huidige maandelijkse nettohuur","Reference-rate change":"Wijziging referentierente","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Geschat maandelijks effect op basis van referentierente","Scenario monthly net rent":"Scenario maandelijkse nettohuur","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Jaarlijkse werking gedurende 12 maanden tegen hetzelfde tarief","potential increase":"potentiële toename","potential decrease":"potentiële afname","no reference-rate change":"geen wijziging van de referentierente","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"De schatting hanteert 3% voor elke stijging van 0,25 procentpunt en de equivalente omgekeerde reductie voor elke daling. Andere factoren kunnen het resultaat veranderen.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Dit geldt niet voor inflatie, algemene kostenwijzigingen, verbeteringen, contractreserveringen, geïndexeerde of getrapte huurprijzen, opzegdata of lokale procedurele vereisten. Controleer uw huurcontract en de richtlijnen van het Federaal Bureau voor Huisvesting.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Bekijk de laatste officiële tarieven en richtlijnen","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Zwitsers Federaal Bureau voor Huisvesting (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Vul de huurprijs en beide tarieven in om een scenario te zien.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Scenario berekend. Controleer de data en contractvoorwaarden voordat u erop vertrouwt.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Bekijk de bedragen en tarieven. Tarieven moeten tussen 0% en 5% liggen en verschillen in stappen van 0,25 punten.","Inputs cleared.":"Ingangen gewist.","Result":"Resultaat","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Zwitserse vakantiecalculator","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Zwitserse vakantieopbouwcalculator - pro rata verlofsaldo","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Schat een Zwitsers vakantiedagensaldo op basis van de jaarlijkse vakantie in uw contract, werkweek, dienstverbanddata en reeds opgenomen dagen.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Schat een pro rata betaald verlof voor één kalenderjaar op basis van de rechten en het werkschema dat u invoert. Er worden geen contractvoorwaarden geraden.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"De schatter berekent de jaarlijkse vakantiedagen in uw contract naar rato van de kalenderdagen die u in het geselecteerde jaar hebt gewerkt. Voor deeltijdwerk vult u uw gebruikelijke werkdagen per week en het jaarlijkse verlof in weken in.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Bij vier weken verlof, een vijfdaagse werkweek en een dienstverband gedurende het hele jaar bedraagt ​​het jaarrecht 20 werkdagen vóór aftrek van reeds opgenomen verlof.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Wat is het Zwitserse wettelijke minimum?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Federale richtlijnen stellen minimaal vier weken per dienstjaar, en vijf weken voor werknemers die de leeftijd van 20 jaar nog niet hebben bereikt. Een contract of collectieve overeenkomst kan meer toestaan.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Is dit bepalend voor mijn juridische saldo?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Nr. Het is een eenvoudige pro rata op kalenderdagen. Contractvoorwaarden, toepasselijke collectieve regels, kwalificerende afwezigheden, afrondingen en werkgeversgegevens kunnen het saldo doen veranderen.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Deze schatting bepaalt niet het wettelijke recht en berekent geen vakantiegeld. Het sluit kortingen uit voor bepaalde langdurige afwezigheden, contractspecifieke opbouw- en afrondingsregels, feestdagen, overuren, overdrachtsdeadlines en geschillen. Controleer uw contract en win advies in bij een betwist saldo.","Leave year":"Verlofjaar","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Jaarlijks verlof in uw contract (weken)","Usual working days per week":"Gebruikelijke werkdagen per week","Employment start date":"Ingangsdatum dienstverband","Employment end date":"Einddatum dienstverband","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Reeds opgenomen vakantiedagen in dit vakantiejaar","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Alleen ter oriëntatie. Vul het contractuele jaarrecht in; het wettelijke minimum is over het algemeen vier weken, of vijf weken voor werknemers onder de 20 jaar.","Estimate balance":"Saldo schatten","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Vul uw contract en data in om een saldo te schatten.","Estimated leave balance":"Geschat verlofsaldo","Annual leave at this schedule":"Jaarlijks verlof volgens dit schema","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Kalenderdagen gewerkt in dit verlofjaar","Prorated days accrued":"Pro rata opgebouwde dagen","Days already taken":"Reeds opgenomen dagen","Estimated days remaining":"Geschatte resterende dagen","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Hiermee wordt het jaarlijkse verlof evenredig verdeeld over de kalenderdagen van de arbeidsperiode. Werkgevers- en contractregels kunnen verschillen.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Schatting berekend. Vergelijk het met uw contract- en werkgeversgegevens.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Controleer het jaar, de data, het werkschema en de waarden."},"el":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Σενάριο Ελβετικού Επιδόματος Ανεργίας","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Ελβετικός Υπολογιστής επιδόματος ανεργίας — Μικτό σενάριο","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Υπολογίστε ένα ακαθάριστο ελβετικό ημερήσιο επίδομα χρησιμοποιώντας τον ασφαλισμένο μισθό και το επιτόκιο που επιβεβαιώνεται από το ταμείο σας.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Εισαγάγετε τον ασφαλισμένο μισθό και το ποσοστό 70% ή 80% που επιβεβαιώνεται από το ταμείο ανεργίας σας.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Οι ελβετικοί κανόνες ορίζουν το ποσοστό επιδόματος και το ανώτατο όριο μισθών. Το ταμείο αποφασίζει την επιλεξιμότητα, τις κρατήσεις, τις ημέρες αναμονής και το δικαίωμα. Το μηνιαίο εύρος αντανακλά 20–23 πληρωτέες καθημερινές.","Example":"Παράδειγμα","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5.000 CHF στο 70% είναι περίπου 161,29 CHF ανά ημέρα πληρωμής.","How it works":"Πώς λειτουργεί","Questions":"Ερωτήσεις","Scope and limits":"Εύρος και όρια","Related tools":"Σχετικά εργαλεία","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Μηνιαίος ασφαλισμένος μισθός (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Το επιτόκιο επιβεβαιώθηκε από το αμοιβαίο κεφάλαιο","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Εκτίμηση","Clear":"Καθαρό","Gross scenario":"Χονδρικό σενάριο","Insured salary used":"Μεταχειρισμένος ασφαλισμένος μισθός","Per payable weekday":"Ανά πληρωτέα καθημερινή","20-day month":"μήνας 20 ημερών","23-day month":"23 ημέρες μήνα","Official benefit rules":"Επίσημοι κανόνες παροχών","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Εισαγάγετε τα επιβεβαιωμένα στοιχεία σας.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Υπολογισμένο σενάριο. Επιβεβαιώστε τα ποσά με το ταμείο σας.","Check the values.":"Ελέγξτε τις τιμές.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Ελβετικός προγραμματιστής ειδοποίησης μίσθωσης","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Ελβετικός προγραμματιστής ειδοποίησης ενοικίασης και σχέδιο επιστολής","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Σχεδιάστε μια ειδοποίηση μίσθωσης από τις ημερομηνίες και τους όρους του συμβολαίου σας. να συντάξει μια επιστολή χωρίς να υποθέσει κανόνες καντονίου.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Εισαγάγετε την περίοδο ειδοποίησης, την επόμενη έγκυρη ημέρα καταγγελίας στη σύμβασή σας και την ημερομηνία παραλαβής. Ελέγχετε κάθε ημερομηνία με την ένωση ιδιοκτητών ή ενοικιαστών σας.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Ο προγραμματιστής εφαρμόζει μόνο τις ημερομηνίες και την περίοδο που παρέχετε. Δεν αποφασίζει εάν η ειδοποίηση είναι έγκυρη, πότε λαμβάνεται νόμιμα ή εάν ισχύει ειδική προστασία.","Contract notice period (months)":"Περίοδος προκήρυξης σύμβασης (μήνες)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Επόμενη έγκυρη ημέρα καταγγελίας του μήνα (από τη σύμβαση)","Expected receipt date":"Αναμενόμενη ημερομηνία παραλαβής","Your name":"Το όνομά σας","Your address":"Η διεύθυνσή σας","Landlord / agency":"Ιδιοκτήτης / πρακτορείο","Recipient address":"Διεύθυνση παραλήπτη","Rental property":"Ενοικιάζεται ακίνητο","Place":"Τόπος","Letter date":"Ημερομηνία επιστολής","Termination of tenancy":"Λήξη μίσθωσης","Calculate date and draft letter":"Υπολογισμός ημερομηνίας και σχέδιο επιστολής","Planning date":"Ημερομηνία προγραμματισμού","Target date":"Ημερομηνία-στόχος","Editable draft":"Επεξεργάσιμο πρόχειρο","Copy draft":"Αντιγραφή προσχέδιο","Enter your contract terms.":"Εισαγάγετε τους όρους της σύμβασής σας.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Έτοιμο το προσχέδιο σχεδιασμού. Επαλήθευση έναντι του συμβολαίου σας.","Check the dates and period.":"Ελέγξτε τις ημερομηνίες και την περίοδο.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Το αποτέλεσμα ακολουθεί την ημέρα προκήρυξης σύμβασης που παρέχεται. δεν είναι νομοθετική απόφαση.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Σενάριο απόκτησης περιουσίας στην Ελβετία","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Ελβετικός φόρος κερδών ιδιοκτησίας — Σενάριο τιμής που έχει εισαχθεί από τον χρήστη","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Υπολογίστε ένα κέρδος ιδιοκτησίας χρησιμοποιώντας τα δικά σας έξοδα συναλλαγής και έναν φορολογικό συντελεστή από το υπεύθυνο καντόνι.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Εισαγάγετε τα έσοδα, το κόστος απόκτησης, τις επιλέξιμες δαπάνες που έχετε επιβεβαιώσει και μια πραγματική τιμή από την επίσημη αριθμομηχανή καντονιών.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Ο ελβετικός φόρος κερδών ιδιοκτησίας ποικίλλει ανάλογα με το καντόνι, την περίοδο κατοχής, τις κρατήσεις και την περίπτωση. Αυτό το εργαλείο δεν παρέχει τιμές ούτε καθορίζει το αποδεκτό κόστος.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Έσοδα από εκπτώσεις (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Κόστος απόκτησης (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Άλλα έξοδα επιβεβαιώθηκαν αποδεκτά (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Πραγματικός φορολογικός συντελεστής από επίσημη πηγή (%)","Estimate scenario":"Εκτίμηση σεναρίου","Illustrative scenario":"Ενδεικτικό σενάριο","Gain entered":"Εισήγαγε κέρδος","Tax at entered rate":"Φόρος με εισηγμένο συντελεστή","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Εισαγάγετε στοιχεία από τα αρχεία σας και την πηγή του καντονιού σας.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Υπολογίστηκε το σενάριο. επιβεβαιώστε το με το καντόνι.","Check amounts and rate.":"Ελέγξτε τα ποσά και την τιμή.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Δεν υπάρχει ενσωματωμένος πίνακας φορολογίας καντονιών. Το πραγματικό επιτόκιο που εισαγάγατε οδηγεί την εκτίμηση.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Ελβετικό σενάριο φόρου κληρονομιάς και δώρων","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Ελβετικός φόρος κληρονομιάς και δώρων — Το σενάριο της τιμής σας","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Υπολογίστε ένα φορολογητέο ποσό από εξαίρεση και συντελεστή που έχει καταχωρίσει ο χρήστης. Οι κανόνες διαφέρουν ανάλογα με το καντόνι και τη σχέση.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Εισαγάγετε ένα ποσό, την εξαίρεση και το πραγματικό επιτόκιο που επιβεβαιώνεται για τον παραλήπτη και το καντόνι.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Οι κανόνες της Καντόνας και οι οικογενειακές σχέσεις μπορούν να αλλάξουν τις εξαιρέσεις και τα ποσοστά. Αυτό το εργαλείο δεν επιλέγει κανόνα καντονίου ούτε καθορίζει φορολογική υποχρέωση.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Ποσό κληρονομιάς ή δώρου (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Επιβεβαιώθηκε η εξαίρεση με το καντόνι (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Επιβεβαιώθηκε το πραγματικό ποσοστό με το καντόνι (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Ποσό μετά την εισαγωγή της εξαίρεσης","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Εισαγάγετε επιβεβαιωμένα στοιχεία για την περίπτωσή σας.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Η εκτίμηση χρησιμοποιεί μόνο την εξαίρεση και το ποσοστό που καταχωρίσατε.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Ελβετικό σενάριο προϋπολογισμού υποστήριξης παιδιών","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Ελβετικός προϋπολογισμός υποστήριξης παιδιών — Διαφανές σενάριο για το νοικοκυριό","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Καταχωρίστε έναν εγγεγραμμένο προϋπολογισμό παιδιού ανά εισόδημα γονέα μετά από μια εισαγόμενη πίστωση άμεσου κόστους.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε τις τεκμηριωμένες μηνιαίες ανάγκες του παιδιού, τα διαθέσιμα μηνιαία εισοδήματα και των δύο γονέων και τυχόν άμεσο κόστος που θέλετε να πιστώσετε.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Αυτό είναι μόνο φύλλο εργασίας προγραμματισμού. Δεν είναι ελβετικό βραβείο διατροφής ή νομική μέθοδος. στέγαση, περίθαλψη, φόροι, παροχές και νομολογία δεν αξιολογούνται.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Μηνιαίος παιδικός προϋπολογισμός που τεκμηριώσατε (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Διαθέσιμο μηνιαίο εισόδημα γονέα Α (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Διαθέσιμο μηνιαίο εισόδημα γονέα Β (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Άμεσο κόστος παιδιού που καταβάλλεται από τον Γονέα Α σε πίστωση (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Ανάθεση σεναρίου","Illustrative allocation":"Ενδεικτική κατανομή","Parent A remaining contribution":"Γονέας Μια υπολειπόμενη συνεισφορά","Parent B contribution":"Συμβολή γονέα Β","Entered monthly child budget":"Εισαγάγατε τον μηνιαίο παιδικό προϋπολογισμό","Enter your household budget figures.":"Εισαγάγετε τα στοιχεία του οικογενειακού προϋπολογισμού σας.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Υπολογίστηκε το σενάριο προϋπολογισμού. συζητήστε τις νομικές υποχρεώσεις με έναν εξειδικευμένο σύμβουλο.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Έλεγχος ποσών. η πίστωση δεν μπορεί να υπερβαίνει τον προϋπολογισμό.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Οι μετοχές είναι ανάλογες με τα δύο εισαγόμενα εισοδήματα. η πίστωση άμεσου κόστους αφαιρείται πρώτα.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Προεπισκόπηση συλλαβισμού προγράμματος περιήγησης","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Προεπισκόπηση συλλαβισμού λέξεων — Μοτίβα γλώσσας προγράμματος περιήγησης","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Προεπισκόπηση του συλλαβισμού του προγράμματος περιήγησης για το κείμενο που παρέχετε. Η υποστήριξη εξαρτάται από το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης και τους εγκατεστημένους πόρους γλώσσας.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Επιλέξτε τη γλώσσα που ταιριάζει με το κείμενό σας, εισαγάγετε ένα δείγμα και προσαρμόστε το διαθέσιμο πλάτος γραμμής.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Χρησιμοποιεί τον εγγενή παύλα CSS του προγράμματος περιήγησης. Δεν συνδυάζει λεξικά. Τα μη υποστηριζόμενα προγράμματα περιήγησης ενδέχεται να μην εμφανίζουν παύλες. Η αντιγραφή του κειμένου διατηρεί την αρχική ορθογραφία.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Γλώσσα κειμένου (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Πλάτος προεπισκόπησης (χαρακτήρες)","Text to preview":"Κείμενο για προεπισκόπηση","Preview":"Προεπισκόπηση","Enter text and choose its language.":"Εισαγάγετε κείμενο και επιλέξτε τη γλώσσα του.","Preview updated.":"Η προεπισκόπηση ενημερώθηκε.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Εισαγάγετε μια υποστηριζόμενη ετικέτα γλώσσας και κείμενο.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Δοκιμάστε την ίδια παράγραφο σε διαφορετικά πλάτη για να δείτε πού μπορεί το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης να σπάσει λέξεις.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Ιδιωτικός χώρος εργασίας ορθογραφικού ελέγχου","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Τοπικός ορθογραφικός έλεγχος — Χρησιμοποιήστε το λεξικό του προγράμματος περιήγησής σας","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Επεξεργαστείτε κείμενο με τον εγγενή ορθογραφικό έλεγχο του προγράμματος περιήγησης, επιλέξτε μια γλώσσα και αντιγράψτε το διορθωμένο κείμενο.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Το κείμενο παραμένει σε αυτήν τη σελίδα. Ορίστε μια γλώσσα για την οποία το πρόγραμμα περιήγησής σας διαθέτει ορθογραφικό λεξικό και, στη συνέχεια, χρησιμοποιήστε το μενού ορθογραφίας ή υπογραμμίστε τις προτάσεις.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Αυτός ο χώρος εργασίας δεν ανεβάζει κείμενο ή αποστέλλει λεξικά. Η διαθεσιμότητα και οι προτάσεις του ορθογραφικού ελέγχου του προγράμματος περιήγησης εξαρτώνται από τη συσκευή, το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης και το εγκατεστημένο λεξικό.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Γλώσσα ορθογραφικού ελέγχου (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Κείμενο προς έλεγχο","Copy text":"Αντιγραφή κειμένου","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Πληκτρολογήστε ή επικολλήστε κείμενο. Κάντε δεξί κλικ ή χρησιμοποιήστε το μενού ορθογραφίας της συσκευής σας για προτάσεις.","Text copied.":"Το κείμενο αντιγράφηκε.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η αυτόματη αντιγραφή. επιλέξτε και αντιγράψτε το κείμενο.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Ένα πρόγραμμα περιήγησης χωρίς αντίστοιχο λεξικό ενδέχεται να μην επισημαίνει ορθογραφικά λάθη.","Resume Structure Checker":"Έλεγχος δομής βιογραφικού","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"Έλεγχος βιογραφικού ATS — Δωρεάν τοπική αναθεώρηση PDF & DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Ελέγξτε το κείμενο βιογραφικού, τις επικεφαλίδες, τις ενότητες, τους συνδέσμους και τη δομή των κουκκίδων στο πρόγραμμα περιήγησής σας. Συγκρίνετε τους όρους περιγραφής εργασίας ανά μέτρηση. χωρίς βαθμολογία πρόσληψης ή μεταφόρτωση.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Ελέγξτε τι πραγματικά εκθέτει ένα βιογραφικό με κείμενο: εξαγόμενο κείμενο, δομή επικεφαλίδας, παρουσία πεδίου επαφής, συνδέσμους και κοινώς αναγνωρισμένες ενότητες. Προαιρετικά συγκρίνετε τους επαναλαμβανόμενους όρους περιγραφής εργασίας.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"Ένα DOCX με στυλ Επικεφαλίδας 1 για Εμπειρία και Εκπαίδευση εμφανίζει αυτές τις επικεφαλίδες. Ένα PDF ελέγχεται από το επιλέξιμο κείμενό του. οι στήλες μπορούν να διαβαστούν με διαφορετική σειρά.\nΤα αρχεία","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX ελέγχονται τοπικά ως ZIP/XML του Office. Τα PDF διαβάζονται με μια αναβαλλόμενη τοπική μηχανή PDF.js. Η προαιρετική σύγκριση περιγραφής εργασίας μετράει επιλεγμένους όρους σε κάθε κείμενο. δεν δημιουργεί βαθμολογία ούτε συνιστά αν θα προσλάβετε κάποιον.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Πρόκειται για έλεγχο μορφής και δομής κειμένου, όχι προσομοιωτή ATS, νομική αναθεώρηση ή πρόβλεψη επιτυχίας συνέντευξης. Τα σαρωμένα PDF χωρίς επιλέξιμο κείμενο χρειάζονται πρώτα OCR. Δεν υποστηρίζονται έγγραφα που προστατεύονται με κωδικό πρόσβασης, με δυνατότητα μακροεντολής, υπογεγραμμένα ή ασυνήθιστα μεγάλα.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Επιλέξτε ένα βιογραφικό (PDF ή DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Τα αρχεία σας παραμένουν σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης και δεν μεταφορτώνονται. Μέγιστο 20 MB. PDF έως 50 σελίδες. Το εκτεταμένο περιεχόμενο DOCX περιορίζεται στα 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Προαιρετική περιγραφή θέσης εργασίας","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Επικολλήστε απλό κείμενο εάν θέλετε μια σύγκριση όρων-συχνότητας. Μην συμπεριλάβετε ευαίσθητες πληροφορίες που δεν χρειάζεται να αναλύσετε.","Paste job-description text here…":"Επικολλήστε εδώ το κείμενο περιγραφής εργασίας…","Analyze locally":"Ανάλυση τοπικά","Clear files and report":"Εκκαθάριση αρχείων και αναφορά","Resume review":"Συνέχιση ελέγχου","File type":"Τύπος αρχείου","Extracted characters":"Εξαγωγή χαρακτήρων","Words counted":"Οι λέξεις μετρημένες","Detected headings":"Εντοπίστηκαν επικεφαλίδες","Recognized sections":"Αναγνωρισμένα τμήματα","Hyperlinks found":"Βρέθηκαν υπερσύνδεσμοι","Bullet paragraphs":"Παράγραφοι κουκκίδων","An email address appears in the text":"Στο κείμενο εμφανίζεται μια διεύθυνση email","No email address pattern was detected":"Δεν εντοπίστηκε μοτίβο διεύθυνσης email","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Ένα μοτίβο που μοιάζει με αριθμό τηλεφώνου εμφανίζεται στο κείμενο","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Δεν εντοπίστηκε μοτίβο που να μοιάζει με αριθμό τηλεφώνου","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Όροι περιγραφής εργασίας (μετράει μόνο)","Term":"Διάρκεια","In job text":"Στο κείμενο εργασίας","In resume":"Στο βιογραφικό","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Επικολλήστε μια περιγραφή εργασίας για να συγκρίνετε τον αριθμό των θητειών.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Δεν εντοπίστηκαν καθαρά στυλ επικεφαλίδων. Οι επικεφαλίδες PDF εκτιμώνται από το μέγεθος του κειμένου και μπορεί να είναι ανακριβείς.","Detected":"Εντοπίστηκε","Not detected":"Δεν εντοπίστηκε","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Αυτή η ευρετική αναγνωρίζει ένα περιορισμένο σύνολο κοινών ονομάτων ενοτήτων. δεν αποφασίζει ποιες ενότητες απαιτούνται.","Profile / summary":"Προφίλ / περίληψη","Experience":"Εμπειρία","Education":"Εκπαίδευση","Skills":"Δεξιότητες","Contact":"Επικοινωνία","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Δεν βρέθηκε κείμενο με δυνατότητα επιλογής. Τα αρχεία PDF μόνο για σάρωση χρειάζονται OCR για να μπορέσουν να ελεγχθούν.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Επιλέξτε ένα βιογραφικό PDF ή DOCX για να ξεκινήσετε.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Ανάγνωση του επιλεγμένου αρχείου τοπικά…","Local structure review complete.":"Ολοκληρώθηκε ο έλεγχος τοπικής δομής.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης δεν υποστηρίζει μια απαιτούμενη δυνατότητα τοπικού εγγράφου.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Επιλέξτε ένα έγκυρο αρχείο PDF ή σύγχρονο αρχείο DOCX μέχρι τα αναφερόμενα τοπικά όρια.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η ανάγνωση του PDF. Μπορεί να είναι κατεστραμμένο, κρυπτογραφημένο ή να μην περιέχει επιλέξιμο κείμενο.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Το πακέτο DOCX δεν ήταν δυνατό να ανοίξει ή να διαβάσει με ασφάλεια.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Αυτό το εργαλείο μεταφορτώνει ή αποθηκεύει το βιογραφικό μου;","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Αρ. Η ανάλυση και η ανάλυση εκτελούνται στο πρόγραμμα περιήγησής σας. Το κείμενο του αρχείου δεν αποστέλλεται σε διακομιστή ούτε διατηρείται αφού διαγράψετε την αναφορά ή φύγετε από τη σελίδα.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Προβλέπει εάν ένα ATS ή εργοδότης θα δεχτεί το βιογραφικό μου;","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Αρ. Ελέγχει μόνο αναγνώσιμο κείμενο και απλή δομή. Τα συστήματα πρόσληψης διαφέρουν και αυτό δεν αποτελεί εγγύηση συμβατότητας ATS ή πρόβλεψη πρόσληψης.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Μπορεί να διαβάσει ένα σαρωμένο PDF;","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Μόνο εάν το PDF έχει επιλέξιμο επίπεδο κειμένου. Αυτό το πούλι δεν κατεβάζει μοντέλα OCR. χρησιμοποιήστε πρώτα ένα εργαλείο OCR για ένα έγγραφο μόνο για σαρωμένη εικόνα.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Τι σημαίνει η σύγκριση περιγραφής εργασίας;","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Δείχνει μετρήσεις για επαναλαμβανόμενους όρους μετά από απλή κανονικοποίηση. Δεν είναι ποσοστό αγώνα, κατάταξη, σύσταση ή αξιολόγηση των προσόντων σας.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Γιατί ένα PDF εμφανίζει λιγότερες επικεφαλίδες από ένα DOCX;","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"Τα PDF συνήθως δεν διατηρούν τα σημασιολογικά στυλ επικεφαλίδων. Το πούλι εκτιμά τις εμφανείς γραμμές από το μέγεθος του κειμένου και τη σειρά ανάγνωσης, έτσι ώστε οι στήλες και ο οπτικός σχεδιασμός να μπορούν να επηρεάσουν το αποτέλεσμα.","How local resume review works":"Πώς λειτουργεί ο τοπικός έλεγχος βιογραφικού","Resume checker questions":"Ερωτήσεις ελεγκτή συνέχισης","Scope and limitations":"Πεδίο εφαρμογής και περιορισμοί","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Τοπικό διαχωριστικό φωνής και συνοδείας","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Φωνητικό Remover — Ξεχωριστά φωνητικά και συνοδεία τοπικά","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Διαχωρίστε ένα σύντομο στερεοφωνικό δείγμα ήχου σε εκτιμώμενα φωνητικά και συνοδεία στο πρόγραμμα περιήγησής σας. Ο ήχος παραμένει στη συσκευή σας. Το μοντέλο κατεβάζεται από τον δημόσιο κεντρικό υπολογιστή του.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Επιλέξτε ένα στερεοφωνικό κλιπ μουσικής έως 30 δευτερόλεπτα. Κατά την πρώτη χρήση, το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης κατεβάζει ένα μοντέλο 35,6 MB. Το αρχείο ήχου υποβάλλεται σε επεξεργασία σε αυτήν τη συσκευή και δεν μεταφορτώνεται ποτέ.","What you get":"Τι παίρνετε","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Πραγματοποιήστε προεπισκόπηση και κατεβάστε δύο στελέχη WAV: εκτιμώμενα φωνητικά και την υπολειπόμενη συνοδεία. Τα αποτελέσματα εξαρτώνται από το μείγμα και μπορεί να περιέχουν τεχνουργήματα.","Local processing":"Τοπική επεξεργασία","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Το εργαλείο χρησιμοποιεί το δίκτυο φωνητικών Open-Unmix UMX-HQ που εξάγεται σε ONNX και ONNX Runtime Web. Το μοντέλο λαμβάνεται μόνο όταν πατάτε Διαχωρίστε. δεν χρησιμοποιείται API ή συνδρομή επί πληρωμή. Ο ήχος αποκωδικοποιείται, επεξεργάζεται και εξάγεται τοπικά.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Αυτή είναι μια εκτίμηση για στερεοφωνική επεξεργασία 44,1 kHz και κλιπ έως 30 δευτερόλεπτα. Οι μονοφωνικές πηγές αντιγράφονται σε στερεοφωνικό. Τα φωνητικά που αναμειγνύονται βαθιά σε όργανα, τα βαριά εφέ, οι ζωντανές ηχογραφήσεις και τα ασυνήθιστα είδη μπορούν να προκαλέσουν διαρροές ή τεχνουργήματα. Μην χρησιμοποιείτε το αποτέλεσμα ως καθαρό κύριο. Η λήψη μοντέλου απαιτεί σύνδεση στο Διαδίκτυο. ο ήχος δεν φεύγει από αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Μεταφορτώθηκε ο ήχος μου;","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Αρ. Ο επιλεγμένος ήχος αποκωδικοποιείται και επεξεργάζεται στο πρόγραμμα περιήγησής σας. Το μόνο αίτημα δικτύου είναι η λήψη του μοντέλου κατά την έναρξη του διαχωρισμού.","Why is the first run slow?":"Γιατί η πρώτη εκτέλεση είναι αργή;","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης κατεβάζει ένα μοντέλο 35,6 MB μία φορά. το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης μπορεί να το αποθηκεύσει προσωρινά. Στη συνέχεια, το Inference εκτελείται τοπικά στην CPU της συσκευής.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Θα χωρίζει κάθε τραγούδι καθαρά;","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Αρ. Το μοντέλο υπολογίζει ένα φωνητικό στέλεχος και μπορεί να αφήσει φωνητική διαρροή, να αφαιρέσει τις αρμονικές του οργάνου ή να δημιουργήσει τεχνουργήματα. Ακούστε πριν βασιστείτε σε ένα στέλεχος.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Στερεοφωνικό αρχείο ήχου (έως 30 δευτερόλεπτα)","Choose audio":"Επιλέξτε ήχο","Separate vocals":"Χωριστά φωνητικά","Cancel / clear":"Ακύρωση / διαγραφή","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Επιλέξτε ένα σύντομο αρχείο ήχου για να ξεκινήσετε.","Downloading the separation model…":"Λήψη του μοντέλου διαχωρισμού…","Separating locally…":"Τοπικός διαχωρισμός…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Ο διαχωρισμός ολοκληρώθηκε. Κάντε προεπισκόπηση ή κατεβάστε οποιοδήποτε στέλεχος.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η επεξεργασία αυτού του αρχείου ή η φόρτωση του μοντέλου. Ελέγξτε τη μορφή και τη σύνδεση και, στη συνέχεια, δοκιμάστε ξανά.","Model and weight license information":"Πληροφορίες άδειας μοντέλου και βάρους","Estimated vocals":"Εκτιμώμενα φωνητικά","Estimated accompaniment":"Εκτιμώμενη συνοδεία","Download WAV":"Λήψη WAV","Progress":"Πρόοδος","Preparing local separation…":"Προετοιμασία τοπικού διαχωρισμού…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Ο διαχωρισμός ολοκληρώθηκε. Ο ήχος παρέμεινε σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η επεξεργασία αυτού του ήχου. Δοκιμάστε ένα στερεοφωνικό αρχείο μουσικής κάτω από 30 δευτερόλεπτα.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Ελβετικό εκπεστέο συγκριτικό σύστημα ασφάλισης υγείας","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Ελβετικός Υπολογιστής Franchise Ασφάλισης Υγείας — Σύγκριση ετήσιων δαπανών","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Συγκρίνετε τις εκπτώσεις βασικής ασφάλισης υγείας της Ελβετίας χρησιμοποιώντας ασφάλιστρα και επιλέξιμες ετήσιες ιατρικές δαπάνες που καταχωρείτε. Δεν μαντεύεται καμία προσφορά ασφαλιστή.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Εισαγάγετε τα μηνιαία ασφάλιστρα που εμφανίζονται από την ίδια ασφαλιστική εταιρεία για κάθε έκπτωση που προσφέρει και, στη συνέχεια, συγκρίνετε σενάρια χαμηλού, αναμενόμενου και υψηλού ετήσιου κόστους θεραπείας.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Για την υποχρεωτική ελβετική βασική ασφάλιση υγείας, μια τυπική έκπτωση για ενήλικες είναι 300 CHF και η έκπτωση για παιδιά είναι 0 CHF. Τα προαιρετικά επίπεδα διαφέρουν ανά ηλικιακή ομάδα. Μετά την έκπτωση, η τυπική χρέωση διατήρησης είναι 10% των επιλέξιμων υπολειπόμενων δαπανών, με ανώτατο όριο 700 CHF ετησίως για ενήλικες και 350 CHF για παιδιά. Το εργαλείο προσθέτει το εισαγόμενο ασφάλιστρο σε αυτήν την μοντελοποιημένη κατανομή κόστους. δεν συλλέγει τα ποσοστά του ασφαλιστή ούτε αποφασίζει ποια επιλογή είναι κατάλληλη για εσάς.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Εάν ένας ενήλικας εισαγάγει μηνιαίο ασφάλιστρο 400 CHF με έκπτωση 300 CHF και 350 CHF με έκπτωση 2.500 CHF, η ετήσια διαφορά πριμοδότησης είναι 600 CHF. Συγκρίνετε αυτή την εξοικονόμηση με την μοντελοποιημένη διαφορά στο χαμηλότερο ποσό κατανομής κόστους και το υψηλότερο αναμενόμενο ποσό elig.co.","How the estimate works":"Πώς λειτουργεί η εκτίμηση","Common questions":"Συνήθεις ερωτήσεις","Scope and exclusions":"Πεδίο εφαρμογής και εξαιρέσεις","Where do I get the premiums?":"Πού μπορώ να βρω τα ασφάλιστρα;","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε τις τρέχουσες μηνιαίες προσφορές για τον ίδιο ασφαλιστή, την ίδια περιοχή ασφαλίστρων, την ηλικιακή ομάδα, την κάλυψη ατυχημάτων και το μοντέλο ασφάλισης. Το Priminfo είναι ο επίσημος ομοσπονδιακός ιστότοπος σύγκρισης. Αυτή η σελίδα δεν ανακτά ούτε αναπαράγει τις προσφορές των ασφαλιστών.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Προσφέρονται πάντα όλα τα αναγραφόμενα εκπεστέα επίπεδα;","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Αρ. Οι ασφαλιστές δεν χρειάζεται να προσφέρουν κάθε προαιρετικό επίπεδο και οι προσφορές μπορεί να διαφέρουν για νεαρούς ενήλικες. Εισαγάγετε μόνο τα ασφάλιστρα που εμφανίζονται για το δικό σας συμβόλαιο. αφήστε κενές τις μη διαθέσιμες επιλογές.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Αυτό δείχνει τον πλήρη ιατρικό μου λογαριασμό;","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Αρ. Το μοντέλο καλύπτει τη συνήθη εκπεστέα και την τυπική αμοιβή διατήρησης 10% επί των επιλέξιμων δαπανών. Εξαιρούνται οι εισφορές ημερήσιας νοσηλείας, η ειδική διατήρηση φαρμάκων 40%, οι απαλλασσόμενες υπηρεσίες, η μη καλυπτόμενη περίθαλψη και η επικουρική ασφάλιση.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Πρόκειται για σύγκριση σεναρίων, όχι ασφαλιστικές, ιατρικές ή οικονομικές συμβουλές. Δεν προβλέπει τη θεραπεία ή τα ασφάλιστρά σας. Εξαιρούνται οι εισφορές ημέρας νοσηλείας (συνήθως 15 CHF ανά ημέρα νοσηλείας, με νόμιμες εξαιρέσεις), ειδική παρακράτηση 40% σε ορισμένα φάρμακα, εξαιρέσεις μητρότητας/προληπτικών, υπηρεσίες εκτός υποχρεωτικής κάλυψης, επιδοτήσεις ασφαλίστρων και συμπληρωματική ασφάλιση. Συνεπώς, η πραγματική συμπληρωμή μπορεί να διαφέρει. Μια υψηλότερη έκπτωση σημαίνει ότι πρέπει να είστε σε θέση να πληρώσετε περισσότερα προκαταβολικά εάν λάβετε περίθαλψη.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Ποιος είναι ασφαλισμένος βάσει αυτού του συμβολαίου;","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Ενήλικες (ηλικίας 19 ετών και άνω)","Child (under 18)":"Παιδί (κάτω των 18 ετών)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Σενάριο χαμηλού ετήσιου επιλέξιμου κόστους θεραπείας (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Αναμενόμενο ετήσιο επιλέξιμο κόστος θεραπείας (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Σενάριο υψηλού ετήσιου επιλέξιμου κόστους θεραπείας (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Μηνιαία ασφάλιστρα από έναν ασφαλιστή","Monthly premium":"Μηνιαία πριμοδότηση","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Εισαγάγετε μόνο τις επιλογές που προσφέρονται για την ίδια πολιτική. Αφήστε τα άλλα κενά.","Adult deductible choices":"Επιλογές με δυνατότητα έκπτωσης για ενήλικες","Child deductible choices":"Επιλογές με δυνατότητα έκπτωσης παιδιών","Compare annual costs":"Συγκρίνετε το ετήσιο κόστος","Clear entries":"Διαγραφή καταχωρήσεων","Download CSV":"Λήψη CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Εκτιμώμενο ετήσιο ασφάλιστρο συν κατανομή κόστους","Deductible":"Απαιρείται","Annual premiums":"Ετήσια ασφάλιστρα","Total at low costs":"Σύνολο με χαμηλό κόστος","Total at expected costs":"Σύνολο με αναμενόμενο κόστος","Total at high costs":"Σύνολο με υψηλό κόστος","Cost sharing at low costs":"Κοινή χρήση κόστους με χαμηλό κόστος","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Κατανομή κόστους στο αναμενόμενο κόστος","Cost sharing at high costs":"Κοινή χρήση κόστους με υψηλό κόστος","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Διαφορά από τη χαμηλότερη διαθέσιμη έκπτωση","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Ιατρικό κόστος όπου εξαντλείται η εξοικονόμηση πριμοδότησης","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Η εισαχθείσα εξοικονόμηση πριμοδότησης δεν ακυρώνεται εντός του διαμορφωμένου εύρους κατανομής κόστους.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Καμία εξοικονόμηση ασφαλίστρου έναντι της χαμηλότερης έκπτωσης.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Το χαμηλότερο αναμενόμενο σύνολο μεταξύ των εισαγόμενων επιλογών","Scenario details":"Λεπτομέρειες σεναρίου","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Εισαγάγετε τρία παραγγελθέντα σενάρια ιατρικού κόστους και μηνιαία ασφάλιστρα για τουλάχιστον δύο διαθέσιμες εκπτώσεις.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Επίσημοι κανόνες και τρέχοντα ασφάλιστρα:","Federal deductible rules":"Ομοσπονδιακοί κανόνες έκπτωσης","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo επίσημη σύγκριση premium","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Σύγκριση υπολογίζεται σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Ελέγξτε την ηλικιακή ομάδα, τα σενάρια κόστους παραγγελίας και τουλάχιστον δύο μηνιαία ασφάλιστρα.","Entries cleared.":"Οι καταχωρήσεις διαγράφηκαν.","CSV downloaded locally.":"Το CSV έγινε τοπικά.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Ελβετικός Υπολογιστής επιδότησης Premium — Το καθαρό σας ασφάλιστρο","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Υπολογίστε το καθαρό ελβετικό ασφάλιστρο ασφάλισης υγείας από το τρέχον ασφάλιστρο και τη μηνιαία μείωση που έχει ήδη χορηγηθεί από το καντόνι σας.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Εισαγάγετε το ασφάλιστρο και την επιβεβαιωμένη μηνιαία έκπτωση από τον ασφαλιστή ή την απόφαση καντονιού σας. Αυτό το εργαλείο δεν αποφασίζει εάν πληροίτε τις προϋποθέσεις.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Τα ελβετικά καντόνια καθορίζουν ποιος πληροί τις προϋποθέσεις, πόση υποστήριξη παρέχεται και εάν απαιτείται αίτηση. Αυτή η αριθμομηχανή αφαιρεί μόνο μια επιβεβαιωμένη μηνιαία μείωση από ένα ασφάλιστρο και εμφανίζει το ετήσιο ποσό.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Εάν το μηνιαίο ασφάλιστρο είναι 420 CHF και η επιβεβαιωμένη μείωση είναι 120 CHF, το εκτιμώμενο καθαρό ασφάλιστρο είναι 300 CHF ανά μήνα.","How the calculation works":"Πώς λειτουργεί ο υπολογισμός","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Μου λέει αυτό αν πληροί τις προϋποθέσεις;","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Αρ. Η επιλεξιμότητα και τα ποσά απονομής αποφασίζονται από το καντόνι της κατοικίας. Χρησιμοποιήστε τις συνδεδεμένες επίσημες πληροφορίες ή επικοινωνήστε με το γραφείο του καντονιού.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Πού μπορώ να βρω το ποσό μείωσης;","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε την τρέχουσα απόφαση ή το μειωμένο ασφάλιστρο που δείχνει ο ασφαλιστής σας. Ορισμένα καντόνια χορηγούν αυτόματα μειώσεις. άλλα απαιτούν αίτηση.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Αυτό είναι αριθμητικό για μια πολιτική, όχι για απόφαση καταλληλότητας ή οφέλους. Δεν υπολογίζει το εισόδημα του νοικοκυριού, τα περιουσιακά στοιχεία, την οικογενειακή κατάσταση, τις προθεσμίες, τα κατώτατα όρια καντονιών ή τα δικαιώματα αίτησης. Τα ασφάλιστρα και τα βραβεία μπορούν να αλλάξουν. επιβεβαιώστε τα με τον ασφαλιστή και το καντόνι σας.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Τρέχον μηνιαίο ασφάλιστρο (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Μηνιαία μείωση έχει ήδη χορηγηθεί (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Εισαγάγετε ένα ποσό που επιβεβαιώνεται από το καντόνι ή τον ασφαλιστή. μην χρησιμοποιείτε μια εκτίμηση ως βραβείο.","Calculate net premium":"Υπολογίστε το καθαρό ασφάλιστρο","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Εισαγάγετε το τρέχον ασφάλιστρο και την επιβεβαιωμένη μείωση.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Εκτιμώμενο ασφάλιστρο μετά τη μείωση","Current monthly premium":"Τρέχον μηνιαίο ασφάλιστρο","Monthly reduction":"Μηνιαία μείωση","Estimated net monthly premium":"Εκτιμώμενο καθαρό μηνιαίο ασφάλιστρο","Reduction over 12 months":"Μείωση σε 12 μήνες","Reduction as a share of premium":"Μείωση ως μερίδιο premium","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Ο υπολογισμός ολοκληρώθηκε. Επιβεβαιώστε την ανάθεση και τις ημερομηνίες έναρξης ισχύος με το καντόνι και τον ασφαλιστή σας.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Βεβαιωθείτε ότι η μείωση δεν είναι μεγαλύτερη από το μηνιαίο ασφάλιστρο.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Υπολογιστής σεναρίου τιμής αναφοράς ενοικίου Ελβετίας","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Ελβετικός Υπολογιστής Προσαρμογής Ενοικίου — Σενάριο τιμής αναφοράς","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Υπολογίστε μόνο πώς μια αλλαγή στο επιτόκιο αναφοράς στεγαστικών δανείων της Ελβετίας επηρεάζει το καθαρό ενοίκιο κατοικιών. Χρησιμοποιήστε την πιο πρόσφατη τιμή από το ομοσπονδιακό γραφείο στέγασης.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Συγκρίνετε την τιμή αναφοράς που αναφέρεται στη μίσθωση ή την τελευταία ειδοποίηση ενοικίασης με την τρέχουσα επίσημη ελβετική τιμή. Ο υπολογισμός παραμένει στη συσκευή σας.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Η Ομοσπονδιακή Υπηρεσία Στέγασης δημοσιεύει ένα επιτόκιο αναφοράς στεγαστικών δανείων για προσαρμογές ενοικίων στην Ελβετία κάθε τρίμηνο. Μια αύξηση κατά 0,25 ποσοστιαίες μονάδες μπορεί κατ' αρχήν να επιτρέψει αύξηση ενοικίου κατά 3%. μια μείωση 0,25 μονάδων μπορεί κατ' αρχήν να επιτρέψει μείωση 2,91%. Αυτό το σενάριο εφαρμόζει αυτές τις αλλαγές βήμα προς βήμα στο καθαρό ενοίκιο που εισάγετε.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Για μηνιαίο καθαρό μίσθωμα 3.000 CHF, μια μείωση του επιτοκίου αναφοράς από 1,75% σε 1,50% δίνει μια εκτιμώμενη αλλαγή μόνο του επιτοκίου αναφοράς περίπου -87,38 CHF ανά μήνα (−2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Πώς λειτουργεί αυτή η εκτίμηση","Where do I find the current rate?":"Πού μπορώ να βρω την τρέχουσα τιμή;","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Ανοίξτε τη συνδεδεμένη σελίδα Ομοσπονδιακής Υπηρεσίας Στέγασης και εισαγάγετε την τρέχουσα δημοσιευμένη τιμή. Το εργαλείο δεν ενσωματώνει ρυθμό που θα μπορούσε να είναι ξεπερασμένος.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Αυτό αποφασίζει εάν μπορώ να ζητήσω αλλαγή ενοικίου;","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Αρ. Απομονώνει έναν παράγοντα για τον προσανατολισμό. Το συμβόλαιό σας, ο πληθωρισμός, οι αλλαγές κόστους, οι κρατήσεις και άλλες νομικές προϋποθέσεις μπορούν να αλλάξουν το αποτέλεσμα.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Περιλαμβάνει το αποτέλεσμα παρεπόμενες δαπάνες;","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Αρ. Εισαγάγετε το μηνιαίο καθαρό μίσθωμα, εξαιρουμένων των παρεπόμενων δαπανών και άλλων μεταβλητών χρεώσεων.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Το αποτέλεσμα είναι ένα ενδεικτικό σενάριο τιμής αναφοράς, όχι μια νομική γνώμη ή πλήρης έλεγχος ενοικίου. Εξαιρεί τον πληθωρισμό, τις αλλαγές γενικού κόστους, τις βελτιώσεις, τις συμβατικές κρατήσεις, τα τιμαριθμοποιημένα ή κλιμακωτά ενοίκια, τις ημερομηνίες ειδοποίησης και τη διαδικασία καντονιών. Ελέγξτε τη μίσθωση και την επίσημη καθοδήγηση πριν ενεργήσετε.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Ελβετικές μισθώσεις κατοικιών: εκτίμηση της επίδρασης μόνο του επιτοκίου αναφοράς στεγαστικού δανείου. Δεν είναι νομική απόφαση ή πλήρης αναθεώρηση ενοικίου.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Τρέχον μηνιαίο καθαρό μίσθωμα (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Ποσοστό αναφοράς που αναφέρεται στη μίσθωση ή στην τελευταία ειδοποίηση ενοικίασης (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Τρέχον επίσημο ελβετικό επιτόκιο αναφοράς (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Υπολογισμός σεναρίου ποσοστού αναφοράς","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Σενάριο μόνο για ποσοστό αναφοράς","Current monthly net rent":"Τρέχον μηνιαίο καθαρό μίσθωμα","Reference-rate change":"Αλλαγή ποσοστού αναφοράς","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Εκτιμώμενη μηνιαία επίδραση από το επιτόκιο αναφοράς","Scenario monthly net rent":"Σενάριο μηνιαίο καθαρό μίσθωμα","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Ετήσια επίδραση για 12 μήνες με τον ίδιο ρυθμό","potential increase":"δυνητική αύξηση","potential decrease":"δυνητική μείωση","no reference-rate change":"καμία αλλαγή στην τιμή αναφοράς","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Η εκτίμηση ισχύει 3% για κάθε αύξηση κατά 0,25 ποσοστιαίες μονάδες και την ισοδύναμη αντίστροφη μείωση για κάθε μείωση. Άλλοι παράγοντες μπορούν να αλλάξουν το αποτέλεσμα.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Δεν περιλαμβάνει πληθωρισμό, αλλαγές γενικού κόστους, βελτιώσεις, κρατήσεις συμβολαίων, τιμαριθμοποιημένα ή κλιμακωτά ενοίκια, ημερομηνίες ειδοποίησης ή τοπικές διαδικαστικές απαιτήσεις. Ελέγξτε τη μίσθωση και την καθοδήγηση της Ομοσπονδιακής Υπηρεσίας Στέγασης.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Ελέγξτε την πιο πρόσφατη επίσημη τιμή και οδηγίες","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Ελβετικό Ομοσπονδιακό Γραφείο Στέγασης (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Εισαγάγετε το ενοίκιο και τις δύο τιμές για να δείτε ένα σενάριο.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Υπολογισμένο σενάριο. Επαληθεύστε τις ημερομηνίες και τους όρους της σύμβασης προτού βασιστείτε σε αυτό.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Ελέγξτε τα ποσά και τις τιμές. Οι τιμές πρέπει να είναι μεταξύ 0% και 5% και να διαφέρουν σε βήματα 0,25 πόντων.","Inputs cleared.":"Οι είσοδοι διαγράφηκαν.","Result":"Αποτέλεσμα","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Ελβετικός Εκτιμητής Δεδομένων Διακοπών","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Ελβετικός Υπολογιστής Δεδομένων Διακοπών — Αναλογικό υπόλοιπο άδειας","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Υπολογίστε ένα υπόλοιπο ελβετικών ημερών διακοπών από την ετήσια άδεια στο συμβόλαιό σας, την εβδομάδα εργασίας, τις ημερομηνίες απασχόλησης και τις ημέρες που έχετε ήδη λάβει.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Υπολογίστε την κατ' αναλογία άδεια μετ' αποδοχών για ένα ημερολογιακό έτος χρησιμοποιώντας το δικαίωμα και το πρόγραμμα εργασίας που καταχωρίζετε. Δεν υπάρχουν όροι σύμβασης εικασίες.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Ο εκτιμητής αναλογεί τις ημέρες ετήσιας άδειας στη σύμβασή σας ανά ημερολογιακές ημέρες που εργάζονταν στο επιλεγμένο έτος. Για εργασία μερικής απασχόλησης, εισαγάγετε τις συνήθεις εργάσιμες ημέρες την εβδομάδα και την ετήσια άδεια σε εβδομάδες.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Με τέσσερις εβδομάδες άδειας, πενθήμερη εβδομάδα εργασίας και απασχόληση καθ' όλη τη διάρκεια του έτους, το ετήσιο δικαίωμα είναι 20 εργάσιμες ημέρες πριν αφαιρεθεί η άδεια που έχει ήδη λάβει.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Ποιο είναι το ελάχιστο νόμιμο στην Ελβετία;","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Η ομοσπονδιακή καθοδήγηση αναφέρει τουλάχιστον τέσσερις εβδομάδες ανά έτος υπηρεσίας και πέντε εβδομάδες για τους εργαζόμενους που δεν έχουν συμπληρώσει την ηλικία των 20 ετών. Μια σύμβαση ή συλλογική σύμβαση μπορεί να χορηγήσει περισσότερα.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Αυτό καθορίζει το νομικό υπόλοιπό μου;","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Αρ. Είναι μια απλή αναλογία ημερολογιακών ημερών. Οι συμβατικοί όροι, οι ισχύοντες συλλογικοί κανόνες, οι απουσίες που πληρούν τις προϋποθέσεις, οι στρογγυλοποιήσεις και τα αρχεία εργοδότη μπορούν να αλλάξουν την ισορροπία.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Αυτή η εκτίμηση δεν καθορίζει το νόμιμο δικαίωμα ή τον υπολογισμό των αποδοχών διακοπών. Εξαιρεί μειώσεις για ορισμένες παρατεταμένες απουσίες, κανόνες αυτοτέλειας και στρογγυλοποίησης για συγκεκριμένες συμβάσεις, αργίες, υπερωρίες, προθεσμίες μεταφοράς και διαφορές. Ελέγξτε το συμβόλαιό σας και λάβετε συμβουλές για αμφισβητούμενο υπόλοιπο.","Leave year":"Έτος άδειας","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Ετήσια άδεια στο συμβόλαιό σας (εβδομάδες)","Usual working days per week":"Συνήθεις εργάσιμες ημέρες την εβδομάδα","Employment start date":"Ημερομηνία έναρξης απασχόλησης","Employment end date":"Ημερομηνία λήξης απασχόλησης","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Ημέρες άδειας που έχουν ήδη πραγματοποιηθεί σε αυτό το έτος άδειας","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Μόνο για προσανατολισμό. Καταχωρίστε το συμβατικό ετήσιο δικαίωμα· το νόμιμο ελάχιστο είναι γενικά τέσσερις εβδομάδες ή πέντε εβδομάδες για εργαζόμενους κάτω των 20 ετών.","Estimate balance":"Εκτίμηση υπολοίπου","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Εισαγάγετε το συμβόλαιό σας και τις ημερομηνίες για να υπολογίσετε το υπόλοιπο.","Estimated leave balance":"Εκτιμώμενο υπόλοιπο άδειας","Annual leave at this schedule":"Ετήσια άδεια σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Ημερολογιακές ημέρες που χρησιμοποιούνται σε αυτό το έτος άδειας","Prorated days accrued":"Συγκεντρώθηκαν αναλογικές ημέρες","Days already taken":"Οι μέρες έχουν ήδη περάσει","Estimated days remaining":"Εκτιμώμενες ημέρες απομένουν","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Αυτό αναλογεί την ετήσια άδεια ανά ημερολογιακές ημέρες στην περίοδο απασχόλησης. Οι κανόνες εργοδότη και σύμβασης ενδέχεται να διαφέρουν.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Υπολογισμός εκτίμησης. Ελέγξτε το σύμφωνα με το συμβόλαιο και τα αρχεία του εργοδότη σας.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Ελέγξτε το έτος, τις ημερομηνίες, το πρόγραμμα εργασίας και τις τιμές."},"ms":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Senario Elaun Pengangguran Switzerland","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Kalkulator Faedah Pengangguran Switzerland — Senario Kasar","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Anggarkan elaun harian Swiss kasar menggunakan gaji dan kadar yang diinsuranskan yang disahkan oleh dana anda.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Masukkan gaji yang diinsuranskan dan kadar 70% atau 80% yang disahkan oleh dana pengangguran anda.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Peraturan Switzerland menetapkan kadar elaun dan had gaji. Dana memutuskan kelayakan, potongan, hari menunggu dan kelayakan. Julat bulanan mencerminkan 20–23 hari kerja yang perlu dibayar.","Example":"Contoh","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5,000 pada 70% ialah kira-kira CHF 161.29 setiap hari kerja yang perlu dibayar.","How it works":"Cara ia berfungsi","Questions":"Soalan","Scope and limits":"Skop dan had","Related tools":"Alat berkaitan","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Gaji diinsuranskan bulanan (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Kadar disahkan oleh dana","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Anggaran","Clear":"Jelas","Gross scenario":"Senario kasar","Insured salary used":"Gaji yang diinsuranskan digunakan","Per payable weekday":"Setiap hari kerja yang perlu dibayar","20-day month":"20 hari bulan","23-day month":"23 hari bulan","Official benefit rules":"Peraturan faedah rasmi","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Masukkan angka anda yang disahkan.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Senario dikira. Sahkan jumlah dengan dana anda.","Check the values.":"Semak nilai.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Perancang Notis Penyewaan Switzerland","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Perancang Notis Sewaan Switzerland dan Draf Surat","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Rancang notis penyewaan dari tarikh dan terma dalam kontrak anda sendiri; draf surat tanpa mengambil kira peraturan canton.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Masukkan tempoh notis, hari penamatan sah seterusnya dalam kontrak anda dan tarikh penerimaan. Semak setiap tarikh dengan tuan tanah atau persatuan penyewa anda.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Perancang hanya menggunakan tarikh dan tempoh yang anda berikan. Ia tidak memutuskan sama ada notis itu sah, apabila ia diterima secara sah, atau sama ada perlindungan khas dikenakan.","Contract notice period (months)":"Tempoh notis kontrak (bulan)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Hari penamatan sah seterusnya dalam bulan (dari kontrak)","Expected receipt date":"Tarikh penerimaan yang dijangkakan","Your name":"Nama anda","Your address":"Alamat anda","Landlord / agency":"Tuan Tanah / agensi","Recipient address":"Alamat penerima","Rental property":"Harta sewa","Place":"Tempat","Letter date":"Tarikh surat","Termination of tenancy":"Penamatan penyewaan","Calculate date and draft letter":"Kira tarikh dan draf surat","Planning date":"Tarikh perancangan","Target date":"Tarikh sasaran","Editable draft":"Draf boleh diedit","Copy draft":"Salin draf","Enter your contract terms.":"Masukkan syarat kontrak anda.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Draf perancangan sedia. Sahkan terhadap kontrak anda.","Check the dates and period.":"Semak tarikh dan tempoh.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Hasilnya mengikuti hari notis kontrak yang dibekalkan; ia bukan ketetapan notis berkanun.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Senario Keuntungan Hartanah Switzerland","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Cukai Keuntungan Hartanah Switzerland — Senario Kadar Yang Dimasukkan Pengguna","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Anggarkan keuntungan hartanah menggunakan kos transaksi anda sendiri dan kadar cukai daripada canton yang bertanggungjawab.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Masukkan hasil, kos pemerolehan, perbelanjaan layak yang telah anda sahkan dan kadar berkesan daripada kalkulator cantonal rasmi.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Cukai keuntungan hartanah Switzerland berbeza mengikut kanton, tempoh pegangan, potongan dan kes. Alat ini tidak membekalkan kadar atau menentukan kos yang boleh diterima.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Hasil jualan (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Kos pemerolehan (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Kos lain disahkan boleh diterima (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Kadar cukai berkesan daripada sumber rasmi (%)","Estimate scenario":"Anggaran senario","Illustrative scenario":"Senario ilustrasi","Gain entered":"Keuntungan dimasukkan","Tax at entered rate":"Cukai pada kadar yang dimasukkan","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Masukkan angka daripada rekod dan sumber canton anda.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Senario dikira; sahkan dengan canton.","Check amounts and rate.":"Semak amaun dan kadar.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Tiada jadual cukai kanton dibenamkan; kadar berkesan yang anda masukkan memacu anggaran.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Senario Cukai Pewarisan dan Hadiah Switzerland","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Pusaka Switzerland dan Cukai Hadiah — Senario Kadar Anda","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Anggarkan amaun bercukai daripada pengecualian dan kadar yang dimasukkan pengguna; peraturan berbeza mengikut kanton dan perhubungan.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Masukkan jumlah, pengecualian dan kadar berkesan yang disahkan untuk penerima dan kanton.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Peraturan Canton dan hubungan keluarga boleh mengubah pengecualian dan kadar. Alat ini tidak memilih peraturan kanton atau menentukan liabiliti cukai.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Jumlah warisan atau hadiah (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Pengecualian disahkan dengan kanton (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Kadar berkesan disahkan dengan kanton (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Jumlah selepas dimasukkan pengecualian","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Masukkan angka yang disahkan untuk kes anda.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Anggaran hanya menggunakan pengecualian dan kadar yang anda masukkan.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Senario Belanjawan Sokongan Kanak-Kanak Switzerland","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Bajet Sokongan Kanak-Kanak Switzerland — Senario Isi Rumah Telus","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Peruntukkan belanjawan anak yang dimasukkan mengikut pendapatan ibu bapa selepas kredit kos langsung dimasukkan.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Gunakan keperluan bulanan yang didokumentasikan oleh anak, pendapatan bulanan tersedia kedua-dua ibu bapa dan sebarang kos langsung yang anda ingin kreditkan.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Ini adalah lembaran kerja perancangan sahaja. Ia bukan anugerah penyelenggaraan kanak-kanak Switzerland atau kaedah undang-undang; perumahan, penjagaan, cukai, faedah dan undang-undang kes tidak dinilai.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Belanjawan bulanan kanak-kanak yang anda dokumentasikan (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Pendapatan bulanan tersedia (CHF) Ibu Bapa A","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Pendapatan bulanan tersedia (CHF) Ibu Bapa B","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Kos anak langsung dibayar oleh Ibu Bapa A kepada kredit (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Peruntukkan senario","Illustrative allocation":"Peruntukan ilustrasi","Parent A remaining contribution":"Ibu bapa A baki sumbangan","Parent B contribution":"Sumbangan ibu bapa B","Entered monthly child budget":"Memasukkan belanjawan bulanan anak","Enter your household budget figures.":"Masukkan angka belanjawan isi rumah anda.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Senario belanjawan dikira; bincangkan kewajipan undang-undang dengan penasihat bertauliah.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Semak amaun; kredit tidak boleh melebihi bajet.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Saham adalah berkadar dengan dua pendapatan yang dimasukkan; kredit kos langsung ditolak dahulu.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Pratonton Sempang Penyemak Imbas","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Pratonton Sempang Kata — Corak Bahasa Penyemak Imbas","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Pratonton tanda sempang penyemak imbas untuk teks yang anda berikan; sokongan bergantung pada pelayar dan sumber bahasa yang dipasang.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Pilih bahasa yang sepadan dengan teks anda, masukkan sampel dan laraskan lebar baris yang tersedia.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Menggunakan tanda sempang CSS asli penyemak imbas. Ia tidak menggabungkan kamus; pelayar yang tidak disokong mungkin tidak menunjukkan tanda sempang. Menyalin teks mengekalkan ejaan asal.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Bahasa teks (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Pratonton lebar (aksara)","Text to preview":"Teks untuk pratonton","Preview":"Pratonton","Enter text and choose its language.":"Masukkan teks dan pilih bahasanya.","Preview updated.":"Pratonton dikemas kini.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Masukkan teg dan teks bahasa yang disokong.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Cuba perenggan yang sama pada lebar yang berbeza untuk melihat tempat penyemak imbas boleh memecahkan perkataan.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Ruang Kerja Semak Ejaan Peribadi","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Pemeriksa Ejaan Tempatan — Gunakan Kamus Penyemak Imbas Anda","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Edit teks dengan semakan ejaan asli penyemak imbas, pilih bahasa dan salin teks yang diperbetulkan.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Teks kekal dalam halaman ini. Tetapkan bahasa pelayar anda mempunyai kamus ejaan, kemudian gunakan menu ejaannya atau garis bawah cadangan.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Ruang kerja ini tidak memuat naik teks atau menghantar kamus. Ketersediaan semakan ejaan penyemak imbas dan cadangan bergantung pada peranti, penyemak imbas dan kamus yang dipasang.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Bahasa semakan ejaan (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Teks untuk disemak","Copy text":"Salin teks","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Taip atau tampal teks. Klik kanan atau gunakan menu ejaan peranti anda untuk cadangan.","Text copied.":"Teks disalin.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Tidak dapat menyalin secara automatik; pilih dan salin teks.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Pelayar tanpa kamus yang sepadan mungkin tidak menandakan salah ejaan.","Resume Structure Checker":"Pemeriksa Struktur Resume","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"Pemeriksa Resume ATS — Semakan PDF & DOCX Tempatan Percuma","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Semak teks resume, tajuk, bahagian, pautan dan struktur titik dalam penyemak imbas anda. Bandingkan istilah perihalan kerja mengikut kiraan; tiada skor pengambilan pekerja atau muat naik.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Semak perkara yang sebenarnya didedahkan oleh resume berasaskan teks: teks yang diekstrak, struktur tajuk, kehadiran medan kenalan, pautan dan bahagian yang biasa dikenali. Secara pilihan, bandingkan istilah perihalan kerja yang berulang.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"A DOCX dengan Tajuk 1 gaya untuk Pengalaman dan Pendidikan menunjukkan tajuk tersebut. PDF disemak daripada teks yang boleh dipilih; lajur boleh dibaca dalam susunan yang berbeza.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"Fail DOCX diperiksa secara setempat sebagai Office ZIP/XML. PDF dibaca dengan enjin PDF.js tempatan tertunda. Perbandingan huraian kerja pilihan mengira istilah yang dipilih dalam setiap teks; ia tidak mencipta skor atau mengesyorkan sama ada untuk mengupah seseorang.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Ini ialah semakan format dan struktur teks, bukan simulator ATS, semakan undang-undang atau ramalan kejayaan temu duga. PDF yang diimbas tanpa teks boleh dipilih memerlukan OCR terlebih dahulu. Dokumen yang dilindungi kata laluan, didayakan makro, ditandatangani atau luar biasa besar tidak disokong.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Pilih resume (PDF atau DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Fail anda kekal dalam penyemak imbas ini dan tidak dimuat naik. Maksimum 20 MB; PDF sehingga 50 muka surat. Kandungan dikembangkan DOCX dihadkan pada 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Penerangan kerja pilihan","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Tampal teks biasa jika anda mahukan perbandingan kekerapan istilah. Jangan sertakan maklumat sensitif yang anda tidak perlu analisa.","Paste job-description text here…":"Tampal teks huraian kerja di sini…","Analyze locally":"Analisis setempat","Clear files and report":"Kosongkan fail dan laporan","Resume review":"Sambung semula semakan","File type":"Jenis fail","Extracted characters":"Aksara yang diekstrak","Words counted":"Perkataan dikira","Detected headings":"Tajuk yang dikesan","Recognized sections":"Bahagian yang dikenali","Hyperlinks found":"Hiperpautan ditemui","Bullet paragraphs":"Perenggan peluru","An email address appears in the text":"Alamat e-mel muncul dalam teks","No email address pattern was detected":"Tiada corak alamat e-mel dikesan","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Corak seperti nombor telefon muncul dalam teks","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Tiada corak seperti nombor telefon dikesan","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Syarat perihalan kerja (kiraan sahaja)","Term":"Tempoh","In job text":"Dalam teks kerja","In resume":"Dalam resume","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Tampal huraian kerja untuk membandingkan kiraan penggal.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Tiada gaya tajuk yang jelas dikesan. Tajuk PDF dianggarkan daripada saiz teks dan mungkin tidak tepat.","Detected":"Dikesan","Not detected":"Tidak dikesan","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Heuristik ini mengiktiraf set terhad nama bahagian biasa; ia tidak menentukan bahagian mana yang diperlukan.","Profile / summary":"Profil / ringkasan","Experience":"Pengalaman","Education":"Pendidikan","Skills":"Kemahiran","Contact":"Hubungi","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Tiada teks boleh pilih ditemui. PDF yang diimbas sahaja memerlukan OCR sebelum ia boleh disemak.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Pilih resume PDF atau DOCX untuk bermula.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Membaca fail yang dipilih secara setempat…","Local structure review complete.":"Semakan struktur tempatan selesai.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Pelayar ini tidak menyokong ciri dokumen setempat yang diperlukan.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Pilih PDF yang sah atau fail DOCX moden sehingga had setempat yang dinyatakan.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF tidak dapat dibaca. Ia mungkin rosak, disulitkan atau tidak mengandungi teks yang boleh dipilih.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Pakej DOCX tidak dapat dibuka atau dibaca dengan selamat.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Adakah alat ini memuat naik atau menyimpan resume saya?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"No. Penghuraian dan analisis dijalankan dalam penyemak imbas anda. Teks fail tidak dihantar ke pelayan atau disimpan selepas anda mengosongkan laporan atau meninggalkan halaman.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Adakah ia meramalkan sama ada ATS atau majikan akan menerima resume saya?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"No. Ia menyemak teks yang boleh dibaca dan struktur ringkas sahaja. Sistem pengambilan pekerja berbeza, dan ini bukan jaminan keserasian ATS atau ramalan pengambilan pekerja.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Bolehkah ia membaca PDF yang diimbas?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Hanya jika PDF mempunyai lapisan teks yang boleh dipilih. Penyemak ini tidak memuat turun model OCR; gunakan alat OCR dahulu untuk dokumen imej sahaja yang diimbas.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Apakah yang dimaksudkan dengan perbandingan perihalan kerja?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Ia menunjukkan kiraan untuk istilah berulang selepas penormalan mudah. Ia bukan peratusan perlawanan, kedudukan, pengesyoran atau penilaian kelayakan anda.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Mengapa PDF menunjukkan lebih sedikit tajuk daripada DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF biasanya tidak mengekalkan gaya tajuk semantik. Pemeriksa menganggarkan baris yang menonjol daripada saiz teks dan susunan bacaan, jadi lajur dan reka bentuk visual boleh menjejaskan hasilnya.","How local resume review works":"Cara semakan resume tempatan berfungsi","Resume checker questions":"Sambung semula soalan penyemak","Scope and limitations":"Skop dan had","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Pemisah Vokal dan Iringan Tempatan","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Penyingkiran Vokal — Asingkan Vokal dan Iringan Secara Tempatan","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Asingkan sampel audio stereo pendek kepada anggaran vokal dan iringan dalam penyemak imbas anda. Audio kekal pada peranti anda; model dimuat turun daripada hos awamnya.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Pilih klip muzik stereo sehingga 30 saat. Pada penggunaan pertama, penyemak imbas memuat turun model 35.6 MB. Fail audio diproses pada peranti ini dan tidak pernah dimuat naik.","What you get":"Apa yang anda dapat","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Pratonton dan muat turun dua batang WAV: anggaran vokal dan baki iringan. Keputusan bergantung pada campuran dan mungkin mengandungi artifak.","Local processing":"Pemprosesan tempatan","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Alat ini menggunakan rangkaian vokal Open-Unmix UMX-HQ yang dieksport ke ONNX dan ONNX Runtime Web. Model diambil hanya apabila anda menekan Separate; tiada API inferens berbayar atau langganan digunakan. Audio dinyahkod, diproses dan dieksport secara tempatan.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Ini ialah anggaran untuk pemprosesan stereo 44.1 kHz dan klip sehingga 30 saat. Sumber mono diduakan kepada stereo. Vokal bercampur mendalam ke dalam instrumen, kesan berat, rakaman langsung dan genre luar biasa boleh menghasilkan kebocoran atau artifak. Jangan gunakan hasilnya sebagai tuan yang bersih. Muat turun model memerlukan sambungan internet; audio tidak meninggalkan peranti ini.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Adakah audio saya dimuat naik?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"No. Audio yang dipilih dinyahkod dan diproses dalam penyemak imbas anda. Satu-satunya permintaan rangkaian ialah muat turun model apabila anda memulakan pemisahan.","Why is the first run slow?":"Mengapa larian pertama perlahan?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Pelayar memuat turun model 35.6 MB sekali; penyemak imbas mungkin cachenya. Inferens kemudian berjalan secara setempat pada CPU peranti.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Adakah setiap lagu akan dipisahkan dengan bersih?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"No. Model menganggarkan batang vokal dan mungkin meninggalkan kebocoran vokal, mengeluarkan harmonik instrumen atau mencipta artifak. Dengar sebelum bergantung pada batang.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Fail audio stereo (sehingga 30 saat)","Choose audio":"Pilih audio","Separate vocals":"Vokal berasingan","Cancel / clear":"Batal / kosongkan","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Pilih fail audio pendek untuk bermula.","Downloading the separation model…":"Memuat turun model pengasingan…","Separating locally…":"Memisahkan secara setempat…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Pemisahan selesai. Pratonton atau muat turun sama ada batang.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Tidak dapat memproses fail ini atau memuatkan model. Semak format dan sambungan, kemudian cuba lagi.","Model and weight license information":"Model dan maklumat lesen berat","Estimated vocals":"Anggaran vokal","Estimated accompaniment":"Anggaran iringan","Download WAV":"Muat turun WAV","Progress":"Kemajuan","Preparing local separation…":"Menyediakan pemisahan setempat…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Pemisahan selesai. Audio kekal pada peranti ini.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Audio ini tidak dapat diproses. Cuba fail muzik stereo di bawah 30 saat.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Pembanding Boleh Potong Insurans Kesihatan Switzerland","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Kalkulator Francais Insurans Kesihatan Switzerland — Bandingkan Kos Tahunan","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Bandingkan potongan insurans kesihatan asas Switzerland menggunakan premium dan kos perubatan tahunan yang layak yang anda masukkan. Tiada sebut harga syarikat insurans dijangka.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Masukkan premium bulanan yang ditunjukkan oleh penanggung insurans yang sama untuk setiap potongan yang ditawarkannya, kemudian bandingkan senario kos rawatan tahunan yang rendah, dijangka dan tinggi.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Untuk insurans kesihatan asas Switzerland yang wajib, potongan standard dewasa ialah CHF 300 dan boleh ditolak kanak-kanak ialah CHF 0. Tahap pilihan berbeza mengikut kumpulan umur. Selepas ditolak, yuran pengekalan standard ialah 10% daripada baki kos yang layak, dihadkan pada CHF 700 setahun untuk orang dewasa dan CHF 350 untuk kanak-kanak. Alat ini menambahkan premium yang anda masukkan kepada perkongsian kos model ini; ia tidak mengambil kadar penanggung insurans atau memutuskan pilihan yang sesuai untuk anda.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Jika seorang dewasa memasuki premium bulanan CHF 400 pada potongan CHF 300 dan CHF 350 pada potongan CHF 2,500, perbezaan premium tahunan ialah CHF 600. Bandingkan penjimatan itu dengan perbezaan model dalam perkongsian kos pada setiap jumlah kos layak anda yang rendah, dijangka dan tinggi.","How the estimate works":"Cara anggaran berfungsi","Common questions":"Soalan biasa","Scope and exclusions":"Skop dan pengecualian","Where do I get the premiums?":"Di manakah saya boleh mendapatkan premium?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Gunakan tawaran bulanan semasa untuk penanggung insurans, rantau premium, kumpulan umur, perlindungan kemalangan dan model insurans yang sama. Priminfo ialah tapak perbandingan rasmi persekutuan. Halaman ini tidak mengambil atau mengeluarkan semula sebut harga syarikat insurans.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Adakah semua peringkat boleh ditolak tersenarai sentiasa ditawarkan?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"No. Penanggung insurans tidak perlu menawarkan setiap peringkat pilihan, dan tawaran boleh berbeza untuk dewasa muda. Masukkan hanya premium yang ditunjukkan untuk polisi anda sendiri; biarkan pilihan yang tidak tersedia kosong.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Adakah ini menunjukkan bil perubatan saya yang lengkap?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"No. Model ini meliputi yuran pengekalan boleh ditolak biasa dan 10% standard ke atas kos yang layak. Ia tidak termasuk caruman hari hospital, pengekalan ubat khas 40%, perkhidmatan terkecuali, penjagaan tidak dilindungi dan insurans tambahan.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Ini adalah perbandingan senario, bukan nasihat insurans, perubatan atau kewangan. Ia tidak meramalkan rawatan atau premium anda. Ia tidak termasuk caruman hari hospital (biasanya CHF 15 setiap hari pesakit dalam, dengan pengecualian berkanun), pengekalan khas 40% ke atas ubat-ubatan tertentu, pengecualian bersalin/pencegahan, perkhidmatan di luar perlindungan wajib, subsidi premium dan insurans tambahan. Oleh itu, pembayaran bersama sebenar boleh berbeza. Deduktibel yang lebih tinggi bermakna anda perlu membayar lebih awal jika anda menerima penjagaan.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Siapa yang diinsuranskan di bawah polisi ini?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Dewasa (umur 19 ke atas)","Child (under 18)":"Kanak-kanak (bawah 18)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Senario kos rawatan layak tahunan rendah (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Kos rawatan layak tahunan (CHF) dijangka","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Senario kos rawatan layak tahunan (CHF) yang tinggi","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Premium bulanan daripada satu syarikat insurans","Monthly premium":"Premium bulanan","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Masukkan hanya pilihan yang ditawarkan untuk dasar yang sama ini. Biarkan yang lain kosong.","Adult deductible choices":"Pilihan boleh ditolak dewasa","Child deductible choices":"Pilihan boleh ditolak kanak-kanak","Compare annual costs":"Bandingkan kos tahunan","Clear entries":"Kosongkan entri","Download CSV":"Muat turun CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Anggaran premium tahunan ditambah perkongsian kos","Deductible":"Boleh ditolak","Annual premiums":"Premium tahunan","Total at low costs":"Jumlah pada kos rendah","Total at expected costs":"Jumlah pada kos yang dijangkakan","Total at high costs":"Jumlah pada kos yang tinggi","Cost sharing at low costs":"Perkongsian kos pada kos rendah","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Perkongsian kos pada kos yang dijangkakan","Cost sharing at high costs":"Perkongsian kos pada kos yang tinggi","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Perbezaan daripada potongan terendah yang tersedia","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Kos perubatan di mana penjimatan premium digunakan","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Penjimatan premium yang dimasukkan tidak dibatalkan dalam julat perkongsian kos yang dimodelkan.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Tiada penjimatan premium berbanding deduktibel terendah.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Jumlah jangkaan terendah antara pilihan yang dimasukkan","Scenario details":"Butiran senario","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Masukkan tiga senario kos perubatan yang dipesan dan premium bulanan untuk sekurang-kurangnya dua deduktibel yang tersedia.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Peraturan rasmi dan premium semasa:","Federal deductible rules":"Peraturan boleh ditolak persekutuan","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Perbandingan premium rasmi Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Perbandingan dikira dalam penyemak imbas ini.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Semak kumpulan umur, senario kos tersusun dan sekurang-kurangnya dua premium bulanan.","Entries cleared.":"Entri dikosongkan.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV dimuat turun secara tempatan.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Kalkulator Pengurangan Premium Kesihatan Switzerland","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Kalkulator Subsidi Premium Swiss — Premium Bersih Anda","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Kira premium insurans kesihatan Swiss bersih daripada premium semasa dan pengurangan bulanan yang telah diberikan oleh kanton anda.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Masukkan premium dan disahkan pengurangan bulanan daripada syarikat insurans atau keputusan kantonal anda. Alat ini tidak menentukan sama ada anda layak.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Kanton Switzerland menentukan siapa yang layak, jumlah sokongan yang diberikan dan sama ada permohonan diperlukan. Kalkulator ini hanya menolak pengurangan bulanan yang disahkan daripada satu premium polisi dan menunjukkan jumlah tahunan.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Jika premium bulanan ialah CHF 420 dan pengurangan yang disahkan ialah CHF 120, anggaran premium bersih ialah CHF 300 sebulan.","How the calculation works":"Cara pengiraan berfungsi","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Adakah ini memberitahu saya sama ada saya layak?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"No. Kelayakan dan jumlah anugerah ditentukan oleh kanton kediaman. Gunakan maklumat rasmi yang dipautkan atau hubungi pejabat cantonal.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Di manakah saya boleh mencari jumlah pengurangan?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Gunakan keputusan semasa atau pengurangan premium yang ditunjukkan oleh syarikat insurans anda. Sesetengah kanton memberikan pengurangan secara automatik; yang lain memerlukan permohonan.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Ini adalah aritmetik untuk satu polisi, bukan keputusan kelayakan atau faedah. Ia tidak mengira pendapatan isi rumah, aset, status keluarga, tarikh akhir, ambang cantonal atau hak permohonan. Premium dan anugerah boleh berubah; sahkan mereka dengan syarikat insurans dan canton anda.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Premium bulanan semasa (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Pengurangan bulanan sudah diberikan (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Masukkan jumlah yang disahkan oleh kanton atau syarikat insurans; jangan gunakan anggaran sebagai anugerah.","Calculate net premium":"Kira premium bersih","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Masukkan premium semasa dan pengurangan yang disahkan.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Anggaran premium selepas pengurangan","Current monthly premium":"Premium bulanan semasa","Monthly reduction":"Pengurangan bulanan","Estimated net monthly premium":"Anggaran premium bulanan bersih","Reduction over 12 months":"Pengurangan selama 12 bulan","Reduction as a share of premium":"Pengurangan sebagai bahagian premium","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Pengiraan selesai. Sahkan anugerah dan tarikh berkuat kuasa dengan canton dan syarikat insurans anda.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Semak sama ada pengurangan tidak lebih besar daripada premium bulanan.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Kalkulator Senario Kadar Rujukan Sewa Switzerland","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Kalkulator Pelarasan Sewa Switzerland — Senario Kadar Rujukan","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Anggarkan hanya bagaimana perubahan dalam kadar rujukan gadai janji Switzerland mempengaruhi sewa bersih kediaman. Gunakan kadar terkini daripada pejabat perumahan persekutuan.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Bandingkan kadar rujukan yang dinyatakan dalam pajakan atau notis sewa terkini anda dengan kadar rasmi Switzerland semasa. Pengiraan kekal pada peranti anda.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Pejabat Persekutuan untuk Perumahan menerbitkan satu kadar rujukan gadai janji untuk pelarasan sewa Switzerland setiap suku tahun. Peningkatan 0.25 mata peratusan pada dasarnya boleh membenarkan kenaikan sewa sebanyak 3%; penurunan 0.25 mata pada dasarnya boleh membenarkan pengurangan sebanyak 2.91%. Senario ini menggunakan perubahan tersebut langkah demi langkah pada sewa bersih yang anda masukkan.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Untuk CHF 3,000 sewa bersih bulanan, penurunan kadar rujukan daripada 1.75% kepada 1.50% memberikan anggaran perubahan kadar rujukan sahaja kira-kira −CHF 87.38 sebulan (−2.91%).","How this estimate works":"Cara anggaran ini berfungsi","Where do I find the current rate?":"Di manakah saya boleh mencari kadar semasa?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Buka halaman Pejabat Persekutuan untuk Perumahan yang dipautkan dan masukkan kadar yang diterbitkan semasa. Alat ini tidak membenamkan kadar yang boleh menjadi lapuk.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Adakah ini menentukan sama ada saya boleh meminta pertukaran sewa?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"No. Ia mengasingkan satu faktor untuk orientasi. Kontrak anda, inflasi, perubahan kos, tempahan dan syarat undang-undang lain boleh mengubah keputusan.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Adakah hasilnya termasuk kos sampingan?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"No. Masukkan sewa bersih bulanan, tidak termasuk kos sampingan dan caj berubah-ubah lain.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Hasilnya ialah senario kadar rujukan ilustrasi, bukan pendapat undang-undang atau semakan sewa yang lengkap. Ia tidak termasuk inflasi, perubahan kos am, penambahbaikan, tempahan kontrak, sewa diindeks atau berperingkat, tarikh notis dan prosedur cantonal. Semak pajakan anda dan panduan rasmi sebelum bertindak.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Pajakan kediaman Switzerland: anggaran kesan kadar rujukan gadai janji sahaja. Ia bukan keputusan undang-undang atau semakan sewa penuh.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Sewa bersih bulanan semasa (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Kadar rujukan dinyatakan dalam pajakan anda atau notis sewa terkini (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Kadar rujukan Switzerland rasmi semasa (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Kira senario kadar rujukan","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Senario kadar rujukan sahaja","Current monthly net rent":"Sewa bersih bulanan semasa","Reference-rate change":"Perubahan kadar rujukan","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Anggaran kesan bulanan daripada kadar rujukan","Scenario monthly net rent":"Senario sewa bersih bulanan","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Kesan tahunan selama 12 bulan pada kadar yang sama","potential increase":"potensi peningkatan","potential decrease":"potensi penurunan","no reference-rate change":"tiada perubahan kadar rujukan","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Anggaran menggunakan 3% untuk setiap peningkatan 0.25 mata peratusan dan pengurangan songsang yang setara untuk setiap penurunan. Faktor lain boleh mengubah hasilnya.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Ini tidak termasuk inflasi, perubahan kos am, penambahbaikan, tempahan kontrak, sewa diindeks atau berperingkat, tarikh notis atau keperluan prosedur tempatan. Semak pajakan anda dan panduan Pejabat Persekutuan untuk Perumahan.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Semak kadar dan panduan rasmi terkini","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Pejabat Persekutuan Switzerland untuk Perumahan (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Masukkan sewa dan kedua-dua kadar untuk melihat senario.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Senario dikira. Sahkan tarikh dan terma kontrak sebelum bergantung padanya.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Semak amaun dan kadar. Kadar mestilah antara 0% dan 5% dan berbeza dalam langkah 0.25 mata.","Inputs cleared.":"Input dikosongkan.","Result":"Hasil","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Penganggar Akruan Percutian Switzerland","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Kalkulator Akruan Percutian Switzerland — Baki Cuti Prorata","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Anggarkan baki hari percutian Switzerland daripada cuti tahunan dalam kontrak anda, minggu kerja, tarikh pekerjaan dan hari yang telah diambil.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Anggaran cuti berbayar prorata untuk satu tahun kalendar menggunakan kelayakan dan jadual kerja yang anda masukkan. Tiada syarat kontrak dapat diduga.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Penganggar meratakan hari cuti tahunan dalam kontrak anda mengikut hari kalendar yang diambil bekerja pada tahun yang dipilih. Untuk kerja sambilan, masukkan hari bekerja biasa anda setiap minggu dan cuti tahunan dalam beberapa minggu.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Dengan cuti empat minggu, lima hari seminggu bekerja dan pekerjaan sepanjang tahun, kelayakan tahunan ialah 20 hari bekerja sebelum menolak cuti yang telah diambil.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Apakah minimum berkanun Switzerland?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Panduan persekutuan menyatakan sekurang-kurangnya empat minggu setiap tahun perkhidmatan, dan lima minggu untuk pekerja yang belum mencapai umur 20 tahun. Kontrak atau perjanjian kolektif mungkin memberikan lebih.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Adakah ini menentukan baki sah saya?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"No. Ia adalah proration hari kalendar yang mudah. Terma kontrak, peraturan kolektif yang berkenaan, ketidakhadiran kelayakan, penggenapan dan rekod majikan boleh mengubah baki.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Anggaran ini tidak menentukan kelayakan undang-undang atau mengira gaji percutian. Ia tidak termasuk pengurangan untuk ketidakhadiran berpanjangan tertentu, peraturan akruan dan pembundaran khusus kontrak, cuti umum, lebih masa, tarikh akhir pemindahan dan pertikaian. Semak kontrak anda dan dapatkan nasihat untuk baki yang dipertikaikan.","Leave year":"Tahun cuti","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Cuti tahunan dalam kontrak anda (minggu)","Usual working days per week":"Hari bekerja biasa setiap minggu","Employment start date":"Tarikh mula pekerjaan","Employment end date":"Tarikh tamat pekerjaan","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Hari cuti sudah diambil dalam tahun cuti ini","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Untuk orientasi sahaja. Masukkan kelayakan tahunan kontrak; minimum undang-undang biasanya empat minggu, atau lima minggu untuk pekerja di bawah 20 tahun.","Estimate balance":"Anggaran baki","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Masukkan kontrak dan tarikh anda untuk menganggarkan baki.","Estimated leave balance":"Anggaran baki cuti","Annual leave at this schedule":"Cuti tahunan mengikut jadual ini","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Hari kalendar digunakan dalam tahun cuti ini","Prorated days accrued":"Hari prorata terakru","Days already taken":"Hari sudah diambil","Estimated days remaining":"Anggaran hari lagi","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Ini prorata cuti tahunan mengikut hari kalendar dalam tempoh pekerjaan. Peraturan majikan dan kontrak mungkin berbeza.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Anggaran dikira. Semak dengan rekod kontrak dan majikan anda.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Semak tahun, tarikh, jadual kerja dan nilai."},"pl":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Scenariusz zasiłku dla bezrobotnych w Szwajcarii","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Szwajcarski kalkulator zasiłku dla bezrobotnych — scenariusz brutto","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Oszacuj szwajcarską kwotę dzienną brutto, korzystając z ubezpieczonego wynagrodzenia i stawki potwierdzonej przez Twój fundusz.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Wprowadź ubezpieczone wynagrodzenie i stawkę 70% lub 80% potwierdzoną przez kasę bezrobotnych.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Szwajcarskie przepisy określają stawkę zasiłku i górny limit wynagrodzenia. Fundusz decyduje o kwalifikowalności, odliczeniach, dniach oczekiwania i uprawnieniach. Przedział miesięczny odzwierciedla 20–23 płatne dni tygodnia.","Example":"Przykład","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5000 CHF przy stawce 70% to około 161,29 CHF za płatny dzień powszedni.","How it works":"Jak to działa","Questions":"Pytania","Scope and limits":"Zakres i ograniczenia","Related tools":"Powiązane narzędzia","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Miesięczne wynagrodzenie objęte ubezpieczeniem (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Kurs potwierdzony przez fundusz","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Oszacowanie","Clear":"Wyczyść","Gross scenario":"Scenariusz brutto","Insured salary used":"Wykorzystano ubezpieczone wynagrodzenie","Per payable weekday":"Za płatny dzień powszedni","20-day month":"20-dniowy miesiąc","23-day month":"23-dniowy miesiąc","Official benefit rules":"Oficjalne zasady świadczeń","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Wprowadź potwierdzone dane.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Scenariusz obliczony. Potwierdź kwoty w swoim funduszu.","Check the values.":"Sprawdź wartości.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Szwajcarski planista zawiadomień o najmie","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Szwajcarski planista zawiadomień o wynajmie i projekt listu","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Zaplanuj wypowiedzenie najmu na podstawie dat i warunków zawartych we własnej umowie; napisać list bez przyjmowania zasad kantonu.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Wprowadź okres wypowiedzenia, następny ważny dzień rozwiązania umowy i datę otrzymania. Sprawdzaj każdą datę u wynajmującego lub stowarzyszenia najemców.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Planista uwzględnia tylko podane przez Ciebie daty i okres. Nie decyduje o tym, czy zawiadomienie jest ważne, kiedy zostało zgodnie z prawem otrzymane i czy obowiązuje szczególna ochrona.","Contract notice period (months)":"Okres wypowiedzenia umowy (miesiące)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Następny ważny dzień zakończenia miesiąca (z umowy)","Expected receipt date":"Oczekiwana data odbioru","Your name":"Twoje imię i nazwisko","Your address":"Twój adres","Landlord / agency":"Właściciel / agencja","Recipient address":"Adres odbiorcy","Rental property":"Nieruchomość do wynajęcia","Place":"Miejsce","Letter date":"Data listu","Termination of tenancy":"Wypowiedzenie umowy najmu","Calculate date and draft letter":"Oblicz datę i wersję roboczą listu","Planning date":"Data planowania","Target date":"Data docelowa","Editable draft":"Edytowalna wersja robocza","Copy draft":"Skopiuj wersję roboczą","Enter your contract terms.":"Wprowadź warunki umowy.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Projekt planu gotowy. Sprawdź, czy zgadzasz się z umową.","Check the dates and period.":"Sprawdź daty i okres.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Wynik następuje po dostarczonym dniu ogłoszenia o zamówieniu; nie jest to ustawowe orzeczenie w sprawie zawiadomienia.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Scenariusz zysków ze szwajcarskiej nieruchomości","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Szwajcarski podatek od zysków z nieruchomości — scenariusz stawki wprowadzony przez użytkownika","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Oszacuj zysk z nieruchomości, korzystając z własnych kosztów transakcyjnych i stawki podatku obowiązującej w odpowiednim kantonie.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Wprowadź przychody, koszt nabycia, potwierdzone wydatki kwalifikowane i efektywną stawkę z oficjalnego kalkulatora kantonalnego.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Szwajcarski podatek od zysków z nieruchomości różni się w zależności od kantonu, okresu posiadania majątku, odliczeń i przypadku. Narzędzie to nie podaje stawek ani nie określa kosztów dopuszczalnych.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Przychody ze sprzedaży (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Koszt nabycia (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Inne koszty potwierdzone dopuszczalne (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Efektywna stawka podatku z oficjalnego źródła (%)","Estimate scenario":"Scenariusz szacunkowy","Illustrative scenario":"Scenariusz ilustracyjny","Gain entered":"Wprowadzono wzmocnienie","Tax at entered rate":"Podatek według wprowadzonej stawki","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Wprowadź dane ze swoich rejestrów i źródła kantonu.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Scenariusz obliczony; sprawdź to w kantonie.","Check amounts and rate.":"Sprawdź kwoty i stawkę.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Nie osadzono tabeli podatków kantonowych; wprowadzona efektywna stopa procentowa wpływa na oszacowanie.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Scenariusz szwajcarskiego podatku od spadków i darowizn","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Szwajcarski podatek od spadków i darowizn — Twój scenariusz stawkowy","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Oszacuj kwotę podlegającą opodatkowaniu na podstawie wprowadzonego przez użytkownika zwolnienia i stawki; zasady różnią się w zależności od kantonu i związku.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Wprowadź kwotę, zwolnienie i stawkę efektywną potwierdzoną dla odbiorcy i kantonu.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Przepisy kantonu i powiązania rodzinne mogą zmieniać zwolnienia i stawki. To narzędzie nie wybiera reguły kantonu ani nie określa zobowiązania podatkowego.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Kwota spadku lub darowizny (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Zwolnienie potwierdzone w kantonie (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Efektywna stawka potwierdzona w kantonie (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Kwota po wprowadzeniu zwolnienia","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Wprowadź liczby potwierdzone dla Twojego przypadku.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"W szacunkach uwzględniane jest wyłącznie wprowadzone zwolnienie i stawka.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Scenariusz szwajcarskiego budżetu na alimenty","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Szwajcarski budżet na alimenty — przejrzysty scenariusz gospodarstwa domowego","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Przydziel wprowadzony budżet dziecka według dochodów rodziców po wprowadzeniu ulgi na koszty bezpośrednie.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Wykorzystaj udokumentowane miesięczne potrzeby dziecka, dostępne miesięczne dochody obojga rodziców i wszelkie koszty bezpośrednie, które chcesz zaliczyć.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"To jest wyłącznie arkusz planowania. Nie jest to szwajcarskie świadczenie alimentacyjne ani metoda prawna; mieszkalnictwo, opieka, podatki, świadczenia i orzecznictwo nie są poddawane ocenie.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Udokumentowany miesięczny budżet dziecka (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Rodzic A dostępny miesięczny dochód (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Dostępny miesięczny dochód rodzica B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Bezpośrednie koszty dziecka opłacane przez Rodzica A na kredyt (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Przydziel scenariusz","Illustrative allocation":"Przydział ilustracyjny","Parent A remaining contribution":"Nadrzędny Pozostały wkład","Parent B contribution":"Wkład rodzica B","Entered monthly child budget":"Wprowadzono miesięczny budżet podrzędny","Enter your household budget figures.":"Wprowadź dane dotyczące budżetu domowego.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Obliczony scenariusz budżetowy; omówić zobowiązania prawne z wykwalifikowanym doradcą.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Sprawdź kwoty; kredyt nie może przekroczyć budżetu.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Udziały są proporcjonalne do dwóch wprowadzonych dochodów; w pierwszej kolejności odejmuje się kredyt na koszty bezpośrednie.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Podgląd dzielenia wyrazów w przeglądarce","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Podgląd dzielenia wyrazów — wzorce językowe przeglądarki","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Podgląd dzielenia tekstu w przeglądarce; obsługa zależy od przeglądarki i zainstalowanych zasobów językowych.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Wybierz język pasujący do Twojego tekstu, wprowadź próbkę i dostosuj dostępną szerokość linii.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Używa natywnego dzielenia wyrazów CSS przeglądarki. Nie łączy słowników; nieobsługiwane przeglądarki mogą nie wyświetlać łączników. Kopiowanie tekstu powoduje zachowanie oryginalnej pisowni.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Język tekstowy (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Szerokość podglądu (znaki)","Text to preview":"Tekst do podglądu","Preview":"Zapowiedź","Enter text and choose its language.":"Wpisz tekst i wybierz jego język.","Preview updated.":"Podgląd zaktualizowany.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Wprowadź znacznik i tekst obsługiwanego języka.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Wypróbuj ten sam akapit w różnych szerokościach, aby zobaczyć, gdzie przeglądarka może dzielić słowa.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Prywatny obszar roboczy sprawdzania pisowni","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Lokalny moduł sprawdzania pisowni — użyj słownika przeglądarki","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Edytuj tekst za pomocą natywnego sprawdzania pisowni w przeglądarce, wybierz język i skopiuj poprawiony tekst.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Tekst pozostaje na tej stronie. Ustaw język, dla którego Twoja przeglądarka ma słownik pisowni, a następnie skorzystaj z menu pisowni lub sugestii podkreślenia.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"W tym obszarze roboczym nie można przesyłać tekstu ani dostarczać słowników. Dostępność i sugestie sprawdzania pisowni w przeglądarce zależą od urządzenia, przeglądarki i zainstalowanego słownika.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Język sprawdzania pisowni (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Tekst do sprawdzenia","Copy text":"Kopiuj tekst","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Wpisz lub wklej tekst. Kliknij prawym przyciskiem myszy lub skorzystaj z menu pisowni urządzenia, aby uzyskać sugestie.","Text copied.":"Tekst skopiowany.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Nie można skopiować automatycznie; wybierz i skopiuj tekst.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Przeglądarka bez odpowiedniego słownika może nie oznaczać błędów ortograficznych.","Resume Structure Checker":"Wznów sprawdzanie struktury","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Sprawdzanie CV — bezpłatna lokalna recenzja w formacie PDF i DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Sprawdź tekst CV, nagłówki, sekcje, linki i strukturę punktorów w swojej przeglądarce. Porównaj terminy opisujące stanowisko według liczby; brak wyników rekrutacji lub przesyłania.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Przejrzyj, co tak naprawdę ujawnia CV w formie tekstowej: wyodrębniony tekst, strukturę nagłówków, obecność w polu kontaktowym, linki i powszechnie rozpoznawane sekcje. Opcjonalnie porównaj powtarzające się terminy opisujące stanowisko.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"A DOCX ze stylami nagłówka 1 dla Doświadczenie i Edukacja pokazuje te nagłówki. Plik PDF jest sprawdzany na podstawie wybranego tekstu; kolumny można czytać w innej kolejności.\nPliki","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX są sprawdzane lokalnie w formacie Office ZIP/XML. Pliki PDF są odczytywane za pomocą odroczonego lokalnego silnika PDF.js. Opcjonalne porównanie opisów stanowisk liczy wybrane terminy w każdym tekście; nie tworzy oceny ani nie zaleca, czy kogoś zatrudnić.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"To jest sprawdzenie formatu i struktury tekstu, a nie symulator ATS, ocena prawna czy przewidywanie powodzenia rozmowy kwalifikacyjnej. Zeskanowane pliki PDF bez tekstu do zaznaczenia wymagają najpierw OCR. Dokumenty chronione hasłem, z włączoną obsługą makr, podpisane lub o wyjątkowo dużych rozmiarach nie są obsługiwane.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Wybierz CV (PDF lub DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Twoje pliki pozostają w tej przeglądarce i nie są przesyłane. Maksymalnie 20 MB; PDF do 50 stron. Rozszerzona zawartość DOCX jest ograniczona do 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Opcjonalny opis stanowiska","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Wklej zwykły tekst, jeśli chcesz porównać termin z częstotliwością. Nie podawaj wrażliwych informacji, których nie musisz analizować.","Paste job-description text here…":"Wklej tutaj tekst opisu stanowiska…","Analyze locally":"Analizuj lokalnie","Clear files and report":"Wyczyść pliki i raport","Resume review":"Wznów recenzję","File type":"Typ pliku","Extracted characters":"Wyodrębnione znaki","Words counted":"Słowa policzone","Detected headings":"Wykryto nagłówki","Recognized sections":"Rozpoznane sekcje","Hyperlinks found":"Znaleziono hiperłącza","Bullet paragraphs":"Akapity punktowane","An email address appears in the text":"W tekście pojawi się adres e-mail","No email address pattern was detected":"Nie wykryto wzorca adresu e-mail","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"W tekście pojawia się wzór przypominający numer telefonu","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Nie wykryto wzorca przypominającego numer telefonu","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Warunki opisu stanowiska (tylko się liczy)","Term":"Termin","In job text":"W tekście stanowiska","In resume":"W CV","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Wklej opis stanowiska, aby porównać liczbę kadencji.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Nie wykryto wyraźnych stylów nagłówków. Nagłówki plików PDF są szacowane na podstawie rozmiaru tekstu i mogą być niedokładne.","Detected":"Wykryto","Not detected":"Nie wykryto","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Ta heurystyka rozpoznaje ograniczony zestaw wspólnych nazw sekcji; nie decyduje, które sekcje są wymagane.","Profile / summary":"Profil / podsumowanie","Experience":"Doświadczenie","Education":"Edukacja","Skills":"Umiejętności","Contact":"Kontakt","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Nie znaleziono tekstu do zaznaczenia. Zeskanowane pliki PDF wymagają OCR, zanim będą mogły zostać sprawdzone.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Aby rozpocząć, wybierz CV w formacie PDF lub DOCX.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Odczytywanie wybranego pliku lokalnie…","Local structure review complete.":"Zakończono przegląd struktury lokalnej.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Ta przeglądarka nie obsługuje wymaganej funkcji dokumentu lokalnego.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Wybierz prawidłowy plik PDF lub nowoczesny plik DOCX zgodnie z podanymi lokalnymi limitami.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"Nie można odczytać pliku PDF. Może być uszkodzony, zaszyfrowany lub nie zawierać tekstu do wyboru.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Nie można bezpiecznie otworzyć lub odczytać pakietu DOCX.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Czy to narzędzie przesyła lub zapisuje moje CV?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Nie. Parsowanie i analiza działają w Twojej przeglądarce. Tekst pliku nie jest wysyłany na serwer ani zachowywany po wyczyszczeniu raportu lub opuszczeniu strony.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Czy przewiduje, czy ATS lub pracodawca zaakceptuje moje CV?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Nie. Sprawdza tylko czytelny tekst i prostą strukturę. Systemy zatrudniania są różne i nie jest to gwarancja zgodności z ATS ani prognoza zatrudnienia.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Czy może odczytać zeskanowany plik PDF?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Tylko jeśli plik PDF ma wybieralną warstwę tekstową. Ten moduł sprawdzający nie pobiera modeli OCR; w przypadku dokumentu zawierającego wyłącznie zeskanowany obraz użyj najpierw narzędzia OCR.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Co oznacza porównanie opisu stanowiska pracy?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Pokazuje liczbę terminów powtarzających się po prostej normalizacji. Nie jest to procent dopasowania, ranking, rekomendacja ani ocena Twoich kwalifikacji.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Dlaczego plik PDF zawiera mniej nagłówków niż plik DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"Pliki PDF zwykle nie zachowują semantycznych stylów nagłówków. Moduł sprawdzający szacuje widoczne linie na podstawie rozmiaru tekstu i kolejności czytania, więc kolumny i wygląd mogą mieć wpływ na wynik.","How local resume review works":"Jak działa lokalna recenzja CV","Resume checker questions":"Wznów pytania sprawdzające","Scope and limitations":"Zakres i ograniczenia","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Lokalny separator wokalu i akompaniamentu","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Usuwanie wokalu — lokalnie oddzielne wokale i akompaniament","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Podziel w przeglądarce krótką próbkę dźwięku stereo na szacunkowe wokale i akompaniament. Dźwięk pozostaje na Twoim urządzeniu; model jest pobierany z publicznego hosta.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Wybierz klip muzyczny stereo o długości do 30 sekund. Przy pierwszym użyciu przeglądarka pobiera model o rozmiarze 35,6 MB. Plik audio jest przetwarzany na tym urządzeniu i nigdy nie jest przesyłany.","What you get":"Co otrzymasz","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Przejrzyj i pobierz dwa pliki WAV: szacunkowy wokal i pozostały akompaniament. Wyniki zależą od mieszanki i mogą zawierać artefakty.","Local processing":"Przetwarzanie lokalne","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Narzędzie wykorzystuje sieć wokalną Open-Unmix UMX-HQ wyeksportowaną do ONNX i ONNX Runtime Web. Model zostanie pobrany tylko po naciśnięciu przycisku Oddziel; nie jest używany żaden płatny interfejs API ani subskrypcja wnioskowania. Dźwięk jest dekodowany, przetwarzany i eksportowany lokalnie.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Jest to wartość szacunkowa dla przetwarzania stereo 44,1 kHz i klipów trwających do 30 sekund. Źródła monofoniczne są duplikowane do stereo. Wokale wmieszane głęboko w instrumenty, ciężkie efekty, nagrania na żywo i nietypowe gatunki mogą powodować wycieki lub artefakty. Nie używaj wyniku jako czystego wzorca. Pobieranie modelu wymaga połączenia z Internetem; dźwięk nie opuszcza tego urządzenia.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Czy mój plik audio został przesłany?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Nie. Wybrany dźwięk jest dekodowany i przetwarzany w Twojej przeglądarce. Jedynym żądaniem sieciowym jest pobranie modelu po rozpoczęciu separacji.","Why is the first run slow?":"Dlaczego pierwsze uruchomienie jest powolne?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Przeglądarka pobiera jednorazowo model 35,6 MB; przeglądarka może go buforować. Wnioskowanie jest następnie uruchamiane lokalnie na procesorze urządzenia.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Czy każda piosenka będzie czysto oddzielona?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Nie. Model szacuje łodygę głosu i może pozostawić wyciek głosu, usunąć harmoniczne instrumentu lub stworzyć artefakty. Posłuchaj, zanim zaczniesz polegać na łodydze.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Plik audio stereo (do 30 sekund)","Choose audio":"Wybierz dźwięk","Separate vocals":"Oddzielne wokale","Cancel / clear":"Anuluj / wyczyść","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Wybierz krótki plik audio, aby rozpocząć.","Downloading the separation model…":"Pobieranie modelu separacji…","Separating locally…":"Oddzielanie lokalne…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Rozdzielanie zakończone. Wyświetl podgląd lub pobierz dowolny rdzeń.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Nie można przetworzyć tego pliku ani załadować modelu. Sprawdź format i połączenie, a następnie spróbuj ponownie.","Model and weight license information":"Informacje o licencji na model i wagę","Estimated vocals":"Szacowany wokal","Estimated accompaniment":"Szacowany akompaniament","Download WAV":"Pobierz WAV","Progress":"Postęp","Preparing local separation…":"Przygotowanie separacji lokalnej…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Rozdzielanie zakończone. Dźwięk pozostał na tym urządzeniu.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Nie można przetworzyć tego dźwięku. Wypróbuj plik muzyczny stereo krótszy niż 30 sekund.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Szwajcarski komparator odliczeń z tytułu ubezpieczenia zdrowotnego","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Kalkulator franczyzy szwajcarskiego ubezpieczenia zdrowotnego — porównaj koszty roczne","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Porównaj odliczenia od podstawowego szwajcarskiego ubezpieczenia zdrowotnego na podstawie wprowadzonych składek i kwalifikujących się rocznych kosztów leczenia. Żadna oferta ubezpieczyciela nie jest zgadywana.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Wprowadź miesięczne składki wykazywane przez tego samego ubezpieczyciela dla każdego oferowanego przez niego odliczenia, a następnie porównaj scenariusze niskich, oczekiwanych i wysokich rocznych kosztów leczenia.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"W przypadku obowiązkowego szwajcarskiego podstawowego ubezpieczenia zdrowotnego standardowe odliczenie dla osoby dorosłej wynosi 300 CHF, a dla dziecka 0 CHF. Poziomy opcjonalne różnią się w zależności od grupy wiekowej. Po odliczeniu standardowa opłata za utrzymanie wynosi 10% pozostałych kosztów kwalifikowanych, maksymalnie do 700 CHF rocznie dla dorosłych i 350 CHF dla dzieci. Narzędzie dodaje wprowadzoną składkę do modelowanego podziału kosztów; nie pobiera stawek ubezpieczyciela ani nie decyduje, która opcja jest dla Ciebie odpowiednia.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Jeśli osoba dorosła wpłaca miesięczną składkę w wysokości 400 CHF z odliczeniem 300 CHF i 350 CHF z odliczeniem 2500 CHF, roczna różnica w składce wynosi 600 CHF. Porównaj tę oszczędność z modelowaną różnicą w podziale kosztów dla każdej z Twoich niskich, oczekiwanych i wysokich kwot kosztów kwalifikowalnych.","How the estimate works":"Jak działa oszacowanie","Common questions":"Często zadawane pytania","Scope and exclusions":"Zakres i wyłączenia","Where do I get the premiums?":"Gdzie dostanę składki?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Korzystaj z aktualnych ofert miesięcznych dla tego samego ubezpieczyciela, regionu składkowego, grupy wiekowej, ochrony NNW i modelu ubezpieczenia. Priminfo to oficjalna federalna witryna porównawcza. Na tej stronie nie można pobierać ani reprodukować ofert ubezpieczycieli.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Czy wszystkie wymienione poziomy odliczeń są zawsze oferowane?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Nie. Ubezpieczyciele nie muszą oferować każdego opcjonalnego poziomu, a oferty mogą się różnić w przypadku młodych dorosłych. Wprowadź tylko składki wskazane dla Twojej własnej polisy; pozostaw niedostępne opcje puste.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Czy to pokazuje mój pełny rachunek za leczenie?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Nie. Model obejmuje zwykły udział własny oraz standardową opłatę retencyjną w wysokości 10% kosztów kwalifikowanych. Nie obejmuje składek za dni szpitalne, specjalnego zatrzymania leków w wysokości 40%, usług zwolnionych, opieki nieobjętej ubezpieczeniem i ubezpieczenia dodatkowego.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"To jest porównanie scenariuszy, a nie porada ubezpieczeniowa, medyczna czy finansowa. Nie przewiduje Twojego leczenia ani składek. Nie obejmuje składek za dzień hospitalizacji (zwykle 15 CHF za dzień hospitalizacji, z ustawowymi zwolnieniami), specjalnego 40% zatrzymania na niektóre leki, zwolnień z tytułu macierzyństwa/profilaktycznych, usług poza obowiązkowym ubezpieczeniem, dotacji do składek i ubezpieczenia dodatkowego. Rzeczywista współpłatność może zatem się różnić. Wyższe odliczenie oznacza, że ​​musisz być w stanie zapłacić więcej z góry, jeśli otrzymasz opiekę.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Kto jest ubezpieczony w ramach tej polisy?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Dorosły (w wieku 19 lat lub więcej)","Child (under 18)":"Dziecko (poniżej 18 lat)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Scenariusz niskich rocznych kwalifikujących się kosztów leczenia (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Oczekiwane roczne kwalifikowalne koszty leczenia (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Scenariusz wysokich rocznych kwalifikowanych kosztów leczenia (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Składki miesięczne od jednego ubezpieczyciela","Monthly premium":"Składka miesięczna","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Wprowadź tylko opcje oferowane dla tej samej polisy. Pozostałe pozostaw puste.","Adult deductible choices":"Odliczenia dla dorosłych","Child deductible choices":"Możliwości odliczenia na dziecko","Compare annual costs":"Porównaj koszty roczne","Clear entries":"Wyczyść wpisy","Download CSV":"Pobierz plik CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Szacowana roczna składka plus podział kosztów","Deductible":"Odliczenie","Annual premiums":"Składki roczne","Total at low costs":"Razem przy niskich kosztach","Total at expected costs":"Suma przy oczekiwanych kosztach","Total at high costs":"Razem przy wysokich kosztach","Cost sharing at low costs":"Podział kosztów przy niskich kosztach","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Podział kosztów przy oczekiwanych kosztach","Cost sharing at high costs":"Podział kosztów przy wysokich kosztach","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Różnica od najniższego dostępnego udziału własnego","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Koszty leczenia w przypadku wyczerpania oszczędności składki","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Wprowadzona oszczędność składki nie jest anulowana w modelowanym zakresie podziału kosztów.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Brak oszczędności w ramach składki przy najniższym odliczeniu.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Najniższa oczekiwana suma spośród wprowadzonych opcji","Scenario details":"Szczegóły scenariusza","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Wprowadź trzy uporządkowane scenariusze kosztów leczenia i miesięczne składki dla co najmniej dwóch dostępnych odliczeń.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Oficjalny regulamin i aktualne składki:","Federal deductible rules":"Federalne zasady odliczeń","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Oficjalne porównanie premium Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Porównanie obliczone w tej przeglądarce.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Sprawdź grupę wiekową, uporządkowane scenariusze kosztów i co najmniej dwie składki miesięczne.","Entries cleared.":"Wpisy zostały usunięte.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV pobrany lokalnie.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Kalkulator zniżki na szwajcarską składkę zdrowotną","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Kalkulator dotacji szwajcarskiej składki — Twoja składka netto","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Oblicz składkę netto szwajcarskiego ubezpieczenia zdrowotnego na podstawie aktualnej składki i miesięcznej zniżki już przyznanej przez Twój kanton.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Wprowadź składkę i potwierdzoną miesięczną obniżkę od ubezpieczyciela lub decyzji kantonu. To narzędzie nie decyduje o tym, czy się kwalifikujesz.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Szwajcarskie kantony określają, kto się kwalifikuje, jaka wysokość przyznawanego wsparcia i czy potrzebny jest wniosek. Kalkulator ten odejmuje jedynie potwierdzoną miesięczną obniżkę od jednej składki polisowej i pokazuje kwotę roczną.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Jeśli miesięczna składka wynosi 420 CHF, a potwierdzona obniżka wynosi 120 CHF, szacunkowa składka netto wynosi 300 CHF miesięcznie.","How the calculation works":"Jak działają obliczenia","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Czy to informuje mnie, czy się kwalifikuję?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Nie. O kwalifikowalności i wysokości nagród decyduje kanton zamieszkania. Skorzystaj z linkowanych oficjalnych informacji lub skontaktuj się z biurem kantonu.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Gdzie znajdę kwotę obniżki?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Skorzystaj z aktualnej decyzji lub obniżonej składki wskazanej przez ubezpieczyciela. Niektóre kantony przyznają zniżki automatycznie; inne wymagają aplikacji.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"To jest arytmetyka dla jednej polisy, a nie decyzja o uprawnieniach lub świadczeniach. Nie oblicza dochodu gospodarstwa domowego, majątku, statusu rodzinnego, terminów, progów kantonalnych ani praw do składania wniosków. Składki i nagrody mogą ulec zmianie; potwierdź je u swojego ubezpieczyciela i w kantonie.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Aktualna składka miesięczna (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Miesięczna obniżka już przyznana (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Wprowadź kwotę potwierdzoną przez kanton lub ubezpieczyciela; nie traktuj wyceny jako nagrody.","Calculate net premium":"Oblicz składkę netto","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Wprowadź aktualną składkę i potwierdzoną obniżkę.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Szacowana składka po obniżce","Current monthly premium":"Aktualna składka miesięczna","Monthly reduction":"Miesięczna redukcja","Estimated net monthly premium":"Szacowana miesięczna składka netto","Reduction over 12 months":"Redukcja w ciągu 12 miesięcy","Reduction as a share of premium":"Zniżka jako udział w składce","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Obliczenia zakończone. Potwierdź przyznanie nagrody i daty jej obowiązywania u swojego kantonu i ubezpieczyciela.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Sprawdź, czy obniżka nie jest większa niż miesięczna składka.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Szwajcarski kalkulator scenariusza referencyjnej stawki czynszu","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Szwajcarski kalkulator korekty czynszu — scenariusz stawki referencyjnej","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Oszacuj jedynie, jak zmiana stopy referencyjnej kredytu hipotecznego w Szwajcarii wpływa na czynsz netto lokalu mieszkalnego. Skorzystaj z najnowszego kursu federalnego urzędu ds. mieszkalnictwa.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Porównaj stawkę referencyjną podaną w umowie najmu lub ostatnim najmie z aktualną oficjalną stawką szwajcarską. Obliczenia pozostają na Twoim urządzeniu.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Federalny Urząd ds. Mieszkalnictwa publikuje co kwartał jedną stopę referencyjną kredytu hipotecznego dla szwajcarskich korekt czynszu. Podwyżka o 0,25 punktu procentowego może w zasadzie pozwolić na podwyżkę czynszu o 3%; spadek o 0,25 punktu może w zasadzie pozwolić na redukcję o 2,91%. W tym scenariuszu zmiany te są stosowane krok po kroku do wprowadzonego czynszu netto.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"W przypadku miesięcznego czynszu netto wynoszącego 3000 CHF spadek stopy referencyjnej z 1,75% do 1,50% daje szacunkową zmianę samej stawki referencyjnej o około −87,38 CHF miesięcznie (−2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Jak działa to oszacowanie","Where do I find the current rate?":"Gdzie znajdę aktualny kurs?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Otwórz połączoną stronę Federalnego Urzędu Mieszkalnictwa i wprowadź aktualnie opublikowaną stawkę. Narzędzie nie osadza stawki, która mogłaby stać się nieaktualna.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Czy to decyduje o tym, czy mogę wystąpić o zmianę czynszu?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Nie. Izoluje jeden czynnik orientacji. Twoja umowa, inflacja, zmiany kosztów, rezerwacje i inne warunki prawne mogą zmienić wynik.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Czy wynik uwzględnia koszty dodatkowe?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Nie. Wprowadź miesięczny czynsz netto, bez kosztów dodatkowych i innych opłat zmiennych.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Rezultatem jest ilustracyjny scenariusz dotyczący stóp referencyjnych, a nie opinia prawna lub pełny przegląd czynszów. Nie obejmuje inflacji, ogólnych zmian kosztów, ulepszeń, zastrzeżeń umownych, czynszów indeksowanych lub stopniowanych, dat wypowiedzenia i procedur kantonalnych. Zanim podejmiesz działania, sprawdź umowę najmu i oficjalne wytyczne.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Szwajcarskie umowy najmu lokali mieszkalnych: jedynie oszacowanie efektu stopy referencyjnej kredytu hipotecznego. To nie jest decyzja prawna ani pełna weryfikacja czynszu.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Aktualny miesięczny czynsz netto (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Stawka referencyjna podana w umowie najmu lub ostatnim najmie (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Aktualna oficjalna szwajcarska stopa referencyjna (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Oblicz scenariusz stopy referencyjnej","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Scenariusz obejmujący wyłącznie stopę referencyjną","Current monthly net rent":"Aktualny miesięczny czynsz netto","Reference-rate change":"Zmiana kursu referencyjnego","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Szacowany miesięczny efekt stopy referencyjnej","Scenario monthly net rent":"Scenariusz miesięcznego czynszu netto","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Efekt roczny przez 12 miesięcy w tym samym tempie","potential increase":"potencjalny wzrost","potential decrease":"potencjalny spadek","no reference-rate change":"brak zmiany stopy referencyjnej","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"W oszacowaniu stosuje się 3% za każde 0,25 punktu procentowego wzrostu i równoważną odwrotną obniżkę za każdy spadek. Inne czynniki mogą zmienić wynik.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Nie obejmuje to inflacji, ogólnych zmian kosztów, ulepszeń, zastrzeżeń w umowie, czynszów indeksowanych lub stopniowanych, dat wypowiedzenia ani lokalnych wymogów proceduralnych. Sprawdź umowę najmu i wytyczne Federalnego Biura ds. Mieszkalnictwa.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Sprawdź najnowsze oficjalne stawki i wytyczne","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Szwajcarski Federalny Urząd Mieszkalnictwa (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Wprowadź czynsz i obie stawki, aby zobaczyć scenariusz.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Scenariusz obliczony. Zanim na nich polegasz, sprawdź daty i warunki umowy.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Sprawdź kwoty i stawki. Stawki muszą mieścić się w przedziale od 0% do 5% i różnić się w krokach co 0,25 punktu.","Inputs cleared.":"Wejścia wyczyszczone.","Result":"Wynik","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Szwajcarski kalkulator naliczania urlopów","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Szwajcarski kalkulator naliczania urlopów — proporcjonalne saldo urlopu","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Oszacuj saldo dni urlopu w Szwajcarii na podstawie corocznego urlopu określonego w umowie, tygodniu pracy, datach zatrudnienia i dniach już wykorzystanych.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Oszacuj proporcjonalnie płatny urlop na jeden rok kalendarzowy, korzystając z wprowadzonych uprawnień i harmonogramu pracy. Żadne warunki umowy nie są domyślane.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Estymator dzieli liczbę dni urlopu rocznego w Twojej umowie według dni kalendarzowych przepracowanych w wybranym roku. W przypadku pracy w niepełnym wymiarze godzin należy podać zwykłe dni pracy w tygodniu i wymiar urlopu wypoczynkowego w tygodniach.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Przy czterech tygodniach urlopu, pięciodniowym tygodniu pracy i zatrudnieniu przez cały rok roczny wymiar urlopu wynosi 20 dni roboczych przed odliczeniem już wykorzystanego urlopu.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Jakie jest szwajcarskie ustawowe minimum?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Wytyczne federalne stanowią co najmniej cztery tygodnie w roku służbowym i pięć tygodni w przypadku pracowników, którzy nie ukończyli 20. roku życia. Umowa lub układ zbiorowy może zapewniać więcej.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Czy to decyduje o mojej równowadze prawnej?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Nie. Jest to prosta proporcja dni kalendarzowych. Warunki umowy, obowiązujące zasady zbiorowe, kwalifikujące się nieobecności, zaokrąglenia i zapisy pracodawcy mogą zmienić równowagę.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"To oszacowanie nie decyduje o uprawnieniach ustawowych ani nie oblicza wynagrodzenia urlopowego. Nie obejmuje redukcji z tytułu niektórych przedłużających się nieobecności, zasad naliczania i zaokrąglania specyficznych dla umowy, świąt państwowych, nadgodzin, terminów przeniesienia i sporów. Sprawdź swoją umowę i uzyskaj poradę dotyczącą kwestionowanego salda.","Leave year":"Rok urlopu","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Coroczny urlop w Twojej umowie (tygodnie)","Usual working days per week":"Zwykłe dni robocze w tygodniu","Employment start date":"Data rozpoczęcia zatrudnienia","Employment end date":"Data zakończenia zatrudnienia","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Dni urlopu już wykorzystane w tym roku urlopu","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Tylko dla orientacji. Wprowadź umowne roczne uprawnienie; ustawowe minimum wynosi zazwyczaj cztery tygodnie lub pięć tygodni w przypadku pracowników poniżej 20. roku życia.","Estimate balance":"Oszacuj saldo","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Wprowadź umowę i daty, aby oszacować saldo.","Estimated leave balance":"Szacowany stan urlopu","Annual leave at this schedule":"Urlop roczny według tego harmonogramu","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Dni kalendarzowe wykorzystane w tym roku urlopowym","Prorated days accrued":"Naliczone dni proporcjonalnie","Days already taken":"Dni już zajęte","Estimated days remaining":"Szacowana liczba pozostałych dni","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Powoduje to podział urlopu corocznego według dni kalendarzowych okresu zatrudnienia. Zasady pracodawcy i umowy mogą się różnić.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Oszacowanie obliczone. Sprawdź to w odniesieniu do swojej umowy i dokumentacji pracodawcy.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Sprawdź rok, daty, harmonogram prac i wartości."},"sv":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Scenario för schweizisk arbetslöshetsersättning","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Schweizisk kalkylator för arbetslöshetsersättning – bruttoscenario","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Uppskatta ett schweiziskt bruttodagtraktamente med hjälp av den försäkrade lönen och räntan som bekräftats av din fond.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Ange den försäkrade lönen och 70 % eller 80 % som bekräftats av din a-kassa.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Schweiziska regler fastställer bidragssatsen och lönetaket. Fonden beslutar om behörighet, avdrag, karensdagar och rätt. Månadsintervallet återspeglar 20–23 betalbara vardagar.","Example":"Exempel","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5 000 CHF vid 70 % är cirka 161,29 CHF per betalbar vardag.","How it works":"Hur det fungerar","Questions":"Frågor","Scope and limits":"Omfattning och begränsningar","Related tools":"Relaterade verktyg","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Månadsförsäkrad lön (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Ränte bekräftad av fonden","70%":"70 %","80%":"80 %","Estimate":"Uppskattning","Clear":"Klar","Gross scenario":"Brutt scenario","Insured salary used":"Försäkrad lön används","Per payable weekday":"Per betalbar vardag","20-day month":"20-dagars månad","23-day month":"23-dagars månad","Official benefit rules":"Officiella förmånsregler","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Ange dina bekräftade siffror.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Scenario beräknat. Bekräfta beloppen med din fond.","Check the values.":"Kontrollera värdena.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Schweizisk hyresuppsägningsplanerare","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Schweizisk hyresmeddelandeplanerare och brevutkast","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Planera ett hyresmeddelande från datum och villkor i ditt eget kontrakt; utarbeta ett brev utan att anta kantonregler.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Ange uppsägningstiden, nästa giltiga uppsägningsdag i ditt kontrakt och mottagningsdatum. Kontrollera varje datum med din hyresvärd eller hyresgästförening.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Planeraren tillämpar endast de datum och perioder du anger. Det avgör inte om uppsägning är giltigt, när det lagligen inkommer eller om ett särskilt skydd gäller.","Contract notice period (months)":"Uppsägningstid (månader)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Nästa giltiga uppsägningsdag i månaden (från kontrakt)","Expected receipt date":"Förväntat mottagningsdatum","Your name":"Ditt namn","Your address":"Din adress","Landlord / agency":"Hyresvärd/byrå","Recipient address":"Mottagarens adress","Rental property":"Hyresfastighet","Place":"Plats","Letter date":"Brevsdatum","Termination of tenancy":"Uppsägning av hyresförhållande","Calculate date and draft letter":"Beräkna datum och utkast till brev","Planning date":"Planeringsdatum","Target date":"Måldatum","Editable draft":"Redigerbart utkast","Copy draft":"Kopiera utkast","Enter your contract terms.":"Ange dina avtalsvillkor.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Planeringsutkast klart. Kontrollera mot ditt kontrakt.","Check the dates and period.":"Kontrollera datum och period.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Resultatet följer den angivna uppsägningsdagen; det är inte en lagstadgad varselbesked.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Scenario för schweizisk fastighetsvinst","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Schweizisk fastighetsvinstskatt – scenarie för användarinmatad taxa","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Uppskatta en fastighetsvinst med dina egna transaktionskostnader och en skattesats från ansvarig kanton.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Ange intäkter, anskaffningskostnad, berättigade utgifter som du har bekräftat och en effektiv kurs från den officiella kantonalkalkylatorn.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Schweizisk fastighetsvinstskatt varierar beroende på kanton, innehavstid, avdrag och fall. Det här verktyget tillhandahåller inte priser eller bestämmer tillåtna kostnader.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Försäljningsintäkter (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Anskaffningskostnad (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Övriga kostnader bekräftade tillåtna (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Effektiv skattesats från officiell källa (%)","Estimate scenario":"Uppskattningsscenario","Illustrative scenario":"Illustrativt scenario","Gain entered":"Förstärkning angett","Tax at entered rate":"Skatt enligt angiven skattesats","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Ange siffror från dina register och kantonkälla.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Scenario beräknat; verifiera det med kantonen.","Check amounts and rate.":"Kontrollera belopp och kurs.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Ingen kantonskattetabell är inbäddad; din angivna effektiva ränta driver uppskattningen.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Scenario för schweizisk arvs- och gåvoskatt","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Schweizisk arvs- och gåvoskatt — ditt prisscenario","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Uppskatta ett skattepliktigt belopp från ett användarinmatat undantag och skattesats; reglerna varierar beroende på kanton och förhållande.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Ange ett belopp, befrielse och effektiv ränta bekräftad för mottagaren och kantonen.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Kantonregler och familjeförhållande kan ändra undantag och skattesatser. Det här verktyget väljer inte en kantonregel eller bestämmer skattskyldighet.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Arv eller gåvobelopp (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Undantag bekräftat med kanton (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Effektiv sats bekräftad med kanton (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Belopp efter angett undantag","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Ange siffror som bekräftats för ditt fall.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Uppskattningen använder endast det undantag och priset du anger.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Schweizisk barnbidragsbudgetscenario","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Schweizisk barnbidragsbudget — Transparent hushållsscenario","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Tilldela en inmatad underordnad budget efter förälders inkomst efter en inmatad direktkostnadskredit.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Använd barnets dokumenterade månatliga behov, båda föräldrarnas tillgängliga månadsinkomster och eventuella direkta kostnader du vill kreditera.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Detta är endast ett planeringsark. Det är inte en schweizisk utmärkelse för underhåll av barn eller juridisk metod; boende, vård, skatter, förmåner och rättspraxis bedöms inte.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Månatlig underordnad budget som du dokumenterade (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Förälder En tillgänglig månadsinkomst (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Förälder B tillgänglig månadsinkomst (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Direkta barnkostnader som betalas av förälder A till kredit (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Allokera scenario","Illustrative allocation":"Illustrativ tilldelning","Parent A remaining contribution":"Förälder Ett återstående bidrag","Parent B contribution":"Förälder B-bidrag","Entered monthly child budget":"Anged månatlig underordnad budget","Enter your household budget figures.":"Ange dina hushållsbudgetsiffror.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Budgetscenario beräknat; diskutera juridiska skyldigheter med en kvalificerad rådgivare.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Kontrollera belopp; krediten får inte överstiga budgeten.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Andelar är proportionella mot de två införda inkomsterna; krediten för direkta kostnader dras av först.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Förhandsvisning av webbläsaravstavning","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Förhandsgranskning av ordavstavning — webbläsares språkmönster","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Förhandsgranska webbläsaravstavning för text du anger; support beror på webbläsaren och installerade språkresurser.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Välj det språk som matchar din text, ange ett exempel och justera den tillgängliga radbredden.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Använder webbläsarens inbyggda CSS-avstavning. Det paketerar inte ordböcker; webbläsare som inte stöds kanske inte visar några bindestreck. Kopiering av texten behåller den ursprungliga stavningen.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Textspråk (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Förhandsgranskningsbredd (tecken)","Text to preview":"Text att förhandsgranska","Preview":"Förhandsgranskning","Enter text and choose its language.":"Skriv in text och välj dess språk.","Preview updated.":"Förhandsgranskningen uppdaterad.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Ange en språktagg och text som stöds.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Försök samma stycke på olika bredder för att se var webbläsaren kan bryta ord.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Privat stavningskontrollarbetsyta","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Lokal stavningskontroll — Använd din webbläsarordbok","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Redigera text med webbläsarens ursprungliga stavningskontroll, välj ett språk och kopiera den korrigerade texten.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Texten stannar på den här sidan. Ställ in ett språk som din webbläsare har en stavningsordbok för, använd sedan dess stavningsmeny eller stryk under förslag.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Denna arbetsyta laddar inte upp text eller skickar ordböcker. Tillgänglighet och förslag på webbläsarens stavningskontroll beror på enheten, webbläsaren och den installerade ordboken.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Språk för stavningskontroll (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Text att kontrollera","Copy text":"Kopiera text","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Skriv eller klistra in text. Högerklicka eller använd enhetens stavningsmeny för förslag.","Text copied.":"Text kopierad.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Kunde inte kopiera automatiskt; markera och kopiera texten.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"En webbläsare utan en matchande ordbok får inte markera felstavningar.","Resume Structure Checker":"Resume Structure Checker","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS CV-kontroll — gratis lokal PDF- och DOCX-granskning","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Kontrollera CV-text, rubriker, avsnitt, länkar och punktstruktur i din webbläsare. Jämför arbetsbeskrivningsvillkor efter antal; ingen anställningspoäng eller uppladdning.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Granska vad ett textbaserat CV faktiskt visar: extraherad text, rubrikstruktur, kontaktfältsnärvaro, länkar och allmänt kända avsnitt. Jämför eventuellt upprepade arbetsbeskrivningsvillkor.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"En DOCX med rubrik 1-stilar för erfarenhet och utbildning visar dessa rubriker. En PDF kontrolleras från dess valbara text; kolumner kan läsas i en annan ordning.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX-filer inspekteras lokalt som Office ZIP/XML. PDF-filer läses med en uppskjuten lokal PDF.js-motor. Den valfria jämförelsen av arbetsbeskrivningen räknar valda termer i varje text; det skapar ingen poäng eller rekommenderar om man ska anställa någon.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Detta är en format- och textstrukturkontroll, inte en ATS-simulator, juridisk granskning eller förutsägelse av intervjuframgång. Skannade PDF-filer utan valbar text behöver OCR först. Lösenordsskyddade, makroaktiverade, signerade eller ovanligt stora dokument stöds inte.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Välj ett CV (PDF eller DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Dina filer stannar i den här webbläsaren och laddas inte upp. Max 20 MB; PDF upp till 50 sidor. DOCX utökat innehåll är begränsat till 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Valfri arbetsbeskrivning","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Klistra in vanlig text om du vill ha en term-frekvensjämförelse. Ta inte med känslig information som du inte behöver analysera.","Paste job-description text here…":"Klistra in jobbbeskrivningstext här...","Analyze locally":"Analysera lokalt","Clear files and report":"Rensa filer och rapportera","Resume review":"Återuppta granskning","File type":"Filtyp","Extracted characters":"Extraherade tecken","Words counted":"Räknade ord","Detected headings":"Detekterade rubriker","Recognized sections":"Kända sektioner","Hyperlinks found":"Hyperlänkar hittades","Bullet paragraphs":"Punkta stycken","An email address appears in the text":"En e-postadress visas i texten","No email address pattern was detected":"Inget e-postadressmönster upptäcktes","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Ett telefonnummerliknande mönster visas i texten","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Inget telefonnummerliknande mönster upptäcktes","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Arbetsbeskrivningsvillkor (räknas endast)","Term":"Tillstånd","In job text":"I jobbtext","In resume":"I CV","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Klistra in en arbetsbeskrivning för att jämföra antalet terminer.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Inga tydliga rubrikstilar upptäcktes. PDF-rubriker beräknas utifrån textstorlek och kan vara felaktiga.","Detected":"Upptäckt","Not detected":"Inte upptäckt","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Denna heuristik känner igen en begränsad uppsättning vanliga sektionsnamn; det avgör inte vilka avsnitt som krävs.","Profile / summary":"Profil / sammanfattning","Experience":"Erfarenhet","Education":"Utbildning","Skills":"Färdigheter","Contact":"Kontakta","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Ingen valbar text hittades. Enbart skannade PDF-filer behöver OCR innan de kan kontrolleras.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Välj ett PDF- eller DOCX- CV för att börja.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Läser den valda filen lokalt...","Local structure review complete.":"Lokal strukturgenomgång klar.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Denna webbläsare stöder inte en obligatorisk lokal dokumentfunktion.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Välj en giltig PDF- eller modern DOCX-fil upp till de angivna lokala gränserna.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF-filen kunde inte läsas. Den kan vara skadad, krypterad eller innehålla ingen valbar text.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX-paketet kunde inte öppnas eller läsas säkert.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Laddas upp eller sparas mitt CV?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Nr. Parsing och analys körs i din webbläsare. Filtexten skickas inte till en server eller behålls efter att du rensat rapporten eller lämnat sidan.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Förutsäger det om en ATS eller arbetsgivare kommer att acceptera mitt CV?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Nr. Den kontrollerar endast läsbar text och enkel struktur. Anställningssystem skiljer sig åt, och detta är inte en ATS-kompatibilitetsgaranti eller anställningsförutsägelse.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Kan den läsa en skannad PDF?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Endast om PDF-filen har ett valbart textlager. Denna checker laddar inte ned OCR-modeller; använd ett OCR-verktyg först för ett skannat dokument med enbart bild.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Vad betyder jämförelsen av arbetsbeskrivningen?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Det visar antal för återkommande termer efter enkel normalisering. Det är inte en matchningsprocent, ranking, rekommendation eller bedömning av dina kvalifikationer.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Varför visar en PDF-fil färre rubriker än en DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF-filer bevarar vanligtvis inte semantiska rubrikstilar. Checkern uppskattar framträdande linjer utifrån textstorlek och läsordning, så kolumner och visuell design kan påverka resultatet.","How local resume review works":"Så fungerar lokal granskning av CV","Resume checker questions":"Återuppta kontrollfrågor","Scope and limitations":"Omfattning och begränsningar","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Lokal sång- och ackompanjemangsseparator","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Vocal Remover — Separera sång och ackompanjemang lokalt","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Separera ett kort stereoljudprov i uppskattad sång och ackompanjemang i din webbläsare. Ljudet stannar på din enhet; modellen laddas ner från dess offentliga värd.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Välj ett stereomusikklipp på upp till 30 sekunder. Vid första användningen laddar webbläsaren ner en 35,6 MB-modell. Ljudfilen bearbetas på den här enheten och laddas aldrig upp.","What you get":"Vad du får","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Förhandsgranska och ladda ner två WAV-stammar: uppskattad sång och det kvarvarande ackompanjemanget. Resultaten beror på blandningen och kan innehålla artefakter.","Local processing":"Lokal bearbetning","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Verktyget använder Open-Unmix UMX-HQ sångnätverket som exporteras till ONNX och ONNX Runtime Web. Modellen hämtas endast när du trycker på Separat; ingen betald inferens API eller prenumeration används. Ljud avkodas, bearbetas och exporteras lokalt.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Detta är en uppskattning för stereo 44,1 kHz-behandling och klipp upp till 30 sekunder. Monokällor dupliceras till stereo. Sång blandad djupt in i instrument, tunga effekter, liveinspelningar och ovanliga genrer kan producera läckage eller artefakter. Använd inte resultatet som en ren mästare. Modellnedladdning kräver en internetanslutning; ljudet lämnar inte den här enheten.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Har mitt ljud laddat upp?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Nr. Det valda ljudet avkodas och bearbetas i din webbläsare. Den enda nätverksbegäran är modellnedladdningen när du startar separation.","Why is the first run slow?":"Varför är den första körningen långsam?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Webbläsaren laddar ner en 35,6 MB-modell en gång; webbläsaren kan cache det. Inferens körs sedan lokalt på enhetens CPU.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Kommer varje låt att separeras rent?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Nr. Modellen uppskattar en röststam och kan lämna röstläckage, ta bort instrumentövertoner eller skapa artefakter. Lyssna innan du förlitar dig på en stam.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Stereoljudfil (upp till 30 sekunder)","Choose audio":"Välj ljud","Separate vocals":"Separat sång","Cancel / clear":"Avbryt / rensa","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Välj en kort ljudfil för att börja.","Downloading the separation model…":"Hämtar separationsmodellen...","Separating locally…":"Separerar lokalt...","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Separationen klar. Förhandsgranska eller ladda ner endera stammen.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Det gick inte att bearbeta den här filen eller ladda modellen. Kontrollera formatet och anslutningen och försök sedan igen.","Model and weight license information":"Model- och viktlicensinformation","Estimated vocals":"Uppskattad sång","Estimated accompaniment":"Uppskattat ackompanjemang","Download WAV":"Ladda ner WAV","Progress":"Framsteg","Preparing local separation…":"Förbereder lokal separation...","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Separationen klar. Ljudet fanns kvar på den här enheten.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Det här ljudet kunde inte bearbetas. Prova en stereomusikfil under 30 sekunder.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Jämför årliga kostnader","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Jämför självrisker för schweizisk grundläggande sjukförsäkring med premier och berättigade årliga medicinska kostnader som du anger. Ingen försäkringsgivares offert gissas.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Ange de månatliga premierna som visas av samma försäkringsgivare för varje självrisk som den erbjuder, och jämför sedan scenarier för låga, förväntade och höga årliga behandlingskostnader.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"För den obligatoriska schweiziska grundsjukförsäkringen är en standardsjälvrisk för vuxna CHF 300 och en självrisk för barn är 0 CHF. Valfria nivåer skiljer sig åt beroende på åldersgrupp. Efter självrisken är standardavgiften 10 % av de berättigade återstående kostnaderna, maximerad till 700 CHF per år för vuxna och 350 CHF för barn. Verktyget lägger till din angivna premie till denna modellerade kostnadsdelning; det tar inte ut försäkringsbolagens priser eller bestämmer vilket alternativ som är rätt för dig.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Om en vuxen anger 400 CHF i månadspremie med en självrisk på 300 CHF och 350 CHF med en självrisk på 2 500 CHF, är den årliga premieskillnaden 600 CHF. Jämför det besparingen med den modellerade skillnaden i kostnadsdelning för vart och ett av dina låga, förväntade och höga berättigande belopp.","How the estimate works":"Hur uppskattningen fungerar","Common questions":"Vanliga frågor","Scope and exclusions":"Omfattning och undantag","Where do I get the premiums?":"Var får jag premierna?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Använd aktuella månadserbjudanden för samma försäkringsgivare, premieregion, åldersgrupp, olycksfallsskydd och försäkringsmodell. Priminfo är den officiella federala jämförelsesidan. Den här sidan hämtar eller återger inte försäkringsgivares offerter.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Erbjuds alla angivna självrisknivåer alltid?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Nr. Försäkringsbolagen behöver inte erbjuda alla valfria nivåer, och erbjudanden kan variera för unga vuxna. Ange endast premierna som visas för din egen försäkring; lämna otillgängliga alternativ tomma.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Visar detta min fullständiga läkarräkning?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Nr. Modellen täcker ordinarie självrisk och standard 10 % retentionsavgift på stödberättigande kostnader. Det exkluderar sjukhusdagsbidrag, särskild 40 % medicinretention, undantagna tjänster, icke täckt vård och tilläggsförsäkring.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Detta är en scenariojämförelse, inte försäkring, medicinsk eller finansiell rådgivning. Det förutsäger inte din behandling eller premier. Det exkluderar sjukhusdagsavgifter (normalt 15 CHF per slutenvårdsdag, med lagstadgade undantag), särskilda 40 % retention på vissa läkemedel, moderskaps-/förebyggande undantag, tjänster utanför obligatoriskt skydd, premiesubventioner och tilläggsförsäkringar. Den faktiska egenavgiften kan därför skilja sig åt. En högre självrisk innebär att du måste kunna betala mer i förskott om du får vård.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Vem är försäkrad enligt denna försäkring?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Vuxen (19 år eller äldre)","Child (under 18)":"Barn (under 18)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Låga årliga kvalificerade behandlingskostnader (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Förväntade årliga stödberättigande behandlingskostnader (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Scenario med hög årlig kvalificerad behandlingskostnad (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Månatliga premier från en försäkringsgivare","Monthly premium":"Månadspremie","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Ange endast alternativ som erbjuds för samma policy. Lämna andra tomma.","Adult deductible choices":"Vuxen avdragsgill val","Child deductible choices":"Barnavdragsgilla val","Compare annual costs":"Jämför årliga kostnader","Clear entries":"Rensa poster","Download CSV":"Ladda ner CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Uppskattad årlig premie plus kostnadsdelning","Deductible":"Självrisk","Annual premiums":"Årliga premier","Total at low costs":"Totalt till låga kostnader","Total at expected costs":"Totalt till förväntade kostnader","Total at high costs":"Totalt till höga kostnader","Cost sharing at low costs":"Kostnadsdelning till låga kostnader","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Kostnadsdelning till förväntade kostnader","Cost sharing at high costs":"Kostnadsdelning till höga kostnader","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Skillnad från lägsta tillgängliga självrisk","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Medicinkostnader där premiebesparing är förbrukad","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Det angivna premiebesparingen annulleras inte inom det modellerade kostnadsdelningsintervallet.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Inget premiesparande mot lägsta självrisk.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Lägsta förväntade totalsumman bland angivna alternativ","Scenario details":"Scenariodetaljer","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Ange tre beställda medicinska kostnadsscenarier och månatliga premier för minst två tillgängliga självrisker.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Officiella regler och aktuella premier:","Federal deductible rules":"Federala regler för avdragsgill","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo officiella premiumjämförelse","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Jämförelse beräknad i den här webbläsaren.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Kontrollera åldersgruppen, beställda kostnadsscenarier och minst två månatliga premier.","Entries cleared.":"Inmatningar raderade.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV laddas ner lokalt.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Swiss Premium Subvention Calculator — Din nettopremie","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Beräkna nettopremien för schweizisk sjukförsäkring från den aktuella premien och en månatlig sänkning som redan beviljats av din kanton.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Ange premien och bekräftad månadsavdrag från ditt försäkringsbolag eller kantonala beslut. Det här verktyget avgör inte om du är kvalificerad.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Schweiziska kantoner avgör vem som kvalificerar sig, hur mycket stöd som beviljas och om en ansökan behövs. Denna kalkylator subtraherar endast en bekräftad månadsreduktion från en försäkringspremie och visar det årliga beloppet.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Om den månatliga premien är 420 CHF och den bekräftade sänkningen är 120 CHF, är den beräknade nettopremien 300 CHF per månad.","How the calculation works":"Så fungerar beräkningen","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Berättar detta för mig om jag kvalificerar mig?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Nr. Stödberättigande och tilldelningsbelopp bestäms av hemortens kanton. Använd den länkade officiella informationen eller kontakta kantonkontoret.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Var hittar jag reduktionsbeloppet?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Använd det aktuella beslutet eller den reducerade premien som din försäkringsgivare visar. Vissa kantoner beviljar minskningar automatiskt; andra kräver en ansökan.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Detta är aritmetiskt för en försäkring, inte ett berättigande eller förmånsbeslut. Den beräknar inte hushållsinkomst, tillgångar, familjestatus, tidsfrister, kantonala trösklar eller ansökningsrättigheter. Premier och utmärkelser kan ändras; bekräfta dem med din försäkringsgivare och kanton.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Aktuell månadspremie (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Månadssänkning redan beviljad (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Ange ett belopp som bekräftats av kantonen eller försäkringsgivaren; använd inte en uppskattning som pris.","Calculate net premium":"Beräkna nettopremien","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Ange aktuell premie och bekräftad sänkning.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Beräknad premie efter sänkning","Current monthly premium":"Aktuell månatlig premie","Monthly reduction":"Månadsreduktion","Estimated net monthly premium":"Uppskattad månatlig nettopremie","Reduction over 12 months":"Reduktion under 12 månader","Reduction as a share of premium":"Sänkning som andel av premien","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Beräkning klar. Bekräfta tilldelningen och ikraftträdandedatum med din kanton och försäkringsgivare.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Kontrollera att sänkningen inte är större än den månatliga premien.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Swiss Referens-Rate Scenario Calculator","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Referensprisscenario","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Uppskatta bara hur en förändring av Schweiz referensränta för bolån påverkar nettohyran för bostäder. Använd den senaste taxan från det federala bostadskontoret.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Jämför referensräntan som anges i ditt hyresavtal eller senaste hyresmeddelande med den aktuella officiella schweiziska kursen. Beräkningen stannar på din enhet.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Federal Office for Housing publicerar en referensränta för bolån för schweiziska hyresjusteringar varje kvartal. En höjning på 0,25 procentenheter kan i princip tillåta en hyreshöjning på 3 %; en minskning med 0,25 punkter kan i princip tillåta en minskning med 2,91 %. Detta scenario tillämpar dessa ändringar steg för steg på nettohyran du anger.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"För 3 000 CHF i månads nettohyra ger en sänkning av referensräntan från 1,75 % till 1,50 % en uppskattad ändring av endast referensräntan på cirka −CHF 87,38 per månad (−2,91 %).","How this estimate works":"Hur denna uppskattning fungerar","Where do I find the current rate?":"Var hittar jag den aktuella kursen?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Öppna den länkade sidan för Federal Office for Housing och ange den aktuella publicerade kursen. Verktyget bäddar inte in en kurs som kan bli föråldrad.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Avgör detta om jag kan begära hyresändring?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Nr. Det isolerar en faktor för orientering. Ditt kontrakt, inflation, kostnadsförändringar, reservationer och andra juridiska villkor kan förändra resultatet.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Inkluderar resultatet kringkostnader?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Nr. Ange den månatliga nettohyran, exklusive kringkostnader och andra rörliga avgifter.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Resultatet är ett illustrativt referensräntescenario, inte ett juridiskt utlåtande eller fullständig hyresgranskning. Det exkluderar inflation, allmänna kostnadsförändringar, förbättringar, avtalsförbehåll, indexerade eller stegvisa hyror, uppsägningsdatum och kantonförfarande. Kontrollera ditt hyresavtal och den officiella vägledningen innan du agerar.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Schweiziska hyresavtal för bostäder: endast en uppskattning av effekten av inteckningsreferensräntan. Det är inte ett juridiskt beslut eller en fullständig hyresprövning.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Aktuell nettohyra per månad (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Referensränta som anges i ditt hyresavtal eller senaste hyresmeddelande (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Aktuell officiell schweizisk referensränta (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Beräkna referenshastighetsscenario","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Scenario med endast referensränta","Current monthly net rent":"Aktuell nettohyra per månad","Reference-rate change":"Referenskursändring","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Uppskattad månatlig effekt från referensränta","Scenario monthly net rent":"Scenario månatlig nettohyra","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Annualiserad effekt i 12 månader i samma takt","potential increase":"potentiell ökning","potential decrease":"potentiell minskning","no reference-rate change":"ingen förändring av referenskursen","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Uppskattningen gäller 3 % för varje ökning med 0,25 procentenheter och motsvarande omvänd minskning för varje minskning. Andra faktorer kan förändra resultatet.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Detta inkluderar inte inflation, allmänna kostnadsförändringar, förbättringar, kontraktsreservationer, indexerade eller stegvisa hyror, uppsägningsdatum eller lokala förfarandekrav. Kontrollera ditt hyresavtal och vägledning från Federal Office for Housing.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Kolla den senaste officiella kursen och vägledningen","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Ange hyran och båda priserna för att se ett scenario.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Scenario beräknat. Kontrollera datum och avtalsvillkor innan du litar på det.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Kontrollera beloppen och priserna. Priserna måste vara mellan 0 % och 5 % och skilja sig åt i steg om 0,25 punkter.","Inputs cleared.":"Ingångar raderade.","Result":"Resultat","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Schweizisk semesteruppskattning","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Schweizisk kalkylator för periodisering av semester – proportionellt ledighetssaldo","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Uppskatta ett saldo på schweiziska semesterdagar från den årliga semestern i ditt kontrakt, arbetsvecka, anställningsdatum och redan uttagna dagar.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Uppskatta den proportionella betalda ledigheten för ett kalenderår med hjälp av den rättighet och arbetsschema du anger. Inga avtalsvillkor är gissade.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Uppskattaren räknar ut de årliga semesterdagarna i ditt kontrakt med kalenderdagar som används under det valda året. För deltidsarbete anger du dina vanliga arbetsdagar per vecka och semestern i veckor.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Med fyra veckors ledighet, en femdagars arbetsvecka och anställning under hela året är den årliga rättigheten 20 arbetsdagar före avdrag för redan uttagen semester.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Vad är det schweiziska lagstadgade minimikravet?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Federal vägledning anger minst fyra veckor per tjänsteår och fem veckor för arbetare som inte har fyllt 20 år. Ett kontrakt eller kollektivavtal kan ge mer.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Avgör detta min rättsliga balans?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Nr. Det är en enkel kalenderdagsproportion. Avtalsvillkor, tillämpliga kollektiva regler, kvalificerande frånvaro, avrundning och arbetsgivarregister kan förändra balansen.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Denna uppskattning avgör inte en laglig rättighet eller beräknar semesterlön. Det utesluter avdrag för viss långvarig frånvaro, avtalsspecifika periodiserings- och avrundningsregler, helgdagar, övertid, tidsfrister för överföring och tvister. Kontrollera ditt kontrakt och få råd om ett omtvistat saldo.","Leave year":"Avgångsår","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Årlig ledighet i ditt kontrakt (veckor)","Usual working days per week":"Vanliga arbetsdagar per vecka","Employment start date":"Startdatum för anställning","Employment end date":"Slutdatum för anställning","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Ledighetsdagar som redan tagits under detta semesterår","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Endast för orientering. Ange den avtalsenliga årliga rättigheten; det lagstadgade minimumet är vanligtvis fyra veckor, eller fem veckor för arbetare under 20 år.","Estimate balance":"Uppskatta saldo","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Ange ditt kontrakt och datum för att uppskatta ett saldo.","Estimated leave balance":"Uppskattat ledighetssaldo","Annual leave at this schedule":"Årlig ledighet enligt detta schema","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Anställda kalenderdagar under detta semesterår","Prorated days accrued":"Intjänade dagar","Days already taken":"Dagarna har redan tagits","Estimated days remaining":"Uppskattade dagar kvar","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Detta proportionerar årlig semester med kalenderdagar under anställningsperioden. Arbetsgivar- och avtalsregler kan skilja sig åt.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Uppskattning beräknad. Kontrollera det mot ditt kontrakt och arbetsgivarregister.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Kontrollera år, datum, arbetsschema och värden."},"th":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"สถานการณ์ค่าเผื่อการว่างงานของสวิส","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"เครื่องคำนวณผลประโยชน์การว่างงานของสวิส - สถานการณ์โดยรวม","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"ประมาณการเบี้ยเลี้ยงรายวันรวมของสวิสโดยใช้เงินเดือนและอัตราที่ประกันที่ยืนยันโดยกองทุนของคุณ","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"กรอกเงินเดือนประกันและอัตรา 70% หรือ 80% ที่ยืนยันโดยกองทุนการว่างงานของคุณ","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"กฎของสวิสกำหนดอัตราเบี้ยเลี้ยงและเงินเดือนสูงสุด กองทุนจะเป็นผู้ตัดสินคุณสมบัติ การหักเงิน วันรอ และสิทธิ ช่วงรายเดือนสะท้อนถึงวันธรรมดาที่ต้องชำระ 20–23 วัน","Example":"ตัวอย่าง","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5,000 ที่ 70% คือประมาณ CHF 161.29 ต่อวันในวันทำการที่ชำระได้","How it works":"มันทำงานอย่างไร","Questions":"คำถาม","Scope and limits":"ขอบเขตและขีดจำกัด","Related tools":"เครื่องมือที่เกี่ยวข้อง","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"เงินเดือนประกันรายเดือน (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"อัตราที่กองทุนยืนยัน","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"ประมาณการ","Clear":"เคลียร์","Gross scenario":"สถานการณ์โดยรวม","Insured salary used":"เงินเดือนที่ใช้ประกัน","Per payable weekday":"ต่อวันในวันทำการที่ชำระได้","20-day month":"เดือน 20 วัน","23-day month":"เดือนที่มี 23 วัน","Official benefit rules":"กฎสิทธิประโยชน์อย่างเป็นทางการ","Enter your confirmed figures.":"กรอกตัวเลขที่ยืนยันแล้ว","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"คำนวณสถานการณ์แล้ว ยืนยันจำนวนเงินด้วยกองทุนของคุณ","Check the values.":"ตรวจสอบค่า","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"ผู้วางแผนประกาศการเช่าของสวิส","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"ผู้วางแผนประกาศการเช่าและร่างจดหมายของสวิส","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"วางแผนการแจ้งการเช่าตามวันที่และเงื่อนไขในสัญญาของคุณเอง ร่างจดหมายโดยไม่ต้องถือว่ากฎเกณฑ์ของมณฑล","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"ป้อนระยะเวลาการแจ้งเตือน วันที่สิ้นสุดที่ถูกต้องถัดไปในสัญญาของคุณ และวันที่ได้รับ ตรวจสอบทุกวันกับสมาคมเจ้าของบ้านหรือผู้เช่าของคุณ","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"เครื่องวางแผนจะใช้เฉพาะวันที่และระยะเวลาที่คุณระบุเท่านั้น ไม่ได้ตัดสินว่าการแจ้งนั้นถูกต้องหรือไม่ ได้รับตามกฎหมายเมื่อใด หรือมีการคุ้มครองพิเศษหรือไม่","Contract notice period (months)":"ระยะเวลาแจ้งสัญญา (เดือน)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"วันสิ้นสุดที่ถูกต้องถัดไปของเดือน (จากสัญญา)","Expected receipt date":"วันที่คาดว่าจะได้รับ","Your name":"ชื่อของคุณ","Your address":"ที่อยู่ของคุณ","Landlord / agency":"เจ้าของบ้าน/เอเจนซี่","Recipient address":"ที่อยู่ผู้รับ","Rental property":"ทรัพย์สินให้เช่า","Place":"สถานที่","Letter date":"วันที่จดหมาย","Termination of tenancy":"การสิ้นสุดการเช่า","Calculate date and draft letter":"คำนวณวันที่และร่างจดหมาย","Planning date":"วันที่วางแผน","Target date":"วันที่เป้าหมาย","Editable draft":"ฉบับร่างที่แก้ไขได้","Copy draft":"คัดลอกฉบับร่าง","Enter your contract terms.":"กรอกเงื่อนไขสัญญาของคุณ","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"ร่างแผนพร้อมแล้ว ตรวจสอบกับสัญญาของคุณ","Check the dates and period.":"ตรวจสอบวันที่และช่วงเวลา","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"ผลลัพธ์เป็นไปตามวันแจ้งสัญญาที่ให้ไว้ ไม่ใช่คำตัดสินตามกฎหมาย","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"สถานการณ์การได้รับทรัพย์สินของสวิส","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"ภาษีกำไรจากทรัพย์สินของสวิส - สถานการณ์อัตราที่ผู้ใช้ป้อน","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"ประมาณการทรัพย์สินที่ได้รับโดยใช้ต้นทุนการทำธุรกรรมของคุณเองและอัตราภาษีจากรัฐที่รับผิดชอบ","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"กรอกรายได้ ค่าใช้จ่ายในการเข้าซื้อกิจการ ค่าใช้จ่ายที่มีสิทธิ์ที่คุณยืนยันแล้ว และอัตราที่มีผลจากเครื่องคำนวณ Cantonal อย่างเป็นทางการ","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"ภาษีทรัพย์สินของสวิสจะแตกต่างกันไปตามเขต ระยะเวลาการถือครอง การหักเงิน และกรณี เครื่องมือนี้ไม่ได้ระบุอัตราหรือกำหนดต้นทุนที่ยอมรับได้","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"รายได้จากการขาย (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"ต้นทุนการได้มา (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"ค่าใช้จ่ายอื่นๆ ที่ยอมรับได้ (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"อัตราภาษีที่แท้จริงจากแหล่งที่มาอย่างเป็นทางการ (%)","Estimate scenario":"สถานการณ์จำลองโดยประมาณ","Illustrative scenario":"สถานการณ์จำลอง","Gain entered":"กำไรเข้าแล้ว","Tax at entered rate":"ภาษีตามอัตราที่ป้อน","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"ป้อนตัวเลขจากบันทึกและแหล่งที่มาของรัฐ","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"คำนวณสถานการณ์แล้ว ตรวจสอบกับตำบล","Check amounts and rate.":"ตรวจสอบจำนวนเงินและอัตรา","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"ไม่มีการฝังตารางภาษีของมณฑล อัตราที่แท้จริงที่คุณป้อนจะช่วยประมาณการ","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"สถานการณ์ภาษีมรดกและภาษีของขวัญของสวิส","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"ภาษีมรดกและของขวัญของสวิส — สถานการณ์อัตราของคุณ","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"ประมาณจำนวนเงินที่ต้องเสียภาษีจากการยกเว้นและอัตราที่ผู้ใช้ป้อน กฎจะแตกต่างกันไปตามเขตและความสัมพันธ์","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"ป้อนจำนวนเงิน การยกเว้น และอัตราที่มีผลบังคับใช้ที่ยืนยันสำหรับผู้รับและเขต","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"กฎของแคนตันและความสัมพันธ์ทางครอบครัวสามารถเปลี่ยนการยกเว้นและอัตราได้ เครื่องมือนี้ไม่ได้เลือกกฎของมณฑลหรือกำหนดภาระภาษี","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"จำนวนมรดกหรือของขวัญ (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"ยืนยันการยกเว้นกับแคนตัน (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"อัตราประสิทธิผลยืนยันด้วยแคนตัน (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"จำนวนเงินหลังจากป้อนการยกเว้น","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"ป้อนตัวเลขที่ยืนยันสำหรับกรณีของคุณ","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"ค่าประมาณใช้เฉพาะการยกเว้นและอัตราที่คุณป้อนเท่านั้น","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"สถานการณ์งบประมาณการสนับสนุนเด็กของสวิส","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"งบประมาณการสนับสนุนเด็กของสวิส — สถานการณ์ครัวเรือนที่โปร่งใส","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"จัดสรรงบประมาณย่อยที่ป้อนตามรายได้หลักหลังจากเครดิตต้นทุนโดยตรงที่ป้อน","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"ใช้เอกสารความต้องการรายเดือนของเด็ก รายได้ต่อเดือนของทั้งผู้ปกครอง และค่าใช้จ่ายโดยตรงใดๆ ที่คุณต้องการเครดิต","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"นี่คือแผ่นงานการวางแผนเท่านั้น ไม่ใช่รางวัลการดูแลเด็กหรือวิธีการทางกฎหมายของสวิส ที่อยู่อาศัย การดูแล ภาษี ผลประโยชน์ และกฎหมายกรณีไม่ได้รับการประเมิน","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"งบประมาณย่อยรายเดือนที่คุณบันทึกไว้ (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"ผู้ปกครอง A มีรายได้ต่อเดือนที่มีอยู่ (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"ผู้ปกครอง B มีรายได้ต่อเดือน (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"จ่ายค่าใช้จ่ายสำหรับเด็กโดยตรงที่ผู้ปกครอง A ชำระเป็นเครดิต (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"จัดสรรสถานการณ์จำลอง","Illustrative allocation":"การจัดสรรที่เป็นภาพประกอบ","Parent A remaining contribution":"Parent A การสนับสนุนที่เหลืออยู่","Parent B contribution":"การมีส่วนร่วมของผู้ปกครอง B","Entered monthly child budget":"ป้อนงบประมาณย่อยรายเดือนแล้ว","Enter your household budget figures.":"กรอกตัวเลขงบประมาณครัวเรือนของคุณ","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"สถานการณ์งบประมาณที่คำนวณแล้ว หารือเกี่ยวกับภาระผูกพันทางกฎหมายกับที่ปรึกษาที่มีคุณสมบัติ","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"ตรวจสอบจำนวนเงิน สินเชื่อต้องไม่เกินงบประมาณ","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"หุ้นเป็นสัดส่วนกับรายได้ที่เข้ามาทั้งสอง เครดิตต้นทุนโดยตรงจะถูกหักออกก่อน","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"ตัวอย่างการใส่ยัติภังค์ของเบราว์เซอร์","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"ตัวอย่างการใส่ยติภังค์คำ — รูปแบบภาษาของเบราว์เซอร์","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"ดูตัวอย่างเครื่องหมายยัติภังค์ของเบราว์เซอร์สำหรับข้อความที่คุณระบุ การสนับสนุนขึ้นอยู่กับเบราว์เซอร์และทรัพยากรภาษาที่ติดตั้ง","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"เลือกภาษาที่ตรงกับข้อความของคุณ ป้อนตัวอย่าง และปรับความกว้างของบรรทัดที่มีอยู่","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"ใช้การใส่ยัติภังค์ CSS ดั้งเดิมของเบราว์เซอร์ ไม่รวมพจนานุกรม เบราว์เซอร์ที่ไม่รองรับอาจไม่แสดงเครื่องหมายยัติภังค์ การคัดลอกข้อความจะคงการสะกดคำเดิมไว้","Text language (BCP 47)":"ภาษาข้อความ (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"แสดงตัวอย่างความกว้าง (ตัวอักษร)","Text to preview":"ข้อความเพื่อดูตัวอย่าง","Preview":"ดูตัวอย่าง","Enter text and choose its language.":"ป้อนข้อความและเลือกภาษา","Preview updated.":"อัปเดตตัวอย่างแล้ว","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"ป้อนแท็กภาษาและข้อความที่รองรับ","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"ลองใช้ย่อหน้าเดียวกันโดยมีความกว้างต่างกันเพื่อดูว่าเบราว์เซอร์สามารถแยกคำตรงส่วนใดได้","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"พื้นที่ทำงานตรวจการสะกดส่วนตัว","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"เครื่องตรวจตัวสะกดในเครื่อง — ใช้พจนานุกรมเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"แก้ไขข้อความด้วยการตรวจตัวสะกดของเบราว์เซอร์ เลือกภาษา และคัดลอกข้อความที่แก้ไข","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"ข้อความยังคงอยู่ในหน้านี้ ตั้งค่าภาษาที่เบราว์เซอร์ของคุณมีพจนานุกรมการสะกดคำ จากนั้นใช้เมนูการสะกดคำหรือขีดเส้นใต้คำแนะนำ","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"พื้นที่ทำงานนี้ไม่ได้อัปโหลดข้อความหรือจัดส่งพจนานุกรม ความพร้อมใช้งานและคำแนะนำในการตรวจการสะกดของเบราว์เซอร์ขึ้นอยู่กับอุปกรณ์ เบราว์เซอร์ และพจนานุกรมที่ติดตั้ง","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"ภาษาตรวจตัวสะกด (BCP 47)","Text to check":"ข้อความที่จะตรวจสอบ","Copy text":"คัดลอกข้อความ","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"พิมพ์หรือวางข้อความ คลิกขวาหรือใช้เมนูการสะกดอุปกรณ์ของคุณเพื่อขอคำแนะนำ","Text copied.":"คัดลอกข้อความแล้ว","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"ไม่สามารถคัดลอกโดยอัตโนมัติ เลือกและคัดลอกข้อความ","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"เบราว์เซอร์ที่ไม่มีพจนานุกรมที่ตรงกันอาจไม่ทำเครื่องหมายการสะกดผิด","Resume Structure Checker":"ตัวตรวจสอบโครงสร้างเรซูเม่","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Resume Checker — ตรวจทาน PDF และ DOCX ในเครื่องฟรี","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"ตรวจสอบข้อความเรซูเม่ ส่วนหัว ส่วน ลิงก์ และโครงสร้างสัญลักษณ์แสดงหัวข้อย่อยในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ เปรียบเทียบคำศัพท์ลักษณะงานด้วยการนับ ไม่มีคะแนนการจ้างงานหรืออัพโหลด","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"ตรวจสอบว่าเรซูเม่แบบข้อความเปิดเผยอะไรบ้าง: ข้อความที่แยกออกมา โครงสร้างส่วนหัว การแสดงข้อมูลในช่องข้อมูลติดต่อ ลิงก์ และส่วนที่เป็นที่รู้จักทั่วไป เลือกเปรียบเทียบเงื่อนไขคำอธิบายงานซ้ำๆ ได้","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"DOCX ที่มีรูปแบบหัวข้อ 1 สำหรับประสบการณ์และการศึกษาจะแสดงหัวข้อเหล่านั้น PDF จะถูกตรวจสอบจากข้อความที่เลือกได้ คอลัมน์อาจถูกอ่านในลำดับอื่น","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"ไฟล์ DOCX ได้รับการตรวจสอบภายในเครื่องเป็น Office ZIP/XML ไฟล์ PDF จะถูกอ่านด้วยกลไก PDF.js ในเครื่องที่เลื่อนออกไป การเปรียบเทียบคำอธิบายลักษณะงานที่ไม่บังคับจะนับคำศัพท์ที่เลือกในแต่ละข้อความ ไม่ได้สร้างคะแนนหรือแนะนำว่าควรจ้างใครสักคนหรือไม่","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"นี่คือการตรวจสอบรูปแบบและโครงสร้างข้อความ ไม่ใช่เครื่องจำลอง ATS การตรวจสอบทางกฎหมาย หรือการทำนายความสำเร็จในการสัมภาษณ์ PDF ที่สแกนโดยไม่มีข้อความที่เลือกได้จะต้องใช้ OCR ก่อน ไม่รองรับเอกสารที่มีการป้องกันด้วยรหัสผ่าน เปิดใช้งานมาโคร ลงนาม หรือมีขนาดใหญ่ผิดปกติ","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"เลือกเรซูเม่ (PDF หรือ DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"ไฟล์ของคุณจะอยู่ในเบราว์เซอร์นี้และไม่ได้อัปโหลด สูงสุด 20 เมกะไบต์; PDF สูงสุด 50 หน้า เนื้อหาที่ขยาย DOCX ถูกจำกัดไว้ที่ 80 MB","Optional job description":"คำอธิบายงานเสริม","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"วางข้อความธรรมดาหากคุณต้องการเปรียบเทียบความถี่ของคำ อย่าใส่ข้อมูลที่ละเอียดอ่อนซึ่งคุณไม่จำเป็นต้องวิเคราะห์","Paste job-description text here…":"วางข้อความคำอธิบายงานที่นี่...","Analyze locally":"วิเคราะห์ในเครื่อง","Clear files and report":"ล้างไฟล์และรายงาน","Resume review":"ตรวจทานต่อ","File type":"ประเภทไฟล์","Extracted characters":"อักขระที่แยกออกมา","Words counted":"นับจำนวนคำ","Detected headings":"ตรวจพบส่วนหัว","Recognized sections":"ส่วนที่ได้รับการยอมรับ","Hyperlinks found":"พบไฮเปอร์ลิงก์","Bullet paragraphs":"ย่อหน้าหัวข้อย่อย","An email address appears in the text":"ที่อยู่อีเมลปรากฏในข้อความ","No email address pattern was detected":"ไม่พบรูปแบบที่อยู่อีเมล","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"มีรูปแบบคล้ายหมายเลขโทรศัพท์ปรากฏในข้อความ","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"ไม่พบรูปแบบคล้ายหมายเลขโทรศัพท์","Job-description terms (counts only)":"เงื่อนไขรายละเอียดงาน (นับเท่านั้น)","Term":"Term","In job text":"ในข้อความงาน","In resume":"ในเรซูเม่","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"วางคำอธิบายงานเพื่อเปรียบเทียบจำนวนเทอม","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"ไม่พบรูปแบบส่วนหัวที่ชัดเจน ส่วนหัวของ PDF เป็นการประเมินจากขนาดตัวอักษรและอาจคลาดเคลื่อนได้","Detected":"ตรวจพบ","Not detected":"ตรวจไม่พบ","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"การวิเคราะห์พฤติกรรมนี้รู้จักชุดชื่อส่วนทั่วไปที่จำกัด ไม่ได้ตัดสินใจว่าจะต้องใช้ส่วนใด","Profile / summary":"โปรไฟล์/สรุป","Experience":"ประสบการณ์","Education":"การศึกษา","Skills":"ทักษะ","Contact":"ติดต่อ","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"ไม่พบข้อความที่เลือกได้ PDF ที่สแกนอย่างเดียวต้องใช้ OCR ก่อนจึงจะตรวจสอบได้","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"เลือกประวัติย่อ PDF หรือ DOCX เพื่อเริ่มต้น","Reading the selected file locally…":"กำลังอ่านไฟล์ที่เลือกในเครื่อง...","Local structure review complete.":"การตรวจสอบโครงสร้างเฉพาะที่เสร็จสมบูรณ์","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"เบราว์เซอร์นี้ไม่รองรับคุณสมบัติเอกสารในเครื่องที่จำเป็น","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"เลือกไฟล์ PDF หรือไฟล์ DOCX สมัยใหม่ที่ถูกต้องตามขีดจำกัดท้องถิ่นที่ระบุไว้","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"ไม่สามารถอ่าน PDF ได้ เนื้อหาอาจเสียหาย ถูกเข้ารหัส หรือไม่มีข้อความที่เลือกได้","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"ไม่สามารถเปิดหรืออ่านแพ็คเกจ DOCX ได้อย่างปลอดภัย","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"เครื่องมือนี้อัพโหลดหรือบันทึกเรซูเม่ของฉันหรือไม่?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"No. การแยกวิเคราะห์และการวิเคราะห์ทำงานในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ ข้อความของไฟล์จะไม่ถูกส่งไปยังเซิร์ฟเวอร์หรือถูกเก็บไว้หลังจากที่คุณล้างรายงานหรือออกจากเพจ","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"มีการคาดเดาว่า ATS หรือนายจ้างจะยอมรับเรซูเม่ของฉันหรือไม่?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"No. จะตรวจสอบข้อความที่อ่านได้และโครงสร้างที่เรียบง่ายเท่านั้น ระบบการจ้างงานแตกต่างกัน และนี่ไม่ใช่การรับประกันความเข้ากันได้ของ ATS หรือการทำนายการจ้างงาน","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"สามารถอ่าน PDF ที่สแกนได้หรือไม่","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"เฉพาะในกรณีที่ PDF มีเลเยอร์ข้อความที่เลือกได้ ตัวตรวจสอบนี้ไม่ดาวน์โหลดโมเดล OCR ใช้เครื่องมือ OCR ก่อนสำหรับเอกสารที่สแกนเฉพาะรูปภาพเท่านั้น","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"การเปรียบเทียบลักษณะงานหมายถึงอะไร?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"แสดงจำนวนสำหรับเงื่อนไขที่เกิดซ้ำหลังจากการทำให้เป็นมาตรฐานอย่างง่าย ไม่ใช่เปอร์เซ็นต์การจับคู่ การจัดอันดับ คำแนะนำ หรือการประเมินคุณสมบัติของคุณ","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"เหตุใด PDF จึงแสดงส่วนหัวน้อยกว่า DOCX","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF มักจะไม่คงรูปแบบส่วนหัวเชิงความหมายไว้ ตัวตรวจสอบจะประมาณบรรทัดที่โดดเด่นจากขนาดข้อความและลำดับการอ่าน ดังนั้นคอลัมน์และการออกแบบภาพจึงส่งผลต่อผลลัพธ์ได้","How local resume review works":"การทบทวนเรซูเม่ในพื้นที่ทำงานอย่างไร","Resume checker questions":"คำถามเกี่ยวกับตัวตรวจสอบเรซูเม่","Scope and limitations":"ขอบเขตและข้อจำกัด","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"เครื่องแยกเสียงร้องและดนตรีประกอบท้องถิ่น","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"ตัวกำจัดเสียงร้อง — แยกเสียงร้องและเสียงประกอบในเครื่อง","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"แยกตัวอย่างเสียงสเตอริโอสั้นๆ ออกเป็นเสียงร้องโดยประมาณและดนตรีประกอบในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ เสียงจะคงอยู่ในอุปกรณ์ของคุณ โมเดลถูกดาวน์โหลดจากโฮสต์สาธารณะ","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"เลือกคลิปเพลงสเตอริโอความยาวสูงสุด 30 วินาที ในการใช้งานครั้งแรก เบราว์เซอร์จะดาวน์โหลดรุ่น 35.6 MB ไฟล์เสียงได้รับการประมวลผลบนอุปกรณ์นี้และไม่มีการอัปโหลด","What you get":"สิ่งที่คุณจะได้","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"ดูตัวอย่างและดาวน์โหลดก้าน WAV สองท่อน: เสียงร้องโดยประมาณและดนตรีประกอบที่เหลือ ผลลัพธ์ขึ้นอยู่กับส่วนผสมและอาจมีสิ่งประดิษฐ์","Local processing":"การประมวลผลภายในเครื่อง","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"เครื่องมือนี้ใช้เครือข่ายเสียงร้อง Open-Unmix UMX-HQ ที่ส่งออกไปยัง ONNX และ ONNX Runtime Web โมเดลจะถูกดึงมาเฉพาะเมื่อคุณกด Separate เท่านั้น ไม่มีการใช้ API การอนุมานแบบชำระเงินหรือการสมัครสมาชิก เสียงถูกถอดรหัส ประมวลผล และส่งออกภายในเครื่อง","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"นี่คือค่าประมาณสำหรับการประมวลผลสเตอริโอ 44.1 kHz และคลิปสูงสุด 30 วินาที แหล่งสัญญาณโมโนจะถูกทำซ้ำเป็นสเตอริโอ เสียงร้องที่มิกซ์อย่างลึกซึ้งในเครื่องดนตรี เอฟเฟกต์หนัก การบันทึกการแสดงสด และแนวเพลงที่ไม่ธรรมดาสามารถทำให้เกิดการรั่วไหลหรือสิ่งแปลกปลอมได้ อย่าใช้ผลลัพธ์เป็นต้นแบบที่สะอาด การดาวน์โหลดโมเดลต้องใช้การเชื่อมต่ออินเทอร์เน็ต เสียงไม่ออกจากอุปกรณ์นี้","Is my audio uploaded?":"เสียงของฉันถูกอัปโหลดหรือไม่","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"No. เสียงที่เลือกจะถูกถอดรหัสและประมวลผลในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ คำขอเครือข่ายเดียวคือการดาวน์โหลดโมเดลเมื่อคุณเริ่มการแยก","Why is the first run slow?":"เหตุใดการทำงานครั้งแรกจึงช้า?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"เบราว์เซอร์ดาวน์โหลดรุ่น 35.6 MB หนึ่งครั้ง เบราว์เซอร์อาจแคชไว้ การอนุมานจะทำงานภายในเครื่องบน CPU ของอุปกรณ์","Will every song separate cleanly?":"แต่ละเพลงจะแยกกันชัดๆมั้ย?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"No. แบบจำลองจะประมาณก้านเสียงและอาจทำให้เกิดการรั่วไหลของเสียง ลบฮาร์โมนิกของเครื่องดนตรี หรือสร้างสิ่งประดิษฐ์ ฟังก่อนพึ่งก้าน","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"ไฟล์เสียงสเตอริโอ (สูงสุด 30 วินาที)","Choose audio":"เลือกเสียง","Separate vocals":"เสียงร้องแยก","Cancel / clear":"ยกเลิก/ล้าง","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"เลือกไฟล์เสียงสั้นๆ เพื่อเริ่มต้น","Downloading the separation model…":"กำลังดาวน์โหลดแบบจำลองการแยก…","Separating locally…":"กำลังแยกภายใน…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"การแยกเสร็จสมบูรณ์ ดูตัวอย่างหรือดาวน์โหลดสเต็มใดก็ได้","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"ไม่สามารถประมวลผลไฟล์นี้หรือโหลดโมเดลได้ ตรวจสอบรูปแบบและการเชื่อมต่อ จากนั้นลองอีกครั้ง","Model and weight license information":"ข้อมูลใบอนุญาตรุ่นและน้ำหนัก","Estimated vocals":"เสียงร้องโดยประมาณ","Estimated accompaniment":"การแสดงดนตรีประกอบโดยประมาณ","Download WAV":"ดาวน์โหลด WAV","Progress":"ความคืบหน้า","Preparing local separation…":"กำลังเตรียมการแยกในพื้นที่…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"การแยกเสร็จสมบูรณ์ เสียงยังคงอยู่ในอุปกรณ์นี้","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"เสียงนี้ไม่สามารถประมวลผลได้ ลองใช้ไฟล์เพลงสเตอริโอที่มีความยาวไม่เกิน 30 วินาที","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"ตัวเปรียบเทียบค่าลดหย่อนการประกันสุขภาพของสวิส","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"เครื่องคำนวณแฟรนไชส์ประกันสุขภาพของสวิส — เปรียบเทียบค่าใช้จ่ายรายปี","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"เปรียบเทียบค่าเสียหายส่วนแรกจากการประกันสุขภาพพื้นฐานของสวิสโดยใช้เบี้ยประกันและค่ารักษาพยาบาลรายปีที่เข้าเกณฑ์ที่คุณกรอก ไม่มีการคาดเดาใบเสนอราคาของผู้ประกันตน","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"ป้อนเบี้ยประกันภัยรายเดือนที่แสดงโดยบริษัทประกันเดียวกันสำหรับค่าเสียหายส่วนแรกแต่ละรายการที่เสนอ จากนั้นเปรียบเทียบสถานการณ์ต้นทุนการรักษารายปีที่ต่ำ คาดหวัง และสูง","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"สำหรับการประกันสุขภาพขั้นพื้นฐานภาคบังคับของสวิส ค่าเสียหายส่วนแรกมาตรฐานสำหรับผู้ใหญ่คือ CHF 300 และค่าเสียหายส่วนแรกสำหรับเด็กคือ CHF 0 ระดับตัวเลือกจะแตกต่างกันไปตามกลุ่มอายุ หลังจากหักลดหย่อนแล้ว ค่าธรรมเนียมการเก็บรักษามาตรฐานคือ 10% ของค่าใช้จ่ายคงเหลือที่เข้าเกณฑ์ โดยจำกัดไว้ที่ CHF 700 ต่อปีสำหรับผู้ใหญ่ และ CHF 350 สำหรับเด็ก เครื่องมือจะเพิ่มเบี้ยประกันภัยที่คุณป้อนให้กับการแบ่งปันต้นทุนตามแบบจำลองนี้ มันไม่ได้ดึงอัตราของผู้ประกันตนหรือตัดสินใจว่าตัวเลือกใดที่เหมาะกับคุณ","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"หากผู้ใหญ่ชำระค่าเบี้ยประกันภัยรายเดือน CHF 400 โดยหักส่วนแรกได้ 300 CHF และ 350 CHF โดยหักส่วนแรกได้ 2,500 CHF ผลต่างเบี้ยประกันภัยรายปีจะอยู่ที่ 600 CHF เปรียบเทียบการประหยัดนั้นกับความแตกต่างตามแบบจำลองในการแบ่งปันต้นทุนในแต่ละจำนวนเงินที่มีสิทธิ์ต่ำ คาดหวัง และสูง","How the estimate works":"วิธีการทำงานของการประมาณการ","Common questions":"คำถามที่พบบ่อย","Scope and exclusions":"ขอบเขตและข้อยกเว้น","Where do I get the premiums?":"รับเบี้ยประกันภัยได้ที่ไหน?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"ใช้ข้อเสนอรายเดือนปัจจุบันสำหรับบริษัทประกันภัย ภูมิภาคพรีเมียม กลุ่มอายุ ความคุ้มครองอุบัติเหตุ และรุ่นประกันภัยเดียวกัน Priminfo เป็นเว็บไซต์เปรียบเทียบอย่างเป็นทางการของรัฐบาลกลาง หน้านี้ไม่ได้ดึงข้อมูลหรือสร้างใบเสนอราคาของผู้ประกันตน","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"มีการเสนอระดับการหักลดหย่อนที่ระบุไว้ทั้งหมดเสมอหรือไม่","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"No. บริษัทประกันภัยไม่จำเป็นต้องเสนอทุกระดับ และข้อเสนออาจแตกต่างกันสำหรับคนหนุ่มสาว กรอกเฉพาะเบี้ยประกันที่แสดงสำหรับกรมธรรม์ของคุณเอง ปล่อยให้ตัวเลือกที่ไม่พร้อมใช้งานว่างไว้","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"นี่แสดงใบเสร็จค่ารักษาพยาบาลของฉันหรือไม่?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"No. แบบจำลองนี้ครอบคลุมค่าธรรมเนียมการหักลดหย่อนปกติและค่าธรรมเนียมการเก็บรักษามาตรฐาน 10% สำหรับค่าใช้จ่ายที่เข้าเกณฑ์ ไม่รวมเงินสมทบรายวันในโรงพยาบาล ค่ารักษายาพิเศษ 40% บริการที่ได้รับการยกเว้น การดูแลที่ไม่คุ้มครอง และการประกันภัยเสริม","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"นี่คือการเปรียบเทียบสถานการณ์ ไม่ใช่คำแนะนำด้านการประกันภัย การแพทย์ หรือทางการเงิน มันไม่ได้ทำนายการรักษาหรือเบี้ยประกันภัยของคุณ โดยไม่รวมเงินสมทบค่ารักษาพยาบาลในแต่ละวัน (ปกติ CHF 15 ต่อวันของผู้ป่วยใน โดยมีการยกเว้นตามกฎหมาย) เงินประกันพิเศษ 40% สำหรับยาบางชนิด การยกเว้นการคลอดบุตร/การป้องกัน บริการนอกความคุ้มครองภาคบังคับ เงินอุดหนุนเบี้ยประกันภัย และประกันเสริม การจ่ายร่วมจริงจึงอาจแตกต่างกัน การหักลดหย่อนที่สูงขึ้นหมายความว่าคุณจะต้องสามารถจ่ายเงินล่วงหน้าได้มากขึ้นหากคุณได้รับการดูแล","Who is insured under this policy?":"ใครเป็นผู้ประกันตนตามกรมธรรม์นี้?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"ผู้ใหญ่ (อายุ 19 ปีขึ้นไป)","Child (under 18)":"เด็ก (อายุต่ำกว่า 18 ปี)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"สถานการณ์ต้นทุนการรักษาที่มีสิทธิ์ต่อปี (CHF) ต่ำ","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"ค่าใช้จ่ายการรักษาที่มีสิทธิ์ต่อปีที่คาดหวัง (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"สถานการณ์ต้นทุนการรักษาที่เข้าเกณฑ์ต่อปีสูง (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"เบี้ยประกันภัยรายเดือนจากบริษัทประกันรายเดียว","Monthly premium":"เบี้ยประกันภัยรายเดือน","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"ป้อนเฉพาะตัวเลือกที่เสนอสำหรับนโยบายเดียวกันนี้ ปล่อยให้คนอื่นว่าง.","Adult deductible choices":"ตัวเลือกการหักลดหย่อนสำหรับผู้ใหญ่","Child deductible choices":"ตัวเลือกการหักลดหย่อนบุตร","Compare annual costs":"เปรียบเทียบค่าใช้จ่ายรายปี","Clear entries":"ล้างรายการ","Download CSV":"ดาวน์โหลด CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"ค่าเบี้ยประกันภัยรายปีโดยประมาณบวกส่วนแบ่งค่าใช้จ่าย","Deductible":"หักลดหย่อนได้","Annual premiums":"เบี้ยประกันภัยรายปี","Total at low costs":"รวมในราคาที่ต่ำ","Total at expected costs":"ยอดรวมตามต้นทุนที่คาดไว้","Total at high costs":"รวมด้วยต้นทุนสูง","Cost sharing at low costs":"แบ่งปันต้นทุนด้วยต้นทุนที่ต่ำ","Cost sharing at expected costs":"การแบ่งต้นทุนตามต้นทุนที่คาดหวัง","Cost sharing at high costs":"การแบ่งปันต้นทุนด้วยต้นทุนที่สูง","Difference from lowest available deductible":"ผลต่างจากค่าเสียหายส่วนแรกต่ำสุดที่มีอยู่","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"ค่ารักษาพยาบาลที่ใช้การประหยัดแบบพรีเมียมจนหมด","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"การประหยัดแบบพรีเมียมที่ป้อนไว้จะไม่ถูกยกเลิกภายในช่วงการแบ่งปันต้นทุนตามแบบจำลอง","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"ไม่มีการประหยัดเบี้ยประกันเทียบกับการหักลดหย่อนขั้นต่ำสุด","Lowest expected total among entered options":"ผลรวมที่คาดหวังต่ำสุดในบรรดาตัวเลือกที่ป้อน","Scenario details":"รายละเอียดสถานการณ์","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"ป้อนสถานการณ์จำลองต้นทุนการรักษาพยาบาลที่สั่งไว้สามสถานการณ์และเบี้ยประกันภัยรายเดือนสำหรับการหักลดหย่อนที่มีอยู่อย่างน้อยสองรายการ","Official rules and current premiums:":"กฎอย่างเป็นทางการและเบี้ยประกันภัยปัจจุบัน:","Federal deductible rules":"กฎการหักลดหย่อนของรัฐบาลกลาง","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo การเปรียบเทียบระดับพรีเมียมอย่างเป็นทางการ","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"การเปรียบเทียบคำนวณในเบราว์เซอร์นี้","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"ตรวจสอบกลุ่มอายุ สั่งซื้อสถานการณ์ต้นทุน และเบี้ยประกันรายเดือนอย่างน้อยสองรายการ","Entries cleared.":"รายการถูกล้างแล้ว","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV ดาวน์โหลดในเครื่อง","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"เครื่องคำนวณส่วนลด Swiss Health Premium","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"เครื่องคำนวณเงินอุดหนุน Swiss Premium — เบี้ยประกันภัยสุทธิของคุณ","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"คำนวณเบี้ยประกันสุขภาพสุทธิของสวิสจากเบี้ยประกันภัยปัจจุบันและส่วนลดรายเดือนที่มอบให้โดยรัฐของคุณ","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"ป้อนเบี้ยประกันภัยและยืนยันการลดราคารายเดือนจากบริษัทประกันภัยหรือการตัดสินใจของเขตพื้นที่ เครื่องมือนี้ไม่ได้ตัดสินว่าคุณมีคุณสมบัติหรือไม่","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"รัฐของสวิสจะเป็นผู้กำหนดว่าใครมีคุณสมบัติ ได้รับการสนับสนุนเท่าใด และจำเป็นต้องมีการสมัครหรือไม่ เครื่องคิดเลขนี้จะลบเฉพาะการลดลงรายเดือนที่ยืนยันแล้วจากเบี้ยประกันภัยเดียวและแสดงจำนวนเงินรายปี","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"หากเบี้ยประกันภัยรายเดือนคือ CHF 420 และส่วนลดที่ยืนยันคือ CHF 120 เบี้ยประกันภัยสุทธิโดยประมาณคือ CHF 300 ต่อเดือน","How the calculation works":"วิธีการคำนวณ","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"สิ่งนี้บอกฉันว่าฉันมีคุณสมบัติหรือไม่?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"No. คุณสมบัติและจำนวนรางวัลจะถูกกำหนดโดยเขตที่อยู่อาศัย ใช้ข้อมูลทางการที่ลิงก์ไว้หรือติดต่อสำนักงานเขต","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"จะหาปริมาณการลดหย่อนได้จากที่ไหน?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"ใช้การตัดสินใจปัจจุบันหรือเบี้ยประกันภัยลดที่แสดงโดยบริษัทประกันของคุณ รัฐบางแห่งให้ส่วนลดโดยอัตโนมัติ อื่น ๆ ต้องมีการสมัคร","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"นี่เป็นเลขคณิตสำหรับนโยบายเดียว ไม่ใช่การตัดสินใจเกี่ยวกับคุณสมบัติหรือผลประโยชน์ โดยจะไม่คำนวณรายได้ครัวเรือน ทรัพย์สิน สถานะทางครอบครัว กำหนดเวลา เกณฑ์เขตการปกครอง หรือสิทธิ์ในการสมัคร พรีเมี่ยมและรางวัลสามารถเปลี่ยนแปลงได้ ยืนยันกับบริษัทประกันและมณฑลของคุณ","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"เบี้ยประกันภัยรายเดือนปัจจุบัน (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"ได้รับการลดหย่อนรายเดือนแล้ว (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"ป้อนจำนวนเงินที่ยืนยันโดยแคนตันหรือบริษัทประกันภัย อย่าใช้การประมาณการเป็นรางวัล","Calculate net premium":"คำนวณเบี้ยประกันภัยสุทธิ","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"ระบุเบี้ยประกันภัยปัจจุบันและยืนยันการลดหย่อน","Estimated premium after reduction":"ประมาณการเบี้ยประกันหลังปรับลด","Current monthly premium":"เบี้ยประกันภัยรายเดือนปัจจุบัน","Monthly reduction":"ลดรายเดือน","Estimated net monthly premium":"ประมาณการเบี้ยประกันภัยสุทธิรายเดือน","Reduction over 12 months":"ลดลงในระยะเวลา 12 เดือน","Reduction as a share of premium":"ลดเป็นส่วนแบ่งพรีเมี่ยม","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"การคำนวณเสร็จสมบูรณ์ ยืนยันรางวัลและวันที่มีผลกับรัฐและบริษัทประกันภัยของคุณ","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"เช็คว่าลดแล้วไม่เกินเบี้ยประกันรายเดือน","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"เครื่องคำนวณสถานการณ์อ้างอิงอัตราค่าเช่าของสวิส","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"เครื่องคำนวณการปรับค่าเช่าของสวิส — สถานการณ์อ้างอิงอัตรา","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"ประมาณว่าการเปลี่ยนแปลงในอัตราอ้างอิงการจำนองของสวิตเซอร์แลนด์ส่งผลต่อค่าเช่าสุทธิที่อยู่อาศัยอย่างไร ใช้อัตราล่าสุดจากสำนักงานการเคหะของรัฐบาลกลาง","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"เปรียบเทียบอัตราอ้างอิงที่ระบุในสัญญาเช่าหรือประกาศเช่าล่าสุดของคุณกับอัตราสวิสอย่างเป็นทางการในปัจจุบัน การคำนวณยังคงอยู่บนอุปกรณ์ของคุณ","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"สำนักงานกลางเพื่อการเคหะเผยแพร่อัตราอ้างอิงการจำนองหนึ่งอัตราสำหรับการปรับค่าเช่าของสวิสในแต่ละไตรมาส โดยหลักการแล้วการเพิ่มขึ้น 0.25 เปอร์เซ็นต์สามารถช่วยให้ค่าเช่าเพิ่มขึ้น 3%; โดยหลักการแล้วการลดลง 0.25 จุดสามารถลดลงได้ 2.91% สถานการณ์นี้ใช้การเปลี่ยนแปลงเหล่านั้นทีละขั้นตอนกับค่าเช่าสุทธิที่คุณป้อน","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"สำหรับค่าเช่าสุทธิ CHF 3,000 ต่อเดือน อัตราการอ้างอิงที่ลดลงจาก 1.75% เป็น 1.50% ให้การเปลี่ยนแปลงเฉพาะอัตราอ้างอิงโดยประมาณที่ประมาณ −87.38 CHF ต่อเดือน (−2.91%)","How this estimate works":"การประมาณการนี้ทำงานอย่างไร","Where do I find the current rate?":"ฉันจะดูอัตราปัจจุบันได้ที่ไหน?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"เปิดหน้า Federal Office for Housing ที่เชื่อมโยงไว้ และป้อนอัตราที่เผยแพร่ในปัจจุบัน เครื่องมือนี้ไม่ได้ฝังอัตราที่อาจล้าสมัย","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"สิ่งนี้จะตัดสินว่าฉันสามารถขอเปลี่ยนแปลงค่าเช่าได้หรือไม่?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"No. มันแยกปัจจัยหนึ่งสำหรับการปฐมนิเทศ สัญญา อัตราเงินเฟ้อ การเปลี่ยนแปลงต้นทุน การจอง และเงื่อนไขทางกฎหมายอื่นๆ สามารถเปลี่ยนแปลงผลลัพธ์ได้","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"ผลลัพธ์รวมค่าใช้จ่ายเสริมหรือไม่","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"No. ป้อนค่าเช่าสุทธิรายเดือน ไม่รวมค่าใช้จ่ายเสริมและค่าใช้จ่ายผันแปรอื่นๆ","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"ผลลัพธ์ที่ได้คือสถานการณ์จำลองที่มีอัตราอ้างอิง ไม่ใช่ความคิดเห็นทางกฎหมายหรือการตรวจสอบค่าเช่าทั้งหมด โดยไม่รวมอัตราเงินเฟ้อ การเปลี่ยนแปลงต้นทุนทั่วไป การปรับปรุง การจองตามสัญญา ค่าเช่าที่จัดทำดัชนีหรือขั้นบันได วันที่แจ้งให้ทราบ และขั้นตอนของเขตปกครอง ตรวจสอบสัญญาเช่าและคำแนะนำอย่างเป็นทางการก่อนดำเนินการ","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"สัญญาเช่าที่อยู่อาศัยของสวิส: การประมาณการผลกระทบจากอัตราอ้างอิงการจำนองเท่านั้น ไม่ใช่การตัดสินใจทางกฎหมายหรือการตรวจสอบค่าเช่าทั้งหมด","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"ค่าเช่าสุทธิรายเดือนปัจจุบัน (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"อัตราอ้างอิงที่ระบุไว้ในสัญญาเช่าหรือประกาศเช่าล่าสุดของคุณ (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"อัตราอ้างอิงสวิสอย่างเป็นทางการในปัจจุบัน (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"คำนวณสถานการณ์อัตราอ้างอิง","Reference-rate-only scenario":"สถานการณ์เฉพาะที่มีอัตราอ้างอิงเท่านั้น","Current monthly net rent":"ค่าเช่าสุทธิรายเดือนปัจจุบัน","Reference-rate change":"การเปลี่ยนแปลงอัตราอ้างอิง","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"ผลกระทบรายเดือนโดยประมาณจากอัตราอ้างอิง","Scenario monthly net rent":"สถานการณ์ค่าเช่าสุทธิรายเดือน","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"ผลรายปีเป็นเวลา 12 เดือนในอัตราเดียวกัน","potential increase":"ศักยภาพในการเพิ่มขึ้น","potential decrease":"ศักยภาพในการลดลง","no reference-rate change":"ไม่มีการเปลี่ยนแปลงอัตราอ้างอิง","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"ค่าประมาณจะใช้ 3% สำหรับการเพิ่มทุกๆ 0.25 จุดเปอร์เซ็นต์ และการลดแบบผกผันที่เท่ากันสำหรับการลดลงแต่ละครั้ง ปัจจัยอื่น ๆ สามารถเปลี่ยนผลลัพธ์ได้","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"ไม่รวมถึงอัตราเงินเฟ้อ การเปลี่ยนแปลงต้นทุนทั่วไป การปรับปรุง การจองสัญญา ค่าเช่าที่จัดทำดัชนีหรือขั้นบันได วันที่แจ้งให้ทราบ หรือข้อกำหนดขั้นตอนในท้องถิ่น ตรวจสอบสัญญาเช่าของคุณและสำนักงานกลางเพื่อคำแนะนำด้านที่อยู่อาศัย","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"ตรวจสอบอัตราและคำแนะนำอย่างเป็นทางการล่าสุด","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"สำนักงานเพื่อการเคหะแห่งสวิสเซอร์แลนด์ (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"ป้อนค่าเช่าและราคาทั้งสองเพื่อดูสถานการณ์","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"คำนวณสถานการณ์แล้ว ตรวจสอบวันที่และเงื่อนไขสัญญาก่อนที่จะเชื่อถือ","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"ตรวจสอบจำนวนและอัตรา ราคาต้องอยู่ระหว่าง 0% ถึง 5% และแตกต่างกันในขั้นละ 0.25 จุด","Inputs cleared.":"ล้างอินพุตแล้ว","Result":"ผลลัพธ์","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"ตัวประมาณค่าคงค้างวันหยุดของสวิส","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"เครื่องคำนวณการคงค้างวันหยุดของสวิส - ยอดการลาตามสัดส่วน","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"ประมาณการยอดวันลาพักร้อนของสวิสโดยพิจารณาจากวันลาประจำปีในสัญญา สัปดาห์ทำงาน วันที่จ้างงาน และวันที่ดำเนินการไปแล้ว","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"ประมาณการการลาโดยจ่ายเงินตามสัดส่วนเป็นเวลาหนึ่งปีปฏิทินโดยใช้สิทธิ์และตารางการทำงานที่คุณป้อน ไม่มีการเดาเงื่อนไขสัญญา","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"ตัวประมาณจะแบ่งวันลาประจำปีในสัญญาของคุณตามจำนวนวันตามปฏิทินที่ทำงานในปีที่เลือก สำหรับงานนอกเวลา ให้ป้อนวันทำงานปกติต่อสัปดาห์และวันลาประจำปีเป็นสัปดาห์","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"ด้วยการลาสี่สัปดาห์ สัปดาห์ทำงานห้าวัน และการจ้างงานตลอดทั้งปี สิทธิ์ประจำปีคือ 20 วันทำการก่อนที่จะลบการลาที่ได้ไปแล้ว","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"ขั้นต่ำตามกฎหมายของสวิสคือเท่าไร?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"คำแนะนำของรัฐบาลกลางระบุไว้อย่างน้อยสี่สัปดาห์ต่อปีบริการ และห้าสัปดาห์สำหรับพนักงานที่มีอายุไม่ถึง 20 ปี สัญญาหรือข้อตกลงร่วมอาจให้เงินเพิ่มเติมมากกว่านี้","Does this decide my legal balance?":"สิ่งนี้จะส่งผลต่อความสมดุลทางกฎหมายของฉันหรือไม่","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"No. เป็นการปันส่วนวันตามปฏิทินแบบง่ายๆ เงื่อนไขสัญญา กฎรวมที่เกี่ยวข้อง การขาดงานตามคุณสมบัติ การปัดเศษ และบันทึกของนายจ้างสามารถเปลี่ยนยอดคงเหลือได้","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"การประมาณการนี้ไม่ได้ตัดสินสิทธิ์ตามกฎหมายหรือคำนวณการจ่ายเงินวันหยุด โดยไม่รวมการลดสำหรับการขาดงานเป็นเวลานาน กฎการคงค้างเฉพาะสัญญาและการปัดเศษ วันหยุดนักขัตฤกษ์ ค่าล่วงเวลา กำหนดเวลาการยกยอด และข้อพิพาท ตรวจสอบสัญญาของคุณและรับคำแนะนำเกี่ยวกับยอดคงเหลือที่มีการโต้แย้ง","Leave year":"ปีลา","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"การลาประจำปีตามสัญญา (สัปดาห์)","Usual working days per week":"วันทำงานปกติต่อสัปดาห์","Employment start date":"วันที่เริ่มงาน","Employment end date":"วันที่สิ้นสุดการจ้างงาน","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"วันลาที่ได้เกิดขึ้นแล้วในปีวันหยุดนี้","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"สำหรับการวางแนวเท่านั้น ป้อนสิทธิ์รายปีตามสัญญา โดยทั่วไปขั้นต่ำตามกฎหมายคือสี่สัปดาห์หรือห้าสัปดาห์สำหรับคนงานอายุต่ำกว่า 20 ปี","Estimate balance":"ประมาณการยอดคงเหลือ","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"ป้อนสัญญาและวันที่ของคุณเพื่อประเมินยอดคงเหลือ","Estimated leave balance":"ยอดการลาโดยประมาณ","Annual leave at this schedule":"ลาประจำปีตามตารางนี้","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"วันปฏิทินที่ทำงานในปีลาหยุดนี้","Prorated days accrued":"วันที่สะสมตามสัดส่วน","Days already taken":"วันที่ผ่านไปแล้ว","Estimated days remaining":"วันที่เหลือโดยประมาณ","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"จะแบ่งวันลาประจำปีตามจำนวนวันตามปฏิทินในช่วงระยะเวลาการจ้างงาน กฎของนายจ้างและสัญญาอาจแตกต่างกัน","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"คำนวณแล้วโดยประมาณ ตรวจสอบกับสัญญาและบันทึกนายจ้างของคุณ","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"ตรวจสอบปี วันที่ ตารางการทำงาน และค่าต่างๆ"},"uk":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Сценарій допомоги по безробіттю в Швейцарії","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Калькулятор допомоги по безробіттю в Швейцарії — валовий сценарій","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Оцініть валову денну допомогу в Швейцарії, використовуючи застраховану зарплату та ставку, підтверджену вашим фондом.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Введіть страхову заробітну плату та ставку 70% або 80%, підтверджену вашою касою з безробіття.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Правила Швейцарії встановлюють ставку надбавки та обмеження зарплати. Фонд вирішує відповідність вимогам, відрахування, дні очікування та право. Місячний діапазон відображає 20–23 оплачуваних робочих дня.","Example":"Приклад","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5000 швейцарських франків при 70% становить приблизно 161,29 швейцарських франків за день тижня, який підлягає оплаті.","How it works":"Як це працює","Questions":"Питання","Scope and limits":"Сфера застосування та обмеження","Related tools":"Пов’язані інструменти","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Місячна застрахована заробітна плата (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Ставка підтверджена фондом","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Оцінка","Clear":"Очистити","Gross scenario":"Грубий сценарій","Insured salary used":"Страхова заробітна плата використана","Per payable weekday":"За оплачуваний день тижня","20-day month":"20-денний місяць","23-day month":"23-денний місяць","Official benefit rules":"Офіційні правила вигоди","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Введіть підтверджені цифри.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Розрахований сценарій. Підтвердьте суми у своєму фонді.","Check the values.":"Перевірте значення.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Планувальник повідомлень про оренду в Швейцарії","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Планувальник повідомлень про оренду в Швейцарії та чернетка листа","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Сплануйте повідомлення про оренду з дат і умов у вашому власному контракті; написати листа, не дотримуючись правил кантону.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Введіть період сповіщення, наступний дійсний день розірвання договору та дату отримання. Уточнюйте кожну дату у свого орендодавця чи асоціації орендарів.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Планувальник застосовує лише вказані вами дати та період. Він не вирішує, чи є повідомлення дійсним, коли воно отримано на законних підставах, чи застосовується спеціальний захист.","Contract notice period (months)":"Період повідомлення про контракт (місяці)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Наступний дійсний день розірвання місяця (з договору)","Expected receipt date":"Очікувана дата надходження","Your name":"Ваше ім'я","Your address":"Ваша адреса","Landlord / agency":"Орендодавець / агентство","Recipient address":"Адреса одержувача","Rental property":"Оренда нерухомості","Place":"Місце","Letter date":"Дата листа","Termination of tenancy":"Припинення договору оренди","Calculate date and draft letter":"Обчислити дату та чернетку листа","Planning date":"Дата планування","Target date":"Цільова дата","Editable draft":"Чернетка, яку можна редагувати","Copy draft":"Копіювати чернетку","Enter your contract terms.":"Введіть умови контракту.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Проект планування готовий. Перевірте ваш контракт.","Check the dates and period.":"Перевірте дати та період.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Результат слідує за наданим днем ​​повідомлення про контракт; це не законне рішення про повідомлення.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Сценарій приросту власності в Швейцарії","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Податок на прибуток від власності в Швейцарії — сценарій ставки, введеної користувачем","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Оцініть прибуток від власності, використовуючи власні витрати на трансакцію та ставку податку відповідального кантону.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Введіть надходження, вартість придбання, прийнятні витрати, які ви підтвердили, і ефективну ставку з офіційного кантонального калькулятора.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Податок на прибуток від власності в Швейцарії залежить від кантону, періоду зберігання, відрахувань і випадку. Цей інструмент не надає ставки та не визначає допустимі витрати.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Доходи від продажу (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Вартість придбання (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Інші витрати підтверджено прийнятними (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Дійсна ставка податку з офіційного джерела (%)","Estimate scenario":"Розрахунковий сценарій","Illustrative scenario":"Ілюстративний сценарій","Gain entered":"Посилення введено","Tax at entered rate":"Податок за введеною ставкою","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Введіть цифри з ваших записів і джерела кантону.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Сценарій розрахований; перевірте це в кантоні.","Check amounts and rate.":"Перевірити суму та курс.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Таблиця кантональних податків не вбудована; введена ефективна ставка визначає оцінку.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Швейцарський сценарій податку на спадщину та дарування","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Податок на спадщину та дарування у Швейцарії — ваш сценарій ставок","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Оцінка оподатковуваної суми на основі введених користувачем звільнення та ставки; правила відрізняються залежно від кантону та відносин.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Введіть суму, звільнення та ефективну ставку, підтверджену для одержувача та кантону.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Правила кантону та сімейні відносини можуть змінити винятки та ставки. Цей інструмент не вибирає правило кантону чи визначає податкові зобов’язання.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Сума спадщини або подарунка (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Звільнення підтверджено кантоном (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Ефективна норма підтверджена кантоном (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Сума після введеного винятку","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Введіть цифри, підтверджені для вашого випадку.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Оцінка використовує лише введені вами звільнення та ставку.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Сценарій бюджету аліментів у Швейцарії","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Швейцарський бюджет аліментів на дітей — прозорий сценарій домогосподарства","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Розподілити введений дитячий бюджет за доходом батьків після введеного кредиту на прямі витрати.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Використовуйте документально підтверджені місячні потреби дитини, доступні місячні доходи обох батьків і будь-які прямі витрати, які ви бажаєте зарахувати.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Це лише аркуш планування. Це не швейцарська компенсація аліментів або законний метод; житло, догляд, податки, пільги та судова практика не оцінюються.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Задокументований вами щомісячний дитячий бюджет (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Доступний місячний дохід батьків А (швейцарські франки)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Доступний місячний дохід батьків B (швейцарські франки)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Прямі витрати на дитину, сплачені батьком А в кредит (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Виділити сценарій","Illustrative allocation":"Ілюстративне виділення","Parent A remaining contribution":"Залишковий внесок батьківської сторони A","Parent B contribution":"Внесок батьків B","Entered monthly child budget":"Введений місячний дитячий бюджет","Enter your household budget figures.":"Введіть цифри сімейного бюджету.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Розрахований бюджетний сценарій; обговорити правові зобов'язання з кваліфікованим консультантом.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Суми чеків; кредит не може перевищувати бюджет.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Часті пропорційні двом введеним доходам; спочатку віднімається кредит на прямі витрати.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Попередній перегляд переносів у веб-переглядачі","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Попередній перегляд переносів слів — шаблони мови веб-переглядача","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Попередній перегляд переносів у веб-переглядачі для тексту, який ви надаєте; підтримка залежить від браузера та встановлених мовних ресурсів.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Виберіть мову, яка відповідає вашому тексту, введіть зразок і налаштуйте доступну ширину лінії.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Використовує власну розстановку переносів CSS браузера. Він не об’єднує словники; непідтримувані браузери можуть не показувати дефіси. Копіювання тексту зберігає оригінальне написання.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Мова тексту (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Ширина попереднього перегляду (символи)","Text to preview":"Текст для попереднього перегляду","Preview":"Попередній перегляд","Enter text and choose its language.":"Введіть текст і виберіть його мову.","Preview updated.":"Попередній перегляд оновлено.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Введіть підтримуваний мовний тег і текст.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Спробуйте той самий абзац різної ширини, щоб побачити, де браузер може розбити слова.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Приватна робоча область перевірки правопису","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Локальна перевірка правопису — використовуйте словник браузера","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Відредагуйте текст за допомогою перевірки правопису браузера, виберіть мову та скопіюйте виправлений текст.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Текст залишається на цій сторінці. Виберіть мову, для якої ваш браузер має орфографічний словник, а потім скористайтеся його меню орфографії або підкресліть пропозиції.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Ця робоча область не завантажує текст і не надсилає словники. Доступність перевірки правопису в браузері та пропозиції залежать від пристрою, браузера та встановленого словника.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Мова перевірки правопису (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Текст для перевірки","Copy text":"Копіювати текст","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Введіть або вставте текст. Клацніть правою кнопкою миші або скористайтеся меню орфографії свого пристрою, щоб отримати пропозиції.","Text copied.":"Текст скопійовано.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Не вдалося скопіювати автоматично; виділіть і скопіюйте текст.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Браузер без відповідного словника може не позначати орфографічні помилки.","Resume Structure Checker":"Перевірка структури резюме","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"Програма перевірки резюме ATS — безкоштовний локальний огляд PDF і DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Перевірте текст резюме, заголовки, розділи, посилання та структуру маркерів у вашому браузері. Порівняйте умови посадової інструкції за кількістю; немає рейтингу найму чи завантаження.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Перегляньте, що насправді представляє текстове резюме: витягнутий текст, структуру заголовка, присутність контактного поля, посилання та загальновизнані розділи. За бажанням порівняйте повторювані терміни опису посади.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"DOCX зі стилями заголовка 1 для Досвіду та Освіта показує ці заголовки. PDF-файл перевіряється за текстом, який можна вибрати; колонки можна читати в іншому порядку.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"Файли DOCX перевіряються локально як Office ZIP/XML. PDF-файли читаються за допомогою відкладеного локального механізму PDF.js. Додаткове порівняння посадових інструкцій підраховує вибрані терміни в кожному тексті; він не створює балів і не рекомендує, чи найняти когось.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Це перевірка формату та структури тексту, а не симулятор ATS, юридичний огляд чи прогноз успіху співбесіди. Відскановані PDF-файли без тексту для вибору спочатку потребують OCR. Захищені паролем, макроси, підписані або надзвичайно великі документи не підтримуються.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Оберіть резюме (PDF або DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Ваші файли залишаються в цьому браузері й не завантажуються. Максимум 20 Мб; PDF до 50 сторінок. Розширений вміст DOCX обмежений 80 МБ.","Optional job description":"Додаткова посадова інструкція","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Вставте звичайний текст, якщо вам потрібно порівняння термінів і частоти. Не включайте конфіденційну інформацію, яку вам не потрібно аналізувати.","Paste job-description text here…":"Вставте сюди текст посадового опису…","Analyze locally":"Аналізувати локально","Clear files and report":"Очистити файли та звіт","Resume review":"Перегляд резюме","File type":"Тип файлу","Extracted characters":"Витягнуті символи","Words counted":"Пораховано слів","Detected headings":"Виявлені заголовки","Recognized sections":"Розпізнані розділи","Hyperlinks found":"Знайдено гіперпосилання","Bullet paragraphs":"Маркіровані абзаци","An email address appears in the text":"Адреса електронної пошти відображається в тексті","No email address pattern was detected":"Шаблон адреси електронної пошти не виявлено","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"У тексті з’являється шаблон, схожий на номер телефону","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Не виявлено шаблону, схожого на номер телефону","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Умови посадової інструкції (враховуються лише)","Term":"Термін","In job text":"У тексті завдання","In resume":"В резюме","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Вставте опис роботи, щоб порівняти кількість термінів.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Не виявлено чітких стилів заголовків. Заголовки PDF оцінюються на основі розміру тексту та можуть бути неточними.","Detected":"Виявлено","Not detected":"Не виявлено","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Ця евристика розпізнає обмежений набір загальних назв розділів; він не вирішує, які розділи потрібні.","Profile / summary":"Профіль / резюме","Experience":"Досвід","Education":"Освіта","Skills":"Навички","Contact":"Контакт","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Текст для вибору не знайдено. Лише відскановані PDF-файли потребують OCR, перш ніж їх можна буде перевірити.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Для початку виберіть резюме у форматі PDF або DOCX.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Читання вибраного файлу локально…","Local structure review complete.":"Огляд локальної структури завершено.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Цей браузер не підтримує обов’язкову функцію локального документа.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Виберіть дійсний файл PDF або сучасний файл DOCX відповідно до зазначених локальних обмежень.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"Неможливо прочитати PDF-файл. Він може бути пошкоджений, зашифрований або не містити тексту для вибору.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Пакет DOCX не вдалося безпечно відкрити чи прочитати.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Чи завантажує чи зберігає цей інструмент моє резюме?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"№ Розбір і аналіз виконуються у вашому браузері. Текст файлу не надсилається на сервер і не зберігається після очищення звіту або виходу зі сторінки.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Чи передбачається, чи прийме ATS або роботодавець моє резюме?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"№ Він перевіряє лише читабельний текст і просту структуру. Системи найму відрізняються, і це не є гарантією сумісності з ATS або прогнозом найму.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Чи може він читати відсканований PDF?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Лише якщо у PDF є текстовий шар, який можна вибрати. Цей засіб перевірки не завантажує моделі OCR; спершу скористайтеся інструментом OCR для відсканованого документа, що містить лише зображення.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Що означає порівняння посадових інструкцій?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Відображає кількість повторюваних умов після простої нормалізації. Це не відсоток відповідності, рейтинг, рекомендація чи оцінка вашої кваліфікації.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Чому PDF показує менше заголовків, ніж DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF-файли зазвичай не зберігають семантичні стилі заголовків. Засіб перевірки оцінює помітні рядки на основі розміру тексту та порядку читання, тому стовпці та візуальний дизайн можуть вплинути на результат.","How local resume review works":"Як працює локальний перегляд резюме","Resume checker questions":"Питання для перевірки резюме","Scope and limitations":"Сфера застосування та обмеження","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Місцевий роздільник вокалу та акомпанементу","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Засіб для видалення вокалу — розділіть вокал і акомпанемент локально","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Розділіть короткий стереозразок аудіо на приблизний вокал і акомпанемент у вашому браузері. Аудіо залишається на вашому пристрої; модель завантажується з публічного хосту.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Виберіть стереомузичний кліп тривалістю до 30 секунд. Під час першого використання браузер завантажує модель розміром 35,6 МБ. Аудіофайл обробляється на цьому пристрої та ніколи не завантажується.","What you get":"Що ви отримуєте","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Перегляньте та завантажте дві основи WAV: приблизний вокал і залишковий акомпанемент. Результати залежать від суміші та можуть містити артефакти.","Local processing":"Локальна обробка","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Інструмент використовує вокальну мережу Open-Unmix UMX-HQ, експортовану до ONNX і ONNX Runtime Web. Модель вибирається лише тоді, коли ви натискаєте Окремо; не використовується платний API або підписка. Аудіо декодується, обробляється та експортується локально.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Це приблизна обробка стереозвуку 44,1 кГц і кліпів тривалістю до 30 секунд. Моноджерела дублюються на стерео. Вокал, глибоко змішаний з інструментами, важкі ефекти, живі записи та незвичні жанри можуть спричинити витік або артефакти. Не використовуйте результат як чистий майстер. Для завантаження моделі потрібне підключення до Інтернету; звук не залишає цей пристрій.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Чи завантажено моє аудіо?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"№ Вибране аудіо буде декодовано та оброблено у вашому браузері. Єдиним мережевим запитом є завантаження моделі, коли ви починаєте розділення.","Why is the first run slow?":"Чому перший запуск повільний?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Браузер завантажує модель розміром 35,6 МБ один раз; браузер може кешувати його. Потім висновок виконується локально на ЦП пристрою.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Чи буде кожна пісня окремо окремо?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"№ Модель оцінює вокальний стрижень і може залишити вокальний витік, видалити гармоніки інструменту або створити артефакти. Послухайте, перш ніж покладатися на стебло.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Стерео аудіофайл (до 30 секунд)","Choose audio":"Виберіть аудіо","Separate vocals":"Окремий вокал","Cancel / clear":"Скасувати / очистити","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Для початку виберіть короткий аудіофайл.","Downloading the separation model…":"Завантаження моделі розділення…","Separating locally…":"Відокремлення локально…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Відділення завершено. Перегляньте або завантажте будь-який стебло.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Не вдалося обробити цей файл або завантажити модель. Перевірте формат і підключення, а потім повторіть спробу.","Model and weight license information":"Інформація про ліцензію на модель і вагу","Estimated vocals":"Приблизний вокал","Estimated accompaniment":"Орієнтовний супровід","Download WAV":"Завантажити WAV","Progress":"Прогрес","Preparing local separation…":"Підготовка локального розділення…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Відділення завершено. Аудіо залишилося на цьому пристрої.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Не вдалося обробити це аудіо. Спробуйте музичний стереофайл тривалістю до 30 секунд.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Порівняння франшиз за медичне страхування Швейцарії","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Швейцарський калькулятор франшизи медичного страхування — порівняння річних витрат","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Порівняйте франшизи швейцарського базового медичного страхування, використовуючи премії та відповідні річні витрати на медичне обслуговування, які ви вводите. Жодна пропозиція страховика не вгадується.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Введіть щомісячні премії, указані тим самим страховиком для кожної франшизи, яку він пропонує, а потім порівняйте сценарії низької, очікуваної та високої річної вартості лікування.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Для обов’язкового базового медичного страхування в Швейцарії стандартна франшиза для дорослих становить 300 швейцарських франків, а франшиза для дітей – 0 швейцарських франків. Додаткові рівні різняться залежно від вікової групи. Після франшизи стандартна плата за утримання становить 10% прийнятних залишкових витрат, що не перевищує 700 швейцарських франків на рік для дорослих і 350 швейцарських франків для дітей. Інструмент додає вашу введену премію до цього змодельованого розподілу витрат; він не отримує тарифи страхової компанії та не вирішує, який варіант підходить саме вам.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Якщо доросла особа вводить місячний внесок у розмірі 400 швейцарських франків із франшизою 300 швейцарських франків і 350 швейцарських франків із франшизою у розмірі 2500 швейцарських франків, річна різниця в розмірі премії становитиме 600 швейцарських франків. Порівняйте цю економію із змодельованою різницею у розподілі витрат за кожною з низьких, очікуваних і високих сум прийнятних витрат.","How the estimate works":"Як працює кошторис","Common questions":"Поширені запитання","Scope and exclusions":"Сфера застосування та виключення","Where do I get the premiums?":"Де я можу отримати премії?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Використовуйте поточні щомісячні пропозиції для того самого страховика, регіону преміум-класу, вікової групи, покриття від нещасних випадків і моделі страхування. Priminfo — офіційний федеральний сайт порівняння. Ця сторінка не отримує та не відтворює котирування страхових компаній.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Чи завжди пропонуються всі перераховані рівні франшизи?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"№ Страховики не повинні пропонувати кожен додатковий рівень, і пропозиції можуть відрізнятися для молодих людей. Введіть лише премії, вказані для вашого власного полісу; залиште недоступні параметри порожніми.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Це відображає мій повний медичний рахунок?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"№ Модель покриває звичайну франшизу та стандартну комісію утримання у розмірі 10% від прийнятних витрат. Сюди не входять внески на лікарняний день, спеціальне утримання ліків у розмірі 40%, звільнені послуги, догляд, що не покривається, і додаткове страхування.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Це порівняння сценаріїв, а не страхові, медичні чи фінансові поради. Він не передбачає вашого лікування чи премій. Сюди не входять внески на лікарняний день (зазвичай 15 швейцарських франків за день перебування в стаціонарі, із встановленими законом винятками), спеціальні 40% утримання на певні ліки, звільнення від материнства/профілактики, послуги поза обов’язковим покриттям, премії та додаткове страхування. Тому фактична співоплата може відрізнятися. Вища франшиза означає, що ви повинні мати можливість сплатити більше наперед, якщо ви отримуєте допомогу.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Хто застрахований за цим полісом?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Дорослий (віком від 19 років)","Child (under 18)":"Дитина (до 18 років)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Сценарій низької річної прийнятної вартості лікування (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Очікувані річні прийнятні витрати на лікування (швейцарські франки)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Сценарій високої річної прийнятної вартості лікування (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Щомісячні внески від одного страховика","Monthly premium":"Щомісячна премія","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Введіть лише варіанти, запропоновані для цієї самої політики. Інші залиште порожніми.","Adult deductible choices":"Вибір франшизи для дорослих","Child deductible choices":"Вибір франшизи на дитину","Compare annual costs":"Порівняйте річні витрати","Clear entries":"Очистити записи","Download CSV":"Завантажити CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Очікувана річна премія плюс розподіл витрат","Deductible":"Франшиза","Annual premiums":"Річні премії","Total at low costs":"Усього за низькими витратами","Total at expected costs":"Усього за очікуваними витратами","Total at high costs":"Усього за високими витратами","Cost sharing at low costs":"Споділ витрат за низьких витрат","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Споділ витрат за очікуваними витратами","Cost sharing at high costs":"Споділ витрат за високих витрат","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Різниця від найменшої доступної франшизи","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Витрати на медичне обслуговування, де витрачено премію","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Введена премія не скасовується в межах змодельованого діапазону розподілу витрат.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Жодної премії заощадження проти найнижчої франшизи.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Найменша очікувана сума серед введених варіантів","Scenario details":"Деталі сценарію","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Введіть три замовлені сценарії витрат на медичне обслуговування та щомісячні внески принаймні для двох доступних франшиз.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Офіційні правила та поточні премії:","Federal deductible rules":"Федеральні правила франшиз","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Офіційне преміальне порівняння Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Порівняння, обчислене в цьому браузері.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Перевірте вікову групу, замовлені сценарії витрат і щонайменше дві місячні премії.","Entries cleared.":"Записи видалено.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV завантажено локально.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Калькулятор зменшення премії Swiss Health","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Калькулятор швейцарської преміальної субсидії — ваша чиста премія","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Обчисліть чисту швейцарську премію медичного страхування з поточної премії та щомісячного зниження, яке вже надано вашим кантоном.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Введіть премію та підтверджене щомісячне зниження за рішенням страхової компанії або кантону. Цей інструмент не вирішує, чи відповідаєте ви кваліфікації.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Швейцарські кантони визначають, хто відповідає вимогам, скільки надається підтримки та чи потрібна заявка. Цей калькулятор лише віднімає підтверджене місячне зниження від премії за полісом і показує річну суму.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Якщо місячна премія становить 420 швейцарських франків, а підтверджене зниження – 120 швейцарських франків, орієнтовна чиста премія становить 300 швейцарських франків на місяць.","How the calculation works":"Як працює розрахунок","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Це говорить мені, чи маю я право?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"№ Відповідність вимогам і розмір винагороди визначаються кантоном проживання. Скористайтеся офіційною інформацією за посиланням або зверніться до кантонального офісу.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Де я можу знайти суму знижки?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Використовуйте поточне рішення або знижену премію, надану вашим страховиком. Деякі кантони надають знижки автоматично; для інших потрібна заявка.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Це арифметика для одного полісу, а не рішення про право чи пільги. Він не розраховує дохід домогосподарства, майно, сімейний статус, терміни, кантональні пороги чи права подання заявки. Премії та нагороди можуть змінюватися; підтвердьте їх у свого страховика та кантону.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Поточна місячна премія (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Щомісячна знижка вже надана (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Введіть суму, підтверджену кантоном або страховиком; не використовуйте оцінку як винагороду.","Calculate net premium":"Обчислити чисту премію","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Введіть поточну премію та підтверджену знижку.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Очікувана премія після зниження","Current monthly premium":"Поточна місячна премія","Monthly reduction":"Щомісячне зниження","Estimated net monthly premium":"Очікувана чиста місячна премія","Reduction over 12 months":"Зниження за 12 місяців","Reduction as a share of premium":"Зниження частки премії","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Розрахунок завершено. Підтвердьте нагороду та дати набуття чинності у вашому кантоні та страховій компанії.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Переконайтеся, що зниження не перевищує місячну премію.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Калькулятор базового сценарію орендної плати в Швейцарії","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Швейцарський калькулятор коригування орендної плати — базовий сценарій ставки","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Оцініть лише те, як зміна базової ставки іпотечного кредиту в Швейцарії впливає на чисту орендну плату за житло. Використовуйте останні тарифи федерального житлового відомства.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Порівняйте базову ставку, зазначену у вашому договорі оренди чи останньому повідомленні про оренду, з поточною офіційною ставкою Швейцарії. Розрахунок залишається на вашому пристрої.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Федеральне відомство з питань житла щоквартально публікує одну довідкову ставку іпотеки для коригування орендної плати в Швейцарії. Збільшення на 0,25 процентного пункту може в принципі дозволити збільшити орендну плату на 3%; зниження на 0,25 пункту в принципі може дозволити скорочення на 2,91%. Цей сценарій крок за кроком застосовує ці зміни до введеної вами чистої орендної плати.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Для 3000 швейцарських франків на місяць чистої орендної плати зниження базової ставки з 1,75% до 1,50% дає орієнтовну зміну базової ставки приблизно на −87,38 швейцарських франків на місяць (−2,91%).","How this estimate works":"Як працює ця оцінка","Where do I find the current rate?":"Де я можу знайти поточний курс?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Відкрийте пов’язану сторінку Федерального відомства з питань житла та введіть поточну опубліковану ставку. Інструмент не містить ставки, яка може застаріти.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Це вирішує, чи можу я подати запит на зміну орендної плати?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"№ Він виділяє один фактор для орієнтації. Ваш контракт, інфляція, зміни вартості, бронювання та інші правові умови можуть змінити результат.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Чи включає результат додаткові витрати?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"№ Введіть місячну чисту орендну плату без урахування додаткових витрат та інших змінних платежів.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Результатом є ілюстративний сценарій базової ставки, а не юридичний висновок чи повний аналіз орендної плати. Він виключає інфляцію, загальні зміни вартості, покращення, договірні резервування, індексовану або ступеневу орендну плату, дати повідомлення та кантональні процедури. Перш ніж діяти, перевірте договір оренди та офіційні вказівки.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Оренда житла в Швейцарії: лише оцінка ефекту базової ставки іпотеки. Це не юридичне рішення чи повний перегляд орендної плати.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Поточна місячна чиста орендна плата (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Опорна ставка, зазначена у вашому договорі оренди або останньому повідомленні про орендну плату (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Поточна офіційна базова ставка Швейцарії (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Розрахувати сценарій базової ставки","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Сценарій лише для базової ставки","Current monthly net rent":"Поточна місячна чиста орендна плата","Reference-rate change":"Зміна довідкової ставки","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Очікуваний щомісячний вплив базової ставки","Scenario monthly net rent":"Сценарій місячної чистої орендної плати","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Річний ефект протягом 12 місяців з тією самою швидкістю","potential increase":"підвищення потенціалу","potential decrease":"потенційне зниження","no reference-rate change":"без зміни контрольної ставки","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Оцінка передбачає 3% для кожного збільшення на 0,25 відсоткового пункту та еквівалентне зворотне зменшення для кожного зменшення. Інші фактори можуть змінити результат.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Це не включає інфляцію, загальні зміни вартості, покращення, резервування контрактів, індексовану або ступеневу орендну плату, дати повідомлення або місцеві процедурні вимоги. Перевірте свій договір оренди та вказівки Федерального відомства з питань житла.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Перевірте останній офіційний курс і вказівки","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Швейцарське федеральне відомство з питань житла (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Введіть орендну плату та обидві ставки, щоб побачити сценарій.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Розрахований сценарій. Перевірте дати й умови контракту, перш ніж покладатися на це.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Перевірте суми та ставки. Ставки мають бути від 0% до 5% і відрізнятися з кроком 0,25 пункту.","Inputs cleared.":"Введення видалено.","Result":"Результат","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Оцінювач нарахування відпусток у Швейцарії","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Швейцарський калькулятор нарахування відпустки — пропорційний баланс відпустки","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Оцініть баланс швейцарських днів відпустки на основі щорічної відпустки у вашому контракті, робочому тижні, датах роботи та вже використаних днях.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Оцініть пропорційно оплачувану відпустку на один календарний рік, використовуючи право та графік роботи, які ви ввели. Умови договору не вгадуються.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Оцінювач пропорційно розподіляє кількість днів щорічної відпустки у вашому контракті на календарні дні, відпрацьовані у вибраному році. Для неповного робочого дня введіть звичайні робочі дні на тиждень і щорічну відпустку в тижнях.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"З чотирма тижнями відпустки, п’ятиденним робочим тижнем і роботою протягом року, річна винагорода становить 20 робочих днів до вирахування вже використаної відпустки.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Який мінімальний мінімум у Швейцарії?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Федеральне керівництво передбачає щонайменше чотири тижні на рік служби та п’ять тижнів для працівників, які не досягли 20 років. Контракт або колективний договір може надавати більше.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Чи визначає це мій правовий баланс?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"№ Це проста пропорція календарного дня. Умови контракту, застосовні колективні правила, кваліфікаційна відсутність, округлення та записи роботодавця можуть змінити баланс.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Ця оцінка не визначає законне право чи розраховує відпустку. Це виключає скорочення за певні тривалі відсутності, правила нарахування та округлення, пов’язані з контрактом, державні свята, понаднормову роботу, терміни перенесення та спори. Перевірте свій договір і отримайте консультацію щодо спірного балансу.","Leave year":"Рік відпустки","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Щорічна відпустка у вашому контракті (тижнів)","Usual working days per week":"Звичайні робочі дні на тиждень","Employment start date":"Дата початку роботи","Employment end date":"Дата закінчення роботи","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Дні відпустки вже використані в цьому році відпустки","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Тільки для орієнтування. Введіть договірне річне право; законний мінімум становить, як правило, чотири тижні або п’ять тижнів для працівників віком до 20 років.","Estimate balance":"Розрахунковий баланс","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Введіть свій контракт і дати, щоб оцінити баланс.","Estimated leave balance":"Розрахунковий баланс відпустки","Annual leave at this schedule":"Щорічна відпустка за таким графіком","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Календарні дні роботи в цьому році відпустки","Prorated days accrued":"Пропорційно накопичені дні","Days already taken":"Дні вже зайняті","Estimated days remaining":"Залишилося орієнтовно днів","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Це пропорційно розподіляє щорічну відпустку за календарними днями в період працевлаштування. Правила роботодавця та договору можуть відрізнятися.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Оцінка розрахована. Звірте це зі своїм контрактом і записами роботодавця.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Перевірте рік, дати, графік роботи та значення."},"sw":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Scenario ya Posho ya Ukosefu wa Ajira ya Uswizi","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Kikokotoo cha Manufaa ya Ukosefu wa Ajira ya Uswizi - Hali ya Jumla","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Kadiria jumla ya posho ya kila siku ya Uswizi kwa kutumia mshahara uliowekewa bima na kiwango kilichothibitishwa na hazina yako.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Weka mshahara uliowekewa bima na kiwango cha 70% au 80% kilichothibitishwa na hazina yako ya ukosefu wa ajira.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Sheria za Uswizi huweka kiwango cha posho na kikomo cha mshahara. Mfuko huamua kustahiki, makato, siku za kusubiri na haki. Masafa ya kila mwezi yanaonyesha siku 20-23 zinazoweza kulipwa.","Example":"Mfano","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5,000 kwa 70% ni takriban CHF 161.29 kwa siku ya kazi inayolipwa.","How it works":"Jinsi inavyofanya kazi","Questions":"Maswali","Scope and limits":"Upeo na mipaka","Related tools":"Zana zinazohusiana","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Mshahara wa kila mwezi uliowekewa bima (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Kiwango kimethibitishwa na mfuko","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Kadirio","Clear":"Safi","Gross scenario":"Hali ya Jumla","Insured salary used":"Mshahara wa bima umetumika","Per payable weekday":"Kwa siku ya wiki inayolipwa","20-day month":"mwezi wa siku 20","23-day month":"mwezi wa siku 23","Official benefit rules":"Sheria rasmi za manufaa","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Weka takwimu zako zilizothibitishwa.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Imekokotoa. Thibitisha kiasi kwa mfuko wako.","Check the values.":"Angalia thamani.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Mpangaji wa Notisi ya Umiliki wa Uswizi","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Mpangaji Notisi ya Kukodisha ya Uswizi na Rasimu ya Barua","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Panga notisi ya upangaji kuanzia tarehe na masharti katika mkataba wako mwenyewe; andika barua bila kuchukua sheria za jimbo.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Weka kipindi cha notisi, siku inayofuata halali ya kukomesha mkataba wako, na tarehe ya kupokea. Angalia kila tarehe na mwenye nyumba au chama cha wapangaji.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Mpangaji atatumia tarehe na kipindi unachosambaza pekee. Haiamui ikiwa notisi ni halali, inapokewa kisheria, au kama ulinzi maalum utatumika.","Contract notice period (months)":"Kipindi cha notisi ya mkataba (miezi)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Siku halali ya mwisho ya mwezi inayofuata (kutoka kwa mkataba)","Expected receipt date":"Tarehe inayotarajiwa ya kupokea","Your name":"Jina lako","Your address":"Anwani yako","Landlord / agency":"Mwenye nyumba / wakala","Recipient address":"Anwani ya mpokeaji","Rental property":"Mali ya kukodisha","Place":"Mahali","Letter date":"Tarehe ya barua","Termination of tenancy":"Kukomeshwa kwa upangaji","Calculate date and draft letter":"Kokotoa tarehe na rasimu ya barua","Planning date":"Tarehe ya kupanga","Target date":"Tarehe inayolengwa","Editable draft":"Rasimu inayoweza kuhaririwa","Copy draft":"Nakili rasimu","Enter your contract terms.":"Weka masharti ya mkataba wako.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Rasimu ya kupanga iko tayari. Thibitisha dhidi ya mkataba wako.","Check the dates and period.":"Angalia tarehe na kipindi.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Matokeo yanafuata siku ya notisi ya mkataba iliyotolewa; sio notisi ya kisheria inayotawala.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Scenario ya Faida ya Mali ya Uswizi","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Kodi ya Faida ya Mali ya Uswizi - Hali ya Kiwango Kilichoingiwa na Mtumiaji","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Kadiria faida ya mali ukitumia gharama zako za muamala na kiwango cha kodi kutoka kwa jimbo linalowajibika.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Weka mapato, gharama ya upataji, gharama zinazostahiki ambazo umethibitisha, na kiwango kinachofaa kutoka kwa kikokotoo rasmi cha kanuni.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Kodi ya faida ya mali ya Uswizi hutofautiana kulingana na jimbo, muda wa malipo, makato na kesi. Zana hii haitoi viwango au kubainisha gharama zinazokubalika.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Mapato ya mauzo (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Gharama ya Upataji (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Gharama zingine zimethibitishwa kuwa zinakubalika (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Kiwango madhubuti cha ushuru kutoka kwa chanzo rasmi (%)","Estimate scenario":"Kadiria hali","Illustrative scenario":"Mchoro wa matukio","Gain entered":"Faida imeingizwa","Tax at entered rate":"Kodi kwa kiwango kilichowekwa","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Ingiza takwimu kutoka kwa rekodi zako na chanzo cha canton.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Scenario imekokotolewa; ithibitishe na korongo.","Check amounts and rate.":"Angalia kiasi na kiwango.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Hakuna jedwali la ushuru la korongo lililopachikwa; kiwango cha ufanisi ulichoingiza huendesha makadirio.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Mtindo wa Ushuru wa Urithi na Zawadi wa Uswizi","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Ushuru wa Urithi na Zawadi ya Uswizi - Hali Yako ya Kiwango","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Kadiria kiasi kinachotozwa ushuru kutoka kwa msamaha na kiwango kilichowekwa na mtumiaji; sheria hutofautiana kwa katoni na uhusiano.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Weka kiasi, msamaha na kiwango kinachofaa kilichothibitishwa kwa mpokeaji na jimbo.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Sheria za Canton na uhusiano wa familia zinaweza kubadilisha misamaha na viwango. Zana hii haichagui sheria ya jimbo au kubainisha dhima ya kodi.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Kiasi cha urithi au zawadi (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Msamaha umethibitishwa na kantoni (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Kiwango kinachofaa kimethibitishwa na jimbo (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Kiasi baada ya kuweka msamaha","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Weka takwimu zilizothibitishwa kwa kesi yako.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Kadirio hutumia tu msamaha na kiwango unachoweka.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Scenari ya Bajeti ya Msaada wa Mtoto wa Uswizi","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Bajeti ya Msaada wa Mtoto ya Uswizi - Hali ya Uwazi ya Kaya","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Tenga bajeti ya mtoto iliyoingizwa kwa mapato ya mzazi baada ya mkopo uliowekwa wa gharama ya moja kwa moja.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Tumia mahitaji ya kila mwezi ya mtoto yaliyothibitishwa, mapato ya kila mwezi ya wazazi wote wawili na gharama zozote za moja kwa moja unazotaka kuweka mikopo.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Hii ni lahakazi ya kupanga pekee. Siyo tuzo ya Uswizi ya malezi ya watoto au mbinu ya kisheria; nyumba, matunzo, kodi, marupurupu na sheria ya kesi hazitathminiwi.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Bajeti ya kila mwezi ya mtoto uliyoweka kumbukumbu (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Mapato ya kila mwezi ya Mzazi A yanayopatikana (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Mzazi B mapato ya kila mwezi yanapatikana (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Gharama za moja kwa moja za mtoto zinazolipwa na Mzazi A kwa mkopo (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Tenga hali","Illustrative allocation":"Mgao wa kielelezo","Parent A remaining contribution":"Mzazi Mchango uliosalia","Parent B contribution":"Mchango wa Mzazi B","Entered monthly child budget":"Umeingiza bajeti ya kila mwezi ya mtoto","Enter your household budget figures.":"Weka takwimu za bajeti ya kaya yako.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Hali ya Bajeti imekokotolewa; kujadili majukumu ya kisheria na mshauri aliyehitimu.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Angalia kiasi; mkopo hauwezi kuzidi bajeti.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Hisa ni sawia na mapato mawili yaliyoingizwa; mkopo wa gharama ya moja kwa moja hupunguzwa kwanza.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Onyesho la Muhtasari wa Mseto wa Kivinjari","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Onyesho la Muhtasari wa Maneno - Miundo ya Lugha ya Kivinjari","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Onyesha muhtasari wa kivinjari kwa maandishi unayotoa; usaidizi unategemea kivinjari na rasilimali za lugha zilizowekwa.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Chagua lugha inayolingana na maandishi yako, weka sampuli na urekebishe upana wa mstari unaopatikana.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Hutumia mchanganyiko asilia wa CSS wa kivinjari. Haijumuishi kamusi; vivinjari visivyotumika huenda visionyeshe vistari. Kunakili maandishi huweka tahajia asili.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Lugha ya maandishi (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Onyesha upana (herufi)","Text to preview":"Tuma maandishi ili kuhakiki","Preview":"Onyesho la kukagua","Enter text and choose its language.":"Ingiza maandishi na uchague lugha yake.","Preview updated.":"Onyesho la kukagua limesasishwa.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Ingiza lebo ya lugha inayotumika na maandishi.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Jaribu aya sawa kwa upana tofauti ili kuona ni wapi kivinjari kinaweza kuvunja maneno.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Check SpellCheck Nafasi ya Kazi ya Kibinafsi","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Kikagua Tahajia za Ndani - Tumia Kamusi Yako ya Kivinjari","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Hariri maandishi kwa kikagua tahajia asilia ya kivinjari, chagua lugha na unakili maandishi yaliyosahihishwa.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Maandishi yanakaa kwenye ukurasa huu. Weka lugha ambayo kivinjari chako kina kamusi ya tahajia, kisha utumie menyu yake ya tahajia au pigia mstari mapendekezo.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Nafasi hii ya kazi haipakii maandishi au kusafirisha kamusi. Upatikanaji wa kikagua tahajia za kivinjari hutegemea kifaa, kivinjari na kamusi iliyosakinishwa.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Lugha ya ukaguzi wa tahajia (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Tuma maandishi ya kuangalia","Copy text":"Nakili maandishi","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Chapa au ubandike maandishi. Bofya kulia au tumia menyu ya tahajia ya kifaa chako kwa mapendekezo.","Text copied.":"Maandishi yamenakiliwa.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Haikuweza kunakili kiotomatiki; chagua na unakili maandishi.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Kivinjari kisicho na kamusi inayolingana hakiwezi kuashiria makosa ya tahajia.","Resume Structure Checker":"Rejesha Kikagua Muundo","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Resume Checker — PDF ya Ndani Isiyolipishwa & Mapitio ya DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Angalia maandishi ya wasifu, vichwa, sehemu, viungo na muundo wa vitone kwenye kivinjari chako. Linganisha masharti ya maelezo ya kazi kwa kuhesabu; hakuna alama ya kukodisha au kupakia.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Kagua kile ambacho wasifu unaotegemea maandishi hufichua haswa: maandishi yaliyotolewa, muundo wa kichwa, uwepo wa sehemu ya mawasiliano, viungo na sehemu zinazotambulika kwa kawaida. Kwa hiari, linganisha maneno yanayorudiwa ya maelezo ya kazi.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"A DOCX yenye mitindo ya Kichwa cha 1 kwa Uzoefu na Elimu inaonyesha vichwa hivyo. PDF inaangaliwa kutoka kwa maandishi yake yanayoweza kuchaguliwa; safu zinaweza kusomwa kwa mpangilio tofauti.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"Faili za DOCX hukaguliwa ndani kama Office ZIP/XML. PDF husomwa na injini ya ndani ya PDF.js iliyoahirishwa. Ulinganisho wa hiari wa maelezo ya kazi huhesabu maneno yaliyochaguliwa katika kila maandishi; haiundi alama au kupendekeza kama utaajiri mtu.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Hii ni ukaguzi wa umbizo na muundo wa maandishi, si kiigaji cha ATS, ukaguzi wa kisheria au ubashiri wa mafanikio ya mahojiano. PDF zilizochanganuliwa bila maandishi yanayoweza kuchaguliwa zinahitaji OCR kwanza. Hati zinazolindwa na nenosiri, zilizowezeshwa kwa jumla, zilizotiwa sahihi au kubwa isivyo kawaida hazitumiki.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Chagua wasifu (PDF au DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Faili zako hukaa kwenye kivinjari hiki na hazijapakiwa. Upeo wa 20 MB; PDF hadi kurasa 50. Maudhui yaliyopanuliwa ya DOCX yana ukubwa wa MB 80.","Optional job description":"Maelezo ya kazi ya hiari","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Bandika maandishi wazi ikiwa unataka ulinganisho wa muda wa masafa. Usijumuishe maelezo nyeti ambayo huhitaji kuchanganua.","Paste job-description text here…":"Bandika maandishi ya maelezo ya kazi hapa...","Analyze locally":"Changanua ndani ya nchi","Clear files and report":"Futa faili na uripoti","Resume review":"Rejea ukaguzi","File type":"Aina ya faili","Extracted characters":"Vibambo vilivyotolewa","Words counted":"Maneno yamehesabiwa","Detected headings":"Vichwa vilivyotambuliwa","Recognized sections":"Sehemu zinazotambulika","Hyperlinks found":"Viungo vya kuunganisha vimepatikana","Bullet paragraphs":"Aya za risasi","An email address appears in the text":"Anwani ya barua pepe inaonekana katika maandishi","No email address pattern was detected":"Hakuna mchoro wa anwani ya barua pepe uliogunduliwa","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Mchoro unaofanana na nambari ya simu unaonekana kwenye maandishi","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Hakuna muundo unaofanana na nambari ya simu uliogunduliwa","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Masharti ya maelezo ya kazi (hesabu pekee)","Term":"Muda","In job text":"Maandishi ya kazini","In resume":"Inaendelea","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Bandika maelezo ya kazi ili kulinganisha hesabu za muda.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Hakuna mitindo dhahiri ya vichwa iliyogunduliwa. Vichwa vya PDF vinakadiriwa kutoka kwa ukubwa wa maandishi na huenda visiwe sahihi.","Detected":"Imegunduliwa","Not detected":"Haijatambuliwa","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Mchanganyiko huu unatambua seti ndogo ya majina ya sehemu za kawaida; haiamui ni sehemu gani zinahitajika.","Profile / summary":"Wasifu / muhtasari","Experience":"Uzoefu","Education":"Elimu","Skills":"Ujuzi","Contact":"Wasiliana","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Hakuna maandishi ya kuchaguliwa yaliyopatikana. PDF zilizochanganuliwa pekee zinahitaji OCR kabla ya kukaguliwa.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Chagua PDF au DOCX endelea ili kuanza.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Kusoma faili iliyochaguliwa ndani ya nchi...","Local structure review complete.":"Ukaguzi wa muundo wa ndani umekamilika.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Kivinjari hiki hakitumii kipengele cha hati ya ndani kinachohitajika.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Chagua PDF halali au faili ya kisasa ya DOCX hadi vikomo vilivyotajwa vya ndani.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF haikuweza kusomeka. Inaweza kuharibiwa, kusimbwa kwa njia fiche au haina maandishi yanayoweza kuchaguliwa.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Kifurushi cha DOCX hakikuweza kufunguliwa au kusomeka kwa usalama.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Je, zana hii inapakia au kuhifadhi wasifu wangu?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Na. Uchanganuzi na uchanganuzi huendeshwa kwenye kivinjari chako. Maandishi ya faili hayatumwi kwa seva au kuhifadhiwa baada ya kufuta ripoti au kuondoka kwenye ukurasa.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Je, inatabiri kama ATS au mwajiri atakubali wasifu wangu?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Na. Hukagua maandishi yanayosomeka na muundo rahisi pekee. Mifumo ya kukodisha inatofautiana, na hii si hakikisho la uoanifu la ATS au ubashiri wa kukodisha.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Je, inaweza kusoma PDF iliyochanganuliwa?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Ikiwa tu PDF ina safu ya maandishi inayoweza kuchaguliwa. Kikagua hiki hakipakui miundo ya OCR; tumia zana ya OCR kwanza kwa hati iliyochanganuliwa ya picha pekee.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Ulinganisho wa maelezo ya kazi unamaanisha nini?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Inaonyesha hesabu kwa masharti yanayojirudia baada ya kuhalalisha rahisi. Si asilimia inayolingana, cheo, mapendekezo au tathmini ya sifa zako.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Kwa nini PDF inaonyesha vichwa vichache kuliko DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF kwa kawaida hazihifadhi mitindo ya vichwa vya kisemantiki. Kikagua hukadiria mistari maarufu kutoka kwa ukubwa wa maandishi na mpangilio wa usomaji, kwa hivyo safu wima na muundo unaoonekana unaweza kuathiri matokeo.","How local resume review works":"Jinsi ukaguzi wa wasifu wa ndani unavyofanya kazi","Resume checker questions":"Rejea maswali ya kukagua","Scope and limitations":"Upeo na mapungufu","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Kitenganishi cha Sauti na Usindikizaji wa Karibu","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Kiondoa Sauti — Tenganisha Sauti na Ufuataji Ndani Yake","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Tenganisha sampuli fupi ya sauti ya stereo katika makadirio ya sauti na usindikizaji katika kivinjari chako. Sauti hukaa kwenye kifaa chako; mtindo huo unapakuliwa kutoka kwa mwenyeji wake wa umma.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Chagua klipu ya muziki ya stereo hadi sekunde 30. Katika matumizi ya kwanza, kivinjari hupakua mfano wa 35.6 MB. Faili ya sauti inachakatwa kwenye kifaa hiki na haipakii kamwe.","What you get":"Unachopata","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Kagua na upakue mashina mawili ya WAV: sauti zinazokadiriwa na mabaki ya sauti. Matokeo hutegemea mchanganyiko na inaweza kuwa na vizalia vya programu.","Local processing":"Uchakataji wa ndani","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Zana hutumia mtandao wa sauti wa Open-Unmix UMX-HQ unaosafirishwa kwa ONNX na ONNX Runtime Web. Mfano huo unachukuliwa tu wakati unabonyeza Tenga; hakuna API ya uelekezaji unaolipwa au usajili unaotumika. Sauti inasimbuliwa, kuchakatwa na kusafirishwa ndani ya nchi.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Haya ni makadirio ya kuchakata stereo 44.1 kHz na klipu hadi sekunde 30. Vyanzo vya Mono vimenakiliwa kwa stereo. Sauti zilizochanganywa kwa kina katika ala, athari nzito, rekodi za moja kwa moja na aina zisizo za kawaida zinaweza kutoa uvujaji au vizalia vya programu. Usitumie matokeo kama bwana safi. Upakuaji wa mfano unahitaji muunganisho wa intaneti; sauti haiondoki kwenye kifaa hiki.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Je, sauti yangu imepakiwa?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Na. Sauti iliyochaguliwa inasimbuliwa na kuchakatwa katika kivinjari chako. Ombi la mtandao pekee ni upakuaji wa modeli unapoanza kutenganisha.","Why is the first run slow?":"Kwa nini kukimbia kwa kwanza ni polepole?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Kivinjari hupakua muundo wa MB 35.6 mara moja; kivinjari kinaweza kuihifadhi. Inference basi huendesha ndani kwenye CPU ya kifaa.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Je, kila wimbo utatengana kisafi?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Na. Muundo huu hukadiria shina la sauti na huenda likaacha uvujaji wa sauti, kuondoa ulinganifu wa chombo au kuunda vizalia vya programu. Sikiliza kabla ya kutegemea shina.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Faili ya sauti ya stereo (hadi sekunde 30)","Choose audio":"Chagua sauti","Separate vocals":"Sauti tofauti","Cancel / clear":"Ghairi / futa","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Chagua faili fupi ya sauti ili kuanza.","Downloading the separation model…":"Inapakua muundo wa utengano…","Separating locally…":"Inatengana ndani ya nchi...","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Utenganisho umekamilika. Hakiki au pakua aidha shina.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Haikuweza kuchakata faili hii au kupakia muundo. Angalia umbizo na muunganisho, kisha ujaribu tena.","Model and weight license information":"Maelezo ya leseni ya muundo na uzani","Estimated vocals":"Kadirio la sauti","Estimated accompaniment":"Kadirio la kusindikiza","Download WAV":"Pakua WAV","Progress":"Maendeleo","Preparing local separation…":"Inatayarisha utengano wa ndani...","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Mgawanyiko umekamilika. Sauti ilisalia kwenye kifaa hiki.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Sauti hii haikuweza kuchakatwa. Jaribu faili ya muziki ya stereo chini ya sekunde 30.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Kilinganishi Kinachokatwa Bima ya Afya ya Uswizi","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Kikokotoo cha Franchise ya Bima ya Afya ya Uswizi — Linganisha Gharama za Mwaka","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Linganisha makato ya bima ya msingi ya afya ya Uswizi kwa kutumia malipo na gharama zinazostahiki za matibabu za kila mwaka unazoweka. Hakuna nukuu ya bima inayokisiwa.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Weka ada za kila mwezi zinazoonyeshwa na bima sawa kwa kila makato anayotoa, kisha ulinganishe hali ya chini, inayotarajiwa na ya juu ya kila mwaka ya gharama ya matibabu.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Kwa bima ya msingi ya afya ya Uswizi ya lazima, kiwango kinachokatwa kwa watu wazima ni CHF 300 na kinachokatwa mtoto ni CHF 0. Viwango vya hiari hutofautiana kulingana na kikundi cha umri. Baada ya kukatwa, ada ya kawaida ya kubaki ni 10% ya gharama zinazosalia zinazostahiki, zikiwa zimepunguzwa kuwa CHF 700 kwa mwaka kwa watu wazima na CHF 350 kwa watoto. Zana inaongeza malipo yako uliyoweka kwenye ugavi huu wa gharama uliowekewa kielelezo; haileti viwango vya bima au kuamua ni chaguo gani linafaa kwako.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Ikiwa mtu mzima ataingiza malipo ya kila mwezi ya CHF 400 kwa kukatwa CHF 300 na CHF 350 kwa kukatwa CHF 2,500, tofauti ya malipo ya kila mwaka ni CHF 600. Linganisha uokoaji huo na tofauti ya kielelezo katika ugavi wa gharama katika kila kiwango chako cha chini, kinachotarajiwa na cha juu kinachostahiki.","How the estimate works":"Jinsi makadirio yanavyofanya kazi","Common questions":"Maswali ya kawaida","Scope and exclusions":"Upeo na vizuizi","Where do I get the premiums?":"Nitapata wapi malipo?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Tumia ofa za sasa za kila mwezi kwa bima sawa, eneo linalolipiwa, rika, bima ya ajali na muundo wa bima. Priminfo ndio tovuti rasmi ya kulinganisha ya shirikisho. Ukurasa huu hauleti au kutoa tena nukuu za bima.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Je, viwango vyote vya kukatwa vilivyoorodheshwa vinatolewa kila wakati?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Na. Bima si lazima watoe kila kiwango cha hiari, na matoleo yanaweza kutofautiana kwa vijana. Weka tu malipo yanayoonyeshwa kwa sera yako mwenyewe; acha chaguo zisizopatikana wazi.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Je, hii inaonyesha bili yangu kamili ya matibabu?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Na. Muundo huu unalipia ada ya kawaida inayokatwa na ya kawaida ya 10% ya kubaki kwenye gharama zinazostahiki. Haijumuishi michango ya siku ya hospitali, uhifadhi maalum wa 40% wa dawa, huduma zisizo na malipo, utunzaji usiolipiwa na bima ya ziada.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Hii ni mlinganisho wa hali, si bima, ushauri wa matibabu au kifedha. Haitabiri matibabu au malipo yako. Haijumuishi michango ya siku ya hospitali (kawaida CHF 15 kwa siku ya kulazwa, pamoja na misamaha ya kisheria), uhifadhi maalum wa 40% kwenye dawa fulani, misamaha ya uzazi/kinga, huduma nje ya malipo ya lazima, ruzuku ya ada na bima ya ziada. Kwa hivyo malipo ya pamoja yanaweza kutofautiana. Gharama ya juu ina maana unahitaji kuwa na uwezo wa kulipa mapema zaidi ikiwa utapata huduma.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Ni nani aliyewekewa bima chini ya sera hii?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Watu wazima (umri wa miaka 19 au zaidi)","Child (under 18)":"Mtoto (chini ya miaka 18)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Hali ya chini ya gharama ya matibabu inayostahiki kwa mwaka (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Gharama zinazotarajiwa za matibabu za kila mwaka (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Hali ya juu ya gharama ya matibabu inayostahiki kwa mwaka (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Malipo ya kila mwezi kutoka kwa bima mmoja","Monthly premium":"Malipo ya kila mwezi","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Ingiza chaguo zinazotolewa kwa sera hii pekee. Wacha wengine wazi.","Adult deductible choices":"Chaguo zinazokatwa kwa watu wazima","Child deductible choices":"Chaguo zinazoweza kukatwa kwa watoto","Compare annual costs":"Linganisha gharama za kila mwaka","Clear entries":"Futa maingizo","Download CSV":"Pakua CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Kadirio la malipo ya kila mwaka pamoja na kushiriki gharama","Deductible":"Inatolewa","Annual premiums":"Malipo ya kila mwaka","Total at low costs":"Jumla kwa gharama ya chini","Total at expected costs":"Jumla kwa gharama zinazotarajiwa","Total at high costs":"Jumla kwa gharama kubwa","Cost sharing at low costs":"Kugawana gharama kwa gharama nafuu","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Kugawana gharama kwa gharama zinazotarajiwa","Cost sharing at high costs":"Kugawana gharama kwa gharama kubwa","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Tofauti kutoka kwa makato ya chini kabisa","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Gharama za matibabu ambapo uokoaji wa malipo hutumika zaidi","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Hifadhi ya malipo uliyoweka haijaghairiwa ndani ya masafa ya ushiriki wa gharama yaliyowekwa kielelezo.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Hakuna uhifadhi wa malipo ya juu dhidi ya makato ya chini kabisa.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Jumla ya chini inayotarajiwa kati ya chaguo zilizoingizwa","Scenario details":"Maelezo ya hali","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Weka matukio matatu ya gharama ya matibabu uliyoagizwa na ada za kila mwezi kwa angalau makato mawili yanayopatikana.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Sheria rasmi na malipo ya sasa:","Federal deductible rules":"Sheria za shirikisho za kukatwa","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo ulinganisho rasmi wa malipo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Ulinganisho umekokotolewa katika kivinjari hiki.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Angalia kikundi cha umri, matukio ya gharama uliyoagizwa na angalau ada mbili za kila mwezi.","Entries cleared.":"Maingizo yamefutwa.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV imepakuliwa ndani ya nchi.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Kikokotoo cha Kupunguza Malipo ya Uswisi Health Health","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Kikokotoo cha Ruzuku ya Uswizi ya Kulipiwa — Malipo Yako Yote","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Kokotoa malipo yote ya bima ya afya ya Uswizi kutoka kwa malipo ya sasa na punguzo la kila mwezi ambalo tayari limetolewa na jimbo lako.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Weka malipo na kuthibitishwa kupunguzwa kwa kila mwezi kutoka kwa bima au uamuzi wako wa kawaida. Chombo hiki hakiamui ikiwa unahitimu.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Mikoa ya Uswizi huamua ni nani anayehitimu, ni kiasi gani cha usaidizi kinachotolewa na ikiwa ombi inahitajika. Kikokotoo hiki huondoa tu punguzo la kila mwezi lililothibitishwa kutoka kwa malipo moja ya sera na kuonyesha kiasi cha mwaka.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Ikiwa malipo ya kila mwezi ni CHF 420 na punguzo lililothibitishwa ni CHF 120, makadirio ya malipo yote ni CHF 300 kwa mwezi.","How the calculation works":"Jinsi hesabu inavyofanya kazi","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Je, hii inaniambia ikiwa ninahitimu?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Na. Kiasi cha kustahiki na tuzo huamuliwa na jimbo la makazi. Tumia maelezo rasmi yaliyounganishwa au wasiliana na ofisi ya cantonal.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Nitapata wapi kiasi cha kupunguza?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Tumia uamuzi wa sasa au malipo yaliyopunguzwa yaliyoonyeshwa na bima wako. Baadhi ya korongo hutoa kupunguzwa kiotomatiki; wengine wanahitaji maombi.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Hii ni hesabu ya sera moja, si uamuzi wa kustahiki au manufaa. Haihesabu mapato ya kaya, mali, hali ya familia, tarehe za mwisho, vizingiti vya sheria au haki za maombi. Malipo na tuzo zinaweza kubadilika; zithibitishe na bima yako na jimbo.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Malipo ya sasa ya kila mwezi (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Punguzo la kila mwezi tayari limetolewa (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Weka kiasi kilichothibitishwa na jimbo au bima; usitumie makadirio kama tuzo.","Calculate net premium":"Kokotoa malipo yote","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Weka malipo ya sasa na upunguzaji uliothibitishwa.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Kadirio la malipo baada ya kupunguzwa","Current monthly premium":"Malipo ya kila mwezi ya sasa","Monthly reduction":"Punguzo la kila mwezi","Estimated net monthly premium":"Kadirio la malipo yote ya kila mwezi","Reduction over 12 months":"Kupunguzwa kwa zaidi ya miezi 12","Reduction as a share of premium":"Kupunguzwa kama sehemu ya malipo","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Hesabu imekamilika. Thibitisha tuzo na tarehe za kutekelezwa na jimbo lako na bima.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Hakikisha kuwa punguzo si kubwa kuliko malipo ya kila mwezi.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Kikokotoo cha Hali ya Marejeleo ya Kasi ya Kodi ya Uswizi","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Kikokotoo cha Marekebisho ya Kodi ya Uswizi - Hali ya Kiwango cha Marejeleo","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Kadiria tu jinsi mabadiliko katika kiwango cha marejeleo ya rehani ya Uswizi yanavyoathiri upangaji wa jumla wa makazi. Tumia bei ya hivi punde kutoka kwa ofisi ya serikali ya makazi.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Linganisha kiwango cha rejeleo kilichobainishwa katika ukodishaji wako au notisi ya hivi punde ya ukodishaji na kiwango rasmi cha sasa cha Uswizi. Hesabu hubaki kwenye kifaa chako.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Ofisi ya Shirikisho ya Makazi huchapisha kiwango kimoja cha marejeleo ya rehani kwa marekebisho ya kodi ya Uswizi kila robo mwaka. Ongezeko la asilimia 0.25 kwa kanuni linaweza kuruhusu ongezeko la kodi ya 3%; kupungua kwa pointi 0.25 kwa kanuni kunaweza kuruhusu kupunguzwa kwa 2.91%. Hali hii inatumika mabadiliko hayo hatua kwa hatua kwenye ukodishaji wa jumla unaoingiza.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Kwa CHF 3,000 ya kodi ya kila mwezi, kupungua kwa kiwango cha marejeleo kutoka 1.75% hadi 1.50% kunatoa makadirio ya mabadiliko ya kiwango cha marejeleo cha takriban -CHF 87.38 kwa mwezi (-2.91%).","How this estimate works":"Jinsi makadirio haya yanavyofanya kazi","Where do I find the current rate?":"Nitapata wapi kiwango cha sasa?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Fungua Ofisi ya Shirikisho iliyounganishwa kwa ukurasa wa Makazi na uweke kiwango cha sasa kilichochapishwa. Zana haipachiki kiwango ambacho kinaweza kupitwa na wakati.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Je, hii itaamua kama ninaweza kuomba mabadiliko ya kodi?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Na. Inatenga sababu moja ya mwelekeo. Mkataba wako, mfumuko wa bei, mabadiliko ya gharama, uwekaji nafasi na masharti mengine ya kisheria yanaweza kubadilisha matokeo.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Je, matokeo yanajumuisha gharama za ziada?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Na. Weka kodi ya kila mwezi, bila kujumuisha gharama za ziada na gharama zingine zinazobadilika.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Tokeo ni mfano wa kiwango cha marejeleo, sio maoni ya kisheria au ukaguzi kamili wa kodi. Haijumuishi mfumuko wa bei, mabadiliko ya gharama ya jumla, maboresho, uwekaji nafasi wa kimkataba, kodi zilizoorodheshwa au za kuongezwa, tarehe za notisi na utaratibu wa kanuni. Angalia ukodishaji wako na mwongozo rasmi kabla ya kuchukua hatua.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Ukodishaji wa makazi ya Uswizi: makadirio ya athari ya kiwango cha rejeleo la rehani pekee. Si uamuzi wa kisheria au ukaguzi kamili wa kodi.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Kodi ya sasa ya kila mwezi (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Kiwango cha marejeleo kimebainishwa katika ukodishaji wako au notisi ya hivi punde ya ukodishaji (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Kiwango rasmi cha marejeleo cha Uswizi kwa sasa (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Kokotoa hali ya kiwango cha marejeleo","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Hali ya kiwango cha marejeleo pekee","Current monthly net rent":"Kodi ya sasa ya kila mwezi","Reference-rate change":"Mabadiliko ya kiwango cha marejeleo","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Kadirio la athari ya kila mwezi kutoka kwa kiwango cha marejeleo","Scenario monthly net rent":"Scenario ya kodi ya kila mwezi","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Athari iliyotangazwa kwa miezi 12 kwa kiwango sawa","potential increase":"uwezekano wa kuongezeka","potential decrease":"uwezekano wa kupungua","no reference-rate change":"hakuna mabadiliko ya kiwango cha marejeleo","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Kadirio linatumika 3% kwa kila ongezeko la asilimia 0.25 na punguzo sawa la kinyume kwa kila upungufu. Sababu zingine zinaweza kubadilisha matokeo.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Hii haijumuishi mfumuko wa bei, mabadiliko ya gharama ya jumla, maboresho, uwekaji nafasi wa mikataba, ukodishaji wa faharasa au hatua kwa hatua, tarehe za notisi au mahitaji ya utaratibu wa ndani. Angalia ukodishaji wako na Ofisi ya Shirikisho kwa mwongozo wa Makazi.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Angalia kiwango rasmi na mwongozo mpya zaidi","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Ofisi ya Shirikisho ya Makazi ya Uswizi (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Weka kodi na viwango vyote viwili ili kuona hali.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Imekokotwa. Thibitisha tarehe na masharti ya mkataba kabla ya kutegemea.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Angalia kiasi na viwango. Viwango lazima ziwe kati ya 0% na 5% na zitofautiane katika hatua za pointi 0.25.","Inputs cleared.":"Imefuta.","Result":"matokeo","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Kikadirio cha Malipo ya Likizo ya Uswizi","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Kikokotoo cha Malipo ya Likizo ya Uswizi - Salio la Likizo Lililokadiriwa","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Kadiria salio la siku ya likizo ya Uswizi kutoka kwa likizo ya kila mwaka katika mkataba wako, wiki ya kazi, tarehe za kazi na siku ambazo tayari umechukua.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Kadiria likizo ya malipo iliyopangwa kwa muda kwa mwaka mmoja wa kalenda ukitumia haki na ratiba ya kazi unayoweka. Hakuna masharti ya mkataba yanayokisiwa.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Mkadiriaji anakadiria siku za likizo ya kila mwaka katika mkataba wako kwa siku za kalenda zilizoajiriwa katika mwaka uliochaguliwa. Kwa kazi ya muda, weka siku zako za kawaida za kazi kwa wiki na likizo ya kila mwaka katika wiki.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Kwa wiki nne za likizo, wiki ya kazi ya siku tano na ajira kwa mwaka mzima, haki ya kila mwaka ni siku 20 za kazi kabla ya kuondoa likizo ambayo tayari imechukuliwa.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Kima cha chini cha sheria cha Uswizi ni kipi?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Mwongozo wa shirikisho unasema angalau wiki nne kwa mwaka wa huduma, na wiki tano kwa wafanyakazi ambao hawajafikisha umri wa miaka 20. Mkataba au makubaliano ya pamoja yanaweza kutoa zaidi.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Je, hii huamua salio langu la kisheria?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Na. Ni mgawanyo rahisi wa siku ya kalenda. Masharti ya mkataba, sheria za pamoja zinazotumika, kutokuwepo kwa kufuzu, rekodi za pande zote na mwajiri zinaweza kubadilisha salio.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Kadirio hili haliamui haki ya kisheria au kukokotoa malipo ya likizo. Haijumuishi kupunguzwa kwa baadhi ya kutokuwepo kwa muda mrefu, sheria mahususi za ulimbikizaji na ukamilishaji wa mkataba, sikukuu za umma, saa za ziada, makataa ya kuendelea na mizozo. Angalia mkataba wako na upate ushauri kwa salio linalopingwa.","Leave year":"Ondoka mwaka","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Likizo ya kila mwaka katika mkataba wako (wiki)","Usual working days per week":"Siku za kawaida za kazi kwa wiki","Employment start date":"Tarehe ya kuanza kwa ajira","Employment end date":"Tarehe ya mwisho ya ajira","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Siku za likizo ambazo tayari zimechukuliwa katika mwaka huu wa likizo","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Kwa mwelekeo pekee. Ingiza haki ya mwaka ya mkataba; kima cha chini cha kisheria kwa ujumla ni wiki nne, au wiki tano kwa wafanyakazi chini ya miaka 20.","Estimate balance":"Kadiria salio","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Weka mkataba wako na tarehe ili kukadiria salio.","Estimated leave balance":"Kadirio la salio la likizo","Annual leave at this schedule":"Likizo ya kila mwaka katika ratiba hii","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Siku za Kalenda zilizotumika katika mwaka huu wa likizo","Prorated days accrued":"Siku zilizoratibiwa zimeongezwa","Days already taken":"Siku tayari zimechukuliwa","Estimated days remaining":"Kadirio la siku zilizosalia","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Hii hukadiria likizo ya kila mwaka kwa siku za kalenda katika kipindi cha ajira. Sheria za mwajiri na mikataba zinaweza kutofautiana.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Makadirio yamekokotolewa. Iangalie dhidi ya mkataba wako na rekodi za mwajiri.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Angalia mwaka, tarehe, ratiba ya kazi na maadili."},"mr":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"स्विस बेरोजगारी भत्ता परिस्थिती","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"स्विस बेरोजगारी लाभ कॅल्क्युलेटर — एकूण परिस्थिती","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"तुमच्या फंडाद्वारे पुष्टी केलेला विमा उतरवलेला पगार आणि दर वापरून एकूण स्विस दैनिक भत्तेचा अंदाज लावा.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"तुमच्या बेरोजगारी निधीद्वारे पुष्टी केलेला विमा उतरवलेला पगार आणि 70% किंवा 80% दर प्रविष्ट करा.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"स्विस नियम भत्ता दर आणि पगार कॅप सेट करतात. निधी पात्रता, कपात, प्रतीक्षा दिवस आणि हक्क ठरवतो. मासिक श्रेणी 20-23 देय आठवड्याचे दिवस प्रतिबिंबित करते.","Example":"उदाहरण","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"70% दराने CHF 5,000 दर आठवड्याला देय असलेल्या प्रत्येक दिवशी सुमारे CHF 161.29 आहे.","How it works":"ते कसे कार्य करते","Questions":"प्रश्न","Scope and limits":"व्याप्ति आणि मर्यादा","Related tools":"संबंधित साधने","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"मासिक विमा उतरवलेला पगार (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"निधीद्वारे पुष्टी केलेला दर","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"अंदाज","Clear":"साफ करा","Gross scenario":"एकूण परिस्थिती","Insured salary used":"विमा उतरवलेला पगार वापरला","Per payable weekday":"प्रति देय आठवड्याचा दिवस","20-day month":"20-दिवसांचा महिना","23-day month":"23-दिवसांचा महिना","Official benefit rules":"अधिकृत लाभ नियम","Enter your confirmed figures.":"तुमची पुष्टी केलेली आकडेवारी प्रविष्ट करा.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"परिदृश्य गणना केली. तुमच्या फंडासह रकमेची पुष्टी करा.","Check the values.":"मूल्ये तपासा.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"स्विस टेनन्सी नोटिस प्लॅनर","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"स्विस भाडे सूचना नियोजक आणि पत्र मसुदा","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"तुमच्या स्वतःच्या करारातील तारखा आणि अटींवरून भाडेकरू नोटिसची योजना करा; कॅन्टोन नियम गृहीत न धरता पत्र तयार करा.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"सूचना कालावधी, तुमच्या करारातील पुढील वैध समाप्ती दिवस आणि पावतीची तारीख प्रविष्ट करा. तुमच्या घरमालक किंवा भाडेकरूंच्या संघटनेसोबत प्रत्येक तारीख तपासा.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"प्लॅनर फक्त तुम्ही पुरवलेल्या तारखा आणि कालावधी लागू करतो. नोटीस वैध आहे की नाही, ती कायदेशीररित्या कधी प्राप्त होते किंवा विशेष संरक्षण लागू होते की नाही हे ते ठरवत नाही.","Contract notice period (months)":"करार सूचना कालावधी (महिने)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"महिन्याचा पुढील वैध समाप्ती दिवस (करारातून)","Expected receipt date":"अपेक्षित पावतीची तारीख","Your name":"तुमचे नाव","Your address":"तुमचा पत्ता","Landlord / agency":"जमीन मालक / एजन्सी","Recipient address":"प्राप्तकर्त्याचा पत्ता","Rental property":"भाड्याची मालमत्ता","Place":"ठिकाण","Letter date":"पत्र तारीख","Termination of tenancy":"भाडेकरार संपुष्टात आणणे","Calculate date and draft letter":"तारीख आणि मसुदा पत्राची गणना करा","Planning date":"नियोजन तारीख","Target date":"लक्ष्य तारीख","Editable draft":"संपादन करण्यायोग्य मसुदा","Copy draft":"मसुदा कॉपी करा","Enter your contract terms.":"तुमच्या कराराच्या अटी प्रविष्ट करा.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"प्लॅनिंग मसुदा तयार आहे. तुमच्या कराराविरुद्ध पडताळणी करा.","Check the dates and period.":"तारीखा आणि कालावधी तपासा.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"परिणाम पुरवठा केलेल्या कॉन्ट्रॅक्ट नोटिसच्या दिवसानंतर येतो; तो वैधानिक नोटीसचा निर्णय नाही.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"स्विस प्रॉपर्टी गेन परिदृश्य","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"स्विस मालमत्ता नफा कर — वापरकर्ता-प्रविष्ट दर परिस्थिती","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"तुमच्या स्वतःच्या व्यवहार खर्चाचा वापर करून आणि जबाबदार कॅन्टोनकडून मिळणाऱ्या कर दराचा वापर करून मालमत्तेच्या नफ्याचा अंदाज लावा.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"उत्पन्न, संपादन खर्च, तुम्ही पुष्टी केलेले पात्र खर्च आणि अधिकृत कँटोनल कॅल्क्युलेटरकडून प्रभावी दर प्रविष्ट करा.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"स्विस मालमत्ता नफा कर कॅन्टोन, होल्डिंग कालावधी, कपात आणि प्रकरणानुसार बदलतो. हे साधन दर पुरवत नाही किंवा स्वीकार्य खर्च ठरवत नाही.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"विक्रीची रक्कम (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"संपादन खर्च (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"अन्य खर्चाची पुष्टी मान्य आहे (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"अधिकृत स्त्रोताकडून प्रभावी कर दर (%)","Estimate scenario":"अंदाज परिस्थिती","Illustrative scenario":"चित्रणात्मक परिस्थिती","Gain entered":"नफा प्रविष्ट केला","Tax at entered rate":"एंटर केलेल्या दरावर कर","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"तुमच्या नोंदी आणि कॅन्टन स्त्रोतातील आकडे प्रविष्ट करा.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"परिदृश्य गणना केली; कॅन्टोनसह त्याची पडताळणी करा.","Check amounts and rate.":"रक्कम आणि दर तपासा.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"कोणतेही कँटन टॅक्स टेबल एम्बेड केलेले नाही; तुमचा एंटर केलेला प्रभावी दर अंदाज वाढवतो.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"स्विस वारसा आणि भेट कर परिस्थिती","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"स्विस वारसा आणि भेट कर — तुमचा दर परिस्थिती","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"वापरकर्त्याने प्रविष्ट केलेल्या सूट आणि दरावरून करपात्र रकमेचा अंदाज लावा; नियम कॅन्टोन आणि नातेसंबंधानुसार बदलतात.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"प्राप्तकर्ता आणि कॅन्टोनसाठी पुष्टी केलेली रक्कम, सूट आणि प्रभावी दर प्रविष्ट करा.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Canton नियम आणि कौटुंबिक संबंध सूट आणि दर बदलू शकतात. हे साधन कॅन्टोन नियम निवडत नाही किंवा कर दायित्व निर्धारित करत नाही.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"वारसा किंवा भेट रक्कम (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"कॅन्टोन (CHF) सह सूट पुष्टी केली","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"कॅन्टोन (%) सह प्रभावी दर पुष्टी केली","Amount after entered exemption":"प्रविष्ट केलेल्या सूट नंतरची रक्कम","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"तुमच्या केससाठी पुष्टी केलेले आकडे एंटर करा.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"अंदाज फक्त तुम्ही एंटर केलेला सूट आणि दर वापरतो.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"स्विस चाइल्ड सपोर्ट बजेट परिदृश्य","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"स्विस चाइल्ड सपोर्ट बजेट — पारदर्शक घरगुती परिस्थिती","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"एंटर केलेल्या डायरेक्ट-कॉस्ट क्रेडिटनंतर पालकांच्या उत्पन्नानुसार एंटर केलेल्या चाइल्ड बजेटचे वाटप करा.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"मुलाच्या कागदोपत्री मासिक गरजा, दोन्ही पालकांचे उपलब्ध मासिक उत्पन्न आणि तुम्हाला क्रेडिट करायचे असलेले कोणतेही थेट खर्च वापरा.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"हे फक्त नियोजन कार्यपत्रक आहे. हा स्विस बाल-देखभाल पुरस्कार किंवा कायदेशीर पद्धत नाही; गृहनिर्माण, काळजी, कर, फायदे आणि केस कायद्याचे मूल्यांकन केले जात नाही.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"तुम्ही दस्तऐवजीकरण केलेले मासिक बाल बजेट (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"पालक A उपलब्ध मासिक उत्पन्न (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"पालक B उपलब्ध मासिक उत्पन्न (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"पालक A द्वारे क्रेडिट (CHF) द्वारे अदा केलेले थेट बालक खर्च","Allocate scenario":"परिदृश्य वाटप करा","Illustrative allocation":"चित्रात्मक वाटप","Parent A remaining contribution":"पालक A उर्वरित योगदान","Parent B contribution":"पालक बी योगदान","Entered monthly child budget":"मासिक बाल बजेट प्रविष्ट केले","Enter your household budget figures.":"तुमच्या घरगुती बजेटचे आकडे टाका.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"बजेट परिस्थितीची गणना केली; पात्र सल्लागारासह कायदेशीर दायित्वांवर चर्चा करा.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"रक्कम तपासा; क्रेडिट बजेटपेक्षा जास्त असू शकत नाही.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"शेअर्स दोन प्रविष्ट केलेल्या उत्पन्नाच्या प्रमाणात आहेत; डायरेक्ट-कॉस्ट क्रेडिट प्रथम वजा केला जातो.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"ब्राउझर हायफनेशन पूर्वावलोकन","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"शब्द हायफनेशन पूर्वावलोकन — ब्राउझर भाषा नमुने","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"तुम्ही प्रदान केलेल्या मजकूरासाठी ब्राउझर हायफनेशनचे पूर्वावलोकन करा; समर्थन ब्राउझर आणि स्थापित भाषा संसाधनांवर अवलंबून असते.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"तुमच्या मजकुराशी जुळणारी भाषा निवडा, नमुना एंटर करा आणि उपलब्ध रेषेची रुंदी समायोजित करा.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"ब्राउझरचे मूळ CSS हायफनेशन वापरते. हे शब्दकोषांचे बंडल करत नाही; असमर्थित ब्राउझर कोणतेही हायफन दर्शवू शकत नाहीत. मजकूर कॉपी केल्याने मूळ स्पेलिंग कायम राहते.","Text language (BCP 47)":"मजकूर भाषा (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"पूर्वावलोकन रुंदी (वर्ण)","Text to preview":"पूर्वावलोकनासाठी मजकूर","Preview":"पूर्वावलोकन","Enter text and choose its language.":"मजकूर एंटर करा आणि त्याची भाषा निवडा.","Preview updated.":"पूर्वावलोकन अद्यतनित केले.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"समर्थित भाषा टॅग आणि मजकूर प्रविष्ट करा.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"ब्राउझर शब्द कुठे मोडू शकतो हे पाहण्यासाठी वेगवेगळ्या रुंदीवर समान परिच्छेद वापरून पहा.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"खाजगी स्पेलचेक वर्कस्पेस","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"स्थानिक शब्दलेखन तपासक — तुमचा ब्राउझर शब्दकोश वापरा","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"ब्राउझरच्या मूळ शब्दलेखन तपासणीसह मजकूर संपादित करा, भाषा निवडा आणि दुरुस्त केलेला मजकूर कॉपी करा.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"मजकूर या पानावर राहतो. तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये स्पेलिंग डिक्शनरी असलेली भाषा सेट करा, नंतर त्याचा स्पेलिंग मेनू वापरा किंवा सूचना अधोरेखित करा.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"हे कार्यस्थान मजकूर किंवा शिप डिक्शनरी अपलोड करत नाही. ब्राउझर शब्दलेखन तपासणीची उपलब्धता आणि सूचना डिव्हाइस, ब्राउझर आणि स्थापित शब्दकोशावर अवलंबून असतात.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"शब्दलेखन तपासणी भाषा (BCP 47)","Text to check":"तपासण्यासाठी मजकूर","Copy text":"मजकूर कॉपी करा","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"मजकूर टाइप करा किंवा पेस्ट करा. राइट-क्लिक करा किंवा सूचनांसाठी तुमचे डिव्हाइस स्पेलिंग मेनू वापरा.","Text copied.":"मजकूर कॉपी केला.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"आपोआप कॉपी करू शकलो नाही; मजकूर निवडा आणि कॉपी करा.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"जुळणाऱ्या शब्दकोशाशिवाय ब्राउझर चुकीचे शब्दलेखन चिन्हांकित करू शकत नाही.","Resume Structure Checker":"स्ट्रक्चर तपासक पुन्हा सुरू करा","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS रेझ्युमे तपासक - मोफत स्थानिक PDF आणि DOCX पुनरावलोकन","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये रेझ्युमे मजकूर, शीर्षके, विभाग, लिंक्स आणि बुलेट स्ट्रक्चर तपासा. गणनेनुसार नोकरी-वर्णन अटींची तुलना करा; नो हायरिंग स्कोअर किंवा अपलोड नाही.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"मजकूर-आधारित रेझ्युमे प्रत्यक्षात काय उघड करतो याचे पुनरावलोकन करा: काढलेला मजकूर, शीर्षक रचना, संपर्क-क्षेत्र उपस्थिती, दुवे आणि सामान्यतः ओळखले जाणारे विभाग. वैकल्पिकरित्या पुनरावृत्ती केलेल्या नोकरी-वर्णन अटींची तुलना करा.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"अनुभव आणि शिक्षणासाठी हेडिंग 1 शैली असलेले DOCX हे शीर्षक दाखवते. पीडीएफ त्याच्या निवडण्यायोग्य मजकुरातून तपासला जातो; स्तंभ वेगळ्या क्रमाने वाचले जाऊ शकतात.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX फाइल्सची स्थानिक पातळीवर Office ZIP/XML म्हणून तपासणी केली जाते. पीडीएफ स्थगित केलेल्या स्थानिक PDF.js इंजिनसह वाचले जातात. पर्यायी जॉब-वर्णन तुलना प्रत्येक मजकूरातील निवडलेल्या संज्ञा मोजते; ते स्कोअर तयार करत नाही किंवा एखाद्याला कामावर ठेवायचे की नाही याची शिफारस करत नाही.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"हे स्वरूप आणि मजकूर-संरचना तपासणी आहे, ATS सिम्युलेटर, कायदेशीर पुनरावलोकन किंवा मुलाखतीच्या यशाचा अंदाज नाही. निवडण्यायोग्य मजकुराशिवाय स्कॅन केलेल्या PDF ला प्रथम OCR आवश्यक आहे. पासवर्ड-संरक्षित, मॅक्रो-सक्षम, स्वाक्षरी केलेले किंवा असामान्यपणे मोठे दस्तऐवज समर्थित नाहीत.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"एक रेझ्युमे निवडा (PDF किंवा DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"तुमच्या फायली या ब्राउझरमध्ये राहतात आणि अपलोड केल्या जात नाहीत. कमाल 20 एमबी; 50 पृष्ठांपर्यंत PDF. DOCX विस्तारित सामग्री 80 MB वर मर्यादित आहे.","Optional job description":"पर्यायी नोकरीचे वर्णन","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"तुम्हाला टर्म-फ्रिक्वेंसी तुलना हवी असल्यास साधा मजकूर पेस्ट करा. तुम्हाला विश्लेषण करण्याची आवश्यकता नसलेली संवेदनशील माहिती समाविष्ट करू नका.","Paste job-description text here…":"नोकरी-वर्णन मजकूर येथे पेस्ट करा...","Analyze locally":"स्थानिक पातळीवर विश्लेषण करा","Clear files and report":"फाईल्स आणि अहवाल साफ करा","Resume review":"पुनरावलोकन पुन्हा सुरू करा","File type":"फाइल प्रकार","Extracted characters":"एक्सट्रॅक्ट केलेले वर्ण","Words counted":"शब्द मोजले","Detected headings":"ओळखलेली शीर्षके","Recognized sections":"ओळखलेले विभाग","Hyperlinks found":"हायपरलिंक्स सापडले","Bullet paragraphs":"बुलेट परिच्छेद","An email address appears in the text":"मजकूरात ईमेल पत्ता दिसेल","No email address pattern was detected":"कोणताही ईमेल पत्ता नमुना आढळला नाही","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"फोन-नंबर सारखा नमुना मजकुरात दिसतो","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"कोणताही फोन नंबर सारखा पॅटर्न आढळला नाही","Job-description terms (counts only)":"नोकरी-वर्णन अटी (केवळ मोजा)","Term":"टर्म","In job text":"नोकरी मजकूरात","In resume":"रेझ्युमेमध्ये","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"टर्म संख्यांची तुलना करण्यासाठी नोकरीचे वर्णन पेस्ट करा.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"कोणतीही स्पष्ट शीर्षक शैली आढळली नाही. PDF मथळे मजकूर आकारावरून अंदाजे आहेत आणि चुकीची असू शकतात.","Detected":"आढळले","Not detected":"आढळले नाही","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"हे ह्युरिस्टिक सामान्य विभाग नावांचा मर्यादित संच ओळखते; कोणते विभाग आवश्यक आहेत हे ठरवत नाही.","Profile / summary":"प्रोफाइल / सारांश","Experience":"अनुभव","Education":"शिक्षण","Skills":"कौशल्य","Contact":"संपर्क","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"कोणताही निवडण्यायोग्य मजकूर आढळला नाही. फक्त-स्कॅन केलेल्या PDF तपासण्याआधी त्यांना OCR आवश्यक आहे.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"सुरु करण्यासाठी PDF किंवा DOCX रेझ्युमे निवडा.","Reading the selected file locally…":"निवडलेली फाइल स्थानिक पातळीवर वाचत आहे...","Local structure review complete.":"स्थानिक संरचनेचे पुनरावलोकन पूर्ण झाले.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"हा ब्राउझर आवश्यक स्थानिक दस्तऐवज वैशिष्ट्यास समर्थन देत नाही.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"सांगितलेल्या स्थानिक मर्यादेपर्यंत वैध PDF किंवा आधुनिक DOCX फाइल निवडा.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF वाचता आले नाही. ते खराब झालेले, कूटबद्ध केलेले किंवा निवडण्यायोग्य मजकूर असू शकत नाही.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX पॅकेज सुरक्षितपणे उघडले किंवा वाचले जाऊ शकले नाही.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"हे टूल माझा रेझ्युमे अपलोड करते किंवा सेव्ह करते?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"नं. पार्सिंग आणि विश्लेषण तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालतात. फाइल मजकूर सर्व्हरवर पाठविला जात नाही किंवा तुम्ही अहवाल साफ केल्यानंतर किंवा पृष्ठ सोडल्यानंतर ठेवला जात नाही.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"एटीएस किंवा नियोक्ता माझा रेझ्युमे स्वीकारतील की नाही याचा अंदाज येतो?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"नं. हे केवळ वाचनीय मजकूर आणि साधी रचना तपासते. कामावर ठेवण्याच्या पद्धती भिन्न आहेत, आणि ही ATS सुसंगतता हमी किंवा नियुक्तीचा अंदाज नाही.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"तो स्कॅन केलेली PDF वाचू शकतो का?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"PDF मध्ये निवडण्यायोग्य मजकूर स्तर असेल तरच. हे तपासक OCR मॉडेल डाउनलोड करत नाही; फक्त स्कॅन केलेल्या इमेज दस्तऐवजासाठी प्रथम OCR टूल वापरा.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"नोकरी-वर्णन तुलना म्हणजे काय?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"हे साध्या सामान्यीकरणानंतर आवर्ती अटींची संख्या दाखवते. ही जुळणी टक्केवारी, रँकिंग, शिफारस किंवा तुमच्या पात्रतेचे मूल्यांकन नाही.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"DOCX पेक्षा PDF कमी हेडिंग का दाखवते?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF सहसा सिमेंटिक हेडिंग शैली जतन करत नाहीत. तपासक मजकूर आकार आणि वाचन क्रमावरून प्रमुख ओळींचा अंदाज लावतो, त्यामुळे स्तंभ आणि व्हिज्युअल डिझाइन परिणामावर परिणाम करू शकतात.","How local resume review works":"स्थानिक रेझ्युमे पुनरावलोकन कसे कार्य करते","Resume checker questions":"चेकर प्रश्न पुन्हा सुरू करा","Scope and limitations":"व्याप्ति आणि मर्यादा","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"स्थानिक गायन आणि साथीदार विभाजक","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"व्होकल रीमूव्हर — स्थानिक स्वर आणि साथीदार वेगळे","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"तुमच्या ब्राउझरमधील अंदाजे गायन आणि साथीदारांमध्ये लहान स्टिरिओ ऑडिओ नमुना विभक्त करा. ऑडिओ तुमच्या डिव्हाइसवर राहतो; मॉडेल त्याच्या सार्वजनिक होस्टवरून डाउनलोड केले आहे.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"३० सेकंदांपर्यंत एक स्टिरिओ संगीत क्लिप निवडा. प्रथम वापरावर, ब्राउझर 35.6 MB मॉडेल डाउनलोड करतो. या डिव्हाइसवर ऑडिओ फाइलवर प्रक्रिया केली जाते आणि ती कधीही अपलोड केली जात नाही.","What you get":"तुम्हाला काय मिळेल","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"दोन WAV स्टेमचे पूर्वावलोकन करा आणि डाउनलोड करा: अंदाजे गायन आणि अवशिष्ट साथी. परिणाम मिश्रणावर अवलंबून असतात आणि त्यात कलाकृती असू शकतात.","Local processing":"स्थानिक प्रक्रिया","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"हे टूल ओएनएनएक्स आणि ओएनएनएक्स रनटाइम वेबवर निर्यात केलेल्या ओपन-अनमिक्स UMX-HQ व्होकल्स नेटवर्कचा वापर करते. तुम्ही वेगळे दाबाल तेव्हाच मॉडेल आणले जाते; कोणतेही सशुल्क अनुमान API किंवा सदस्यता वापरली जात नाही. ऑडिओ स्थानिक पातळीवर डीकोड, प्रक्रिया आणि निर्यात केला जातो.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"हे स्टिरिओ 44.1 kHz प्रक्रियेसाठी आणि 30 सेकंदांपर्यंत क्लिपसाठी अंदाज आहे. मोनो स्रोत स्टिरिओवर डुप्लिकेट केले जातात. वादन, भारी प्रभाव, थेट रेकॉर्डिंग आणि असामान्य शैलींमध्ये खोलवर मिसळलेले गायन गळती किंवा कलाकृती निर्माण करू शकतात. स्वच्छ मास्टर म्हणून परिणाम वापरू नका. मॉडेल डाउनलोड करण्यासाठी इंटरनेट कनेक्शन आवश्यक आहे; ऑडिओ हे डिव्हाइस सोडत नाही.","Is my audio uploaded?":"माझा ऑडिओ अपलोड केला आहे का?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"नं. निवडलेला ऑडिओ तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये डीकोड केला जातो आणि त्यावर प्रक्रिया केली जाते. जेव्हा तुम्ही विभक्त होणे सुरू करता तेव्हा मॉडेल डाउनलोड करण्याची एकमेव नेटवर्क विनंती असते.","Why is the first run slow?":"पहिली धाव मंद का आहे?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"ब्राउझर एकदा 35.6 MB मॉडेल डाउनलोड करतो; ब्राउझर ते कॅश करू शकतो. अनुमान नंतर डिव्हाइस CPU वर स्थानिकरित्या चालते.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"प्रत्येक गाणे स्वच्छपणे वेगळे होईल का?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"नं. मॉडेल एक व्होकल स्टेमचा अंदाज लावते आणि व्होकल लीकेज सोडू शकते, इन्स्ट्रुमेंट हार्मोनिक्स काढून टाकू शकते किंवा कलाकृती तयार करू शकते. स्टेमवर अवलंबून राहण्यापूर्वी ऐका.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"स्टिरीओ ऑडिओ फाइल (३० सेकंदांपर्यंत)","Choose audio":"ऑडिओ निवडा","Separate vocals":"वेगळे गायन","Cancel / clear":"रद्द करा / साफ करा","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"सुरु करण्यासाठी एक लहान ऑडिओ फाइल निवडा.","Downloading the separation model…":"सेपरेशन मॉडेल डाउनलोड करत आहे...","Separating locally…":"स्थानिकरित्या विभक्त करत आहे...","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"सेपरेशन पूर्ण. स्टेमचे पूर्वावलोकन करा किंवा डाउनलोड करा.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"या फाइलवर प्रक्रिया करणे किंवा मॉडेल लोड करणे शक्य झाले नाही. स्वरूप आणि कनेक्शन तपासा, नंतर पुन्हा प्रयत्न करा.","Model and weight license information":"मॉडेल आणि वजन परवाना माहिती","Estimated vocals":"अंदाजित गायन","Estimated accompaniment":"अंदाजित साथी","Download WAV":"WAV डाउनलोड करा","Progress":"प्रगती","Preparing local separation…":"स्थानिक पृथक्करण तयार करत आहे...","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"सेपरेशन पूर्ण. या डिव्हाइसवर ऑडिओ राहिला.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"या ऑडिओवर प्रक्रिया करणे शक्य नाही. 30 सेकंदांखालील स्टिरिओ संगीत फाइल वापरून पहा.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"स्विस हेल्थ इन्शुरन्स डिडक्टेबल कॉम्पॅरेटर","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"स्विस हेल्थ इन्शुरन्स फ्रँचायझी कॅल्क्युलेटर — वार्षिक खर्चाची तुलना करा","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"स्विस मूलभूत आरोग्य विमा वजावटीची प्रीमियम आणि पात्र वार्षिक वैद्यकीय खर्च वापरून तुलना करा. कोणत्याही विमा कंपनीचा कोट अंदाज लावलेला नाही.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"प्रत्येक वजावटीसाठी समान विमा कंपनीने दाखवलेले मासिक प्रीमियम प्रविष्ट करा, नंतर कमी, अपेक्षित आणि उच्च वार्षिक उपचार-खर्च परिस्थितींची तुलना करा.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"अनिवार्य स्विस मूलभूत आरोग्य विम्यासाठी, प्रौढ मानक वजापात्र CHF 300 आहे आणि मुलाची वजावट CHF 0 आहे. पर्यायी पातळी वयोगटानुसार भिन्न आहेत. कपातीनंतर, मानक धारणा शुल्क पात्र उर्वरित खर्चाच्या 10% आहे, प्रौढांसाठी प्रति वर्ष CHF 700 आणि मुलांसाठी 350 CHF. हे टूल या मॉडेल केलेल्या खर्च शेअरिंगमध्ये तुमचा एंटर केलेला प्रीमियम जोडते; ते विमा कंपनीचे दर मिळवत नाही किंवा तुमच्यासाठी कोणता पर्याय योग्य आहे हे ठरवत नाही.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"एखाद्या प्रौढ व्यक्तीने CHF 300 वजापाती दराने CHF 400 मासिक प्रीमियम आणि CHF 2,500 वजा करता CHF 350 मध्ये प्रवेश केल्यास, वार्षिक प्रीमियम फरक CHF 600 आहे. त्या बचतीची तुलना किंमतीतील मॉडेल केलेल्या फरकाशी करा, तुमच्या प्रत्येकी सर्वात कमी रकमेवर शेअर करा.","How the estimate works":"अनुमान कसे कार्य करते","Common questions":"सामान्य प्रश्न","Scope and exclusions":"व्याप्ति आणि अपवर्जन","Where do I get the premiums?":"मला प्रीमियम कुठे मिळेल?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"समान विमा कंपनी, प्रीमियम क्षेत्र, वयोगट, अपघात संरक्षण आणि विमा मॉडेलसाठी वर्तमान मासिक ऑफर वापरा. Priminfo अधिकृत फेडरल तुलना साइट आहे. हे पृष्ठ विमा कंपनीचे कोट मिळवत नाही किंवा पुनरुत्पादित करत नाही.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"सर्व सूचीबद्ध वजावटीचे स्तर नेहमी ऑफर केले जातात?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"नं. विमा कंपन्यांना प्रत्येक पर्यायी स्तर ऑफर करण्याची गरज नाही आणि तरुण प्रौढांसाठी ऑफर भिन्न असू शकतात. फक्त तुमच्या स्वतःच्या पॉलिसीसाठी दाखवलेले प्रीमियम प्रविष्ट करा; अनुपलब्ध पर्याय रिक्त सोडा.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"हे माझे संपूर्ण वैद्यकीय बिल दाखवते का?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"नं. मॉडेल पात्र खर्चावर सामान्य वजावटी आणि मानक 10% धारणा शुल्क कव्हर करते. यामध्ये हॉस्पिटल डे योगदान, विशेष 40% औषध धारणा, सूट सेवा, न कव्हर केअर आणि पूरक विमा वगळण्यात आला आहे.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"ही परिस्थिती तुलना आहे, विमा, वैद्यकीय किंवा आर्थिक सल्ला नाही. हे तुमच्या उपचारांचा किंवा प्रीमियमचा अंदाज लावत नाही. यामध्ये हॉस्पिटल डे योगदान (सामान्यत: CHF 15 प्रति रूग्ण दिवस, वैधानिक सवलतींसह), विशिष्ट औषधांवर विशेष 40% धारणा, प्रसूती/प्रतिबंधात्मक सूट, अनिवार्य कव्हरच्या बाहेरील सेवा, प्रीमियम सबसिडी आणि पूरक विमा वगळण्यात आले आहे. वास्तविक सह-पेमेंट त्यामुळे भिन्न असू शकते. उच्च वजावटीचा अर्थ असा आहे की तुम्हाला काळजी मिळाल्यास तुम्हाला अधिक आगाऊ पैसे देण्यास सक्षम असणे आवश्यक आहे.","Who is insured under this policy?":"या पॉलिसी अंतर्गत कोणाचा विमा उतरवला आहे?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"प्रौढ (वय 19 किंवा त्याहून अधिक)","Child (under 18)":"मुल (18 वर्षाखालील)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"कमी वार्षिक पात्र उपचार-खर्च परिस्थिती (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"अपेक्षित वार्षिक पात्र उपचार खर्च (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"उच्च वार्षिक पात्र उपचार-खर्च परिस्थिती (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"एका विमा कंपनीकडून मासिक प्रीमियम","Monthly premium":"मासिक प्रीमियम","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"या पॉलिसीसाठी ऑफर केलेले फक्त पर्याय प्रविष्ट करा. इतरांना रिक्त सोडा.","Adult deductible choices":"प्रौढ वजा करण्यायोग्य पर्याय","Child deductible choices":"मुलांच्या कपात करण्यायोग्य पर्याय","Compare annual costs":"वार्षिक खर्चाची तुलना करा","Clear entries":"प्रविष्टी साफ करा","Download CSV":"CSV डाउनलोड करा","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"अंदाजित वार्षिक प्रीमियम अधिक खर्च सामायिकरण","Deductible":"वजावट करण्यायोग्य","Annual premiums":"वार्षिक प्रीमियम","Total at low costs":"एकूण कमी किमतीत","Total at expected costs":"अपेक्षित खर्चावर एकूण","Total at high costs":"उच्च खर्चावर एकूण","Cost sharing at low costs":"कमी खर्चात खर्च शेअरिंग","Cost sharing at expected costs":"अपेक्षित खर्चावर खर्च शेअरिंग","Cost sharing at high costs":"उच्च किमतीवर खर्च सामायिकरण","Difference from lowest available deductible":"सर्वात कमी उपलब्ध वजावटी पासून फरक","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"वैद्यकीय खर्च जेथे प्रीमियम बचत वापरली जाते","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"प्रविष्ट केलेली प्रीमियम बचत मॉडेल केलेल्या खर्च-सामायिकरण श्रेणीमध्ये रद्द केली जात नाही.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"सर्वात कमी वजावटीवर प्रीमियम बचत नाही.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"प्रविष्ट केलेल्या पर्यायांपैकी सर्वात कमी अपेक्षित एकूण","Scenario details":"परिदृश्य तपशील","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"कमीत कमी दोन उपलब्ध वजावटीसाठी तीन ऑर्डर केलेल्या वैद्यकीय-खर्चाची परिस्थिती आणि मासिक प्रीमियम प्रविष्ट करा.","Official rules and current premiums:":"अधिकृत नियम आणि वर्तमान प्रीमियम:","Federal deductible rules":"फेडरल कपात करण्यायोग्य नियम","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo अधिकृत प्रीमियम तुलना","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"तुलना या ब्राउझरमध्ये गणना केली आहे.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"वयोगट, ऑर्डर केलेल्या खर्चाची परिस्थिती आणि किमान दोन मासिक प्रीमियम तपासा.","Entries cleared.":"प्रविष्टी साफ केल्या.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV स्थानिकरित्या डाउनलोड केले.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"स्विस हेल्थ प्रीमियम रिडक्शन कॅल्क्युलेटर","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"स्विस प्रीमियम सबसिडी कॅल्क्युलेटर - तुमचा निव्वळ प्रीमियम","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"सध्याच्या प्रीमियममधून निव्वळ स्विस हेल्थ-इन्शुरन्स प्रीमियमची गणना करा आणि तुमच्या कॅन्टोनने आधीच मंजूर केलेली मासिक कपात करा.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"तुमच्या विमा कंपनीकडून किंवा कॅन्टोनल निर्णयाकडून प्रीमियम आणि पुष्टी केलेली मासिक कपात प्रविष्ट करा. हे साधन तुम्ही पात्र आहात की नाही हे ठरवत नाही.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"कोण पात्र आहे, किती समर्थन दिले जाते आणि अर्जाची आवश्यकता आहे की नाही हे स्विस कॅन्टन्स ठरवतात. हे कॅल्क्युलेटर केवळ एका पॉलिसी प्रीमियममधून पुष्टी केलेली मासिक कपात वजा करते आणि वार्षिक रक्कम दर्शवते.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"मासिक प्रीमियम CHF 420 असल्यास आणि पुष्टी केलेली कपात CHF 120 असल्यास, अंदाजे निव्वळ प्रीमियम CHF 300 प्रति महिना आहे.","How the calculation works":"गणना कशी कार्य करते","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"मी पात्र आहे की नाही हे मला सांगते?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"नं. पात्रता आणि पुरस्काराची रक्कम निवासस्थानाच्या कॅन्टोनद्वारे ठरवली जाते. लिंक केलेली अधिकृत माहिती वापरा किंवा कॅन्टोनल कार्यालयाशी संपर्क साधा.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"कपात रक्कम मला कुठे मिळेल?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"सध्याचा निर्णय किंवा तुमच्या विमा कंपनीने दाखवलेला कमी केलेला प्रीमियम वापरा. काही कॅन्टन्स आपोआप कपात देतात; इतरांना अर्ज आवश्यक आहे.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"हे एका पॉलिसीसाठी अंकगणित आहे, पात्रता किंवा लाभाचा निर्णय नाही. हे कौटुंबिक उत्पन्न, मालमत्ता, कौटुंबिक स्थिती, अंतिम मुदत, कॅन्टोनल थ्रेशोल्ड किंवा अर्ज अधिकारांची गणना करत नाही. प्रीमियम आणि पुरस्कार बदलू शकतात; तुमच्या विमा कंपनी आणि कॅन्टोनशी त्यांची पुष्टी करा.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"वर्तमान मासिक प्रीमियम (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"मासिक कपात आधीच मंजूर आहे (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"कँटोन किंवा विमा कंपनीने पुष्टी केलेली रक्कम प्रविष्ट करा; पुरस्कार म्हणून अंदाज वापरू नका.","Calculate net premium":"निव्वळ प्रीमियमची गणना करा","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"वर्तमान प्रीमियम आणि पुष्टी केलेली कपात प्रविष्ट करा.","Estimated premium after reduction":"कपात केल्यानंतर अंदाजे प्रीमियम","Current monthly premium":"वर्तमान मासिक प्रीमियम","Monthly reduction":"मासिक कपात","Estimated net monthly premium":"अंदाजित निव्वळ मासिक प्रीमियम","Reduction over 12 months":"12 महिन्यांत कपात","Reduction as a share of premium":"प्रिमियमचा हिस्सा म्हणून कपात","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"गणना पूर्ण. तुमच्या कॅन्टोन आणि विमा कंपनीसोबत पुरस्कार आणि प्रभावी तारखांची पुष्टी करा.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"कपात मासिक प्रीमियमपेक्षा जास्त नाही हे तपासा.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"स्विस भाडे संदर्भ-दर परिस्थिती कॅल्क्युलेटर","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"स्विस भाडे समायोजन कॅल्क्युलेटर - संदर्भ दर परिस्थिती","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"स्वित्झर्लंडच्या तारण संदर्भ दरातील बदलाचा निवासी निव्वळ भाड्यावर कसा परिणाम होतो याचा अंदाज लावा. फेडरल हाउसिंग ऑफिसमधील नवीनतम दर वापरा.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"तुमच्या भाडेपट्टीत नमूद केलेल्या संदर्भ दराची किंवा नवीनतम भाड्याच्या सूचना वर्तमान अधिकृत स्विस दराशी तुलना करा. गणना तुमच्या डिव्हाइसवर राहते.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"फेडरल ऑफिस फॉर हाउसिंग प्रत्येक तिमाहीत स्विस भाड्याच्या समायोजनासाठी एक तारण संदर्भ दर प्रकाशित करते. 0.25 टक्के-बिंदू वाढ तत्त्वतः 3% भाडे वाढ करण्यास परवानगी देऊ शकते; 0.25-पॉइंटची घट तत्त्वतः 2.91% कमी करण्यास अनुमती देऊ शकते. ही परिस्थिती आपण प्रविष्ट केलेल्या निव्वळ भाड्यावर चरण-दर-चरण ते बदल लागू करते.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"CHF 3,000 मासिक निव्वळ भाड्यासाठी, संदर्भ-दर 1.75% वरून 1.50% पर्यंत कमी केल्याने अंदाजे संदर्भ-दर-केवळ अंदाजे −CHF 87.38 प्रति महिना (−2.91%) बदल होतो.","How this estimate works":"हा अंदाज कसा काम करतो","Where do I find the current rate?":"मला वर्तमान दर कुठे मिळेल?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"लिंक केलेले फेडरल ऑफिस फॉर हाउसिंग पृष्ठ उघडा आणि वर्तमान प्रकाशित दर प्रविष्ट करा. साधन कालबाह्य होऊ शकेल असा दर एम्बेड करत नाही.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"मी भाडे बदलाची विनंती करू शकतो की नाही हे हे ठरवते का?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"नं. हे अभिमुखतेसाठी एक घटक वेगळे करते. तुमचा करार, महागाई, किमतीतील बदल, आरक्षणे आणि इतर कायदेशीर अटी परिणाम बदलू शकतात.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"परिणामामध्ये सहायक खर्च समाविष्ट आहेत का?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"नं. मासिक निव्वळ भाडे एंटर करा, सहाय्यक खर्च आणि इतर परिवर्तनीय शुल्क वगळून.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"परिणाम एक उदाहरणात्मक संदर्भ-दर परिस्थिती आहे, कायदेशीर मत किंवा संपूर्ण भाडे पुनरावलोकन नाही. यात महागाई, सामान्य किमतीतील बदल, सुधारणा, कंत्राटी आरक्षणे, अनुक्रमित किंवा चरणबद्ध भाडे, सूचना तारखा आणि कॅन्टोनल प्रक्रिया वगळण्यात आली आहे. अभिनय करण्यापूर्वी तुमचा भाडेपट्टा आणि अधिकृत मार्गदर्शन तपासा.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"स्विस निवासी लीज: फक्त गहाण-संदर्भ-दर प्रभावाचा अंदाज. हा कायदेशीर निर्णय किंवा पूर्ण भाडे पुनरावलोकन नाही.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"वर्तमान मासिक निव्वळ भाडे (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"तुमच्या भाडेपट्टीत किंवा नवीनतम भाडे सूचना (%) मध्ये नमूद केलेला संदर्भ दर","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"वर्तमान अधिकृत स्विस संदर्भ दर (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"संदर्भ-दर परिस्थितीची गणना करा","Reference-rate-only scenario":"संदर्भ-दर-केवळ परिस्थिती","Current monthly net rent":"वर्तमान मासिक निव्वळ भाडे","Reference-rate change":"संदर्भ-दर बदल","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"संदर्भ दरावरून अंदाजे मासिक प्रभाव","Scenario monthly net rent":"परिस्थिती मासिक निव्वळ भाडे","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"12 महिन्यांसाठी त्याच दराने वार्षिक प्रभाव","potential increase":"संभाव्य वाढ","potential decrease":"संभाव्य घट","no reference-rate change":"कोणताही संदर्भ-दर बदल नाही","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"प्रत्येक 0.25 टक्के-बिंदू वाढीसाठी अंदाज 3% लागू होतो आणि प्रत्येक घटासाठी समतुल्य व्यस्त घट. इतर घटक परिणाम बदलू शकतात.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"यामध्ये महागाई, सामान्य खर्चातील बदल, सुधारणा, करार आरक्षणे, अनुक्रमित किंवा चरणबद्ध भाडे, सूचना तारखा किंवा स्थानिक प्रक्रियात्मक आवश्यकता समाविष्ट नाहीत. तुमची भाडेपट्टी आणि गृहनिर्माण मार्गदर्शनासाठी फेडरल ऑफिस तपासा.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"नवीनतम अधिकृत दर आणि मार्गदर्शन तपासा","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"स्विस फेडरल ऑफिस फॉर हाउसिंग (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"परिदृश्य पाहण्यासाठी भाडे आणि दोन्ही दर प्रविष्ट करा.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"परिदृश्य गणना केली. त्यावर अवलंबून राहण्यापूर्वी तारखा आणि कराराच्या अटींची पडताळणी करा.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"रक्कम आणि दर तपासा. दर 0% आणि 5% च्या दरम्यान असणे आवश्यक आहे आणि 0.25-बिंदू चरणांमध्ये भिन्न असणे आवश्यक आहे.","Inputs cleared.":"इनपुट साफ केले.","Result":"परिणाम","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"स्विस सुट्टीतील जमा अंदाजक","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"स्विस सुट्टीतील जमा कॅल्क्युलेटर — यथानुपात रजा शिल्लक","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"तुमच्या करारातील वार्षिक रजा, वर्क वीक, रोजगाराच्या तारखा आणि आधीच घेतलेल्या दिवसांवरून स्विस सुट्टीतील दिवसांची शिल्लक अंदाज लावा.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"तुम्ही एंटर केलेले पात्रता आणि कामाचे वेळापत्रक वापरून एका कॅलेंडर वर्षासाठी यथानुपात सशुल्क रजेचा अंदाज लावा. कोणत्याही कराराच्या अटींचा अंदाज नाही.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"निवडलेल्या वर्षात नियुक्त केलेल्या कॅलेंडर दिवसांनुसार अंदाजकर्ता तुमच्या करारातील वार्षिक सुट्टीच्या दिवसांचे प्रमाण करतो. अर्धवेळ कामासाठी, दर आठवड्याला तुमचे नेहमीचे कामाचे दिवस आणि आठवड्यातील वार्षिक रजा एंटर करा.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"चार आठवड्यांच्या रजेसह, पाच दिवसांचा कामाचा आठवडा आणि वर्षभरातील नोकरीसह, आधीच घेतलेली रजा वजा करण्याआधी वार्षिक हक्क 20 कामकाजाचे दिवस आहेत.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"स्विस वैधानिक किमान काय आहे?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"फेडरल मार्गदर्शन दर सेवा वर्षात किमान चार आठवडे आणि 20 वर्षे वयापर्यंत न पोहोचलेल्या कामगारांसाठी पाच आठवडे सांगते. करार किंवा सामूहिक करार अधिक मंजूर करू शकतो.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"हे माझे कायदेशीर शिल्लक ठरवते का?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"नं. हे एक साधे कॅलेंडर-दिवस प्रमाणीकरण आहे. कराराच्या अटी, लागू सामूहिक नियम, पात्रता अनुपस्थिती, राउंडिंग आणि नियोक्ता रेकॉर्ड शिल्लक बदलू शकतात.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"हा अंदाज कायदेशीर हक्क ठरवत नाही किंवा सुट्टीच्या वेतनाची गणना करत नाही. यात काही प्रदीर्घ अनुपस्थिती, करार-विशिष्ट जमा आणि गोलाकार नियम, सार्वजनिक सुट्ट्या, ओव्हरटाईम, कॅरी-ओव्हर डेडलाइन आणि विवादांसाठी कपात वगळण्यात आली आहे. तुमचा करार तपासा आणि प्रतिस्पर्धी शिल्लकसाठी सल्ला मिळवा.","Leave year":"सुट्टीचे वर्ष","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"तुमच्या करारातील वार्षिक रजा (आठवडे)","Usual working days per week":"दर आठवड्याला नेहमीचे कामकाजाचे दिवस","Employment start date":"रोजगार सुरू होण्याची तारीख","Employment end date":"रोजगार समाप्ती तारीख","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"या रजेच्या वर्षात आधीच घेतलेले रजा दिवस","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"केवळ अभिमुखतेसाठी. कराराचा वार्षिक हक्क प्रविष्ट करा; 20 वर्षाखालील कामगारांसाठी कायदेशीर किमान चार आठवडे किंवा पाच आठवडे असते.","Estimate balance":"अंदाज शिल्लक","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"शेवटचा अंदाज घेण्यासाठी तुमचा करार आणि तारखा प्रविष्ट करा.","Estimated leave balance":"अंदाजित रजा शिल्लक","Annual leave at this schedule":"या वेळापत्रकानुसार वार्षिक रजा","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"या रजेच्या वर्षात नियुक्त केलेले कॅलेंडर दिवस","Prorated days accrued":"प्रमाणित दिवस जमा झाले","Days already taken":"आधीच घेतलेले दिवस","Estimated days remaining":"अंदाजे दिवस शिल्लक आहेत","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"हे रोजगार कालावधीत कॅलेंडर दिवसांनुसार वार्षिक रजेचे प्रमाण आहे. नियोक्ता आणि कराराचे नियम वेगळे असू शकतात.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"अंदाज मोजला. तुमच्या कराराच्या आणि नियोक्त्याच्या नोंदींवर ते तपासा.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"वर्ष, तारखा, कामाचे वेळापत्रक आणि मूल्ये तपासा."},"te":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"స్విస్ నిరుద్యోగ భృతి దృశ్యం","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"స్విస్ నిరుద్యోగ భృతి కాలిక్యులేటర్ — స్థూల దృశ్యం","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"మీ ఫండ్ ద్వారా నిర్ధారించబడిన బీమా చేయబడిన జీతం మరియు రేటును ఉపయోగించి స్థూల స్విస్ రోజువారీ భత్యాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"మీ నిరుద్యోగ నిధి ద్వారా నిర్ధారించబడిన బీమా చేయబడిన జీతం మరియు 70% లేదా 80% రేటును నమోదు చేయండి.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"స్విస్ నియమాలు భత్యం రేటు మరియు జీతం పరిమితిని సెట్ చేస్తాయి. అర్హత, తగ్గింపులు, వేచి ఉండే రోజులు మరియు అర్హతను ఫండ్ నిర్ణయిస్తుంది. నెలవారీ పరిధి 20–23 చెల్లించవలసిన వారపు రోజులను ప్రతిబింబిస్తుంది.","Example":"ఉదాహరణ","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"70% వద్ద CHF 5,000 చెల్లించవలసిన వారానికి దాదాపు CHF 161.29.","How it works":"ఇది ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","Questions":"ప్రశ్నలు","Scope and limits":"పరిధి మరియు పరిమితులు","Related tools":"సంబంధిత సాధనాలు","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"నెలవారీ బీమా జీతం (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"ఫండ్ ద్వారా రేటు నిర్ధారించబడింది","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"అంచనా","Clear":"క్లియర్","Gross scenario":"స్థూల దృశ్యం","Insured salary used":"బీమా జీతం ఉపయోగించబడింది","Per payable weekday":"చెల్లించవలసిన వారపు రోజుకు","20-day month":"20-రోజుల నెల","23-day month":"23-రోజుల నెల","Official benefit rules":"అధికారిక ప్రయోజన నియమాలు","Enter your confirmed figures.":"మీ ధృవీకరించబడిన గణాంకాలను నమోదు చేయండి.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"దృష్టాంతం లెక్కించబడింది. మీ ఫండ్‌తో మొత్తాలను నిర్ధారించండి.","Check the values.":"విలువలను తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"స్విస్ టెనెన్సీ నోటీసు ప్లానర్","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"స్విస్ రెంటల్ నోటీసు ప్లానర్ మరియు లెటర్ డ్రాఫ్ట్","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"మీ స్వంత ఒప్పందంలోని తేదీలు మరియు నిబంధనల నుండి అద్దె నోటీసును ప్లాన్ చేయండి; ఖండ నిబంధనలను ఊహించకుండా ఒక లేఖను రూపొందించండి.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"మీ ఒప్పందంలో నోటీసు వ్యవధి, తదుపరి చెల్లుబాటు అయ్యే ముగింపు రోజు మరియు రసీదు తేదీని నమోదు చేయండి. మీ భూస్వామి లేదా అద్దెదారుల సంఘంతో ప్రతి తేదీని తనిఖీ చేయండి.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"ప్లానర్ మీరు సరఫరా చేసే తేదీలు మరియు వ్యవధిని మాత్రమే వర్తింపజేస్తారు. నోటీసు చెల్లుబాటవుతుందా, అది చట్టబద్ధంగా స్వీకరించబడినప్పుడు లేదా ప్రత్యేక రక్షణ వర్తిస్తుందా అనేది నిర్ణయించదు.","Contract notice period (months)":"కాంట్రాక్ట్ నోటీసు వ్యవధి (నెలలు)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"నెల చెల్లుబాటు అయ్యే ముగింపు రోజు (ఒప్పందం నుండి)","Expected receipt date":"అంచనా రసీదు తేదీ","Your name":"మీ పేరు","Your address":"మీ చిరునామా","Landlord / agency":"భూస్వామి / ఏజెన్సీ","Recipient address":"గ్రహీత చిరునామా","Rental property":"అద్దె ఆస్తి","Place":"ప్లేస్","Letter date":"అక్షర తేదీ","Termination of tenancy":"అద్దె రద్దు","Calculate date and draft letter":"తేదీ మరియు డ్రాఫ్ట్ లెటర్‌ను లెక్కించండి","Planning date":"ప్రణాళిక తేదీ","Target date":"లక్ష్య తేదీ","Editable draft":"సవరించదగిన చిత్తుప్రతి","Copy draft":"డ్రాఫ్ట్ కాపీ","Enter your contract terms.":"మీ ఒప్పంద నిబంధనలను నమోదు చేయండి.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"ప్లానింగ్ డ్రాఫ్ట్ సిద్ధంగా ఉంది. మీ ఒప్పందానికి వ్యతిరేకంగా ధృవీకరించండి.","Check the dates and period.":"తేదీలు మరియు వ్యవధిని తనిఖీ చేయండి.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"ఫలితం సరఫరా చేయబడిన కాంట్రాక్ట్ నోటీసు రోజును అనుసరిస్తుంది; ఇది చట్టబద్ధమైన నోటీసు తీర్పు కాదు.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"స్విస్ ప్రాపర్టీ గెయిన్ దృశ్యం","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"స్విస్ ప్రాపర్టీ గెయిన్స్ టాక్స్ — యూజర్ ఎంటర్ చేసిన రేట్ సినారియో","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"మీ స్వంత లావాదేవీ ఖర్చులు మరియు బాధ్యతాయుతమైన ఖండం నుండి పన్ను రేటును ఉపయోగించి ఆస్తి లాభాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"అధికారిక కంటోనల్ కాలిక్యులేటర్ నుండి రాబడి, కొనుగోలు ఖర్చు, మీరు నిర్ధారించిన అర్హత గల ఖర్చులు మరియు ప్రభావవంతమైన రేటును నమోదు చేయండి.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"స్విస్ ఆస్తి లాభాల పన్ను ఖండం, హోల్డింగ్ వ్యవధి, తగ్గింపులు మరియు కేసులను బట్టి మారుతుంది. ఈ సాధనం రేట్లను సరఫరా చేయదు లేదా ఆమోదయోగ్యమైన ఖర్చులను నిర్ణయించదు.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"అమ్మకం ఆదాయం (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"సముపార్జన ఖర్చు (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"ఇతర ఖర్చులు అనుమతించదగినవిగా నిర్ధారించబడ్డాయి (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"అధికారిక మూలం (%) నుండి ప్రభావవంతమైన పన్ను రేటు","Estimate scenario":"అంచనా దృశ్యం","Illustrative scenario":"ఇలస్ట్రేటివ్ దృశ్యం","Gain entered":"లాభం నమోదు చేయబడింది","Tax at entered rate":"నమోదైన రేటు వద్ద పన్ను","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"మీ రికార్డులు మరియు ఖండ మూలాధారం నుండి బొమ్మలను నమోదు చేయండి.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"దృష్టాంతం లెక్కించబడింది; దానిని ఖండంతో ధృవీకరించండి.","Check amounts and rate.":"మొత్తాలను మరియు రేటును తనిఖీ చేయండి.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"కంటన్ పన్ను పట్టిక పొందుపరచబడలేదు; మీరు నమోదు చేసిన ప్రభావవంతమైన రేటు అంచనాను నడిపిస్తుంది.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"స్విస్ వారసత్వం మరియు బహుమతి పన్ను దృశ్యం","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"స్విస్ వారసత్వం మరియు బహుమతి పన్ను — మీ రేటు దృశ్యం","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"వినియోగదారు నమోదు చేసిన మినహాయింపు మరియు రేటు నుండి పన్ను విధించదగిన మొత్తాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి; ఖండం మరియు సంబంధాన్ని బట్టి నియమాలు మారుతూ ఉంటాయి.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"గ్రహీత మరియు ఖండం కోసం నిర్ధారించబడిన మొత్తం, మినహాయింపు మరియు ప్రభావవంతమైన రేటును నమోదు చేయండి.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"కాంటన్ నియమాలు మరియు కుటుంబ సంబంధాలు మినహాయింపులు మరియు రేట్లను మార్చగలవు. ఈ సాధనం ఖండ నియమాన్ని ఎంచుకోదు లేదా పన్ను బాధ్యతను నిర్ణయించదు.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"వారసత్వం లేదా బహుమతి మొత్తం (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"కాంటన్ (CHF)తో మినహాయింపు నిర్ధారించబడింది","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"కాంటన్ (%)తో ప్రభావవంతమైన రేటు నిర్ధారించబడింది","Amount after entered exemption":"మినహాయింపు నమోదు చేసిన తర్వాత మొత్తం","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"మీ కేసు కోసం ధృవీకరించబడిన గణాంకాలను నమోదు చేయండి.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"అంచనా మీరు నమోదు చేసే మినహాయింపు మరియు రేటును మాత్రమే ఉపయోగిస్తుంది.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"స్విస్ చైల్డ్ సపోర్ట్ బడ్జెట్ దృశ్యం","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"స్విస్ చైల్డ్ సపోర్ట్ బడ్జెట్ — పారదర్శక గృహ దృశ్యం","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"ఎంటర్ చేసిన డైరెక్ట్-కాస్ట్ క్రెడిట్ తర్వాత పేరెంట్ ఆదాయం ద్వారా ఎంటర్ చేసిన చైల్డ్ బడ్జెట్‌ను కేటాయించండి.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"పిల్లల డాక్యుమెంట్ చేయబడిన నెలవారీ అవసరాలు, తల్లిదండ్రుల అందుబాటులో ఉన్న నెలవారీ ఆదాయాలు మరియు మీరు క్రెడిట్ చేయాలనుకుంటున్న ఏవైనా ప్రత్యక్ష ఖర్చులను ఉపయోగించండి.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"ఇది ప్లానింగ్ వర్క్‌షీట్ మాత్రమే. ఇది స్విస్ పిల్లల నిర్వహణ అవార్డు లేదా చట్టపరమైన పద్ధతి కాదు; హౌసింగ్, సంరక్షణ, పన్నులు, ప్రయోజనాలు మరియు కేసు చట్టం అంచనా వేయబడవు.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"మీరు డాక్యుమెంట్ చేసిన నెలవారీ పిల్లల బడ్జెట్ (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"తల్లిదండ్రులు A అందుబాటులో ఉన్న నెలవారీ ఆదాయం (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"తల్లిదండ్రులు B అందుబాటులో ఉన్న నెలవారీ ఆదాయం (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"తల్లిదండ్రులు A క్రెడిట్ (CHF)కి చెల్లించే ప్రత్యక్ష పిల్లల ఖర్చులు","Allocate scenario":"దృష్టాంతాన్ని కేటాయించండి","Illustrative allocation":"ఇలస్ట్రేటివ్ కేటాయింపు","Parent A remaining contribution":"పేరెంట్ A మిగిలి ఉన్న సహకారం","Parent B contribution":"తల్లిదండ్రుల B సహకారం","Entered monthly child budget":"నెలవారీ పిల్లల బడ్జెట్‌ను నమోదు చేసారు","Enter your household budget figures.":"మీ కుటుంబ బడ్జెట్ గణాంకాలను నమోదు చేయండి.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"బడ్జెట్ దృశ్యం లెక్కించబడింది; అర్హత కలిగిన సలహాదారుతో చట్టపరమైన బాధ్యతలను చర్చించండి.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"మొత్తాలను తనిఖీ చేయండి; క్రెడిట్ బడ్జెట్‌ను మించకూడదు.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"షేర్లు నమోదు చేయబడిన రెండు ఆదాయాలకు అనులోమానుపాతంలో ఉంటాయి; డైరెక్ట్-కాస్ట్ క్రెడిట్ మొదట తీసివేయబడుతుంది.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"బ్రౌజర్ హైఫనేషన్ ప్రివ్యూ","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"వర్డ్ హైఫనేషన్ ప్రివ్యూ — బ్రౌజర్ భాషా నమూనాలు","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"మీరు అందించే టెక్స్ట్ కోసం బ్రౌజర్ హైఫనేషన్‌ను ప్రివ్యూ చేయండి; మద్దతు బ్రౌజర్ మరియు ఇన్‌స్టాల్ చేయబడిన భాషా వనరులపై ఆధారపడి ఉంటుంది.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"మీ వచనానికి సరిపోలే భాషను ఎంచుకోండి, నమూనాను నమోదు చేయండి మరియు అందుబాటులో ఉన్న పంక్తి వెడల్పును సర్దుబాటు చేయండి.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"బ్రౌజర్ యొక్క స్థానిక CSS హైఫనేషన్‌ను ఉపయోగిస్తుంది. ఇది నిఘంటువులను కట్టదు; మద్దతు లేని బ్రౌజర్‌లు హైఫన్‌లను చూపకపోవచ్చు. వచనాన్ని కాపీ చేయడం అసలు స్పెల్లింగ్‌ను ఉంచుతుంది.","Text language (BCP 47)":"వచన భాష (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"ప్రివ్యూ వెడల్పు (అక్షరాలు)","Text to preview":"పరిదృశ్యానికి వచనం","Preview":"ప్రివ్యూ","Enter text and choose its language.":"వచనాన్ని నమోదు చేసి, దాని భాషను ఎంచుకోండి.","Preview updated.":"ప్రివ్యూ నవీకరించబడింది.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"మద్దతు ఉన్న భాష ట్యాగ్ మరియు వచనాన్ని నమోదు చేయండి.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"బ్రౌజర్ పదాలను ఎక్కడ విచ్ఛిన్నం చేయగలదో చూడటానికి ఒకే పేరాగ్రాఫ్‌ని వేర్వేరు వెడల్పులలో ప్రయత్నించండి.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"ప్రైవేట్ స్పెల్ చెక్ వర్క్‌స్పేస్","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"లోకల్ స్పెల్ చెకర్ — మీ బ్రౌజర్ డిక్షనరీని ఉపయోగించండి","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"బ్రౌజర్ యొక్క స్థానిక అక్షరక్రమ తనిఖీతో వచనాన్ని సవరించండి, భాషను ఎంచుకోండి మరియు సరిదిద్దబడిన వచనాన్ని కాపీ చేయండి.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"వచనం ఈ పేజీలో ఉంటుంది. మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో స్పెల్లింగ్ నిఘంటువు ఉన్న భాషను సెట్ చేయండి, ఆపై దాని స్పెల్లింగ్ మెనుని ఉపయోగించండి లేదా సూచనలను అండర్‌లైన్ చేయండి.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"ఈ కార్యస్థలం టెక్స్ట్ లేదా షిప్ డిక్షనరీలను అప్‌లోడ్ చేయదు. బ్రౌజర్ స్పెల్ చెక్ లభ్యత మరియు సూచనలు పరికరం, బ్రౌజర్ మరియు ఇన్‌స్టాల్ చేయబడిన నిఘంటువుపై ఆధారపడి ఉంటాయి.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"స్పెల్ చెక్ లాంగ్వేజ్ (BCP 47)","Text to check":"చెక్ చేయడానికి వచనం","Copy text":"వచనాన్ని కాపీ చేయండి","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"వచనాన్ని టైప్ చేయండి లేదా అతికించండి. సూచనల కోసం కుడి-క్లిక్ చేయండి లేదా మీ పరికర స్పెల్లింగ్ మెనుని ఉపయోగించండి.","Text copied.":"టెక్స్ట్ కాపీ చేయబడింది.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"స్వయంచాలకంగా కాపీ చేయడం సాధ్యపడలేదు; వచనాన్ని ఎంచుకోండి మరియు కాపీ చేయండి.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"సరిపోలిన నిఘంటువు లేని బ్రౌజర్ అక్షరదోషాలను గుర్తించకపోవచ్చు.","Resume Structure Checker":"స్ట్రక్చర్ చెకర్‌ని పునఃప్రారంభించండి","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS రెజ్యూమ్ చెకర్ — ఉచిత స్థానిక PDF & DOCX సమీక్ష","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో రెజ్యూమ్ టెక్స్ట్, హెడ్డింగ్‌లు, విభాగాలు, లింక్‌లు మరియు బుల్లెట్ నిర్మాణాన్ని తనిఖీ చేయండి. గణన ద్వారా ఉద్యోగ-వివరణ నిబంధనలను సరిపోల్చండి; నియామక స్కోర్ లేదా అప్‌లోడ్ లేదు.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"టెక్స్ట్-ఆధారిత రెజ్యూమ్ వాస్తవానికి ఏమి బహిర్గతం చేస్తుందో సమీక్షించండి: సంగ్రహించిన వచనం, శీర్షిక నిర్మాణం, సంప్రదింపు-ఫీల్డ్ ఉనికి, లింక్‌లు మరియు సాధారణంగా గుర్తించబడిన విభాగాలు. ఐచ్ఛికంగా పునరావృతమయ్యే ఉద్యోగ వివరణ నిబంధనలను సరిపోల్చండి.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"అనుభవం మరియు విద్య కోసం హెడ్డింగ్ 1 స్టైల్‌లతో కూడిన DOCX ఆ శీర్షికలను చూపుతుంది. ఒక PDF దాని ఎంచుకోదగిన టెక్స్ట్ నుండి తనిఖీ చేయబడింది; నిలువు వరుసలను వేరే క్రమంలో చదవవచ్చు.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX ఫైల్‌లు స్థానికంగా Office ZIP/XMLగా తనిఖీ చేయబడతాయి. వాయిదా వేసిన స్థానిక PDF.js ఇంజిన్‌తో PDFలు చదవబడతాయి. ఐచ్ఛిక ఉద్యోగ-వివరణ పోలిక ప్రతి వచనంలో ఎంచుకున్న పదాలను గణిస్తుంది; ఇది స్కోర్‌ను సృష్టించదు లేదా ఎవరినైనా నియమించాలా వద్దా అని సిఫార్సు చేయదు.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"ఇది ఫార్మాట్ మరియు టెక్స్ట్-స్ట్రక్చర్ చెక్, ATS సిమ్యులేటర్, చట్టపరమైన సమీక్ష లేదా ఇంటర్వ్యూ విజయాన్ని అంచనా వేయడం కాదు. ఎంచుకోదగిన టెక్స్ట్ లేకుండా స్కాన్ చేసిన PDFలకు ముందుగా OCR అవసరం. పాస్‌వర్డ్-రక్షిత, స్థూల-ప్రారంభించబడిన, సంతకం చేయబడిన లేదా అసాధారణంగా పెద్ద పత్రాలకు మద్దతు లేదు.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"రెస్యూమ్‌ను ఎంచుకోండి (PDF లేదా DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"మీ ఫైల్‌లు ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో ఉంటాయి మరియు అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడవు. గరిష్టంగా 20 MB; 50 పేజీల వరకు PDF. DOCX విస్తరించిన కంటెంట్ 80 MBకి పరిమితం చేయబడింది.","Optional job description":"ఐచ్ఛిక ఉద్యోగ వివరణ","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"మీకు టర్మ్-ఫ్రీక్వెన్సీ పోలిక కావాలంటే సాదా వచనాన్ని అతికించండి. మీరు విశ్లేషించాల్సిన అవసరం లేని సున్నితమైన సమాచారాన్ని చేర్చవద్దు.","Paste job-description text here…":"ఉద్యోగ-వివరణ వచనాన్ని ఇక్కడ అతికించండి...","Analyze locally":"స్థానికంగా విశ్లేషించండి","Clear files and report":"ఫైళ్లను మరియు నివేదికను క్లియర్ చేయండి","Resume review":"సమీక్షను పునఃప్రారంభించండి","File type":"ఫైల్ రకం","Extracted characters":"సంగ్రహించిన అక్షరాలు","Words counted":"పదాలు లెక్కించబడ్డాయి","Detected headings":"హెడింగ్‌లు గుర్తించబడ్డాయి","Recognized sections":"గుర్తించబడిన విభాగాలు","Hyperlinks found":"హైపర్‌లింక్‌లు కనుగొనబడ్డాయి","Bullet paragraphs":"బుల్లెట్ పేరాలు","An email address appears in the text":"టెక్స్ట్‌లో ఇమెయిల్ చిరునామా కనిపిస్తుంది","No email address pattern was detected":"ఇమెయిల్ చిరునామా నమూనా కనుగొనబడలేదు","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"టెక్స్ట్‌లో ఫోన్ నంబర్ లాంటి నమూనా కనిపిస్తుంది","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"ఫోన్ నంబర్ లాంటి నమూనా ఏదీ కనుగొనబడలేదు","Job-description terms (counts only)":"ఉద్యోగ-వివరణ నిబంధనలు (గణనలు మాత్రమే)","Term":"టర్మ్","In job text":"జాబ్ టెక్స్ట్‌లో","In resume":"రెజ్యూమ్‌లో","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"కాల గణనలను సరిపోల్చడానికి ఉద్యోగ వివరణను అతికించండి.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"స్పష్టమైన శీర్షిక శైలులు ఏవీ కనుగొనబడలేదు. PDF శీర్షికలు వచన పరిమాణం నుండి అంచనా వేయబడ్డాయి మరియు సరికాకపోవచ్చు.","Detected":"కనుగొన్నారు","Not detected":"కనుగొనబడలేదు","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"ఈ హ్యూరిస్టిక్ సాధారణ విభాగ పేర్ల యొక్క పరిమిత సెట్‌ను గుర్తిస్తుంది; ఏ విభాగాలు అవసరమో అది నిర్ణయించదు.","Profile / summary":"ప్రొఫైల్ / సారాంశం","Experience":"అనుభవం","Education":"విద్య","Skills":"నైపుణ్యాలు","Contact":"సంప్రదింపు","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"ఎంచుకోదగిన వచనం ఏదీ కనుగొనబడలేదు. స్కాన్ చేయబడిన-మాత్రమే PDFలను తనిఖీ చేయడానికి ముందు OCR అవసరం.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"ప్రారంభించడానికి PDF లేదా DOCX రెజ్యూమ్‌ని ఎంచుకోండి.","Reading the selected file locally…":"ఎంచుకున్న ఫైల్‌ని స్థానికంగా చదవడం...","Local structure review complete.":"స్థానిక నిర్మాణ సమీక్ష పూర్తయింది.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్ అవసరమైన స్థానిక పత్ర లక్షణానికి మద్దతు ఇవ్వదు.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"చెప్పబడిన స్థానిక పరిమితుల వరకు చెల్లుబాటు అయ్యే PDF లేదా ఆధునిక DOCX ఫైల్‌ను ఎంచుకోండి.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF చదవడం సాధ్యం కాలేదు. ఇది పాడై ఉండవచ్చు, గుప్తీకరించబడి ఉండవచ్చు లేదా ఎంచుకోదగిన వచనాన్ని కలిగి ఉండకపోవచ్చు.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX ప్యాకేజీని సురక్షితంగా తెరవడం లేదా చదవడం సాధ్యం కాలేదు.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"ఈ సాధనం నా రెజ్యూమ్‌ని అప్‌లోడ్ చేస్తుందా లేదా సేవ్ చేస్తుందా?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"నం. మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో అన్వయించడం మరియు విశ్లేషణ నడుస్తుంది. మీరు నివేదికను క్లియర్ చేసిన తర్వాత లేదా పేజీని విడిచిపెట్టిన తర్వాత ఫైల్ టెక్స్ట్ సర్వర్‌కు పంపబడదు లేదా అలాగే ఉంచబడుతుంది.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"ATS లేదా యజమాని నా రెజ్యూమ్‌ని అంగీకరిస్తారో లేదో అంచనా వేస్తుందా?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"నం. ఇది చదవగలిగే వచనాన్ని మరియు సాధారణ నిర్మాణాన్ని మాత్రమే తనిఖీ చేస్తుంది. నియామక వ్యవస్థలు విభిన్నంగా ఉంటాయి మరియు ఇది ATS అనుకూలత హామీ లేదా నియామక అంచనా కాదు.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"ఇది స్కాన్ చేసిన PDFని చదవగలదా?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"PDF ఎంచుకోదగిన టెక్స్ట్ లేయర్‌ని కలిగి ఉంటే మాత్రమే. ఈ చెకర్ OCR మోడల్‌లను డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయదు; స్కాన్ చేయబడిన ఇమేజ్-ఓన్లీ డాక్యుమెంట్ కోసం ముందుగా OCR సాధనాన్ని ఉపయోగించండి.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"ఉద్యోగ-వివరణ పోలిక అంటే ఏమిటి?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"ఇది సాధారణ సాధారణీకరణ తర్వాత పునరావృతమయ్యే నిబంధనల కోసం గణనలను చూపుతుంది. ఇది మీ అర్హతల సరిపోలిక శాతం, ర్యాంకింగ్, సిఫార్సు లేదా అంచనా కాదు.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"PDF DOCX కంటే తక్కువ శీర్షికలను ఎందుకు చూపుతుంది?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDFలు సాధారణంగా సెమాంటిక్ హెడ్డింగ్ స్టైల్‌లను భద్రపరచవు. చెకర్ టెక్స్ట్ పరిమాణం మరియు రీడింగ్ ఆర్డర్ నుండి ప్రముఖ పంక్తులను అంచనా వేస్తుంది, కాబట్టి నిలువు వరుసలు మరియు దృశ్య రూపకల్పన ఫలితాన్ని ప్రభావితం చేయవచ్చు.","How local resume review works":"స్థానిక పునఃప్రారంభ సమీక్ష ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","Resume checker questions":"చెకర్ ప్రశ్నలను పునఃప్రారంభించండి","Scope and limitations":"పరిధి మరియు పరిమితులు","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"స్థానిక స్వరం మరియు సహవాయిద్యం సెపరేటర్","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"వోకల్ రిమూవర్ — స్థానికంగా ప్రత్యేక గాత్రాలు మరియు సహవాయిద్యం","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో చిన్న స్టీరియో ఆడియో నమూనాను అంచనా వేయబడిన గాత్రాలు మరియు అనుబంధంగా వేరు చేయండి. ఆడియో మీ పరికరంలో ఉంటుంది; మోడల్ దాని పబ్లిక్ హోస్ట్ నుండి డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయబడింది.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"30 సెకన్ల వరకు స్టీరియో మ్యూజిక్ క్లిప్‌ను ఎంచుకోండి. మొదటి ఉపయోగంలో, బ్రౌజర్ 35.6 MB మోడల్‌ను డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేస్తుంది. ఆడియో ఫైల్ ఈ పరికరంలో ప్రాసెస్ చేయబడింది మరియు అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడదు.","What you get":"మీకు ఏమి లభిస్తుంది","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"రెండు WAV స్టెమ్‌లను పరిదృశ్యం చేసి డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయండి: అంచనా వేసిన గాత్రాలు మరియు అవశేష సహవాయిద్యం. ఫలితాలు మిక్స్‌పై ఆధారపడి ఉంటాయి మరియు కళాఖండాలను కలిగి ఉండవచ్చు.","Local processing":"స్థానిక ప్రాసెసింగ్","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"సాధనం ONNX మరియు ONNX రన్‌టైమ్ వెబ్‌కి ఎగుమతి చేయబడిన Open-Unmix UMX-HQ వోకల్స్ నెట్‌వర్క్‌ను ఉపయోగిస్తుంది. మీరు విడిగా నొక్కినప్పుడు మాత్రమే మోడల్ పొందబడుతుంది; చెల్లింపు అనుమితి API లేదా చందా ఉపయోగించబడదు. ఆడియో డీకోడ్ చేయబడింది, ప్రాసెస్ చేయబడుతుంది మరియు స్థానికంగా ఎగుమతి చేయబడుతుంది.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"ఇది స్టీరియో 44.1 kHz ప్రాసెసింగ్ మరియు 30 సెకన్ల వరకు క్లిప్‌ల కోసం అంచనా. మోనో మూలాలు స్టీరియోకి నకిలీ చేయబడ్డాయి. వాయిద్యాలు, హెవీ ఎఫెక్ట్‌లు, లైవ్ రికార్డింగ్‌లు మరియు అసాధారణ కళా ప్రక్రియలలో లోతుగా కలగలిసిన గాత్రాలు లీకేజీ లేదా కళాఖండాలను ఉత్పత్తి చేయగలవు. ఫలితాన్ని క్లీన్ మాస్టర్‌గా ఉపయోగించవద్దు. మోడల్ డౌన్‌లోడ్‌కు ఇంటర్నెట్ కనెక్షన్ అవసరం; ఆడియో ఈ పరికరం నుండి నిష్క్రమించదు.","Is my audio uploaded?":"నా ఆడియో అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడిందా?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"నం. ఎంచుకున్న ఆడియో మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో డీకోడ్ చేయబడింది మరియు ప్రాసెస్ చేయబడింది. మీరు విభజనను ప్రారంభించినప్పుడు మోడల్ డౌన్‌లోడ్ మాత్రమే నెట్‌వర్క్ అభ్యర్థన.","Why is the first run slow?":"మొదటి పరుగు ఎందుకు నెమ్మదిగా ఉంది?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"బ్రౌజర్ 35.6 MB మోడల్‌ను ఒకసారి డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేస్తుంది; బ్రౌజర్ దానిని కాష్ చేయవచ్చు. అనుమితి పరికరం CPUలో స్థానికంగా అమలు అవుతుంది.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"ప్రతి పాట శుభ్రంగా విడిపోతుందా?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"నం. మోడల్ స్వర కాండంను అంచనా వేస్తుంది మరియు స్వర లీకేజీని వదిలివేయవచ్చు, ఇన్స్ట్రుమెంట్ హార్మోనిక్‌లను తీసివేయవచ్చు లేదా కళాఖండాలను సృష్టించవచ్చు. కాండం మీద ఆధారపడే ముందు వినండి.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"స్టీరియో ఆడియో ఫైల్ (30 సెకన్ల వరకు)","Choose audio":"ఆడియోని ఎంచుకోండి","Separate vocals":"ప్రత్యేక గాత్రాలు","Cancel / clear":"రద్దు / క్లియర్ చేయండి","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"ప్రారంభించడానికి చిన్న ఆడియో ఫైల్‌ను ఎంచుకోండి.","Downloading the separation model…":"సెపరేషన్ మోడల్‌ని డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేస్తోంది…","Separating locally…":"స్థానికంగా విడిపోతోంది…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"విభజన పూర్తయింది. స్టెమ్‌ని ప్రివ్యూ చేయండి లేదా డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయండి.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"ఈ ఫైల్‌ను ప్రాసెస్ చేయడం లేదా మోడల్‌ను లోడ్ చేయడం సాధ్యపడలేదు. ఫార్మాట్ మరియు కనెక్షన్‌ని తనిఖీ చేసి, ఆపై మళ్లీ ప్రయత్నించండి.","Model and weight license information":"మోడల్ మరియు బరువు లైసెన్స్ సమాచారం","Estimated vocals":"అంచనా వేయబడిన గాత్రాలు","Estimated accompaniment":"అంచనా వేయబడిన సహవాయిద్యం","Download WAV":"WAVని డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయండి","Progress":"ప్రగతి","Preparing local separation…":"స్థానిక విభజనను సిద్ధం చేస్తోంది…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"విభజన పూర్తయింది. ఈ పరికరంలో ఆడియో అలాగే ఉంది.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"ఈ ఆడియో ప్రాసెస్ చేయబడలేదు. 30 సెకన్లలోపు స్టీరియో మ్యూజిక్ ఫైల్‌ని ప్రయత్నించండి.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"స్విస్ హెల్త్ ఇన్సూరెన్స్ తగ్గించదగిన కంపారేటర్","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"స్విస్ హెల్త్ ఇన్సూరెన్స్ ఫ్రాంచైజ్ కాలిక్యులేటర్ — వార్షిక ఖర్చులను సరిపోల్చండి","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"మీరు నమోదు చేసే ప్రీమియంలు మరియు అర్హత కలిగిన వార్షిక వైద్య ఖర్చులను ఉపయోగించి స్విస్ ప్రాథమిక ఆరోగ్య బీమా తగ్గింపులను సరిపోల్చండి. భీమాదారు కోట్ ఊహించబడలేదు.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"ఇది అందించే ప్రతి మినహాయింపు కోసం అదే బీమా సంస్థ చూపిన నెలవారీ ప్రీమియంలను నమోదు చేయండి, ఆపై తక్కువ, ఆశించిన మరియు అధిక వార్షిక చికిత్స-ఖర్చు దృశ్యాలను సరిపోల్చండి.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"తప్పనిసరి స్విస్ ప్రాథమిక ఆరోగ్య బీమా కోసం, వయోజన స్టాండర్డ్ మినహాయించదగినది CHF 300 మరియు పిల్లల మినహాయించదగినది CHF 0. ఐచ్ఛిక స్థాయిలు వయస్సును బట్టి విభిన్నంగా ఉంటాయి. మినహాయించబడిన తర్వాత, ప్రామాణిక నిలుపుదల రుసుము అర్హత ఉన్న మిగిలిన ఖర్చులలో 10%, పెద్దలకు సంవత్సరానికి CHF 700 మరియు పిల్లలకు CHF 350. సాధనం ఈ నమూనా ధర భాగస్వామ్యానికి మీరు నమోదు చేసిన ప్రీమియంను జోడిస్తుంది; ఇది బీమా సంస్థ ధరలను పొందదు లేదా మీకు ఏ ఎంపిక సరైనదో నిర్ణయించదు.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"వయోజనుడు CHF 400 నెలవారీ ప్రీమియంతో CHF 300 తగ్గింపుతో మరియు CHF 350ని CHF 2,500 మినహాయిస్తే, వార్షిక ప్రీమియం వ్యత్యాసం CHF 600. ఆ పొదుపును మోడల్ చేసిన వ్యత్యాసాన్ని పోల్చి చూడండి. తక్కువ మొత్తంలో మరియు మీ ప్రతి అధిక మొత్తంలో షేరింగ్ చేయవచ్చు.","How the estimate works":"అంచనా ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","Common questions":"సాధారణ ప్రశ్నలు","Scope and exclusions":"స్కోప్ మరియు మినహాయింపులు","Where do I get the premiums?":"నేను ప్రీమియంలను ఎక్కడ పొందగలను?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"అదే బీమా సంస్థ, ప్రీమియం ప్రాంతం, వయస్సు సమూహం, ప్రమాద కవర్ మరియు బీమా మోడల్ కోసం ప్రస్తుత నెలవారీ ఆఫర్‌లను ఉపయోగించండి. Priminfo అనేది అధికారిక ఫెడరల్ పోలిక సైట్. ఈ పేజీ బీమా సంస్థ కోట్‌లను పొందడం లేదా పునరుత్పత్తి చేయడం లేదు.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"జాబితా చేయబడిన అన్ని మినహాయింపు స్థాయిలు ఎల్లప్పుడూ అందించబడతాయా?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"నం. బీమా సంస్థలు ప్రతి ఐచ్ఛిక స్థాయిని అందించనవసరం లేదు మరియు యువకులకు ఆఫర్‌లు మారవచ్చు. మీ స్వంత పాలసీ కోసం చూపిన ప్రీమియంలను మాత్రమే నమోదు చేయండి; అందుబాటులో లేని ఎంపికలను ఖాళీగా ఉంచండి.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"ఇది నా పూర్తి వైద్య బిల్లును చూపుతుందా?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"నం. మోడల్ అర్హత గల ఖర్చులపై సాధారణ మినహాయింపు మరియు ప్రామాణిక 10% నిలుపుదల రుసుమును కవర్ చేస్తుంది. ఇది హాస్పిటల్ డే కంట్రిబ్యూషన్‌లు, ప్రత్యేక 40% ఔషధ నిలుపుదల, మినహాయింపు సేవలు, నాన్-కవర్డ్ కేర్ మరియు సప్లిమెంటరీ ఇన్సూరెన్స్‌ను మినహాయిస్తుంది.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"ఇది దృష్టాంతంలో పోలిక, బీమా, వైద్య లేదా ఆర్థిక సలహా కాదు. ఇది మీ చికిత్స లేదా ప్రీమియంలను అంచనా వేయదు. ఇది హాస్పిటల్ డే కంట్రిబ్యూషన్‌లను మినహాయిస్తుంది (సాధారణంగా ఇన్‌పేషెంట్ రోజుకు CHF 15, చట్టబద్ధమైన మినహాయింపులతో), నిర్దిష్ట ఔషధాలపై ప్రత్యేక 40% నిలుపుదల, ప్రసూతి/నివారణ మినహాయింపులు, తప్పనిసరి కవర్ వెలుపల సేవలు, ప్రీమియం సబ్సిడీలు మరియు అనుబంధ బీమా. కాబట్టి వాస్తవ సహ-చెల్లింపు భిన్నంగా ఉండవచ్చు. అధిక మినహాయింపు అంటే మీరు సంరక్షణను పొందినట్లయితే మీరు మరింత ముందస్తుగా చెల్లించగలగాలి.","Who is insured under this policy?":"ఈ పాలసీ కింద ఎవరు బీమా చేయబడ్డారు?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"పెద్దలు (వయస్సు 19 లేదా అంతకంటే ఎక్కువ)","Child (under 18)":"పిల్లలు (18 ఏళ్లలోపు)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"తక్కువ వార్షిక అర్హత చికిత్స-ధర దృశ్యం (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"అంచనా వార్షిక అర్హత చికిత్స ఖర్చులు (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"అధిక వార్షిక అర్హత చికిత్స-ఖర్చు దృశ్యం (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"ఒక బీమా సంస్థ నుండి నెలవారీ ప్రీమియంలు","Monthly premium":"నెలవారీ ప్రీమియం","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"ఇదే విధానానికి అందించే ఎంపికలను మాత్రమే నమోదు చేయండి. ఇతరులను ఖాళీగా వదలండి.","Adult deductible choices":"పెద్దల మినహాయించదగిన ఎంపికలు","Child deductible choices":"పిల్లల మినహాయింపు ఎంపికలు","Compare annual costs":"వార్షిక ఖర్చులను సరిపోల్చండి","Clear entries":"ఎంట్రీలను క్లియర్ చేయండి","Download CSV":"CSVని డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయండి","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"అంచనా వేయబడిన వార్షిక ప్రీమియం మరియు ఖర్చు భాగస్వామ్యం","Deductible":"తగ్గించదగినది","Annual premiums":"వార్షిక ప్రీమియంలు","Total at low costs":"తక్కువ ఖర్చులతో మొత్తం","Total at expected costs":"అంచనా ఖర్చులతో మొత్తం","Total at high costs":"అధిక ఖర్చులతో మొత్తం","Cost sharing at low costs":"తక్కువ ఖర్చులతో ఖర్చు భాగస్వామ్యం","Cost sharing at expected costs":"అంచనా ఖర్చుల వద్ద ఖర్చు భాగస్వామ్యం","Cost sharing at high costs":"అధిక ఖర్చులతో ఖర్చు భాగస్వామ్యం","Difference from lowest available deductible":"అందుబాటులో ఉన్న అత్యల్ప తగ్గింపు నుండి వ్యత్యాసం","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"ప్రీమియం పొదుపును ఉపయోగించుకునే వైద్య ఖర్చులు","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"మోడల్ చేసిన ధర-భాగస్వామ్య పరిధిలో నమోదు చేయబడిన ప్రీమియం పొదుపు రద్దు చేయబడలేదు.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"తక్కువ తగ్గింపుతో ప్రీమియం పొదుపు ఉండదు.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"నమోదు చేసిన ఎంపికలలో అత్యల్ప అంచనా మొత్తం","Scenario details":"దృష్టాంతం వివరాలు","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"కనీసం రెండు అందుబాటులో ఉన్న తగ్గింపుల కోసం మూడు ఆర్డర్ చేసిన వైద్య ఖర్చు దృశ్యాలు మరియు నెలవారీ ప్రీమియంలను నమోదు చేయండి.","Official rules and current premiums:":"అధికారిక నియమాలు మరియు ప్రస్తుత ప్రీమియంలు:","Federal deductible rules":"ఫెడరల్ మినహాయింపు నియమాలు","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo అధికారిక ప్రీమియం పోలిక","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో పోలిక లెక్కించబడుతుంది.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"వయస్సు సమూహం, ఆర్డర్ చేసిన ధర దృశ్యాలు మరియు కనీసం రెండు నెలవారీ ప్రీమియంలను తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Entries cleared.":"ఎంట్రీలు క్లియర్ చేయబడ్డాయి.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV స్థానికంగా డౌన్‌లోడ్ చేయబడింది.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"స్విస్ హెల్త్ ప్రీమియం తగ్గింపు కాలిక్యులేటర్","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"స్విస్ ప్రీమియం సబ్సిడీ కాలిక్యులేటర్ — మీ నికర ప్రీమియం","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"ప్రస్తుత ప్రీమియం నుండి నికర స్విస్ ఆరోగ్య బీమా ప్రీమియం మరియు మీ ఖండం ద్వారా ఇప్పటికే మంజూరు చేయబడిన నెలవారీ తగ్గింపును లెక్కించండి.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"మీ ఇన్సూరర్ లేదా కాంటోనల్ నిర్ణయం నుండి ప్రీమియం మరియు నిర్ధారించబడిన నెలవారీ తగ్గింపును నమోదు చేయండి. మీరు అర్హత కలిగి ఉన్నారో లేదో ఈ సాధనం నిర్ణయించదు.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"స్విస్ ఖండాలు ఎవరు అర్హత సాధించారు, ఎంత మద్దతు ఇవ్వబడాలి మరియు దరఖాస్తు అవసరమా అని నిర్ణయిస్తాయి. ఈ కాలిక్యులేటర్ ఒక పాలసీ ప్రీమియం నుండి ధృవీకరించబడిన నెలవారీ తగ్గింపును మాత్రమే తీసివేస్తుంది మరియు వార్షిక మొత్తాన్ని చూపుతుంది.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"నెలవారీ ప్రీమియం CHF 420 మరియు ధృవీకరించబడిన తగ్గింపు CHF 120 అయితే, అంచనా వేయబడిన నికర ప్రీమియం నెలకు CHF 300.","How the calculation works":"గణన ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"నేను అర్హత సాధించానో లేదో ఇది చెబుతుందా?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"నం. అర్హత మరియు అవార్డు మొత్తాలు నివాస ప్రాంతం ద్వారా నిర్ణయించబడతాయి. లింక్ చేయబడిన అధికారిక సమాచారాన్ని ఉపయోగించండి లేదా మండల కార్యాలయాన్ని సంప్రదించండి.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"తగ్గింపు మొత్తాన్ని నేను ఎక్కడ కనుగొనగలను?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"ప్రస్తుత నిర్ణయం లేదా మీ బీమా సంస్థ చూపిన తగ్గించిన ప్రీమియంను ఉపయోగించండి. కొన్ని ఖండాలు స్వయంచాలకంగా తగ్గింపులను మంజూరు చేస్తాయి; ఇతరులకు దరఖాస్తు అవసరం.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"ఇది ఒక పాలసీకి సంబంధించిన అంకగణితం, అర్హత లేదా ప్రయోజన నిర్ణయం కాదు. ఇది గృహ ఆదాయం, ఆస్తులు, కుటుంబ స్థితి, గడువులు, కాంటోనల్ థ్రెషోల్డ్‌లు లేదా దరఖాస్తు హక్కులను లెక్కించదు. ప్రీమియంలు మరియు అవార్డులు మారవచ్చు; వాటిని మీ బీమా సంస్థ మరియు ఖండంతో నిర్ధారించండి.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"ప్రస్తుత నెలవారీ ప్రీమియం (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"నెలవారీ తగ్గింపు ఇప్పటికే మంజూరు చేయబడింది (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"ఖండం లేదా బీమా సంస్థ నిర్ధారించిన మొత్తాన్ని నమోదు చేయండి; అంచనాను అవార్డుగా ఉపయోగించవద్దు.","Calculate net premium":"నికర ప్రీమియంను లెక్కించండి","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"ప్రస్తుత ప్రీమియం మరియు నిర్ధారించబడిన తగ్గింపును నమోదు చేయండి.","Estimated premium after reduction":"తగ్గింపు తర్వాత అంచనా వేయబడిన ప్రీమియం","Current monthly premium":"ప్రస్తుత నెలవారీ ప్రీమియం","Monthly reduction":"నెలవారీ తగ్గింపు","Estimated net monthly premium":"అంచనా వేయబడిన నికర నెలవారీ ప్రీమియం","Reduction over 12 months":"12 నెలలకు పైగా తగ్గింపు","Reduction as a share of premium":"ప్రీమియం వాటాగా తగ్గింపు","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"లెక్కింపు పూర్తయింది. మీ ఖండం మరియు బీమా సంస్థతో అవార్డు మరియు ప్రభావవంతమైన తేదీలను నిర్ధారించండి.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"తగ్గింపు నెలవారీ ప్రీమియం కంటే ఎక్కువగా లేదని తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"స్విస్ రెంట్ రిఫరెన్స్-రేట్ సినారియో కాలిక్యులేటర్","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"స్విస్ అద్దె సర్దుబాటు కాలిక్యులేటర్ — సూచన రేటు దృశ్యం","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"స్విట్జర్లాండ్ తనఖా సూచన రేటులో మార్పు నివాస నికర అద్దెను ఎలా ప్రభావితం చేస్తుందో మాత్రమే అంచనా వేయండి. ఫెడరల్ హౌసింగ్ ఆఫీస్ నుండి తాజా ధరను ఉపయోగించండి.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"మీ లీజు లేదా తాజా అద్దె నోటీసులో పేర్కొన్న సూచన రేటును ప్రస్తుత అధికారిక స్విస్ రేటుతో సరిపోల్చండి. గణన మీ పరికరంలో ఉంటుంది.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"హౌసింగ్ కోసం ఫెడరల్ ఆఫీస్ ప్రతి త్రైమాసికంలో స్విస్ అద్దె సర్దుబాట్ల కోసం ఒక తనఖా సూచన రేటును ప్రచురిస్తుంది. 0.25 శాతం-పాయింట్ పెరుగుదల సూత్రప్రాయంగా 3% అద్దె పెరుగుదలను అనుమతిస్తుంది; 0.25 పాయింట్ల తగ్గుదల సూత్రప్రాయంగా 2.91% తగ్గింపును అనుమతిస్తుంది. ఈ దృశ్యం మీరు నమోదు చేసే నికర అద్దెకు దశలవారీగా ఆ మార్పులను వర్తింపజేస్తుంది.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"CHF 3,000 నెలవారీ నికర అద్దెకు, 1.75% నుండి 1.50%కి రిఫరెన్స్ రేటు తగ్గుదల అంచనా వేసిన సూచన రేటు-మాత్రమే నెలకు 87.38 −CHF (−2.91%).","How this estimate works":"ఈ అంచనా ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","Where do I find the current rate?":"ప్రస్తుత రేటును నేను ఎక్కడ కనుగొనగలను?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"హౌసింగ్ కోసం లింక్ చేయబడిన ఫెడరల్ ఆఫీస్ పేజీని తెరిచి, ప్రస్తుతం ప్రచురించిన ధరను నమోదు చేయండి. సాధనం పాతదిగా మారే రేటును పొందుపరచదు.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"నేను అద్దె మార్పును అభ్యర్థించవచ్చో లేదో ఇది నిర్ణయిస్తుందా?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"నం. ఇది ఓరియంటేషన్ కోసం ఒక కారకాన్ని వేరు చేస్తుంది. మీ ఒప్పందం, ద్రవ్యోల్బణం, ధర మార్పులు, రిజర్వేషన్లు మరియు ఇతర చట్టపరమైన పరిస్థితులు ఫలితాన్ని మార్చగలవు.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"ఫలితంలో అనుబంధ ఖర్చులు ఉన్నాయా?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"నం. అనుబంధ ఖర్చులు మరియు ఇతర వేరియబుల్ ఛార్జీలను మినహాయించి నెలవారీ నికర అద్దెను నమోదు చేయండి.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"ఫలితం సచిత్ర సూచన-రేటు దృశ్యం, చట్టపరమైన అభిప్రాయం లేదా పూర్తి అద్దె సమీక్ష కాదు. ఇది ద్రవ్యోల్బణం, సాధారణ వ్యయ మార్పులు, మెరుగుదలలు, ఒప్పంద రిజర్వేషన్లు, ఇండెక్స్డ్ లేదా స్టెప్డ్ అద్దెలు, నోటీసు తేదీలు మరియు కాంటోనల్ విధానాన్ని మినహాయిస్తుంది. నటించే ముందు మీ లీజు మరియు అధికారిక మార్గదర్శకత్వాన్ని తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"స్విస్ రెసిడెన్షియల్ లీజులు: తనఖా-సూచన-రేటు ప్రభావం యొక్క అంచనా మాత్రమే. ఇది చట్టపరమైన నిర్ణయం లేదా పూర్తి అద్దె సమీక్ష కాదు.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"ప్రస్తుత నెలవారీ నికర అద్దె (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"మీ లీజు లేదా తాజా అద్దె నోటీసులో పేర్కొన్న సూచన రేటు (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"ప్రస్తుత అధికారిక స్విస్ సూచన రేటు (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"రిఫరెన్స్-రేట్ దృష్టాంతాన్ని లెక్కించండి","Reference-rate-only scenario":"రిఫరెన్స్-రేట్-మాత్రమే దృశ్యం","Current monthly net rent":"ప్రస్తుత నెలవారీ నికర అద్దె","Reference-rate change":"రిఫరెన్స్-రేట్ మార్పు","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"రిఫరెన్స్ రేటు నుండి అంచనా వేసిన నెలవారీ ప్రభావం","Scenario monthly net rent":"దృష్టి నెలవారీ నికర అద్దె","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"12 నెలల పాటు అదే రేటుతో వార్షిక ప్రభావం","potential increase":"సంభావ్య పెరుగుదల","potential decrease":"సంభావ్య తగ్గుదల","no reference-rate change":"రిఫరెన్స్-రేట్ మార్పు లేదు","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"అంచనా ప్రతి 0.25 శాతం-పాయింట్ పెరుగుదలకు 3% మరియు ప్రతి తగ్గుదలకు సమానమైన విలోమ తగ్గింపు వర్తిస్తుంది. ఇతర కారకాలు ఫలితాన్ని మార్చగలవు.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"ఇందులో ద్రవ్యోల్బణం, సాధారణ వ్యయ మార్పులు, మెరుగుదలలు, కాంట్రాక్ట్ రిజర్వేషన్‌లు, ఇండెక్స్ చేయబడిన లేదా దశలవారీ అద్దెలు, నోటీసు తేదీలు లేదా స్థానిక విధానపరమైన అవసరాలు ఉండవు. మీ లీజు మరియు హౌసింగ్ మార్గదర్శకత్వం కోసం ఫెడరల్ ఆఫీస్‌ను తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"తాజా అధికారిక ధర మరియు మార్గదర్శకాన్ని తనిఖీ చేయండి","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"స్విస్ ఫెడరల్ ఆఫీస్ ఫర్ హౌసింగ్ (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"ఒక దృశ్యాన్ని చూడటానికి అద్దె మరియు రెండు రేట్లు నమోదు చేయండి.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"దృష్టాంతం లెక్కించబడింది. దానిపై ఆధారపడే ముందు తేదీలు మరియు ఒప్పంద నిబంధనలను ధృవీకరించండి.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"మొత్తాలు మరియు రేట్లను తనిఖీ చేయండి. రేట్లు తప్పనిసరిగా 0% మరియు 5% మధ్య ఉండాలి మరియు 0.25-పాయింట్ దశల్లో తేడా ఉండాలి.","Inputs cleared.":"ఇన్‌పుట్‌లు క్లియర్ చేయబడ్డాయి.","Result":"ఫలితం","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"స్విస్ వెకేషన్ అక్రూవల్ ఎస్టిమేటర్","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"స్విస్ వెకేషన్ అక్రూవల్ కాలిక్యులేటర్ — ప్రొరేటెడ్ లీవ్ బ్యాలెన్స్","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"మీ కాంట్రాక్టు, పనివారం, ఉద్యోగ తేదీలు మరియు ఇప్పటికే తీసుకున్న రోజులలో వార్షిక సెలవుల నుండి స్విస్ వెకేషన్-డే బ్యాలెన్స్‌ను అంచనా వేయండి.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"మీరు నమోదు చేసే అర్హత మరియు పని షెడ్యూల్‌ని ఉపయోగించి ఒక క్యాలెండర్ సంవత్సరానికి ప్రొరేటెడ్ చెల్లింపు సెలవును అంచనా వేయండి. ఒప్పంద నిబంధనలు ఏవీ ఊహించబడలేదు.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"ఎంపిక చేసిన సంవత్సరంలో నియమించబడిన క్యాలెండర్ రోజుల ద్వారా మీ ఒప్పందంలో వార్షిక సెలవు దినాలను అంచనా వేసేవారు అంచనా వేస్తారు. పార్ట్‌టైమ్ పని కోసం, వారానికి మీ సాధారణ పని దినాలు మరియు వారాల్లో వార్షిక సెలవులను నమోదు చేయండి.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"నాలుగు వారాల సెలవు, ఐదు రోజుల పనివారం మరియు ఏడాది పొడవునా ఉపాధితో, ఇప్పటికే తీసుకున్న సెలవును తీసివేయడానికి ముందు వార్షిక అర్హత 20 పనిదినాలు.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"స్విస్ చట్టబద్ధమైన కనిష్టం ఎంత?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"ఫెడరల్ మార్గదర్శకత్వం ప్రతి సేవా సంవత్సరానికి కనీసం నాలుగు వారాలు మరియు 20 ఏళ్లు చేరని కార్మికులకు ఐదు వారాలు. ఒప్పందం లేదా సామూహిక ఒప్పందం మరిన్ని మంజూరు చేయవచ్చు.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"ఇది నా చట్టపరమైన బ్యాలెన్స్‌ని నిర్ణయిస్తుందా?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"నం. ఇది సాధారణ క్యాలెండర్-డే ప్రొరేషన్. కాంట్రాక్ట్ నిబంధనలు, వర్తించే సామూహిక నియమాలు, అర్హత లేనివి, చుట్టుముట్టే మరియు యజమాని రికార్డులు బ్యాలెన్స్‌ను మార్చగలవు.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"ఈ అంచనా చట్టపరమైన అర్హతను నిర్ణయించదు లేదా సెలవు చెల్లింపును లెక్కించదు. ఇది నిర్దిష్ట దీర్ఘకాలిక గైర్హాజరు, కాంట్రాక్ట్-నిర్దిష్ట అక్రూవల్ మరియు చుట్టుముట్టే నియమాలు, పబ్లిక్ సెలవులు, ఓవర్‌టైమ్, క్యారీ-ఓవర్ డెడ్‌లైన్‌లు మరియు వివాదాలకు తగ్గింపులను మినహాయిస్తుంది. మీ ఒప్పందాన్ని తనిఖీ చేయండి మరియు వివాదాస్పద బ్యాలెన్స్ కోసం సలహా పొందండి.","Leave year":"వదిన సంవత్సరం","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"మీ ఒప్పందంలో వార్షిక సెలవు (వారాలు)","Usual working days per week":"వారానికి సాధారణ పని రోజులు","Employment start date":"ఉపాధి ప్రారంభ తేదీ","Employment end date":"ఉపాధి ముగింపు తేదీ","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"ఈ సెలవు సంవత్సరంలో ఇప్పటికే తీసుకున్న సెలవు రోజులు","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"ఓరియంటేషన్ కోసం మాత్రమే. ఒప్పంద వార్షిక హక్కును నమోదు చేయండి; చట్టబద్ధమైన కనిష్టం సాధారణంగా నాలుగు వారాలు లేదా 20 ఏళ్లలోపు కార్మికులకు ఐదు వారాలు.","Estimate balance":"అంచనా బ్యాలెన్స్","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"బ్యాలెన్స్ అంచనా వేయడానికి మీ ఒప్పందం మరియు తేదీలను నమోదు చేయండి.","Estimated leave balance":"అంచనా వేయబడిన సెలవు బ్యాలెన్స్","Annual leave at this schedule":"ఈ షెడ్యూల్‌లో వార్షిక సెలవు","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"ఈ సెలవు సంవత్సరంలో నియమించబడిన క్యాలెండర్ రోజులు","Prorated days accrued":"ప్రామాణిక రోజులు పెరిగాయి","Days already taken":"ఇప్పటికే తీసుకున్న రోజులు","Estimated days remaining":"అంచనా వేయబడిన రోజులు మిగిలి ఉన్నాయి","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"ఇది ఉపాధి వ్యవధిలో క్యాలెండర్ రోజుల వారీగా వార్షిక సెలవును సూచిస్తుంది. యజమాని మరియు ఒప్పంద నియమాలు భిన్నంగా ఉండవచ్చు.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"అంచనా లెక్కించబడింది. మీ ఒప్పందం మరియు యజమాని రికార్డులకు వ్యతిరేకంగా దాన్ని తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"సంవత్సరం, తేదీలు, పని షెడ్యూల్ మరియు విలువలను తనిఖీ చేయండి."},"ha":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Yanayin Bayar da Aikin Yi na Swiss","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Ƙididdigar Amfanin Rashin Aikin Yi na Switzerland - Babban Yanayin","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Kididdige babban izinin yau da kullun na Swiss ta amfani da albashin inshora da ƙimar kuɗin da asusun ku ya tabbatar.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Shigar da albashin inshorar da kashi 70 ko 80% wanda asusun rashin aikin yi ya tabbatar.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Dokokin Switzerland sun saita ƙimar alawus da iyakar albashi. Asusun yana yanke shawarar cancanta, cirewa, kwanakin jira da cancanta. Kewayon kowane wata yana nuna kwanaki 20-23 da za a biya.","Example":"Misali","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5,000 a 70% kusan CHF 161.29 ne a kowace ranar mako da ake biya.","How it works":"Yadda yake aiki","Questions":"Tambayoyi","Scope and limits":"Iyaka da iyaka","Related tools":"Kayan aiki masu alaƙa","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Albashin inshora na wata-wata (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Ƙimar da aka tabbatar ta asusun","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Ƙimar","Clear":"Bayyana","Gross scenario":"Babban labari","Insured salary used":"An yi amfani da albashin inshora","Per payable weekday":"Kowace ranar mako mai biya","20-day month":"Watan kwana 20","23-day month":"Watan kwanaki 23","Official benefit rules":"Dokokin fa'ida na hukuma","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Shigar da alkalumman da aka tabbatar.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Halin da aka ƙididdige shi. Tabbatar da adadin da kuɗin ku.","Check the values.":"Duba ƙimar.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Mai tsara Sanarwa na Hayar Swiss","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Mai tsara Sanarwa na Hayar Swiss da Daftarin Wasika","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Shirya sanarwar haya daga kwanakin da sharuɗɗan kwangilar ku; rubuta wasiƙa ba tare da ɗaukar dokokin canton ba.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Bincika kowace kwanan wata tare da ƙungiyar mai gidan ku ko ƙungiyar masu haya.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Mai tsarawa yana aiki ne kawai kwanakin da lokacin da kuka bayar. Ba ya yanke shawara ko sanarwar tana aiki, lokacin da aka karɓi ta bisa doka, ko kuma kariya ta musamman ta shafi.","Contract notice period (months)":"Lokacin sanarwar kwangila (watanni)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Ranar ƙarewa ta gaba na wata (daga kwangila)","Expected receipt date":"Kwanan karɓa da ake tsammani","Your name":"Sunanka","Your address":"Adireshin ku","Landlord / agency":"Mai gida / hukuma","Recipient address":"Adireshin mai karɓa","Rental property":"Kayan haya","Place":"Wuri","Letter date":"Kwanan wata wasika","Termination of tenancy":"Ƙarshewar haya","Calculate date and draft letter":"Kididdige kwanan wata da daftarin wasiƙa","Planning date":"Kwanan shirin","Target date":"Kwanan wata manufa","Editable draft":"daftarin da za a iya gyarawa","Copy draft":"Kwafi daftarin","Enter your contract terms.":"Shigar da sharuɗɗan kwangilar ku.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Shirye shirye shirye. Tabbatar da sabawa kwangilar ku.","Check the dates and period.":"Bincika kwanakin da lokacin.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Sakamakon ya biyo bayan ranar sanarwar kwangilar da aka kawo; ba hukunci ba ne bisa doka.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Yanayin Samun Dukiyar Swiss","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Harajin Samun Dukiyar Swiss - Yanayin Yawan Shigar Mai Amfani","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Yi ƙididdige ribar kadara ta amfani da kuɗin ma'amalar ku da ƙimar haraji daga canton da ke da alhakin.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Shigar da ci gaba, farashin saye, kudaden da suka cancanta da kuka tabbatar, da ingantaccen ƙima daga ma'aunin ƙididdiga na yanki na hukuma.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Harajin dukiyar Swiss ya bambanta ta canton, lokacin riƙewa, cirewa da shari'a. Wannan kayan aikin baya samar da ƙima ko ƙayyadaddun farashi masu dacewa.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Sayar da Siyayya (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Kudin Saye (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Sauran farashin da aka tabbatar da karɓa (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Tasirin haraji daga tushen hukuma (%)","Estimate scenario":"Ƙimar yanayi","Illustrative scenario":"Halin misali","Gain entered":"Riba ya shiga","Tax at entered rate":"Haraji a ƙimar da aka shigar","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Shigar da adadi daga bayananku da tushen canton.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Halin da aka ƙididdige shi; tabbatar da shi da canton.","Check amounts and rate.":"Duba adadi da ƙima.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Babu teburin haraji na canton da aka saka; Ƙimar da kuka shigar da ku yana tafiyar da kimantawa.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Gadon Swiss da Yanayin Harajin Kyauta","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Gadon Swiss da Harajin Kyauta - Yanayin ƙimar ku","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Ƙimar adadin haraji daga keɓancewar shigar mai amfani da ƙima; dokoki sun bambanta ta canton da dangantaka.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Shigar da adadi, keɓancewa da ƙimar inganci da aka tabbatar ga mai karɓa da canton.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Dokokin Canton da dangantakar iyali na iya canza keɓancewa da ƙima. Wannan kayan aikin baya zabar dokar canton ko ƙayyade alhaki na haraji.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Gado ko adadin kyauta (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"An tabbatar da keɓancewa tare da Canton (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"An tabbatar da ƙimar inganci tare da canton (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Adadi bayan shigar da keɓancewa","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Shigar da alkalumman da aka tabbatar don shari'ar ku.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Kididdigar tana amfani da keɓancewa da ƙimar da kuka shigar kawai.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Yanayin Kasafin Kudin Tallafin Yara na Switzerland","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Kasafin Kudi na Tallafin Yara na Swiss - Bayyanar Halin Gida","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Ware kasafin kudin yara ta hanyar samun kudin shiga na iyaye bayan shigar da kiredit-farashin kai tsaye.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Yi amfani da rubuce-rubucen bukatun yaro na wata-wata, samun kuɗin shiga na kowane wata na iyaye da kowane farashi kai tsaye da kuke son ƙima.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Wannan takaddar aikin tsarawa ce kawai. Ba lambar yabo ba ce ta kula da yara ko hanyar doka; gidaje, kulawa, haraji, fa'idodi da dokar shari'a ba a tantance su ba.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Kasafin kudin yara na wata-wata da kuka rubuta (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Iyaye A akwai kuɗin shiga kowane wata (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Iyayen B suna samun kudin shiga kowane wata (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Kudin kai tsaye da iyaye A suka biya zuwa kiredit (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Kaddamar da yanayi","Illustrative allocation":"Rarraba misali","Parent A remaining contribution":"Iyaye Gudunmawar da ta rage","Parent B contribution":"Gudunmawar Iyaye B","Entered monthly child budget":"Shigar da kasafin yara na wata-wata","Enter your household budget figures.":"Shigar da alkalumman kasafin kuɗin gidan ku.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"An ƙididdige yanayin kasafin kuɗi; tattauna wajibai na shari'a tare da ƙwararren mashawarci.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Duba adadin; bashi ba zai iya wuce kasafin kuɗi ba.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Hannun jari sun yi daidai da kudaden shiga guda biyu da aka shigar; Ana rage ƙimar kuɗin kai tsaye da farko.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Duban Jigilar Burauza","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Duban Ƙarƙashin Kalma - Samfuran Harshen Burauza","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Duba saƙon mai bincike don rubutun da kuka bayar; goyan bayan ya dogara da mai lilo da kayan aikin harshe.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Zaɓi yaren da ya dace da rubutunku, shigar da samfurin kuma daidaita girman layin da ke akwai.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Yana amfani da jigon CSS na asali na mai binciken. Ba ya haɗa ƙamus; masu bincike mara tallafi ba za su iya nuna saƙa ba. Kwafi rubutun yana kiyaye ainihin rubutun.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Harshen rubutu (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Faɗin samfoti (haruffa)","Text to preview":"Rubutu don dubawa","Preview":"Dubawa","Enter text and choose its language.":"Shigar da rubutu kuma zaɓi yaren sa.","Preview updated.":"An sabunta samfoti.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Shigar da goyan bayan alamar harshe da rubutu.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Gwada sakin layi ɗaya a faɗin daban-daban don ganin inda mai lilo zai iya karya kalmomi.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Wurin Aiki na SpellCheck mai zaman kansa","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Mai duba Haruffa na gida - Yi amfani da ƙamus na Mai lilo","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Shirya rubutu tare da duban rubutun asalin mai lilo, zaɓi harshe kuma kwafi rubutun da aka gyara.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Rubutu yana tsayawa a wannan shafin. Saita yaren mai burauzar ku yana da ƙamus na haruffa don sa'an nan yi amfani da menu na rubutun rubutunsa ko ja layi shawarwari.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Wannan filin aiki baya loda rubutu ko ƙamus na jirgi. Samuwar duban kalmomin mai lilo da shawarwari sun dogara da na'urar, mai lilo da ƙamus ɗin da aka shigar.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Harshen Haɗawa (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Rubutu don dubawa","Copy text":"Kwafi rubutu","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Buga ko liƙa rubutu. Danna-dama ko amfani da menu na rubutun na'urarka don shawarwari.","Text copied.":"An kwafi rubutu.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Ba za a iya kwafi ta atomatik ba; zaɓi kuma kwafi rubutun.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Mai bincike ba tare da ƙamus ɗin da ya dace ba na iya yin alama ba daidai ba.","Resume Structure Checker":"Ci gaba da Duba Tsarin Tsarin","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Resume Checker - PDF na gida & Bita na DOCX kyauta","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Bincika ci gaba da rubutu, kanun labarai, sassan, hanyoyin haɗin gwiwa da tsarin harsashi a cikin burauzar ku. Kwatanta sharuɗɗan bayanin aiki ta ƙirga; babu maki ko upload.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Yi bitar abin da ainihin ci gaba na tushen rubutu ke fallasa: rubutun da aka ciro, tsarin taken, kasancewar filin lamba, hanyoyin haɗin gwiwa da sassan da aka fi sani. Na zaɓi kwatanta maimaita sharuɗɗan bayanin aiki.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"DOCX tare da salon Jagora na 1 don Kwarewa da Ilimi yana nuna waɗancan kanun. Ana duba PDF daga rubutun da aka zaɓa; Ana iya karanta ginshiƙai a wani tsari na daban.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"Ana duba fayilolin DOCX a gida azaman ZIP/XML Office. Ana karanta PDFs tare da injin PDF.js na gida da aka jinkirta. Kwatancen aikin zaɓi na zaɓi yana ƙirga zaɓaɓɓun sharuɗɗan a cikin kowane rubutu; baya haifar da maki ko bayar da shawarar ko za a yi hayar wani.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Wannan tsari ne da duba tsarin rubutu, ba na'urar kwaikwayo ta ATS ba, bita ta shari'a ko hasashen nasarar hira. Fayilolin da aka bincika ba tare da zaɓaɓɓun rubutu suna buƙatar OCR da farko ba. Ba a samun tallafin kalmar wucewa, macro-kunna, sa hannu ko manyan takaddun da ba a saba gani ba.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Zaɓi ci gaba (PDF ko DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Matsakaicin 20 MB; PDF har zuwa shafuka 50. DOCX da aka faɗaɗa abun ciki an rufe shi akan 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Bayanin aiki na zaɓi","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Manna rubutu bayyananne idan kuna son kwatanta mitar lokaci. Kar a haɗa da mahimman bayanai waɗanda ba kwa buƙatar tantancewa.","Paste job-description text here…":"Manna rubutun bayanin aiki a nan…","Analyze locally":"Yi nazari a gida","Clear files and report":"Share fayiloli da rahoto","Resume review":"Ci gaba da bita","File type":"Nau'in fayil","Extracted characters":"Haruffa da aka ciro","Words counted":"Kalmomi ƙidaya","Detected headings":"Abubuwan da aka gano","Recognized sections":"Sashe da aka gane","Hyperlinks found":"Hyperlinks samu","Bullet paragraphs":"sakin layi na harsashi","An email address appears in the text":"Adireshin imel yana bayyana a cikin rubutun","No email address pattern was detected":"Ba a gano tsarin adireshin imel ba","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Tsarin mai kama da lambar waya ya bayyana a cikin rubutun","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Babu wani tsari mai kama da lambar waya da aka gano","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Sharuɗɗan bayanin aiki (ƙidaya kawai)","Term":"Shafi","In job text":"A cikin rubutun aiki","In resume":"A ci gaba","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Manna bayanin aiki don kwatanta ƙidayar lokaci.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Ba a gano takamaiman salon kanun labarai ba. An kiyasta rubutun PDF daga girman rubutu kuma ƙila ba daidai ba ne.","Detected":"An Gano","Not detected":"Ba a gano shi ba","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"ba ya yanke shawarar wane sassan da ake buƙata.","Profile / summary":"Bayanan martaba / taƙaitawa","Experience":"Kwarewa","Education":"Ilimi","Skills":"Kwarewa","Contact":"Lambobi","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Ba a sami zaɓaɓɓen rubutu ba. PDFs ɗin da aka bincika-kawai suna buƙatar OCR kafin a iya duba su.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Zaɓi PDF ko DOCX ci gaba don farawa.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Karanta fayil ɗin da aka zaɓa a gida…","Local structure review complete.":"An kammala bitar tsarin gida.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Wannan mai bincike baya goyan bayan fasalin daftarin aiki na gida da ake buƙata.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Zaɓi ingantaccen PDF ko fayil na DOCX na zamani har zuwa iyakokin gida da aka bayyana.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"Ba a iya karanta PDF ɗin ba. Yana iya lalacewa, rufaffiyar ko ya ƙunshi babu zaɓaɓɓen rubutu.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Ba za a iya buɗe ko karanta fakitin DOCX lafiya ba.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Wannan kayan aikin yana lodawa ko adana ci gaba na?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"A'a. Ana gudanar da bincike da bincike a cikin burauzar ku. Ba a aika rubutun fayil ɗin zuwa uwar garken ko adanawa bayan kun share rahoton ko barin shafin.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Shin yana hasashen ko ATS ko ma'aikaci zai karɓi ci gaba na?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"A'a. Yana bincika rubutun da ake iya karantawa da tsari mai sauƙi kawai. Tsarin daukar ma'aikata ya bambanta, kuma wannan ba garantin dacewa da ATS ba ne ko hasashen ɗaukar haya.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Za a iya karanta PDF ɗin da aka bincika?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Sai kawai idan PDF ɗin yana da zaɓin rubutu mai zaɓi. Wannan mai duba baya sauke samfuran OCR; yi amfani da kayan aikin OCR da farko don takaddar hoto kawai.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Menene ma'anar kwatancen aikin?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Yana nuna ƙidaya don maimaita sharuɗɗan bayan daidaitawa mai sauƙi. Ba adadin wasa bane, matsayi, shawarwari ko kimanta cancantar ku.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Me yasa PDF ke nuna ƙarancin kanun labarai fiye da DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDFs yawanci ba sa adana salon rubutun kalmomi. Mai duba yana ƙididdige fitattun layuka daga girman rubutu da tsarin karatu, don haka ginshiƙai da ƙirar gani na iya shafar sakamakon.","How local resume review works":"Yadda sake dawowa cikin gida ke aiki","Resume checker questions":"Ci gaba da tambayoyin dubawa","Scope and limitations":"Iyaka da iyakoki","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Mai Rarraba Muryar Gida da Rakiya","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Muryar Cire - Rarrabe muryoyin murya da Rakiya a cikin gida","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Rarraba ɗan gajeren samfurin odiyon sitiriyo zuwa ƙididdigan muryoyi da rakiya a cikin burauzar ku. Audio yana tsayawa akan na'urar ku; Ana zazzage samfurin daga mai masaukin baki.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Zaɓi shirin kiɗan sitiriyo har zuwa daƙiƙa 30. A farkon amfani, mai binciken yana zazzage samfurin 35.6 MB. Ana sarrafa fayil ɗin odiyo akan wannan na'urar kuma ba a taɓa loda shi ba.","What you get":"Abin da kuke samu","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Dubawa da zazzage mai tushe na WAV guda biyu: ƙididdigan muryoyin da sauran rakiya. Sakamako ya dogara da haɗuwa kuma yana iya ƙunsar kayan tarihi.","Local processing":"sarrafa gida","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Kayan aiki yana amfani da Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocal networks wanda aka fitar zuwa ONNX da ONNX Runtime Web. Ana ɗaukar samfurin ne kawai lokacin da ka danna Raba; babu API ko biyan kuɗi da aka yi amfani da shi. Ana yanke sauti, sarrafa kuma ana fitar da shi cikin gida.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Wannan kimantawa ce don sarrafa sitiriyo 44.1 kHz da shirye-shiryen bidiyo har zuwa daƙiƙa 30. Ana kwafi tushen Mono zuwa sitiriyo. Vocals sun gauraya sosai cikin kayan kida, tasiri mai nauyi, rikodin raye-raye da nau'ikan da ba a saba gani ba na iya haifar da yoyo ko kayan tarihi. Kada kayi amfani da sakamakon a matsayin maigida mai tsabta. Zazzage samfurin yana buƙatar haɗin intanet; audio baya barin wannan na'urar.","Is my audio uploaded?":"An loda odiyo na?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"No. Zaɓaɓɓen odiyon yana yankewa kuma ana sarrafa shi a cikin burauzar ku. Buƙatun hanyar sadarwa kawai shine zazzage samfurin lokacin da kuka fara rabuwa.","Why is the first run slow?":"Me yasa farkon gudu yake jinkirin?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"browser zai iya cache shi. Inference sannan yana aiki a gida akan CPU na'urar.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Kowace waƙa za ta rabu da tsabta?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"No. Samfurin yana ƙididdige ƙarar murya kuma yana iya barin ɗigon murya, cire jituwa na kayan aiki ko ƙirƙirar kayan tarihi. Saurari kafin a dogara da tushe.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Fayil mai jiwuwa na sitiriyo (har zuwa daƙiƙa 30)","Choose audio":"Zaɓi audio","Separate vocals":"Rarraban muryoyi","Cancel / clear":"Soke / share","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Zaɓi ɗan gajeren fayil mai jiwuwa don farawa.","Downloading the separation model…":"Zazzage samfurin rabuwa…","Separating locally…":"Warewa cikin gida…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Rabuwa cikakke. Samfoti ko zazzage kowane tushe.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"An kasa aiwatar da wannan fayil ko loda samfurin. Duba tsari da haɗin kai, sannan a sake gwadawa.","Model and weight license information":"Model da bayanin lasisin nauyi","Estimated vocals":"Kiyasin muryoyin","Estimated accompaniment":"Ƙimar rakiyar","Download WAV":"Sauke WAV","Progress":"Ci gaba","Preparing local separation…":"Ana shirya rabuwar gida…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Rabuwa cikakke. Sauti ya kasance akan wannan na'urar.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Ba a iya sarrafa wannan sautin ba. Gwada fayil ɗin kiɗan sitiriyo ƙasa da daƙiƙa 30.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Inshorar Lafiya ta Swiss","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwararren Ƙwaƙwa tọn na Ƙaƙa ) - Kwatanta Kudin Shekara","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Kwatanta abubuwan da za a cire kuɗin inshorar lafiya na asali na Swiss ta amfani da ƙima da ƙimar kuɗin likita na shekara-shekara da kuka shigar. Ba a kisasance maganar mai insurer.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Shigar da ƙimar kuɗi na wata-wata wanda mai inshora ɗaya ke nunawa ga kowane abin cirewa da yake bayarwa, sa'an nan kuma kwatanta yanayin ƙarancin jiyya da ƙima da ƙima na shekara-shekara.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Don inshorar lafiya na asali na Swiss na wajibi, babban ma'auni wanda za'a iya cirewa shine CHF 300 kuma abin cirewa yaro shine CHF 0. Matakan zaɓi sun bambanta da ƙungiyar shekaru. Bayan cirewa, daidaitaccen kuɗin riƙewa shine kashi 10% na ƙimar da suka cancanta, wanda aka keɓe akan CHF 700 kowace shekara ga manya da CHF 350 na yara. Kayan aikin yana ƙara ƙimar kuɗin da kuka shigar zuwa wannan tsarin raba farashi; ba ya fitar da ƙimar inshora ko yanke shawarar wane zaɓi ya dace da ku.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Idan balagagge ya shiga CHF 400 premium kowane wata a CHF 300 deductible da CHF 350 a CHF 2,500 deductible, bambancin ƙimar shekara-shekara shine CHF 600. Kwatanta wannan tanadin tare da bambance-bambancen ƙira a cikin raba farashi a kowane ƙananan ku, tsammanin da babban adadin kuɗaɗen ku.","How the estimate works":"Yadda kimantawa ke aiki","Common questions":"Tambayoyi gama gari","Scope and exclusions":"Iyaka da keɓancewa","Where do I get the premiums?":"A ina zan sami kuɗin kuɗi?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Yi amfani da tayin kowane wata don mai inshora iri ɗaya, yanki mai ƙima, rukunin shekaru, murfin haɗari da ƙirar inshora. Priminfo shine shafin kwatancen tarayya na hukuma. Wannan shafin baya debo ko sake fitar da bayanan masu inshora.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Ana ba da duk matakan da za a cirewa koyaushe?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"A'a. Masu inshora ba dole ba ne su bayar da kowane matakin zaɓi, kuma tayin na iya bambanta ga matasa manya. Shigar da ƙimar kuɗi kawai da aka nuna don manufofin ku; bar zaɓuɓɓukan da ba su samuwa ba komai.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Wannan yana nuna cikakken lissafin likita na?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"A'a. Samfurin ya ƙunshi talakawan da ake cirewa da kuma daidaitaccen kuɗin riƙewa na kashi 10% akan farashi masu cancanta. Ya keɓance gudunmawar ranar asibiti, riƙewar magani na musamman na kashi 40%, sabis na keɓe, kulawa mara rufewa da ƙarin inshora.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Wannan kwatancen yanayi ne, ba inshora ba, shawara na likita ko na kuɗi. Ba ya annabta maganin ku ko ƙimar kuɗi. Ya keɓance gudunmawar ranar asibiti (yawanci CHF 15 a kowace rana na marasa lafiya, tare da keɓancewar doka), riƙe 40% na musamman akan wasu magunguna, keɓancewar haihuwa/haihuwa, sabis a wajen murfin dole, tallafin kuɗi da ƙarin inshora. Ainihin biyan kuɗi na iya bambanta. Mafi girman abin cirewa yana nufin kuna buƙatar samun damar biyan kuɗi gaba idan kun sami kulawa.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Wanene ke da inshora a ƙarƙashin wannan manufar?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Adult (shekaru 19 ko sama da haka)","Child (under 18)":"Yaro (kasa da 18)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Ƙananan yanayin cancantar magani-farashin yanayi (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Farashin jiyya na cancantar shekara-shekara (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Babban yanayin cancantar jiyya na shekara-shekara (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Kudaden kuɗi na wata-wata daga mai inshora ɗaya","Monthly premium":"Farashin kowane wata","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Shigar da zaɓuɓɓukan da aka bayar don wannan manufa ɗaya kawai. Bar wasu komai.","Adult deductible choices":"Zaɓuɓɓukan cirewa na manya","Child deductible choices":"Zaɓuɓɓukan cirewa yara","Compare annual costs":"Kwatanta farashin shekara","Clear entries":"Share abubuwan shigarwa","Download CSV":"Zazzage CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Kiyasta ƙimar shekara-shekara tare da raba farashi","Deductible":"Mai ragewa","Annual premiums":"Kuɗi na shekara-shekara","Total at low costs":"Jimlar a farashi mai rahusa","Total at expected costs":"Jimlar a farashin da ake tsammani","Total at high costs":"Jimlar a farashi mai yawa","Cost sharing at low costs":"Raba farashi akan farashi mai rahusa","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Raba farashi a farashin da ake tsammani","Cost sharing at high costs":"Raba farashi akan farashi mai yawa","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Bambanci daga mafi ƙasƙanci samuwan deductible","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Farashin likita inda ake amfani da tanadin ƙima","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Ba a soke ajiyar kuɗin da aka shigar a cikin kewayon raba farashi mai ƙira.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Babu ajiyar kuɗi akan mafi ƙanƙanta abin cirewa.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Mafi ƙasƙancin jimlar da ake tsammanin tsakanin zaɓuɓɓukan da aka shigar","Scenario details":"Bayanin yanayi","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Shigar da yanayin farashin magani uku da aka ba da oda da ƙimar kuɗi na wata-wata don aƙalla abubuwan cirewa biyu da ake samu.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Dokokin hukuma da ƙimar kuɗi na yanzu:","Federal deductible rules":"Dokokin cire kuɗin tarayya","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Kwatancen ƙimar ƙimar Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Kwatancen da aka ƙididdige su a cikin wannan burauzar.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Bincika ƙungiyar shekaru, yanayin farashi da aka ba da odar da aƙalla ƙima biyu na wata-wata.","Entries cleared.":"An share abubuwan shiga","CSV downloaded locally.":"An sauke CSV a gida.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Kalkuleta na Rage Kiwon Lafiyar Kiwon Lafiyar Swiss","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Kalkuleta na Tallafin Premium na Swiss - Premium Net ɗin ku","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Yi ƙididdige ƙimar kuɗin inshorar lafiya na Switzerland daga ƙimar kuɗi na yanzu da ragin wata-wata wanda yankinku ya riga ya bayar.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Shigar da ƙima kuma an tabbatar da raguwar kowane wata daga mai inshorar ku ko shawarar yanki. Wannan kayan aikin baya yanke shawara ko kun cancanci.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Cantons na Switzerland sun tantance wanda ya cancanta, nawa ake ba da tallafi da ko ana buƙatar aikace-aikacen. Wannan kalkuleta yana cire tabbataccen ragi na kowane wata daga ƙimar manufofin guda ɗaya kuma yana nuna adadin shekara.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Idan ƙimar kowane wata shine CHF 420 kuma an tabbatar da raguwar shine CHF 120, ƙimar kuɗin da aka kiyasta shine CHF 300 kowane wata.","How the calculation works":"Yadda lissafin ke aiki","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Wannan yana gaya mani ko na cancanta?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"No. Canton mazaunin ya yanke shawarar cancanta da adadin lambobin yabo. Yi amfani da bayanan hukuma mai alaƙa ko tuntuɓi ofishin canton.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"A ina zan sami ragin adadin?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Yi amfani da yanke shawara na yanzu ko ragin kuɗin da mai inshorar ku ya nuna. Wasu Canton suna ba da ragi ta atomatik; wasu suna buƙatar aikace-aikace.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Wannan lissafi ne don manufa ɗaya, ba cancanta ko shawarar fa'ida ba. Baya ƙididdige kuɗin shiga na gida, kadarori, matsayin iyali, ƙayyadaddun ƙayyadaddun ƙayyadaddun ƙayyadaddun ƙayyadaddun ƙayyadaddun ƙayyadaddun ƙaya, ko haƙƙoƙin aikace-aikace. Ƙididdigar ƙima da kyaututtuka na iya canzawa; tabbatar da su tare da mai insurer ku da canton.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Kyauta na kowane wata (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"An riga an bayar da ragin kowane wata (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Shigar da adadin da canton ko mai inshorar ya tabbatar; kar a yi amfani da kimantawa azaman kyauta.","Calculate net premium":"Ƙididdigar ƙimar kuɗi","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Shigar da ƙimar kuɗi na yanzu kuma an tabbatar da raguwa.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Ƙimar ƙima bayan raguwa","Current monthly premium":"Kimar kuɗi na wata-wata na yanzu","Monthly reduction":"Rage kowane wata","Estimated net monthly premium":"Ƙimar ƙimar kuɗi na wata-wata","Reduction over 12 months":"Rage sama da watanni 12","Reduction as a share of premium":"Ragewa azaman rabon ƙima","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Lissafi cikakke. Tabbatar da lambar yabo da tasiri mai tasiri tare da yankin ku da mai inshorar ku.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Duba cewa raguwar bai fi kimar kowane wata ba.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Binciken Hayar Swiss","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Lissafin Daidaita Hayar Swiss - Yanayin Magana","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Ƙidaya kawai yadda canji a cikin ƙimar jinginar gida na Switzerland ke shafar gidan hayar gida. Yi amfani da sabon ƙima daga ofishin gidaje na tarayya.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Kwatanta ƙimar ma'anar da aka bayyana a cikin hayar ku ko sabuwar sanarwar haya tare da ƙimar Swiss na yanzu. Lissafin yana kan na'urar ku.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Ofishin Tarayya don Gidaje yana wallafa ƙimar jinginar gida ɗaya don daidaitawar hayar Swiss kowane kwata. Ƙirar kashi 0.25 bisa ga ka'ida na iya ba da damar karuwar haya 3%; raguwar maki 0.25 na iya bisa manufa ba da damar rage 2.91%. Wannan yanayin ya shafi waɗannan canje-canje mataki-mataki zuwa gidan haya da ka shigar.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Don hayan gidan yanar gizo na CHF 3,000 na wata-wata, raguwar ƙididdigewa daga 1.75% zuwa 1.50% yana ba da kiyasin canjin tunani-kawai na kusan -CHF 87.38 a kowane wata (-2.91%).","How this estimate works":"Yadda wannan kimanta ke aiki","Where do I find the current rate?":"A ina zan sami ƙimar halin yanzu?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Bude shafi na Ofishin Tarayya don Gidaje da aka haɗa kuma shigar da ƙimar da aka buga na yanzu. Kayan aikin ba ya haɗa adadin da zai iya zama tsohon zamani.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Shin wannan ya yanke shawarar ko zan iya neman canjin haya?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"A'a. Yana keɓance abu ɗaya don fuskantarwa. Kwangilar ku, hauhawar farashin kaya, canjin farashi, ajiyar kuɗi da sauran sharuɗɗan doka na iya canza sakamakon.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Sakamakon ya haɗa da ƙarin farashi?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"No. Shigar da hayar gidan yanar gizo na wata-wata, ban da ƙarin farashin kuɗi da sauran ƙarin caji.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Sakamakon shi ne misali-ƙididdigar ƙima, ba ra'ayi na doka ba ko cikakken bita na haya. Ya ƙunshi hauhawar farashin kaya, sauye-sauyen farashi na gabaɗaya, haɓakawa, ajiyar kwangila, ƙididdiga ko hayar hayar hayar, kwanakin sanarwa da tsarin kantonal. Bincika hayar ku da jagorar hukuma kafin yin aiki.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Gidajen zama na Switzerland: kimanta tasirin-ƙididdigar jinginar gida kawai. Ba hukunci ba ne na doka ko cikakken bita na haya.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Hayar gidan yanar gizo na kowane wata (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Ƙididdigar ƙididdiga da aka bayyana a cikin hayar ku ko sabuwar sanarwar haya (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Kimar magana ta Swiss na yanzu (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Kididdige yanayin ƙimar tunani","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Yanayin-ƙididdigar ƙididdiga kawai","Current monthly net rent":"Hayar gidan yanar gizo na kowane wata","Reference-rate change":"Canjin ƙididdigewa","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Ƙimar tasirin kowane wata daga ƙimar tunani","Scenario monthly net rent":"Hayar gidan yanar gizo na wata-wata","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Tasirin shekara-shekara na watanni 12 a daidai wannan ƙimar","potential increase":"haɓaka mai yuwuwar","potential decrease":"yuwuwar raguwa","no reference-rate change":"babu wani canji-yawan canji","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Ƙididdiga ta shafi 3% don kowane karuwar kashi 0.25 da kuma raguwar juzu'i na kowane raguwa. Wasu dalilai na iya canza sakamakon.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Wannan baya haɗa da hauhawar farashin kaya, canjin farashi na gabaɗaya, haɓakawa, ajiyar kwangila, ƙididdiga ko hayar hayar hayar, kwanakin sanarwa, ko buƙatun tsarin gida. Bincika hayar ku da Ofishin Tarayya don jagorar Gidaje.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Bincika sabon ƙimar hukuma da jagora","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Ofishin Tarayyar Swiss don Gidaje (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Shigar da haya da farashin duka don ganin yanayi.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"An ƙididdige yanayin. Tabbatar da kwanakin da sharuɗɗan kwangila kafin dogara da shi.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Bincika adadi da ƙima. Dole ne ƙimar kuɗi ta kasance tsakanin 0% da 5% kuma ta bambanta cikin matakan maki 0.25.","Inputs cleared.":"An share abubuwan shigarwa.","Result":"Sakamako","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Ƙimar Hutu ta Swiss","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Ƙididdigar Ƙirar Hutu ta Swiss - Ma'aunin Ma'auni na Ƙira","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Yi ƙididdige ma'auni na ranar hutu na Swiss daga hutun shekara-shekara a cikin kwangilar ku, satin aiki, kwanakin aiki da kwanakin da aka riga aka ɗauka.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. Babu sharuɗɗan kwangila da aka yi hasashe.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Mai ƙididdigewa yana haɓaka kwanakin hutun shekara-shekara a cikin kwangilar ku ta kwanakin kalanda da aka yi aiki a cikin shekarar da aka zaɓa. Don aikin ɗan lokaci, shigar da kwanakin aiki na yau da kullun a kowane mako da hutun shekara a cikin makonni.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Tare da makonni huɗu na hutu, satin aiki na kwana biyar da aiki a duk shekara, haƙƙin shekara shine kwanaki 20 na aiki kafin cire izinin da aka riga aka ɗauka.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Menene mafi ƙarancin ƙa'idar Swiss?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Jagorar Tarayya ta faɗi aƙalla makonni huɗu a kowace shekara ta hidima, da makonni biyar ga ma'aikatan da ba su kai shekaru 20 ba. Kwangila ko yarjejeniya na gama gari na iya ba da ƙarin.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Shin wannan ya yanke shawarar ma'auni na na doka?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"No. Yana da sauƙaƙan adadin kalanda-rana. Sharuɗɗan kwangila, ƙa'idodin gama kai masu aiki, rashin cancantar shiga, zagaye da bayanan ma'aikata na iya canza ma'auni.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Wannan ƙiyasin baya yanke shawarar haƙƙin doka ko lissafin biyan biki. Ya kebance ragi ga wasu tsawaita rashi, ƙayyadaddun ƙayyadaddun ƙayyadaddun kwangila da ƙa'idojin zagaye, bukukuwan jama'a, ƙarin lokacin aiki, ɗaukar lokaci da jayayya. Bincika kwangilar ku kuma sami shawara don ma'auni mai hamayya.","Leave year":"Shekarar Bari","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"hutun shekara a cikin kwangilar ku (makonni)","Usual working days per week":"Kwanakin aiki na yau da kullun kowane mako","Employment start date":"Ranar fara aiki","Employment end date":"Ƙarshen ranar aiki","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Bar kwanakin da aka riga aka ɗauka a cikin wannan shekarar hutun","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Don daidaitawa kawai. Shigar da haƙƙin kwangilar shekara-shekara; Mafi qarancin doka shine gabaɗaya makonni huɗu, ko makonni biyar ga ma’aikatan da basu kai 20 ba.","Estimate balance":"Ƙimar ma'auni","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Shigar da kwangilar ku da kwanan wata don kimanta ma'auni.","Estimated leave balance":"Ƙimar ma'aunin izini","Annual leave at this schedule":"hutun shekara a wannan jadawalin","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Kwanakin kalanda da aka yi aiki a cikin wannan shekarar hutu","Prorated days accrued":"Kwanakin da aka ƙima sun tara","Days already taken":"An riga an ɗauka kwanaki","Estimated days remaining":"Kimanin kwanaki da suka rage","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Wannan yana haɓaka izinin shekara-shekara ta kwanakin kalanda a cikin lokacin aiki. Dokokin ma'aikata da na kwangila na iya bambanta.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Ƙimar ƙididdiga. Bincika shi akan kwangilar ku da bayanan ma'aikata.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Bincika shekara, kwanakin, jadawalin aiki da ƙima."},"tl":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Tantyahin ang kabuuang Swiss daily allowance gamit ang insured na suweldo at rate na kinumpirma ng iyong pondo.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Ilagay ang insured na suweldo at 70% o 80% rate na kinumpirma ng iyong unemployment fund.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Itinakda ng mga panuntunan ng Switzerland ang allowance rate at salary cap. Ang pondo ang nagpapasya sa pagiging karapat-dapat, mga pagbabawas, mga araw ng paghihintay at karapatan. Ang buwanang hanay ay sumasalamin sa 20–23 na babayarang mga karaniwang araw.","Example":"Halimbawa\nAng","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5,000 sa 70% ay humigit-kumulang CHF 161.29 bawat babayarang weekday.","How it works":"Paano ito gumagana","Questions":"Mga Tanong","Scope and limits":"Saklaw at limitasyon","Related tools":"Mga kaugnay na tool","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Buwanang suweldong nakaseguro (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Rate na kinumpirma ng pondo","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"Tantyahin","Clear":"Malinaw","Gross scenario":"Gross na senaryo","Insured salary used":"Ginamit na suweldong nakaseguro","Per payable weekday":"Bawat babayarang araw ng linggo","20-day month":"20 araw na buwan","23-day month":"23 araw na buwan","Official benefit rules":"Opisyal na mga panuntunan sa benepisyo","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Ilagay ang iyong mga nakumpirmang numero.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Kinakalkula ang sitwasyon. Kumpirmahin ang mga halaga gamit ang iyong pondo.","Check the values.":"Suriin ang mga halaga.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Swiss Rental Notice Planner at Letter Draft","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Magplano ng paunawa sa pangungupahan mula sa mga petsa at tuntunin sa sarili mong kontrata; bumalangkas ng isang liham nang hindi ipinapalagay ang mga panuntunan ng canton.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Ilagay ang panahon ng paunawa, ang susunod na wastong araw ng pagwawakas sa iyong kontrata, at petsa ng pagtanggap. Tingnan ang bawat petsa sa iyong kasero o samahan ng mga nangungupahan.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Inilalapat lang ng tagaplano ang mga petsa at panahon na ibinibigay mo. Hindi ito nagpapasya kung wasto ang paunawa, kapag ito ay legal na natanggap, o kung may espesyal na proteksyon ang nalalapat.","Contract notice period (months)":"Panahon ng abiso sa kontrata (mga buwan)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Susunod na wastong araw ng pagtatapos ng buwan (mula sa kontrata)","Expected receipt date":"Inaasahang petsa ng pagtanggap","Your name":"Ang iyong pangalan","Your address":"Ang iyong address","Landlord / agency":"Nagpapaupa / ahensya","Recipient address":"Address ng tatanggap","Rental property":"Rental property","Place":"Lugar","Letter date":"Petsa ng sulat","Termination of tenancy":"Pagwawakas ng pangungupahan","Calculate date and draft letter":"Kalkulahin ang petsa at draft na liham","Planning date":"Petsa ng pagpaplano","Target date":"Target na petsa","Editable draft":"Nae-edit na draft","Copy draft":"Kopyahin ang draft","Enter your contract terms.":"Ilagay ang iyong mga tuntunin sa kontrata.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Handa na ang draft ng pagpaplano. I-verify laban sa iyong kontrata.","Check the dates and period.":"Tingnan ang mga petsa at panahon.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Ang resulta ay sumusunod sa ibinigay na araw ng paunawa sa kontrata; ito ay hindi ayon sa batas na pagpapasya.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Sitwasyon ng Pagkuha ng Ari-arian ng Switzerland","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Tantyahin ang kita ng ari-arian gamit ang sarili mong mga gastos sa transaksyon at rate ng buwis mula sa responsableng canton.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Ipasok ang mga nalikom, gastos sa pagkuha, mga karapat-dapat na gastos na iyong nakumpirma, at isang epektibong rate mula sa opisyal na cantonal calculator.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Swiss property gains tax ay nag-iiba ayon sa canton, holding period, deductions at case. Ang tool na ito ay hindi nagbibigay ng mga rate o tinutukoy ang mga tinatanggap na gastos.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Mga nalikom sa benta (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Gastos sa pagkuha (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Iba pang mga gastos na nakumpirmang tinatanggap (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Epektibong rate ng buwis mula sa opisyal na pinagmulan (%)","Estimate scenario":"Tantyahin ang senaryo","Illustrative scenario":"Mapaglarawang senaryo","Gain entered":"Pumasok ang pakinabang","Tax at entered rate":"Buwis sa inilagay na rate","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Maglagay ng mga numero mula sa iyong mga talaan at canton source.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Kinakalkula ang sitwasyon; i-verify ito sa canton.","Check amounts and rate.":"Suriin ang mga halaga at rate.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Walang canton tax table ang naka-embed; ang iyong ipinasok na epektibong rate ay nagtutulak sa pagtatantya.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Swiss Inheritance at Gift Tax Scenario","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Swiss Inheritance at Gift Tax — Ang Iyong Rate Scenario","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Tantyahin ang halagang nabubuwisan mula sa exemption at rate na inilagay ng user; Ang mga patakaran ay nag-iiba ayon sa canton at relasyon.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Maglagay ng halaga, exemption at epektibong rate na nakumpirma para sa tatanggap at canton.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Maaaring baguhin ng mga panuntunan ng Canton at relasyon ng pamilya ang mga exemption at rate. Ang tool na ito ay hindi pumipili ng panuntunan ng canton o tinutukoy ang pananagutan sa buwis.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Halaga ng mana o regalo (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Nakumpirma ang pagbubukod sa canton (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Nakumpirma ang epektibong rate sa canton (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Halaga pagkatapos maipasok ang exemption","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Maglagay ng mga numerong nakumpirma para sa iyong kaso.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Ginagamit lang ng pagtatantya ang exemption at rate na iyong inilagay.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Maglaan ng inilagay na badyet ng bata ayon sa kita ng magulang pagkatapos ng inilagay na direktang gastos na kredito.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Gamitin ang mga nakadokumentong buwanang pangangailangan ng bata, ang mga available na buwanang kita ng parehong magulang at anumang direktang gastos na gusto mong i-credit.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Ito ay isang planning worksheet lamang. Ito ay hindi isang Swiss child-maintenance award o legal na paraan; pabahay, pangangalaga, buwis, benepisyo at batas ng kaso ay hindi tinasa.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Buwanang badyet ng bata na iyong naidokumento (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Magulang A na available na buwanang kita (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Available na buwanang kita (CHF) ng Magulang B","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Mga direktang gastos sa bata na binayaran ng Magulang A sa credit (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Maglaan ng senaryo","Illustrative allocation":"Mapaglarawang paglalaan","Parent A remaining contribution":"Magulang A ang natitirang kontribusyon","Parent B contribution":"Kontribusyon ng Magulang B","Entered monthly child budget":"Inilagay ang buwanang badyet ng bata","Enter your household budget figures.":"Ilagay ang mga numero ng badyet ng iyong sambahayan.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Kinakalkula ang senaryo ng badyet; talakayin ang mga legal na obligasyon sa isang kwalipikadong tagapayo.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Suriin ang mga halaga; ang kredito ay hindi maaaring lumampas sa badyet.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Ang mga pagbabahagi ay proporsyonal sa dalawang inilagay na kita; ang direktang gastos na kredito ay ibawas muna.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Preview ng Hyphenation ng Browser","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Preview ng Word Hyphenation — Mga Pattern ng Wika ng Browser","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"I-preview ang hyphenation ng browser para sa tekstong ibibigay mo; nakadepende ang suporta sa browser at naka-install na mapagkukunan ng wika.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Piliin ang wikang tumutugma sa iyong teksto, maglagay ng sample at isaayos ang magagamit na lapad ng linya.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Gumagamit ng katutubong CSS hyphenation ng browser. Hindi ito nagsasama ng mga diksyunaryo; ang mga hindi sinusuportahang browser ay maaaring magpakita ng walang mga gitling. Ang pagkopya ng teksto ay nagpapanatili ng orihinal na spelling.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Wika ng text (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Preview na lapad (mga character)","Text to preview":"Text na i-preview","Preview":"Preview","Enter text and choose its language.":"Maglagay ng text at piliin ang wika nito.","Preview updated.":"Na-update ang preview.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Magpasok ng suportadong tag ng wika at text.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Subukan ang parehong talata sa iba't ibang lapad upang makita kung saan maaaring masira ng browser ang mga salita.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Pribadong Spellcheck Workspace","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Lokal na Spell Checker — Gamitin ang Iyong Browser Dictionary","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"I-edit ang text gamit ang native na spellcheck ng browser, pumili ng wika at kopyahin ang naitama na text.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Nananatili ang teksto sa pahinang ito. Magtakda ng wika kung saan mayroong spelling dictionary ang iyong browser, pagkatapos ay gamitin ang spelling menu nito o salungguhitan ang mga mungkahi.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Hindi nag-a-upload ng text o nagpapadala ng mga diksyunaryo ang workspace na ito. Nakadepende ang availability at mga suhestiyon ng spellcheck ng browser sa device, browser at naka-install na diksyunaryo.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Spellcheck language (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Tekstong susuriin","Copy text":"Kopyahin ang text","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Mag-type o mag-paste ng text. I-right-click o gamitin ang menu ng spelling ng iyong device para sa mga mungkahi.","Text copied.":"Nakopya ang text.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Hindi awtomatikong makopya; piliin at kopyahin ang teksto.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"Ang isang browser na walang katugmang diksyunaryo ay maaaring hindi markahan ang mga maling spelling.","Resume Structure Checker":"Resume Structure Checker","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Resume Checker — Libreng Lokal na Pagsusuri ng PDF at DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Suriin ang resume text, heading, seksyon, link at bullet structure sa iyong browser. Ihambing ang mga termino para sa paglalarawan ng trabaho ayon sa bilang; walang hiring score o upload.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Suriin kung ano talaga ang inilalantad ng isang resume na nakabatay sa teksto: na-extract na text, istraktura ng heading, presensya sa contact-field, mga link at mga karaniwang kinikilalang seksyon. Opsyonal na ihambing ang mga termino para sa paglalarawan ng trabaho.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"Isang DOCX na may Heading 1 na mga istilo para sa Karanasan at Edukasyon ay nagpapakita ng mga heading na iyon. Sinusuri ang isang PDF mula sa mapipiling teksto nito; maaaring basahin ang mga column sa ibang pagkakasunod-sunod.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX file ay lokal na siniyasat bilang Office ZIP/XML. Binabasa ang mga PDF gamit ang isang ipinagpaliban na lokal na PDF.js engine. Ang opsyonal na paghahambing sa paglalarawan ng trabaho ay binibilang ang mga napiling termino sa bawat teksto; hindi ito lumilikha ng marka o nagrerekomenda kung kukuha ng isang tao.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Ito ay isang format at text-structure check, hindi isang ATS simulator, legal na pagsusuri o hula ng tagumpay sa panayam. Ang mga na-scan na PDF na walang mapipiling text ay kailangan muna ng OCR. Pinoprotektahan ng password, macro-enabled, nilagdaan o hindi karaniwang malalaking dokumento ay hindi suportado.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Pumili ng resume (PDF o DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Nananatili ang iyong mga file sa browser na ito at hindi ina-upload. Pinakamataas na 20 MB; PDF hanggang 50 na pahina. Ang pinalawak na nilalaman ng DOCX ay nilimitahan sa 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Opsyonal na paglalarawan ng trabaho","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"I-paste ang plain text kung gusto mo ng paghahambing ng term-frequency. Huwag isama ang sensitibong impormasyon na hindi mo kailangang suriin.","Paste job-description text here…":"I-paste ang teksto ng paglalarawan ng trabaho dito...","Analyze locally":"Pagsusuri nang lokal","Clear files and report":"I-clear ang mga file at ulat","Resume review":"Ipagpatuloy ang pagsusuri","File type":"Uri ng file","Extracted characters":"Mga na-extract na character","Words counted":"Bilang mga salita","Detected headings":"Mga nakitang heading","Recognized sections":"Mga kinikilalang seksyon","Hyperlinks found":"May nakitang mga hyperlink","Bullet paragraphs":"Mga talata ng bala","An email address appears in the text":"Lumalabas ang isang email address sa text","No email address pattern was detected":"Walang natukoy na pattern ng email address","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Lumalabas sa text ang isang pattern na tulad ng numero ng telepono","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Walang nakitang pattern na tulad ng numero ng telepono","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Mga tuntunin sa paglalarawan ng trabaho (bilang lamang)","Term":"Termino","In job text":"Sa text ng trabaho","In resume":"Sa resume","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Mag-paste ng paglalarawan ng trabaho upang ihambing ang mga bilang ng termino.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Walang malinaw na istilo ng heading ang nakita. Ang mga PDF heading ay tinatantya mula sa laki ng teksto at maaaring hindi tumpak.","Detected":"Natukoy","Not detected":"Hindi natukoy","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Kinikilala ng heuristic na ito ang isang limitadong hanay ng mga karaniwang pangalan ng seksyon; hindi ito nagpapasya kung aling mga seksyon ang kinakailangan.","Profile / summary":"Profile / buod","Experience":"Karanasan","Education":"Edukasyon","Skills":"Mga Kasanayan","Contact":"Makipag-ugnayan","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Walang nahanap na mapipiling text. Ang mga naka-scan na PDF lang ay nangangailangan ng OCR bago sila masuri.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Pumili ng PDF o DOCX resume para magsimula.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Binabasa ang napiling file nang lokal...","Local structure review complete.":"Kumpleto na ang pagsusuri sa lokal na istraktura.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Hindi sinusuportahan ng browser na ito ang kinakailangang tampok na lokal na dokumento.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Pumili ng wastong PDF o modernong DOCX file hanggang sa nakasaad na mga lokal na limitasyon.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"Hindi mabasa ang PDF. Ito ay maaaring masira, ma-encrypt o maglaman ng walang mapipiling teksto.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"Hindi ligtas na mabuksan o mabasa ang DOCX package.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"In-upload o sine-save ba ng tool na ito ang aking resume?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Hindi. Ang pag-parse at pagsusuri ay tumatakbo sa iyong browser. Ang teksto ng file ay hindi ipinadala sa isang server o pinananatili pagkatapos mong i-clear ang ulat o umalis sa pahina.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Nahuhulaan ba nito kung tatanggapin ng isang ATS o employer ang aking resume?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Hindi. Sinusuri nito ang nababasang teksto at simpleng istraktura lamang. Magkaiba ang mga sistema ng pag-hire, at hindi ito isang garantiya sa pagiging tugma ng ATS o hula sa pag-hire.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Nakakabasa ba ito ng na-scan na PDF?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Lamang kung ang PDF ay may mapipiling text layer. Ang checker na ito ay hindi nagda-download ng mga modelo ng OCR; gumamit muna ng OCR tool para sa isang na-scan na dokumentong imahe lamang.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Ano ang ibig sabihin ng paghahambing sa paglalarawan ng trabaho?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Ito ay nagpapakita ng mga bilang para sa mga umuulit na termino pagkatapos ng simpleng normalisasyon. Ito ay hindi isang porsyento ng tugma, ranggo, rekomendasyon o pagtatasa ng iyong mga kwalipikasyon.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Bakit nagpapakita ang isang PDF ng mas kaunting mga heading kaysa sa isang DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"Karaniwang hindi pinapanatili ng mga PDF ang mga istilo ng semantic na heading. Tinatantya ng checker ang mga kilalang linya mula sa laki ng teksto at pagkakasunud-sunod ng pagbabasa, kaya maaaring makaapekto ang mga column at visual na disenyo sa resulta.","How local resume review works":"Paano gumagana ang pagsusuri sa lokal na resume","Resume checker questions":"Ipagpatuloy ang mga tanong sa checker","Scope and limitations":"Saklaw at limitasyon","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Lokal na Vocal at Accompaniment Separator","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Vocal Remover — Lokal na Paghiwalayin ang Mga Bokal at Saliw","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Paghiwalayin ang isang maikling stereo audio sample sa mga tinantyang vocal at accompaniment sa iyong browser. Nananatili ang audio sa iyong device; ang modelo ay dina-download mula sa pampublikong host nito.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Pumili ng stereo music clip hanggang 30 segundo. Sa unang paggamit, nagda-download ang browser ng 35.6 MB na modelo. Ang audio file ay pinoproseso sa device na ito at hindi kailanman ina-upload.","What you get":"Ano ang makukuha mo","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"I-preview at i-download ang dalawang WAV stem: tinantyang vocal at ang natitirang saliw. Ang mga resulta ay nakasalalay sa halo at maaaring naglalaman ng mga artifact.","Local processing":"Lokal na pagpoproseso","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Ginagamit ng tool ang Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network na na-export sa ONNX at ONNX Runtime Web. Kinukuha lang ang modelo kapag pinindot mo ang Separate; walang bayad na hinuha na API o subscription ang ginagamit. Ang audio ay na-decode, pinoproseso at na-export nang lokal.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Ito ay isang pagtatantya para sa pagpoproseso ng stereo 44.1 kHz at mga clip hanggang 30 segundo. Ang mga mono source ay nadoble sa stereo. Ang mga boses na hinaluan nang malalim sa mga instrumento, mabibigat na epekto, live na pag-record at hindi pangkaraniwang genre ay maaaring makagawa ng pagtagas o mga artifact. Huwag gamitin ang resulta bilang isang malinis na master. Ang pag-download ng modelo ay nangangailangan ng koneksyon sa internet; hindi umaalis ang audio sa device na ito.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Na-upload ba ang aking audio?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Hindi. Ang napiling audio ay na-decode at pinoproseso sa iyong browser. Ang tanging kahilingan sa network ay ang pag-download ng modelo kapag sinimulan mo ang paghihiwalay.","Why is the first run slow?":"Bakit mabagal ang unang pagtakbo?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Nagda-download ang browser ng 35.6 MB na modelo nang isang beses; maaaring i-cache ito ng browser. Ang hinuha ay tumatakbo nang lokal sa CPU ng device.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Maghihiwalay ba nang malinis ang bawat kanta?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Hindi. Tinatantya ng modelo ang isang vocal stem at maaaring mag-iwan ng vocal leakage, alisin ang mga harmonic ng instrumento o lumikha ng mga artifact. Makinig bago umasa sa isang tangkay.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Stereo audio file (hanggang 30 segundo)","Choose audio":"Pumili ng audio","Separate vocals":"Hiwalay na vocal","Cancel / clear":"Kanselahin / i-clear","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Pumili ng maikling audio file para magsimula.","Downloading the separation model…":"Dina-download ang modelo ng paghihiwalay...","Separating locally…":"Lokal na naghihiwalay...","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Kumpleto na ang paghihiwalay. I-preview o i-download ang alinman sa stem.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Hindi maproseso ang file na ito o mai-load ang modelo. Suriin ang format at koneksyon, pagkatapos ay subukang muli.","Model and weight license information":"Impormasyon ng lisensya ng modelo at timbang","Estimated vocals":"Tinantyang vocal","Estimated accompaniment":"Tinantyang saliw","Download WAV":"I-download ang WAV","Progress":"Progreso","Preparing local separation…":"Inihahanda ang lokal na paghihiwalay...","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Kumpleto na ang paghihiwalay. Nanatili ang audio sa device na ito.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Hindi maproseso ang audio na ito. Subukan ang isang stereo music file sa ilalim ng 30 segundo.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Paghambingin ang Mga Taunang Gastos","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Ihambing ang Swiss basic health insurance deductible gamit ang mga premium at karapat-dapat na taunang gastos sa medikal na inilagay mo. Walang quote ng insurer ang nahulaan.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Ilagay ang buwanang mga premium na ipinapakita ng parehong insurer para sa bawat deductible na inaalok nito, pagkatapos ay ihambing ang mababa, inaasahan at mataas na taunang mga senaryo sa gastos sa paggamot.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"Para sa compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, ang pang-adultong standard na deductible ay CHF 300 at ang child deductible ay CHF 0. Iba-iba ang mga opsyonal na antas ayon sa pangkat ng edad. Pagkatapos ng deductible, ang karaniwang bayad sa pagpapanatili ay 10% ng mga karapat-dapat na natitirang gastos, na nililimitahan sa CHF 700 bawat taon para sa mga matatanda at CHF 350 para sa mga bata. Idinaragdag ng tool ang iyong ipinasok na premium sa modelong pagbabahagi ng gastos na ito; hindi ito kumukuha ng mga rate ng insurer o nagpapasya kung aling opsyon ang tama para sa iyo.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Kung ang isang nasa hustong gulang ay nagpasok ng CHF 400 buwanang premium sa CHF 300 na deductible at CHF 350 sa isang CHF 2,500 na deductible, ang taunang pagkakaiba sa premium ay CHF 600. Ihambing ang pagtitipid na iyon sa modelong pagkakaiba sa pagbabahagi ng gastos sa bawat isa sa iyong mababa, inaasahan at mataas na halaga ng karapat-dapat na halaga.","How the estimate works":"Paano gumagana ang pagtatantya","Common questions":"Mga karaniwang tanong","Scope and exclusions":"Saklaw at mga pagbubukod","Where do I get the premiums?":"Saan ko kukunin ang mga premium?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Gumamit ng mga kasalukuyang buwanang alok para sa parehong insurer, premium na rehiyon, pangkat ng edad, saklaw ng aksidente at modelo ng insurance. Ang Priminfo ay ang opisyal na pederal na paghahambing na site. Ang page na ito ay hindi kumukuha o nagpaparami ng mga quote ng insurer.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Lagi bang inaalok ang lahat ng nakalistang deductible level?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Hindi. Ang mga tagaseguro ay hindi kailangang mag-alok ng bawat opsyonal na antas, at maaaring mag-iba ang mga alok para sa mga young adult. Ilagay lamang ang mga premium na ipinapakita para sa iyong sariling patakaran; iwanang blangko ang mga hindi magagamit na opsyon.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Ipinapakita ba nito ang aking kumpletong medikal na bayarin?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Hindi. Sinasaklaw ng modelo ang ordinaryong deductible at karaniwang 10% na bayad sa pagpapanatili sa mga karapat-dapat na gastos. Ibinubukod nito ang mga kontribusyon sa araw ng ospital, espesyal na 40% na pagpapanatili ng gamot, mga exempt na serbisyo, hindi saklaw na pangangalaga at karagdagang insurance.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Ito ay isang paghahambing ng senaryo, hindi insurance, medikal o payo sa pananalapi. Hindi nito hinuhulaan ang iyong paggamot o mga premium. Ibinubukod nito ang mga kontribusyon sa araw ng ospital (karaniwang CHF 15 bawat araw ng inpatient, na may mga statutory exemption), espesyal na 40% na pagpapanatili sa ilang mga gamot, maternity/preventive exemption, mga serbisyo sa labas ng compulsory cover, premium na subsidyo at karagdagang insurance. Ang aktwal na co-payment ay maaaring mag-iba. Ang mas mataas na deductible ay nangangahulugan na kailangan mong makapagbayad ng higit pa sa harap kung makakatanggap ka ng pangangalaga.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Sino ang nakaseguro sa ilalim ng patakarang ito?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Nakatatanda (edad 19 o higit pa)","Child (under 18)":"Bata (sa ilalim ng 18)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Mababang taunang kwalipikadong senaryo ng gastos sa paggamot (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Inaasahang taunang karapat-dapat na mga gastos sa paggamot (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Mataas na taunang kwalipikadong senaryo ng gastos sa paggamot (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Mga buwanang premium mula sa isang insurer","Monthly premium":"Buwanang premium","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Ipasok lamang ang mga opsyong inaalok para sa parehong patakarang ito. Iwanang blangko ang iba.","Adult deductible choices":"Mga pagpipiliang deductible para sa pang-adulto","Child deductible choices":"Mga pagpipiliang deductible ng bata","Compare annual costs":"Ihambing ang mga taunang gastos","Clear entries":"I-clear ang mga entry","Download CSV":"I-download ang CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Tinantyang taunang premium at pagbabahagi ng gastos","Deductible":"Mababawas","Annual premiums":"Taunang mga premium","Total at low costs":"Kabuuan sa mababang halaga","Total at expected costs":"Kabuuan sa inaasahang gastos","Total at high costs":"Kabuuan sa mataas na halaga","Cost sharing at low costs":"Pagbabahagi ng gastos sa mababang halaga","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Pagbabahagi ng gastos sa inaasahang gastos","Cost sharing at high costs":"Pagbabahagi ng gastos sa matataas na halaga","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Pagkakaiba mula sa pinakamababang available na deductible","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Mga gastos sa medikal kung saan nauubos ang premium na pagtitipid","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Ang ipinasok na premium na pagtitipid ay hindi kinansela sa loob ng modelong saklaw ng pagbabahagi ng gastos.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Walang premium na matitipid laban sa pinakamababang deductible.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Pinakamababang inaasahang kabuuan sa mga inilagay na opsyon","Scenario details":"Mga detalye ng senaryo","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Maglagay ng tatlong inayos na mga sitwasyong medikal na gastos at buwanang premium para sa hindi bababa sa dalawang available na deductible.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Opisyal na mga panuntunan at kasalukuyang mga premium:","Federal deductible rules":"Mga panuntunan sa federal na mababawas","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Opisyal na premium na paghahambing ng Priminfo","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Paghahambing na kinakalkula sa browser na ito.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Tingnan ang pangkat ng edad, mga senaryo ng nakaayos na gastos at hindi bababa sa dalawang buwanang premium.","Entries cleared.":"Na-clear ang mga entry.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV na na-download nang lokal.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Ang Iyong Net Premium","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Kalkulahin ang netong Swiss health-insurance premium mula sa kasalukuyang premium at isang buwanang pagbawas na ibinigay na ng iyong canton.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Ilagay ang premium at kumpirmadong buwanang bawas mula sa iyong insurer o cantonal na desisyon. Ang tool na ito ay hindi nagpapasya kung kwalipikado ka.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Tinutukoy ng mga Swiss canton kung sino ang kwalipikado, gaano karaming suporta ang ibibigay at kung kailangan ang isang aplikasyon. Ibinabawas lamang ng calculator na ito ang isang nakumpirmang buwanang pagbawas mula sa isang premium ng patakaran at ipinapakita ang taunang halaga.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Kung ang buwanang premium ay CHF 420 at ang kumpirmadong pagbawas ay CHF 120, ang tinantyang netong premium ay CHF 300 bawat buwan.","How the calculation works":"Paano gumagana ang pagkalkula","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Sinasabi ba nito sa akin kung kwalipikado ako?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Hindi. Ang pagiging karapat-dapat at mga halaga ng award ay pinagpapasyahan ng canton of residence. Gamitin ang naka-link na opisyal na impormasyon o makipag-ugnayan sa cantonal office.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Saan ko mahahanap ang halaga ng pagbawas?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Gamitin ang kasalukuyang desisyon o ang pinababang premium na ipinakita ng iyong insurer. Ang ilang mga canton ay awtomatikong nagbibigay ng mga pagbawas; ang iba ay nangangailangan ng aplikasyon.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Ito ay aritmetika para sa isang patakaran, hindi isang desisyon sa pagiging kwalipikado o benepisyo. Hindi nito kinakalkula ang kita ng sambahayan, mga ari-arian, katayuan ng pamilya, mga deadline, cantonal threshold o mga karapatan sa aplikasyon. Maaaring magbago ang mga premium at parangal; kumpirmahin ang mga ito sa iyong insurer at canton.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Kasalukuyang buwanang premium (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Ibinigay na ang buwanang pagbawas (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Maglagay ng halagang kinumpirma ng canton o insurer; huwag gumamit ng pagtatantya bilang award.","Calculate net premium":"Kalkulahin ang net premium","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Ilagay ang kasalukuyang premium at kumpirmadong pagbawas.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Tinantyang premium pagkatapos ng pagbabawas","Current monthly premium":"Kasalukuyang buwanang premium","Monthly reduction":"Buwanang pagbawas","Estimated net monthly premium":"Tinantyang net buwanang premium","Reduction over 12 months":"Pagbawas sa loob ng 12 buwan","Reduction as a share of premium":"Pagbawas bilang bahagi ng premium","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Kumpleto na ang pagkalkula. Kumpirmahin ang award at epektibong petsa sa iyong canton at insurer.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Tiyaking hindi mas malaki ang bawas kaysa sa buwanang premium.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Tantyahin lamang kung paano naaapektuhan ng pagbabago sa mortgage reference rate ng Switzerland ang isang residential net rent. Gamitin ang pinakabagong rate mula sa federal housing office.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Ihambing ang reference rate na nakasaad sa iyong lease o pinakabagong paunawa sa upa sa kasalukuyang opisyal na Swiss rate. Ang pagkalkula ay nananatili sa iyong device.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Ang Federal Office for Housing ay naglalathala ng isang mortgage reference rate para sa Swiss rent adjustments bawat quarter. Ang 0.25 percentage-point na pagtaas sa prinsipyo ay maaaring magpapahintulot ng 3% na pagtaas ng upa; ang isang 0.25-point na pagbaba sa prinsipyo ay maaaring magbigay ng 2.91% na pagbawas. Inilalapat ng sitwasyong ito ang mga pagbabagong iyon nang hakbang-hakbang sa netong renta na iyong ipinasok.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"Para sa CHF 3,000 buwanang netong upa, ang pagbaba ng reference-rate mula 1.75% hanggang 1.50% ay nagbibigay ng tinantyang pagbabago sa reference-rate-only na humigit-kumulang −CHF 87.38 bawat buwan (−2.91%).","How this estimate works":"Paano gumagana ang pagtatantya na ito","Where do I find the current rate?":"Saan ko mahahanap ang kasalukuyang rate?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Buksan ang naka-link na pahina ng Federal Office for Housing at ilagay ang kasalukuyang nai-publish na rate. Ang tool ay hindi nag-e-embed ng rate na maaaring maging luma na.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Nagpapasya ba ito kung maaari akong humiling ng pagbabago sa upa?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Hindi. Ito ay naghihiwalay ng isang salik para sa oryentasyon. Maaaring baguhin ng iyong kontrata, inflation, mga pagbabago sa gastos, reserbasyon at iba pang legal na kondisyon ang resulta.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Kasama ba sa resulta ang mga karagdagang gastos?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Hindi. Ipasok ang buwanang netong upa, hindi kasama ang mga karagdagang gastos at iba pang mga variable na singil.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Ang resulta ay isang mapaglarawang reference-rate na senaryo, hindi legal na opinyon o kumpletong pagsusuri sa upa. Ibinubukod nito ang inflation, mga pagbabago sa pangkalahatang gastos, mga pagpapahusay, mga pagpapareserba sa kontraktwal, na-index o stepped na mga renta, mga petsa ng paunawa at pamamaraan ng cantonal. Suriin ang iyong pag-upa at ang opisyal na patnubay bago kumilos.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Swiss residential lease: isang pagtatantya ng epekto ng mortgage-reference-rate lamang. Ito ay hindi isang legal na desisyon o isang buong pagsusuri sa upa.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Kasalukuyang buwanang netong upa (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Reference rate na nakasaad sa iyong lease o pinakabagong paunawa sa upa (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Kasalukuyang opisyal na Swiss reference rate (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Kalkulahin ang senaryo ng reference-rate","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Reference-rate-only na senaryo","Current monthly net rent":"Kasalukuyang buwanang netong upa","Reference-rate change":"Pagbabago sa rate ng sanggunian","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Tinantyang buwanang epekto mula sa reference rate","Scenario monthly net rent":"Scenario buwanang netong upa","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Taunang epekto sa loob ng 12 buwan sa parehong rate","potential increase":"potensyal na pagtaas","potential decrease":"potensyal na pagbaba","no reference-rate change":"walang pagbabago sa reference-rate","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Nalalapat ang pagtatantya ng 3% para sa bawat 0.25 porsyentong pagtaas ng punto at ang katumbas na kabaligtaran na pagbawas para sa bawat pagbaba. Maaaring baguhin ng iba pang mga kadahilanan ang resulta.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Hindi kasama dito ang inflation, pangkalahatang mga pagbabago sa gastos, pagpapahusay, pagpapareserba sa kontrata, na-index o stepped na mga renta, petsa ng paunawa, o lokal na mga kinakailangan sa pamamaraan. Suriin ang iyong pag-upa at ang gabay ng Federal Office for Housing.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Tingnan ang pinakabagong opisyal na rate at gabay","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Ilagay ang renta at ang parehong mga rate para makakita ng senaryo.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Kinakalkula ang senaryo. I-verify ang mga petsa at termino ng kontrata bago umasa dito.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Tingnan ang mga halaga at rate. Ang mga rate ay dapat nasa pagitan ng 0% at 5% at naiiba sa 0.25-point na mga hakbang.","Inputs cleared.":"Na-clear ang mga input.","Result":"Resulta","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Tantyahin ang balanse sa araw ng bakasyon sa Switzerland mula sa taunang bakasyon sa iyong kontrata, linggo ng trabaho, mga petsa ng pagtatrabaho at mga araw na kinuha na.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Tantyahin ang prorated na bayad na bakasyon para sa isang taon sa kalendaryo gamit ang entitlement at iskedyul ng trabaho na iyong ipinasok. Walang mga termino ng kontrata ang nahulaan.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Pinapararate ng estimator ang taunang mga araw ng bakasyon sa iyong kontrata ayon sa mga araw sa kalendaryong nagtatrabaho sa napiling taon. Para sa part-time na trabaho, ilagay ang iyong karaniwang araw ng trabaho bawat linggo at ang taunang bakasyon sa mga linggo.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Sa apat na linggong bakasyon, limang araw na linggo ng trabaho at trabaho sa buong taon, ang taunang karapatan ay 20 araw ng trabaho bago ibawas ang bakasyon na nakuha na.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Ano ang Swiss statutory minimum?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Ang pederal na patnubay ay nagsasaad ng hindi bababa sa apat na linggo bawat taon ng serbisyo, at limang linggo para sa mga manggagawang hindi pa umabot sa edad na 20. Ang isang kontrata o kolektibong kasunduan ay maaaring magbigay ng higit pa.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Nagpapasya ba ito sa aking legal na balanse?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Hindi. Ito ay isang simpleng proration sa araw ng kalendaryo. Maaaring baguhin ng mga tuntunin ng kontrata, naaangkop na kolektibong mga panuntunan, qualifying absences, rounding at employer records ang balanse.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Hindi nagpapasya ang pagtatantyang ito ng legal na karapatan o kinakalkula ang holiday pay. Ibinubukod nito ang mga pagbabawas para sa ilang partikular na matagal na pagliban, mga tuntunin sa pag-iipon at pag-ikot na partikular sa kontrata, mga pampublikong pista opisyal, overtime, mga deadline ng pagdala at mga hindi pagkakaunawaan. Suriin ang iyong kontrata at kumuha ng payo para sa isang pinagtatalunang balanse.","Leave year":"Taon ng bakasyon","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Taunang bakasyon sa iyong kontrata (mga linggo)","Usual working days per week":"Mga karaniwang araw ng trabaho bawat linggo","Employment start date":"Petsa ng pagsisimula ng trabaho","Employment end date":"Petsa ng pagtatapos ng trabaho","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Nakuha na ang mga araw ng bakasyon sa taong ito ng bakasyon","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Para sa oryentasyon lamang. Ipasok ang kontraktwal na taunang karapatan; ang legal na minimum ay karaniwang apat na linggo, o limang linggo para sa mga manggagawang wala pang 20 taong gulang.","Estimate balance":"Tinantyang balanse","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Ilagay ang iyong kontrata at mga petsa para tantyahin ang balanse.","Estimated leave balance":"Tinantyang balanse sa leave","Annual leave at this schedule":"Taunang bakasyon sa iskedyul na ito","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Mga araw sa kalendaryo na nagtatrabaho sa taong ito ng bakasyon","Prorated days accrued":"Prorated na mga araw na naipon","Days already taken":"Natapos na ang mga araw","Estimated days remaining":"Mga tinantyang araw na natitira","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Ito ay nagpapabagal sa taunang bakasyon ayon sa mga araw ng kalendaryo sa panahon ng pagtatrabaho. Maaaring magkaiba ang mga tuntunin ng employer at kontrata.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Kinakalkula ang pagtatantya. Suriin ito sa iyong kontrata at mga rekord ng employer.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Tingnan ang taon, petsa, iskedyul ng trabaho at mga halaga."},"ta":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"சுவிஸ் வேலையின்மை கொடுப்பனவு காட்சி","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"சுவிஸ் வேலையின்மை நலன் கால்குலேட்டர் — மொத்த காட்சி","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"உங்கள் நிதியால் உறுதிப்படுத்தப்பட்ட காப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்ட சம்பளம் மற்றும் விகிதத்தைப் பயன்படுத்தி மொத்த சுவிஸ் தினசரி கொடுப்பனவை மதிப்பிடவும்.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"உங்கள் வேலையின்மை நிதியினால் உறுதிப்படுத்தப்பட்ட காப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்ட சம்பளம் மற்றும் 70% அல்லது 80% விகிதத்தை உள்ளிடவும்.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"சுவிஸ் விதிகள் கொடுப்பனவு விகிதம் மற்றும் சம்பள வரம்பை அமைக்கின்றன. இந்த நிதியானது தகுதி, விலக்குகள், காத்திருக்கும் நாட்கள் மற்றும் உரிமையை தீர்மானிக்கிறது. மாதாந்திர வரம்பு 20-23 செலுத்த வேண்டிய வார நாட்களைப் பிரதிபலிக்கிறது.","Example":"எடுத்துக்காட்டு","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5,000 70% என்பது ஒரு வார நாளுக்கு CHF 161.29 ஆகும்.","How it works":"இது எப்படி வேலை செய்கிறது","Questions":"கேள்விகள்","Scope and limits":"நோக்கம் மற்றும் வரம்புகள்","Related tools":"தொடர்புடைய கருவிகள்","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"மாதாந்திர காப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்ட சம்பளம் (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"நிதி மூலம் விகிதம் உறுதிப்படுத்தப்பட்டது","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"மதிப்பீடு","Clear":"தெளிவு","Gross scenario":"மொத்த காட்சி","Insured salary used":"காப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்ட சம்பளம் பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டது","Per payable weekday":"செலுத்த வேண்டிய வார நாளுக்கு","20-day month":"20-நாள் மாதம்","23-day month":"23-நாள் மாதம்","Official benefit rules":"அதிகாரப்பூர்வ நன்மை விதிகள்","Enter your confirmed figures.":"உங்கள் உறுதிப்படுத்தப்பட்ட புள்ளிவிவரங்களை உள்ளிடவும்.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"காட்சி கணக்கிடப்பட்டது. உங்கள் நிதியுடன் தொகைகளை உறுதிப்படுத்தவும்.","Check the values.":"மதிப்புகளைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"சுவிஸ் குத்தகை அறிவிப்பு திட்டமிடுபவர்","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"சுவிஸ் வாடகை அறிவிப்பு திட்டம் மற்றும் கடித வரைவு","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"உங்கள் சொந்த ஒப்பந்தத்தில் உள்ள தேதிகள் மற்றும் விதிமுறைகளிலிருந்து ஒரு குத்தகை அறிவிப்பைத் திட்டமிடுங்கள்; மண்டல விதிகளை அனுமானிக்காமல் ஒரு கடிதத்தை வரையவும்.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"உங்கள் ஒப்பந்தத்தில் அறிவிப்பு காலம், அடுத்த செல்லுபடியாகும் முடிவு நாள் மற்றும் ரசீது தேதியை உள்ளிடவும். ஒவ்வொரு தேதியையும் உங்கள் நில உரிமையாளர் அல்லது குத்தகைதாரர்கள் சங்கத்துடன் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"நீங்கள் வழங்கும் தேதிகள் மற்றும் காலகட்டத்தை மட்டுமே திட்டமிடுபவர் பயன்படுத்துவார். அறிவிப்பு செல்லுபடியாகுமா, அது சட்டப்பூர்வமாக எப்போது பெறப்பட்டது, அல்லது சிறப்பு பாதுகாப்பு பொருந்துமா என்பதை இது தீர்மானிக்காது.","Contract notice period (months)":"ஒப்பந்த அறிவிப்பு காலம் (மாதங்கள்)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"மாதத்தின் அடுத்த செல்லுபடியாகும் முடிவு நாள் (ஒப்பந்தத்திலிருந்து)","Expected receipt date":"எதிர்பார்க்கப்பட்ட ரசீது தேதி","Your name":"உங்கள் பெயர்","Your address":"உங்கள் முகவரி","Landlord / agency":"நில உரிமையாளர் / நிறுவனம்","Recipient address":"பெறுநரின் முகவரி","Rental property":"வாடகை சொத்து","Place":"இடம்","Letter date":"கடிதம் தேதி","Termination of tenancy":"குத்தகையை நிறுத்துதல்","Calculate date and draft letter":"தேதி மற்றும் வரைவு கடிதத்தை கணக்கிடவும்","Planning date":"திட்டமிடும் தேதி","Target date":"இலக்கு தேதி","Editable draft":"திருத்தக்கூடிய வரைவு","Copy draft":"வரைவை நகலெடுக்கவும்","Enter your contract terms.":"உங்கள் ஒப்பந்த விதிமுறைகளை உள்ளிடவும்.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"திட்டமிடல் வரைவு தயார். உங்கள் ஒப்பந்தத்திற்கு எதிராக சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Check the dates and period.":"தேதிகளையும் காலத்தையும் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"சப்ளை செய்யப்பட்ட ஒப்பந்த அறிவிப்பு நாளைத் தொடர்ந்து முடிவு வரும்; இது ஒரு சட்டப்பூர்வ அறிவிப்பு தீர்ப்பு அல்ல.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"சுவிஸ் சொத்து ஆதாய காட்சி","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"சுவிஸ் சொத்து ஆதாய வரி — பயனர் நுழைவு விகிதம் காட்சி","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"உங்கள் சொந்த பரிவர்த்தனை செலவுகள் மற்றும் பொறுப்பான மாகாணத்திலிருந்து வரி விகிதத்தைப் பயன்படுத்தி சொத்து ஆதாயத்தை மதிப்பிடுங்கள்.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"வருமானம், கையகப்படுத்தல் செலவு, நீங்கள் உறுதிப்படுத்திய தகுதியான செலவுகள் மற்றும் அதிகாரப்பூர்வ கன்டோனல் கால்குலேட்டரிலிருந்து பயனுள்ள விகிதத்தை உள்ளிடவும்.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"சுவிஸ் சொத்து ஆதாய வரி மண்டலம், வைத்திருக்கும் காலம், விலக்குகள் மற்றும் வழக்கு ஆகியவற்றைப் பொறுத்து மாறுபடும். இந்தக் கருவி விகிதங்களை வழங்காது அல்லது ஏற்றுக்கொள்ளக்கூடிய செலவுகளை நிர்ணயிக்காது.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"விற்பனை வருமானம் (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"கையகப்படுத்தல் செலவு (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"மற்ற செலவுகள் ஏற்றுக்கொள்ளத்தக்கவை (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"அதிகாரப்பூர்வ மூலத்திலிருந்து பயனுள்ள வரி விகிதம் (%)","Estimate scenario":"கணக்கிடப்பட்ட காட்சி","Illustrative scenario":"விளக்கக் காட்சி","Gain entered":"ஆதாயம் நுழைந்தது","Tax at entered rate":"உள்ளிட்ட விகிதத்தில் வரி","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"உங்கள் பதிவுகள் மற்றும் மண்டல மூலத்திலிருந்து புள்ளிவிவரங்களை உள்ளிடவும்.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"காட்சி கணக்கிடப்பட்டது; மண்டலத்துடன் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Check amounts and rate.":"தொகை மற்றும் விகிதத்தை சரிபார்க்கவும்.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"கண்டன் வரி அட்டவணை உட்பொதிக்கப்படவில்லை; நீங்கள் உள்ளிட்ட பயனுள்ள விகிதம் மதிப்பீட்டை இயக்குகிறது.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"சுவிஸ் மரபுரிமை மற்றும் பரிசு வரி காட்சி","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"சுவிஸ் மரபுரிமை மற்றும் பரிசு வரி — உங்கள் விகித சூழ்நிலை","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"பயனர் உள்ளிடும் விலக்கு மற்றும் விகிதத்திலிருந்து வரி விதிக்கக்கூடிய தொகையை மதிப்பிடுங்கள்; விதிகள் மண்டலம் மற்றும் உறவைப் பொறுத்து மாறுபடும்.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"பெறுநர் மற்றும் மண்டலத்திற்கு உறுதி செய்யப்பட்ட தொகை, விலக்கு மற்றும் பயனுள்ள விகிதத்தை உள்ளிடவும்.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"கேண்டன் விதிகள் மற்றும் குடும்ப உறவு விதிவிலக்குகள் மற்றும் கட்டணங்களை மாற்றலாம். இந்தக் கருவி கன்டன் விதியைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவில்லை அல்லது வரிப் பொறுப்பைத் தீர்மானிக்கவில்லை.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"பரம்பரை அல்லது பரிசுத் தொகை (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"காண்டனில் (CHF) விலக்கு உறுதிப்படுத்தப்பட்டது","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"கண்டன் (%) மூலம் உறுதிசெய்யப்பட்ட செயல்திறன் விகிதம்","Amount after entered exemption":"விலக்கு உள்ளிட்ட பிறகு தொகை","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"உங்கள் வழக்கில் உறுதிப்படுத்தப்பட்ட புள்ளிவிவரங்களை உள்ளிடவும்.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"மதிப்பீடு நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் விலக்கு மற்றும் விகிதத்தை மட்டுமே பயன்படுத்துகிறது.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"சுவிஸ் குழந்தை ஆதரவு பட்ஜெட் காட்சி","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"சுவிஸ் குழந்தை ஆதரவு பட்ஜெட் — வெளிப்படையான குடும்ப சூழ்நிலை","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"உள்ளீடு செய்யப்பட்ட நேரடி-செலவுக் கிரெடிட்டிற்குப் பிறகு பெற்றோர் வருமானத்தின் மூலம் உள்ளிடப்பட்ட குழந்தை பட்ஜெட்டை ஒதுக்கவும்.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"குழந்தையின் ஆவணப்படுத்தப்பட்ட மாதாந்திரத் தேவைகளைப் பயன்படுத்தவும், பெற்றோரின் மாத வருமானம் மற்றும் நீங்கள் கடன் பெற விரும்பும் நேரடிச் செலவுகள்.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"இது திட்டமிடல் பணித்தாள் மட்டுமே. இது சுவிஸ் குழந்தை பராமரிப்பு விருது அல்லது சட்ட முறை அல்ல; வீடுகள், பராமரிப்பு, வரிகள், நன்மைகள் மற்றும் வழக்குச் சட்டம் மதிப்பீடு செய்யப்படவில்லை.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"நீங்கள் ஆவணப்படுத்திய மாதாந்திர குழந்தை பட்ஜெட் (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"பெற்றோர் A கிடைக்கக்கூடிய மாத வருமானம் (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"பெற்றோர் B கிடைக்கும் மாத வருமானம் (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"குழந்தைகளுக்கான நேரடி செலவுகள் பெற்றோர் A மூலம் கிரெடிட்டிற்கு செலுத்தப்படும் (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"காட்சியை ஒதுக்கவும்","Illustrative allocation":"விளக்க ஒதுக்கீடு","Parent A remaining contribution":"பெற்றோர் எ மீதமுள்ள பங்களிப்பு","Parent B contribution":"பெற்றோர் பி பங்களிப்பு","Entered monthly child budget":"மாதாந்திர குழந்தை பட்ஜெட்டை உள்ளிடப்பட்டது","Enter your household budget figures.":"உங்கள் வீட்டு பட்ஜெட் புள்ளிவிவரங்களை உள்ளிடவும்.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"பட்ஜெட் காட்சி கணக்கிடப்பட்டது; ஒரு தகுதி வாய்ந்த ஆலோசகருடன் சட்டக் கடமைகளைப் பற்றி விவாதிக்கவும்.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"தொகையைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்; வரவு பட்ஜெட்டை விட அதிகமாக இருக்க முடியாது.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"பங்குகள் இரண்டு உள்ளிடப்பட்ட வருமானங்களுக்கு விகிதாசாரமாகும்; நேரடி-செலவு கடன் முதலில் கழிக்கப்படுகிறது.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"உலாவி ஹைபனேஷன் முன்னோட்டம்","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Word Hyphenation Preview — உலாவி மொழி வடிவங்கள்","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"நீங்கள் வழங்கும் உரைக்கான உலாவி ஹைபனேஷன் முன்னோட்டம்; ஆதரவு உலாவி மற்றும் நிறுவப்பட்ட மொழி வளங்களைப் பொறுத்தது.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"உங்கள் உரையுடன் பொருந்தக்கூடிய மொழியைத் தேர்வுசெய்து, மாதிரியை உள்ளிட்டு, கிடைக்கும் வரியின் அகலத்தை சரிசெய்யவும்.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"உலாவியின் சொந்த CSS ஹைபனேஷனைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது. இது அகராதிகளை தொகுக்கவில்லை; ஆதரிக்கப்படாத உலாவிகள் ஹைபன்களைக் காட்டக்கூடாது. உரையை நகலெடுப்பது அசல் எழுத்துப்பிழையை வைத்திருக்கிறது.","Text language (BCP 47)":"உரை மொழி (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"முன்னோட்டம் அகலம் (எழுத்துகள்)","Text to preview":"முன்பார்வைக்கான உரை","Preview":"முன்னோட்டம்","Enter text and choose its language.":"உரையை உள்ளிட்டு அதன் மொழியைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","Preview updated.":"முன்னோட்டம் புதுப்பிக்கப்பட்டது.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"ஆதரிக்கப்படும் மொழி குறிச்சொல் மற்றும் உரையை உள்ளிடவும்.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"உலாவியால் வார்த்தைகளை எங்கு உடைக்க முடியும் என்பதைப் பார்க்க, ஒரே பத்தியை வெவ்வேறு அகலங்களில் முயற்சிக்கவும்.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"தனியார் எழுத்துப்பிழை சரிபார்ப்பு பணியிடம்","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"உள்ளூர் எழுத்துப்பிழை சரிபார்ப்பு — உங்கள் உலாவி அகராதியைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"உலாவியின் சொந்த எழுத்துப்பிழை சரிபார்ப்புடன் உரையைத் திருத்தி, ஒரு மொழியைத் தேர்ந்தெடுத்து, திருத்தப்பட்ட உரையை நகலெடுக்கவும்.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"உரை இந்தப் பக்கத்தில் இருக்கும். உங்கள் உலாவியில் எழுத்துப்பிழை அகராதி உள்ள மொழியை அமைத்து, அதன் எழுத்துப்பிழை மெனுவைப் பயன்படுத்தவும் அல்லது பரிந்துரைகளை அடிக்கோடிடவும்.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"இந்த பணியிடமானது உரையை பதிவேற்றவோ அல்லது அகராதிகளை அனுப்பவோ இல்லை. உலாவியின் எழுத்துப்பிழை சரிபார்ப்பு மற்றும் பரிந்துரைகள் சாதனம், உலாவி மற்றும் நிறுவப்பட்ட அகராதியைப் பொறுத்தது.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"எழுத்துப்பிழை சரிபார்ப்பு மொழி (BCP 47)","Text to check":"சரிபார்ப்பதற்கான உரை","Copy text":"உரையை நகலெடு","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"உரையை தட்டச்சு செய்யவும் அல்லது ஒட்டவும். பரிந்துரைகளுக்கு உங்கள் சாதனத்தின் எழுத்துப்பிழை மெனுவை வலது கிளிக் செய்யவும் அல்லது பயன்படுத்தவும்.","Text copied.":"உரை நகலெடுக்கப்பட்டது.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"தானாக நகலெடுக்க முடியவில்லை; உரையைத் தேர்ந்தெடுத்து நகலெடுக்கவும்.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"பொருந்தும் அகராதி இல்லாத உலாவி எழுத்துப்பிழைகளைக் குறிக்காது.","Resume Structure Checker":"கட்டுமான சரிபார்ப்பை மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS Resume Checker — இலவச உள்ளூர் PDF & DOCX மதிப்பாய்வு","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"உங்கள் உலாவியில் ரெஸ்யூம் டெக்ஸ்ட், தலைப்புகள், பிரிவுகள், இணைப்புகள் மற்றும் புல்லட் அமைப்பைச் சரிபார்க்கவும். எண்ணிக்கை அடிப்படையில் வேலை விளக்க விதிமுறைகளை ஒப்பிடுக; பணியமர்த்தல் மதிப்பெண் அல்லது பதிவேற்றம் இல்லை.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"உரை-அடிப்படையிலான ரெஸ்யூம் உண்மையில் எதை வெளிப்படுத்துகிறது என்பதை மதிப்பாய்வு செய்யவும்: பிரித்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட உரை, தலைப்பு அமைப்பு, தொடர்பு-புலம் இருப்பு, இணைப்புகள் மற்றும் பொதுவாக அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட பிரிவுகள். மீண்டும் மீண்டும் வேலை விளக்க விதிமுறைகளை விருப்பமாக ஒப்பிடலாம்.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"அனுபவம் மற்றும் கல்விக்கான தலைப்பு 1 பாணிகளைக் கொண்ட DOCX அந்தத் தலைப்புகளைக் காட்டுகிறது. தேர்ந்தெடுக்கக்கூடிய உரையிலிருந்து ஒரு PDF சரிபார்க்கப்படுகிறது; நெடுவரிசைகளை வேறு வரிசையில் படிக்கலாம்.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX கோப்புகள் உள்ளூரில் Office ZIP/XML ஆக ஆய்வு செய்யப்படுகின்றன. ஒத்திவைக்கப்பட்ட உள்ளூர் PDF.js இன்ஜின் மூலம் PDFகள் படிக்கப்படுகின்றன. விருப்ப வேலை விளக்க ஒப்பீடு ஒவ்வொரு உரையிலும் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட சொற்களைக் கணக்கிடுகிறது; இது ஒரு மதிப்பெண்ணை உருவாக்கவில்லை அல்லது யாரையாவது பணியமர்த்த வேண்டுமா என்று பரிந்துரைக்கவில்லை.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"இது ஒரு வடிவம் மற்றும் உரை அமைப்பு சரிபார்ப்பு, ATS சிமுலேட்டர், சட்ட ஆய்வு அல்லது நேர்காணல் வெற்றிக்கான கணிப்பு அல்ல. தேர்ந்தெடுக்கக்கூடிய உரை இல்லாமல் ஸ்கேன் செய்யப்பட்ட PDFகளுக்கு முதலில் OCR தேவை. கடவுச்சொல்-பாதுகாக்கப்பட்ட, மேக்ரோ-இயக்கப்பட்ட, கையொப்பமிடப்பட்ட அல்லது வழக்கத்திற்கு மாறாக பெரிய ஆவணங்கள் ஆதரிக்கப்படாது.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"ஒரு விண்ணப்பத்தைத் தேர்ந்தெடுங்கள் (PDF அல்லது DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"உங்கள் கோப்புகள் இந்த உலாவியில் இருக்கும், மேலும் அவை பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை. அதிகபட்சம் 20 எம்பி; 50 பக்கங்கள் வரை PDF. DOCX விரிவாக்கப்பட்ட உள்ளடக்கம் 80 MB ஆக உள்ளது.","Optional job description":"விருப்ப வேலை விவரம்","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"கால-அதிர்வெண் ஒப்பீடு வேண்டுமானால், எளிய உரையை ஒட்டவும். நீங்கள் பகுப்பாய்வு செய்யத் தேவையில்லாத முக்கியமான தகவல்களைச் சேர்க்க வேண்டாம்.","Paste job-description text here…":"வேலை விளக்க உரையை இங்கே ஒட்டவும்...","Analyze locally":"உள்ளூரில் பகுப்பாய்வு செய்யவும்","Clear files and report":"கோப்புகளை அழி மற்றும் அறிக்கை","Resume review":"மீண்டும் மதிப்பாய்வு செய்யவும்","File type":"கோப்பு வகை","Extracted characters":"பிரித்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட எழுத்துக்கள்","Words counted":"வார்த்தைகள் எண்ணப்பட்டன","Detected headings":"தலைப்புகள் கண்டறியப்பட்டது","Recognized sections":"அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட பிரிவுகள்","Hyperlinks found":"ஹைப்பர்லிங்க்கள் கண்டறியப்பட்டன","Bullet paragraphs":"புல்லட் பத்திகள்","An email address appears in the text":"ஒரு மின்னஞ்சல் முகவரி உரையில் தோன்றும்","No email address pattern was detected":"மின்னஞ்சல் முகவரி முறை எதுவும் கண்டறியப்படவில்லை","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"உரையில் ஃபோன்-எண் போன்ற பேட்டர்ன் தோன்றும்","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"ஃபோன் எண் போன்ற வடிவங்கள் எதுவும் கண்டறியப்படவில்லை","Job-description terms (counts only)":"வேலை விளக்க விதிமுறைகள் (எண்ணிக்கைகள் மட்டும்)","Term":"காலம்","In job text":"வேலை உரையில்","In resume":"ரெஸ்யூமில்","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"கால எண்ணிக்கையை ஒப்பிட வேலை விளக்கத்தை ஒட்டவும்.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"தெளிவான தலைப்பு நடைகள் கண்டறியப்படவில்லை. PDF தலைப்புகள் உரை அளவிலிருந்து மதிப்பிடப்படுகின்றன, மேலும் அவை துல்லியமாக இருக்கலாம்.","Detected":"கண்டறியப்பட்டது","Not detected":"கண்டறியப்படவில்லை","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"இந்த ஹூரிஸ்டிக் பொதுவான பிரிவு பெயர்களின் வரையறுக்கப்பட்ட தொகுப்பை அங்கீகரிக்கிறது; எந்தப் பிரிவுகள் தேவை என்பதை அது தீர்மானிக்கவில்லை.","Profile / summary":"சுயவிவரம் / சுருக்கம்","Experience":"அனுபவம்","Education":"கல்வி","Skills":"திறன்கள்","Contact":"தொடர்புக்கு","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கக்கூடிய உரை எதுவும் காணப்படவில்லை. ஸ்கேன் செய்யப்பட்ட PDFகளை சரிபார்க்கும் முன் OCR தேவை.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"தொடங்குவதற்கு PDF அல்லது DOCX ரெஸ்யூமைத் தேர்வு செய்யவும்.","Reading the selected file locally…":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட கோப்பை உள்நாட்டில் படிக்கிறது…","Local structure review complete.":"உள்ளூர் கட்டமைப்பு மதிப்பாய்வு முடிந்தது.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"இந்த உலாவி தேவையான உள்ளூர் ஆவண அம்சத்தை ஆதரிக்கவில்லை.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"கூறப்பட்ட உள்ளூர் வரம்புகள் வரை செல்லுபடியாகும் PDF அல்லது நவீன DOCX கோப்பைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF ஐப் படிக்க முடியவில்லை. இது சேதமடைந்திருக்கலாம், மறைகுறியாக்கப்பட்டிருக்கலாம் அல்லது தேர்ந்தெடுக்கக்கூடிய உரை இல்லை.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX தொகுப்பை பாதுகாப்பாக திறக்கவோ அல்லது படிக்கவோ முடியவில்லை.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"இந்தக் கருவி எனது விண்ணப்பத்தை பதிவேற்றுகிறதா அல்லது சேமிக்கிறதா?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"எண். பாகுபடுத்துதல் மற்றும் பகுப்பாய்வு உங்கள் உலாவியில் இயங்கும். நீங்கள் அறிக்கையை அழித்த பிறகு அல்லது பக்கத்தை விட்டு வெளியேறிய பிறகு கோப்பு உரை சேவையகத்திற்கு அனுப்பப்படாது அல்லது தக்கவைக்கப்படாது.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"எனது விண்ணப்பத்தை ATS அல்லது முதலாளி ஏற்றுக்கொள்வார்களா என்பதை இது கணிக்குமா?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"எண். இது படிக்கக்கூடிய உரை மற்றும் எளிமையான கட்டமைப்பை மட்டுமே சரிபார்க்கிறது. பணியமர்த்தல் அமைப்புகள் வேறுபடுகின்றன, மேலும் இது ATS பொருந்தக்கூடிய உத்தரவாதம் அல்லது பணியமர்த்தல் கணிப்பு அல்ல.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"ஸ்கேன் செய்யப்பட்ட PDFஐப் படிக்க முடியுமா?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"PDF இல் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கக்கூடிய உரை அடுக்கு இருந்தால் மட்டுமே. இந்த சரிபார்ப்பு OCR மாதிரிகளைப் பதிவிறக்காது; ஸ்கேன் செய்யப்பட்ட படம் மட்டும் ஆவணத்திற்கு முதலில் OCR கருவியைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"வேலை விளக்க ஒப்பீடு எதைக் குறிக்கிறது?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"எளிய இயல்பாக்கத்திற்குப் பிறகு மீண்டும் நிகழும் சொற்களுக்கான எண்ணிக்கையை இது காட்டுகிறது. இது உங்கள் தகுதிகளின் போட்டி சதவீதம், தரவரிசை, பரிந்துரை அல்லது மதிப்பீடு அல்ல.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"DOCX ஐ விட PDF ஏன் குறைவான தலைப்புகளைக் காட்டுகிறது?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDFகள் பொதுவாக சொற்பொருள் தலைப்பு பாணிகளைப் பாதுகாப்பதில்லை. செக்கர் உரை அளவு மற்றும் வாசிப்பு வரிசையில் இருந்து முக்கிய வரிகளை மதிப்பிடுகிறது, எனவே நெடுவரிசைகள் மற்றும் காட்சி வடிவமைப்பு முடிவை பாதிக்கலாம்.","How local resume review works":"உள்ளூர் ரெஸ்யூம் மதிப்பாய்வு எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறது","Resume checker questions":"சரிபார்ப்பு கேள்விகளை மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்","Scope and limitations":"நோக்கம் மற்றும் வரம்புகள்","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"உள்ளூர் குரல் மற்றும் துணைப் பிரிப்பான்","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"குரல் நீக்கி - உள்ளூரில் தனி குரல் மற்றும் துணை","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"உங்கள் உலாவியில் மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட குரல் மற்றும் துணையாக ஒரு சிறிய ஸ்டீரியோ ஆடியோ மாதிரியை பிரிக்கவும். ஆடியோ உங்கள் சாதனத்தில் இருக்கும்; மாடல் அதன் பொது ஹோஸ்டிலிருந்து பதிவிறக்கம் செய்யப்பட்டது.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"30 வினாடிகள் வரை ஸ்டீரியோ மியூசிக் கிளிப்பைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும். முதல் பயன்பாட்டில், உலாவி 35.6 MB மாதிரியைப் பதிவிறக்குகிறது. இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் ஆடியோ கோப்பு செயலாக்கப்பட்டு, பதிவேற்றப்படவே இல்லை.","What you get":"உங்களுக்கு என்ன கிடைக்கும்","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"இரண்டு WAV ஸ்டெம்களை முன்னோட்டமிட்டு பதிவிறக்கவும்: மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட குரல்கள் மற்றும் எஞ்சிய துணை. முடிவுகள் கலவையைப் பொறுத்தது மற்றும் கலைப்பொருட்கள் இருக்கலாம்.","Local processing":"உள்ளூர் செயலாக்கம்","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"ஓஎன்என்எக்ஸ் மற்றும் ஓஎன்என்எக்ஸ் ரன்டைம் வெப்க்கு ஏற்றுமதி செய்யப்பட்ட ஓபன்-அன்மிக்ஸ் யுஎம்எக்ஸ்-ஹெச்க்யூ குரல் நெட்வொர்க்கை இந்த கருவி பயன்படுத்துகிறது. நீங்கள் தனி அழுத்தினால் மட்டுமே மாதிரி பெறப்படும்; கட்டண அனுமானம் API அல்லது சந்தா பயன்படுத்தப்படவில்லை. ஆடியோ டிகோட் செய்யப்பட்டு, செயலாக்கப்பட்டு உள்நாட்டில் ஏற்றுமதி செய்யப்படுகிறது.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"இது ஸ்டீரியோ 44.1 kHz செயலாக்கம் மற்றும் 30 வினாடிகள் வரையிலான கிளிப்களுக்கான மதிப்பீடாகும். மோனோ மூலங்கள் ஸ்டீரியோவிற்கு நகலெடுக்கப்படுகின்றன. கருவிகள், கனமான விளைவுகள், நேரடி பதிவுகள் மற்றும் அசாதாரண வகைகளில் ஆழமாக கலந்த குரல்கள் கசிவு அல்லது கலைப்பொருட்களை உருவாக்கலாம். ஒரு சுத்தமான மாஸ்டர் விளைவாக பயன்படுத்த வேண்டாம். மாதிரி பதிவிறக்கத்திற்கு இணைய இணைப்பு தேவை; ஆடியோ இந்தச் சாதனத்தை விட்டு வெளியேறாது.","Is my audio uploaded?":"எனது ஆடியோ பதிவேற்றப்பட்டதா?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"எண். தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட ஆடியோ உங்கள் உலாவியில் டிகோட் செய்யப்பட்டு செயலாக்கப்படுகிறது. நீங்கள் பிரிக்கத் தொடங்கும் போது மாடல் பதிவிறக்கம் மட்டுமே நெட்வொர்க் கோரிக்கை.","Why is the first run slow?":"முதல் ஓட்டம் ஏன் மெதுவாக உள்ளது?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"உலாவி 35.6 MB மாதிரியை ஒருமுறை பதிவிறக்குகிறது; உலாவி அதை கேச் செய்யலாம். அனுமானம் பின்னர் சாதன CPU இல் உள்நாட்டில் இயங்கும்.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"ஒவ்வொரு பாடலும் சுத்தமாகப் பிரிக்குமா?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"எண். மாதிரியானது ஒரு குரல் தண்டை மதிப்பிடுகிறது மற்றும் குரல் கசிவை விட்டுவிடலாம், கருவி ஹார்மோனிக்ஸ் அகற்றலாம் அல்லது கலைப்பொருட்களை உருவாக்கலாம். ஒரு தண்டை நம்புவதற்கு முன் கேளுங்கள்.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"ஸ்டீரியோ ஆடியோ கோப்பு (30 வினாடிகள் வரை)","Choose audio":"ஆடியோவைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்","Separate vocals":"தனி குரல்கள்","Cancel / clear":"ரத்து / அழிக்கவும்","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"தொடங்குவதற்கு ஒரு சிறிய ஆடியோ கோப்பைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்.","Downloading the separation model…":"பிரிப்பு மாதிரியைப் பதிவிறக்குகிறது…","Separating locally…":"உள்ளூரில் பிரிக்கப்படுகிறது…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"பிரித்தல் முடிந்தது. தண்டு ஒன்றை முன்னோட்டமிடவும் அல்லது பதிவிறக்கவும்.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"இந்த கோப்பை செயலாக்கவோ அல்லது மாதிரியை ஏற்றவோ முடியவில்லை. வடிவம் மற்றும் இணைப்பைச் சரிபார்த்து, மீண்டும் முயலவும்.","Model and weight license information":"மாடல் மற்றும் எடை உரிமத் தகவல்","Estimated vocals":"மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட குரல்கள்","Estimated accompaniment":"கணக்கிடப்பட்ட துணை","Download WAV":"WAV ஐப் பதிவிறக்கவும்","Progress":"முன்னேற்றம்","Preparing local separation…":"உள்ளூர் பிரிவைத் தயாரிக்கிறது…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"பிரித்தல் முடிந்தது. இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் ஆடியோ அப்படியே இருந்தது.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"இந்த ஆடியோவை செயலாக்க முடியவில்லை. 30 வினாடிகளுக்கு குறைவான ஸ்டீரியோ இசைக் கோப்பை முயற்சிக்கவும்.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"சுவிஸ் ஹெல்த் இன்சூரன்ஸ் விலக்கு ஒப்பீட்டாளர்","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"சுவிஸ் ஹெல்த் இன்சூரன்ஸ் ஃபிரான்சைஸ் கால்குலேட்டர் — ஆண்டு செலவுகளை ஒப்பிடுக","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"சுவிஸ் அடிப்படை மருத்துவக் காப்பீட்டுக் கழிவுகளை நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் பிரீமியங்கள் மற்றும் தகுதியான வருடாந்திர மருத்துவச் செலவுகளைப் பயன்படுத்தி ஒப்பிடுக. காப்பீட்டாளர் மேற்கோள் எதுவும் யூகிக்கப்படவில்லை.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"ஒவ்வொரு விலக்கு அளிக்கும் அதே காப்பீட்டாளரால் காட்டப்படும் மாதாந்திர பிரீமியங்களை உள்ளிடவும், பின்னர் குறைந்த, எதிர்பார்க்கப்படும் மற்றும் அதிக வருடாந்திர சிகிச்சை-செலவு காட்சிகளை ஒப்பிடவும்.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"கட்டாய சுவிஸ் அடிப்படை சுகாதாரக் காப்பீட்டிற்கு, வயது வந்தோருக்கான நிலையான விலக்கு CHF 300 மற்றும் குழந்தை விலக்கு CHF 0. விருப்ப நிலைகள் வயதுக்கு ஏற்ப வேறுபடும். கழிக்கப்பட்ட பிறகு, நிலையான தக்கவைப்புக் கட்டணம், தகுதியான மீதமுள்ள செலவினங்களில் 10% ஆகும், பெரியவர்களுக்கு ஆண்டுக்கு CHF 700 மற்றும் குழந்தைகளுக்கு CHF 350. இந்த மாதிரியான செலவுப் பகிர்வுக்கு கருவி நீங்கள் உள்ளிட்ட பிரீமியத்தைச் சேர்க்கிறது; இது காப்பீட்டு விகிதங்களைப் பெறாது அல்லது உங்களுக்கு எந்த விருப்பம் சரியானது என்பதை முடிவு செய்யாது.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"பெரியவர் CHF 400 மாதாந்திர பிரீமியத்தில் CHF 300 கழிக்கப்படும் மற்றும் CHF 350 இல் CHF 2,500 கழிக்கப்பட்டால், வருடாந்திர பிரீமியம் வித்தியாசம் CHF 600 ஆகும். அந்தச் சேமிப்பை மாதிரி வித்தியாசத்துடன் ஒப்பிட்டுப் பார்க்கவும். நீங்கள் எதிர்பார்க்கும் ஒவ்வொரு விலையும், அதிக அளவும்.","How the estimate works":"மதிப்பீடு எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறது","Common questions":"பொதுவான கேள்விகள்","Scope and exclusions":"நோக்கம் மற்றும் விலக்குகள்","Where do I get the premiums?":"பிரீமியங்களை நான் எங்கே பெறுவது?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"தற்போதைய மாதாந்திர சலுகைகளை அதே காப்பீட்டாளர், பிரீமியம் பகுதி, வயதுக் குழு, விபத்துக் காப்பீடு மற்றும் காப்பீட்டு மாதிரியைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். Priminfo அதிகாரப்பூர்வ ஃபெடரல் ஒப்பீட்டு தளம். இந்தப் பக்கம் காப்பீட்டாளர் மேற்கோள்களைப் பெறவோ அல்லது மீண்டும் உருவாக்கவோ இல்லை.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"பட்டியலிடப்பட்ட அனைத்து விலக்கு நிலைகளும் எப்போதும் வழங்கப்படுமா?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"எண். காப்பீட்டாளர்கள் ஒவ்வொரு விருப்ப நிலையையும் வழங்க வேண்டியதில்லை, மேலும் இளைஞர்களுக்கு சலுகைகள் வேறுபடலாம். உங்கள் சொந்த பாலிசிக்காகக் காட்டப்படும் பிரீமியங்களை மட்டும் உள்ளிடவும்; கிடைக்காத விருப்பங்களை காலியாக விடவும்.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"இது எனது முழுமையான மருத்துவக் கட்டணத்தைக் காட்டுகிறதா?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"எண். மாடல் தகுதியான செலவுகளில் சாதாரண விலக்கு மற்றும் நிலையான 10% தக்கவைப்புக் கட்டணத்தை உள்ளடக்கியது. இது மருத்துவமனை நாள் பங்களிப்புகள், சிறப்பு 40% மருந்து வைத்திருத்தல், விலக்கு சேவைகள், காப்பீடு இல்லாத பராமரிப்பு மற்றும் துணை காப்பீடு ஆகியவற்றை விலக்குகிறது.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"இது ஒரு காட்சி ஒப்பீடு, காப்பீடு, மருத்துவம் அல்லது நிதி ஆலோசனை அல்ல. இது உங்கள் சிகிச்சை அல்லது பிரீமியத்தை கணிக்காது. இது மருத்துவமனை நாள் பங்களிப்புகளை (பொதுவாக ஒரு உள்நோயாளி நாளொன்றுக்கு CHF 15, சட்டப்பூர்வ விலக்குகளுடன்), சில மருந்துகளில் சிறப்பு 40% தக்கவைப்பு, மகப்பேறு/தடுப்பு விலக்குகள், கட்டாயக் காப்பீட்டிற்கு வெளியே சேவைகள், பிரீமியம் மானியங்கள் மற்றும் துணைக் காப்பீடு ஆகியவற்றை விலக்குகிறது. எனவே உண்மையான இணை செலுத்துதல் வேறுபட்டிருக்கலாம். அதிக விலக்கு என்பது, நீங்கள் கவனிப்பைப் பெற்றால், நீங்கள் அதிக முன்பணம் செலுத்த வேண்டும் என்பதாகும்.","Who is insured under this policy?":"இந்த பாலிசியின் கீழ் யார் காப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்டுள்ளனர்?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"வயது வந்தோர் (வயது 19 அல்லது அதற்கு மேல்)","Child (under 18)":"குழந்தை (18 வயதுக்குள்)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"குறைந்த வருடாந்திர சிகிச்சை-செலவு சூழ்நிலை (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"எதிர்பார்க்கப்படும் வருடாந்திர தகுதியான சிகிச்சை செலவுகள் (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"உயர் வருடாந்திர தகுதியான சிகிச்சை-செலவு சூழ்நிலை (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"ஒரு காப்பீட்டாளரிடமிருந்து மாதாந்திர பிரீமியங்கள்","Monthly premium":"மாதாந்திர பிரீமியம்","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"இதே கொள்கைக்கு வழங்கப்படும் விருப்பங்களை மட்டும் உள்ளிடவும். மற்றவற்றை காலியாக விடவும்.","Adult deductible choices":"வயது வந்தோருக்கான விலக்கு தேர்வுகள்","Child deductible choices":"குழந்தைகளுக்கான விலக்கு தேர்வுகள்","Compare annual costs":"ஆண்டு செலவுகளை ஒப்பிடுக","Clear entries":"உள்ளீடுகளை அழிக்கவும்","Download CSV":"CSV ஐப் பதிவிறக்கவும்","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட வருடாந்திர பிரீமியம் மற்றும் செலவு பகிர்வு","Deductible":"கழிக்கத்தக்கது","Annual premiums":"ஆண்டு பிரீமியங்கள்","Total at low costs":"மொத்தம் குறைந்த செலவில்","Total at expected costs":"எதிர்பார்க்கப்பட்ட செலவில் மொத்தம்","Total at high costs":"அதிக செலவில் மொத்தம்","Cost sharing at low costs":"குறைந்த செலவில் செலவு பகிர்வு","Cost sharing at expected costs":"எதிர்பார்த்த செலவில் செலவு பகிர்வு","Cost sharing at high costs":"அதிக செலவில் செலவு பகிர்வு","Difference from lowest available deductible":"கிடைக்கக்கூடிய மிகக் குறைவான விலக்கிலிருந்து வேறுபாடு","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"பிரீமியம் சேமிப்பு பயன்படுத்தப்படும் மருத்துவச் செலவுகள்","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"உள்ளீடு செய்யப்பட்ட பிரீமியம் சேமிப்பு மாதிரியான செலவு-பகிர்வு வரம்பிற்குள் ரத்து செய்யப்படவில்லை.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"குறைந்த விலக்குக்கு எதிராக பிரீமியம் சேமிப்பு இல்லை.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"உள்ளீடு செய்யப்பட்ட விருப்பங்களில் மிகக் குறைந்த எதிர்பார்க்கப்பட்ட மொத்த","Scenario details":"காட்சி விவரங்கள்","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"மூன்று ஆர்டர் செய்யப்பட்ட மருத்துவச் செலவுக் காட்சிகள் மற்றும் குறைந்தபட்சம் இரண்டு கிடைக்கக்கூடிய விலக்குகளுக்கான மாதாந்திர பிரீமியங்களை உள்ளிடவும்.","Official rules and current premiums:":"அதிகாரப்பூர்வ விதிகள் மற்றும் தற்போதைய பிரீமியங்கள்:","Federal deductible rules":"ஃபெடரல் விலக்கு விதிகள்","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo அதிகாரப்பூர்வ பிரீமியம் ஒப்பீடு","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"இந்த உலாவியில் ஒப்பீடு கணக்கிடப்படுகிறது.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"வயதுக் குழு, ஆர்டர் செய்யப்பட்ட செலவு காட்சிகள் மற்றும் குறைந்தது இரண்டு மாதாந்திர பிரீமியங்களைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Entries cleared.":"பதிவுகள் அழிக்கப்பட்டன.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV உள்ளூரில் பதிவிறக்கம் செய்யப்பட்டது.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"சுவிஸ் ஹெல்த் பிரீமியம் குறைப்பு கால்குலேட்டர்","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"சுவிஸ் பிரீமியம் மானியக் கால்குலேட்டர் — உங்கள் நிகர பிரீமியம்","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"தற்போதைய பிரீமியத்தில் இருந்து நிகர சுவிஸ் ஹெல்த்-இன்சூரன்ஸ் பிரீமியத்தைக் கணக்கிடுங்கள் மற்றும் உங்கள் மண்டலத்தால் ஏற்கனவே வழங்கப்பட்ட மாதாந்திரக் குறைப்பு.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"உங்கள் காப்பீட்டாளர் அல்லது கன்டோனல் முடிவின் பிரீமியம் மற்றும் உறுதிப்படுத்தப்பட்ட மாதாந்திர குறைப்பை உள்ளிடவும். நீங்கள் தகுதியுடையவரா என்பதை இந்தக் கருவி தீர்மானிக்காது.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"சுவிஸ் மண்டலங்கள் யார் தகுதி பெறுகிறார்கள், எவ்வளவு ஆதரவு வழங்கப்படுகிறது மற்றும் விண்ணப்பம் தேவையா என்பதை தீர்மானிக்கிறது. இந்தக் கால்குலேட்டர் ஒரு பாலிசி பிரீமியத்திலிருந்து உறுதிப்படுத்தப்பட்ட மாதாந்திரக் குறைப்பை மட்டுமே கழிக்கிறது மற்றும் வருடாந்திரத் தொகையைக் காட்டுகிறது.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"மாதாந்திர பிரீமியம் CHF 420 மற்றும் உறுதிப்படுத்தப்பட்ட குறைப்பு CHF 120 எனில், மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட நிகர பிரீமியம் மாதத்திற்கு CHF 300 ஆகும்.","How the calculation works":"கணக்கீடு எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறது","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"நான் தகுதி பெற்றவனா என்பதை இது கூறுகிறதா?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"எண். தகுதி மற்றும் விருதுத் தொகைகள் வசிக்கும் மண்டலத்தால் தீர்மானிக்கப்படுகிறது. இணைக்கப்பட்ட அதிகாரப்பூர்வ தகவலைப் பயன்படுத்தவும் அல்லது மண்டல அலுவலகத்தைத் தொடர்பு கொள்ளவும்.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"குறைப்புத் தொகையை நான் எங்கே கண்டுபிடிப்பது?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"உங்கள் காப்பீட்டாளரால் காட்டப்படும் தற்போதைய முடிவு அல்லது குறைக்கப்பட்ட பிரீமியத்தைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். சில மண்டலங்கள் தானாகவே குறைப்புகளை வழங்குகின்றன; மற்றவர்களுக்கு விண்ணப்பம் தேவை.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"இது ஒரு கொள்கைக்கான எண்கணிதம், தகுதி அல்லது பலன் முடிவு அல்ல. இது வீட்டு வருமானம், சொத்துக்கள், குடும்ப நிலை, காலக்கெடு, மண்டல வரம்புகள் அல்லது விண்ணப்ப உரிமைகளை கணக்கிடாது. பிரீமியங்களும் விருதுகளும் மாறலாம்; உங்கள் காப்பீட்டாளர் மற்றும் மண்டலத்துடன் அவற்றை உறுதிப்படுத்தவும்.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"தற்போதைய மாதாந்திர பிரீமியம் (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"மாதாந்திர குறைப்பு ஏற்கனவே வழங்கப்பட்டது (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"கண்டன் அல்லது காப்பீட்டாளரால் உறுதிப்படுத்தப்பட்ட தொகையை உள்ளிடவும்; மதிப்பீட்டை விருதாக பயன்படுத்த வேண்டாம்.","Calculate net premium":"நிகர பிரீமியத்தைக் கணக்கிடுங்கள்","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"தற்போதைய பிரீமியம் மற்றும் உறுதிப்படுத்தப்பட்ட குறைப்பை உள்ளிடவும்.","Estimated premium after reduction":"குறைப்புக்குப் பிறகு மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட பிரீமியம்","Current monthly premium":"தற்போதைய மாதாந்திர பிரீமியம்","Monthly reduction":"மாதாந்திர குறைப்பு","Estimated net monthly premium":"மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட நிகர மாதாந்திர பிரீமியம்","Reduction over 12 months":"12 மாதங்களில் குறைப்பு","Reduction as a share of premium":"பிரீமியத்தின் பங்காகக் குறைப்பு","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"கணக்கீடு முடிந்தது. உங்கள் மண்டலம் மற்றும் காப்பீட்டாளரிடம் விருது மற்றும் பயனுள்ள தேதிகளை உறுதிப்படுத்தவும்.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"மாதாந்திர பிரீமியத்தை விடக் குறைப்பு அதிகமாக இல்லை என்பதைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"சுவிஸ் வாடகைக் குறிப்பு-விகித சூழ்நிலைக் கால்குலேட்டர்","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"சுவிஸ் வாடகை சரிசெய்தல் கால்குலேட்டர் — குறிப்பு விகித சூழ்நிலை","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"சுவிட்சர்லாந்தின் அடமானக் குறிப்பு விகிதத்தில் ஏற்படும் மாற்றம் குடியிருப்பு நிகர வாடகையை எவ்வாறு பாதிக்கிறது என்பதை மட்டும் மதிப்பிடவும். கூட்டாட்சி வீட்டுவசதி அலுவலகத்திலிருந்து சமீபத்திய கட்டணத்தைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"உங்கள் குத்தகை அல்லது சமீபத்திய வாடகை அறிவிப்பில் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ள குறிப்பு விகிதத்தை தற்போதைய அதிகாரப்பூர்வ சுவிஸ் கட்டணத்துடன் ஒப்பிடுக. கணக்கீடு உங்கள் சாதனத்தில் இருக்கும்.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"வீடுகளுக்கான ஃபெடரல் அலுவலகம் ஒவ்வொரு காலாண்டிலும் சுவிஸ் வாடகை மாற்றங்களுக்கான ஒரு அடமானக் குறிப்பு விகிதத்தை வெளியிடுகிறது. 0.25 சதவீத புள்ளி அதிகரிப்பு கொள்கையளவில் 3% வாடகை அதிகரிப்பை அனுமதிக்கும்; ஒரு 0.25-புள்ளி குறைப்பு கொள்கையளவில் 2.91% குறைப்பை அனுமதிக்கும். இந்த காட்சியானது நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் நிகர வாடகைக்கு படிப்படியாக அந்த மாற்றங்களைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"CHF 3,000 மாதாந்திர நிகர வாடகைக்கு, 1.75% முதல் 1.50% வரையிலான குறிப்பு-விகிதக் குறைப்பு, ஒரு மாதத்திற்கு சுமார் −CHF 87.38 (−2.91%) என மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட குறிப்பு-விகிதத்தில் மட்டுமே மாற்றத்தை அளிக்கிறது.","How this estimate works":"இந்த மதிப்பீடு எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறது","Where do I find the current rate?":"தற்போதைய விகிதத்தை நான் எங்கே கண்டுபிடிப்பது?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"இணைக்கப்பட்ட ஃபெடரல் ஆஃபீஸ் ஃபார் ஹவுசிங் பக்கத்தைத் திறந்து, தற்போது வெளியிடப்பட்ட கட்டணத்தை உள்ளிடவும். கருவியானது காலாவதியான விகிதத்தை உட்பொதிக்கவில்லை.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"நான் வாடகை மாற்றத்தைக் கோரலாமா என்பதை இது தீர்மானிக்கிறதா?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"எண். இது நோக்குநிலைக்கான ஒரு காரணியை தனிமைப்படுத்துகிறது. உங்கள் ஒப்பந்தம், பணவீக்கம், செலவு மாற்றங்கள், முன்பதிவுகள் மற்றும் பிற சட்ட நிபந்தனைகள் முடிவை மாற்றலாம்.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"முடிவில் துணை செலவுகள் உள்ளதா?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"எண். துணை செலவுகள் மற்றும் பிற மாறிக் கட்டணங்கள் தவிர்த்து, மாதாந்திர நிகர வாடகையை உள்ளிடவும்.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"முடிவு ஒரு விளக்கக் குறிப்பு-விகிதக் காட்சியாகும், சட்டக் கருத்து அல்லது முழுமையான வாடகை மதிப்பாய்வு அல்ல. இது பணவீக்கம், பொதுச் செலவு மாற்றங்கள், மேம்பாடுகள், ஒப்பந்த முன்பதிவுகள், அட்டவணைப்படுத்தப்பட்ட அல்லது படிநிலை வாடகைகள், அறிவிப்பு தேதிகள் மற்றும் கன்டோனல் நடைமுறைகளை விலக்குகிறது. செயல்படுவதற்கு முன் உங்கள் குத்தகை மற்றும் அதிகாரப்பூர்வ வழிகாட்டுதலை சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"சுவிஸ் குடியிருப்பு குத்தகைகள்: அடமான-குறிப்பு-விகித விளைவு மட்டுமே. இது ஒரு சட்ட முடிவு அல்லது முழு வாடகை மதிப்பாய்வு அல்ல.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"தற்போதைய மாதாந்திர நிகர வாடகை (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"உங்கள் குத்தகை அல்லது சமீபத்திய வாடகை அறிவிப்பில் குறிப்பிடப்பட்ட குறிப்பு விகிதம் (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"தற்போதைய அதிகாரப்பூர்வ சுவிஸ் குறிப்பு விகிதம் (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"குறிப்பு-விகித சூழ்நிலையை கணக்கிடவும்","Reference-rate-only scenario":"குறிப்பு விகிதம்-மட்டும் காட்சி","Current monthly net rent":"தற்போதைய மாதாந்திர நிகர வாடகை","Reference-rate change":"குறிப்பு-விகித மாற்றம்","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"குறிப்பு விகிதத்திலிருந்து மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட மாதாந்திர விளைவு","Scenario monthly net rent":"காட்சி மாதாந்திர நிகர வாடகை","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"12 மாதங்களுக்கு அதே விகிதத்தில் வருடாந்திர விளைவு","potential increase":"சாத்தியமான அதிகரிப்பு","potential decrease":"சாத்தியமான குறைவு","no reference-rate change":"குறிப்பு-விகித மாற்றம் இல்லை","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"மதிப்பீடு ஒவ்வொரு 0.25 சதவீத புள்ளி அதிகரிப்பிற்கும் 3% மற்றும் ஒவ்வொரு குறைவிற்கும் சமமான தலைகீழ் குறைப்புக்கு பொருந்தும். பிற காரணிகள் முடிவை மாற்றலாம்.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"இதில் பணவீக்கம், பொதுச் செலவு மாற்றங்கள், மேம்பாடுகள், ஒப்பந்த முன்பதிவுகள், அட்டவணைப்படுத்தப்பட்ட அல்லது படிநிலை வாடகைகள், அறிவிப்பு தேதிகள் அல்லது உள்ளூர் நடைமுறைத் தேவைகள் இல்லை. உங்கள் குத்தகை மற்றும் வீட்டு வழிகாட்டுதலுக்கான ஃபெடரல் அலுவலகத்தை சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"சமீபத்திய அதிகாரப்பூர்வ விலை மற்றும் வழிகாட்டுதலைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"வீடமைப்புக்கான சுவிஸ் ஃபெடரல் அலுவலகம் (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"ஒரு காட்சியைக் காண வாடகை மற்றும் இரண்டு கட்டணங்களையும் உள்ளிடவும்.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"காட்சி கணக்கிடப்பட்டது. அதை நம்புவதற்கு முன் தேதிகள் மற்றும் ஒப்பந்த விதிமுறைகளை சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"தொகைகள் மற்றும் விகிதங்களைச் சரிபார்க்கவும். விகிதங்கள் 0% மற்றும் 5% இடையே இருக்க வேண்டும் மற்றும் 0.25-புள்ளி படிகளில் வேறுபட வேண்டும்.","Inputs cleared.":"உள்ளீடுகள் அழிக்கப்பட்டன.","Result":"முடிவு","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"சுவிஸ் விடுமுறைக் கணக்கீட்டாளர்","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"சுவிஸ் விடுமுறை வரவு கால்குலேட்டர் — ப்ரோரேட்டட் லீவ் பேலன்ஸ்","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"உங்கள் ஒப்பந்தம், வேலை வாரம், வேலை தேதிகள் மற்றும் ஏற்கனவே எடுக்கப்பட்ட நாட்கள் ஆகியவற்றில் வருடாந்தர விடுப்பில் இருந்து சுவிஸ் விடுமுறை நாள் நிலுவையை மதிப்பிடவும்.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் உரிமை மற்றும் பணி அட்டவணையைப் பயன்படுத்தி ஒரு காலண்டர் ஆண்டிற்கான ஊதியத்துடன் கூடிய விடுமுறையை மதிப்பிடுங்கள். ஒப்பந்த விதிமுறைகள் எதுவும் யூகிக்கப்படவில்லை.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட வருடத்தில் பயன்படுத்தப்பட்ட காலண்டர் நாட்களின்படி உங்கள் ஒப்பந்தத்தில் உள்ள வருடாந்திர விடுப்பு நாட்களை மதிப்பீட்டாளர் கணக்கிடுகிறார். பகுதி நேர வேலைக்காக, வாரத்தில் உங்களின் வழக்கமான வேலை நாட்களையும், வாரங்களில் வருடாந்திர விடுமுறையையும் உள்ளிடவும்.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"நான்கு வார விடுப்பு, ஐந்து நாள் வேலை வாரம் மற்றும் ஆண்டு முழுவதும் வேலைவாய்ப்புடன், ஏற்கனவே எடுக்கப்பட்ட விடுப்பைக் கழிப்பதற்கு 20 வேலை நாட்களின் வருடாந்திர உரிமையாகும்.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"சுவிஸ் சட்டப்படி குறைந்தபட்சம் என்ன?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"ஃபெடரல் வழிகாட்டுதல் ஒரு சேவை ஆண்டுக்கு குறைந்தது நான்கு வாரங்கள் என்றும், 20 வயதை எட்டாத தொழிலாளர்களுக்கு ஐந்து வாரங்கள் என்றும் கூறுகிறது. ஒரு ஒப்பந்தம் அல்லது கூட்டு ஒப்பந்தம் அதிகமாக வழங்கலாம்.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"இது எனது சட்டப்பூர்வ சமநிலையை தீர்மானிக்கிறதா?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"எண். இது ஒரு எளிய காலண்டர்-நாள் விகிதமாகும். ஒப்பந்த விதிமுறைகள், பொருந்தக்கூடிய கூட்டு விதிகள், தகுதி இல்லாதவர்கள், ரவுண்டிங் மற்றும் பணியமர்த்துபவர் பதிவுகள் சமநிலையை மாற்றலாம்.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"இந்த மதிப்பீடு சட்டப்பூர்வ உரிமையை தீர்மானிக்கவோ விடுமுறை ஊதியத்தை கணக்கிடவோ இல்லை. சில நீண்ட கால இடைவெளிகள், ஒப்பந்தம் சார்ந்த வருவாய் மற்றும் ரவுண்டிங் விதிகள், பொது விடுமுறைகள், கூடுதல் நேரம், கேரி-ஓவர் டெட்லைன்கள் மற்றும் தகராறுகளுக்கான குறைப்புகளை இது விலக்குகிறது. உங்கள் ஒப்பந்தத்தைச் சரிபார்த்து, போட்டி நிலுவைக்கான ஆலோசனையைப் பெறவும்.","Leave year":"விடுமுறை ஆண்டு","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"உங்கள் ஒப்பந்தத்தில் (வாரங்கள்) வருடாந்திர விடுப்பு","Usual working days per week":"வாரத்திற்கு வழக்கமான வேலை நாட்கள்","Employment start date":"வேலைவாய்ப்பு தொடங்கும் தேதி","Employment end date":"வேலைவாய்ப்பு முடிவு தேதி","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"இந்த விடுமுறை ஆண்டில் ஏற்கனவே எடுக்கப்பட்ட விடுமுறை நாட்கள்","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"நோக்குநிலைக்கு மட்டும். ஒப்பந்தத்தின் வருடாந்திர உரிமையை உள்ளிடவும்; சட்டப்பூர்வ குறைந்தபட்சம் பொதுவாக நான்கு வாரங்கள் அல்லது 20 வயதிற்குட்பட்ட தொழிலாளர்களுக்கு ஐந்து வாரங்கள் ஆகும்.","Estimate balance":"மதிப்பீட்டு இருப்பு","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"உங்கள் ஒப்பந்தம் மற்றும் தேதிகளை உள்ளிடவும்.","Estimated leave balance":"மதிப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்ட விடுப்பு இருப்பு","Annual leave at this schedule":"இந்த அட்டவணையில் வருடாந்திர விடுப்பு","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"இந்த விடுமுறை ஆண்டில் பயன்படுத்தப்படும் காலண்டர் நாட்கள்","Prorated days accrued":"சம்பாதித்த நாட்கள்","Days already taken":"ஏற்கனவே எடுக்கப்பட்ட நாட்கள்","Estimated days remaining":"கணிக்கப்பட்ட நாட்கள் மீதமுள்ளன","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"இது வேலைக் காலத்தில் காலண்டர் நாட்களின் வருடாந்தர விடுப்புக்கு இணையானதாகும். முதலாளி மற்றும் ஒப்பந்த விதிகள் வேறுபடலாம்.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"மதிப்பீடு கணக்கிடப்பட்டது. உங்கள் ஒப்பந்தம் மற்றும் முதலாளியின் பதிவுகளுக்கு எதிராக அதைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"ஆண்டு, தேதிகள், பணி அட்டவணை மற்றும் மதிப்புகளைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்."},"fa":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"سناریوی کمک هزینه بیکاری سوئیس","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"ماشین حساب مزایای بیکاری سوئیس — سناریوی ناخالص","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"دستمزد ناخالص روزانه سوئیس را با استفاده از حقوق بیمه شده و نرخ تایید شده توسط صندوق خود تخمین بزنید.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"حقوق بیمه شده و نرخ 70% یا 80% تایید شده توسط صندوق بیکاری خود را وارد کنید.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"قوانین سوئیس نرخ کمک هزینه و سقف حقوق را تعیین می کنند. صندوق در مورد واجد شرایط بودن، کسورات، روزهای انتظار و استحقاق تصمیم می گیرد. محدوده ماهانه 20 تا 23 روزهای هفته قابل پرداخت را منعکس می کند.","Example":"مثال","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"5000 CHF با 70% حدود 161.29 فرانک فرانک در هر روز هفته قابل پرداخت است.","How it works":"چگونه کار می کند","Questions":"سوالات","Scope and limits":"دامنه و محدودیت ها","Related tools":"ابزارهای مرتبط","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"حقوق بیمه شده ماهانه (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"نرخ تایید شده توسط صندوق","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"برآورد","Clear":"روشن","Gross scenario":"سناریوی بزرگ","Insured salary used":"حقوق بیمه شده استفاده شده","Per payable weekday":"در هر روز هفته قابل پرداخت","20-day month":"ماه 20 روزه","23-day month":"ماه 23 روزه","Official benefit rules":"قوانین مزایا رسمی","Enter your confirmed figures.":"اعداد تایید شده خود را وارد کنید.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"سناریو محاسبه شده است. مبالغ را با صندوق خود تأیید کنید.","Check the values.":"مقادیر را بررسی کنید.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"برنامه ریز اعلامیه اجاره سوئیس","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"برنامه ریز اعلامیه اجاره سوئیس و پیش نویس نامه","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"اطلاعیه اجاره را از تاریخ ها و شرایط قرارداد خود برنامه ریزی کنید. یک نامه بدون فرض قوانین کانتون تهیه کنید.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"دوره اعلان، روز فسخ معتبر بعدی قرارداد و تاریخ دریافت را وارد کنید. هر تاریخ را با انجمن صاحبخانه یا مستاجران خود بررسی کنید.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"برنامه ریز فقط تاریخ ها و دوره هایی را که شما ارائه می کنید اعمال می کند. این تصمیم نمی گیرد که آیا اخطار معتبر است، چه زمانی به طور قانونی دریافت می شود یا اینکه حمایت ویژه اعمال می شود.","Contract notice period (months)":"دوره اعلان قرارداد (ماه)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"روز فسخ معتبر بعدی ماه (از قرارداد)","Expected receipt date":"تاریخ دریافت مورد انتظار","Your name":"نام شما","Your address":"آدرس شما","Landlord / agency":"مالک / نمایندگی","Recipient address":"آدرس گیرنده","Rental property":"ملک اجاره ای","Place":"مکان","Letter date":"تاریخ نامه","Termination of tenancy":"فسخ اجاره","Calculate date and draft letter":"تاریخ و پیش نویس نامه را محاسبه کنید","Planning date":"تاریخ برنامه ریزی","Target date":"تاریخ هدف","Editable draft":"پیش نویس قابل ویرایش","Copy draft":"کپی پیش نویس","Enter your contract terms.":"شرایط قرارداد خود را وارد کنید.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"پیش نویس برنامه آماده است. در مقابل قرارداد خود تأیید کنید.","Check the dates and period.":"تاریخ و دوره را بررسی کنید.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"نتیجه از روز اطلاعیه قرارداد ارائه شده است. این یک حکم اخطاری قانونی نیست.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"سناریوی افزایش املاک سوئیس","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"مالیات بر عایدی املاک سوئیس — سناریوی نرخ وارد شده توسط کاربر","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"با استفاده از هزینه های تراکنش خود و نرخ مالیات از کانتون مسئول، سود دارایی را برآورد کنید.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"درآمدها، هزینه خرید، هزینه‌های واجد شرایطی که تأیید کرده‌اید و نرخ مؤثر را از ماشین حساب رسمی کانتون وارد کنید.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"مالیات بر عایدی دارایی سوئیس بر اساس کانتون، دوره نگهداری، کسورات و موارد متفاوت است. این ابزار نرخ ها یا هزینه های قابل قبول را تعیین نمی کند.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"درآمد فروش (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"هزینه اکتساب (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"سایر هزینه ها قابل قبول است (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"نرخ مالیات مؤثر از منبع رسمی (%)","Estimate scenario":"تخمین سناریو","Illustrative scenario":"سناریوی گویا","Gain entered":"بهره وارد شد","Tax at entered rate":"مالیات با نرخ درج شده","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"ارقام را از سوابق و منبع کانتون خود وارد کنید.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"سناریو محاسبه شده; آن را با کانتون تأیید کنید.","Check amounts and rate.":"مقدار و نرخ را بررسی کنید.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"هیچ جدول مالیات کانتون تعبیه شده است. نرخ موثر وارد شده شما تخمین را هدایت می کند.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"سناریوی مالیات بر ارث و هدیه سوئیس","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"مالیات بر ارث و هدیه سوئیس - سناریوی نرخ شما","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"مبلغ مالیاتی را از معافیت و نرخ وارد شده توسط کاربر تخمین بزنید. قوانین بر اساس کانتون و رابطه متفاوت است.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"مبلغ، معافیت و نرخ مؤثر تأیید شده برای گیرنده و کانتون را وارد کنید.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"قوانین کانتون و روابط خانوادگی می توانند معافیت ها و نرخ ها را تغییر دهند. این ابزار یک قانون کانتون را انتخاب نمی کند یا بدهی مالیاتی را تعیین نمی کند.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"مقدار ارث یا هدیه (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"تأیید معافیت با کانتون (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"نرخ مؤثر با کانتون تأیید شد (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"مبلغ پس از معافیت درج شده","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"اعداد تایید شده برای مورد خود را وارد کنید.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"تخمین فقط از معافیت و نرخی که وارد می‌کنید استفاده می‌کند.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"سناریوی بودجه حمایت از کودکان سوئیس","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"بودجه حمایت از کودکان سوئیس — سناریوی شفاف خانواده","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"بودجه وارد شده فرزند را بر اساس درآمد والدین پس از اعتبار هزینه مستقیم وارد شده اختصاص دهید.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"از نیازهای مستند شده ماهانه کودک، درآمد ماهانه موجود والدین و هر گونه هزینه مستقیمی که می خواهید اعتبار دهید، استفاده کنید.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"این فقط یک کاربرگ برنامه ریزی است. این یک جایزه یا روش قانونی سوئیسی برای نفقه کودک نیست. مسکن، مراقبت، مالیات، مزایا و قانون مورد ارزیابی نمی شود.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"بودجه ماهانه کودکی که مستند کردید (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"درآمد ماهیانه در دسترس والدین A (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"درآمد ماهیانه موجود والدین B (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"هزینه‌های مستقیم فرزند توسط والدین A به اعتبار (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"تخصیص سناریو","Illustrative allocation":"تخصیص گویا","Parent A remaining contribution":"والدین یک سهم باقیمانده","Parent B contribution":"سهم والدین B","Entered monthly child budget":"بودجه ماهانه کودک وارد شده است","Enter your household budget figures.":"ارقام بودجه خانوار خود را وارد کنید.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"سناریوی بودجه محاسبه شد. در مورد تعهدات قانونی با یک مشاور واجد شرایط صحبت کنید.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"میزان را بررسی کنید. اعتبار نمی تواند بیش از بودجه باشد.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"سهام متناسب با دو درآمد وارد شده است. اعتبار هزینه مستقیم ابتدا کم می شود.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"پیش نمایش خط خطی مرورگر","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"پیش‌نمایش خط خطی کلمه — الگوهای زبان مرورگر","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"پیش‌نمایش خط خطی مرورگر برای متنی که ارائه می‌کنید. پشتیبانی به مرورگر و منابع زبان نصب شده بستگی دارد.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"زبانی را انتخاب کنید که با متن شما مطابقت دارد، یک نمونه وارد کنید و عرض خط موجود را تنظیم کنید.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"از خط خط CSS اصلی مرورگر استفاده می کند. لغت نامه ها را جمع نمی کند. مرورگرهای پشتیبانی نشده ممکن است هیچ خط فاصله ای نشان ندهند. کپی کردن متن، املای اصلی را حفظ می کند.","Text language (BCP 47)":"زبان متن (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"عرض پیش نمایش (نویسه)","Text to preview":"متن برای پیش نمایش","Preview":"پیش نمایش","Enter text and choose its language.":"متن را وارد کنید و زبان آن را انتخاب کنید.","Preview updated.":"پیش نمایش به روز شد.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"یک برچسب زبان و متن پشتیبانی شده را وارد کنید.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"یک پاراگراف را در عرض های مختلف امتحان کنید تا ببینید مرورگر کجا می تواند کلمات را بشکند.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"فضای کاری املای خصوصی","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"غلط‌گیر املای محلی — از فرهنگ لغت مرورگر خود استفاده کنید","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"متن را با املای بومی مرورگر ویرایش کنید، زبانی را انتخاب کنید و متن اصلاح شده را کپی کنید.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"متن در این صفحه باقی می ماند. زبانی را تنظیم کنید که مرورگر شما برای آن فرهنگ لغت املا داشته باشد، سپس از منوی املای آن استفاده کنید یا زیر پیشنهادات خط بکشید.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"این فضای کاری متنی را آپلود نمی کند یا فرهنگ لغت ارسال نمی کند. در دسترس بودن بررسی املای مرورگر و پیشنهادات به دستگاه، مرورگر و فرهنگ لغت نصب شده بستگی دارد.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"زبان بررسی املا (BCP 47)","Text to check":"پیامک برای بررسی","Copy text":"کپی متن","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"متن را تایپ یا جایگذاری کنید. برای پیشنهادات، کلیک راست کنید یا از منوی املای دستگاه خود استفاده کنید.","Text copied.":"متن کپی شد.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"به طور خودکار کپی نمی شود. متن را انتخاب و کپی کنید.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"مرورگر بدون فرهنگ لغت منطبق ممکن است اشتباهات املایی را علامت گذاری نکند.","Resume Structure Checker":"بررسی ساختار رزومه\nبررسی رزومه","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS — بررسی رایگان محلی PDF و DOCX","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"متن رزومه، عناوین، بخش ها، پیوندها و ساختار گلوله را در مرورگر خود بررسی کنید. مقایسه شرایط شرح شغل بر اساس تعداد. بدون امتیاز استخدام یا آپلود.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"آنچه را که یک رزومه مبتنی بر متن واقعاً نشان می‌دهد، مرور کنید: متن استخراج‌شده، ساختار عنوان، حضور در میدان تماس، پیوندها و بخش‌های رایج. به صورت اختیاری، اصطلاحات مکرر شرح شغل را مقایسه کنید.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"یک DOCX با سبک‌های سرفصل 1 برای تجربه و آموزش آن سرفصل‌ها را نشان می‌دهد. یک PDF از متن قابل انتخاب آن بررسی می شود. ستون ها ممکن است به ترتیب متفاوت خوانده شوند.\nفایل‌های","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX به صورت محلی به عنوان Office ZIP/XML بازرسی می‌شوند. پی دی اف ها با موتور محلی PDF.js معوق خوانده می شوند. مقایسه اختیاری شرح شغل، عبارات انتخابی را در هر متن شمارش می کند. امتیازی ایجاد نمی کند یا توصیه نمی کند کسی را استخدام کنید.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"این یک بررسی قالب و ساختار متن است، نه شبیه‌ساز ATS، بررسی قانونی یا پیش‌بینی موفقیت در مصاحبه. PDF های اسکن شده بدون متن قابل انتخاب ابتدا به OCR نیاز دارند. اسناد محافظت شده با رمز عبور، ماکرو فعال، امضا شده یا غیرعادی بزرگ پشتیبانی نمی شوند.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"انتخاب رزومه (PDF یا DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"فایل های شما در این مرورگر باقی می مانند و آپلود نمی شوند. حداکثر 20 مگابایت؛ PDF تا 50 صفحه. محتوای توسعه یافته DOCX 80 مگابایت محدود شده است.","Optional job description":"شرح شغل اختیاری","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"اگر می‌خواهید یک مقایسه فرکانس-اصطلاح داشته باشید، متن ساده را جای‌گذاری کنید. اطلاعات حساسی را که نیازی به تجزیه و تحلیل ندارید درج نکنید.","Paste job-description text here…":"متن شرح کار را اینجا جای‌گذاری کنید…","Analyze locally":"تحلیل محلی","Clear files and report":"پاک کردن فایل ها و گزارش","Resume review":"بازبینی رزومه","File type":"نوع فایل","Extracted characters":"کاراکترهای استخراج شده","Words counted":"کلمات حساب شده","Detected headings":"عنوان شناسایی شده","Recognized sections":"قطعات شناخته شده","Hyperlinks found":"هایپرلینک پیدا شد","Bullet paragraphs":"بندهای گلوله","An email address appears in the text":"یک آدرس ایمیل در متن ظاهر می شود","No email address pattern was detected":"هیچ الگوی آدرس ایمیل شناسایی نشد","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"الگویی شبیه شماره تلفن در متن ظاهر می شود","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"الگویی شبیه شماره تلفن شناسایی نشد","Job-description terms (counts only)":"شرایط شرح شغل (فقط شمارش)","Term":"مدت","In job text":"در متن شغل","In resume":"در رزومه","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"یک شرح شغل را برای مقایسه تعداد ترم ها جایگذاری کنید.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"هیچ سبک عنوان واضحی شناسایی نشد. عناوین PDF از اندازه متن تخمین زده می شوند و ممکن است نادرست باشند.","Detected":"تشخیص داده شد","Not detected":"شناسایی نشد","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"این اکتشافی مجموعه محدودی از نام بخش های رایج را تشخیص می دهد. این تصمیم نمی گیرد که کدام بخش مورد نیاز است.","Profile / summary":"نمایه / خلاصه","Experience":"تجربه","Education":"آموزش","Skills":"مهارت","Contact":"تماس","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"هیچ متن قابل انتخابی یافت نشد. PDFهای فقط اسکن شده قبل از بررسی نیاز به OCR دارند.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"برای شروع یک رزومه PDF یا DOCX را انتخاب کنید.","Reading the selected file locally…":"خواندن فایل انتخابی به صورت محلی…","Local structure review complete.":"بررسی ساختار محلی کامل شد.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"این مرورگر از ویژگی سند محلی مورد نیاز پشتیبانی نمی کند.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"یک فایل PDF معتبر یا DOCX مدرن تا محدودیت های محلی اعلام شده انتخاب کنید.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF قابل خواندن نیست. ممکن است آسیب دیده، رمزگذاری شده باشد یا حاوی متن قابل انتخاب نباشد.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"بسته DOCX را نمی توان با خیال راحت باز کرد یا خواند.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"آیا این ابزار رزومه من را آپلود می کند یا ذخیره می کند؟","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"شماره. تجزیه و تحلیل در مرورگر شما اجرا می شود. پس از پاک کردن گزارش یا خروج از صفحه، متن فایل به سرور ارسال نمی‌شود یا حفظ نمی‌شود.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"آیا پیش بینی می کند که آیا ATS یا کارفرما رزومه من را می پذیرد؟","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"شماره. فقط متن قابل خواندن و ساختار ساده را بررسی می کند. سیستم‌های استخدام متفاوت هستند، و این تضمین سازگاری ATS یا پیش‌بینی استخدام نیست.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"آیا می تواند PDF اسکن شده را بخواند؟","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"فقط در صورتی که PDF یک لایه متن قابل انتخاب داشته باشد. این چکر مدل های OCR را دانلود نمی کند. ابتدا از یک ابزار OCR برای یک سند فقط تصویر اسکن شده استفاده کنید.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"مقایسه شرح شغل به چه معناست؟","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"شمارش عبارات تکرار شونده را پس از عادی سازی ساده نشان می دهد. این یک درصد تطابق، رتبه، توصیه یا ارزیابی مدارک شما نیست.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"چرا یک PDF عناوین کمتری نسبت به DOCX نشان می دهد؟","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF ها معمولاً سبک های عنوان معنایی را حفظ نمی کنند. جستجوگر خطوط برجسته را از اندازه متن و ترتیب خواندن تخمین می زند، بنابراین ستون ها و طراحی بصری می توانند بر روی نتیجه تأثیر بگذارند.","How local resume review works":"نحوه بررسی رزومه محلی","Resume checker questions":"سوالات جستجوگر رزومه","Scope and limitations":"دامنه و محدودیت ها","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"جداکننده آواز و همراهی محلی","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"حذف کننده آواز — آواز و همراهی جداگانه به صورت محلی","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"یک نمونه صوتی استریو کوتاه را به آواز تخمینی و همراهی در مرورگر خود جدا کنید. صدا در دستگاه شما باقی می ماند. این مدل از میزبان عمومی خود دانلود می شود.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"یک کلیپ موسیقی استریو تا 30 ثانیه انتخاب کنید. در اولین استفاده، مرورگر یک مدل 35.6 مگابایتی را دانلود می کند. فایل صوتی در این دستگاه پردازش می شود و هرگز آپلود نمی شود.","What you get":"آنچه به دست می آورید","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"پیش‌نمایش و دانلود دو پایه WAV: آواز تخمینی و همراهی باقی‌مانده. نتایج به ترکیب بستگی دارد و ممکن است حاوی مصنوعات باشد.","Local processing":"پردازش محلی","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"این ابزار از شبکه آواز Open-Unmix UMX-HQ استفاده می کند که به ONNX و ONNX Runtime Web صادر شده است. مدل تنها زمانی واکشی می شود که Separate را فشار دهید. هیچ API استنتاج پرداختی یا اشتراکی استفاده نمی شود. صدا به صورت محلی رمزگشایی، پردازش و صادر می شود.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"این یک تخمین برای پردازش استریو 44.1 کیلوهرتز و کلیپ تا 30 ثانیه است. منابع مونو به استریو کپی شده اند. آوازهایی که عمیقاً در سازها ترکیب شده اند، جلوه های سنگین، ضبط زنده و ژانرهای غیرمعمول می توانند نشت یا مصنوعات ایجاد کنند. از نتیجه به عنوان یک استاد تمیز استفاده نکنید. دانلود مدل نیاز به اتصال به اینترنت دارد. صدا از این دستگاه خارج نمی شود.","Is my audio uploaded?":"آیا صدای من آپلود شده است؟","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"شماره. صدای انتخاب شده در مرورگر شما رمزگشایی و پردازش می شود. تنها درخواست شبکه دانلود مدل هنگام شروع جداسازی است.","Why is the first run slow?":"چرا اولین اجرا کند است؟","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"مرورگر یک مدل 35.6 مگابایتی را یک بار دانلود می کند. ممکن است مرورگر آن را کش کند. سپس Inference به صورت محلی روی CPU دستگاه اجرا می شود.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"آیا هر آهنگ به طور تمیز جدا می شود؟","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"شماره. مدل یک ساقه صوتی را تخمین می زند و ممکن است نشت آوازی را ترک کند، هارمونیک های ساز را حذف کند یا مصنوعاتی ایجاد کند. قبل از تکیه بر ساقه گوش کنید.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"فایل صوتی استریو (حداکثر 30 ثانیه)","Choose audio":"صوت را انتخاب کنید","Separate vocals":"آواز مجزا","Cancel / clear":"لغو / پاک کردن","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"یک فایل صوتی کوتاه را برای شروع انتخاب کنید.","Downloading the separation model…":"دانلود مدل جداسازی…","Separating locally…":"جداسازی محلی…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"جداسازی کامل شد. پیش نمایش یا دانلود هر یک از پایه ها.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"این فایل پردازش یا مدل بارگیری نشد. فرمت و اتصال را بررسی کنید، سپس دوباره امتحان کنید.","Model and weight license information":"اطلاعات مجوز مدل و وزن","Estimated vocals":"خواننده تخمینی","Estimated accompaniment":"همراهی تخمینی","Download WAV":"دانلود WAV","Progress":"پیشرفت","Preparing local separation…":"آماده سازی جداسازی محلی…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"جداسازی کامل شد. صدا در این دستگاه باقی ماند.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"این صدا قابل پردازش نیست. یک فایل موسیقی استریو کمتر از 30 ثانیه را امتحان کنید.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"مقایسه فرانشیز بیمه سلامت سوئیس","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"ماشین حساب حق بیمه بیمه سلامت سوئیس — مقایسه هزینه های سالانه","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"فرانشیزهای بیمه درمانی پایه سوئیس را با استفاده از حق بیمه و هزینه های پزشکی سالانه واجد شرایطی که وارد می کنید، مقایسه کنید. هیچ قیمت بیمه ای حدس زده نمی شود.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"حق بیمه‌های ماهانه نشان‌داده‌شده توسط همان بیمه‌گر را برای هر فرانشیزی که ارائه می‌کند وارد کنید، سپس سناریوهای هزینه درمان سالانه پایین، مورد انتظار و بالا را مقایسه کنید.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"برای بیمه درمانی پایه اجباری سوئیس، فرانشیز استاندارد بزرگسالان 300 CHF و فرانشیز کودک 0 CHF است. سطوح اختیاری بر اساس گروه سنی متفاوت است. پس از کسر، هزینه نگهداری استاندارد 10٪ از هزینه های باقیمانده واجد شرایط است که سقف آن 700 فرانک فرانک در سال برای بزرگسالان و 350 CHF برای کودکان است. این ابزار حق بیمه وارد شده شما را به این تقسیم هزینه مدل شده اضافه می کند. نرخ های بیمه گر را دریافت نمی کند یا تصمیم نمی گیرد که کدام گزینه برای شما مناسب است.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"اگر یک بزرگسال حق بیمه ماهیانه 400 فرانک فرانک را با کسر 300 فرانک فرانک و 350 فرانک فرانک را با کسر 2500 فرانک فرانک دریافت کند، تفاوت حق بیمه سالانه 600 فرانک فرانک است.","How the estimate works":"تخمین چگونه کار می کند","Common questions":"سوالات رایج","Scope and exclusions":"محدوده و استثنائات","Where do I get the premiums?":"حق بیمه را از کجا دریافت کنم؟","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"از پیشنهادات ماهانه جاری برای همان بیمه‌گر، منطقه حق بیمه، گروه سنی، پوشش حوادث و مدل بیمه استفاده کنید. Priminfo سایت رسمی مقایسه فدرال است. این صفحه مظنه های بیمه گر را واکشی یا بازتولید نمی کند.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"آیا همه سطوح کسر فهرست شده همیشه ارائه می شوند؟","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"شماره. بیمه‌گران مجبور نیستند هر سطح اختیاری را ارائه دهند، و پیشنهادات ممکن است برای بزرگسالان جوان متفاوت باشد. فقط حق بیمه های نشان داده شده برای خط مشی خود را وارد کنید. گزینه های در دسترس را خالی بگذارید","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"آیا این صورت حساب پزشکی کامل من را نشان می دهد؟","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"شماره. این مدل هزینه های 10 درصدی معمولی و استاندارد را در هزینه های واجد شرایط پوشش می دهد. این شامل کمک های روزانه بیمارستان، 40٪ نگهداری داروی ویژه، خدمات معاف، مراقبت های غیر تحت پوشش و بیمه تکمیلی نمی شود.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"این یک مقایسه سناریو است، نه بیمه، مشاوره پزشکی یا مالی. درمان یا حق بیمه شما را پیش بینی نمی کند. کمک‌های روزانه بیمارستان (معمولاً 15 فرانک فرانک در هر روز بستری، با معافیت‌های قانونی)، 40% نگهداری ویژه در برخی داروها، معافیت‌های زایمان/پیشگیری، خدمات خارج از پوشش اجباری، یارانه‌های حق بیمه و بیمه تکمیلی را شامل نمی‌شود. بنابراین مشارکت واقعی می تواند متفاوت باشد. فرانشیز بالاتر به این معنی است که در صورت دریافت مراقبت باید بتوانید پیش پرداخت بیشتری بپردازید.","Who is insured under this policy?":"چه کسانی تحت این بیمه نامه بیمه می شوند؟","Adult (age 19 or over)":"بزرگسال (۱۹ سال یا بیشتر)","Child (under 18)":"کودک (زیر 18 سال)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"سناریوی کم هزینه درمان واجد شرایط سالانه (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"هزینه‌های قابل انتظار سالانه درمان (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"سناریوی هزینه درمان واجد شرایط بالا (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"حق بیمه ماهانه از یک شرکت بیمه","Monthly premium":"حق بیمه ماهانه","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"فقط گزینه های ارائه شده برای همین خط مشی را وارد کنید. دیگران را خالی بگذارید.","Adult deductible choices":"گزینه های کسر برای بزرگسالان","Child deductible choices":"انتخاب های کسر فرزند","Compare annual costs":"مقایسه هزینه های سالانه","Clear entries":"پاک کردن ورودی ها","Download CSV":"دانلود CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"حق بیمه سالانه تخمینی به اضافه اشتراک هزینه","Deductible":"قابل کسر","Annual premiums":"حق بیمه سالانه","Total at low costs":"مجموع با هزینه کم","Total at expected costs":"مجموع با هزینه های مورد انتظار","Total at high costs":"مجموع با هزینه های بالا","Cost sharing at low costs":"به اشتراک گذاری هزینه با هزینه کم","Cost sharing at expected costs":"به اشتراک گذاری هزینه در هزینه های مورد انتظار","Cost sharing at high costs":"به اشتراک گذاری هزینه با هزینه های بالا","Difference from lowest available deductible":"تفاوت با کمترین کسر موجود","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"هزینه های پزشکی که در آن صرفه جویی حق بیمه تمام می شود","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"پس انداز حق بیمه وارد شده در محدوده تقسیم هزینه مدل‌سازی شده لغو نمی‌شود.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"بدون صرفه جویی در حق بیمه در برابر کمترین کسر.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"کمترین کل مورد انتظار در بین گزینه های وارد شده","Scenario details":"جزئیات سناریو","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"سه سناریو هزینه پزشکی سفارش داده شده و حق بیمه ماهانه حداقل برای دو کسر موجود را وارد کنید.","Official rules and current premiums:":"قوانین رسمی و حق بیمه فعلی:","Federal deductible rules":"قوانین کسر فدرال","Priminfo official premium comparison":"مقایسه پریمیوم رسمی پریمفو","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"مقایسه در این مرورگر محاسبه شده است.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"گروه سنی، سناریوهای هزینه سفارش داده شده و حداقل دو حق بیمه ماهانه را بررسی کنید.","Entries cleared.":"ورودی ها پاک شدند.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV به صورت محلی دانلود شده است.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"ماشین حساب کاهش حق بیمه سلامت سوئیس","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"محاسب یارانه حق بیمه سوئیس — حق بیمه خالص شما","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"حق بیمه خالص بیمه سلامت سوئیس را از حق بیمه فعلی و کاهش ماهانه ای که قبلاً توسط ایالت شما اعطا شده است، محاسبه کنید.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"حق بیمه و کاهش ماهانه تایید شده را از تصمیم بیمه گر یا ایالتی خود وارد کنید. این ابزار تعیین نمی کند که آیا شما واجد شرایط هستید یا خیر.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"کانتون‌های سوئیس تعیین می‌کنند که چه کسی واجد شرایط است، چه میزان پشتیبانی اعطا می‌شود و آیا به درخواست نیاز است یا خیر. این ماشین حساب فقط یک کاهش ماهانه تایید شده را از یک حق بیمه بیمه کم می کند و مبلغ سالانه را نشان می دهد.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"اگر حق بیمه ماهانه 420 فرانک فرانک و کاهش تایید شده 120 فرانک فرانک باشد، حق بیمه خالص تخمینی 300 فرانک فرانک در ماه است.","How the calculation works":"نحوه محاسبه","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"آیا این به من می گوید که واجد شرایط هستم؟","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"شماره. میزان واجد شرایط بودن و جایزه توسط کانتون محل اقامت تعیین می شود. از اطلاعات رسمی مرتبط استفاده کنید یا با دفتر کانتون تماس بگیرید.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"مبلغ کاهش را از کجا پیدا کنم؟","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"از تصمیم فعلی یا حق بیمه کاهش یافته نشان داده شده توسط بیمه گر خود استفاده کنید. برخی از کانتون ها به طور خودکار کاهش می دهند. دیگران نیاز به یک برنامه دارند.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"این حساب برای یک سیاست است، نه یک تصمیم واجد شرایط بودن یا سود. درآمد خانوار، دارایی‌ها، وضعیت خانواده، مهلت‌ها، آستانه کانتونی یا حقوق درخواست را محاسبه نمی‌کند. حق بیمه و جوایز می توانند تغییر کنند. آنها را با بیمه گر و کانتون خود تأیید کنید.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"حق بیمه فعلی ماهانه (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"کاهش ماهانه قبلاً اعطا شده است (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"مبلغ تایید شده توسط کانتون یا بیمه‌گر را وارد کنید. از تخمین به عنوان جایزه استفاده نکنید.","Calculate net premium":"حق بیمه خالص را محاسبه کنید","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"حق بیمه فعلی و کاهش تایید شده را وارد کنید.","Estimated premium after reduction":"حق بیمه تخمینی پس از کاهش","Current monthly premium":"حق بیمه فعلی ماهانه","Monthly reduction":"کاهش ماهانه","Estimated net monthly premium":"حق بیمه خالص ماهانه تخمینی","Reduction over 12 months":"کاهش بیش از 12 ماه","Reduction as a share of premium":"کاهش به عنوان سهم حق بیمه","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"محاسبه کامل شد. جایزه و تاریخ های موثر را با کانتون و بیمه گر خود تأیید کنید.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"بررسی کنید که کاهش بیشتر از حق بیمه ماهانه نباشد.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"ماشین حساب سناریوی نرخ مرجع اجاره سوئیس","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"ماشین حساب تعدیل اجاره سوئیسی — سناریوی نرخ مرجع","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"فقط تخمین بزنید که تغییر در نرخ مرجع وام مسکن سوئیس چگونه بر اجاره خالص مسکونی تأثیر می گذارد. از آخرین نرخ دفتر مسکن فدرال استفاده کنید.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"نرخ مرجع ذکر شده در اجاره نامه یا آخرین اطلاعیه اجاره خود را با نرخ رسمی فعلی سوئیس مقایسه کنید. محاسبه روی دستگاه شما باقی می ماند.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"دفتر فدرال مسکن هر سه ماهه یک نرخ مرجع وام مسکن را برای تعدیل اجاره بهای سوئیس منتشر می کند. افزایش 0.25 درصدی در اصل می تواند افزایش 3 درصدی اجاره بها را فراهم کند. کاهش 0.25 واحدی در اصل می تواند باعث کاهش 2.91٪ شود. این سناریو این تغییرات را گام به گام در اجاره خالصی که وارد می‌کنید اعمال می‌کند.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"برای اجاره خالص ماهیانه 3000 فرانک، کاهش نرخ مرجع از 1.75٪ به 1.50٪، تغییر تخمینی نرخ مرجع را در حدود -87.38 CHF در ماه (-2.91٪) نشان می دهد.","How this estimate works":"این تخمین چگونه کار می کند","Where do I find the current rate?":"نرخ فعلی را از کجا پیدا کنم؟","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"صفحه مرتبط شده اداره فدرال مسکن را باز کنید و نرخ فعلی منتشر شده را وارد کنید. این ابزار نرخی را تعبیه نمی کند که ممکن است قدیمی شود.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"آیا این تصمیم می‌گیرد که آیا می‌توانم درخواست تغییر اجاره‌بکنم؟","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"شماره این یک عامل را برای جهت گیری جدا می کند. قرارداد، تورم، تغییرات هزینه، رزرو و سایر شرایط قانونی شما می تواند نتیجه را تغییر دهد.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"آیا نتیجه شامل هزینه های جانبی می شود؟","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"شماره. خالص اجاره ماهانه را بدون احتساب هزینه های جانبی و سایر هزینه های متغیر وارد کنید.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"نتیجه یک سناریوی گویای نرخ مرجع است، نه یک نظر قانونی یا بررسی کامل اجاره. تورم، تغییرات هزینه عمومی، بهبودها، رزروهای قراردادی، اجاره های شاخص یا پلکانی، تاریخ های اطلاع رسانی و رویه کانتونی را استثنا نمی کند. قبل از اقدام، اجاره نامه و راهنمای رسمی خود را بررسی کنید.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"اجاره‌های مسکونی سوئیس: برآوردی از تنها اثر نرخ مرجع وام مسکن. این یک تصمیم قانونی یا بررسی کامل اجاره نیست.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"اجاره ماهانه خالص فعلی (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"نرخ مرجع ذکر شده در اجاره نامه یا آخرین اطلاعیه اجاره شما (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"نرخ مرجع رسمی فعلی سوئیس (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"محاسبه سناریوی نرخ مرجع","Reference-rate-only scenario":"سناریوی فقط با نرخ مرجع","Current monthly net rent":"اجاره ماهانه خالص فعلی","Reference-rate change":"تغییر نرخ مرجع","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"تأثیر ماهانه تخمینی از نرخ مرجع","Scenario monthly net rent":"سناریو اجاره خالص ماهانه","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"اثر سالانه به مدت 12 ماه با همان نرخ","potential increase":"افزایش پتانسیل","potential decrease":"کاهش پتانسیل","no reference-rate change":"بدون تغییر نرخ مرجع","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"برآورد 3% برای هر 0.25 درصد افزایش و معادل کاهش معکوس برای هر کاهش اعمال می‌شود. عوامل دیگر می توانند نتیجه را تغییر دهند.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"این شامل تورم، تغییرات کلی هزینه، بهبودها، رزرو قرارداد، اجاره‌های فهرست‌بندی شده یا افزایش‌یافته، تاریخ‌های اعلامیه، یا الزامات رویه‌ای محلی نمی‌شود. اجاره نامه خود و راهنمای اداره فدرال مسکن را بررسی کنید.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"آخرین نرخ رسمی و راهنمایی را بررسی کنید","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"دفتر فدرال مسکن سوئیس (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"برای دیدن یک سناریو، اجاره و هر دو نرخ را وارد کنید.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"سناریو محاسبه شده است. قبل از اتکا به آن، تاریخ ها و شرایط قرارداد را بررسی کنید.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"مقدارها و نرخ ها را بررسی کنید. نرخ ها باید بین 0 تا 5 درصد باشد و در مراحل 0.25 امتیازی متفاوت باشد.","Inputs cleared.":"ورودی ها پاک شدند.","Result":"نتیجه","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"برآورنده تعهدی تعطیلات سوئیس","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"ماشین حساب تعهدی تعطیلات سوئیسی — مانده مرخصی متناسب","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"تراز روز مرخصی سوئیس را از مرخصی سالانه در قرارداد، هفته کاری، تاریخ های استخدام و روزهایی که قبلاً گرفته اید، تخمین بزنید.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"با استفاده از استحقاق و برنامه کاری که وارد می‌کنید، مرخصی استحقاقی متناسب را برای یک سال تقویمی تخمین بزنید. هیچ شرایط قراردادی حدس زده نمی شود.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"برآورنده روزهای مرخصی سالانه در قرارداد شما را بر اساس روزهای تقویمی که در سال انتخابی کار می‌کند، تقسیم می‌کند. برای کار پاره وقت، روزهای کاری معمول در هفته و مرخصی سالانه را به هفته وارد کنید.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"با چهار هفته مرخصی، یک هفته کاری پنج روزه و اشتغال در طول سال، حق سالانه 20 روز کاری قبل از کسر مرخصی است.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"حداقل قانونی سوئیس چیست؟","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"راهنمای فدرال حداقل چهار هفته در هر سال خدمتی، و پنج هفته برای کارگرانی که به سن 20 سالگی نرسیده اند، بیان می کند. ممکن است قرارداد یا قرارداد جمعی بیشتر اعطا کند.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"آیا این تعادل قانونی من را تعیین می کند؟","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"شماره. این یک تقسیم بندی ساده تقویمی در روز است. شرایط قرارداد، قوانین جمعی قابل اجرا، غیبت های واجد شرایط، گرد کردن و سوابق کارفرما می توانند تعادل را تغییر دهند.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"این برآورد حق قانونی یا محاسبه حقوق تعطیلات را تعیین نمی کند. این کاهش برای برخی غیبت های طولانی مدت، قوانین تعهدی و گردآوری خاص قرارداد، تعطیلات رسمی، اضافه کاری، مهلت های انتقال و اختلافات را مستثنی می کند. قرارداد خود را بررسی کنید و برای تعادل مورد بحث مشاوره دریافت کنید.","Leave year":"سال مرخصی","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"مرخصی سالانه در قرارداد شما (هفته)","Usual working days per week":"روزهای کاری معمول در هفته","Employment start date":"تاریخ شروع استخدام","Employment end date":"تاریخ پایان استخدام","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"روزهای مرخصی قبلاً در این سال مرخصی گرفته شده است","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"فقط برای جهت یابی. حق سالانه قراردادی را وارد کنید؛ حداقل قانونی معمولاً چهار هفته یا پنج هفته برای کارگران زیر 20 سال است.","Estimate balance":"تخمین موجودی","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"قرارداد و تاریخ‌های خود را برای برآورد موجودی وارد کنید.","Estimated leave balance":"تراز مرخصی تخمینی","Annual leave at this schedule":"مرخصی سالانه در این برنامه","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"روزهای تقویمی شاغل در این سال مرخصی","Prorated days accrued":"روزهای انباشته شده","Days already taken":"روزهای گذشته","Estimated days remaining":"روزهای تخمینی باقی مانده است","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"این به نسبت مرخصی سالانه بر اساس روزهای تقویم در دوره اشتغال است. قوانین کارفرما و قرارداد ممکن است متفاوت باشد.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"تخمین محاسبه شد. آن را با قرارداد و سوابق کارفرما بررسی کنید.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"سال، تاریخ، برنامه کاری و مقادیر را بررسی کنید."},"am":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"የስዊስ የስራ አጥ አበል ሁኔታ","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"የስዊስ የስራ አጥነት ጥቅማ ጥቅም ማስያ - አጠቃላይ ሁኔታ","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"በእርስዎ ፈንድ የተረጋገጠውን የኢንሹራንስ ደሞዝ እና መጠን በመጠቀም አጠቃላይ የስዊስ ዕለታዊ አበል ይገምቱ።","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"የመድህን ደሞዝ ያስገቡ እና 70% ወይም 80% መጠን በስራ አጥ ፈንድዎ የተረጋገጠ።","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"የስዊስ ህጎች የአበል መጠን እና የደመወዝ ጣሪያ ያዘጋጃሉ። ፈንዱ ብቁነትን፣ ተቀናሾችን፣ የጥበቃ ቀናትን እና መብትን ይወስናል። ወርሃዊው ክልል ከ20-23 የሚከፈሉ የስራ ቀናትን ያንፀባርቃል።","Example":"ምሳሌ","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5,000 በ70% ገደማ CHF 161.29 በሚከፈል የስራ ቀን ነው።","How it works":"እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","Questions":"ጥያቄዎች","Scope and limits":"ወሰን እና ገደቦች","Related tools":"ተዛማጅ መሳሪያዎች","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"ወርሃዊ የኢንሹራንስ ደመወዝ (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"ዋጋ በፈንድ ተረጋግጧል","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"ግምት።","Clear":"አጽዳ","Gross scenario":"አጠቃላይ ሁኔታ","Insured salary used":"የኢንሹራንስ ደመወዝ ጥቅም ላይ ውሏል","Per payable weekday":"በሚከፈልበት የስራ ቀን","20-day month":"20-ቀን ወር","23-day month":"23-ቀን ወር","Official benefit rules":"ኦፊሴላዊ የጥቅም ህጎች","Enter your confirmed figures.":"የተረጋገጡትን ቁጥሮች ያስገቡ።","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"ሁኔታ ይሰላል። በገንዘብዎ መጠን ያረጋግጡ።","Check the values.":"እሴቶቹን ያረጋግጡ።","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"የስዊስ የተከራይና አከራይ ማስታወቂያ ዕቅድ አውጪ","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"የስዊስ የኪራይ ማስታወቂያ እቅድ አውጪ እና ደብዳቤ ረቂቅ","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"በእራስዎ ውል ውስጥ ያሉትን ቀናት እና ውሎች የተከራይና አከራይ ማስታወቂያ ያቅዱ; የካንቶን ህግጋትን ሳታስብ ደብዳቤ አዘጋጅ.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"የማስታወቂያ ሰአቱን ያስገቡ፣በኮንትራትዎ ውስጥ ቀጣዩን የሚያበቃበትን ቀን እና የሚደርስበትን ቀን ያስገቡ። እያንዳንዱን ቀን ከአከራይዎ ወይም ከተከራዮች ማህበር ጋር ያረጋግጡ።","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"እቅድ አውጪው የሚመለከተው እርስዎ ያቀረቡትን ቀኖች እና ጊዜ ብቻ ነው። ማስታወቂያው የሚሰራ መሆኑን፣ በህጋዊ መንገድ ሲደርሰው ወይም ልዩ ጥበቃ ስለመሆኑ አይወስንም።","Contract notice period (months)":"የኮንትራት ማስታወቂያ ጊዜ (ወራት)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"በሚቀጥለው ወር የሚቋረጥበት ቀን (ከኮንትራት)","Expected receipt date":"የሚጠበቀው ደረሰኝ ቀን","Your name":"ስምህ","Your address":"አድራሻዎ","Landlord / agency":"አከራይ/ኤጀንሲ","Recipient address":"የተቀባዩ አድራሻ","Rental property":"የኪራይ ንብረት","Place":"ቦታ","Letter date":"የደብዳቤ ቀን","Termination of tenancy":"የተከራይና አከራይ ማቋረጥ","Calculate date and draft letter":"ቀን እና ረቂቅ ደብዳቤ አስላ","Planning date":"የእቅድ ቀን","Target date":"የዒላማ ቀን","Editable draft":"የሚስተካከል ረቂቅ","Copy draft":"ረቂቅ ቅዳ","Enter your contract terms.":"የኮንትራት ውልዎን ያስገቡ።","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"የእቅድ ረቂቅ ተዘጋጅቷል። ከውልዎ ጋር የሚቃረን መሆኑን ያረጋግጡ።","Check the dates and period.":"ቀኖቹን እና ወቅቶችን ያረጋግጡ።","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"ውጤቱ የቀረበውን የውል ማስታወቂያ ቀን ይከተላል; በሕግ የተደነገገ ማስታወቂያ አይደለም.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"የስዊስ ንብረት መጨመር ሁኔታ","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"የስዊስ ንብረት ትርፍ ግብር - በተጠቃሚ የገባ ዋጋ ሁኔታ","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"በእራስዎ የግብይት ወጪዎች እና ኃላፊነት ከሚሰማው ካንቶን የግብር መጠን በመጠቀም የንብረት ትርፍ ይገምቱ።","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"ገቢ፣ የግዢ ወጪ፣ ያረጋገጡትን ብቁ ወጪዎች እና ውጤታማ ዋጋ ከኦፊሴላዊው የካንቶናል ካልኩሌተር ያስገቡ።","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"የስዊስ ንብረት ትርፍ ታክስ በካቶን፣በመያዣ ጊዜ፣ቅናሾች እና ጉዳይ ይለያያል። ይህ መሳሪያ ተመኖችን አያቀርብም ወይም ተቀባይነት ያላቸውን ወጪዎች አይወስንም.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"የሽያጭ ገቢ (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"የማግኘት ወጪ (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"ሌሎች ወጪዎች ተቀባይነት እንዳላቸው ተረጋግጧል (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"ውጤታማ የግብር ተመን ከኦፊሴላዊ ምንጭ (%)","Estimate scenario":"የግምት ሁኔታ","Illustrative scenario":"ምሳሌያዊ ሁኔታ","Gain entered":"ገቢ ገብቷል።","Tax at entered rate":"ታክስ በገባው መጠን","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"የእርስዎን መዛግብት እና የካንቶን ምንጭ አሃዞችን ያስገቡ።","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"ሁኔታ ይሰላል; ከካንቶን ጋር ያረጋግጡ.","Check amounts and rate.":"መጠን እና መጠን ያረጋግጡ።","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"ምንም የካንቶን የግብር ሠንጠረዥ አልተካተተም። የገባህ ውጤታማ መጠን ግምቱን ይመራዋል።","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"የስዊስ ውርስ እና የስጦታ ታክስ ሁኔታ","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"የስዊስ ውርስ እና የስጦታ ግብር - የእርስዎ ተመን ሁኔታ","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"በተጠቃሚ ከገባ ነፃ እና ተመን ታክስ የሚከፈልበትን መጠን ይገምቱ። ደንቦች በካንቶን እና በግንኙነት ይለያያሉ.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"ለተቀባይ እና ካንቶን የተረጋገጠ መጠን፣ ነፃ እና ውጤታማ ዋጋ ያስገቡ።","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"የካንቶን ህጎች እና የቤተሰብ ግንኙነት ነፃነቶችን እና ዋጋዎችን ሊለውጡ ይችላሉ። ይህ መሳሪያ የካንቶን ህግን አይመርጥም ወይም የታክስ ተጠያቂነትን አይወስንም.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"ውርስ ወይም የስጦታ መጠን (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"ከካንቶን (CHF) ነፃ መሆን ተረጋግጧል","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"ውጤታማ ተመን በካቶን (%) ተረጋግጧል","Amount after entered exemption":"ከነጻነት ከገባ በኋላ መጠን","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"ለእርስዎ ጉዳይ የተረጋገጡ አሃዞችን ያስገቡ።","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"ግምቱ የሚጠቀመው እርስዎ ያስገቡትን ነፃ እና ደረጃን ብቻ ነው።","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"የስዊስ የልጆች ድጋፍ የበጀት ሁኔታ","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"የስዊዘርላንድ የልጅ ድጋፍ በጀት - ግልጽ የቤተሰብ ሁኔታ","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"በቀጥታ ወጪ ክሬዲት ከገባ በኋላ የገባ የልጅ በጀት በወላጅ ገቢ መድብ።","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"የልጁን ወርሃዊ ፍላጎቶች፣ የሁለቱም ወላጆችን ወርሃዊ ገቢ እና ክሬዲት ሊያደርጉባቸው የሚፈልጓቸውን ማንኛውንም ቀጥተኛ ወጪዎች ይጠቀሙ።","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"ይህ የእቅድ ሉህ ብቻ ነው። የስዊዘርላንድ የልጅ እንክብካቤ ሽልማት ወይም ህጋዊ ዘዴ አይደለም; መኖሪያ ቤት፣ እንክብካቤ፣ ታክስ፣ ጥቅማጥቅሞች እና የጉዳይ ሕግ አይገመገሙም።","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"እርስዎ ያስመዘገቡት ወርሃዊ የልጅ በጀት (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"ወላጅ A የሚገኝ ወርሃዊ ገቢ (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"የወላጅ ቢ ወርሃዊ ገቢ (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"በወላጅ A ለክሬዲት (CHF) የሚከፍሉት ቀጥተኛ የልጅ ወጪዎች","Allocate scenario":"ሁኔታን ይመድቡ","Illustrative allocation":"ምሳሌያዊ ምደባ","Parent A remaining contribution":"ወላጅ የቀረው መዋጮ","Parent B contribution":"የወላጅ ቢ አስተዋፅዖ","Entered monthly child budget":"የህጻናት ወርሃዊ በጀት ገብቷል።","Enter your household budget figures.":"የቤተሰብዎን በጀት ቁጥሮች ያስገቡ።","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"የበጀት ሁኔታ ይሰላል; ብቃት ካለው አማካሪ ጋር የሕግ ግዴታዎችን መወያየት።","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"የፍተሻ መጠን; ብድር ከበጀት መብለጥ አይችልም.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"አክሲዮኖች ከገቡት ሁለት ገቢዎች ጋር ተመጣጣኝ ናቸው; ቀጥተኛ ወጪ ክሬዲት በቅድሚያ ይቀንሳል.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"የአሳሽ ሃይፊኔሽን ቅድመ እይታ","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"የቃላት ማቋረጫ ቅድመ እይታ - የአሳሽ ቋንቋ ቅጦች","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"ለሚያቀርቡት ጽሑፍ የአሳሽ ሰረዝን አስቀድመው ይመልከቱ። ድጋፍ በአሳሹ እና በተጫኑ የቋንቋ ሀብቶች ላይ የተመሰረተ ነው.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"ከጽሑፍዎ ጋር የሚስማማውን ቋንቋ ይምረጡ፣ ናሙና ያስገቡ እና ያለውን የመስመር ስፋት ያስተካክሉ።","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"የአሳሹን ቤተኛ CSS ማሰረዣ ይጠቀማል። መዝገበ ቃላትን አያጠቃልልም; የማይደገፉ አሳሾች ምንም ሰረዝ ላያሳዩ ይችላሉ። ጽሑፉን መቅዳት ዋናውን የፊደል አጻጻፍ ያስቀምጣል።","Text language (BCP 47)":"የጽሑፍ ቋንቋ (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"የቅድመ-እይታ ስፋት (ቁምፊዎች)","Text to preview":"ቅድመ-እይታ የሚቀርብ ጽሑፍ","Preview":"ቅድመ እይታ","Enter text and choose its language.":"ጽሑፍ ያስገቡ እና ቋንቋውን ይምረጡ።","Preview updated.":"ቅድመ እይታ ተዘምኗል።","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"የሚደገፍ የቋንቋ መለያ እና ጽሑፍ ያስገቡ።","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"አሳሹ ቃላትን የት እንደሚሰብር ለማየት በተለያየ ስፋቶች ላይ ያለውን ተመሳሳይ አንቀጽ ይሞክሩ።","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"የግል ፊደል ማረሚያ የስራ ቦታ","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"የአከባቢ ፊደል አራሚ - የአሳሽ መዝገበ ቃላትዎን ይጠቀሙ","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"ጽሑፍን በአሳሹ ቤተኛ ፊደል ያርትዑ፣ ቋንቋ ይምረጡ እና የተስተካከለውን ጽሑፍ ይቅዱ።","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"ጽሑፍ በዚህ ገጽ ላይ ይቆያል። አሳሽህ የፊደል አጻጻፍ መዝገበ ቃላት ያለው ቋንቋ አዘጋጅ፣ ከዚያ የፊደል አጻጻፍ ምናሌውን ተጠቀም ወይም የአስተያየት ጥቆማዎችን አስምር።","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"ይህ የስራ ቦታ ጽሑፍ ወይም የመርከብ መዝገበ ቃላት አይሰቀልም። የአሳሽ ፊደል ማረሚያ መገኘት እና የአስተያየት ጥቆማዎች በመሳሪያው፣ በአሳሹ እና በተጫነው መዝገበ-ቃላት ላይ ይወሰናሉ።","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"የፊደል ማረሚያ ቋንቋ (BCP 47)","Text to check":"ለመፈተሽ ጽሑፍ","Copy text":"ጽሑፍ ቅዳ","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"ጽሑፍ ይተይቡ ወይም ይለጥፉ። ለጥቆማዎች በቀኝ ጠቅ ያድርጉ ወይም የመሣሪያዎን የፊደል አጻጻፍ ምናሌ ይጠቀሙ።","Text copied.":"ጽሑፍ ተቀድቷል።","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"በራስ ሰር መቅዳት አልተቻለም፤ ጽሑፉን ይምረጡ እና ይቅዱ።","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"ተዛማጅ መዝገበ ቃላት የሌለው አሳሽ የተሳሳቱ የፊደል አጻጻፍን ላያሳይ ይችላል።","Resume Structure Checker":"የመዋቅር አራሚውን ከቆመበት ቀጥል","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS ከቆመበት ቀጥል አረጋጋጭ - ነፃ የአካባቢ ፒዲኤፍ እና DOCX ግምገማ","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"በአሳሽህ ውስጥ ከቆመበት ቀጥል ጽሑፍ፣ ርዕሶች፣ ክፍሎች፣ ማገናኛዎች እና የነጥብ መዋቅር ተመልከት። የሥራ-መግለጫ ቃላትን በቁጥር ያወዳድሩ; ምንም የቅጥር ነጥብ ወይም ሰቀላ.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"በፅሁፍ ላይ የተመሰረተ የስራ ሂደት በትክክል የሚያጋልጠውን ይከልሱ፡- የወጣ ጽሑፍ፣ የአርዕስት መዋቅር፣ የእውቂያ መስክ መገኘት፣ ማገናኛዎች እና የተለመዱ የታወቁ ክፍሎችን። እንደ አማራጭ ተደጋጋሚ የስራ መግለጫ ቃላትን ያወዳድሩ።","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"የልምድ እና የትምህርት 1 ቅጦች ያለው DOCX እነዚያን ርዕሶች ያሳያል። ፒዲኤፍ ከተመረጠው ጽሑፍ ላይ ምልክት ይደረግበታል; ዓምዶች በተለየ ቅደም ተከተል ሊነበቡ ይችላሉ.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX ፋይሎች እንደ Office ZIP/XML በአገር ውስጥ ይመረመራሉ። ፒዲኤፎች የሚነበቡት ከዘገየ የአካባቢ ፒዲኤፍ.js ሞተር ጋር ነው። የአማራጭ የሥራ መግለጫ ንጽጽር በእያንዳንዱ ጽሑፍ ውስጥ የተመረጡ ቃላትን ይቆጥራል; ነጥብ አይፈጥርም ወይም ሰው ለመቅጠር አይመክርም።","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"ይህ የቅርጸት እና የፅሁፍ-መዋቅር ቼክ እንጂ የ ATS አስመሳይ፣ የህግ ግምገማ ወይም የቃለ መጠይቅ ስኬት ትንበያ አይደለም። ሊመረጥ የሚችል ጽሑፍ የሌሉ የተቃኙ ፒዲኤፎች መጀመሪያ OCR ያስፈልጋቸዋል። በይለፍ ቃል የተጠበቀ፣ ማክሮ የነቃ፣ የተፈረመ ወይም ያልተለመደ ትልቅ ሰነዶች አይደገፉም።","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"ከቆመበት ቀጥል (PDF ወይም DOCX) ይምረጡ","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"የእርስዎ ፋይሎች በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይቆያሉ እና አይሰቀሉም። ከፍተኛው 20 ሜባ; ፒዲኤፍ እስከ 50 ገጾች. DOCX የተስፋፋ ይዘት በ80 ሜባ ተሸፍኗል።","Optional job description":"አማራጭ የሥራ መግለጫ","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"የቃል-ድግግሞሽ ንጽጽር ከፈለጉ ግልጽ ጽሑፍ ለጥፍ። ለመተንተን የማይፈልጉትን ሚስጥራዊነት ያለው መረጃ አያካትቱ።","Paste job-description text here…":"የሥራ መግለጫ ጽሑፍ እዚህ ለጥፍ…","Analyze locally":"በአካባቢው ይተንትኑ","Clear files and report":"ፋይሎችን አጽዳ እና ሪፖርት አድርግ","Resume review":"ግምገማ ከቆመበት ቀጥል","File type":"የፋይል አይነት","Extracted characters":"የተወጡ ቁምፊዎች","Words counted":"ቃላቶች ተቆጥረዋል።","Detected headings":"የተገኙ ርዕሶች","Recognized sections":"የሚታወቁ ክፍሎች","Hyperlinks found":"Hyperlinks ተገኝተዋል","Bullet paragraphs":"የነጥብ አንቀጾች","An email address appears in the text":"የኢሜል አድራሻ በጽሁፉ ውስጥ ይታያል","No email address pattern was detected":"ምንም የኢሜይል አድራሻ ስርዓተ ጥለት አልተገኘም።","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"ስልክ ቁጥር መሰል ጥለት በጽሁፉ ላይ ይታያል","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"ስልክ ቁጥር መሰል ጥለት አልተገኘም።","Job-description terms (counts only)":"የሥራ መግለጫ ውሎች (የሚቆጠሩት ብቻ)","Term":"ውል።","In job text":"በሥራ ጽሁፍ","In resume":"በስራ ሂደት ውስጥ","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"የጊዜ ብዛትን ለማነፃፀር የስራ መግለጫ ይለጥፉ።","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"ምንም ግልጽ የአርእስት ቅጦች አልተገኙም። የፒዲኤፍ ርእሶች የሚገመቱት ከጽሑፍ መጠን ነው እና ትክክል ላይሆኑ ይችላሉ።","Detected":"ተገኝቷል","Not detected":"አልተገኘም።","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"ይህ ሂዩሪስት የተወሰነ የጋራ ክፍል ስሞችን ያውቃል። የትኞቹ ክፍሎች እንደሚያስፈልጉ አይወስንም.","Profile / summary":"መገለጫ/ማጠቃለያ","Experience":"ልምድ","Education":"ትምህርት","Skills":"ችሎታዎች","Contact":"እውቂያ","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"የሚመረጥ ጽሑፍ አልተገኘም። የተቃኙ-ብቻ ፒዲኤፎች ከመመረጣቸው በፊት OCR ያስፈልጋቸዋል።","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"ለመጀመር ፒዲኤፍ ወይም DOCX ከቆመበት ቀጥል ይምረጡ።","Reading the selected file locally…":"የተመረጠውን ፋይል በአገር ውስጥ በማንበብ…","Local structure review complete.":"የአከባቢ መዋቅር ግምገማ ተጠናቋል።","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"ይህ አሳሽ የሚፈለግ የአካባቢ ሰነድ ባህሪን አይደግፍም።","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"የሚሰራ ፒዲኤፍ ወይም ዘመናዊ DOCX ፋይል እስከተገለጸው የአካባቢ ገደብ ድረስ ይምረጡ።","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"ፒዲኤፍ ሊነበብ አልቻለም። የተበላሸ፣ የተመሰጠረ ወይም ምንም ሊመረጥ የሚችል ጽሑፍ አልያዘም።","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"የDOCX ጥቅል በደህና ሊከፈት ወይም ሊነበብ አልቻለም።","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"ይህ መሣሪያ የእኔን የሥራ ልምድ ይጭናል ወይም ያስቀምጣል?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"ቁ. መተንተን እና ትንተና በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ይሰራሉ። ሪፖርቱን ካጸዱ ወይም ገጹን ከለቀቁ በኋላ የፋይሉ ጽሁፍ ወደ አገልጋይ አይላክም ወይም እንዲቆይ ተደርጓል።","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"ኤቲኤስ ወይም ቀጣሪ የሥራ ሒደቴን ይቀበሉ እንደሆነ ይተነብያል?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"ቁ. የሚነበብ ጽሑፍ እና ቀላል መዋቅር ብቻ ይፈትሻል። የቅጥር ስርዓቶች ይለያያሉ፣ እና ይህ የATS ተኳኋኝነት ዋስትና ወይም የቅጥር ትንበያ አይደለም።","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"የተቃኘ ፒዲኤፍ ማንበብ ይችላል?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"ፒዲኤፍ የሚመረጥ የጽሑፍ ንብርብር ካለው ብቻ። ይህ አረጋጋጭ የ OCR ሞዴሎችን አያወርድም; ለተቃኘ ምስል-ብቻ ሰነድ መጀመሪያ የ OCR መሳሪያ ይጠቀሙ።","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"የሥራ መግለጫ ንጽጽር ምን ማለት ነው?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"ከቀላል መደበኛነት በኋላ ለተደጋጋሚ ጊዜ ቆጠራዎችን ያሳያል። የእርስዎ መመዘኛዎች ግጥሚያ መቶኛ፣ ደረጃ፣ ምክር ወይም ግምገማ አይደለም።","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"ለምንድነው ፒዲኤፍ ከDOCX ያነሱ ርዕሶችን የሚያሳየው?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"ፒዲኤፍ አብዛኛውን ጊዜ የትርጉም ርዕስ ቅጦችን አያስቀምጡም። አረጋጋጩ ታዋቂ መስመሮችን ከጽሑፍ መጠን እና የንባብ ቅደም ተከተል ይገምታል, ስለዚህ አምዶች እና ምስላዊ ንድፍ ውጤቱን ሊነኩ ይችላሉ.","How local resume review works":"የአገር ውስጥ ከቆመበት ቀጥል ግምገማ እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","Resume checker questions":"የአመልካች ጥያቄዎችን ከቆመበት ቀጥል","Scope and limitations":"ወሰን እና ገደቦች","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"የአከባቢ ድምጽ እና አጃቢ መለያ","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"ድምጽ አስወጋጅ - የተለያዩ ድምፆች እና አጃቢዎች በአካባቢው","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"አጭር የስቲሪዮ ኦዲዮ ናሙናን ወደ ግምታዊ ድምጾች እና አጃቢ በአሳሽህ ለይ። ኦዲዮ በመሣሪያዎ ላይ ይቆያል; ሞዴሉ ከሕዝብ አስተናጋጁ ይወርዳል።","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"እስከ 30 ሰከንድ የሚደርስ ስቴሪዮ ሙዚቃ ክሊፕ ይምረጡ። በመጀመሪያ አጠቃቀም, አሳሹ 35.6 ሜባ ሞዴል ያወርዳል. የድምጽ ፋይሉ በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ነው የሚሰራው እና በጭራሽ አይሰቀልም።","What you get":"ያገኙት","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"ሁለት የ WAV ግንዶችን አስቀድመው ይመልከቱ እና ያውርዱ፡ የሚገመቱ ድምጾች እና ቀሪው አጃቢ። ውጤቶቹ በድብልቅ ላይ የተመሰረቱ ናቸው እና ቅርሶችን ሊይዙ ይችላሉ።","Local processing":"አካባቢያዊ ሂደት","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"መሳሪያው ወደ ONNX እና ONNX Runtime Web የሚላከው የOpen-Unmix UMX-HQ ቮካል ኔትወርክን ይጠቀማል። ሞዴሉ የሚወሰደው ተለያይተው ሲጫኑ ብቻ ነው; ምንም የሚከፈልበት ግምት ኤፒአይ ወይም የደንበኝነት ምዝገባ ጥቅም ላይ አይውልም። ኦዲዮ ዲኮድ ተሰርዟል እና ወደ ውጭ ይላካል።","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"ይህ የስቴሪዮ 44.1 kHz ሂደት እና እስከ 30 ሰከንድ የሚደርሱ ቅንጥቦች ግምት ነው። የሞኖ ምንጮች ወደ ስቴሪዮ የተባዙ ናቸው። በመሳሪያዎች፣በከባድ ውጤቶች፣በቀጥታ የተቀረጹ ቀረጻዎች እና ያልተለመዱ ዘውጎች የተደባለቁ ድምጾች መፍሰስ ወይም ቅርሶችን ሊፈጥሩ ይችላሉ። ውጤቱን እንደ ንጹህ ጌታ አይጠቀሙ. ሞዴል ማውረድ የበይነመረብ ግንኙነት ያስፈልገዋል; ኦዲዮ ከዚህ መሳሪያ አይወጣም።","Is my audio uploaded?":"የእኔ ኦዲዮ ተሰቅሏል?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"ቁ. የተመረጠው ኦዲዮ በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ዲኮድ ተሰርዟል። ብቸኛው የአውታረ መረብ ጥያቄ መለያየት ሲጀምሩ ሞዴል ማውረድ ነው።","Why is the first run slow?":"የመጀመሪያው ሩጫ ለምን ቀርፋፋ ነው?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"አሳሹ አንድ ጊዜ 35.6 ሜባ ሞዴል ያወርዳል። አሳሹ መሸጎጥ ይችላል። ኢንፈረንስ በመሣሪያው ሲፒዩ ላይ በአካባቢው ይሰራል።","Will every song separate cleanly?":"እያንዳንዱ ዘፈን በንጽህና ይለያል?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"ቁ. ሞዴሉ የድምፅ ግንድ ይገምታል እና የድምፅ መፍሰስን ሊተው ፣ የመሳሪያዎች መለዋወጫዎችን ያስወግዳል ወይም ቅርሶችን ሊፈጥር ይችላል። ግንድ ላይ ከመታመንዎ በፊት ያዳምጡ።","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"የስቴሪዮ ኦዲዮ ፋይል (እስከ 30 ሰከንድ)","Choose audio":"ድምጽ ይምረጡ","Separate vocals":"የተለያዩ ድምጾች","Cancel / clear":"ሰርዝ/አጽዳ","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"ለመጀመር አጭር የድምጽ ፋይል ይምረጡ።","Downloading the separation model…":"የመለያ ሞዴሉን በማውረድ ላይ…","Separating locally…":"በአካባቢው በመለየት ላይ…","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"መለያየት ተጠናቋል። አንዱን ግንድ አስቀድመው ይመልከቱ ወይም ያውርዱ።","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"ይህን ፋይል ማስኬድ ወይም ሞዴሉን መጫን አልተቻለም። ቅርጸቱን እና ግንኙነቱን ያረጋግጡ፣ ከዚያ እንደገና ይሞክሩ።","Model and weight license information":"የአምሳያ እና የክብደት ፍቃድ መረጃ","Estimated vocals":"የተገመቱ ድምጾች","Estimated accompaniment":"የተገመተው አጃቢ","Download WAV":"WAV አውርድ","Progress":"ሂደት።","Preparing local separation…":"አካባቢያዊ መለያየትን በማዘጋጀት ላይ…","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"መለያየት ተጠናቋል። ኦዲዮ በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ቀርቷል።","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"ይህ ኦዲዮ ሊሰራ አልቻለም። ከ30 ሰከንድ በታች የስቲሪዮ ሙዚቃ ፋይል ይሞክሩ።","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"የስዊስ የጤና መድህን ተቀናሽ ንጽጽር","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"የስዊስ የጤና መድን ፍራንቸስ ካልኩሌተር — አመታዊ ወጪዎችን አወዳድር","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"የሚገቡትን ፕሪሚየም እና ብቁ የሆኑ አመታዊ የህክምና ወጪዎችን በመጠቀም የስዊስ መሰረታዊ የጤና መድህን ተቀናሾችን ያወዳድሩ። ምንም የኢንሹራንስ ጥቅስ አይገመትም.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"በተመሳሳይ መድን ሰጪ የሚታየውን ወርሃዊ ክፍያ ያስገቡ ለእያንዳንዱ ተቀናሽ ዋጋ ያስገቡ እና ዝቅተኛ፣ የሚጠበቁ እና ከፍተኛ አመታዊ ህክምና-ወጪ ሁኔታዎችን ያወዳድሩ።","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"ለግዳጅ የስዊስ መሰረታዊ የጤና መድህን የአዋቂዎች ስታንዳርድ ተቀናሽ CHF 300 እና የልጅ ተቀናሽ CHF 0 ነው። የአማራጭ ደረጃዎች በእድሜ ምድብ ይለያያሉ። ከተቀነሰው በኋላ፣ መደበኛው የማቆያ ክፍያ ብቁ ከሚሆኑት ቀሪ ወጪዎች 10% ነው፣ በዓመት CHF 700 ለአዋቂዎች እና CHF 350 ለልጆች። መሣሪያው የገባዎትን ፕሪሚየም ወደዚህ ሞዴል የወጪ መጋራት ይጨምራል። የኢንሹራንስ ተመኖችን አያመጣም ወይም የትኛው አማራጭ ለእርስዎ ትክክል እንደሆነ አይወስንም.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"አንድ አዋቂ ሰው CHF 400 ወርሃዊ አረቦን በCHF 300 ተቀናሽ እና CHF 350 በCHF 2,500 ተቀናሽ ከገባ፣ አመታዊ የአረቦን ልዩነቱ CHF 600 ነው። ያንን ቁጠባ በእያንዳንዱ ዝቅተኛ እና ከሚጠበቀው ወጪ መጋራት ጋር ያወዳድሩ።","How the estimate works":"ግምቱ እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","Common questions":"የተለመዱ ጥያቄዎች","Scope and exclusions":"ወሰን እና የማይካተቱት።","Where do I get the premiums?":"ፕሪሚየሙን የት ነው የማገኘው?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"ለተመሳሳይ መድን ሰጪ፣ ፕሪሚየም ክልል፣ የዕድሜ ቡድን፣ የአደጋ ሽፋን እና የኢንሹራንስ ሞዴል ወቅታዊ ወርሃዊ ቅናሾችን ይጠቀሙ። Priminfo ኦፊሴላዊው የፌደራል ንፅፅር ጣቢያ ነው። ይህ ገጽ የኢንሹራንስ ጥቅሶችን አያመጣም ወይም አያባዛም።","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"ሁሉም የተዘረዘሩ ተቀናሽ ደረጃዎች ሁልጊዜ ይቀርባሉ?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"ቁ. ኢንሹራንስ ሰጪዎች እያንዳንዱን አማራጭ ደረጃ ማቅረብ የለባቸውም፣ እና ቅናሾች ለወጣቶች ሊለያዩ ይችላሉ። ለራስህ ፖሊሲ የሚታየውን ፕሪሚየም ብቻ አስገባ፤ የማይገኙ አማራጮችን ባዶ ይተዉ።","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"ይህ ሙሉ የህክምና ሂሳቤን ያሳያል?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"ቁ. ሞዴሉ መደበኛውን ተቀናሽ እና መደበኛ 10% ማቆያ ክፍያ በተገቢ ወጪዎች ይሸፍናል። የሆስፒታል ቀን መዋጮን፣ ልዩ 40% የመድሃኒት ማቆያ፣ ነፃ አገልግሎትን፣ ያልተሸፈነ እንክብካቤን እና ተጨማሪ መድንን አያካትትም።","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"ይህ የሁኔታ ንጽጽር እንጂ ኢንሹራንስ፣ የሕክምና ወይም የፋይናንስ ምክር አይደለም። ህክምናዎን ወይም ፕሪሚየምዎን አይተነብይም። የሆስፒታል ቀን መዋጮዎችን (በተለምዶ CHF 15 በታካሚ ቀን፣ በህግ የተደነገገ ነፃነቶች)፣ ለአንዳንድ መድሃኒቶች ልዩ 40% ማቆየት፣ የወሊድ/የመከላከያ ነፃነቶች፣ ከግዳጅ ሽፋን ውጪ አገልግሎቶችን፣ የአረቦን ድጎማዎችን እና ተጨማሪ መድንን አያካትትም። ትክክለኛው የጋራ ክፍያ ስለዚህ ሊለያይ ይችላል። ከፍ ያለ ተቀናሽ ማለት እንክብካቤ ካገኙ የበለጠ በቅድሚያ መክፈል ያስፈልግዎታል ማለት ነው።","Who is insured under this policy?":"በዚህ መመሪያ ኢንሹራንስ ያለው ማነው?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"አዋቂ (ዕድሜያቸው 19 ወይም ከዚያ በላይ)","Child (under 18)":"ልጅ (ከ18 ዓመት በታች)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"ዝቅተኛ አመታዊ ብቁ የሆነ ህክምና-ወጪ ሁኔታ (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"የሚጠበቁ አመታዊ ብቁ የሕክምና ወጪዎች (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"ከፍተኛ አመታዊ ብቁ የሆነ ህክምና-ወጪ ሁኔታ (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"ወርሃዊ ፕሪሚየም ከአንድ መድን ሰጪ","Monthly premium":"ወርሃዊ ፕሪሚየም","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"ለተመሳሳይ መመሪያ የቀረቡ አማራጮችን ብቻ ያስገቡ። ሌሎችን ባዶ ይተዉ።","Adult deductible choices":"የአዋቂዎች ተቀናሽ ምርጫዎች","Child deductible choices":"የልጆች ተቀናሽ ምርጫዎች","Compare annual costs":"የአመታዊ ወጪዎችን ያወዳድሩ","Clear entries":"ግቤቶችን አጽዳ","Download CSV":"CSV አውርድ","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"የተገመተው አመታዊ ፕሪሚየም እና የወጪ መጋራት","Deductible":"ተቀነሰ","Annual premiums":"አመታዊ ፕሪሚየም","Total at low costs":"ጠቅላላ በዝቅተኛ ወጪዎች","Total at expected costs":"ጠቅላላ በሚጠበቀው ወጪ","Total at high costs":"ጠቅላላ በከፍተኛ ወጪ","Cost sharing at low costs":"ወጪ መጋራት በዝቅተኛ ወጪዎች","Cost sharing at expected costs":"ወጪ መጋራት በሚጠበቀው ወጪ","Cost sharing at high costs":"ወጪ መጋራት በከፍተኛ ወጭ","Difference from lowest available deductible":"ከዝቅተኛው ተቀናሽ ከሚገኝ ልዩነት","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"ፕሪሚየም ቁጠባ ጥቅም ላይ የሚውልባቸው የሕክምና ወጪዎች","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"የገባው ፕሪሚየም ቁጠባ በሞዴል የወጪ መጋራት ክልል ውስጥ አልተሰረዘም።","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"ከዝቅተኛው ተቀናሽ አንፃር ምንም ፕሪሚየም አያድንም።","Lowest expected total among entered options":"ከገቡት አማራጮች መካከል ዝቅተኛው የሚጠበቀው ጠቅላላ","Scenario details":"የሁኔታ ዝርዝሮች","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"ሦስት የታዘዙ የሕክምና ወጪ ሁኔታዎችን እና ወርሃዊ ፕሪሚየም ቢያንስ ለሁለት ለሚቀነሱ ተቀናሾች ያስገቡ።","Official rules and current premiums:":"ኦፊሴላዊ ህጎች እና ወቅታዊ ክፍያዎች፡-","Federal deductible rules":"የፌዴራል ተቀናሽ ህጎች","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo ይፋዊ የፕሪሚየም ንጽጽር","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"ንፅፅር በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይሰላል።","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"የእድሜ ቡድኑን ፣የታዘዙ የወጪ ሁኔታዎችን እና ቢያንስ ሁለት ወርሃዊ ክፍያዎችን ያረጋግጡ።","Entries cleared.":"ግቤቶች ጸድተዋል።","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV በአገር ውስጥ ወርዷል።","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"የስዊስ ጤና ፕሪሚየም ቅነሳ ማስያ","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"የስዊስ ፕሪሚየም ድጎማ ማስያ — የእርስዎ የተጣራ ፕሪሚየም","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"የተጣራውን የስዊስ የጤና-መድህን ዓረቦን አሁን ካለበት ፕሪሚየም እና ቀደም ሲል በእርስዎ ካንቶን የተሰጠውን ወርሃዊ ቅናሽ ያስሉ።","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"ፕሪሚየም ያስገቡ እና ከኢንሹራንስ ሰጪዎ ወይም ከካንቶናል ውሳኔ ወርሃዊ ቅናሽ የተረጋገጠ። ይህ መሳሪያ ብቁ መሆንዎን አይወስንም.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"የስዊስ ካንቶኖች ማን ብቁ እንደሆነ፣ ምን ያህል ድጋፍ እንደሚሰጥ እና ማመልከቻ እንደሚያስፈልግ ይወስናሉ። ይህ ካልኩሌተር የተረጋገጠ ወርሃዊ ቅነሳን ከአንድ የፖሊሲ ፕሪሚየም ብቻ በመቀነስ አመታዊውን መጠን ያሳያል።","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"የወሩ ፕሪሚየም CHF 420 ከሆነ እና የተረጋገጠው ቅናሽ CHF 120 ከሆነ፣ የሚገመተው የተጣራ አረቦን በወር CHF 300 ነው።","How the calculation works":"ስሌቱ እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"ይህ ብቁ መሆን አለመሆኔን ይነግረኛል?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"ቁ. የብቁነት እና የሽልማት መጠን የሚወሰነው በመኖሪያው ካንቶን ነው። የተገናኘውን ኦፊሴላዊ መረጃ ይጠቀሙ ወይም የካንቶኑን ቢሮ ያነጋግሩ።","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"የተቀነሰበትን መጠን የት ነው የማገኘው?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"አሁን ያለውን ውሳኔ ወይም በመድን ሰጪዎ የሚታየውን የተቀነሰ አረቦን ይጠቀሙ። አንዳንድ ካንቶኖች በራስ-ሰር ይቀንሳሉ; ሌሎች ማመልከቻ ያስፈልጋቸዋል.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"ይህ የአንድ ፖሊሲ ስሌት ነው እንጂ የብቁነት ወይም የጥቅም ውሳኔ አይደለም። የቤተሰብ ገቢን፣ ንብረትን፣ የቤተሰብ ሁኔታን፣ የግዜ ገደቦችን፣ የካንቶናል ገደቦችን ወይም የማመልከቻ መብቶችን አይሰላም። ፕሪሚየም እና ሽልማቶች ሊለወጡ ይችላሉ; በእርስዎ መድን ሰጪ እና ካንቶን ያረጋግጡዋቸው።","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"የአሁኑ ወርሃዊ ፕሪሚየም (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"ወርሃዊ ቅነሳ አስቀድሞ ተሰጥቷል (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"በካንቶን ወይም በኢንሹራንስ የተረጋገጠ መጠን ያስገቡ። ግምትን እንደ ሽልማት አይጠቀሙ.","Calculate net premium":"የተጣራ ፕሪሚየም አስላ","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"አሁን ያለውን ፕሪሚየም ያስገቡ እና የተረጋገጠ ቅነሳ።","Estimated premium after reduction":"ከተቀነሰ በኋላ የሚገመተው ፕሪሚየም","Current monthly premium":"የአሁኑ ወርሃዊ ፕሪሚየም","Monthly reduction":"ወርሃዊ ቅነሳ","Estimated net monthly premium":"የተገመተው የተጣራ ወርሃዊ ፕሪሚየም","Reduction over 12 months":"በ12 ወራት ውስጥ መቀነስ","Reduction as a share of premium":"ቅነሳ እንደ የፕሪሚየም ድርሻ","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"ስሌቱ ተጠናቅቋል። ሽልማቱን እና ውጤታማ ቀናትን ከእርስዎ ካንቶን እና ኢንሹራንስ ጋር ያረጋግጡ።","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"ቅናሹ ከወርሃዊ ፕሪሚየም የማይበልጥ መሆኑን ያረጋግጡ።","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"የስዊስ ኪራይ ማጣቀሻ-ምት ትዕይንት ማስያ","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"የስዊስ ኪራይ ማስተካከያ ማስያ - የማጣቀሻ ደረጃ ሁኔታ","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"የስዊዘርላንድ የሞርጌጅ ማጣቀሻ መጠን ለውጥ የመኖሪያ ቤት ኪራይ እንዴት እንደሚጎዳ ብቻ ይገምቱ። ከፌዴራል የቤቶች ጽሕፈት ቤት የቅርብ ጊዜውን ዋጋ ይጠቀሙ።","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"በእርስዎ የኪራይ ውል ላይ የተገለፀውን የማመሳከሪያ ዋጋ ወይም የቅርብ ጊዜ የኪራይ ማስታወቂያ አሁን ካለው ኦፊሴላዊ የስዊስ ዋጋ ጋር ያወዳድሩ። ስሌቱ በመሣሪያዎ ላይ ይቆያል።","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"የፌደራል ቤቶች ጽሕፈት ቤት በየሩብ ዓመቱ አንድ የሞርጌጅ ማጣቀሻ ተመን ለስዊስ የቤት ኪራይ ማስተካከያ ያትማል። የ 0.25 በመቶ-ነጥብ መጨመር በመርህ ደረጃ የ 3% የቤት ኪራይ ጭማሪ ሊፈቅድ ይችላል; የ 0.25-ነጥብ መቀነስ በመርህ ደረጃ 2.91% ቅነሳን ይፈቅዳል. ይህ ሁኔታ እነዚያን ለውጦች ደረጃ በደረጃ እርስዎ በሚያስገቡት የተጣራ ኪራይ ላይ ይተገበራል።","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"ለ CHF 3,000 ወርሃዊ የተጣራ ኪራይ፣ የማጣቀሻ-ተመን ከ1.75% ወደ 1.50% መቀነስ በግምት -CHF 87.38 በወር (-2.91%) የሚገመተው የማጣቀሻ-ተመን ብቻ ለውጥ ይሰጣል።","How this estimate works":"ይህ ግምት እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","Where do I find the current rate?":"የአሁኑን ተመን የት ነው የማገኘው?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"የተገናኘውን የፌዴራል ቢሮ ለቤቶች ገጽ ይክፈቱ እና አሁን የታተመውን ዋጋ ያስገቡ። መሣሪያው ጊዜው ያለፈበት ሊሆን የሚችል መጠንን አይካተትም።","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"ይህ የኪራይ ለውጥ መጠየቅ እንደምችል ይወስናል?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"ቁ. ለአቅጣጫ አንድ ምክንያት ይለያል። የእርስዎ ውል፣ የዋጋ ግሽበት፣ የወጪ ለውጦች፣ የተያዙ ቦታዎች እና ሌሎች ህጋዊ ሁኔታዎች ውጤቱን ሊቀይሩ ይችላሉ።","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"ውጤቱ ተጨማሪ ወጪዎችን ያካትታል?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"ቁ. ተጨማሪ ወጪዎችን እና ሌሎች ተለዋዋጭ ክፍያዎችን ሳይጨምር ወርሃዊ የተጣራ ኪራይ ያስገቡ።","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"ውጤቱ ገላጭ የማጣቀሻ-ታሪፍ ሁኔታ ነው እንጂ የህግ አስተያየት ወይም የተሟላ የኪራይ ግምገማ አይደለም። የዋጋ ግሽበትን፣ አጠቃላይ የወጪ ለውጦችን፣ ማሻሻያዎችን፣ የውል ማስያዣዎችን፣ በመረጃ የተደገፈ ወይም የደረጃ ኪራይ፣ የማስታወቂያ ቀናትን እና የካንቶናዊ አሰራርን አያካትትም። እርምጃ ከመውሰድዎ በፊት የእርስዎን የኪራይ ውል እና ኦፊሴላዊ መመሪያ ይመልከቱ።","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"የስዊስ የመኖሪያ ኪራይ ውል፡ የሞርጌጅ-ማጣቀሻ-ተመን ውጤት ግምት ብቻ። ህጋዊ ውሳኔ ወይም ሙሉ የቤት ኪራይ ግምገማ አይደለም።","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"የአሁኑ ወርሃዊ የተጣራ ኪራይ (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"በእርስዎ የኪራይ ውል ወይም የቅርብ ጊዜ የኪራይ ማስታወቂያ (%) የማጣቀሻ መጠን ተገልጿል","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"የአሁኑ ኦፊሴላዊ የስዊስ ማጣቀሻ መጠን (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"የማጣቀሻ-ተመን ሁኔታን አስላ","Reference-rate-only scenario":"የማጣቀሻ-ተመን-ብቻ ሁኔታ","Current monthly net rent":"የአሁኑ ወርሃዊ የተጣራ ኪራይ","Reference-rate change":"የማጣቀሻ-ተመን ለውጥ","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"የሚገመተው ወርሃዊ ውጤት ከማጣቀሻ መጠን","Scenario monthly net rent":"ሁኔታ ወርሃዊ የተጣራ ኪራይ","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"ለ12 ወራት ዓመታዊ ውጤት በተመሳሳይ መጠን","potential increase":"አቅም መጨመር","potential decrease":"የሚቻል መቀነስ","no reference-rate change":"የማጣቀሻ-ተመን ለውጥ የለም።","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"ግምቱ ለእያንዳንዱ የ0.25 በመቶ-ነጥብ ጭማሪ 3% እና ለእያንዳንዱ ቅነሳ ተመጣጣኝ ተቃራኒ ቅነሳን ይመለከታል። ሌሎች ምክንያቶች ውጤቱን ሊለውጡ ይችላሉ.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"ይህ የዋጋ ግሽበትን፣ አጠቃላይ የወጪ ለውጦችን፣ ማሻሻያዎችን፣ የኮንትራት ማስያዣዎችን፣ ኢንዴክስ የተደረገ ወይም የደረጃ ኪራይ፣ የማስታወቂያ ቀናትን ወይም የአካባቢን የሥርዓት መስፈርቶችን አያካትትም። የእርስዎን የኪራይ ውል እና የፌደራል ቢሮ ለቤቶች መመሪያ ይመልከቱ።","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"የቅርብ ጊዜውን ይፋዊ ዋጋ እና መመሪያ ይመልከቱ","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"የስዊስ ፌዴራል የቤቶች ቢሮ (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"አንድን ሁኔታ ለማየት ኪራዩን እና ሁለቱንም ዋጋዎችን ያስገቡ።","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"ሁኔታ ይሰላል። በእሱ ላይ ከመተማመንዎ በፊት ቀኖቹን እና የኮንትራት ውሎችን ያረጋግጡ።","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"መጠኖቹን እና መጠኖቹን ያረጋግጡ። ተመኖች በ0% እና 5% መካከል መሆን አለባቸው እና በ0.25-ነጥብ ደረጃዎች ይለያያሉ።","Inputs cleared.":"ግብዓቶች ጸድተዋል።","Result":"ውጤት","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"የስዊስ የዕረፍት ጊዜ Accrual ግምት","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"የስዊዘርላንድ የዕረፍት ጊዜ ሂሳብ ማስያ - የተመጣጠነ ፈቃድ ቀሪ ሂሳብ","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"በኮንትራትዎ፣ በስራ ሳምንትዎ፣ በስራ ቀናትዎ እና በተወሰዱት ቀናት ውስጥ ካለው የዓመት ፈቃድ የስዊስ የዕረፍት ቀን ቀሪ ሂሳብ ይገምቱ።","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"ያስገቡትን የመብት እና የስራ መርሃ ግብር በመጠቀም ለአንድ የቀን መቁጠሪያ አመት የተመጣጣኝ የተከፈለ ፈቃድ ይገምቱ። ምንም የኮንትራት ውሎች አይገመቱም.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"ገምጋሚው በኮንትራትዎ ውስጥ ያሉትን የዓመት ዕረፍት ቀናት በተመረጠው ዓመት ውስጥ በተቀጠሩ የቀን መቁጠሪያ ቀናት ያነፃፅራል። ለትርፍ ሰዓት ሥራ፣ የተለመዱትን የስራ ቀናትዎን በሳምንት እና የዓመት እረፍት በሳምንታት ውስጥ ያስገቡ።","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"በአራት ሳምንታት የእረፍት፣ የአምስት ቀን የስራ ሳምንት እና በዓመቱ ውስጥ ከስራ ጋር፣ አመታዊ መብቱ አስቀድሞ የወሰደውን እረፍት ከመቀነሱ በፊት 20 የስራ ቀናት ነው።","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"የስዊስ ህጋዊ ዝቅተኛው ምንድን ነው?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"የፌደራል መመሪያ በአገልግሎት አመት ቢያንስ አራት ሳምንታት እና አምስት ሳምንታት እድሜያቸው 20 ያልሞሉ ሰራተኞችን ይገልጻል። ውል ወይም የጋራ ስምምነት የበለጠ ሊሰጥ ይችላል።","Does this decide my legal balance?":"ይህ የእኔን ህጋዊ ሚዛን ይወስናል?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"አይደለም ቀላል የቀን መቁጠሪያ-ቀን ፕሮሬሽን ነው። የውል ስምምነቶች፣ የሚመለከታቸው የጋራ ሕጎች፣ ብቁ መቅረቶች፣ ማጠቃለያ እና የአሰሪ መዝገቦች ሚዛኑን ሊለውጡ ይችላሉ።","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"ይህ ግምት ህጋዊ መብትን አይወስንም ወይም የበዓል ክፍያን አያሰላም. ለተወሰኑ የረዥም ጊዜ መቅረቶች፣ ውል-ተኮር የመሰብሰቢያ እና የማጠቃለያ ህጎች፣ የህዝብ በዓላት፣ የትርፍ ሰዓት፣ የማስተላለፍ ቀነ-ገደቦች እና አለመግባባቶች ቅነሳን አያካትትም። ኮንትራትዎን ይፈትሹ እና ለተከራካሪ ቀሪ ሂሳብ ምክር ያግኙ።","Leave year":"አመት ልቀቁ","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"በኮንትራትዎ ውስጥ የዓመት ፈቃድ (ሳምንታት)","Usual working days per week":"መደበኛ የስራ ቀናት በሳምንት","Employment start date":"የሥራ መጀመሪያ ቀን","Employment end date":"የስራ ማብቂያ ቀን","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"በዚህ የእረፍት ዓመት የተወሰዱት የእረፍት ቀናት","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"ለማቅናት ብቻ። የኮንትራት አመታዊ መብቶችን ያስገቡ; ህጋዊው ዝቅተኛው በአጠቃላይ አራት ሳምንታት ወይም ከ 20 ዓመት በታች ለሆኑ ሰራተኞች አምስት ሳምንታት ነው.","Estimate balance":"ሚዛን ግምት","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"ሒሳብዎን ለመገመት ውልዎን እና ቀኖችን ያስገቡ።","Estimated leave balance":"የተገመተው የእረፍት ቀሪ ሒሳብ","Annual leave at this schedule":"የዓመት ፈቃድ በዚህ መርሐግብር","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"የቀን መቁጠሪያ ቀናት በዚህ የዕረፍት ጊዜ ውስጥ ተቀጥረዋል።","Prorated days accrued":"የተገመቱ ቀናት ተከማችተዋል።","Days already taken":"ቀናቶች ተወስደዋል።","Estimated days remaining":"የተገመተው ቀናት ይቀራሉ","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"ይህ የዓመት ዕረፍትን በሥራ ጊዜ ውስጥ በቀን መቁጠሪያ ቀናት ያካክላል። የአሰሪ እና የኮንትራት ደንቦች ሊለያዩ ይችላሉ.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"ግምት ይሰላል። በኮንትራትዎ እና በአሰሪዎ መዝገቦች ላይ ያረጋግጡ።","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"ዓመቱን፣ ቀናቱን፣ የሥራ መርሃ ግብሩን እና እሴቶችን ይመልከቱ።"},"gu":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"સ્વિસ બેરોજગારી ભથ્થું દૃશ્ય","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"સ્વિસ બેરોજગારી લાભ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર — કુલ દૃશ્ય","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"તમારા ફંડ દ્વારા પુષ્ટિ થયેલ વીમાકૃત પગાર અને દરનો ઉપયોગ કરીને કુલ સ્વિસ દૈનિક ભથ્થાનો અંદાજ કાઢો.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"તમારા બેરોજગારી ભંડોળ દ્વારા પુષ્ટિ થયેલ વીમો કરેલ પગાર અને 70% અથવા 80% દર દાખલ કરો.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"સ્વિસ નિયમો ભથ્થા દર અને પગારની મર્યાદા નક્કી કરે છે. ફંડ પાત્રતા, કપાત, રાહ જોવાના દિવસો અને હકદારી નક્કી કરે છે. માસિક શ્રેણી 20-23 ચૂકવવાપાત્ર અઠવાડિયાના દિવસોને પ્રતિબિંબિત કરે છે.","Example":"ઉદાહરણ","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"70% પર CHF 5,000 ચૂકવવાપાત્ર અઠવાડિયાના દિવસ દીઠ લગભગ CHF 161.29 છે.","How it works":"તે કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","Questions":"પ્રશ્નો","Scope and limits":"અવકાશ અને મર્યાદા","Related tools":"સંબંધિત સાધનો","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"માસિક વીમો પગાર (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"દર ફંડ દ્વારા પુષ્ટિ થયેલ છે","70%":"70%","80%":"80%","Estimate":"અંદાજ","Clear":"સાફ કરો","Gross scenario":"ગ્રોસ સિનારિયો","Insured salary used":"વીમેદાર પગાર વપરાયો","Per payable weekday":"ચુકવવાપાત્ર અઠવાડિયાના દિવસ દીઠ","20-day month":"20-દિવસનો મહિનો","23-day month":"23-દિવસનો મહિનો","Official benefit rules":"સત્તાવાર લાભ નિયમો","Enter your confirmed figures.":"તમારા પુષ્ટિ થયેલ આંકડાઓ દાખલ કરો.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"પરિદ્રશ્યની ગણતરી કરી. તમારા ફંડ સાથે રકમની પુષ્ટિ કરો.","Check the values.":"મૂલ્યો તપાસો.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"સ્વિસ ટેનન્સી નોટિસ પ્લાનર","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"સ્વિસ રેન્ટલ નોટિસ પ્લાનર અને લેટર ડ્રાફ્ટ","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"તમારા પોતાના કરારમાંની તારીખો અને શરતો પરથી ટેનન્સી નોટિસની યોજના બનાવો; કેન્ટોન નિયમો ધાર્યા વિના પત્રનો મુસદ્દો તૈયાર કરો.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"નોટિસ પીરિયડ, તમારા કોન્ટ્રાક્ટમાં આગામી માન્ય સમાપ્તિનો દિવસ અને રસીદની તારીખ દાખલ કરો. તમારા મકાનમાલિક અથવા ભાડૂતોના સંગઠન સાથે દરેક તારીખ તપાસો.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"આયોજક તમે જે તારીખો અને સમયગાળો સપ્લાય કરો છો તે જ લાગુ કરે છે. તે નક્કી કરતું નથી કે નોટિસ માન્ય છે કે નહીં, તે કાયદેસર રીતે ક્યારે પ્રાપ્ત થાય છે અથવા વિશેષ સુરક્ષા લાગુ પડે છે કે કેમ.","Contract notice period (months)":"કોન્ટ્રાક્ટ નોટિસ અવધિ (મહિના)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"મહિનાનો આગામી માન્ય સમાપ્તિ દિવસ (કરારમાંથી)","Expected receipt date":"અપેક્ષિત રસીદ તારીખ","Your name":"તમારું નામ","Your address":"તમારું સરનામું","Landlord / agency":"જમીનદાર/એજન્સી","Recipient address":"પ્રાપ્તકર્તાનું સરનામું","Rental property":"ભાડાની મિલકત","Place":"સ્થળ","Letter date":"પત્રની તારીખ","Termination of tenancy":"ટેનન્સીની સમાપ્તિ","Calculate date and draft letter":"તારીખ અને ડ્રાફ્ટ લેટરની ગણતરી કરો","Planning date":"આયોજન તારીખ","Target date":"લક્ષ્ય તારીખ","Editable draft":"સંપાદનયોગ્ય ડ્રાફ્ટ","Copy draft":"ડ્રાફ્ટની નકલ કરો","Enter your contract terms.":"તમારા કરારની શરતો દાખલ કરો.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"પ્લાનિંગ ડ્રાફ્ટ તૈયાર. તમારા કરાર સામે ચકાસો.","Check the dates and period.":"તારીખો અને સમયગાળો તપાસો.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"પરિણામ પૂરા પાડવામાં આવેલ કોન્ટ્રાક્ટ નોટિસ દિવસને અનુસરે છે; તે કોઈ વૈધાનિક સૂચના ચુકાદો નથી.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"સ્વિસ પ્રોપર્ટી ગેઇન સિનારિયો","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"સ્વિસ પ્રોપર્ટી ગેન્સ ટેક્સ — વપરાશકર્તા દ્વારા દાખલ કરેલ દર દૃશ્ય","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"તમારા પોતાના ટ્રાન્ઝેક્શન ખર્ચનો ઉપયોગ કરીને અને જવાબદાર કેન્ટનમાંથી ટેક્સ દરનો ઉપયોગ કરીને પ્રોપર્ટી ગેઇનનો અંદાજ કાઢો.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"પ્રક્રિયા, સંપાદન ખર્ચ, તમે પુષ્ટિ કરેલ પાત્ર ખર્ચ અને સત્તાવાર કેન્ટોનલ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર તરફથી અસરકારક દર દાખલ કરો.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"સ્વિસ પ્રોપર્ટી ગેઇન ટેક્સ કેન્ટન, હોલ્ડિંગ પિરિયડ, કપાત અને કેસ પ્રમાણે બદલાય છે. આ સાધન દર સપ્લાય કરતું નથી અથવા સ્વીકાર્ય ખર્ચ નક્કી કરતું નથી.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"વેચાણની આવક (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"એક્વિઝિશન કોસ્ટ (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"અન્ય ખર્ચની પુષ્ટિ સ્વીકાર્ય (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"અધિકૃત સ્ત્રોતમાંથી અસરકારક કર દર (%)","Estimate scenario":"અંદાજિત દૃશ્ય","Illustrative scenario":"દૃષ્ટાંતરૂપ દૃશ્ય","Gain entered":"ગેઇન દાખલ કર્યો","Tax at entered rate":"દાખલ કરેલ દર પર કર","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"તમારા રેકોર્ડ્સ અને કેન્ટન સ્ત્રોતમાંથી આંકડાઓ દાખલ કરો.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"પરિદ્રશ્યની ગણતરી; તેને કેન્ટન સાથે ચકાસો.","Check amounts and rate.":"માત્રા અને દર તપાસો.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"કોઈ કેન્ટન ટેક્સ ટેબલ એમ્બેડેડ નથી; તમારો દાખલ કરેલ અસરકારક દર અંદાજને આગળ ધપાવે છે.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"સ્વિસ વારસો અને ભેટ કર દૃશ્ય","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"સ્વિસ વારસો અને ભેટ કર — તમારા દરનું દૃશ્ય","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"વપરાશકર્તા દ્વારા દાખલ કરાયેલ મુક્તિ અને દરમાંથી કરપાત્ર રકમનો અંદાજ કાઢો; નિયમો કેન્ટન અને સંબંધ પ્રમાણે બદલાય છે.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"પ્રાપ્તકર્તા અને કેન્ટન માટે પુષ્ટિ થયેલ રકમ, મુક્તિ અને અસરકારક દર દાખલ કરો.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"કેન્ટન નિયમો અને કૌટુંબિક સંબંધો મુક્તિ અને દરોને બદલી શકે છે. આ સાધન કેન્ટોન નિયમ પસંદ કરતું નથી અથવા કર જવાબદારી નક્કી કરતું નથી.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"વારસા અથવા ભેટની રકમ (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"કેન્ટન (CHF) સાથે મુક્તિની પુષ્ટિ","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"કેન્ટન (%) સાથે અસરકારક દરની પુષ્ટિ","Amount after entered exemption":"મુક્તિ દાખલ કર્યા પછીની રકમ","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"તમારા કેસ માટે પુષ્ટિ થયેલ આંકડાઓ દાખલ કરો.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"અંદાજ ફક્ત તમે દાખલ કરો છો તે મુક્તિ અને દરનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"સ્વિસ ચાઇલ્ડ સપોર્ટ બજેટ દૃશ્ય","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"સ્વિસ ચાઇલ્ડ સપોર્ટ બજેટ — પારદર્શક ઘરગથ્થુ દૃશ્ય","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"દાખલ કરેલ ડાયરેક્ટ-કોસ્ટ ક્રેડિટ પછી માતાપિતાની આવક દ્વારા દાખલ કરેલ બાળ બજેટ ફાળવો.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"બાળકની દસ્તાવેજીકૃત માસિક જરૂરિયાતો, બંને માતા-પિતાની ઉપલબ્ધ માસિક આવક અને તમે ક્રેડિટ કરવા માંગતા હોય તેવા કોઈપણ સીધા ખર્ચનો ઉપયોગ કરો.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"આ માત્ર પ્લાનિંગ વર્કશીટ છે. તે સ્વિસ બાળ-જાળવણી પુરસ્કાર અથવા કાનૂની પદ્ધતિ નથી; આવાસ, સંભાળ, કર, લાભો અને કેસ કાયદાનું મૂલ્યાંકન કરવામાં આવતું નથી.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"તમે દસ્તાવેજીકૃત કરેલ માસિક બાળકનું બજેટ (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"પિતૃ A ઉપલબ્ધ માસિક આવક (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"પિતૃ B ઉપલબ્ધ માસિક આવક (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"પેરેન્ટ A દ્વારા ક્રેડિટ (CHF) દ્વારા ચૂકવવામાં આવેલ ડાયરેક્ટ ચાઇલ્ડ ખર્ચ","Allocate scenario":"દૃશ્ય ફાળવો","Illustrative allocation":"દૃષ્ટાંતરૂપ ફાળવણી","Parent A remaining contribution":"માતા-પિતા એ બાકીનું યોગદાન","Parent B contribution":"પિતૃ B યોગદાન","Entered monthly child budget":"માસિક બાળ બજેટ દાખલ કર્યું","Enter your household budget figures.":"તમારા ઘરના બજેટના આંકડા દાખલ કરો.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"બજેટ દૃશ્ય ગણતરી કરેલ; લાયક સલાહકાર સાથે કાનૂની જવાબદારીઓની ચર્ચા કરો.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"માત્રા તપાસો; ક્રેડિટ બજેટ કરતાં વધી શકે નહીં.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"શેર બે દાખલ કરેલ આવકના પ્રમાણસર છે; ડાયરેક્ટ-કોસ્ટ ક્રેડિટ પહેલા બાદ કરવામાં આવે છે.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"બ્રાઉઝર હાઇફનેશન પૂર્વાવલોકન","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"વર્ડ હાઇફનેશન પૂર્વાવલોકન — બ્રાઉઝર ભાષા પેટર્ન","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"તમે પ્રદાન કરો છો તે ટેક્સ્ટ માટે બ્રાઉઝર હાઇફનેશનનું પૂર્વાવલોકન કરો; આધાર બ્રાઉઝર અને સ્થાપિત ભાષા સંસાધનો પર આધાર રાખે છે.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"તમારા લખાણ સાથે મેળ ખાતી ભાષા પસંદ કરો, એક નમૂનો દાખલ કરો અને ઉપલબ્ધ લાઇન પહોળાઈને સમાયોજિત કરો.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"બ્રાઉઝરના મૂળ CSS હાઇફનેશનનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. તે શબ્દકોશોને બંડલ કરતું નથી; અસમર્થિત બ્રાઉઝર્સ કોઈ હાઇફન્સ બતાવતા નથી. ટેક્સ્ટની નકલ કરવાથી મૂળ જોડણી જળવાઈ રહે છે.","Text language (BCP 47)":"ટેક્સ્ટ લેંગ્વેજ (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"પૂર્વાવલોકન પહોળાઈ (અક્ષરો)","Text to preview":"પૂર્વાવલોકન માટે ટેક્સ્ટ","Preview":"પૂર્વાવલોકન","Enter text and choose its language.":"ટેક્સ્ટ દાખલ કરો અને તેની ભાષા પસંદ કરો.","Preview updated.":"પૂર્વાવલોકન અપડેટ કર્યું.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"સમર્થિત ભાષા ટેગ અને ટેક્સ્ટ દાખલ કરો.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"બ્રાઉઝર શબ્દો ક્યાં તોડી શકે છે તે જોવા માટે અલગ અલગ પહોળાઈ પર સમાન ફકરાનો પ્રયાસ કરો.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"ખાનગી સ્પેલચેક વર્કસ્પેસ","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"સ્થાનિક જોડણી તપાસનાર — તમારા બ્રાઉઝર શબ્દકોશનો ઉપયોગ કરો","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"બ્રાઉઝરની મૂળ જોડણી તપાસ સાથે ટેક્સ્ટને સંપાદિત કરો, ભાષા પસંદ કરો અને સુધારેલ ટેક્સ્ટની નકલ કરો.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"ટેક્સ્ટ આ પેજમાં રહે છે. તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં સ્પેલિંગ ડિક્શનરી હોય તે ભાષા સેટ કરો, પછી તેના સ્પેલિંગ મેનૂનો ઉપયોગ કરો અથવા સૂચનોને રેખાંકિત કરો.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"આ કાર્યસ્થળ ટેક્સ્ટ અથવા શિપ શબ્દકોશો અપલોડ કરતું નથી. બ્રાઉઝરની જોડણી તપાસની ઉપલબ્ધતા અને સૂચનો ઉપકરણ, બ્રાઉઝર અને ઇન્સ્ટોલ કરેલ શબ્દકોશ પર આધારિત છે.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"જોડણી તપાસની ભાષા (BCP 47)","Text to check":"તપાસ કરવા માટે ટેક્સ્ટ","Copy text":"ટેક્સ્ટ કૉપિ કરો","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"ટેક્સ્ટ લખો અથવા પેસ્ટ કરો. સૂચનો માટે જમણું-ક્લિક કરો અથવા તમારા ઉપકરણ જોડણી મેનૂનો ઉપયોગ કરો.","Text copied.":"ટેક્સ્ટની નકલ કરી.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"આપમેળે નકલ કરી શકાઈ નથી; ટેક્સ્ટ પસંદ કરો અને નકલ કરો.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"મેળ ખાતા શબ્દકોશ વિનાનું બ્રાઉઝર ખોટી જોડણીઓને ચિહ્નિત કરી શકશે નહીં.","Resume Structure Checker":"સ્ટ્રક્ચર ચેકર ફરી શરૂ કરો","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS રેઝ્યૂમે તપાસનાર - મફત સ્થાનિક PDF અને DOCX સમીક્ષા","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં રેઝ્યૂમે ટેક્સ્ટ, હેડિંગ, સેક્શન, લિંક્સ અને બુલેટ સ્ટ્રક્ચર તપાસો. ગણતરી દ્વારા જોબ-વર્ણનની શરતોની તુલના કરો; કોઈ હાયરિંગ સ્કોર અથવા અપલોડ નથી.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"ટેક્સ્ટ-આધારિત રેઝ્યૂમે ખરેખર શું ઉજાગર કરે છે તેની સમીક્ષા કરો: એક્સટ્રેક્ટ કરેલ ટેક્સ્ટ, હેડિંગ સ્ટ્રક્ચર, સંપર્ક-ક્ષેત્રની હાજરી, લિંક્સ અને સામાન્ય રીતે ઓળખાતા વિભાગો. વૈકલ્પિક રીતે પુનરાવર્તિત જોબ-વર્ણન શરતોની તુલના કરો.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"અનુભવ અને શિક્ષણ માટે મથાળા 1 શૈલીઓ સાથે DOCX તે મથાળાઓ દર્શાવે છે. પીડીએફ તેના પસંદ કરી શકાય તેવા ટેક્સ્ટમાંથી તપાસવામાં આવે છે; કૉલમ અલગ ક્રમમાં વાંચી શકાય છે.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX ફાઇલો સ્થાનિક રીતે Office ZIP/XML તરીકે તપાસવામાં આવે છે. PDF ને વિલંબિત સ્થાનિક PDF.js એન્જિન સાથે વાંચવામાં આવે છે. વૈકલ્પિક જોબ-વર્ણન સરખામણી દરેક ટેક્સ્ટમાં પસંદ કરેલા શબ્દોની ગણતરી કરે છે; તે કોઈ સ્કોર બનાવતો નથી અથવા કોઈને નોકરીએ રાખવાની ભલામણ કરતું નથી.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"આ એક ફોર્મેટ અને ટેક્સ્ટ-સ્ટ્રક્ચર ચેક છે, ATS સિમ્યુલેટર, કાનૂની સમીક્ષા અથવા ઇન્ટરવ્યુની સફળતાની આગાહી નથી. પસંદ કરી શકાય તેવા ટેક્સ્ટ વિના સ્કેન કરેલ PDF ને પહેલા OCRની જરૂર છે. પાસવર્ડ-સંરક્ષિત, મેક્રો-સક્ષમ, સહી કરેલ અથવા અસામાન્ય રીતે મોટા દસ્તાવેજો સમર્થિત નથી.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"રેઝ્યૂમે પસંદ કરો (PDF અથવા DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"તમારી ફાઇલો આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં રહે છે અને અપલોડ થતી નથી. મહત્તમ 20 એમબી; પીડીએફ 50 પૃષ્ઠો સુધી. DOCX વિસ્તૃત સામગ્રી 80 MB પર મર્યાદિત છે.","Optional job description":"વૈકલ્પિક જોબ વર્ણન","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"જો તમને ટર્મ-ફ્રિકવન્સી સરખામણી જોઈતી હોય તો સાદો ટેક્સ્ટ પેસ્ટ કરો. તમારે વિશ્લેષણ કરવાની જરૂર ન હોય તેવી સંવેદનશીલ માહિતીનો સમાવેશ કરશો નહીં.","Paste job-description text here…":"જોબ-વર્ણન ટેક્સ્ટ અહીં પેસ્ટ કરો...","Analyze locally":"સ્થાનિક રીતે વિશ્લેષણ કરો","Clear files and report":"ફાઈલો અને રિપોર્ટ સાફ કરો","Resume review":"સમીક્ષા ફરી શરૂ કરો","File type":"ફાઇલ પ્રકાર","Extracted characters":"એક્સ્ટ્રેક્ટ કરેલ અક્ષરો","Words counted":"શબ્દો ગણ્યા","Detected headings":"સહિત મથાળા","Recognized sections":"માન્ય વિભાગો","Hyperlinks found":"હાયપરલિંક્સ મળી","Bullet paragraphs":"બુલેટ ફકરા","An email address appears in the text":"ટેક્સ્ટમાં ઈમેલ એડ્રેસ દેખાય છે","No email address pattern was detected":"કોઈ ઈમેલ એડ્રેસ પેટર્ન મળી નથી","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"ટેક્સ્ટમાં ફોન-નંબર જેવી પેટર્ન દેખાય છે","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"કોઈ ફોન-નંબર જેવી પેટર્ન મળી નથી","Job-description terms (counts only)":"જોબ-વર્ણન શરતો (માત્ર ગણતરીઓ)","Term":"સમય","In job text":"જોબ ટેક્સ્ટમાં","In resume":"બાયોડેટામાં","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"ટર્મ કાઉન્ટ્સની સરખામણી કરવા માટે જોબ વર્ણન પેસ્ટ કરો.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"કોઈ સ્પષ્ટ હેડિંગ શૈલીઓ મળી નથી. PDF શીર્ષકો ટેક્સ્ટના કદ પરથી અંદાજવામાં આવે છે અને તે અચોક્કસ હોઈ શકે છે.","Detected":"શોધાયેલ","Not detected":"મળ્યું નથી","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"આ હ્યુરિસ્ટિક સામાન્ય વિભાગના નામોના મર્યાદિત સમૂહને ઓળખે છે; તે નક્કી કરતું નથી કે કયા વિભાગો જરૂરી છે.","Profile / summary":"પ્રોફાઇલ / સારાંશ","Experience":"અનુભવ","Education":"શિક્ષણ","Skills":"કૌશલ્યો","Contact":"સંપર્ક","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"કોઈ પસંદ કરી શકાય તેવું લખાણ મળ્યું નથી. ફક્ત સ્કેન કરેલ PDF ને તપાસી શકાય તે પહેલા OCR ની જરૂર છે.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"શરૂ કરવા માટે PDF અથવા DOCX રેઝ્યૂમે પસંદ કરો.","Reading the selected file locally…":"પસંદ કરેલી ફાઇલને સ્થાનિક રીતે વાંચી રહી છે...","Local structure review complete.":"સ્થાનિક બંધારણની સમીક્ષા પૂર્ણ.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"આ બ્રાઉઝર જરૂરી સ્થાનિક દસ્તાવેજ સુવિધાને સપોર્ટ કરતું નથી.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"જણાવેલ સ્થાનિક મર્યાદા સુધી માન્ય PDF અથવા આધુનિક DOCX ફાઇલ પસંદ કરો.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF વાંચી શકાયું નથી. તે ક્ષતિગ્રસ્ત, એન્ક્રિપ્ટેડ અથવા પસંદ કરવા યોગ્ય ટેક્સ્ટ ધરાવતું નથી.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX પેકેજ સુરક્ષિત રીતે ખોલી અથવા વાંચી શકાયું નથી.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"શું આ ટૂલ મારા રેઝ્યૂમેને અપલોડ કરે છે અથવા સાચવે છે?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"નં. પાર્સિંગ અને વિશ્લેષણ તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં ચાલે છે. તમે રિપોર્ટ સાફ કરો અથવા પૃષ્ઠ છોડી દો તે પછી ફાઇલ ટેક્સ્ટ સર્વરને મોકલવામાં આવતી નથી અથવા જાળવી રાખવામાં આવતી નથી.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"શું તે અનુમાન કરે છે કે શું ATS અથવા એમ્પ્લોયર મારો રેઝ્યૂમે સ્વીકારશે?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"નં. તે ફક્ત વાંચી શકાય તેવું લખાણ અને સરળ માળખું તપાસે છે. હાયરિંગ સિસ્ટમ્સ અલગ છે, અને આ ATS સુસંગતતા ગેરંટી અથવા ભાડે રાખવાની આગાહી નથી.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"શું તે સ્કેન કરેલી PDF વાંચી શકે છે?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"ફક્ત જો PDF માં પસંદ કરી શકાય તેવું ટેક્સ્ટ લેયર હોય. આ તપાસનાર OCR મોડલ ડાઉનલોડ કરતું નથી; સ્કેન કરેલ ઈમેજ-ઓન્લી ડોક્યુમેન્ટ માટે પહેલા OCR ટૂલનો ઉપયોગ કરો.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"જોબ-વર્ણન સરખામણીનો અર્થ શું છે?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"તે સરળ સામાન્યીકરણ પછી પુનરાવર્તિત શરતો માટે ગણતરીઓ દર્શાવે છે. તે મેચની ટકાવારી, રેન્કિંગ, ભલામણ અથવા તમારી લાયકાતનું મૂલ્યાંકન નથી.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"શા માટે PDF એ DOCX કરતા ઓછા હેડિંગ બતાવે છે?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF સામાન્ય રીતે સિમેન્ટીક હેડિંગ શૈલીઓ સાચવતા નથી. પરીક્ષક ટેક્સ્ટના કદ અને વાંચન ક્રમ પરથી અગ્રણી રેખાઓનો અંદાજ કાઢે છે, તેથી કૉલમ અને વિઝ્યુઅલ ડિઝાઇન પરિણામને અસર કરી શકે છે.","How local resume review works":"સ્થાનિક રેઝ્યૂમે સમીક્ષા કેવી રીતે કાર્ય કરે છે","Resume checker questions":"ચેકર પ્રશ્નો ફરી શરૂ કરો","Scope and limitations":"સ્કોપ અને મર્યાદાઓ","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"સ્થાનિક ગાયક અને સાથ વિભાજક","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"વોકલ રીમુવર — સ્થાનિક રીતે અલગ અવાજ અને સાથ આપો","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં અંદાજિત ગાયક અને સાથમાં ટૂંકા સ્ટીરિયો ઓડિયો નમૂનાને અલગ કરો. ઑડિયો તમારા ઉપકરણ પર રહે છે; મોડેલ તેના સાર્વજનિક હોસ્ટ પરથી ડાઉનલોડ થયેલ છે.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"30 સેકન્ડ સુધીની સ્ટીરિયો મ્યુઝિક ક્લિપ પસંદ કરો. પ્રથમ ઉપયોગ પર, બ્રાઉઝર 35.6 MB મોડલ ડાઉનલોડ કરે છે. ઑડિઓ ફાઇલ આ ઉપકરણ પર પ્રક્રિયા કરવામાં આવે છે અને તે ક્યારેય અપલોડ થતી નથી.","What you get":"તમને શું મળે છે","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"બે ડબલ્યુએવી સ્ટેમનું પૂર્વાવલોકન કરો અને ડાઉનલોડ કરો: અંદાજિત ગાયક અને શેષ સાથ. પરિણામો મિશ્રણ પર આધાર રાખે છે અને તેમાં કલાકૃતિઓ હોઈ શકે છે.","Local processing":"સ્થાનિક પ્રક્રિયા","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"ટૂલ ONNX અને ONNX રનટાઇમ વેબ પર નિકાસ કરાયેલ ઓપન-અનમિક્સ UMX-HQ વોકલ્સ નેટવર્કનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. જ્યારે તમે અલગ દબાવો છો ત્યારે જ મોડેલ મેળવવામાં આવે છે; કોઈ ચૂકવેલ અનુમાન API અથવા સબ્સ્ક્રિપ્શનનો ઉપયોગ થતો નથી. ઑડિયો સ્થાનિક રીતે ડીકોડ, પ્રોસેસ અને નિકાસ કરવામાં આવે છે.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"આ સ્ટીરિયો 44.1 kHz પ્રોસેસિંગ અને 30 સેકન્ડ સુધીની ક્લિપ્સ માટેનો અંદાજ છે. મોનો સ્ત્રોતો સ્ટીરિયો પર ડુપ્લિકેટ છે. વાદ્યો, ભારે અસરો, લાઇવ રેકોર્ડિંગ અને અસામાન્ય શૈલીઓમાં ઊંડે સુધી ભળેલા ગાયક લીકેજ અથવા કલાકૃતિઓ પેદા કરી શકે છે. સ્વચ્છ માસ્ટર તરીકે પરિણામનો ઉપયોગ કરશો નહીં. મોડલ ડાઉનલોડ કરવા માટે ઇન્ટરનેટ કનેક્શનની જરૂર છે; ઑડિયો આ ઉપકરણને છોડતું નથી.","Is my audio uploaded?":"શું મારો ઓડિયો અપલોડ થયેલ છે?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"નં. પસંદ કરેલ ઑડિઓ તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં ડીકોડ અને પ્રક્રિયા કરવામાં આવે છે. જ્યારે તમે અલગ થવાનું શરૂ કરો છો ત્યારે એકમાત્ર નેટવર્ક વિનંતી મોડેલ ડાઉનલોડ છે.","Why is the first run slow?":"પ્રથમ રન ધીમો કેમ છે?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"બ્રાઉઝર 35.6 MB મોડલ એકવાર ડાઉનલોડ કરે છે; બ્રાઉઝર તેને કેશ કરી શકે છે. અનુમાન પછી ઉપકરણ CPU પર સ્થાનિક રીતે ચાલે છે.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"શું દરેક ગીત સ્વચ્છ રીતે અલગ થશે?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"નં. મોડેલ વોકલ સ્ટેમનો અંદાજ લગાવે છે અને તે વોકલ લીકેજ છોડી શકે છે, ઇન્સ્ટ્રુમેન્ટ હાર્મોનિક્સ દૂર કરી શકે છે અથવા કલાકૃતિઓ બનાવી શકે છે. સ્ટેમ પર આધાર રાખતા પહેલા સાંભળો.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"સ્ટીરિયો ઓડિયો ફાઇલ (30 સેકન્ડ સુધી)","Choose audio":"ઓડિયો પસંદ કરો","Separate vocals":"અલગ અવાજ","Cancel / clear":"રદ કરો / સાફ કરો","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"શરૂ કરવા માટે ટૂંકી ઓડિયો ફાઇલ પસંદ કરો.","Downloading the separation model…":"સેપરેશન મોડલ ડાઉનલોડ કરી રહ્યું છે...","Separating locally…":"સ્થાનિક રીતે અલગ થઈ રહ્યું છે...","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"વિભાજન પૂર્ણ. પૂર્વાવલોકન કરો અથવા સ્ટેમ ડાઉનલોડ કરો.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"આ ફાઇલ પર પ્રક્રિયા કરી શકાઈ નથી અથવા મોડેલ લોડ કરી શક્યું નથી. ફોર્મેટ અને કનેક્શન તપાસો, પછી ફરી પ્રયાસ કરો.","Model and weight license information":"મોડલ અને વેઇટ લાયસન્સ માહિતી","Estimated vocals":"અંદાજિત ગાયક","Estimated accompaniment":"અંદાજિત સાથ","Download WAV":"WAV ડાઉનલોડ કરો","Progress":"પ્રગતિ","Preparing local separation…":"સ્થાનિક વિભાજનની તૈયારી કરી રહ્યું છે...","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"વિભાજન પૂર્ણ. આ ઉપકરણ પર ઑડિયો રહે છે.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"આ ઓડિયો પર પ્રક્રિયા કરી શકાઈ નથી. 30 સેકન્ડની અંદર સ્ટીરિયો મ્યુઝિક ફાઇલ અજમાવી જુઓ.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"સ્વિસ હેલ્થ ઈન્સ્યોરન્સ કપાતપાત્ર તુલનાકાર","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"સ્વિસ હેલ્થ ઇન્સ્યોરન્સ ફ્રેન્ચાઇઝ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર — વાર્ષિક ખર્ચની સરખામણી કરો","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"તમે દાખલ કરો છો તે પ્રીમિયમ અને પાત્ર વાર્ષિક તબીબી ખર્ચનો ઉપયોગ કરીને સ્વિસ મૂળભૂત આરોગ્ય વીમા કપાતપાત્રોની તુલના કરો. કોઈ વીમાદાતા ક્વોટ અનુમાનિત નથી.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"દરેક કપાતપાત્ર માટે સમાન વીમાદાતા દ્વારા દર્શાવેલ માસિક પ્રીમિયમ દાખલ કરો, પછી નીચા, અપેક્ષિત અને ઉચ્ચ વાર્ષિક સારવાર-ખર્ચના દૃશ્યોની તુલના કરો.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"અનિવાર્ય સ્વિસ બેઝિક હેલ્થ ઈન્સ્યોરન્સ માટે, પુખ્ત માનક કપાતપાત્ર CHF 300 છે અને બાળક કપાતપાત્ર CHF 0 છે. વૈકલ્પિક સ્તર વય જૂથ દ્વારા અલગ પડે છે. કપાતપાત્ર થયા પછી, પ્રમાણભૂત રીટેન્શન ફી 10% પાત્ર બાકી ખર્ચ છે, જે પુખ્તો માટે પ્રતિ વર્ષ CHF 700 અને બાળકો માટે 350 CHF છે. આ સાધન તમારા દાખલ કરેલ પ્રીમિયમને આ મોડેલ કરેલ ખર્ચ શેરિંગમાં ઉમેરે છે; તે વીમાદાતાના દરો મેળવતી નથી અથવા તમારા માટે કયો વિકલ્પ યોગ્ય છે તે નક્કી કરતું નથી.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"જો કોઈ પુખ્ત વ્યક્તિ CHF 300 કપાતપાત્ર દરે CHF 400 માસિક પ્રીમિયમ અને CHF 2,500 કપાતપાત્ર દરે CHF 350 દાખલ કરે છે, તો વાર્ષિક પ્રીમિયમ તફાવત CHF 600 છે. તે બચતની સરખામણી કિંમતની વહેંચણીમાં મોડલ કરેલ તફાવત સાથે કરો, અને તમારી દરેક કિંમતમાં અપેક્ષિત નીચી રકમ.","How the estimate works":"અંદાજ કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","Common questions":"સામાન્ય પ્રશ્નો","Scope and exclusions":"સ્કોપ અને બાકાત","Where do I get the premiums?":"હું પ્રીમિયમ ક્યાંથી મેળવી શકું?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"સમાન વીમાદાતા, પ્રીમિયમ ક્ષેત્ર, વય જૂથ, અકસ્માત કવર અને વીમા મોડેલ માટે વર્તમાન માસિક ઑફર્સનો ઉપયોગ કરો. Priminfo એ અધિકૃત ફેડરલ સરખામણી સાઇટ છે. આ પૃષ્ઠ વીમા કંપનીના અવતરણો મેળવતું નથી અથવા પુનઃઉત્પાદિત કરતું નથી.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"શું તમામ સૂચિબદ્ધ કપાતપાત્ર સ્તરો હંમેશા ઓફર કરવામાં આવે છે?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"નં. વીમા કંપનીઓએ દરેક વૈકલ્પિક સ્તરની ઑફર કરવાની જરૂર નથી, અને ઑફર્સ યુવાન વયસ્કો માટે અલગ હોઈ શકે છે. તમારી પોતાની પોલિસી માટે દર્શાવેલ પ્રીમિયમ જ દાખલ કરો; અનુપલબ્ધ વિકલ્પો ખાલી છોડો.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"શું આ મારું સંપૂર્ણ મેડિકલ બિલ દર્શાવે છે?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"નં. મોડલ યોગ્ય ખર્ચ પર સામાન્ય કપાતપાત્ર અને પ્રમાણભૂત 10% રીટેન્શન ફી આવરી લે છે. તેમાં હોસ્પિટલ ડે યોગદાન, વિશેષ 40% દવા રીટેન્શન, મુક્તિ સેવાઓ, બિન-આવરી સંભાળ અને પૂરક વીમો શામેલ છે.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"આ એક દૃશ્ય સરખામણી છે, વીમો, તબીબી અથવા નાણાકીય સલાહ નહીં. તે તમારી સારવાર અથવા પ્રીમિયમની આગાહી કરતું નથી. તેમાં હોસ્પિટલ ડે યોગદાન (સામાન્ય રીતે 15 ઇનપેશન્ટ દિવસ દીઠ CHF, વૈધાનિક મુક્તિ સાથે), અમુક દવાઓ પર વિશેષ 40% રીટેન્શન, પ્રસૂતિ/નિવારક મુક્તિ, ફરજિયાત કવરની બહારની સેવાઓ, પ્રીમિયમ સબસિડી અને પૂરક વીમો શામેલ નથી. તેથી વાસ્તવિક સહ-ચુકવણી અલગ હોઈ શકે છે. ઉચ્ચ કપાતપાત્ર હોવાનો અર્થ એ છે કે જો તમે કાળજી મેળવો છો તો તમારે વધુ અગાઉથી ચૂકવણી કરવા સક્ષમ બનવાની જરૂર છે.","Who is insured under this policy?":"આ પોલિસી હેઠળ કોનો વીમો લેવામાં આવ્યો છે?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"પુખ્ત વય (19 કે તેથી વધુ)","Child (under 18)":"બાળક (18 વર્ષથી ઓછી ઉંમરના)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"નીચા વાર્ષિક પાત્ર સારવાર-ખર્ચ દૃશ્ય (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"અપેક્ષિત વાર્ષિક પાત્ર સારવાર ખર્ચ (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"ઉચ્ચ વાર્ષિક પાત્ર સારવાર-ખર્ચ દૃશ્ય (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"એક વીમાદાતા તરફથી માસિક પ્રીમિયમ","Monthly premium":"માસિક પ્રીમિયમ","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"આ જ નીતિ માટે ઓફર કરેલા વિકલ્પો જ દાખલ કરો. અન્યને ખાલી છોડો.","Adult deductible choices":"પુખ્ત કપાતપાત્ર પસંદગીઓ","Child deductible choices":"બાળક કપાતપાત્ર પસંદગીઓ","Compare annual costs":"વાર્ષિક ખર્ચની સરખામણી કરો","Clear entries":"એન્ટ્રીઝ સાફ કરો","Download CSV":"CSV ડાઉનલોડ કરો","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"અંદાજિત વાર્ષિક પ્રીમિયમ વત્તા ખર્ચ શેરિંગ","Deductible":"કપાતપાત્ર","Annual premiums":"વાર્ષિક પ્રીમિયમ","Total at low costs":"ઓછા ખર્ચે કુલ","Total at expected costs":"અપેક્ષિત ખર્ચ પર કુલ","Total at high costs":"કુલ ઊંચા ખર્ચે","Cost sharing at low costs":"ઓછા ખર્ચે ખર્ચ વહેંચણી","Cost sharing at expected costs":"અપેક્ષિત ખર્ચ પર ખર્ચ વહેંચણી","Cost sharing at high costs":"ઉચ્ચ ખર્ચ પર ખર્ચ શેરિંગ","Difference from lowest available deductible":"સૌથી ઓછા ઉપલબ્ધ કપાતપાત્રથી તફાવત","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"તબીબી ખર્ચ જ્યાં પ્રીમિયમ બચત વપરાય છે","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"દાખલ કરેલ પ્રીમિયમ બચત મોડલ કરેલ ખર્ચ-શેરિંગ શ્રેણીમાં રદ કરવામાં આવતી નથી.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"સૌથી ઓછી કપાતપાત્ર સામે કોઈ પ્રીમિયમ બચત નથી.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"દાખલ કરેલા વિકલ્પોમાં સૌથી ઓછી અપેક્ષિત કુલ","Scenario details":"દૃશ્ય વિગતો","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"ઓછામાં ઓછા બે ઉપલબ્ધ કપાતપાત્ર માટે ત્રણ ઓર્ડર કરેલ તબીબી-ખર્ચના દૃશ્યો અને માસિક પ્રીમિયમ દાખલ કરો.","Official rules and current premiums:":"સત્તાવાર નિયમો અને વર્તમાન પ્રિમીયમ:","Federal deductible rules":"ફેડરલ કપાતપાત્ર નિયમો","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo સત્તાવાર પ્રીમિયમ સરખામણી","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં ગણતરી કરેલ સરખામણી.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"વય જૂથ, ઓર્ડર કરેલ ખર્ચ દૃશ્યો અને ઓછામાં ઓછા બે માસિક પ્રીમિયમ તપાસો.","Entries cleared.":"એન્ટ્રી સાફ કરી.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV સ્થાનિક રીતે ડાઉનલોડ કરેલ.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"સ્વિસ હેલ્થ પ્રીમિયમ રિડક્શન કેલ્ક્યુલેટર","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"સ્વિસ પ્રીમિયમ સબસિડી કેલ્ક્યુલેટર — તમારું નેટ પ્રીમિયમ","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"હાલના પ્રીમિયમમાંથી નેટ સ્વિસ હેલ્થ-ઇન્શ્યોરન્સ પ્રીમિયમની ગણતરી કરો અને તમારા કેન્ટન દ્વારા પહેલેથી જ મંજૂર કરાયેલ માસિક ઘટાડો.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"તમારા વીમાદાતા અથવા કેન્ટોનલ નિર્ણય તરફથી પ્રીમિયમ અને પુષ્ટિ કરેલ માસિક ઘટાડો દાખલ કરો. આ સાધન નક્કી કરતું નથી કે તમે લાયક છો કે નહીં.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"સ્વિસ કેન્ટન્સ નક્કી કરે છે કે કોણ લાયક છે, કેટલો સપોર્ટ આપવામાં આવે છે અને અરજીની જરૂર છે કે કેમ. આ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર માત્ર એક પોલિસી પ્રીમિયમમાંથી પુષ્ટિ થયેલ માસિક ઘટાડો બાદ કરે છે અને વાર્ષિક રકમ દર્શાવે છે.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"જો માસિક પ્રીમિયમ CHF 420 છે અને પુષ્ટિ થયેલ ઘટાડો CHF 120 છે, તો અંદાજિત ચોખ્ખું પ્રીમિયમ દર મહિને CHF 300 છે.","How the calculation works":"ગણતરી કેવી રીતે કાર્ય કરે છે","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"શું આ મને કહે છે કે હું લાયક છું કે નહીં?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"નં. પાત્રતા અને પુરસ્કારની રકમ નિવાસસ્થાનના કેન્ટન દ્વારા નક્કી કરવામાં આવે છે. લિંક કરેલ સત્તાવાર માહિતીનો ઉપયોગ કરો અથવા કેન્ટોનલ ઓફિસનો સંપર્ક કરો.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"ઘટાડાની રકમ હું ક્યાં શોધી શકું?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"વર્તમાન નિર્ણય અથવા તમારા વીમાદાતા દ્વારા દર્શાવેલ ઘટાડેલા પ્રીમિયમનો ઉપયોગ કરો. કેટલાક કેન્ટન્સ આપોઆપ ઘટાડો આપે છે; અન્યને અરજીની જરૂર છે.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"આ એક નીતિ માટે અંકગણિત છે, પાત્રતા અથવા લાભના નિર્ણય માટે નહીં. તે ઘરની આવક, સંપત્તિ, કૌટુંબિક સ્થિતિ, સમયમર્યાદા, કેન્ટોનલ થ્રેશોલ્ડ અથવા એપ્લિકેશન અધિકારોની ગણતરી કરતું નથી. પ્રીમિયમ અને પુરસ્કારો બદલાઈ શકે છે; તમારા વીમાદાતા અને કેન્ટોન સાથે તેમની પુષ્ટિ કરો.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"વર્તમાન માસિક પ્રીમિયમ (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"માસિક ઘટાડો પહેલેથી જ મંજૂર (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"કેન્ટન અથવા વીમા કંપની દ્વારા પુષ્ટિ થયેલ રકમ દાખલ કરો; એવોર્ડ તરીકે અંદાજનો ઉપયોગ કરશો નહીં.","Calculate net premium":"નેટ પ્રીમિયમની ગણતરી કરો","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"વર્તમાન પ્રીમિયમ અને પુષ્ટિ થયેલ ઘટાડો દાખલ કરો.","Estimated premium after reduction":"ઘટાડા પછી અંદાજિત પ્રીમિયમ","Current monthly premium":"વર્તમાન માસિક પ્રીમિયમ","Monthly reduction":"માસિક ઘટાડો","Estimated net monthly premium":"અંદાજિત ચોખ્ખું માસિક પ્રીમિયમ","Reduction over 12 months":"12 મહિનામાં ઘટાડો","Reduction as a share of premium":"પ્રીમિયમના હિસ્સા તરીકે ઘટાડો","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"ગણતરી પૂર્ણ. તમારા કેન્ટન અને વીમાદાતા સાથે એવોર્ડ અને અસરકારક તારીખોની પુષ્ટિ કરો.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"ચકાસો કે ઘટાડો માસિક પ્રીમિયમ કરતા વધારે નથી.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"સ્વિસ ભાડા સંદર્ભ-દર દૃશ્ય કેલ્ક્યુલેટર","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"સ્વિસ રેન્ટ એડજસ્ટમેન્ટ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર - સંદર્ભ દર દૃશ્ય","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"સ્વિત્ઝર્લેન્ડના મોર્ટગેજ રેફરન્સ રેટમાં ફેરફાર રહેણાંકના ચોખ્ખા ભાડાને કેવી રીતે અસર કરે છે તેનો જ અંદાજ કાઢો. ફેડરલ હાઉસિંગ ઑફિસમાંથી નવીનતમ દરનો ઉપયોગ કરો.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"તમારા લીઝ અથવા તાજેતરની ભાડાની સૂચનામાં દર્શાવેલ સંદર્ભ દરની વર્તમાન સત્તાવાર સ્વિસ દર સાથે સરખામણી કરો. ગણતરી તમારા ઉપકરણ પર રહે છે.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"ધ ફેડરલ ઑફિસ ફોર હાઉસિંગ દરેક ક્વાર્ટરમાં સ્વિસ ભાડાના ગોઠવણો માટે એક મોર્ટગેજ સંદર્ભ દર પ્રકાશિત કરે છે. 0.25 ટકા-બિંદુનો વધારો સૈદ્ધાંતિક રીતે 3% ભાડા વધારાને મંજૂરી આપી શકે છે; 0.25-પોઇન્ટનો ઘટાડો સૈદ્ધાંતિક રીતે 2.91% ઘટાડાને મંજૂરી આપી શકે છે. આ દૃશ્ય તમે દાખલ કરો છો તે ચોખ્ખા ભાડા પર તબક્કાવાર તે ફેરફારો લાગુ કરે છે.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"CHF 3,000 માસિક ચોખ્ખા ભાડા માટે, સંદર્ભ-દર 1.75% થી 1.50% સુધીનો ઘટાડો દર મહિને આશરે −CHF 87.38 (−2.91%) નો અંદાજિત સંદર્ભ-દર-માત્ર ફેરફાર આપે છે.","How this estimate works":"આ અંદાજ કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","Where do I find the current rate?":"હું વર્તમાન દર ક્યાં શોધી શકું?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"હાઉસિંગ પેજ માટે લિંક કરેલ ફેડરલ ઓફિસ ખોલો અને વર્તમાન પ્રકાશિત દર દાખલ કરો. ટૂલ એવા દરને એમ્બેડ કરતું નથી કે જે જૂનું થઈ શકે.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"શું આ નક્કી કરે છે કે શું હું ભાડામાં ફેરફારની વિનંતી કરી શકું?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"નં. તે ઓરિએન્ટેશન માટે એક પરિબળને અલગ પાડે છે. તમારો કરાર, ફુગાવો, ખર્ચમાં ફેરફાર, આરક્ષણ અને અન્ય કાનૂની શરતો પરિણામને બદલી શકે છે.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"શું પરિણામમાં આનુષંગિક ખર્ચનો સમાવેશ થાય છે?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"નં. માસિક ચોખ્ખું ભાડું દાખલ કરો, આનુષંગિક ખર્ચ અને અન્ય ચલ શુલ્કને બાદ કરતાં.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"પરિણામ એક ઉદાહરણરૂપ સંદર્ભ-દર દૃશ્ય છે, કાનૂની અભિપ્રાય અથવા સંપૂર્ણ ભાડા સમીક્ષા નથી. તેમાં ફુગાવો, સામાન્ય ખર્ચમાં ફેરફાર, સુધારા, કરાર આધારિત આરક્ષણ, અનુક્રમિત અથવા સ્ટેપ્ડ રેન્ટ્સ, નોટિસ તારીખો અને કેન્ટોનલ પ્રક્રિયાનો સમાવેશ થતો નથી. કાર્ય કરતા પહેલા તમારી લીઝ અને સત્તાવાર માર્ગદર્શન તપાસો.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"સ્વિસ રેસિડેન્શિયલ લીઝ: માત્ર મોર્ટગેજ-રેફરન્સ-રેટ ઇફેક્ટનો અંદાજ. તે કાનૂની નિર્ણય અથવા સંપૂર્ણ ભાડા સમીક્ષા નથી.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"વર્તમાન માસિક ચોખ્ખું ભાડું (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"તમારી લીઝ અથવા તાજેતરની ભાડાની સૂચનામાં દર્શાવેલ સંદર્ભ દર (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"વર્તમાન સત્તાવાર સ્વિસ સંદર્ભ દર (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"સંદર્ભ-દર દૃશ્યની ગણતરી કરો","Reference-rate-only scenario":"સંદર્ભ-દર-માત્ર દૃશ્ય","Current monthly net rent":"વર્તમાન માસિક ચોખ્ખું ભાડું","Reference-rate change":"સંદર્ભ-દર ફેરફાર","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"સંદર્ભ દરથી અંદાજિત માસિક અસર","Scenario monthly net rent":"દૃશ્ય માસિક ચોખ્ખું ભાડું","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"આ જ દરે 12 મહિના માટે વાર્ષિક અસર","potential increase":"સંભવિત વધારો","potential decrease":"સંભવિત ઘટાડો","no reference-rate change":"કોઈ સંદર્ભ-દર ફેરફાર નથી","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"દરેક 0.25 ટકા-બિંદુ વધારા માટે અંદાજ 3% અને દરેક ઘટાડા માટે સમકક્ષ વ્યસ્ત ઘટાડા માટે લાગુ પડે છે. અન્ય પરિબળો પરિણામ બદલી શકે છે.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"આમાં ફુગાવો, સામાન્ય ખર્ચ ફેરફારો, સુધારાઓ, કરાર આરક્ષણ, અનુક્રમિત અથવા સ્ટેપ્ડ ભાડા, નોટિસ તારીખો અથવા સ્થાનિક પ્રક્રિયાગત આવશ્યકતાઓનો સમાવેશ થતો નથી. તમારા લીઝ અને હાઉસિંગ માર્ગદર્શન માટે ફેડરલ ઓફિસ તપાસો.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"નવીનતમ સત્તાવાર દર અને માર્ગદર્શન તપાસો","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"સ્વિસ ફેડરલ ઓફિસ ફોર હાઉસિંગ (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"દૃશ્ય જોવા માટે ભાડું અને બંને દરો દાખલ કરો.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"પરિદ્રશ્યની ગણતરી કરી. તેના પર આધાર રાખતા પહેલા તારીખો અને કરારની શરતોને ચકાસો.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"માત્રા અને દરો તપાસો. દરો 0% અને 5% ની વચ્ચે હોવા જોઈએ અને 0.25-પોઈન્ટના પગલાંમાં અલગ હોવા જોઈએ.","Inputs cleared.":"ઇનપુટ્સ સાફ.","Result":"પરિણામ","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"સ્વિસ વેકેશન એક્રુઅલ એસ્ટીમેટર","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"સ્વિસ વેકેશન એક્રુઅલ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર — પ્રોરેટેડ લીવ બેલેન્સ","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"તમારા કોન્ટ્રાક્ટ, વર્કવીક, રોજગાર તારીખો અને પહેલાથી લીધેલા દિવસોની વાર્ષિક રજામાંથી સ્વિસ વેકેશન-ડે બેલેન્સનો અંદાજ કાઢો.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"તમે દાખલ કરેલ હકદારી અને કાર્ય શેડ્યૂલનો ઉપયોગ કરીને એક કેલેન્ડર વર્ષ માટે પ્રોરેટેડ પેઇડ લીવનો અંદાજ કાઢો. કોઈ કરારની શરતો અનુમાનિત નથી.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"અંદાજકાર તમારા કરારમાં વાર્ષિક રજાના દિવસોને પસંદ કરેલ વર્ષમાં નિયુક્ત કરાયેલા કેલેન્ડર દિવસો દ્વારા પ્રમાણિત કરે છે. પાર્ટ-ટાઇમ કામ માટે, અઠવાડિયાના તમારા સામાન્ય કામકાજના દિવસો અને અઠવાડિયામાં વાર્ષિક રજા દાખલ કરો.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"ચાર અઠવાડિયાની રજા, પાંચ દિવસનું વર્કવીક અને આખા વર્ષ દરમિયાન રોજગાર સાથે, વાર્ષિક હકદારી પહેલાથી લીધેલી રજા બાદ કરતાં 20 કામકાજી દિવસોની છે.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"સ્વિસ વૈધાનિક લઘુત્તમ શું છે?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"ફેડરલ માર્ગદર્શન જણાવે છે કે સેવા વર્ષ દીઠ ઓછામાં ઓછા ચાર અઠવાડિયા, અને 20 વર્ષની વય સુધી ન પહોંચેલા કામદારો માટે પાંચ અઠવાડિયા. કરાર અથવા સામૂહિક કરાર વધુ મંજૂરી આપી શકે છે.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"શું આ મારું કાનૂની બેલેન્સ નક્કી કરે છે?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"નં. તે એક સરળ કેલેન્ડર-દિવસ પ્રમાણ છે. કરારની શરતો, લાગુ સામૂહિક નિયમો, લાયકાતની ગેરહાજરી, રાઉન્ડિંગ અને એમ્પ્લોયર રેકોર્ડ્સ સંતુલન બદલી શકે છે.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"આ અંદાજ કાનૂની હક નક્કી કરતું નથી અથવા રજાના પગારની ગણતરી કરતું નથી. તે ચોક્કસ લાંબી ગેરહાજરી, કરાર-વિશિષ્ટ ઉપાર્જન અને રાઉન્ડિંગ નિયમો, જાહેર રજાઓ, ઓવરટાઇમ, કેરી-ઓવર ડેડલાઇન અને વિવાદો માટેના ઘટાડાઓને બાકાત રાખે છે. તમારો કોન્ટ્રાક્ટ તપાસો અને હરીફાઈ કરેલ બેલેન્સ માટે સલાહ મેળવો.","Leave year":"લીવ વર્ષ","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"તમારા કરારમાં વાર્ષિક રજા (અઠવાડિયા)","Usual working days per week":"અઠવાડિયાના સામાન્ય કામકાજના દિવસો","Employment start date":"રોજગારની શરૂઆતની તારીખ","Employment end date":"રોજગાર સમાપ્તિ તારીખ","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"આ રજાના વર્ષમાં પહેલેથી લીધેલ રજાના દિવસો","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"ફક્ત ઓરિએન્ટેશન માટે. કરાર વાર્ષિક હક દાખલ કરો; 20 વર્ષથી ઓછી ઉંમરના કામદારો માટે કાનૂની લઘુત્તમ સામાન્ય રીતે ચાર અઠવાડિયા અથવા પાંચ અઠવાડિયા છે.","Estimate balance":"અંદાજિત સંતુલન","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"બેલેન્સનો અંદાજ કાઢવા માટે તમારો કરાર અને તારીખો દાખલ કરો.","Estimated leave balance":"અનુમાનિત રજા સંતુલન","Annual leave at this schedule":"આ શેડ્યૂલ પર વાર્ષિક રજા","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"આ રજાના વર્ષમાં કાર્યરત કેલેન્ડર દિવસો","Prorated days accrued":"પ્રમાણિત દિવસો ઉપાર્જિત","Days already taken":"પહેલેથી જ લેવાયેલા દિવસો","Estimated days remaining":"અંદાજિત દિવસો બાકી","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"આ રોજગાર સમયગાળામાં કેલેન્ડર દિવસો દ્વારા વાર્ષિક રજાને પ્રમાણિત કરે છે. એમ્પ્લોયર અને કોન્ટ્રાક્ટના નિયમો અલગ અલગ હોઈ શકે છે.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"અંદાજની ગણતરી. તમારા કરાર અને એમ્પ્લોયર રેકોર્ડ્સ સામે તેને તપાસો.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"વર્ષ, તારીખો, કાર્ય શેડ્યૂલ અને મૂલ્યો તપાસો."},"nb":{"Swiss Unemployment Allowance Scenario":"Senario for sveitsisk arbeidsledighetstrygd","Swiss Unemployment Benefit Calculator — Gross Scenario":"Sveitsisk arbeidsledighetstrygdkalkulator – bruttoscenario","Estimate a gross Swiss daily allowance using the insured salary and rate confirmed by your fund.":"Beregn en brutto sveitsisk dagpenger ved å bruke den forsikrede lønnen og satsen bekreftet av fondet ditt.","Enter the insured salary and 70% or 80% rate confirmed by your unemployment fund.":"Skriv inn den forsikrede lønnen og 70 % eller 80 % sats bekreftet av arbeidsløshetskassen din.","Swiss rules set the allowance rate and salary cap. The fund decides eligibility, deductions, waiting days and entitlement. The monthly range reflects 20–23 payable weekdays.":"Sveitsiske regler fastsetter godtgjørelsessatsen og lønnstaket. Fondet avgjør valgbarhet, trekk, karensdager og rettighet. Månedsintervallet reflekterer 20–23 betalingsdager.","Example":"Eksempel","CHF 5,000 at 70% is about CHF 161.29 per payable weekday.":"CHF 5000 ved 70 % er omtrent CHF 161,29 per betalingsdag.","How it works":"Slik fungerer det","Questions":"Spørsmål","Scope and limits":"Omfang og begrensninger","Related tools":"Relaterte verktøy","Monthly insured salary (CHF)":"Månedlig forsikret lønn (CHF)","Rate confirmed by fund":"Rate bekreftet av fondet","70%":"70 %","80%":"80 %","Estimate":"Estimat","Clear":"Klart","Gross scenario":"Grutt scenario","Insured salary used":"Forsikret lønn brukt","Per payable weekday":"Per betalbar ukedag","20-day month":"20-dagers måned","23-day month":"23-dagers måned","Official benefit rules":"Offisielle fordelsregler","Enter your confirmed figures.":"Skriv inn dine bekreftede tall.","Scenario calculated. Confirm amounts with your fund.":"Scenario beregnet. Bekreft beløp med fondet ditt.","Check the values.":"Sjekk verdiene.","Swiss Tenancy Notice Planner":"Sveitsisk leieavtaleplanlegger","Swiss Rental Notice Planner and Letter Draft":"Sveitsisk leievarselsplanlegger og brevutkast","Plan a tenancy notice from the dates and terms in your own contract; draft a letter without assuming canton rules.":"Planlegg en leieoppsigelse fra datoene og vilkårene i din egen kontrakt; utarbeide et brev uten å anta kantonregler.","Enter the notice period, the next valid termination day in your contract, and receipt date. Check every date with your landlord or tenants’ association.":"Skriv inn oppsigelsesfristen, neste gyldige oppsigelsesdag i kontrakten din og mottaksdato. Sjekk hver dato med utleier eller leietakerforening.","The planner applies only the dates and period you supply. It does not decide whether notice is valid, when it is legally received, or whether a special protection applies.":"Planleggeren bruker kun datoene og perioden du oppgir. Den avgjør ikke om varsel er gyldig, når det er lovlig mottatt, eller om det gjelder et særskilt vern.","Contract notice period (months)":"Oppsigelsesfrist (måneder)","Next valid termination day of month (from contract)":"Neste gyldige oppsigelsesdag i måneden (fra kontrakt)","Expected receipt date":"Forventet mottaksdato","Your name":"Ditt navn","Your address":"Din adresse","Landlord / agency":"Utleier / byrå","Recipient address":"Mottakers adresse","Rental property":"Leieeiendom","Place":"Sted","Letter date":"Brevdato","Termination of tenancy":"Oppsigelse av leieforhold","Calculate date and draft letter":"Beregn dato og utkast til brev","Planning date":"Planleggingsdato","Target date":"Måldato","Editable draft":"Redigerbart utkast","Copy draft":"Kopier utkast","Enter your contract terms.":"Skriv inn kontraktsvilkårene dine.","Planning draft ready. Verify against your contract.":"Planleggingsutkast klar. Bekreft mot kontrakten din.","Check the dates and period.":"Sjekk datoene og perioden.","The result follows the supplied contract notice day; it is not a statutory notice ruling.":"Resultatet følger den oppgitte oppsigelsesdagen; det er ikke en lovfestet varselkjennelse.","Swiss Property Gain Scenario":"Senario for sveitsisk eiendomsgevinst","Swiss Property Gains Tax — User-Entered Rate Scenario":"Sveitsisk eiendomsgevinstskatt — brukerangitt rentescenario","Estimate a property gain using your own transaction costs and a tax rate from the responsible canton.":"Estimer en eiendomsgevinst ved å bruke dine egne transaksjonskostnader og en skattesats fra ansvarlig kanton.","Enter proceeds, acquisition cost, eligible expenses you have confirmed, and an effective rate from the official cantonal calculator.":"Skriv inn inntekter, anskaffelseskost, kvalifiserte utgifter du har bekreftet, og en effektiv sats fra den offisielle kantonkalkulatoren.","Swiss property gains tax varies by canton, holding period, deductions and case. This tool does not supply rates or determine admissible costs.":"Sveitsisk eiendomsgevinstskatt varierer etter kanton, beholdningsperiode, fradrag og sak. Dette verktøyet gir ikke priser eller bestemmer tillatte kostnader.","Sale proceeds (CHF)":"Salgsinntekter (CHF)","Acquisition cost (CHF)":"Anskaffelseskostnad (CHF)","Other costs confirmed admissible (CHF)":"Andre kostnader bekreftet akseptable (CHF)","Effective tax rate from official source (%)":"Effektiv skattesats fra offisiell kilde (%)","Estimate scenario":"Estimat scenario","Illustrative scenario":"Illustrativt scenario","Gain entered":"Gevinst angitt","Tax at entered rate":"Avgift til oppgitt sats","Enter figures from your records and canton source.":"Skriv inn tall fra postene dine og kantonkilden.","Scenario calculated; verify it with the canton.":"Scenario beregnet; bekrefte det med kantonen.","Check amounts and rate.":"Sjekk beløp og pris.","No canton tax table is embedded; your entered effective rate drives the estimate.":"Ingen kantonskattetabell er innebygd; din angitte effektive rente styrer estimatet.","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax Scenario":"Senario for sveitsisk arve- og gaveavgift","Swiss Inheritance and Gift Tax — Your Rate Scenario":"Sveitsisk arve- og gaveavgift – ditt satsscenario","Estimate a taxable amount from a user-entered exemption and rate; rules vary by canton and relationship.":"Beregn et skattepliktig beløp fra et brukeroppgitt fritak og sats; Reglene varierer etter kanton og forhold.","Enter an amount, exemption and effective rate confirmed for the recipient and canton.":"Skriv inn et beløp, fritak og effektiv sats bekreftet for mottaker og kanton.","Canton rules and family relationship can change exemptions and rates. This tool does not select a canton rule or determine tax liability.":"Kantonregler og familieforhold kan endre fritak og satser. Dette verktøyet velger ikke en kantonregel eller bestemmer skatteplikt.","Inheritance or gift amount (CHF)":"Arv eller gavebeløp (CHF)","Exemption confirmed with canton (CHF)":"Unntak bekreftet med kanton (CHF)","Effective rate confirmed with canton (%)":"Effektiv rate bekreftet med kanton (%)","Amount after entered exemption":"Beløp etter angitt fritak","Enter figures confirmed for your case.":"Skriv inn bekreftede tall for ditt tilfelle.","The estimate uses only the exemption and rate you enter.":"Estimatet bruker kun unntaket og prisen du angir.","Swiss Child Support Budget Scenario":"Sveitsisk budsjettscenario for barnebidrag","Swiss Child Support Budget — Transparent Household Scenario":"Sveitsisk barnebidragsbudsjett — Transparent husholdningsscenario","Allocate an entered child budget by parent income after an entered direct-cost credit.":"Tildel et angitt barnebudsjett etter foreldreinntekt etter en innført direktekostnadskreditt.","Use the child’s documented monthly needs, both parents’ available monthly incomes and any direct costs you want to credit.":"Bruk barnets dokumenterte månedlige behov, begge foreldrenes tilgjengelige månedlige inntekter og eventuelle direkte kostnader du ønsker å kreditere.","This is a planning worksheet only. It is not a Swiss child-maintenance award or legal method; housing, care, taxes, benefits and case law are not assessed.":"Dette er kun et planleggingsark. Det er ikke en sveitsisk barnebidragspris eller juridisk metode; bolig, omsorg, skatt, ytelser og rettspraksis vurderes ikke.","Monthly child budget you documented (CHF)":"Månedlig barnebudsjett du dokumenterte (CHF)","Parent A available monthly income (CHF)":"Foreldre En tilgjengelig månedlig inntekt (CHF)","Parent B available monthly income (CHF)":"Foreldre B tilgjengelig månedlig inntekt (CHF)","Direct child costs paid by Parent A to credit (CHF)":"Direkte barnekostnader betalt av forelder A til kreditering (CHF)","Allocate scenario":"Tildel scenario","Illustrative allocation":"Illustrativ tildeling","Parent A remaining contribution":"Forelder Et gjenstående bidrag","Parent B contribution":"Foreldre B-bidrag","Entered monthly child budget":"Oppgitt månedlig barnebudsjett","Enter your household budget figures.":"Skriv inn tall for husholdningsbudsjettet.","Budget scenario calculated; discuss legal obligations with a qualified adviser.":"Budsjettscenario beregnet; diskutere juridiske forpliktelser med en kvalifisert rådgiver.","Check amounts; credit cannot exceed the budget.":"Sjekk beløp; kreditt kan ikke overstige budsjettet.","Shares are proportional to the two entered incomes; the direct-cost credit is subtracted first.":"Andeler er proporsjonale med de to inntektene; direktekostnadskreditten trekkes først.","Browser Hyphenation Preview":"Forhåndsvisning av nettleserorddeling","Word Hyphenation Preview — Browser Language Patterns":"Forhåndsvisning av orddeling — nettleserspråkmønstre","Preview browser hyphenation for text you provide; support depends on the browser and installed language resources.":"Forhåndsvis nettleserorddeling for tekst du oppgir; støtte avhenger av nettleseren og installerte språkressurser.","Choose the language that matches your text, enter a sample and adjust the available line width.":"Velg språket som passer til teksten din, skriv inn et eksempel og juster den tilgjengelige linjebredden.","Uses the browser’s native CSS hyphenation. It does not bundle dictionaries; unsupported browsers may show no hyphens. Copying the text keeps the original spelling.":"Bruker nettleserens opprinnelige CSS-orddeling. Den pakker ikke ordbøker; ikke-støttede nettlesere viser kanskje ingen bindestreker. Kopiering av teksten beholder den opprinnelige stavemåten.","Text language (BCP 47)":"Tekstspråk (BCP 47)","Preview width (characters)":"Forhåndsvisningsbredde (tegn)","Text to preview":"Tekst til forhåndsvisning","Preview":"Forhåndsvisning","Enter text and choose its language.":"Skriv inn tekst og velg språket.","Preview updated.":"Forhåndsvisning oppdatert.","Enter a supported language tag and text.":"Skriv inn en støttet språkkode og tekst.","Try the same paragraph at different widths to see where the browser can break words.":"Prøv samme avsnitt i forskjellige bredder for å se hvor nettleseren kan bryte ord.","Private Spellcheck Workspace":"Privat stavekontrollarbeidsområde","Local Spell Checker — Use Your Browser Dictionary":"Lokal stavekontroll — Bruk nettleserordboken din","Edit text with the browser’s native spellcheck, choose a language and copy the corrected text.":"Rediger tekst med nettleserens opprinnelige stavekontroll, velg et språk og kopier den korrigerte teksten.","Text stays in this page. Set a language your browser has a spelling dictionary for, then use its spelling menu or underline suggestions.":"Teksten forblir på denne siden. Angi et språk nettleseren din har en staveordbok for, og bruk deretter stavemenyen eller understrek forslag.","This workspace does not upload text or ship dictionaries. Browser spellcheck availability and suggestions depend on the device, browser and installed dictionary.":"Dette arbeidsområdet laster ikke opp tekst eller sender ordbøker. Nettleserens stavekontroll tilgjengelighet og forslag avhenger av enheten, nettleseren og installert ordbok.","Spellcheck language (BCP 47)":"Språk for stavekontroll (BCP 47)","Text to check":"Tekst for å sjekke","Copy text":"Kopier tekst","Type or paste text. Right-click or use your device spelling menu for suggestions.":"Skriv eller lim inn tekst. Høyreklikk eller bruk stavemenyen på enheten for forslag.","Text copied.":"Tekst kopiert.","Could not copy automatically; select and copy the text.":"Kunne ikke kopiere automatisk; velg og kopier teksten.","A browser without a matching dictionary may not mark misspellings.":"En nettleser uten en matchende ordbok kan ikke merke feilstavinger.","Resume Structure Checker":"Fortsett strukturkontroll","ATS Resume Checker — Free Local PDF & DOCX Review":"ATS CV-sjekker — Gratis lokal PDF- og DOCX-gjennomgang","Check resume text, headings, sections, links and bullet structure in your browser. Compare job-description terms by count; no hiring score or upload.":"Sjekk CV-tekst, overskrifter, seksjoner, lenker og punktstruktur i nettleseren din. Sammenlign jobbbeskrivelsesvilkår etter antall; ingen ansettelsesscore eller opplasting.","Review what a text-based resume actually exposes: extracted text, heading structure, contact-field presence, links and commonly recognized sections. Optionally compare repeated job-description terms.":"Gjennomgå hva en tekstbasert CV faktisk avslører: uttrukket tekst, overskriftsstruktur, kontaktfelttilstedeværelse, lenker og ofte gjenkjente seksjoner. Sammenlign eventuelt gjentatte stillingsbeskrivelsesvilkår.","A DOCX with Heading 1 styles for Experience and Education shows those headings. A PDF is checked from its selectable text; columns may be read in a different order.":"En DOCX med Overskrift 1-stiler for erfaring og utdanning viser disse overskriftene. En PDF kontrolleres fra dens valgbare tekst; kolonner kan leses i en annen rekkefølge.","DOCX files are inspected locally as Office ZIP/XML. PDFs are read with a deferred local PDF.js engine. The optional job-description comparison counts selected terms in each text; it does not create a score or recommend whether to hire someone.":"DOCX-filer inspiseres lokalt som Office ZIP/XML. PDF-filer leses med en utsatt lokal PDF.js-motor. Den valgfrie sammenligningen med jobbbeskrivelsen teller utvalgte termer i hver tekst; det skaper ikke en poengsum eller anbefaler om du skal ansette noen.","This is a format and text-structure check, not an ATS simulator, legal review or prediction of interview success. Scanned PDFs without selectable text need OCR first. Password-protected, macro-enabled, signed or unusually large documents are not supported.":"Dette er en format- og tekststruktursjekk, ikke en ATS-simulator, juridisk gjennomgang eller spådom om intervjusuksess. Skannede PDF-filer uten valgbar tekst trenger OCR først. Passordbeskyttede, makroaktiverte, signerte eller uvanlig store dokumenter støttes ikke.","Choose a resume (PDF or DOCX)":"Velg en CV (PDF eller DOCX)","Your files stay in this browser and are not uploaded. Maximum 20 MB; PDF up to 50 pages. DOCX expanded content is capped at 80 MB.":"Filene dine blir værende i denne nettleseren og blir ikke lastet opp. Maks 20 MB; PDF opptil 50 sider. DOCX utvidet innhold er begrenset til 80 MB.","Optional job description":"Valgfri stillingsbeskrivelse","Paste plain text if you want a term-frequency comparison. Do not include sensitive information you do not need to analyze.":"Lim inn ren tekst hvis du vil ha en sammenligning av term-frekvens. Ikke ta med sensitiv informasjon du ikke trenger å analysere.","Paste job-description text here…":"Lim inn jobbbeskrivelsestekst her...","Analyze locally":"Analyser lokalt","Clear files and report":"Slett filer og rapporter","Resume review":"Fortsett gjennomgang","File type":"Filtype","Extracted characters":"Uttrukket tegn","Words counted":"Ord telt","Detected headings":"Oppdaget overskrifter","Recognized sections":"Gjenkjente seksjoner","Hyperlinks found":"Hyperkoblinger funnet","Bullet paragraphs":"Punktavsnitt","An email address appears in the text":"En e-postadresse vises i teksten","No email address pattern was detected":"Ingen e-postadressemønster ble oppdaget","A phone-number-like pattern appears in the text":"Et telefonnummerlignende mønster vises i teksten","No phone-number-like pattern was detected":"Ingen telefonnummerlignende mønster ble oppdaget","Job-description terms (counts only)":"Vilkår for stillingsbeskrivelse (teller bare)","Term":"Tid","In job text":"I jobbtekst","In resume":"I CV","Paste a job description to compare term counts.":"Lim inn en stillingsbeskrivelse for å sammenligne antall terminer.","No clear heading styles were detected. PDF headings are estimated from text size and may be inaccurate.":"Ingen klare overskriftsstiler ble oppdaget. PDF-overskrifter er beregnet ut fra tekststørrelse og kan være unøyaktige.","Detected":"Oppdaget","Not detected":"Ikke oppdaget","This heuristic recognizes a limited set of common section names; it does not decide which sections are required.":"Denne heuristikken gjenkjenner et begrenset sett med vanlige seksjonsnavn; den bestemmer ikke hvilke seksjoner som kreves.","Profile / summary":"Profil / sammendrag","Experience":"Erfaring","Education":"Utdanning","Skills":"ferdigheter","Contact":"Kontakt","No selectable text was found. Scanned-only PDFs need OCR before they can be checked.":"Ingen valgbar tekst ble funnet. Skannede PDF-filer trenger OCR før de kan kontrolleres.","Choose a PDF or DOCX resume to begin.":"Velg en PDF- eller DOCX-CV for å begynne.","Reading the selected file locally…":"Leser den valgte filen lokalt...","Local structure review complete.":"Lokal strukturgjennomgang fullført.","This browser does not support a required local document feature.":"Denne nettleseren støtter ikke en nødvendig lokal dokumentfunksjon.","Choose a valid PDF or modern DOCX file up to the stated local limits.":"Velg en gyldig PDF- eller moderne DOCX-fil opp til de angitte lokale grensene.","The PDF could not be read. It may be damaged, encrypted or contain no selectable text.":"PDF-filen kunne ikke leses. Den kan være skadet, kryptert eller inneholde ingen valgbar tekst.","The DOCX package could not be safely opened or read.":"DOCX-pakken kunne ikke åpnes eller leses på en sikker måte.","Does this tool upload or save my resume?":"Laster dette verktøyet opp eller lagrer CV-en min?","No. Parsing and analysis run in your browser. The file text is not sent to a server or retained after you clear the report or leave the page.":"Nr. Parsing og analyse kjøres i nettleseren din. Filteksten sendes ikke til en server eller beholdes etter at du sletter rapporten eller forlater siden.","Does it predict whether an ATS or employer will accept my resume?":"Forutsier det om en ATS eller arbeidsgiver vil godta CV-en min?","No. It checks readable text and simple structure only. Hiring systems differ, and this is not an ATS compatibility guarantee or hiring prediction.":"Nei. Den sjekker kun lesbar tekst og enkel struktur. Ansettelsessystemene er forskjellige, og dette er ikke en ATS-kompatibilitetsgaranti eller ansettelsesprediksjon.","Can it read a scanned PDF?":"Kan den lese en skannet PDF?","Only if the PDF has a selectable text layer. This checker does not download OCR models; use an OCR tool first for a scanned image-only document.":"Bare hvis PDF-en har et valgbart tekstlag. Denne sjekken laster ikke ned OCR-modeller; Bruk først et OCR-verktøy for et skannet dokument med kun bilder.","What does the job-description comparison mean?":"Hva betyr sammenligningen av stillingsbeskrivelsen?","It shows counts for recurring terms after simple normalization. It is not a match percentage, ranking, recommendation or assessment of your qualifications.":"Det viser antall gjentakende termer etter enkel normalisering. Det er ikke en samsvarsprosent, rangering, anbefaling eller vurdering av dine kvalifikasjoner.","Why does a PDF show fewer headings than a DOCX?":"Hvorfor viser en PDF færre overskrifter enn en DOCX?","PDFs usually do not preserve semantic heading styles. The checker estimates prominent lines from text size and reading order, so columns and visual design can affect the result.":"PDF-er bevarer vanligvis ikke semantiske overskriftsstiler. Kontrolløren estimerer fremtredende linjer fra tekststørrelse og leserekkefølge, så kolonner og visuell design kan påvirke resultatet.","How local resume review works":"Hvordan lokal CV-gjennomgang fungerer","Resume checker questions":"Fortsett kontrollspørsmål","Scope and limitations":"Omfang og begrensninger","Local Vocal and Accompaniment Separator":"Lokal vokal- og akkompagnementsseparator","Vocal Remover — Separate Vocals and Accompaniment Locally":"Vokalfjerner – Skill vokal og akkompagnement lokalt","Separate a short stereo audio sample into estimated vocals and accompaniment in your browser. Audio stays on your device; the model is downloaded from its public host.":"Skill en kort stereolydprøve i estimert vokal og akkompagnement i nettleseren din. Lyden forblir på enheten din; modellen lastes ned fra den offentlige verten.","Choose a stereo music clip up to 30 seconds. On first use, the browser downloads a 35.6 MB model. The audio file is processed on this device and is never uploaded.":"Velg et stereomusikkklipp på opptil 30 sekunder. Ved første gangs bruk laster nettleseren ned en 35,6 MB-modell. Lydfilen behandles på denne enheten og blir aldri lastet opp.","What you get":"Hva du får","Preview and download two WAV stems: estimated vocals and the residual accompaniment. Results depend on the mix and may contain artifacts.":"Forhåndsvis og last ned to WAV-stammer: estimert vokal og gjenværende akkompagnement. Resultatene avhenger av blandingen og kan inneholde artefakter.","Local processing":"Lokal behandling","The tool uses the Open-Unmix UMX-HQ vocals network exported to ONNX and ONNX Runtime Web. The model is fetched only when you press Separate; no paid inference API or subscription is used. Audio is decoded, processed and exported locally.":"Verktøyet bruker Open-Unmix UMX-HQ-vokalnettverket eksportert til ONNX og ONNX Runtime Web. Modellen hentes kun når du trykker Separat; ingen betalt slutnings-API eller abonnement brukes. Lyd dekodes, behandles og eksporteres lokalt.","This is an estimate for stereo 44.1 kHz processing and clips up to 30 seconds. Mono sources are duplicated to stereo. Vocals mixed deeply into instruments, heavy effects, live recordings and unusual genres can produce leakage or artifacts. Do not use the result as a clean master. Model download requires an internet connection; audio does not leave this device.":"Dette er et estimat for stereo 44,1 kHz-behandling og klipp på opptil 30 sekunder. Monokilder dupliseres til stereo. Vokal blandet dypt inn i instrumenter, tunge effekter, liveopptak og uvanlige sjangre kan produsere lekkasje eller artefakter. Ikke bruk resultatet som en ren mester. Modellnedlasting krever internettforbindelse; lyd forlater ikke denne enheten.","Is my audio uploaded?":"Er lyden min lastet opp?","No. The selected audio is decoded and processed in your browser. The only network request is the model download when you start separation.":"Nei. Den valgte lyden dekodes og behandles i nettleseren din. Den eneste nettverksforespørselen er modellnedlastingen når du starter separasjon.","Why is the first run slow?":"Hvorfor er den første løpeturen sakte?","The browser downloads a 35.6 MB model once; the browser may cache it. Inference then runs locally on the device CPU.":"Nettleseren laster ned en 35,6 MB-modell én gang; nettleseren kan bufre den. Inferens kjører deretter lokalt på enhetens CPU.","Will every song separate cleanly?":"Vil hver sang skille seg rent?","No. The model estimates a vocal stem and may leave vocal leakage, remove instrument harmonics or create artifacts. Listen before relying on a stem.":"Nei. Modellen estimerer en stemmestamme og kan etterlate stemmelekkasje, fjerne instrumentharmoniske eller skape artefakter. Lytt før du stoler på en stilk.","Stereo audio file (up to 30 seconds)":"Stereo lydfil (opptil 30 sekunder)","Choose audio":"Velg lyd","Separate vocals":"Separat vokal","Cancel / clear":"Avbryt / fjern","Choose a short audio file to begin.":"Velg en kort lydfil for å begynne.","Downloading the separation model…":"Laster ned separasjonsmodellen …","Separating locally…":"Skiller lokalt...","Separation complete. Preview or download either stem.":"Separering fullført. Forhåndsvis eller last ned begge stammene.","Could not process this file or load the model. Check the format and connection, then try again.":"Kunne ikke behandle denne filen eller laste inn modellen. Sjekk formatet og tilkoblingen, og prøv på nytt.","Model and weight license information":"Informasjon om modell og vektlisens","Estimated vocals":"Estimert vokal","Estimated accompaniment":"Estimert akkompagnement","Download WAV":"Last ned WAV","Progress":"Fremgang","Preparing local separation…":"Forbereder lokal separasjon …","Separation complete. Audio remained on this device.":"Separering fullført. Lyden forble på denne enheten.","This audio could not be processed. Try a stereo music file under 30 seconds.":"Denne lyden kunne ikke behandles. Prøv en stereomusikkfil under 30 sekunder.","Swiss Health Insurance Deductible Comparator":"Sveitsisk helseforsikring egenandelskomparator","Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator — Compare Annual Costs":"Swiss Health Insurance Franchise Calculator – Sammenlign årlige kostnader","Compare Swiss basic health insurance deductibles using premiums and eligible annual medical costs that you enter. No insurer quote is guessed.":"Sammenlign egenandeler i sveitsisk grunnleggende helseforsikring ved å bruke premier og kvalifiserte årlige medisinske kostnader som du oppgir. Ingen forsikringsgivers tilbud er gjettet.","Enter the monthly premiums shown by the same insurer for each deductible it offers, then compare low, expected and high annual treatment-cost scenarios.":"Skriv inn de månedlige premiene vist av samme forsikringsselskap for hver egenandel den tilbyr, og sammenlign deretter lave, forventede og høye årlige behandlingskostnader.","For compulsory Swiss basic health insurance, an adult standard deductible is CHF 300 and a child deductible is CHF 0. Optional levels differ by age group. After the deductible, the standard retention fee is 10% of eligible remaining costs, capped at CHF 700 per year for adults and CHF 350 for children. The tool adds your entered premium to this modeled cost sharing; it does not fetch insurer rates or decide which option is right for you.":"For obligatorisk sveitsisk grunnleggende helseforsikring er standard egenandel for voksne CHF 300 og egenandel for barn er CHF 0. Valgfrie nivåer varierer etter aldersgruppe. Etter egenandelen er standard oppbevaringsgebyret 10 % av kvalifiserte gjenværende kostnader, begrenset til CHF 700 per år for voksne og CHF 350 for barn. Verktøyet legger til den angitte premien til denne modellerte kostnadsdelingen; det henter ikke forsikringsselskapets priser eller bestemmer hvilket alternativ som er riktig for deg.","If an adult enters CHF 400 monthly premium at a CHF 300 deductible and CHF 350 at a CHF 2,500 deductible, the annual premium difference is CHF 600. Compare that saving with the modeled difference in cost sharing at each of your low, expected and high eligible-cost amounts.":"Hvis en voksen legger inn CHF 400 månedlig premie til CHF 300 egenandel og CHF 350 med CHF 2500 egenandel, er den årlige premieforskjellen CHF 600. Sammenlign denne besparelsen med den modellerte forskjellen i kostnadsdeling for hvert av dine lave, forventede og høye kvalifiserte beløp.","How the estimate works":"Hvordan estimatet fungerer","Common questions":"Vanlige spørsmål","Scope and exclusions":"Omfang og unntak","Where do I get the premiums?":"Hvor får jeg premiene?","Use current monthly offers for the same insurer, premium region, age group, accident cover and insurance model. Priminfo is the official federal comparison site. This page does not fetch or reproduce insurer quotes.":"Bruk gjeldende månedlige tilbud for samme forsikringsselskap, premieregion, aldersgruppe, ulykkesdekning og forsikringsmodell. Priminfo er den offisielle føderale sammenligningssiden. Denne siden henter eller gjengir ikke forsikringstilbud.","Are all listed deductible levels always offered?":"Er alle oppførte egenandelsnivåer alltid tilbudt?","No. Insurers do not have to offer every optional level, and offers can differ for young adults. Enter only the premiums shown for your own policy; leave unavailable options blank.":"Nei. Forsikringsselskapene trenger ikke tilby alle valgfrie nivåer, og tilbudene kan variere for unge voksne. Angi kun premiene som vises for din egen forsikring; la utilgjengelige alternativer stå tomme.","Does this show my complete medical bill?":"Viser dette hele legeregningen min?","No. The model covers the ordinary deductible and standard 10% retention fee on eligible costs. It excludes hospital day contributions, special 40% medicine retention, exempt services, non-covered care and supplementary insurance.":"Nei. Modellen dekker ordinær egenandel og standard 10 % oppbevaringsgebyr på støtteberettigede kostnader. Det inkluderer ikke sykehusdagbidrag, spesiell medisinoppbevaring på 40 %, unntatte tjenester, ikke-dekket omsorg og tilleggsforsikring.","This is a scenario comparison, not insurance, medical or financial advice. It does not predict your treatment or premiums. It excludes hospital day contributions (normally CHF 15 per inpatient day, with statutory exemptions), special 40% retention on certain medicines, maternity/preventive exemptions, services outside compulsory cover, premium subsidies and supplementary insurance. Actual co-payment can therefore differ. A higher deductible means you need to be able to pay more upfront if you receive care.":"Dette er en scenariosammenligning, ikke forsikring, medisinsk eller økonomisk råd. Det forutsier ikke din behandling eller premier. Den ekskluderer sykehusdagbidrag (normalt CHF 15 per døgndag, med lovbestemte fritak), spesiell 40 % oppbevaring på visse medisiner, fødsels-/forebyggende fritak, tjenester utenfor obligatorisk dekning, premietilskudd og tilleggsforsikring. Faktisk egenandel kan derfor variere. En høyere egenandel betyr at du må kunne betale mer på forhånd hvis du får omsorg.","Who is insured under this policy?":"Hvem er forsikret under denne forsikringen?","Adult (age 19 or over)":"Voksen (19 år eller eldre)","Child (under 18)":"Barn (under 18)","Low annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Scenario med lave årlige kvalifiserte behandlingskostnader (CHF)","Expected annual eligible treatment costs (CHF)":"Forventede årlige kvalifiserte behandlingskostnader (CHF)","High annual eligible treatment-cost scenario (CHF)":"Scenario med høy årlig kvalifisert behandlingskostnad (CHF)","Monthly premiums from one insurer":"Månedlige premier fra ett forsikringsselskap","Monthly premium":"Månedlig premie","Enter only options offered for this same policy. Leave others blank.":"Angi bare alternativer som tilbys for denne samme policyen. La andre stå tomme.","Adult deductible choices":"Voksen egenandel valg","Child deductible choices":"Valg for egenandel for barn","Compare annual costs":"Sammenlign årlige kostnader","Clear entries":"Slett oppføringer","Download CSV":"Last ned CSV","Estimated annual premium plus cost sharing":"Estimert årlig premie pluss kostnadsdeling","Deductible":"Eigenandel","Annual premiums":"Årlige premier","Total at low costs":"Totalt til lave kostnader","Total at expected costs":"Totalt til forventede kostnader","Total at high costs":"Totalt til høye kostnader","Cost sharing at low costs":"Kostnadsdeling til lave kostnader","Cost sharing at expected costs":"Kostnadsdeling til forventede kostnader","Cost sharing at high costs":"Kostnadsdeling til høye kostnader","Difference from lowest available deductible":"Forskjellen fra laveste tilgjengelige egenandel","Medical costs where premium saving is used up":"Medisinske kostnader der premiesparing er brukt opp","The entered premium saving is not cancelled within the modeled cost-sharing range.":"Den angitte premiebesparelsen kanselleres ikke innenfor det modellerte kostnadsdelingsområdet.","No premium saving against the lowest deductible.":"Ingen premiesparing mot laveste egenandel.","Lowest expected total among entered options":"Lavest forventet totalsum blant angitte alternativer","Scenario details":"Senariodetaljer","Enter three ordered medical-cost scenarios and monthly premiums for at least two available deductibles.":"Skriv inn tre bestilte medisinske kostnadsscenarier og månedlige premier for minst to tilgjengelige egenandeler.","Official rules and current premiums:":"Offisielle regler og gjeldende premier:","Federal deductible rules":"Federale egenandelsregler","Priminfo official premium comparison":"Priminfo offisiell premium sammenligning","Comparison calculated in this browser.":"Sammenligning beregnet i denne nettleseren.","Check the age group, ordered cost scenarios and at least two monthly premiums.":"Sjekk aldersgruppen, bestilte kostnadsscenarier og minst to månedlige premier.","Entries cleared.":"Oppføringer slettet.","CSV downloaded locally.":"CSV lastet ned lokalt.","Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator":"Swiss Health Premium Reduction Calculator","Swiss Premium Subsidy Calculator — Your Net Premium":"Swiss Premium Subsidie Kalkulator — Din Netto Premium","Calculate the net Swiss health-insurance premium from the current premium and a monthly reduction already granted by your canton.":"Beregn netto sveitsisk helseforsikringspremie fra gjeldende premie og en månedlig reduksjon allerede gitt av din kanton.","Enter the premium and confirmed monthly reduction from your insurer or cantonal decision. This tool does not decide whether you qualify.":"Skriv inn premien og bekreftet månedlig reduksjon fra forsikringsselskapet eller kantonalvedtaket. Dette verktøyet avgjør ikke om du er kvalifisert.","Swiss cantons determine who qualifies, how much support is granted and whether an application is needed. This calculator only subtracts a confirmed monthly reduction from one policy premium and shows the annual amount.":"Sveitsiske kantoner bestemmer hvem som er kvalifisert, hvor mye støtte som gis og om det er behov for en søknad. Denne kalkulatoren trekker kun en bekreftet månedlig reduksjon fra én forsikringspremie og viser det årlige beløpet.","If the monthly premium is CHF 420 and the confirmed reduction is CHF 120, the estimated net premium is CHF 300 per month.":"Hvis den månedlige premien er CHF 420 og den bekreftede reduksjonen er CHF 120, er den estimerte nettopremien CHF 300 per måned.","How the calculation works":"Hvordan regnestykket fungerer","Does this tell me whether I qualify?":"Forteller dette meg om jeg er kvalifisert?","No. Eligibility and award amounts are decided by the canton of residence. Use the linked official information or contact the cantonal office.":"Nei. Kvalifikasjons- og tildelingsbeløp bestemmes av bostedskantonen. Bruk den tilknyttede offisielle informasjonen eller kontakt kantonkontoret.","Where do I find the reduction amount?":"Hvor finner jeg reduksjonsbeløpet?","Use the current decision or the reduced premium shown by your insurer. Some cantons grant reductions automatically; others require an application.":"Bruk gjeldende avgjørelse eller den reduserte premien vist av forsikringsselskapet. Noen kantoner gir reduksjoner automatisk; andre krever søknad.","This is arithmetic for one policy, not an eligibility or benefit decision. It does not calculate household income, assets, family status, deadlines, cantonal thresholds or application rights. Premiums and awards can change; confirm them with your insurer and canton.":"Dette er aritmetikk for én forsikring, ikke en kvalifikasjons- eller fordelsbeslutning. Den beregner ikke husholdningsinntekt, formue, familiestatus, frister, kantonale terskler eller søknadsrettigheter. Premier og premier kan endres; bekrefte dem med forsikringsselskapet og kantonen.","Current monthly premium (CHF)":"Gjeldende månedlig premie (CHF)","Monthly reduction already granted (CHF)":"Månedlig reduksjon allerede gitt (CHF)","Enter an amount confirmed by the canton or insurer; do not use an estimate as an award.":"Skriv inn et beløp bekreftet av kantonen eller forsikringsselskapet; ikke bruk et estimat som en pris.","Calculate net premium":"Beregn nettopremie","Enter the current premium and confirmed reduction.":"Skriv inn gjeldende premie og bekreftet reduksjon.","Estimated premium after reduction":"Estimert premie etter reduksjon","Current monthly premium":"Gjeldende månedlig premie","Monthly reduction":"Månedlig reduksjon","Estimated net monthly premium":"Estimert netto månedlig premie","Reduction over 12 months":"Reduksjon over 12 måneder","Reduction as a share of premium":"Reduksjon som andel av premie","Calculation complete. Confirm the award and effective dates with your canton and insurer.":"Beregning fullført. Bekreft tildelingen og virkningsdatoene med din kanton og forsikringsselskap.","Check that the reduction is not greater than the monthly premium.":"Kontroller at reduksjonen ikke er større enn den månedlige premien.","Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator":"Swiss Rent Reference-Rate Scenario Calculator","Swiss Rent Adjustment Calculator — Reference Rate Scenario":"Sveitsisk husleiejusteringskalkulator — referanseprisscenario","Estimate only how a change in Switzerland’s mortgage reference rate affects a residential net rent. Use the latest rate from the federal housing office.":"Estimer bare hvordan en endring i Sveits referanserente for boliglån påvirker en nettoleie for boliger. Bruk den siste prisen fra det føderale boligkontoret.","Compare the reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice with the current official Swiss rate. The calculation stays on your device.":"Sammenlign referanserenten som er oppgitt i din leiekontrakt eller siste leievarsel med gjeldende offisielle sveitsiske sats. Beregningen forblir på enheten din.","The Federal Office for Housing publishes one mortgage reference rate for Swiss rent adjustments each quarter. A 0.25 percentage-point increase can in principle allow a 3% rent increase; a 0.25-point decrease can in principle allow a 2.91% reduction. This scenario applies those changes step by step to the net rent you enter.":"Federal Office for Housing publiserer én referanserente for boliglån for sveitsiske leiejusteringer hvert kvartal. En økning på 0,25 prosentpoeng kan i prinsippet tillate en leieøkning på 3 %; en reduksjon på 0,25 poeng kan i prinsippet tillate en reduksjon på 2,91 %. Dette scenariet bruker disse endringene trinn for trinn til nettoleien du angir.","For CHF 3,000 monthly net rent, a reference-rate decrease from 1.75% to 1.50% gives an estimated reference-rate-only change of about −CHF 87.38 per month (−2.91%).":"For CHF 3 000 månedlig nettoleie gir en reduksjon i referanserenten fra 1,75 % til 1,50 % en estimert referanseprisendring på ca. -CHF 87,38 per måned (−2,91 %).","How this estimate works":"Hvordan dette anslaget fungerer","Where do I find the current rate?":"Hvor finner jeg gjeldende kurs?","Open the linked Federal Office for Housing page and enter the current published rate. The tool does not embed a rate that could become outdated.":"Åpne den tilknyttede Federal Office for Housing-siden og angi gjeldende publiserte sats. Verktøyet bygger ikke inn en rate som kan bli utdatert.","Does this decide whether I can request a rent change?":"Avgjør dette om jeg kan be om endring av husleien?","No. It isolates one factor for orientation. Your contract, inflation, cost changes, reservations and other legal conditions can alter the result.":"Nei. Det isolerer én faktor for orientering. Din kontrakt, inflasjon, kostnadsendringer, reservasjoner og andre juridiske forhold kan endre resultatet.","Does the result include ancillary costs?":"Inkluderer resultatet tilleggskostnader?","No. Enter the monthly net rent, excluding ancillary costs and other variable charges.":"Nei. Angi den månedlige nettoleien, eksklusive tilleggskostnader og andre variable kostnader.","The result is an illustrative reference-rate scenario, not a legal opinion or complete rent review. It excludes inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contractual reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates and cantonal procedure. Check your lease and the official guidance before acting.":"Resultatet er et illustrativt scenario med referanserenter, ikke en juridisk vurdering eller fullstendig leiegjennomgang. Den ekskluderer inflasjon, generelle kostnadsendringer, forbedringer, kontraktsmessige reservasjoner, indekserte eller trinnvise leiepriser, oppsigelsesdatoer og kantonal prosedyre. Sjekk leiekontrakten din og den offisielle veiledningen før du handler.","Swiss residential leases: an estimate of the mortgage-reference-rate effect only. It is not a legal decision or a full rent review.":"Sveitsiske boligleieavtaler: kun et estimat av referanserenteeffekten for boliglån. Det er ikke et rettslig vedtak eller en fullstendig leiegjennomgang.","Current monthly net rent (CHF)":"Gjeldende månedlig nettoleie (CHF)","Reference rate stated in your lease or latest rent notice (%)":"Referansesats oppgitt i leiekontrakten eller siste leievarsel (%)","Current official Swiss reference rate (%)":"Gjeldende offisielle sveitsiske referanserente (%)","Calculate reference-rate scenario":"Beregn scenario med referanserente","Reference-rate-only scenario":"Scenario med kun referansesats","Current monthly net rent":"Gjeldende månedlig nettoleie","Reference-rate change":"Referanse-rate endring","Estimated monthly effect from reference rate":"Estimert månedlig effekt fra referanserente","Scenario monthly net rent":"Scenario månedlig nettoleie","Annualized effect for 12 months at the same rate":"Årlig effekt i 12 måneder med samme hastighet","potential increase":"potensiell økning","potential decrease":"potensiell reduksjon","no reference-rate change":"ingen endring i referanserente","The estimate applies 3% for each 0.25 percentage-point increase and the equivalent inverse reduction for each decrease. Other factors can change the result.":"Estimatet gjelder 3 % for hver økning på 0,25 prosentpoeng og tilsvarende invers reduksjon for hver reduksjon. Andre faktorer kan endre resultatet.","This does not include inflation, general cost changes, improvements, contract reservations, indexed or stepped rents, notice dates, or local procedural requirements. Check your lease and the Federal Office for Housing guidance.":"Dette inkluderer ikke inflasjon, generelle kostnadsendringer, forbedringer, kontraktsreservasjoner, indekserte eller trinnvise leiepriser, oppsigelsesdatoer eller lokale prosedyrekrav. Sjekk leiekontrakten og veiledning fra Federal Office for Housing.","Check the latest official rate and guidance":"Sjekk siste offisielle kurs og veiledning","Swiss Federal Office for Housing (BWO)":"Sveitsiske forbundskontor for boliger (BWO)","Enter the rent and both rates to see a scenario.":"Skriv inn husleien og begge prisene for å se et scenario.","Scenario calculated. Verify the dates and contract terms before relying on it.":"Scenario beregnet. Bekreft datoene og kontraktsvilkårene før du stoler på det.","Check the amounts and rates. Rates must be between 0% and 5% and differ in 0.25-point steps.":"Sjekk beløpene og prisene. Satsene må være mellom 0 % og 5 % og avvike i trinn på 0,25 poeng.","Inputs cleared.":"Innganger slettet.","Result":"Resultat","Swiss Vacation Accrual Estimator":"Sveitsisk estimering av ferieopptjening","Swiss Vacation Accrual Calculator — Prorated Leave Balance":"Sveitsisk kalkulator for ferieopptjening – forholdsmessig permisjonsaldo","Estimate a Swiss vacation-day balance from the annual leave in your contract, workweek, employment dates and days already taken.":"Beregn en saldo for sveitsiske feriedager fra den årlige ferien i kontrakten, arbeidsuken, ansettelsesdatoene og dagene som allerede er tatt.","Estimate prorated paid leave for one calendar year using the entitlement and work schedule you enter. No contract terms are guessed.":"Beregn forholdsmessig betalt permisjon for ett kalenderår ved å bruke rettighetene og arbeidsplanen du angir. Ingen avtalevilkår er gjettet.","The estimator prorates the annual leave days in your contract by calendar days employed in the selected year. For part-time work, enter your usual working days per week and the annual leave in weeks.":"Estimatoren proraterer de årlige feriedagene i kontrakten din med kalenderdager brukt i det valgte året. For deltidsarbeid angir du vanlige arbeidsdager per uke og årlig ferie i uker.","With four weeks of leave, a five-day workweek and employment throughout the year, the annual entitlement is 20 working days before subtracting leave already taken.":"Med fire ukers permisjon, en fem-dagers arbeidsuke og ansettelse gjennom året, er den årlige rettigheten 20 virkedager før fratrekk av allerede tatt ferie.","What is the Swiss statutory minimum?":"Hva er det sveitsiske lovbestemte minimumet?","Federal guidance states at least four weeks per service year, and five weeks for workers who have not reached age 20. A contract or collective agreement may grant more.":"Federal veiledning sier minst fire uker per tjenesteår, og fem uker for arbeidere som ikke har fylt 20 år. En kontrakt eller tariffavtale kan gi mer.","Does this decide my legal balance?":"Avgjør dette min juridiske balanse?","No. It is a simple calendar-day proration. Contract terms, applicable collective rules, qualifying absences, rounding and employer records can change the balance.":"Nei. Det er en enkel kalenderdag-prorasjon. Kontraktsvilkår, gjeldende kollektive regler, kvalifiserende fravær, avrunding og arbeidsgiverregistrering kan endre saldoen.","This estimate does not decide a legal entitlement or calculate holiday pay. It excludes reductions for certain prolonged absences, contract-specific accrual and rounding rules, public holidays, overtime, carry-over deadlines and disputes. Check your contract and obtain advice for a contested balance.":"Dette anslaget bestemmer ikke en rettslig rettighet eller beregner feriepenger. Det utelukker reduksjoner for visse langvarige fravær, kontraktsspesifikke periodiserings- og avrundingsregler, helligdager, overtid, overføringsfrister og tvister. Sjekk kontrakten din og få råd om en bestridt saldo.","Leave year":"Permisjonsår","Annual leave in your contract (weeks)":"Årlig permisjon i kontrakten din (uker)","Usual working days per week":"Vanlige arbeidsdager per uke","Employment start date":"Startdato for ansettelse","Employment end date":"Sluttdato for ansettelse","Leave days already taken in this leave year":"Permisjonsdager allerede tatt i dette permisjonsåret","For orientation only. Enter the contractual annual entitlement; the legal minimum is generally four weeks, or five weeks for workers under 20.":"Kun for orientering. Angi den kontraktsfestede årlige rettigheten; det juridiske minimum er vanligvis fire uker, eller fem uker for arbeidere under 20 år.","Estimate balance":"Estimer saldo","Enter your contract and dates to estimate a balance.":"Skriv inn kontrakten din og datoer for å beregne en saldo.","Estimated leave balance":"Beregnet permisjonsaldo","Annual leave at this schedule":"Årlig permisjon på denne tidsplanen","Calendar days employed in this leave year":"Kalenderdager ansatt i dette permisjonsåret","Prorated days accrued":"Forholdsmessig påløpte dager","Days already taken":"Dager allerede tatt","Estimated days remaining":"Beregnet dager igjen","This prorates annual leave by calendar days in the employment period. Employer and contract rules may differ.":"Dette fordeler årlig ferie med kalenderdager i arbeidsperioden. Arbeidsgiver- og kontraktsreglene kan variere.","Estimate calculated. Check it against your contract and employer records.":"Estimat beregnet. Sjekk det mot kontrakten din og arbeidsgiverregistrene.","Check the year, dates, work schedule and values.":"Sjekk år, datoer, arbeidsplan og verdier."}});
